export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"modelcraft","name":"ModelCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.9","summary":"Marxalada daabacaadda oo leh slicer-keenna iyo u diri USB, Klipper, OctoPrint iyo PrusaLink, slicing-ka resin iyo add-ons-ka faylalka, material flow, digital twin iyo factory floor add-ons, NURBS fillets, thickening iyo scan fitting, AR goobta iyo toban arc methods.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["waxa cusub","release notes","changelog","0.9","qaybta daabacaadda","daabacaadda 3d","u dir daabacaha 3d","slicer","cadcraft basic","gcode","usb","klipper","moonraker","octoprint","prusalink","kiri moto","prusaslicer","orcaslicer","bambu","resin","daabacaadda resin","goo","sl1","ctb","anycubic","imtixaan exposure","material flow","digital twin","factory floor","plc","conveyor","nurbs","fillet","thicken","scan fit","ar","goobta","arc methods","units","changelog","isbeddel","0.8","0.8.1","nooca","astaamo cusub","engine","render engine","open in","usd","gltf","unreal","add-on engine","nurbs","surfaces","loft","sweep","continuity","g0","g1","g2","zebra","step","iges","say the scene","muuqaal","cimilada","waqtiga maalinta","xilliga","kaaliye","agab sawir ka","sawir","sketch photo","furnish","furnish a room","slant","jarista xagal","split","hubinta daabacaadda","dhibaatooyin","property grid","lambaro","luuqadaha","aaladaha gelinta","safafka toolbar","dwg","live"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"daabacaadda-3d","text":"Daabacaadda 3D","level":3},{"id":"socodka-alaabta-digital-twin-iyo-factory-floor","text":"Socodka alaabta, Digital twin iyo Factory floor","level":3},{"id":"dusha-moodeelada-iyo-naqshadaynta","text":"Dusha, moodeelada iyo naqshadaynta","level":3},{"id":"barnaamij-kasta","text":"Barnaamij kasta","level":2},{"id":"la-hagaajiyay","text":"La hagaajiyay","level":2},{"id":"xadka-runta","text":"Xadka runta","level":2},{"id":"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1","text":"Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub-2","text":"Cusub","level":3},{"id":"la-hagaajiyay-0-8-1","text":"La hagaajiyay 0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca","text":"Weli kuma jirto nooca","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8. ModelCraft hadda wuxuu gaaraa sariirta daabacaha iyo dhulka warshadda: waxaad shayaad saari kartaa sariirta daabacaha oo u dirtaa adoon faylal dhoofin, u slice-garee filament ama resin, oo habayn kartaa khadka maareynta alaabta. Tanu waa CadCraft Studio 0.9 iyo sideeda apps-kiisa; inta badan astaamaha cusub ee hoose waa add-ons.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"daabacaadda-3d\"\u003EDaabacaadda 3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta daabacaadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybta daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E qalabka. Ku dar shayaadka Maktabadda sariirta daabacaha, habee, eeg lakabyada la slice-gareeyay oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir daabacaha 3D\u003C/span\u003E, iyada oo aan STL la dhoofin. Waxay ka tirsan tahay add-on-ka 3D Print, kaas oo furan bilowga oo laga saari karo sida add-on kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-stage\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-stage\"\u003EShayaad saar sariirta daabacaha oo u dir printer-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlicer-keenna alaabta filament-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft basic (ku jira, ugu degdeg badan)\u003C/span\u003E waa slicer-ka liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ESlicer\u003C/strong\u003E ee kaarka: derbiyada, lakabyada, infill, taageerooyinka iyo skirt, worker dhexdeeda si bogga uu u sii yahay wax la isticmaali karo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHor-eeg lakabyada\u003C/span\u003E oo leh slider-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa lakabyada ka hor intaadan u dirin. Profiles-ka printer-ka sida Ender-3 iyo Prusa MK4 waxay leeyihiin G-code bilowga u gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EU dirid.\u003C/strong\u003E Over USB (Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar, bogga oo furan), ama Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint ama PrusaLink shabakadda. Wax aan riix lagu xirayn ama lagu dirin, u diridda waxay weydiisaa marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlicer-yada kale.\u003C/strong\u003E Kiri:Moto, PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waa add-ons gaar ah, oo bilowga laga go&#039;ay; ku dar kaarka ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E. PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waxay isticmaalaan nuqulkaaga la rakibay ee CadCraft Studio. Add-on-ka printers-ka Bambu Lab wuxuu slice-gareeyaa OrcaSlicer-kaaga iyo preset-yadiisa P2S wuxuuna u baahan yahay Studio kombiyuutar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaabacaadda resin.\u003C/strong\u003E Add-ons-ka resin (bilowga laga go&#039;ay) waxay sameeyaan sawirro lakab ah oo shaashada printer-kaaga, oo leh godad dhex-madhan iyo hawo, raft iyo taageerooyin, hor-eeg lakabyada, iyo waqti, resin iyo kharash. Add-ons-ka faylalka waxay qoraan Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox (CBDDLP iyo CTB 2 ilaa 5) iyo Anycubic (PWMX iyo PWS). Imtixaanka resin exposure wuxuu sameeyaa sulam shan exposures ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/resin-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/resin-printing\"\u003ESlice-garee printer-ka resin-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAan wax isbeddelin.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E, qalabka daabacaadda iyo kala-jarka daabacaadda waxay shaqeeyaan sida 0.8. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaarso moodeel daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"socodka-alaabta-digital-twin-iyo-factory-floor\"\u003ESocodka alaabta, Digital twin iyo Factory floor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdan waa add-ons, ilaa aad ku shido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E, mid kastaa caawinteeda gaarka ah ayuu leeyahay marka uu shido.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial flow.\u003C/strong\u003E Panel la magacdaray Material flow wuxuu habeeyaa suunka, siteeshinnada, buffers-ka iyo jidadka AGV ee aragta 3D, wuxuu socodsiiyaa simulation seeded ah, wuu dib u ciyaaraa, wuxuuna muujiyaa throughput, lead times iyo queues, natiijooyinka wuxuu keydiyaa CSV. Amarada waxa laga yaabaa inay ka imaan faylka CSV. Robot cells waa la hubin karaa oo la dhoofin karaa. Xiriirka PLC wuxuu leeyahay mode pousi ah (soft) iyo mode dhab ah oo ku saabsan Modbus TCP, taas oo shaqeysa CadCraft Studio keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDigital twin.\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu akhrisaa habaynta Material flow wuxuuna socodsiiyaa PLC pousi ah, oo leh khaladaad aad qasbi karto, tijaabooyin kaydka, isbarbardhig habaynta iyo bill of materials.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFactory floor.\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu siteeshinnada u beddelaa machines iyo cells, wuxuuna akhriyaa toosa ama simulator-ka, wuxuuna haya jaro shaqo iyo OEE fudud. Wuxuu akhrisaa kaliya; dhismahan ma qori karo machine ama PLC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dusha-moodeelada-iyo-naqshadaynta\"\u003EDusha, moodeelada iyo naqshadaynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGees-wareeg, qaro iyo booleans NURBS dusha.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGees-wareeg u dhexeeya dhinacyada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg dhowr geesood\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaro oo ka dhig jidh\u003C/span\u003E iyo Isku geyn, Jar, Isgoys, mid kastaa leh deviation-ka la cabbiray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EDusha bilaa-qaab (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaafi dusha scan-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro mesh scan-ka oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaafi dusha scan-ka\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xidh dusha jidh ah\u003C/span\u003E. Waa waafin hore, ma aha xirmo reverse-engineering oo buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriir toos ah oo ka yimaada modeller .3dm.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal dhinac oo keliya, Rhino 8 ama Grasshopper, wuxuuna u baahan yahay CadCraft Studio isla kombiyuutarka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EIlaali moodeel .3dm oo toos ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArag moodeelka goobta.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEeg goobta (AR, taleefan)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jirta menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shaqeeyaa taleefan Android ah oo leh Chrome. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/ar-on-site\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/ar-on-site\"\u003EArag moodeelka goobta taleefan Android (AR)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka qaanso.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHababka qaanso\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa toban siyaabood oo lagu sawiro qaanso, oo ay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3-Bar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow, Dhexe, Dhammaad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECutubyo dheeraad ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Miisaanka (kg, lb, t, ton) iyo heerkulka (digrii C, F, K iyo R) waa la fahmaa meelaha aad ku qorto qiyamka leh unit-yo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamij-kasta\"\u003EBarnaamij kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka hoverka.\u003C/strong\u003E Qoraalka hoverka ee badhamada iyo labels-ka jaraan waa Bootstrap tooltip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETip-ka bilowga oo la xidhi karo.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaarka tip-ka ee goobta naqshadda madhan wuxuu leeyahay xidhid x yar. Waa xirnaan, command palette-ka ayaa mar kale muujin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETabs-ka soo socda.\u003C/strong\u003E Tab strip-ka panelka oo aan ku habboonayn wuu soo socdaa halkii la jari lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka tabka.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii dukumeenti la furay, tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu ku bilaabmaa magaca dukumeentiga, kadibna ModelCraft iyo CadCraft. Dhibic ayaa hore u iman marka uusan kaydsanayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › Layout wuxuu hayaa qaabeynta liis hoos-u-dhac ah, oo leh doorasho si qaabeyn loogu isticmaalo app-kan keligiis, iyo badhan dib-u-dejin qaabeynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska luuqadaha Dejinta wuxuu raacaa faylalka luuqadda ee dhismuhu leeyahay. Luuqadaha kale ee aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELive iyo Maktabad.\u003C/strong\u003E Live TeamWork wuxuu muujiyaa cursors-ka toosa iyo magacyada, Maktabad ururinta wuxuu siiyaa app kasta ururin caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-hagaajiyay\"\u003ELa hagaajiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii dheji\u003C/span\u003E inta animation-ku ciyaarayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa oo sii dhejiyaa inta timeline-ku furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka rendarka ee adag wuxuu u dhacaa WebGL marka kaarka garaafka uusan bilaabi karin path tracer-ka. Aragta rendarka toosa ayaa weli muuqan karta khalad; tan lama hubin kombiyuutarka Windows oo leh driver-kaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaterial flow real mode wuu dib u xiriiraa marka xiriirku dhammaado jawaabaha PLC exception.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka-runta\"\u003EXadka runta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba lama daabicin printer dhab ah: ma filament, ma resin, ma marka Bambu Connect. Faylalka resin waxa dib u akhriyay akhristayaasha CadCraft keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigital twin iyo Factory floor waxaa lagu tijaabiyay simulators iyo jawaabo la yaqaan keliya, mana jiro PLC, line ama protocol dhab ah. Waa caawimo hubin, ma aha xaqiijin badbaado. Physics wuxuu daboolaa sanduuqyada keliya, ilaa siddeed culus.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirka Rhino iyo Grasshopper weligiis ma shaqeyn barnaamijyada dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1\"\u003EHore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E hadda wuxuu u dir karaa muuqaalka barnaamij kale, panelka Dusha wuxuu sameeyaa dusha bilaa-qaab, iyo kaaliye aad xidhay wuxuu dejin karaa muuqaal oo dhan hal jumlad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cusub-2\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERendarka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDoorashada Engine.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis \u003Cstrong\u003EEngine\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka sarreysa Mode. Laba engines-keenna, Fast iyo Path tracer, ayaa caadi ah oo meel kasta ka shaqeeya. Ikhtiyaarada kale waxay kaydiyaan muuqaalka sida package (moodeelka faylka USD, iyo faylka dejinta oo leh qiyamka agabka saxda ah, lambaro shidan, qorraxda, samada, exposure-ka iyo kaamerada) si loogu geeyo barnaamij kale. Sawirka barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka iyo nooca; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engines\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engines\"\u003EDooro barnaamijka sawirka kaa soo saara\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu fur barnaamij kale.\u003C/strong\u003E Liiska Engine wuxuu muuqaalka kaydin karaa fayl USD, fayl glTF (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E) ama foolder mashruuc Unreal (\u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E), browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Studio-ga waxa kale oo uu bilaabi karaa usdview ama barnaamijka kombiyuutarka faylka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EFur muuqaalka barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EU dir game engine-ka Studio-ga.\u003C/strong\u003E Studio wuxuu muuqaalka ku qoraa mashruuc Unreal Engine wuxuuna joogteeyaa dir kasta, hal jihood oo keliya. Tafatirkaaga ayaa ku jira layer aan CadCraft weligeed qorin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EU dir muuqaalka game engine-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngines-ka add-ons-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Add-on wuxuu ku dari karaa engine liiska. Mid JavaScript ah wuxuu sawiraa browser-ka iyo Studio; mid barnaamij maamula wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaashaadaada Studio-ga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003ESawir ku sameey barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EKu dar render engine add-on ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu sheeg muuqaalka.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaaliyahaaga AI ee xiriirsan ku sheeg &quot;dusk, light rain, autumn trees, people on the plaza&quot; wuxuuna ModelCraft u dejiyaa hal tallaabo: qorraxdu waxay u dhaqaaqaa taariikhda iyo waqtiga si hooska u raaco, samadu way beddelaysaa, dusha qoyan ayaa soo muuqda, geedaha iyo dadka waxaa lagu dhigaa sida shayaad dhab ah oo tags-ka aad qarin karto, u guuri karto ama tirtiri karto. Waqtiga maalinta, taariikhda ama xilliga, iyo cimilada (clear, overcast, fog, light rain, rain, storm) waxay sidoo kale shaqeeyaan keligood, codsi dambe wuxuu beddelaa isla muuqaalkaas. Ceeryaanka waxay muuqataa sawirka tayo sare ee kaarka garaafka; engines-ka kale waxay muujiyaan samada, iftiinka iyo dusha qoyan. Roobka lama sawiro sida xariiqyo dhaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgab hal sawir ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku sii sawir dusha (derbi, sagxad, dhagax) ModelCraft wuxuu sameeyaa agab tiling ah: iftiinka sawirka oo dhan ayaa la siman yahay, geesaha waa la isku xidhay, oo color map, roughness map iyo normal map waa laga shaqeeyay sawirka. Waa habayn sawir oo fudud oo ku saabsan sawirkaaga kombiyuutarka, oo aan model tababar ah lahayn. Roughness waa qiyaas. Sawir fudud, labajibbaaran, toosan ayaa tile ugu fiican siiya; qaab xoog leh sida dhagaxyada waxay muuqan kartaa sawir cadaadis jilicsan meesha isku xidhka la isku dhejiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha bilaa-qaab.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa curves NURBS iyo dusha aan la jarin: curves oo dhibco ku maran, loft, ruled, extrude, revolve, sweeps oo ku socda hal ama laba rail, dusha laga sameeyo shabakad curve, patches laga sameeyo afar geesood, match iyo blend. Geesaha la wadaago kasta waxaa lagu cabbiraa G0, G1 ama G2 (fur, xagal, jump curvature) dusha saxda ah, geesta xumaysa ee aad codsatay waxay ka muuqataa panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E oo leh badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EMatch\u003C/strong\u003E. Zebra stripes iyo midabka curvature waxaa laga sameeyaa dusha saxda ah. Faylalka STEP iyo IGES way baxaan oo way imaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EDusha bilaa-qaab (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta iyo qolalka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir sketch ah oo ku yaal dhulka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli sawir gacmeed…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa sawir taleefan oo gacan-sawir ah geesood dhulka cabbir aad sheegto: hal koox, tag kasta midabka qalinka. Waraaqda waa la helaa oo toosiya kombiyuutarkaaga, wax lagama dirin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EQorshe goobeed\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQol alaab ku rakib.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro floor oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabee\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQol alaab ku rakib…\u003C/span\u003E. Alaabta qolka jiifka, qolka fadhiga, qolka cunista, qolka cuntada, musqusha ama xafiiska waa la dhigaa qawaaniin, derbiyada ku dhow oo ka fog albaabbada iyo daaqadaha, hal koox oo aad mar kale ka saari karto. Waa qaabeyn caadi ah oo aad dib u eegto, ma aha naqshad. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/starter\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/starter\"\u003EMaktabadda bilowga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaabacaadda 3D\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJarista xagal.\u003C/strong\u003E Split for printing wuxuu xagal ahaan jari karaa jarista ilaa 60 darajo, taasoo siinaysa qaybaha meel dheeraad ah oo lagu xidho. Connectors-ka waxay istaagaan toosan jarista. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-split\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-split\"\u003EKala-jar moodeelka daabacaadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubinta daabacaadda ee Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Natiijooyinka hubinta daabacaadda 3D waxay muuqdaan panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E oo leh calaamado moodeelka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka soo saaraa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003ETaageerooyinka, ballaca darbiga, dhex-madhanka iyo hagaaska\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarnaamij kasta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Caawinta iyo apps-ka waxay imaan 54 luuqadood. Toban waa cusub: Lithuanian, Latvian, Bosnian, Marathi, Telugu, Albanian, Afrikaans, Filipino, Swahili iyo Uzbek. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah ilaa uu barto af-hooyo, mawduucyada caawinta waxay weli ku jiri karaan Ingiriisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAaladaha gelinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Trackpad, qalin, 3D mouse, game controller iyo kontoroolada MIDI waxay wadi karaan apps-ka, dhammaantood ama mid keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafafka toolbar-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › Toolbar rows wuxuu dejiyaa Wrap (sida hore), 2 safaf ama 1 safaf. Bar aan ku habboonayn wuu sideeyaa halkii uu ka qaadan lahaa meesha naqshadda. Wrap wuxuu weli yahay caadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProperty grid.\u003C/strong\u003E Goobaha lambarada ModelCraft waxay isticmaalaan grid-ka wadaagga ah: qaybo la ruxi karo, tiirarka label-ka iyo qiimaha, iyo cufnaanta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooban\u003C/span\u003E. Xisaabinta sida \u003Ccode\u003E2*450\u003C/code\u003E way sii shaqeysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E (badhanka digniinta ee bar-ka app-ka) waa la wadaagaa dhammaan apps-ka. ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay hubinta daabacaadda iyo digniinaha isku xidhka dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELive.\u003C/strong\u003E Kalfadhi Live TeamWork wuxuu muujiyaa qofka meesha uu joogo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/work-live\"\u003EMoodeel si wadajir ah oo Live TeamWork\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKordhinno.\u003C/strong\u003E Add-ons-ka waxay ku dari karaan render engines, sida kor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh AI-gaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaabka qalabka iyo hubinta sideeda apps-ka way gudbeen, oo leh 454 qalab oo dhan. Ku xidhka hal-riix gudaha Studio, connector la martiqaadayo kaaliyayaasha browser-ka, furaha aad leedahay gudaha Studio iyo package la daabacay lama ballan qaadin weli. Apps-ka ma leh AI gaar ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003EIsticmaal ModelCraft kaaliye AI ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"la-hagaajiyay-0-8-1\"\u003ELa hagaajiyay 0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta classes ee DWG.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybta classes ee faylka DWG waxaa lagu akhriyay nooc qaldan, taas oo ka dhigi karta faylka mid xun marka la soo geliyo. Hadda si sax ah ayaa loo akhriyaa, ModelCraft iyo apps-ka kale ee akhrinaya DWG.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETablets-ka xaashida.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhererka grid-ka ee dheeraadka ah wuxuu u gudbaa canvas-ka, qaabeynta xaashida waxay bilaabataa 760 pixels ama ka yar ballac. Style sheet-ka ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay isbeddelkaas sidoo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadda Studio.\u003C/strong\u003E CadCraft Studio iyo nooca xirmada waxay beddeli karaan luuqadda intay shaqeynayaan; ka hor waxay ahaayeen Ingiriis keliya. Lama tijaabin dhammaan madalaha weli: noo sheeg haddii luuqadu aanay beddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca\"\u003EWeli kuma jirto nooca\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama saxiixin code.\u003C/strong\u003E Windows wuxuu muujin karaa SmartScreen: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaad dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax kasta sii wad\u003C/span\u003E. Mac-ka, midig-guji oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. Dhismaha store-ka waa la joojiyay ilaa hadda, iPad iyo iPhone dhismaha lama dib u dhisin 0.8.1.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarnaamij kale oo sawiraya sawirka aan add-on render engine lahayn, panoramas ama kamaarooyin stereo iyo sawirka samada ee barnaamij kale, iyo plug-in-ka furaya Unreal stage weli ma jiraan. Faylalka waa la qoraa; plug-in-ka lama sii dayn, Unreal kuma shaqayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha bilaa-qaab: G3 iyo class A lama cabbiro ama lama sheego, trimming iyo solids way dambeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirrada barnaamijyada kale ma aha pixel ilaa pixel sida kuwayaga: kaamera, qorraxda, lambaro iyo exposure-ka oo keliya ayaa isku mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaajinta 0.8.1 ee beddelka luuqadda Studio lama tijaabin dhammaan madalaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E. Nooca hore, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWaxa cusub ee 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.9, marka la barbardhigo 0.8. ModelCraft hadda wuxuu gaaraa sariirta daabacaha iyo dhulka warshadda: waxaad shayaad saari kartaa sariirta daabacaha oo u dirtaa adoon faylal dhoofin, u slice-garee filament ama resin, oo habayn kartaa khadka maareynta alaabta. Tanu waa CadCraft Studio 0.9 iyo sideeda apps-kiisa; inta badan astaamaha cusub ee hoose waa add-ons. Cusub Daabacaadda 3D Qaybta daabacaadda. Riix Qaybta daabacaadda qalabka. Ku dar shayaadka Maktabadda sariirta daabacaha, habee, eeg lakabyada la slice-gareeyay oo riix U dir daabacaha 3D, iyada oo aan STL la dhoofin. Waxay ka tirsan tahay add-on-ka 3D Print, kaas oo furan bilowga oo laga saari karo sida add-on kasta. Eeg Shayaad saar sariirta daabacaha oo u dir printer-ka. Slicer-keenna alaabta filament-ka. CadCraft basic (ku jira, ugu degdeg badan) waa slicer-ka liiska Slicer ee kaarka: derbiyada, lakabyada, infill, taageerooyinka iyo skirt, worker dhexdeeda si bogga uu u sii yahay wax la isticmaali karo. Hor-eeg lakabyada oo leh slider-ka Layer wuxuu muujinayaa lakabyada ka hor intaadan u dirin. Profiles-ka printer-ka sida Ender-3 iyo Prusa MK4 waxay leeyihiin G-code bilowga u gaar ah. U dirid. Over USB (Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar, bogga oo furan), ama Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint ama PrusaLink shabakadda. Wax aan riix lagu xirayn ama lagu dirin, u diridda waxay weydiisaa marka hore. Slicer-yada kale. Kiri:Moto, PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waa add-ons gaar ah, oo bilowga laga go'ay; ku dar kaarka ama Dejinta › Kordhinno. PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waxay isticmaalaan nuqulkaaga la rakibay ee CadCraft Studio. Add-on-ka printers-ka Bambu Lab wuxuu slice-gareeyaa OrcaSlicer-kaaga iyo preset-yadiisa P2S wuxuuna u baahan yahay Studio kombiyuutar. Daabacaadda resin. Add-ons-ka resin (bilowga laga go'ay) waxay sameeyaan sawirro lakab ah oo shaashada printer-kaaga, oo leh godad dhex-madhan iyo hawo, raft iyo taageerooyin, hor-eeg lakabyada, iyo waqti, resin iyo kharash. Add-ons-ka faylalka waxay qoraan Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox (CBDDLP iyo CTB 2 ilaa 5) iyo Anycubic (PWMX iyo PWS). Imtixaanka resin exposure wuxuu sameeyaa sulam shan exposures ah. Eeg Slice-garee printer-ka resin-ka. Aan wax isbeddelin. Soo saar › Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…, qalabka daabacaadda iyo kala-jarka daabacaadda waxay shaqeeyaan sida 0.8. Eeg Diyaarso moodeel daabacaadda 3D. Socodka alaabta, Digital twin iyo Factory floor Saddexdan waa add-ons, ilaa aad ku shido Dejinta › Kordhinno, mid kastaa caawinteeda gaarka ah ayuu leeyahay marka uu shido. Material flow. Panel la magacdaray Material flow wuxuu habeeyaa suunka, siteeshinnada, buffers-ka iyo jidadka AGV ee aragta 3D, wuxuu socodsiiyaa simulation seeded ah, wuu dib u ciyaaraa, wuxuuna muujiyaa throughput, lead times iyo queues, natiijooyinka wuxuu keydiyaa CSV. Amarada waxa laga yaabaa inay ka imaan faylka CSV. Robot cells waa la hubin karaa oo la dhoofin karaa. Xiriirka PLC wuxuu leeyahay mode pousi ah (soft) iyo mode dhab ah oo ku saabsan Modbus TCP, taas oo shaqeysa CadCraft Studio keliya. Digital twin. Wuxuu akhrisaa habaynta Material flow wuxuuna socodsiiyaa PLC pousi ah, oo leh khaladaad aad qasbi karto, tijaabooyin kaydka, isbarbardhig habaynta iyo bill of materials. Factory floor. Wuxuu siteeshinnada u beddelaa machines iyo cells, wuxuuna akhriyaa toosa ama simulator-ka, wuxuuna haya jaro shaqo iyo OEE fudud. Wuxuu akhrisaa kaliya; dhismahan ma qori karo machine ama PLC. Dusha, moodeelada iyo naqshadaynta Gees-wareeg, qaro iyo booleans NURBS dusha. Panelka Dusha wuxuu leeyahay Gees-wareeg u dhexeeya dhinacyada, Wareeg dhowr geesood, Qaro oo ka dhig jidh iyo Isku geyn, Jar, Isgoys, mid kastaa leh deviation-ka la cabbiray. Eeg Dusha bilaa-qaab (NURBS). Waafi dusha scan-ka. Dooro mesh scan-ka oo isticmaal Waafi dusha scan-ka kooxda Scan, ka dibna Isku xidh dusha jidh ah. Waa waafin hore, ma aha xirmo reverse-engineering oo buuxa. Xiriir toos ah oo ka yimaada modeller .3dm. Hal dhinac oo keliya, Rhino 8 ama Grasshopper, wuxuuna u baahan yahay CadCraft Studio isla kombiyuutarka. Eeg Ilaali moodeel .3dm oo toos ah. Arag moodeelka goobta. Eeg goobta (AR, taleefan) oo ku jirta menu-ka Muuqaalo wuxuu shaqeeyaa taleefan Android ah oo leh Chrome. Eeg Arag moodeelka goobta taleefan Android (AR). Habka qaanso. Liiska Hababka qaanso wuxuu bixiyaa toban siyaabood oo lagu sawiro qaanso, oo ay ku jiraan 3-Bar iyo Bilow, Dhexe, Dhammaad. Cutubyo dheeraad ah. Miisaanka (kg, lb, t, ton) iyo heerkulka (digrii C, F, K iyo R) waa la fahmaa meelaha aad ku qorto qiyamka leh unit-yo. Barnaamij kasta Qoraalka hoverka. Qoraalka hoverka ee badhamada iyo labels-ka jaraan waa Bootstrap tooltip. Tip-ka bilowga oo la xidhi karo. Kaarka tip-ka ee goobta naqshadda madhan wuxuu leeyahay xidhid x yar. Waa xirnaan, command palette-ka ayaa mar kale muujin kara. Tabs-ka soo socda. Tab strip-ka panelka oo aan ku habboonayn wuu soo socdaa halkii la jari lahaa. Cinwaanka tabka. Haddii dukumeenti la furay, tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu ku bilaabmaa magaca dukumeentiga, kadibna ModelCraft iyo CadCraft. Dhibic ayaa hore u iman marka uusan kaydsanayn. Qaabeyn. Dejinta › Guud › Layout wuxuu hayaa qaabeynta liis hoos-u-dhac ah, oo leh doorasho si qaabeyn loogu isticmaalo app-kan keligiis, iyo badhan dib-u-dejin qaabeynta. Luuqadaha. Liiska luuqadaha Dejinta wuxuu raacaa faylalka luuqadda ee dhismuhu leeyahay. Luuqadaha kale ee aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah. Live iyo Maktabad. Live TeamWork wuxuu muujiyaa cursors-ka toosa iyo magacyada, Maktabad ururinta wuxuu siiyaa app kasta ururin caadi ah. La hagaajiyay Ciyaar wuxuu noqdaa Sii dheji inta animation-ku ciyaarayo, Space wuxuu ciyaaraa oo sii dhejiyaa inta timeline-ku furan yahay. Sawirka rendarka ee adag wuxuu u dhacaa WebGL marka kaarka garaafka uusan bilaabi karin path tracer-ka. Aragta rendarka toosa ayaa weli muuqan karta khalad; tan lama hubin kombiyuutarka Windows oo leh driver-kaas. Material flow real mode wuu dib u xiriiraa marka xiriirku dhammaado jawaabaha PLC exception. Xadka runta Waxba lama daabicin printer dhab ah: ma filament, ma resin, ma marka Bambu Connect. Faylalka resin waxa dib u akhriyay akhristayaasha CadCraft keliya. Digital twin iyo Factory floor waxaa lagu tijaabiyay simulators iyo jawaabo la yaqaan keliya, mana jiro PLC, line ama protocol dhab ah. Waa caawimo hubin, ma aha xaqiijin badbaado. Physics wuxuu daboolaa sanduuqyada keliya, ilaa siddeed culus. Xiriirka Rhino iyo Grasshopper weligiis ma shaqeyn barnaamijyada dhabta ah. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah. Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 Tanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.8 (2026-11-01) iyo 0.8.1 (2026-11-02), marka la barbardhigo 0.7. Badhanka Rendar sawir… hadda wuxuu u dir karaa muuqaalka barnaamij kale, panelka Dusha wuxuu sameeyaa dusha bilaa-qaab, iyo kaaliye aad xidhay wuxuu dejin karaa muuqaal oo dhan hal jumlad. Cusub Rendarka Doorashada Engine. Rendar sawir… wuxuu leeyahay liis Engine oo ka sarreysa Mode. Laba engines-keenna, Fast iyo Path tracer, ayaa caadi ah oo meel kasta ka shaqeeya. Ikhtiyaarada kale waxay kaydiyaan muuqaalka sida package (moodeelka faylka USD, iyo faylka dejinta oo leh qiyamka agabka saxda ah, lambaro shidan, qorraxda, samada, exposure-ka iyo kaamerada) si loogu geeyo barnaamij kale. Sawirka barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka iyo nooca; eeg Dooro barnaamijka sawirka kaa soo saara. Ku fur barnaamij kale. Liiska Engine wuxuu muuqaalka kaydin karaa fayl USD, fayl glTF (.glb) ama foolder mashruuc Unreal (.zip), browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Studio-ga waxa kale oo uu bilaabi karaa usdview ama barnaamijka kombiyuutarka faylka. Eeg Fur muuqaalka barnaamij kale. U dir game engine-ka Studio-ga. Studio wuxuu muuqaalka ku qoraa mashruuc Unreal Engine wuxuuna joogteeyaa dir kasta, hal jihood oo keliya. Tafatirkaaga ayaa ku jira layer aan CadCraft weligeed qorin. Eeg U dir muuqaalka game engine-ka. Engines-ka add-ons-ka. Add-on wuxuu ku dari karaa engine liiska. Mid JavaScript ah wuxuu sawiraa browser-ka iyo Studio; mid barnaamij maamula wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaashaadaada Studio-ga. Eeg Sawir ku sameey barnaamij kale iyo Ku dar render engine add-on ah. Ku sheeg muuqaalka. Kaaliyahaaga AI ee xiriirsan ku sheeg \"dusk, light rain, autumn trees, people on the plaza\" wuxuuna ModelCraft u dejiyaa hal tallaabo: qorraxdu waxay u dhaqaaqaa taariikhda iyo waqtiga si hooska u raaco, samadu way beddelaysaa, dusha qoyan ayaa soo muuqda, geedaha iyo dadka waxaa lagu dhigaa sida shayaad dhab ah oo tags-ka aad qarin karto, u guuri karto ama tirtiri karto. Waqtiga maalinta, taariikhda ama xilliga, iyo cimilada (clear, overcast, fog, light rain, rain, storm) waxay sidoo kale shaqeeyaan keligood, codsi dambe wuxuu beddelaa isla muuqaalkaas. Ceeryaanka waxay muuqataa sawirka tayo sare ee kaarka garaafka; engines-ka kale waxay muujiyaan samada, iftiinka iyo dusha qoyan. Roobka lama sawiro sida xariiqyo dhaca. Agabka Agab hal sawir ka. Ku sii sawir dusha (derbi, sagxad, dhagax) ModelCraft wuxuu sameeyaa agab tiling ah: iftiinka sawirka oo dhan ayaa la siman yahay, geesaha waa la isku xidhay, oo color map, roughness map iyo normal map waa laga shaqeeyay sawirka. Waa habayn sawir oo fudud oo ku saabsan sawirkaaga kombiyuutarka, oo aan model tababar ah lahayn. Roughness waa qiyaas. Sawir fudud, labajibbaaran, toosan ayaa tile ugu fiican siiya; qaab xoog leh sida dhagaxyada waxay muuqan kartaa sawir cadaadis jilicsan meesha isku xidhka la isku dhejiyo. Dusha Dusha bilaa-qaab. Panelka Dusha wuxuu sameeyaa curves NURBS iyo dusha aan la jarin: curves oo dhibco ku maran, loft, ruled, extrude, revolve, sweeps oo ku socda hal ama laba rail, dusha laga sameeyo shabakad curve, patches laga sameeyo afar geesood, match iyo blend. Geesaha la wadaago kasta waxaa lagu cabbiraa G0, G1 ama G2 (fur, xagal, jump curvature) dusha saxda ah, geesta xumaysa ee aad codsatay waxay ka muuqataa panelka Dhibaatooyinka oo leh badhanka Match. Zebra stripes iyo midabka curvature waxaa laga sameeyaa dusha saxda ah. Faylalka STEP iyo IGES way baxaan oo way imaan. Eeg Dusha bilaa-qaab (NURBS). Goobta iyo qolalka Sawir sketch ah oo ku yaal dhulka. Fayl › Soo geli sawir gacmeed… wuxuu u beddelaa sawir taleefan oo gacan-sawir ah geesood dhulka cabbir aad sheegto: hal koox, tag kasta midabka qalinka. Waraaqda waa la helaa oo toosiya kombiyuutarkaaga, wax lagama dirin. Eeg Qorshe goobeed. Qol alaab ku rakib. Dooro floor oo isticmaal Habee › Qol alaab ku rakib…. Alaabta qolka jiifka, qolka fadhiga, qolka cunista, qolka cuntada, musqusha ama xafiiska waa la dhigaa qawaaniin, derbiyada ku dhow oo ka fog albaabbada iyo daaqadaha, hal koox oo aad mar kale ka saari karto. Waa qaabeyn caadi ah oo aad dib u eegto, ma aha naqshad. Eeg Maktabadda bilowga. Daabacaadda 3D Jarista xagal. Split for printing wuxuu xagal ahaan jari karaa jarista ilaa 60 darajo, taasoo siinaysa qaybaha meel dheeraad ah oo lagu xidho. Connectors-ka waxay istaagaan toosan jarista. Eeg Kala-jar moodeelka daabacaadda. Hubinta daabacaadda ee Dhibaatooyinka. Natiijooyinka hubinta daabacaadda 3D waxay muuqdaan panelka Dhibaatooyinka oo leh calaamado moodeelka, Hagaaji ayaa ka soo saaraa. Eeg Taageerooyinka, ballaca darbiga, dhex-madhanka iyo hagaaska. Barnaamij kasta Luuqadaha. Caawinta iyo apps-ka waxay imaan 54 luuqadood. Toban waa cusub: Lithuanian, Latvian, Bosnian, Marathi, Telugu, Albanian, Afrikaans, Filipino, Swahili iyo Uzbek. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qoraallo machine ah ilaa uu barto af-hooyo, mawduucyada caawinta waxay weli ku jiri karaan Ingiriisi. Aaladaha gelinta. Trackpad, qalin, 3D mouse, game controller iyo kontoroolada MIDI waxay wadi karaan apps-ka, dhammaantood ama mid keliya. Safafka toolbar-ka. Dejinta › Guud › Toolbar rows wuxuu dejiyaa Wrap (sida hore), 2 safaf ama 1 safaf. Bar aan ku habboonayn wuu sideeyaa halkii uu ka qaadan lahaa meesha naqshadda. Wrap wuxuu weli yahay caadi. Property grid. Goobaha lambarada ModelCraft waxay isticmaalaan grid-ka wadaagga ah: qaybo la ruxi karo, tiirarka label-ka iyo qiimaha, iyo cufnaanta Kooban. Xisaabinta sida 2*450 way sii shaqeysaa. Dhibaatooyinka. Panelka Dhibaatooyinka (badhanka digniinta ee bar-ka app-ka) waa la wadaagaa dhammaan apps-ka. ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay hubinta daabacaadda iyo digniinaha isku xidhka dusha. Live. Kalfadhi Live TeamWork wuxuu muujiyaa qofka meesha uu joogo. Eeg Moodeel si wadajir ah oo Live TeamWork. Kordhinno. Add-ons-ka waxay ku dari karaan render engines, sida kor. Ku xidh AI-gaaga. Qaabka qalabka iyo hubinta sideeda apps-ka way gudbeen, oo leh 454 qalab oo dhan. Ku xidhka hal-riix gudaha Studio, connector la martiqaadayo kaaliyayaasha browser-ka, furaha aad leedahay gudaha Studio iyo package la daabacay lama ballan qaadin weli. Apps-ka ma leh AI gaar ah. Eeg Isticmaal ModelCraft kaaliye AI ah. La hagaajiyay 0.8.1 Qaybta classes ee DWG. Qaybta classes ee faylka DWG waxaa lagu akhriyay nooc qaldan, taas oo ka dhigi karta faylka mid xun marka la soo geliyo. Hadda si sax ah ayaa loo akhriyaa, ModelCraft iyo apps-ka kale ee akhrinaya DWG. Tablets-ka xaashida. Dhererka grid-ka ee dheeraadka ah wuxuu u gudbaa canvas-ka, qaabeynta xaashida waxay bilaabataa 760 pixels ama ka yar ballac. Style sheet-ka ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay isbeddelkaas sidoo kale. Luuqadda Studio. CadCraft Studio iyo nooca xirmada waxay beddeli karaan luuqadda intay shaqeynayaan; ka hor waxay ahaayeen Ingiriis keliya. Lama tijaabin dhammaan madalaha weli: noo sheeg haddii luuqadu aanay beddelin. Weli kuma jirto nooca Lama saxiixin code. Windows wuxuu muujin karaa SmartScreen: dooro Macluumaad dheeraad ah, ka dibna Wax kasta sii wad. Mac-ka, midig-guji oo dooro Fur. Dhismaha store-ka waa la joojiyay ilaa hadda, iPad iyo iPhone dhismaha lama dib u dhisin 0.8.1. Barnaamij kale oo sawiraya sawirka aan add-on render engine lahayn, panoramas ama kamaarooyin stereo iyo sawirka samada ee barnaamij kale, iyo plug-in-ka furaya Unreal stage weli ma jiraan. Faylalka waa la qoraa; plug-in-ka lama sii dayn, Unreal kuma shaqayn. Dusha bilaa-qaab: G3 iyo class A lama cabbiro ama lama sheego, trimming iyo solids way dambeeyaan. Sawirrada barnaamijyada kale ma aha pixel ilaa pixel sida kuwayaga: kaamera, qorraxda, lambaro iyo exposure-ka oo keliya ayaa isku mid ah. Hagaajinta 0.8.1 ee beddelka luuqadda Studio lama tijaabin dhammaan madalaha. Waxa kale oo dhan waa ku jira Weli lama dhisin. Nooca hore, eeg Waxa cusub ee 0.7.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.7 (hore)","summary":"Meshes oo leh modifiers, sculpting, UV-yo iyo curve objects, path tracing kaarka garaafka iyo goobta Rendarka, live view oo wakhti dhab ah oo leh scatter iyo panoramas, node materials, goobta Animate oo leh bones iyo physics, USD, FBX, STEP iyo faylal .3dm, iyo qalabka daabacaadda oo leh style-ka Bilowga.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.7","nooca hore","release notes","changelog","isbeddel","0.7","nooca","astaamo cusub","mesh","meshes","goobta mesh","beddelayaal","subdivision","crease","uv","unwrap","xagallo","curves","curve objects","nurbs","bezier","sculpt","remesh","retopology","qaybi","xisaab","path tracing","webgpu","goobta rendarka","safka rendarka","mp4","exr","denoise","physical sky","hdri","ies","depth of field","light mixing","fog","caustics","live view","wakhti dhab ah","socod","scatter","panorama","tour","viewer","shading","nodes","node materials","maktabadda agabka","materialx","decals","texture painting","baking","animate","tafatiraha grafka","clips","shape keys","drivers","armature","bones","skinning","ik","constraints","physics","usd","usdz","gltf","fbx","step","3dm","alembic","ply","acis","3d solids","supports","ballaca darbiga","dhex-madhan","hagaaji","bilowga","kaaliyayaasha","kombiyuutarkaaga","units","boortaqiis"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"meshes","text":"Meshes","level":3},{"id":"naqshad","text":"Naqshad","level":3},{"id":"rendarka","text":"Rendarka","level":3},{"id":"aragta-toosa-ah-iyo-bandhigyada","text":"Aragta toosa ah iyo bandhigyada","level":3},{"id":"agabka","text":"Agabka","level":3},{"id":"animation","text":"Animation","level":3},{"id":"faylalka","text":"Faylalka","level":3},{"id":"daabacaadda-3d","text":"Daabacaadda 3D","level":3},{"id":"kaaliyayaasha-iyo-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Kaaliyayaasha iyo kombiyuutarkaaga","level":3},{"id":"la-hagaajiyay","text":"La hagaajiyay","level":2},{"id":"barnaamij-kasta","text":"Barnaamij kasta","level":2},{"id":"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca","text":"Weli kuma jirto nooca","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. ModelCraft hadda wuxuu moodeelaa meshes sida uu moodeelayo geometry-ga push/pull, wuxuu rendarka ku sameeyaa kaarka garaafka, wuxuuna leeyahay goob shaqo kasta oo shaqo ah: dooro gudaha liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca bidix ee toolbar-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"meshes\"\u003EMeshes\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeshes.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro koox ama komponent oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU beddel mesh\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E: waxay noqonaysaa mesh, oo leh dhinacyo tiro kasta oo geeso ah oo qaadan kara UV-yo tekstuur, normals, midabo iyo weights. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU beddel joomatari\u003C/span\u003E ayaa u celinaysa geometry. Ka noqo mesh-ka wuxuu hayaa kaliya waxa talaabo kasta beddeshay. Fayl leh mesh wuxuu u baahan yahay ModelCraft 0.7 si uu u furmo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EMesh-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta Mesh.\u003C/strong\u003E Laba jeer-guji mesh, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh\u003C/span\u003E liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u tafatirto goobaha, geesaha iyo dhinacyada: xarrago iyo giraanta, tafatirka isbarbar-dhigan, extrude, inset, bevel, loop cut, knife, bisect, spin, merge, dissolve, fill, grid fill, bridge iyo slide, iyo dejinta hawlgalka ugu dambeeya oo panelka laga beddelo. Ka bilow diyaarad, kuub, kubbad, torus iyo wax ka badan. Furayaasha push/pull iyo furayaasha modeler labaduba way shaqeeyaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003ETafatirka mesh goobta Mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModifiers.\u003C/strong\u003E Mirror, array, subdivision surface, bevel, solidify, boolean, displace, weld, decimate, smooth, lattice, curve deform iyo shrinkwrap waxay beddelaan waxa mesh-ku muujiyo, iyada oo aan mesh-ka laftiisa beddelin. Ku rari, u demi ama shid mid kasta muuqaalka iyo rendarrada, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E mid marka aad rabto inuu joogto noqdo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EBeddelayaasha mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESubdivision with creases.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E goobta Mesh wuxuu ilaaliyaa geesaha la doortay ee adag subdivision surface hoostiisa. Rendarrada waxay isticmaali karaan heer ka badan muuqaalka, mesh weyn wuxuu muuqaalka u muuqdaa heer hoose wuuna sheegaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers#subdivision-surface\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\" data-hash=\"subdivision-surface\"\u003ESubdivision surface\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurve objects.\u003C/strong\u003E Bézier, NURBS iyo curves xariiq toos ah oo samaysa tuubo, bayaan, taper ama lamaane buuxa, iyo qoraal sida curve. Ka tafatir dhibcahooda goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh-ka\u003C/span\u003E marka qaabku sax yahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003ECurve objects\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta UV.\u003C/strong\u003E Calaamadi xagallada (ama ka reeb ha calaamadiyo geesaha adag), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnwrap\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERar\u003C/span\u003E, ama mudee boks, silindar, kubbad ama aragta. Tafatiraha UV ee aragta 3D ayaa dhaqaajiya, leexiya oo cabbiraya qaybaha, shaxan iyo midabyada ballaadhinta ayaa muujinaya natiijada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/uv\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/uv\"\u003EHabee UV-yada mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESculpting.\u003C/strong\u003E Goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay burushyo rinji, dhoobo, siman, qabo, buufi, xagal, siiq, fidi iyo maaskin, mirror-ka X dhinaca, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E oo ku daraa saddexgeesood meesha aad sculpt-ka sameyso. Cadaadiska qalinka wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirka iyo xoogga burushka. Stroke kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003ESculpt a mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemesh iyo retopology.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mesh oo dhan mar kale sameeyaa saddexgeesood isku mid ah, isagoo xidhaya godad iyo isku xidhaya qaybo isku kaco. Si aad u dhistid mesh nadiif ah oo ka sarreeya mid faahfaahsan, dooro isagoo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/span\u003E: barta aad dhaqaajiso waxay ku degaysaa dusheeda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#remesh\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"remesh\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"naqshad\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybi geesta ama curve.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa jaraha markaad ka dhaqaajiso geesta, wuxuuna qaybiyaa gujin ama lambar qoran; geesta, bayaanka ama goobada la doortay, qor \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu weydiiyaa lambarka, tablet-ka. Bayaanka ama goobada waxaa loo qaybiyaa xagal isle&#039;eg oo xagalka sax ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003EQaybi geesta ama curve qaybo isle&#039;eg\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXisaabinta sanduuqa qiimaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Qor \u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;+3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E dherer kasta, iyo \u003Ccode\u003E90/2\u003C/code\u003E xagal. Xisaab aan la samayn karin wuxuu sheegaa waxa khaldan iyo meesha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box#calculations\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\" data-hash=\"calculations\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"rendarka\"\u003ERendarka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPath tracing kaarka garaafka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa path tracer-ka CadCraft ee kaarka garaafka halka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU; sadarka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu sheegaa injineerka soo sameeyay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa sawirka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii wad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka sii socdaa halkaas. Haddii WebGPU aanu jirin, sawirka waxa lagu path trace-gareeyaa WebGL, sida hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERendar aragta.\u003C/strong\u003E Goobta rendarka path tracing-ka aragta laftiisa ayaa wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale marka aad wareejiso ama tafatirto: rendar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobol\u003C/span\u003E, guji si aad u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiiradda\u003C/span\u003E, dejiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#render-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"render-in-the-view\"\u003ERendar aragta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlaab, iftiin iyo samooyin.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawirrada tayo sare ahi waxay hoosaad kasta oo dusha ah ku hoosaadaan qaabka alaabta OpenPBR (dahaarro, fuzz, filimo khafiif ah, muraayad midab leh, iftiin). Halkaas WebGPU, waxaa jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamada jireed\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECeeryaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka samada (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E, iyo profiles-ka iftiinka IES ee soo saaraha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"skies-and-light-profiles-on-the-graphics-card\"\u003ESamooyin iyo profiles-ka iftiinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaamera sida sawir.\u003C/strong\u003E Iftiinka ka f-stop, shutter iyo ISO, mode kasta; WebGPU, sidoo kale depth of field, perspective laba-barood, white balance, panorama 360° (sidoo kale stereo) iyo cube maps. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-camera\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-camera\"\u003EKaameraha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaystir sawirka ka dib rendarka.\u003C/strong\u003E Hagaaji (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E, contrast, bloom, glare, vignette, miis midab \u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E), isku dar samada, qorraxda iyo kooxda lambarada, oo eeg render elements mid mid, dhammaantood iyadoo aan mar kale rendarin. Dhaanta hadhay waxaa nadiifiya denoiser kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#finish-the-picture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"finish-the-picture\"\u003EDhammaystir sawirka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#mix-the-lights-after-the-render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"mix-the-lights-after-the-render\"\u003EIsku qas iftiinka ka dib rendarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESiyaabo dheeraad ah oo lagu kaydiyo rendar.\u003C/strong\u003E PNG 16-bit, EXR multi-layer oo leh render element kasta iyo kooxda iftiinka, iyo fayl rendar (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccrender\u003C/code\u003E) oo dib u furma isku darkiisa iyo hagaaskiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#save-the-picture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"save-the-picture\"\u003EKaydi sawirka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECeeryaan, qiiq iyo caustics.\u003C/strong\u003E Ceeryaan iyo ceeryaan ay iftiimiyaan qorraxda iyo lambaro, leh tiirar iftiin; hal tiir qiiq ama hal daruur; caustics hoosta muraayadaha iyo muraayadaha; adaptive sampling oo joojiya pixels-ka nadiifka ah. Kaarka garaafka oo keliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#fog-smoke-noise-and-caustics\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"fog-smoke-noise-and-caustics\"\u003ECeeryaan, qiiq, dhawaaq iyo caustics\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka rendarka iyo MP4.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku dar sawirro tayo sare ah iyo animations oo dhan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/span\u003E; mid-mid ayay u rendaraan, safka wuu ku sii jiraa marka bogga la xido. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU. Fiidiyowyada waxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydin karaa MP4 meel browser-ku ku qori karo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation#render-the-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\" data-hash=\"render-the-video\"\u003ERendar fiidiyaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"aragta-toosa-ah-iyo-bandhigyada\"\u003EAragta toosa ah iyo bandhigyada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELive view.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka muuqaal wakhti dhab ah oo ku taal aragta, wuxuu raacaa tafatir kasta iyo kaamerada: hooska qorraxda, agabka, lambaro iyo iftiinka dhabaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E wuu ku dhex socdaa, jiid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqti\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBil\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dhaqaajiso qorraxda, ama u geey \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaaqad cusub\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU meesha browser-ku leeyahay, kaleba WebGL 2. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003EAragta toosa ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScatter.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku firdhi cawska, ubaxyada, dhagaxyada, geedaha iyo dadka dusha ama brush-ka, oo laga soo qaato toddobo shay oo cusub iyo maktabadda kale; ururiyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\"\u003EScatter dhirta, dhagaxyada iyo dadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaagid.\u003C/strong\u003E Panorama 360°, tour panorama oo leh fallaaro u dhexeeya meelaha, muuqaal kali ah oo fayl ah (bog hoosaad ah oo furma khad la&#039;aan ah oo aan wax internet ka soo qaadin) iyo fiidyoow jid kaamera, dhammaantood muuqaalka wakhtiga dhabta ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#share-panoramas-tours-a-viewer-a-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"share-panoramas-tours-a-viewer-a-video\"\u003EWadaagid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVR muuqaalka wakhtiga dhabta ah.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u eeg VR\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka agabkiisa, samada, hooska qorraxda, lambaro, shayaad firdhsan iyo iftiinka dhabaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/vr-review#what-it-looks-like\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/vr-review\" data-hash=\"what-it-looks-like\"\u003ESida ay u muuqato\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"agabka\"\u003EAgabka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgab lagu sameeyo nodes.\u003C/strong\u003E Goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoosaad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhisaa agabka faylka sida grafiyada nodes: sawiro, noise iyo checker-yo, unugyada Voronoi, mowjado, dhismo, tiilo, qabow, marble, gradients, wasakh iyo cidhifka xidhid, shaqada midabka, xisaab, bump iyo normal maps, ilaa OpenPBR oo dhan. Aragta waxay muujinaysaa isbeddel kasta mar. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003ESamee agabka nodes\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadda agabka iyo teksturadaadii.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka Hoosaad wuxuu liistaa agabada Maktabadda: 16 CC0 texture sets, mid kastaa wuu aqoonsanyahay. Riix mid si aad u isticmaasho, ama jiid dusha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirro ama zip…\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGal…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa agab ka maaptaadaada, oo lagu aqoonsado magacyada faylka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materials-from-the-library\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materials-from-the-library\"\u003EAgabka maktabadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterialX gelin iyo bixin.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofi agab sida MaterialX (OpenPBR Surface ama Standard Surface, teksturada PNG), oo soo geli faylalka MaterialX iyo sawirradooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materialx\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDecals iyo rinjiga teksturka.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku dhig sawir dusha sida decal oo leh agab gaar ah, oo rinji sawirka agabka brush wareegsan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#decals\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"decals\"\u003EDecals\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#paint-on-the-texture\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"paint-on-the-texture\"\u003ERinji teksturka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDubbeynta teksturada.\u003C/strong\u003E Dubbee ambient occlusion, curvature, iftiinka iyo normals-ka shay faahfaahsan oo sawiro ah oo ku dhex jira UV-yada mesh-ka, oo lagu sameeyo cores-ka processor-ka kombiyuutarka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#bake-textures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"bake-textures\"\u003EDubbee teksturada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"animation\"\u003EAnimation\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta Animate.\u003C/strong\u003E Muuqaal kasta ku dhaji meel, leexasho iyo cabbir, iyo shidnaanta lambar kasta, baaxadda iyo midabka, iyo xagal lens, si toos ah panelka. Timeline-ku wuxuu helayaa aragta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E (Bézier handles, ku celcelin) iyo aragta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClips\u003C/span\u003E oo kaydinta furayaasha sida falal ah oo dib loo dhigo oo isku dar; furayaasha safafka badan waa la dhaqaajin karaa, la fidin karaa, la koobiyeyn karaa, la alabaqsan karaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003EAnimate any property\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShape keys iyo drivers.\u003C/strong\u003E Mesh wuxuu hayaa qaabab kale oo isaga ah, oo lagu isku dhejiyo slider-ro la furayo ama lagu dejin karo qiimo ka yimid qiimayaal kale oo expression yar ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#shape-keys-morphs\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"shape-keys-morphs\"\u003EShape keys\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#drivers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"drivers\"\u003EDrivers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArmatures.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku dhig bones mesh-ka, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaanka toosan\u003C/span\u003E u wadaag dhibcaha iyaga dhexdooda ama rinji miisaannada, oo ku dhaji oo ku furaysso bones; linear ama dual quaternion skinning. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#armatures-bones-that-bend-a-mesh\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"armatures-bones-that-bend-a-mesh\"\u003EArmatures\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIK iyo constraints.\u003C/strong\u003E Gaadhid (IK) oo leh pole, eeg, koobiyee transforms, xaddidaadyo, child of iyo follow path, bones iyo shayaadka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#ik-and-constraints\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"ik-and-constraints\"\u003EIK iyo constraints\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhysics.\u003C/strong\u003E Kooxaha iyo komponentada way dhacaan, way isku dhejiyaan oo way isku dhacaan sida sanduuqyo ama kubbado, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubbee fiisigiska\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa natiijada sida furayaasha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate#physics-drop-stack-and-collide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\" data-hash=\"physics-drop-stack-and-collide\"\u003EPhysics\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"faylalka\"\u003EFaylalka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUSD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu kaydiyaa moodeelka sida \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, faylka USD ee ModelCraft kaydiyay wuu dib u furmaa iyada oo waxba lumin. USD ka barnaamijyada kale wuxuu furmaa ama soo geliyaa sida mesh-yo, kooxo, komponentada, lambaro iyo kaamerooyin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu weli kaydiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EKaydi, fur iyo dhoofi USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF, oo dhamaystiran.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylalka glTF waxay u yimaadaan sida mesh-yo la tafatiri karo, oo leh normals, UVs, midabka geesaha iyo teksturada; nodes sida kooxo, iftiinka sida lambaro, kaamerooyinka sida muuqaalo, Draco iyo meshopt oo ku jira; \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E wuu furmaa marka lagu soo tuuro faylalkiisa la socda. Dhoofintu waxay qorta mesh-yo, teksturo, lambaro iyo kaamerooyin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#gltf-glb-gltf\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"gltf-glb-gltf\"\u003EglTF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo geli FBX, PLY, STL iyo Alembic.\u003C/strong\u003E FBX 2011 iyo ka cusub (mesh-yo, UV sets, agabka, teksturo lagu daray, lambaro, kaamerooyin), PLY iyo STL midabkooda, iyo Alembic caches sample-kooda ugu horreeya. OBJ wuxuu yimaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyo sawiradiisa marka lagu soo tuuro wada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EQaababka faylalka faahfaahin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta dheeraad ah.\u003C/strong\u003E PLY midabka, STL midabka geesaha la rinjiyeeyay, iyo OBJ teksturadiisa hal zip ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EQaababka faylalka faahfaahin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka STEP.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa qaybaha iyo assemblies-ka STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) sida mesh-yo xidhan oo cabbirkooda sax ah, qayb kasta meesha faylku dhigo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#step-step-stp\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"step-step-stp\"\u003ESTEP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka .3dm.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa moodeelada \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E: meshes, polysurfaces iyo extrusions (meshes-ka faylka lagu kaydiyay, haddii kale ModelCraft ayaa tessellate-gareeya), curves sida geesood, blocks sida komponentada iyo layers sida tags. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ESoo geli moodeel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka 3D solids ee DWG iyo DXF.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka naqshad la soo geliyo, waxay soo geli 3D solids-ka, gobollada iyo jidhadka kale, mid kastaa kooxdiisa, kuwa xidhan sida solids. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan#what-comes-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\" data-hash=\"what-comes-in\"\u003EKu qor moodeel qorshe goobeed\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"daabacaadda-3d\"\u003EDaabacaadda 3D\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHormarinta taageerooyinka\u003C/span\u003E (overhangs, tiirar ama taageerooyin geed, qiyaas alaabta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca darbiga\u003C/span\u003E (darbiyada aad u khafiifka ah ee aan la daabacin, lagu liistay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E (darbiyo ballaac aad siisay, oo leh godad biyo) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E (dhammaan hagaajinta la liistay; qaybaha isku dhacaya waxay isku xidhaan kaliya marka aad weydiisid). Dhex-madhan iyo Hagaaji waxay kuu siinayaan kooxo oo dusha dhinacyadooda caadiga ah ah dhinacyo keliya, ama mesh haddii natiijadu aanay xirmin ama ay leedahay dhinac badan; sadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003ETaageerooyinka, ballaca darbiga, dhex-madhanka iyo hagaaska\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStyle-ka Bilowga.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga\u003C/span\u003E: badhamo waaweyn oo lagu dhigo qaabab iyo godad, guuri, isku toosin iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E si godad u jarmaan, ka dibna hubi moodeelka daabacaadda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EStyle-ka Bilowga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kaaliyayaasha-iyo-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha iyo kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax dheeraad ah oo AI kaaliyayaasha.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaaliyuhu hadda wuu liisan karaa dhinacyada iyo agabka, push/pull, rinji, samee kooxo, ku dar oo muuji muuqaalo, ku dar mesh-yo, tafatir xirmooyinka beddelayaasha, dhoofi USD, rendar sawir oo buuxi safka rendarka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003EIsticmaal ModelCraft kaaliye AI ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKumbiyuutarkaaga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa graphics-ka, cores-ka processor-ka, xusuusta uu browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka, iyo heerka uu aragta toosa ah ka bilaabo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu rendarka ku sameeyo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-hagaajiyay\"\u003ELa hagaajiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsgoys\u003C/span\u003E waxay soo celin jireen kooxda aan xidhnayn, ballac kasta. Hadda way xidhan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ahaa mid midabkiisu dhimman yahay marka waxba la dooran, in kasta oo marka la doorto uu labada qayb si jaad ah u doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha timeline-ka animation-ka, furayaasha la qoro meel ma gelin, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sidoo kale. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E halkaas waa ka noqo iyo samee mar kale ee timeline-ka; furayaasha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kale waxay gaaraan app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamij-kasta\"\u003EBarnaamij kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dherer, balac, mug, xagal iyo jiritaan (slope), oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unitada (feet-ka US survey waa unit gaar ah). Ka demi unitada aan waligaa isticmaalin, oo ka tirtir liiska; xiddigeey mid si shaqada cusub ay ugu bilowdo. Fayl kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer hayaa unitkiisa. ModelCraft-ka liiska unitada ee ku yaal sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu raacaa doorashooyinka, unitka moodeelka had iyo jeer wuu ku jiraa, xiddiguna wuxuu dejiyaa unitka moodeel cusub, marka ModelCraft uu unitkaas leeyahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnitada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn cufan iyo panelo la habeeyo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka qaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooban\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax badan geliyaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo taleefannada waxay hayaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay cinwaan bar yar: jiid si aad u dhigto ama u dhigto mid sabbeeya, ku daa bar kale si aad u wadaagto frame tabs ahaan, ku xidh si uu u siibto geeska, ama qari oo dib u soo celi geeska. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDialog-yadu way dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiid dialog-ka title bar-kiisa si uu uga baxo sawirka; wuu soo laabanayaa halkii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer-guji title bar-ka si aad u dhex geliso mar kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EDhaqaajinta dialog-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToban codsi oo kaaliye AI ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Toban codsi oo dhab ah oo kaaliyahaaga (naqshad nadiifi, qorshe ururin, naqshadaha hubi, moodeel su&#039;aal weydii, takeoff wadar, isku day variant-ka qayb …), mid kastaa leh qalabkiisa iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, mid kastaana waxaa dib u ciyaaray tijaabadayada. Apps-ka ma leh AI. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ETusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cusub \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuuqad\u003C/span\u003E. Iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E hadda waxay leeyihiin ereyada app-ka oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli barbaro af-hooyo ahi akhrin. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku jiraan Ingiriisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta u guuldaysatay (ma jiro fayl nidaamkaaga weli, ma jiro shabakad, saxiixa khaldan) halkii uu ku odhon lahaa &quot;Dhammaaday&quot;, wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa uu jiro nooc cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-kuma-jirto-nooca\"\u003EWeli kuma jirto nooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 lama saxiixin code.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u wareegeen 0.8 sababtoo ah ansixinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta oo ku taal getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaad dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax kasta sii wad\u003C/span\u003E. Mac-ka, markii ugu horreysay, midig-guji CadCraft Studio oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. CadCraft Studio weli ma jiro dukaanka app-yada, iPad ama iPhone dhismo weli ma jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska xagalka iyo jiritaanka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli ma jiro sanduuq akhrinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERendarka kaarka garaafka (WebGPU) waxaa lagu tijaabiyay halkan software stand-in oo keliya, kaarka garaafka dhab ah weli ma lagu tijaabin, sidaas darteed rendar wax yar kombiyuutarkaaga marka hore. Isla arrintaas ayaa ku saabsan aragta toosa, VR-na weli waxaa lagu tijaabiyay emulator madadaal oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro WebGPU, ma jiro goobta rendarka iyo safka rendarka; sawirro tayo sare ahi ma leeyihiin depth of field, samada jireed, sawirka samada, ceeryaan, qiiq, caustics ama isku darka iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E weli ma rendariyo shayaad firdhsan; way muuqdaan aragta toosa, panoramas-kooda, viewer-kooda iyo fiidyowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELambaro waa animate-gareeyaan aragta, laakiin fiidyow la rendariyey wuxuu isticmaalaa lambarada sida ay tahay marka uu bilaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBones iyo animation lama akhriyo lamana qorin faylalka glTF, FBX ama USD weli (moodeelada skin-ka leh waxay yimaadaan nasasho, miisaankooda leh), glTF iyo FBX agabka ka sii badan midabka saldhigga ama teksturada weli lama hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidabka STEP iyo magacyada qaybaha assembly-ga weli lama akhriyo. Soo gelinta \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxaa lagu tijaabiyay faylalka uu qoray toolkit-ka qaabka, weli faylalka barnaamijka naqshadaynta laftiisa ma aan tijaabin; SubD objects, qoraal iyo cabbirro way ka maqan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhirta maktabadda CivilCraft waa ModelCraft dhexdeeda, laakiin dhigidda dhirta ka soo qaadista weli lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERinjiga teksturka dusha push/pull wuxuu ku celcelinayaa tile-ka agabka; si aad dhinac keliya u rinjiso, u beddel mesh oo unwrap.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo dhan waa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tanu waa waxa isbeddelay ModelCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. ModelCraft hadda wuxuu moodeelaa meshes sida uu moodeelayo geometry-ga push/pull, wuxuu rendarka ku sameeyaa kaarka garaafka, wuxuuna leeyahay goob shaqo kasta oo shaqo ah: dooro gudaha liiska Goobta shaqada ee dhinaca bidix ee toolbar-ka. Cusub Meshes Meshes. Dooro koox ama komponent oo riix U beddel mesh gudaha Macluumaadka: waxay noqonaysaa mesh, oo leh dhinacyo tiro kasta oo geeso ah oo qaadan kara UV-yo tekstuur, normals, midabo iyo weights. U beddel joomatari ayaa u celinaysa geometry. Ka noqo mesh-ka wuxuu hayaa kaliya waxa talaabo kasta beddeshay. Fayl leh mesh wuxuu u baahan yahay ModelCraft 0.7 si uu u furmo. Eeg Mesh-yada. Goobta Mesh. Laba jeer-guji mesh, ama dooro Mesh liiska Goobta shaqada, si aad u tafatirto goobaha, geesaha iyo dhinacyada: xarrago iyo giraanta, tafatirka isbarbar-dhigan, extrude, inset, bevel, loop cut, knife, bisect, spin, merge, dissolve, fill, grid fill, bridge iyo slide, iyo dejinta hawlgalka ugu dambeeya oo panelka laga beddelo. Ka bilow diyaarad, kuub, kubbad, torus iyo wax ka badan. Furayaasha push/pull iyo furayaasha modeler labaduba way shaqeeyaan. Eeg Tafatirka mesh goobta Mesh. Modifiers. Mirror, array, subdivision surface, bevel, solidify, boolean, displace, weld, decimate, smooth, lattice, curve deform iyo shrinkwrap waxay beddelaan waxa mesh-ku muujiyo, iyada oo aan mesh-ka laftiisa beddelin. Ku rari, u demi ama shid mid kasta muuqaalka iyo rendarrada, ka dibna Codso mid marka aad rabto inuu joogto noqdo. Eeg Beddelayaasha mesh-ka. Subdivision with creases. Crease goobta Mesh wuxuu ilaaliyaa geesaha la doortay ee adag subdivision surface hoostiisa. Rendarrada waxay isticmaali karaan heer ka badan muuqaalka, mesh weyn wuxuu muuqaalka u muuqdaa heer hoose wuuna sheegaa. Eeg Subdivision surface. Curve objects. Bézier, NURBS iyo curves xariiq toos ah oo samaysa tuubo, bayaan, taper ama lamaane buuxa, iyo qoraal sida curve. Ka tafatir dhibcahooda goobta Qalin; Mesh-ka marka qaabku sax yahay. Eeg Curve objects. Goobta UV. Calaamadi xagallada (ama ka reeb ha calaamadiyo geesaha adag), Unwrap iyo Rar, ama mudee boks, silindar, kubbad ama aragta. Tafatiraha UV ee aragta 3D ayaa dhaqaajiya, leexiya oo cabbiraya qaybaha, shaxan iyo midabyada ballaadhinta ayaa muujinaya natiijada. Eeg Habee UV-yada mesh-ka. Sculpting. Goobta Sculpt waxay leedahay burushyo rinji, dhoobo, siman, qabo, buufi, xagal, siiq, fidi iyo maaskin, mirror-ka X dhinaca, iyo Faahfaahin oo ku daraa saddexgeesood meesha aad sculpt-ka sameyso. Cadaadiska qalinka wuxuu dejiyaa cabbirka iyo xoogga burushka. Stroke kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Eeg Sculpt a mesh. Remesh iyo retopology. Remesh wuxuu mesh oo dhan mar kale sameeyaa saddexgeesood isku mid ah, isagoo xidhaya godad iyo isku xidhaya qaybo isku kaco. Si aad u dhistid mesh nadiif ah oo ka sarreeya mid faahfaahsan, dooro isagoo ku jira Retopology: barta aad dhaqaajiso waxay ku degaysaa dusheeda. Eeg Remesh. Naqshad Qaybi geesta ama curve. Qalabka Kala qaybi wuxuu calaamadiyaa jaraha markaad ka dhaqaajiso geesta, wuxuuna qaybiyaa gujin ama lambar qoran; geesta, bayaanka ama goobada la doortay, qor /5; Macluumaadka › Kala qaybi… wuxuu weydiiyaa lambarka, tablet-ka. Bayaanka ama goobada waxaa loo qaybiyaa xagal isle'eg oo xagalka sax ah. Eeg Qaybi geesta ama curve qaybo isle'eg. Xisaabinta sanduuqa qiimaha. Qor 2.5/3, 12'6\"+3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 ama 2*450mm dherer kasta, iyo 90/2 xagal. Xisaab aan la samayn karin wuxuu sheegaa waxa khaldan iyo meesha. Eeg Xisaabinta. Rendarka Path tracing kaarka garaafka. Rendar sawir… › Tayo sare (path traced) wuxuu socodsiiyaa path tracer-ka CadCraft ee kaarka garaafka halka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU; sadarka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu sheegaa injineerka soo sameeyay. Jooji wuxuu hayaa sawirka, Sii wad wuxuu ka sii socdaa halkaas. Haddii WebGPU aanu jirin, sawirka waxa lagu path trace-gareeyaa WebGL, sida hore. Eeg Tayo sare. Rendar aragta. Goobta rendarka path tracing-ka aragta laftiisa ayaa wuxuu bilaabaa mar kale marka aad wareejiso ama tafatirto: rendar Gobol, guji si aad u Diiradda, dejiso Faahfaahin. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU. Eeg Rendar aragta. Alaab, iftiin iyo samooyin. Sawirrada tayo sare ahi waxay hoosaad kasta oo dusha ah ku hoosaadaan qaabka alaabta OpenPBR (dahaarro, fuzz, filimo khafiif ah, muraayad midab leh, iftiin). Halkaas WebGPU, waxaa jira Samada jireed oo leh Ceeryaan, Sawirka samada (HDRI), iyo profiles-ka iftiinka IES ee soo saaraha. Eeg Samooyin iyo profiles-ka iftiinka. Kaamera sida sawir. Iftiinka ka f-stop, shutter iyo ISO, mode kasta; WebGPU, sidoo kale depth of field, perspective laba-barood, white balance, panorama 360° (sidoo kale stereo) iyo cube maps. Eeg Kaameraha. Dhammaystir sawirka ka dib rendarka. Hagaaji (ACES filmic, AgX, Filmic ama Caadi, contrast, bloom, glare, vignette, miis midab .cube), isku dar samada, qorraxda iyo kooxda lambarada, oo eeg render elements mid mid, dhammaantood iyadoo aan mar kale rendarin. Dhaanta hadhay waxaa nadiifiya denoiser kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Dhammaystir sawirka iyo Isku qas iftiinka ka dib rendarka. Siyaabo dheeraad ah oo lagu kaydiyo rendar. PNG 16-bit, EXR multi-layer oo leh render element kasta iyo kooxda iftiinka, iyo fayl rendar (.ccrender) oo dib u furma isku darkiisa iyo hagaaskiisa. Eeg Kaydi sawirka. Ceeryaan, qiiq iyo caustics. Ceeryaan iyo ceeryaan ay iftiimiyaan qorraxda iyo lambaro, leh tiirar iftiin; hal tiir qiiq ama hal daruur; caustics hoosta muraayadaha iyo muraayadaha; adaptive sampling oo joojiya pixels-ka nadiifka ah. Kaarka garaafka oo keliya. Eeg Ceeryaan, qiiq, dhawaaq iyo caustics. Safka rendarka iyo MP4. Ku dar sawirro tayo sare ah iyo animations oo dhan Safka rendarka; mid-mid ayay u rendaraan, safka wuu ku sii jiraa marka bogga la xido. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU. Fiidiyowyada waxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydin karaa MP4 meel browser-ku ku qori karo. Eeg Safka rendarka iyo Rendar fiidiyaha. Aragta toosa ah iyo bandhigyada Live view. Soo saar › Muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka muuqaal wakhti dhab ah oo ku taal aragta, wuxuu raacaa tafatir kasta iyo kaamerada: hooska qorraxda, agabka, lambaro iyo iftiinka dhabaha. Socod wuu ku dhex socdaa, jiid Waqti iyo Bil si aad u dhaqaajiso qorraxda, ama u geey Daaqad cusub. Wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU meesha browser-ku leeyahay, kaleba WebGL 2. Eeg Aragta toosa ah. Scatter. Ku firdhi cawska, ubaxyada, dhagaxyada, geedaha iyo dadka dusha ama brush-ka, oo laga soo qaato toddobo shay oo cusub iyo maktabadda kale; ururiyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Eeg Scatter dhirta, dhagaxyada iyo dadka. Wadaagid. Panorama 360°, tour panorama oo leh fallaaro u dhexeeya meelaha, muuqaal kali ah oo fayl ah (bog hoosaad ah oo furma khad la'aan ah oo aan wax internet ka soo qaadin) iyo fiidyoow jid kaamera, dhammaantood muuqaalka wakhtiga dhabta ah. Eeg Wadaagid. VR muuqaalka wakhtiga dhabta ah. Dib u eeg VR wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka agabkiisa, samada, hooska qorraxda, lambaro, shayaad firdhsan iyo iftiinka dhabaha. Eeg Sida ay u muuqato. Agabka Agab lagu sameeyo nodes. Goobta Hoosaad wuxuu dhisaa agabka faylka sida grafiyada nodes: sawiro, noise iyo checker-yo, unugyada Voronoi, mowjado, dhismo, tiilo, qabow, marble, gradients, wasakh iyo cidhifka xidhid, shaqada midabka, xisaab, bump iyo normal maps, ilaa OpenPBR oo dhan. Aragta waxay muujinaysaa isbeddel kasta mar. Eeg Samee agabka nodes. Maktabadda agabka iyo teksturadaadii. Panelka Hoosaad wuxuu liistaa agabada Maktabadda: 16 CC0 texture sets, mid kastaa wuu aqoonsanyahay. Riix mid si aad u isticmaasho, ama jiid dusha. Sawirro ama zip… ama Gal… wuxuu sameeyaa agab ka maaptaadaada, oo lagu aqoonsado magacyada faylka. Eeg Agabka maktabadda. MaterialX gelin iyo bixin. Dhoofi agab sida MaterialX (OpenPBR Surface ama Standard Surface, teksturada PNG), oo soo geli faylalka MaterialX iyo sawirradooda. Eeg MaterialX. Decals iyo rinjiga teksturka. Ku dhig sawir dusha sida decal oo leh agab gaar ah, oo rinji sawirka agabka brush wareegsan. Eeg Decals iyo Rinji teksturka. Dubbeynta teksturada. Dubbee ambient occlusion, curvature, iftiinka iyo normals-ka shay faahfaahsan oo sawiro ah oo ku dhex jira UV-yada mesh-ka, oo lagu sameeyo cores-ka processor-ka kombiyuutarka. Eeg Dubbee teksturada. Animation Goobta Animate. Muuqaal kasta ku dhaji meel, leexasho iyo cabbir, iyo shidnaanta lambar kasta, baaxadda iyo midabka, iyo xagal lens, si toos ah panelka. Timeline-ku wuxuu helayaa aragta Qalin (Bézier handles, ku celcelin) iyo aragta Clips oo kaydinta furayaasha sida falal ah oo dib loo dhigo oo isku dar; furayaasha safafka badan waa la dhaqaajin karaa, la fidin karaa, la koobiyeyn karaa, la alabaqsan karaa. Eeg Animate any property. Shape keys iyo drivers. Mesh wuxuu hayaa qaabab kale oo isaga ah, oo lagu isku dhejiyo slider-ro la furayo ama lagu dejin karo qiimo ka yimid qiimayaal kale oo expression yar ah. Eeg Shape keys iyo Drivers. Armatures. Ku dhig bones mesh-ka, oo Miisaanka toosan u wadaag dhibcaha iyaga dhexdooda ama rinji miisaannada, oo ku dhaji oo ku furaysso bones; linear ama dual quaternion skinning. Eeg Armatures. IK iyo constraints. Gaadhid (IK) oo leh pole, eeg, koobiyee transforms, xaddidaadyo, child of iyo follow path, bones iyo shayaadka. Eeg IK iyo constraints. Physics. Kooxaha iyo komponentada way dhacaan, way isku dhejiyaan oo way isku dhacaan sida sanduuqyo ama kubbado, Dubbee fiisigiska wuxuu kaydiyaa natiijada sida furayaasha. Eeg Physics. Faylalka USD. Kaydi sida (Ctrl+Shift+S) wuxuu kaydiyaa moodeelka sida .usda, .usdc ama .usdz, faylka USD ee ModelCraft kaydiyay wuu dib u furmaa iyada oo waxba lumin. USD ka barnaamijyada kale wuxuu furmaa ama soo geliyaa sida mesh-yo, kooxo, komponentada, lambaro iyo kaamerooyin. Kaydi wuxuu weli kaydiyaa .modelcraft. Eeg Kaydi, fur iyo dhoofi USD. glTF, oo dhamaystiran. Faylalka glTF waxay u yimaadaan sida mesh-yo la tafatiri karo, oo leh normals, UVs, midabka geesaha iyo teksturada; nodes sida kooxo, iftiinka sida lambaro, kaamerooyinka sida muuqaalo, Draco iyo meshopt oo ku jira; .gltf wuu furmaa marka lagu soo tuuro faylalkiisa la socda. Dhoofintu waxay qorta mesh-yo, teksturo, lambaro iyo kaamerooyin. Eeg glTF. Soo geli FBX, PLY, STL iyo Alembic. FBX 2011 iyo ka cusub (mesh-yo, UV sets, agabka, teksturo lagu daray, lambaro, kaamerooyin), PLY iyo STL midabkooda, iyo Alembic caches sample-kooda ugu horreeya. OBJ wuxuu yimaadaa .mtl iyo sawiradiisa marka lagu soo tuuro wada. Eeg Qaababka faylalka faahfaahin. Dhoofinta dheeraad ah. PLY midabka, STL midabka geesaha la rinjiyeeyay, iyo OBJ teksturadiisa hal zip ah. Eeg Qaababka faylalka faahfaahin. Faylalka STEP. Soo dhoofi wuxuu akhrinayaa qaybaha iyo assemblies-ka STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) sida mesh-yo xidhan oo cabbirkooda sax ah, qayb kasta meesha faylku dhigo. Eeg STEP. Faylalka .3dm. Soo dhoofi wuxuu akhrinayaa moodeelada .3dm: meshes, polysurfaces iyo extrusions (meshes-ka faylka lagu kaydiyay, haddii kale ModelCraft ayaa tessellate-gareeya), curves sida geesood, blocks sida komponentada iyo layers sida tags. Eeg Soo geli moodeel .3dm. Faylalka 3D solids ee DWG iyo DXF. Marka naqshad la soo geliyo, waxay soo geli 3D solids-ka, gobollada iyo jidhadka kale, mid kastaa kooxdiisa, kuwa xidhan sida solids. Eeg Ku qor moodeel qorshe goobeed. Daabacaadda 3D Qalabka daabacaadda. Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)… › Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu leeyahay Hormarinta taageerooyinka (overhangs, tiirar ama taageerooyin geed, qiyaas alaabta), Ballaca darbiga (darbiyada aad u khafiifka ah ee aan la daabacin, lagu liistay Muuji), Dhex-madhan (darbiyo ballaac aad siisay, oo leh godad biyo) iyo Hagaaji (dhammaan hagaajinta la liistay; qaybaha isku dhacaya waxay isku xidhaan kaliya marka aad weydiisid). Dhex-madhan iyo Hagaaji waxay kuu siinayaan kooxo oo dusha dhinacyadooda caadiga ah ah dhinacyo keliya, ama mesh haddii natiijadu aanay xirmin ama ay leedahay dhinac badan; sadarka hoose wuxuu sheegaa; eeg Taageerooyinka, ballaca darbiga, dhex-madhanka iyo hagaaska. Style-ka Bilowga. Dejinta › ModelCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka › Bilowga: badhamo waaweyn oo lagu dhigo qaabab iyo godad, guuri, isku toosin iyo Koox si godad u jarmaan, ka dibna hubi moodeelka daabacaadda. Eeg Style-ka Bilowga. Kaaliyayaasha iyo kombiyuutarkaaga Wax dheeraad ah oo AI kaaliyayaasha. Kaaliyuhu hadda wuu liisan karaa dhinacyada iyo agabka, push/pull, rinji, samee kooxo, ku dar oo muuji muuqaalo, ku dar mesh-yo, tafatir xirmooyinka beddelayaasha, dhoofi USD, rendar sawir oo buuxi safka rendarka. Eeg Isticmaal ModelCraft kaaliye AI ah. Kombiyuutarkaaga. Dejinta › ModelCraft › Rendar › Kumbiyuutarkaaga wuxuu muujinayaa graphics-ka, cores-ka processor-ka, xusuusta uu browser-kan u ogolaado app-ka, iyo heerka uu aragta toosa ah ka bilaabo. Eeg Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu rendarka ku sameeyo. La hagaajiyay Jirarka › Isku geyn, Jar iyo Isgoys waxay soo celin jireen kooxda aan xidhnayn, ballac kasta. Hadda way xidhan yihiin. Jirarka › Jar wuxuu ahaa mid midabkiisu dhimman yahay marka waxba la dooran, in kasta oo marka la doorto uu labada qayb si jaad ah u doortaa. Gudaha timeline-ka animation-ka, furayaasha la qoro meel ma gelin, Ctrl+S sidoo kale. Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y halkaas waa ka noqo iyo samee mar kale ee timeline-ka; furayaasha Ctrl kale waxay gaaraan app-ka. Barnaamij kasta Unitada. Dejinta › Guud › Cutubyada wuxuu leeyahay liis kasta oo dherer, balac, mug, xagal iyo jiritaan (slope), oo leh cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidda unitada (feet-ka US survey waa unit gaar ah). Ka demi unitada aan waligaa isticmaalin, oo ka tirtir liiska; xiddigeey mid si shaqada cusub ay ugu bilowdo. Fayl kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer hayaa unitkiisa. ModelCraft-ka liiska unitada ee ku yaal sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu raacaa doorashooyinka, unitka moodeelka had iyo jeer wuu ku jiraa, xiddiguna wuxuu dejiyaa unitka moodeel cusub, marka ModelCraft uu unitkaas leeyahay. Eeg Unitada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitada. Qaabeyn cufan iyo panelo la habeeyo. Dejinta › Guud › Cabbirka qaabeynta › Kooban wuxuu wax badan geliyaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo taleefannada waxay hayaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay cinwaan bar yar: jiid si aad u dhigto ama u dhigto mid sabbeeya, ku daa bar kale si aad u wadaagto frame tabs ahaan, ku xidh si uu u siibto geeska, ama qari oo dib u soo celi geeska. Eeg Habee panelada. Dialog-yadu way dhaqaaqaan. Jiid dialog-ka title bar-kiisa si uu uga baxo sawirka; wuu soo laabanayaa halkii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer-guji title bar-ka si aad u dhex geliso mar kale. Eeg Dhaqaajinta dialog-ka. Toban codsi oo kaaliye AI ah. Toban codsi oo dhab ah oo kaaliyahaaga (naqshad nadiifi, qorshe ururin, naqshadaha hubi, moodeel su'aal weydii, takeoff wadar, isku day variant-ka qayb …), mid kastaa leh qalabkiisa iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, mid kastaana waxaa dib u ciyaaray tijaabadayada. Apps-ka ma leh AI. Eeg Tusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI. Luuqadaha. Português (Portugal) waa cusub Dejinta › Guud › Luuqad. Iyo Português (Brasil), Español (México) iyo Bahasa Indonesia hadda waxay leeyihiin ereyada app-ka oo dhan, sida qabyo aan weli barbaro af-hooyo ahi akhrin. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku jiraan Ingiriisi. CadCraft Studio wuxuu sheegaa sababta cusboonaysiinta u guuldaysatay (ma jiro fayl nidaamkaaga weli, ma jiro shabakad, saxiixa khaldan) halkii uu ku odhon lahaa \"Dhammaaday\", wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka waxa cusub ee aad xirtay ilaa uu jiro nooc cusub. Weli kuma jirto nooca 0.7 lama saxiixin code. Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u wareegeen 0.8 sababtoo ah ansixinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee fayl kasta oo ku taal getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro Macluumaad dheeraad ah, ka dibna Wax kasta sii wad. Mac-ka, markii ugu horreysay, midig-guji CadCraft Studio oo dooro Fur. CadCraft Studio weli ma jiro dukaanka app-yada, iPad ama iPhone dhismo weli ma jiro. Liiska xagalka iyo jiritaanka ee Cutubyada waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin weli ma jiro sanduuq akhrinaya. Rendarka kaarka garaafka (WebGPU) waxaa lagu tijaabiyay halkan software stand-in oo keliya, kaarka garaafka dhab ah weli ma lagu tijaabin, sidaas darteed rendar wax yar kombiyuutarkaaga marka hore. Isla arrintaas ayaa ku saabsan aragta toosa, VR-na weli waxaa lagu tijaabiyay emulator madadaal oo keliya. Ma jiro WebGPU, ma jiro goobta rendarka iyo safka rendarka; sawirro tayo sare ahi ma leeyihiin depth of field, samada jireed, sawirka samada, ceeryaan, qiiq, caustics ama isku darka iftiinka. Rendar sawir… weli ma rendariyo shayaad firdhsan; way muuqdaan aragta toosa, panoramas-kooda, viewer-kooda iyo fiidyowga. Lambaro waa animate-gareeyaan aragta, laakiin fiidyow la rendariyey wuxuu isticmaalaa lambarada sida ay tahay marka uu bilaabo. Bones iyo animation lama akhriyo lamana qorin faylalka glTF, FBX ama USD weli (moodeelada skin-ka leh waxay yimaadaan nasasho, miisaankooda leh), glTF iyo FBX agabka ka sii badan midabka saldhigga ama teksturada weli lama hayo. Midabka STEP iyo magacyada qaybaha assembly-ga weli lama akhriyo. Soo gelinta .3dm waxaa lagu tijaabiyay faylalka uu qoray toolkit-ka qaabka, weli faylalka barnaamijka naqshadaynta laftiisa ma aan tijaabin; SubD objects, qoraal iyo cabbirro way ka maqan yihiin. Dhirta maktabadda CivilCraft waa ModelCraft dhexdeeda, laakiin dhigidda dhirta ka soo qaadista weli lama dhisin. Rinjiga teksturka dusha push/pull wuxuu ku celcelinayaa tile-ka agabka; si aad dhinac keliya u rinjiso, u beddel mesh oo unwrap. Waxa kale oo dhan waa ku jira Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Bilow ModelCraft","summary":"Waa maxay ModelCraft, sida loo furo, iyo sanduuqaaga ugu horreeya laga bilaabo afar-geesle ilaa moodel la kaydiyay.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["bilow","moodelka ugu horreeya","casharro","hordhac","boks","3d","riix jiid","bilow degdeg ah","hagid","la hagayo","cusub 3D"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-modelcraft","text":"Fur ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"hubi-cutubyada-marka-hore","text":"Hubi cutubyada marka hore","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-modelcraft-inuu-kugu-hago-moodelkaaga-ugu-horreeya","text":"Ka dhig ModelCraft inuu kugu hago moodelkaaga ugu horreeya","level":2},{"id":"sawir-sanduuqaaga-ugu-horreeya","text":"Sawir sanduuqaaga ugu horreeya","level":2},{"id":"eeg-wareegga","text":"Eeg wareegga","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo","text":"Ka noqo","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-moodelkaaga","text":"Kaydi moodelkaaga","level":2},{"id":"hel-caawimaad","text":"Hel caawimaad","level":2},{"id":"meesha-aad-u-gudubto-xiga","text":"Meesha aad u gudubto xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft waa nidaamiye 3D oo loo isticmaalo naqshadeynta bilowga: daraasado qaab-dhismeed, qorshe qolal, qaabab dhismeed oo degdeg ah, iyo hooska ay tuurayaan. Waxaad sawirtaa qaabab fiiqan, kadibna waad u kor qaadaysaa oo jidh adag ka dhigtaa, waxaadna ku sii shaqeysaa adigoo ku sawirayo wejiyadooda. Waxay ku shaqeysaa browser-kaaga, moodelladaadna way ku sii jiraan kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad SketchUp isticmaashay, inta badan waxa aad hore u taqaan way kuu wareegaan: furayaasha qalabka ee isku mid ah, riix/jiid, qiime sanduuq oo cabbirro saxan u ah, kooxo iyo qaybo. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa yimaada nidaamiyeyaasha kale\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa waxa kala duwan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-modelcraft\"\u003EFur ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur ModelCraft browser-ka nooca hadda jira ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowser-yada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug in muuqaalka 3D uu soo muuqdo: meel iftiin (ama mugdi) ah oo dhexe ah, iyo kaar cinwaankiisu yahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow samaynta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGL, astaanta sawirka 3D ee browser-kaaga. Haddii dhexda shaashadda ay madhan tahay oo qalabyadu waxba samayn waayaan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#the-3d-view-is-blank\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"the-3d-view-is-blank\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-cutubyada-marka-hore\"\u003EHubi cutubyada marka hore\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg geeska hoose ee midig. Badhanka cutubka wuxuu muujinayaa cutubka dhererka lagu cabbiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efeet iyo inch\u003C/strong\u003E markii browser-kaaga loo dejiyo Maraykanka (sidoo kale Liberia iyo Myanmar), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitir\u003C/strong\u003E meel kasta oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u beddesho, dooro cutub kale doorashada: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eft and in\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ein\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Em\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Ecm\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emm\u003C/span\u003E. Moodelka qudhiisu ma beddelo cabbirkiisa; kaliya sida dherer loo muujiyo iyo sida lambarada aan cutub lahayn loo akhriyo ayaa beddela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELambar aad ku qortid oo aan cutub lahayn waxay isticmaalaysaa cutubka moodelka. Moodel feet iyo inch ah, lambar aan cutub lahayn waa \u003Cstrong\u003Einch\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E waa 10 feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-modelcraft-inuu-kugu-hago-moodelkaaga-ugu-horreeya\"\u003EKa dhig ModelCraft inuu kugu hago moodelkaaga ugu horreeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECusub baa 3D? Kaarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow samaynta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodelka ugu horreeya ee la hagayo\u003C/span\u003E (waxaa sidoo kale ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E). Kaar yar ayaa kugu hagaya afar talaabo, laga bilaabo afar-geesle ilaa moodel diyaar u ah printer 3D:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir afar-geesle dhulka korkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix ku dhig sanduuq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa dhig sanduuqa hal shay (koox).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D, kadibna soo deji faylka 3MF ama STL.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarku wuxuu eegaa moodelka, ma badhamada: wuxuu u gudbaa talaabada markii ay dhammaato, siduu ku samayn kasta, wuxuuna dib ugu noqdaa talaabo markaad ka noqoto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro qalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka kuu doortaa. Xir wakhti kasta oo aad rabto adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-sanduuqaaga-ugu-horreeya\"\u003ESawir sanduuqaaga ugu horreeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u hesho qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji mar dhulka, ku dhow bartiga dhexe ee muuqaalka. Taasi waa geeska ugu horreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMouse-ka u fogee. Afar-geesle ayaa raacda, sanduuqa qiimaha hoose (oo lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E) ayaa muujinaya cabbirkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor cabbirka oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003E16&#039;,12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E feet iyo inch. Ma u baahnid inaad marka hore gujiso sanduuqa qiimaha; lambar aad ku qortid wuxuu u diraa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad heleysaa afar-geesle dhulka ah. Waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ewejig\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha oo leh geesaha ku wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u hesho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji afar-geesleha, u dhaqaaq sare, kadibna mar kale guji. Ama guji afar-geesleha oo ku qor dherer, sida \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfar-geesleha wuxuu noqonayaa sanduuq leh korka, hoose, iyo afar dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji korka sanduuqa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E midigta ayaa muujinaya bedkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa kale oo aad jiidi kartaa halkii aad laba jeer guji: taabo geeska koowaad, jiid, kadibna sii dayn geeska labaad. Labada habba way shaqeeyaan qalabka sawirka kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-wareegga\"\u003EEeg wareegga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg:\u003C/strong\u003E jiid badhanka dhexe ee mouse-ka (tuubada), ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid badhanka bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E jiid badhanka midig, ama badhanka dhexe adigoo haysta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynee:\u003C/strong\u003E rog tuubada. Waxay weynaysaa wax kasta oo ku yaal taabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArag wax walba:\u003C/strong\u003E taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad ama shaashad taabasho ah gacmo-tilmaameedyadu way kala duwan yihiin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EWareeg, guuri iyo weynee\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad uga noqoto, iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad mar kale u samayso, ama isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E qalabka. ModelCraft wuxuu xasuustaa 200 talaabo oo ugu dambeeya intii moodelku furan yahay. Taariikhdan fayl kuma kaydsanto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-moodelkaaga\"\u003EKaydi moodelkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl loo magacaabay moodelkaaga, sida \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa meesha uu tagay: &quot;Waa la kaydiyay Untitled.modelcraft degdegaha soo dejinta.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta waa soo dejin.\u003C/strong\u003E Mar kasta oo aad kaydiso waxay samaysaa nuqul cusub galka soo dejinta; ma dhigayso faylka aad furtay. Si aad u hayso gal mashruuc oo nadiif ah, u rog ama magacow faylka halkaas adigu. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\"\u003EFur, kaydi, soo geli iyo soo saar\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sharraxayaa sababta iyo waxa kale oo aad samayn karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ma kaydiyo isaga keligiis. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa (&quot;Ka tag goobta?&quot;). Dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hel-caawimaad\"\u003EHel caawimaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka app-ka si aad u furto caawimaadan moodelka dhinacdiisa. Waxay shaqeysaa adigoon xiriir lahayn. Taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E gudaha caawimaadda, si aad u xirto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/help\" data-topic=\"basics/help\"\u003EIsticmaalka caawimaadan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-aad-u-gudubto-xiga\"\u003EMeesha aad u gudubto xiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003ESawir wejiyada xarriiqyo, afar-geesleyaal iyo goobo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\"\u003ERiix oo jiid wejiyada si aad jidh adag u dhigto\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EKu qor cabbirro saxan oo sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"ModelCraft waa nidaamiye 3D oo loo isticmaalo naqshadeynta bilowga: daraasado qaab-dhismeed, qorshe qolal, qaabab dhismeed oo degdeg ah, iyo hooska ay tuurayaan. Waxaad sawirtaa qaabab fiiqan, kadibna waad u kor qaadaysaa oo jidh adag ka dhigtaa, waxaadna ku sii shaqeysaa adigoo ku sawirayo wejiyadooda. Waxay ku shaqeysaa browser-kaaga, moodelladaadna way ku sii jiraan kombiyuutarkaaga. Haddii aad SketchUp isticmaashay, inta badan waxa aad hore u taqaan way kuu wareegaan: furayaasha qalabka ee isku mid ah, riix/jiid, qiime sanduuq oo cabbirro saxan u ah, kooxo iyo qaybo. Ka yimaada nidaamiyeyaasha kale wuxuu sheegayaa waxa kala duwan. Fur ModelCraft Fur ModelCraft browser-ka nooca hadda jira ee Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari. Eeg Browser-yada iyo kombiyuutarrada. Sug in muuqaalka 3D uu soo muuqdo: meel iftiin (ama mugdi) ah oo dhexe ah, iyo kaar cinwaankiisu yahay Bilow samaynta moodelka. ModelCraft wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGL, astaanta sawirka 3D ee browser-kaaga. Haddii dhexda shaashadda ay madhan tahay oo qalabyadu waxba samayn waayaan, eeg Xallinta dhibaatada. Hubi cutubyada marka hore Eeg geeska hoose ee midig. Badhanka cutubka wuxuu muujinayaa cutubka dhererka lagu cabbiro. Moodel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa feet iyo inch markii browser-kaaga loo dejiyo Maraykanka (sidoo kale Liberia iyo Myanmar), iyo millimitir meel kasta oo kale. Si aad u beddesho, dooro cutub kale doorashada: ft and in, in, m, cm ama mm. Moodelka qudhiisu ma beddelo cabbirkiisa; kaliya sida dherer loo muujiyo iyo sida lambarada aan cutub lahayn loo akhriyo ayaa beddela. Lambar aad ku qortid oo aan cutub lahayn waxay isticmaalaysaa cutubka moodelka. Moodel feet iyo inch ah, lambar aan cutub lahayn waa inch, sidaas darteed 120 waa 10 feet. Ka dhig ModelCraft inuu kugu hago moodelkaaga ugu horreeya Cusub baa 3D? Kaarka Bilow samaynta moodelka guji Moodelka ugu horreeya ee la hagayo (waxaa sidoo kale ku jira Muuqaalo). Kaar yar ayaa kugu hagaya afar talaabo, laga bilaabo afar-geesle ilaa moodel diyaar u ah printer 3D: Sawir afar-geesle dhulka korkiisa. Riix ku dhig sanduuq. Ka dhig sanduuqa hal shay (koox). Hubi daabacaadda 3D, kadibna soo deji faylka 3MF ama STL. Kaarku wuxuu eegaa moodelka, ma badhamada: wuxuu u gudbaa talaabada markii ay dhammaato, siduu ku samayn kasta, wuxuuna dib ugu noqdaa talaabo markaad ka noqoto. Dooro qalabka wuxuu qalabka kuu doortaa. Xir wakhti kasta oo aad rabto adigoo isticmaalaya ×. Sawir sanduuqaaga ugu horreeya Taabo R si aad u hesho qalabka Afar-geesle, ama guji Afar-geesle kooxda Sawir ee qalabka. Guji mar dhulka, ku dhow bartiga dhexe ee muuqaalka. Taasi waa geeska ugu horreeya. Mouse-ka u fogee. Afar-geesle ayaa raacda, sanduuqa qiimaha hoose (oo lagu calaamadeeyay Cabbirrada) ayaa muujinaya cabbirkiisa. Ku qor cabbirka oo taabo Enter: tusaale 4m,3m, ama 16',12' feet iyo inch. Ma u baahnid inaad marka hore gujiso sanduuqa qiimaha; lambar aad ku qortid wuxuu u diraa halkaas. Waxaad heleysaa afar-geesle dhulka ah. Waa wejig: dusha oo leh geesaha ku wareegsan. Taabo P si aad u hesho Riix/jiid. Guji afar-geesleha, u dhaqaaq sare, kadibna mar kale guji. Ama guji afar-geesleha oo ku qor dherer, sida 3m ama 10', kadibna taabo Enter. Afar-geesleha wuxuu noqonayaa sanduuq leh korka, hoose, iyo afar dhinac. Taabo Space si aad ugu noqoto Dooro, kadibna guji korka sanduuqa. Macluumaadka midigta ayaa muujinaya bedkiisa. Waxa kale oo aad jiidi kartaa halkii aad laba jeer guji: taabo geeska koowaad, jiid, kadibna sii dayn geeska labaad. Labada habba way shaqeeyaan qalabka sawirka kasta. Eeg wareegga Wareeg: jiid badhanka dhexe ee mouse-ka (tuubada), ama taabo O oo jiid badhanka bidix. Guuri muuqaalka: jiid badhanka midig, ama badhanka dhexe adigoo haysta Shift. Weynee: rog tuubada. Waxay weynaysaa wax kasta oo ku yaal taabka. Arag wax walba: taabo Shift+Z, ama guji Xuduudaha. Trackpad ama shaashad taabasho ah gacmo-tilmaameedyadu way kala duwan yihiin. Eeg Wareeg, guuri iyo weynee. Ka noqo Taabo Ctrl+Z si aad uga noqoto, iyo Ctrl+Y si aad mar kale u samayso, ama isticmaal Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale qalabka. ModelCraft wuxuu xasuustaa 200 talaabo oo ugu dambeeya intii moodelku furan yahay. Taariikhdan fayl kuma kaydsanto. Kaydi moodelkaaga Guji Kaydi kooxda Fayl, ama taabo Ctrl+S. Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa fayl loo magacaabay moodelkaaga, sida Untitled.modelcraft. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa meesha uu tagay: \"Waa la kaydiyay Untitled.modelcraft degdegaha soo dejinta.\" Kaydinta waa soo dejin. Mar kasta oo aad kaydiso waxay samaysaa nuqul cusub galka soo dejinta; ma dhigayso faylka aad furtay. Si aad u hayso gal mashruuc oo nadiif ah, u rog ama magacow faylka halkaas adigu. Fur, kaydi, soo geli iyo soo saar wuxuu sharraxayaa sababta iyo waxa kale oo aad samayn karto. ModelCraft ma kaydiyo isaga keligiis. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa (\"Ka tag goobta?\"). Dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Hel caawimaad Taabo F1 ama guji Caawimaad bar-ka app-ka si aad u furto caawimaadan moodelka dhinacdiisa. Waxay shaqeysaa adigoon xiriir lahayn. Taabo F1 mar kale, ama Esc gudaha caawimaadda, si aad u xirto. Eeg Isticmaalka caawimaadan. Meesha aad u gudubto xiga Sawir wejiyada xarriiqyo, afar-geesleyaal iyo goobo Riix oo jiid wejiyada si aad jidh adag u dhigto Ku qor cabbirro saxan oo sanduuqa qiimaha Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka oo dhan","lang":"so"},{"slug":"beginner","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Habka Bilowga","summary":"Badhamo waaweyn oo yar si aad u bilowdo nidaaminta 3D: ku dhig qaabab, samee godad, guuri oo isku toosi, isku koox samee si godadku u gooyaan, oo hubi natiijada daabacaadda 3D.","section":"start","order":12,"keywords":["bilowga","bilowgii","fudud","sahlan","moodelka ugu horreeya","carruur","dugsi","qaabab","sanduuq","silindar","kubbad","koon","saqaf","god","godad","gooy","gooyn","isku toosi","koox","ku dhac dhulka","habka menyuga","saxanka sare"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dhis-qaabab","text":"Ku dhis qaabab","level":2},{"id":"samee-godad","text":"Samee godad","level":2},{"id":"isku-toosi","text":"Isku toosi","level":2},{"id":"hubi-daabacaadda","text":"Hubi daabacaadda","level":2},{"id":"tabbadaha-kale","text":"Tabbadaha kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMa cusub baa 3D? \u003Cstrong\u003EHabka menyuga Bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tab-ka koowaad ku saaraa dhowr badhan oo waaweyn, si aad wax uga dhisto qaabab iyo godad ka hor intaadan baran sida wejiyada loo sawiro oo loo riixo. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga\u003C/span\u003E. Hababka kale oo dhan way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen; mar kasta waad dib ugu beddeli kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhis-qaabab\"\u003EKu dhis qaabab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qaab tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoks\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilindar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKubbad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoon\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaqaf\u003C/span\u003E. Mid kasta waa 20 mm ballac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayso: dhulka, ama wejiga qaab kale (wuxuu istaaganayaa wejigaas). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa joojisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qaab si aad u doorato, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E. Intaad guurinayso ama miisaaminayso ballac qor si aad u saxdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-godad\"\u003ESamee godad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod waa qaab ku gooya qaababka uu kooxda la yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod sanduuq ah\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod wareegsan\u003C/span\u003E (midabkoodu waa cirro), ama dooro qaab kasta oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig god\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig jidh adag\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu godka dib ugu soo celiyaa qaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhig godka meesha ay ka gooyayso: dhex qaab, ama qayb ka mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaababka iyo godadka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wuxuu ku daraa mid), kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E. Godadka waa la gooyaa, natiijadu waa hal qayb. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa mar kale kala furta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii godka aan xulashada ku jirin, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu samaynayaa koox caadi ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-toosi\"\u003EIsku toosi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro laba qaab ama ka badan, kadibna isticmaal badamada isku toosinta: fallaadhadooda waxay tilmaamaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku toosi bidix\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku toosi xudunta (casaan)\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku toosi midig\u003C/span\u003E, isla sidaas oo ku saabsan cagaaran (hore, dhexe, dhabar) iyo buluug (salka, dhexe, sare). Waxay ku toosaan dibedda xulashada oo dhan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhac dhulka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaab kasta oo la doortay dib ugu dejiyaa dhulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-daabacaadda\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacidda 3D…\u003C/span\u003E tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hubiyaa moodelka wuxuuna soo dejiyaa printer-kaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EMoodelka u diyaari daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003ETaageerayaasha, dhumucda darbiga, qodista gudaha iyo hagaajinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tabbadaha-kale\"\u003ETabbadaha kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay kamaradda: wareeg, guuri muuqaalka, weynee, weynee wax kasta, iyo muuqaalada caadiga ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalab dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay dhammaan qalabyada kale ee ModelCraft, kuwa yaryar. Habkan, badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003Emidig\u003C/strong\u003E ee mouse-ku wuu wareegaa, badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003Edhexe\u003C/strong\u003E wuu guurinayaa; tuubada wuu weynaynayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa rabtaa in ModelCraft kugu hago markii aad qaybtaada 3D ee ugu horreysa sawirayso? Isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/getting-started#let-modelcraft-guide-your-first-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/getting-started\" data-hash=\"let-modelcraft-guide-your-first-model\"\u003Emoodelka ugu horreeya ee la hagayo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXidhiidh: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ma cusub baa 3D? Habka menyuga Bilowga wuxuu tab-ka koowaad ku saaraa dhowr badhan oo waaweyn, si aad wax uga dhisto qaabab iyo godad ka hor intaadan baran sida wejiyada loo sawiro oo loo riixo. Dooro Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › ModelCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka › Bilowga. Hababka kale oo dhan way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen; mar kasta waad dib ugu beddeli kartaa. Ku dhis qaabab Guji qaab tab-ka Samee: Boks, Silindar, Kubbad, Koon ama Saqaf. Mid kasta waa 20 mm ballac. Guji meesha ay tagayso: dhulka, ama wejiga qaab kale (wuxuu istaaganayaa wejigaas). Esc ayaa joojisa. Guji qaab si aad u doorato, kadibna Guuri, Wareeji ama Miisaan. Intaad guurinayso ama miisaaminayso ballac qor si aad u saxdo. Samee godad God waa qaab ku gooya qaababka uu kooxda la yahay. Ku dhig God sanduuq ah ama God wareegsan (midabkoodu waa cirro), ama dooro qaab kasta oo guji Ka dhig god. Ka dhig jidh adag wuxuu godka dib ugu soo celiyaa qaab. Dhig godka meesha ay ka gooyayso: dhex qaab, ama qayb ka mid ah. Dooro qaababka iyo godadka (Shift+guji wuxuu ku daraa mid), kadibna guji Koox. Godadka waa la gooyaa, natiijadu waa hal qayb. Ctrl+Z ayaa mar kale kala furta. Haddii godka aan xulashada ku jirin, Koox wuxuu samaynayaa koox caadi ah. Isku toosi Dooro laba qaab ama ka badan, kadibna isticmaal badamada isku toosinta: fallaadhadooda waxay tilmaamaan Isku toosi bidix / Isku toosi xudunta (casaan) / Isku toosi midig, isla sidaas oo ku saabsan cagaaran (hore, dhexe, dhabar) iyo buluug (salka, dhexe, sare). Waxay ku toosaan dibedda xulashada oo dhan. Ku dhac dhulka wuxuu qaab kasta oo la doortay dib ugu dejiyaa dhulka. Hubi daabacaadda Hubi daabacidda 3D… tab-ka Samee wuxuu hubiyaa moodelka wuxuuna soo dejiyaa printer-kaaga. Eeg Moodelka u diyaari daabacaadda 3D iyo Taageerayaasha, dhumucda darbiga, qodista gudaha iyo hagaajinta. Tabbadaha kale Muuqaal wuxuu leeyahay kamaradda: wareeg, guuri muuqaalka, weynee, weynee wax kasta, iyo muuqaalada caadiga ah. Qalab dheeraad ah wuxuu leeyahay dhammaan qalabyada kale ee ModelCraft, kuwa yaryar. Habkan, badhanka midig ee mouse-ku wuu wareegaa, badhanka dhexe wuu guurinayaa; tuubada wuu weynaynayaa. Ma rabtaa in ModelCraft kugu hago markii aad qaybtaada 3D ee ugu horreysa sawirayso? Isticmaal moodelka ugu horreeya ee la hagayo. Xidhiidh: Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka · Kooxaha iyo qaybaha","lang":"so"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Shaashadda ModelCraft","summary":"Safar ku saabsan qalabka hagaha, panelada dhinac kasta, muuqaalka 3D iyo bar-ka xaaladda, iyada oo loo sheegay magacyadooda shaashadda.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["shaashad","qaabka","qalabka hagaha","panelada","liiska","macluumaadka","habka","muuqallada","bar-ka xaaladda","qiimaha sanduuqa","cabbirrada","interface","safar"],"headings":[{"id":"bar-ka-app-ka","text":"Bar-ka app-ka","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-hagaha","text":"Qalabka hagaha","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"panelada-bidix","text":"Panelada bidix","level":2},{"id":"panelada-midig","text":"Panelada midig","level":2},{"id":"bar-ka-xaaladda","text":"Bar-ka xaaladda","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-yar","text":"Shaashad yar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose: bar-ka app-ka, qalabka hagaha, saddex tiir (panelada bidix, muuqaalka 3D, panelada midig) iyo bar-ka xaaladda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-app-ka\"\u003EBar-ka app-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar-ka yaryar ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu u jiraa app kasta oo CadCraft ah. Wuxuu leeyahay magaca app-ka iyo nooca, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu saabsan ModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, badhanka habka shaashadda iyo beddelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E waa mawduuca iftiinka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E waa midka mugdiga. Muuqaalka 3D midabkiisa wuu beddelaa si uu ula mid noqdo; moodelkaagu ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka habka shaashadda (wuxuu akhrinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaashad buuxda\u003C/span\u003E marka hore) iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay wareegaan saddex habab: caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bararada laga qariyay. Marka bararku qarsan yihiin, taabo geeska sare ee shaashadda (ama taabo) si aad u soo celiso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka baxaa shaashadda buuxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa furaha Control kombiyuutar kasta, Mac-ka sidoo kale. iPhone-ka, halkaas oo browser-yadu aan shaashad buuxda lahayn, badhanku wuxuu kaliya qariyaa oo muujiyaa bararka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-hagaha\"\u003EQalabka hagaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka hagaha waa qaybo-qaybo la calaamadeeyay. Taabo badhanka si aad u aragto magacyadiisa iyo furahiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBidixda, liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa waxa qalabka iyo panelka midig loogu talagalay: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E (riix/jiid moodelka, safarka hoose), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003Etafatir mesh\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Eshayada qalinka\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUV\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/uv\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/uv\"\u003Ehabee UV\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003Esculpt\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoosaad\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003Eagabka laga sameeyay nodes\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003Edhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/a\u003E) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#render-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"render-in-the-view\"\u003Erendar muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhamada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E (menu qaabab)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeef\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayb\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E (menu: jar, koobiyee, dhaji, dhaji meeshii \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, nuqul \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tirtir, dooro dhammaan, ka saar xulashada, iyo habka furayaasha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKamarad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E (menu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha la muujiyay waa kuwa riix/jiid. Haddii habka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha: Moodelka\u003C/span\u003E lagu doortay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003Edejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E, tilmaamayaasha ayaa muujinaya furayaasha kale. Qalabka aad isticmaalayso wuxuu ku muuqdaa riixan. Shaashad yar, qalabka hagaha wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMenu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhabar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBidix\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E, midkiiba oo lagu habeeyay moodelka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiif\u003C/span\u003E, kaas oo u beddela perspective iyo parallel projection.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhexda shaashadda. Khadadka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug waa tilmaamayaasha: casaan iyo cagaarku waxay ku jiraan dhulka, buluugu wuxuu u taagan yahay sare, \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaqooyigu waa tilmaamaha cagaaran\u003C/strong\u003E. Meesha ay isku kulmaan waa asalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii aad bilowdo, kaar cinwaankiisu yahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow samaynta moodelka\u003C/span\u003E ayaa liistaa furayaasha ugu horreeya. Wuu baxayaa markaad doorato qalab sawir ama aad gujiso muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntii qalab shaqeynayo, muuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecalaamadaha tilmaanta\u003C/strong\u003E: qaabab midab leh oo yaryar meesha mouse-ku ku dhacayo (goob cagaar ah oo ah geeska dhamaadka, goob cyan ah oo ah dhexe, laba-jibaare casaan ah oo geesha, qaab buluug ah oo wejiga). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003ETilmaanta iyo dhufashada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxyaabaha la doortay waxay u noqdaan buluug. Wejiga laga arko dhabarka waa buluug-cad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka aad koox furto si aad u tafatirto, wax kasta oo ka baxsan way ifaan, tilmaamayaasha waxay u guuraan tilmaamayaasha kooxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka moodelku leeyahay muuqallo, safka tab-yada muuqaallada ayaa soo muuqda sare ee muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka meel kasta oo muuqaalka ku dhig si aad u furto ama u soo dhoofiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-bidix\"\u003EPanelada bidix\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha moodelka, sida ay isku dhex jiraan. Qayb loo isticmaalo in ka badan hal mar wuxuu muujinayaa inta jeer, sida &quot;Daaqad (4)&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji magac si aad u doorato. Laba jeer guji si aad u tafatirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi magac\u003C/strong\u003E (wuxuu muuqdaa marka laba koox ama ka badan jiraan) wuxuu hayaa safafka magacoodu u dhigmo oo keliya, iyo kooxaha ay ku jiraan. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa nadiifiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndhaha\u003C/strong\u003E ku yaal dhamaadka safka ayaa qariya ama muujiya kooxda ama qaybta (sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari\u003C/span\u003E sameeyo). Astaanta tag-ga waxay tusaysaa in ay qarsan tahay tag-gaas \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Etag\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagac-beddel meesha:\u003C/strong\u003E guji safka, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, qor, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu hayaa magaca hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid safka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u guuri karaa dhexda safka kooxda kale si uu ugu jiro, ama geeska sare ama hoose ee safka si uu uga horreeyo ama ka dambeeyo safkaas, ama cinwaanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/span\u003E si uu u gudbo heerka sare. Wuxuu sii joogaa meeshiisa moodelka, wuxuuna hayaa midabkiisa, tag-gii iyo magacii. Koox gudaha kooxdeeda ma geli karto. Guri kasta waa hal talaabo oo laga noqdo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components#rearrange-in-the-outliner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\" data-hash=\"rearrange-in-the-outliner\"\u003EDib u habeyn Liiska\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad gudaha kooxda ka tafatirayso, hal xariiq wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Tafatirka: Moodel › …&quot;, iyo badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir kooxda\u003C/span\u003E ayaa soo muuqda. Wuxuu xiraa dhammaan heerarka furan hal mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa qeexid kasta oo qayb ah oo lagu tiriyay inta nuqul la dhigay (&quot;3×&quot;) iyo badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E oo ku daraa nuqul kale meesha aad gujiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-midig\"\u003EPanelada midig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sharraxaa waxa la doortay. Cinwaankiisu wuu beddelaa si uu u sheego waa maxay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECinwaanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu muujinayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhamada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodel (wax la dooran waayay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo qaybaha iyo inta la dhigay, hagayaasha, cabbirka guud\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir dhammaan hagayaasha\u003C/span\u003E (marka hagayaasha ay jiraan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBedka, inta godad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi wajiga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGees\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoox ama Qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca (ku qor si aad u beddesho), inta jeer la dhigay, haddii uu yahay jidh adag oo xiran, mugga, cabbirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E (qayb la dhigay in ka badan hal mar), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee qayb\u003C/span\u003E (koox)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaha dhibic ama hagaha xariiq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay dhowr\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta wejiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo hagayaasha, wadarta bedka wejiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee qayb (G)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee koox (Shift+G)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa sida moodelku loo muuqdo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin-hoosaad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhad qarsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji geesaha\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooska qorraxda\u003C/span\u003E oo leh taariikhda, waqtiga iyo goobta qorraxda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\"\u003EHabka iyo hooska qorraxda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaallo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar muuqaal\u003C/span\u003E, liiska muuqaallada, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKan hore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKan xiga\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EKaydi muuqaallada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-xaaladda\"\u003EBar-ka xaaladda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta, laga bilaabo bidix ilaa midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETalo-yar\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa qalabku rabo xiga, ama waxa mouse-ku ku dhacayo (&quot;Dhamaadka&quot;, &quot;Tooska casaanka&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFariimo\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa kaliya dhacay (&quot;Ka noqday riix/jiid.&quot;, &quot;Waa la soo dhoofiyay site.dxf: 1697 geesood dhulka, koox ku jira.&quot;) ama sababta wax aan u shaqayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha sanduuqa\u003C/strong\u003E: calaamadiisu wuu beddelaa qalabka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E). Wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka tooska ah intaad shaqeynayso, wuxuuna qaataa waxa aad qortay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EQor cabbirro saxan sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka furayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha: Riix-jiid\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha: Moodelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa gaaban-furayaasha iyo badhamada mouse-ka isla mar (sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003Edejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dhac\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: ku xidhka barta, geesaha iyo tilmaamaha, iyo jidhka adag ee joogsada marka ay isku taabtaan. Gooyan = damisan. Guji si aad u beddesho. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003Edejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanka cutubka\u003C/strong\u003E: cutubka ay dhererka lagu muujiyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/getting-started#check-the-units-first\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/getting-started\" data-hash=\"check-the-units-first\"\u003EBilow\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-yar\"\u003EShaashad yar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hooseeya qiyaas 760 pikseel ballac (taleefan, ama daaqad cidhiidh ah), muuqaalka 3D wuxuu hayaa shaashadda. Qalabka hagaha waa hal saf oo dhinac u socda, panelada waxay furmaan sida xaashi ka bar-ka hoose ee shaashadda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Laga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose: bar-ka app-ka, qalabka hagaha, saddex tiir (panelada bidix, muuqaalka 3D, panelada midig) iyo bar-ka xaaladda. Bar-ka app-ka Bar-ka yaryar ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu u jiraa app kasta oo CadCraft ah. Wuxuu leeyahay magaca app-ka iyo nooca, Ku saabsan ModelCraft, badhanka habka shaashadda iyo beddelka Paper / Moodeel. Paper waa mawduuca iftiinka, Moodeel waa midka mugdiga. Muuqaalka 3D midabkiisa wuu beddelaa si uu ula mid noqdo; moodelkaagu ma beddelo. Badhanka habka shaashadda (wuxuu akhrinayaa Shaashad buuxda marka hore) iyo Ctrl+Shift+F waxay wareegaan saddex habab: caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bararada laga qariyay. Marka bararku qarsan yihiin, taabo geeska sare ee shaashadda (ama taabo) si aad u soo celiso. Esc wuxuu ka baxaa shaashadda buuxda. Ctrl+Shift+F wuxuu isticmaalaa furaha Control kombiyuutar kasta, Mac-ka sidoo kale. iPhone-ka, halkaas oo browser-yadu aan shaashad buuxda lahayn, badhanku wuxuu kaliya qariyaa oo muujiyaa bararka. Qalabka hagaha Qalabka hagaha waa qaybo-qaybo la calaamadeeyay. Taabo badhanka si aad u aragto magacyadiisa iyo furahiisa. Bidixda, liiska Goobta shaqada wuxuu beddelaa waxa qalabka iyo panelka midig loogu talagalay: Moodeel (riix/jiid moodelka, safarka hoose), Mesh (tafatir mesh), Qalin (shayada qalinka), UV (habee UV), Sculpt (sculpt), Hoosaad (agabka laga sameeyay nodes), Dhaqdhaqaaq (dhaqdhaqaaq) iyo Soo saar (rendar muuqaalka). Kooxda Badhamada Fayl Cusub, Fur, Kaydi, Soo dhoofi, Soo saar (menu qaabab) Sawir Xarriiq (L), Afar-geesle (R), Goobo (C), Poligon (N) Wax ka beddel Dooro (Space), Riix/jiid (P), Guuri (M), Wareeji (Q), Miisaan (S), Tirtiraha (E), Teef (T) Habee Qayb (G), Koox (Shift+G), Kala bax Tafatir Ka noqo (Ctrl+Z), Samee mar kale (Ctrl+Y), Koobiyee (Ctrl+C), Dhaji (Ctrl+V), Dheeraad (menu: jar, koobiyee, dhaji, dhaji meeshii Ctrl+Shift+V, nuqul Ctrl+D, tirtir, dooro dhammaan, ka saar xulashada, iyo habka furayaasha) Kamarad Wareeg (O), Muuqaalka guuri (H), Weynee (Z), Xuduudaha (Shift+Z), Muuqaalo (menu) Furayaasha la muujiyay waa kuwa riix/jiid. Haddii habka Furayaasha: Moodelka lagu doortay dejinta ModelCraft, tilmaamayaasha ayaa muujinaya furayaasha kale. Qalabka aad isticmaalayso wuxuu ku muuqdaa riixan. Shaashad yar, qalabka hagaha wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa dhinac. Menu-ga Muuqaalo wuxuu leeyahay Iso, Sare, Hore, Midig, Dhabar, Bidix iyo Hoose, midkiiba oo lagu habeeyay moodelka, iyo Perspektiif, kaas oo u beddela perspective iyo parallel projection. Muuqaalka 3D Dhexda shaashadda. Khadadka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug waa tilmaamayaasha: casaan iyo cagaarku waxay ku jiraan dhulka, buluugu wuxuu u taagan yahay sare, waqooyigu waa tilmaamaha cagaaran. Meesha ay isku kulmaan waa asalka. Markii aad bilowdo, kaar cinwaankiisu yahay Bilow samaynta moodelka ayaa liistaa furayaasha ugu horreeya. Wuu baxayaa markaad doorato qalab sawir ama aad gujiso muuqaalka. Intii qalab shaqeynayo, muuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa calaamadaha tilmaanta: qaabab midab leh oo yaryar meesha mouse-ku ku dhacayo (goob cagaar ah oo ah geeska dhamaadka, goob cyan ah oo ah dhexe, laba-jibaare casaan ah oo geesha, qaab buluug ah oo wejiga). Eeg Tilmaanta iyo dhufashada. Waxyaabaha la doortay waxay u noqdaan buluug. Wejiga laga arko dhabarka waa buluug-cad. Marka aad koox furto si aad u tafatirto, wax kasta oo ka baxsan way ifaan, tilmaamayaasha waxay u guuraan tilmaamayaasha kooxda. Marka moodelku leeyahay muuqallo, safka tab-yada muuqaallada ayaa soo muuqda sare ee muuqaalka. Faylka meel kasta oo muuqaalka ku dhig si aad u furto ama u soo dhoofiso. Panelada bidix Liiska wuxuu liistaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha moodelka, sida ay isku dhex jiraan. Qayb loo isticmaalo in ka badan hal mar wuxuu muujinayaa inta jeer, sida \"Daaqad (4)\". Guji magac si aad u doorato. Laba jeer guji si aad u tafatirto. Raadi magac (wuxuu muuqdaa marka laba koox ama ka badan jiraan) wuxuu hayaa safafka magacoodu u dhigmo oo keliya, iyo kooxaha ay ku jiraan. Esc ayaa nadiifiya. Indhaha ku yaal dhamaadka safka ayaa qariya ama muujiya kooxda ama qaybta (sida Tafatir › Dheeraad › Qari sameeyo). Astaanta tag-ga waxay tusaysaa in ay qarsan tahay tag-gaas tag. Magac-beddel meesha: guji safka, kadibna taabo F2, qor, kadibna taabo Enter (Esc wuxuu hayaa magaca hore). Jiid safka wuxuu u guuri karaa dhexda safka kooxda kale si uu ugu jiro, ama geeska sare ama hoose ee safka si uu uga horreeyo ama ka dambeeyo safkaas, ama cinwaanka Liiska si uu u gudbo heerka sare. Wuxuu sii joogaa meeshiisa moodelka, wuxuuna hayaa midabkiisa, tag-gii iyo magacii. Koox gudaha kooxdeeda ma geli karto. Guri kasta waa hal talaabo oo laga noqdo. Eeg Dib u habeyn Liiska. Intaad gudaha kooxda ka tafatirayso, hal xariiq wuxuu leeyahay \"Tafatirka: Moodel › …\", iyo badhanka Xir kooxda ayaa soo muuqda. Wuxuu xiraa dhammaan heerarka furan hal mar. Qaybaha wuxuu liistaa qeexid kasta oo qayb ah oo lagu tiriyay inta nuqul la dhigay (\"3×\") iyo badhanka Dhig oo ku daraa nuqul kale meesha aad gujiso. Panelada midig Macluumaadka wuxuu sharraxaa waxa la doortay. Cinwaankiisu wuu beddelaa si uu u sheego waa maxay: Cinwaanka Wuxuu muujinayaa Badhamada Moodel (wax la dooran waayay) Wejiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo qaybaha iyo inta la dhigay, hagayaasha, cabbirka guud Tirtir dhammaan hagayaasha (marka hagayaasha ay jiraan) Wejig Bedka, inta godad Rogi wajiga Gees Dherer midna Koox ama Qayb Magaca (ku qor si aad u beddesho), inta jeer la dhigay, haddii uu yahay jidh adag oo xiran, mugga, cabbirka Tafatir, Kala bax, Ka dhig gaar ah (qayb la dhigay in ka badan hal mar), Samee qayb (koox) Hagaha dhibic ama hagaha xariiq midna Tirtir Shay dhowr Inta wejiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo hagayaasha, wadarta bedka wejiyada Samee qayb (G), Samee koox (Shift+G) Habka wuxuu dejiyaa sida moodelku loo muuqdo: Dusha (Iftiin-hoosaad, Khad qarsan, Silig, X-ray), Muuji geesaha, iyo Hooska qorraxda oo leh taariikhda, waqtiga iyo goobta qorraxda. Eeg Habka iyo hooska qorraxda. Muuqaallada wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaallo: Ku dar muuqaal, liiska muuqaallada, iyo Kan hore, Ciyaar iyo Kan xiga. Eeg Kaydi muuqaallada. Bar-ka xaaladda Hoosta, laga bilaabo bidix ilaa midig: Talo-yar: waxa qalabku rabo xiga, ama waxa mouse-ku ku dhacayo (\"Dhamaadka\", \"Tooska casaanka\"). Fariimo: waxa kaliya dhacay (\"Ka noqday riix/jiid.\", \"Waa la soo dhoofiyay site.dxf: 1697 geesood dhulka, koox ku jira.\") ama sababta wax aan u shaqayn. Qiimaha sanduuqa: calaamadiisu wuu beddelaa qalabka (Dherer, Cabbirrada, Radius, Dhinacyada, Masaafo, Xagal, Miisaan, Ka fogaan). Wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka tooska ah intaad shaqeynayso, wuxuuna qaataa waxa aad qortay. Eeg Qor cabbirro saxan sanduuqa qiimaha. Habka furayaasha: Furayaasha: Riix-jiid ama Furayaasha: Moodelka wuxuu beddelaa gaaban-furayaasha iyo badhamada mouse-ka isla mar (sida dejinta ModelCraft). Ku xidh iyo Isku dhac: ku xidhka barta, geesaha iyo tilmaamaha, iyo jidhka adag ee joogsada marka ay isku taabtaan. Gooyan = damisan. Guji si aad u beddesho. Eeg dejinta ModelCraft. Badhanka cutubka: cutubka ay dhererka lagu muujiyo. Eeg Bilow. Shaashad yar Ka hooseeya qiyaas 760 pikseel ballac (taleefan, ama daaqad cidhiidh ah), muuqaalka 3D wuxuu hayaa shaashadda. Qalabka hagaha waa hal saf oo dhinac u socda, panelada waxay furmaan sida xaashi ka bar-ka hoose ee shaashadda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Fur, kaydi, soo dhoofi iyo soo saar","summary":"Faylka ModelCraft, waxa aad soo geli kartid iyo dibadda u dirtid, meesha faylasha tagaan, iyo waxa isbeddela markii khadka ka baxsan iyo browserrada ka dhexeeya.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["fur","kaydi","soo dhoofi","soo saar","fayl","3dm","skp","soo celi","kaydi toos ah","dhowaan","desktop","fur 3D","gudbin","soo degso","fayl ModelCraft","dae","collada","obj","gltf","glb","stl","step","stp","ifc","dwg","dxf","qaababka","khadka ka baxsan","u kaydi sida"],"headings":[{"id":"qaababka-marlabaad","text":"Qaababka marlabaad","level":2},{"id":"faylka-modelcraft","text":"Faylka ModelCraft","level":2},{"id":"fur-moodel","text":"Fur moodel","level":3},{"id":"kaydi-moodel","text":"Kaydi moodel","level":3},{"id":"bilow-moodel-cusub","text":"Bilow moodel cusub","level":3},{"id":"haddii-browserku-xirmo-ka-hor-intaadan-kaydin","text":"Haddii browserku xirmo ka hor intaadan kaydin","level":3},{"id":"laga-bilaabo-cadcraft-fur-gudaha-modelcraft","text":"Laga bilaabo CadCraft: Fur gudaha ModelCraft","level":3},{"id":"soo-dhoofi","text":"Soo dhoofi","level":2},{"id":"soo-saar","text":"Soo saar","level":2},{"id":"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Khadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"app-ka-desktopka","text":"App-ka desktopka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu akhrisaa oo qoraa faylasha kombiyuutarkaaga. Wax lagu soo raro ma jiro: faylka aad furto waxa lagu akhriyaa browserkaaga gudihiisa, faylka aad kaydiso waa soo dejin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha faylashaadu tagaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-marlabaad\"\u003EQaababka marlabaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loogu talagalay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft (\u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylkaaga shaqada. Wax walba wuu hayaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijyada rendarka iyo isku-dhiska muuqaalka. USD-ga ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa wax walba. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EKaydi, fur iyo soo saar USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo dhoofinta moodelada SketchUp. Waxay hayaan kooxaha, komponentiyada, midabyada, tekstuurada wejiyada, tagaha iyo geesaha jilicsan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ESoo dhoofi moodel SKP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECollada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIs-weydaarsiga moodelada la yeelan karo kuwa kale ee 3D. Waxay hayaan kooxaha, komponentiyada iyo midabyada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ (\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijyada rendarka iyo muuqaalka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EglTF (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaallada webka, injiinnada ciyaaraha, AR.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL (\u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaabacaadda 3D (millimitir).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPLY (\u003Ccode\u003E.ply\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshyo midab leh: iskaanka, daabacaadda midabka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFBX (\u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelada barnaamijyada xoogsiga iyo ciyaaraha (FBX 2011 iyo kuwa cusub).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlembic (\u003Ccode\u003E.abc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydka joomatriga, muunadkiisa ugu horreeya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP (\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha barnaamijyada qaybaha iyo kuwa bixiyaha, sida meshyo xidhan oo cabbirkooda run ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EQaababka faylasha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodelada NURBS: polysurfaces, meshyo, curves, blocks iyo layers, sida meshyo, geesaha, komponentiyada iyo tagaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ESoo dhoofi moodel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF (\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaabacaadda 3D, midabada leh (millimitir). Ka yimid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC (\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijyada BIM, iyo BimCraft.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG (\u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhariidada goobta ama qorshaha dabaqa si loo moodelo; u dirida moodelka barnaamij CAD.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF (\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid, barnaamij CAD kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EQaababka faylasha si faahfaahsan\u003C/a\u003E waxa ay si sax ah u liistaa waxa qaab kasta hayo iyo waxa ka tago.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylka-modelcraft\"\u003EFaylka ModelCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu hayaa moodelka oo dhan: joomatriga, kooxaha, komponentiyada, hagayaasha, mashaadyada, cabbirrada, iyo kaamarada iyo qaabka aad isticmaalayay markaad kaydisay. Ma hayo taariikhda ka noqoshada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fur-moodel\"\u003EFur moodel\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii moodelka shaashadda ku jira uu leeyahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, ModelCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa: &quot;Moodelkan wuxuu leeyahay isbeddello aan la kaydin. Marka hore nuqul kaydi?&quot; Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi nuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir isbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka wuxuu ku furmaa cabbirrada uu lagu kaydiyay, kaamarada uu lagu kaydiyay. Waxaad sidoo kale ku rididi kartaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E muuqaalka 3D, ama guji mid ka mid ah liiska faylasha dhowaan ee kaarta bilowga (browserrada ku furi kara fayl, iyo app-ka desktopka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApp-ka desktopka, laba jeer ku dhufo fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ku furaa ModelCraft, sidaas oo kalena wuxuu sameeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFur ku\u003C/strong\u003E fayl Collada, OBJ, glTF, DWG ama DXF (waxaa loo soo dhoofiyaa moodel cusub).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kaydi-moodel\"\u003EKaydi moodel\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Browserku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, halkaas oo magaca yahay faylka aad furtay, ama &quot;Untitled&quot; moodel cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApp-ka desktopka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa faylka aad furtay isla meeshiisii. Moodel cusub wuxuu weydiiyaa meesha loo kaydinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu kaydiyaa nuqul ahaan fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E; meel ay browserku ku kari karto, wuxuu weydiiyaa magaca iyo meesha. Haddii kale, magacii soo dejisay beddel: kaydinta xigta ee ka dib markaad furto faylka magaca cusub leh waxay isticmaalaysaa magaca cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydin kasta waa soo dejin cusub. Iyadoo la eegayo dejinta browserka, waxay toos ugu aadaa folder-ka soo dejinta ama way weydiisaa meesha ay kaydinta ku tahay. Haddii fayl magacaas leh horay u jiro, browserka intiisa badan wuxuu ku daraa tiro, sida \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (1).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad folder kasta u doorato, fur dejinta browserka, ka raadi &quot;downloads&quot; oo shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad folder kasta u doorato, fur \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E, oo hoosta &quot;Downloads&quot; dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho meesha soo dejintu tagto, fur \u003Cstrong\u003ESafari\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E, oo deji &quot;File download location&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"bilow-moodel-cusub\"\u003EBilow moodel cusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii ay jiraan isbeddello aan la kaydin, ModelCraft marka hore wuu weydiiyaa. Moodel cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa madhan, cabbirka dalkaaga (feet iyo inches Maraykanka, millimitir meelo kale), mana leh mashaadyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"haddii-browserku-xirmo-ka-hor-intaadan-kaydin\"\u003EHaddii browserku xirmo ka hor intaadan kaydin\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul shaqada aan la kaydin browserkaaga, laba ilbiriqsi kadib isbeddel kasta. Nuqulka waxa lagu qoraa asal ahaan, sidaas darteed moodel weyn ma sugo adiga markii la hayo. Haddii tab-ka ama browserku xirmo ka hor intaadan kaydin, markii xigta ee aad furto ModelCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa &quot;Soo celi shaqadaada?&quot;. Soo celinta waxa ay furaa moodelka sidii uu ahaa, oo aan wali fayl loo kaydin: kaydi si aad u hayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ESoo celi shaqadaada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"laga-bilaabo-cadcraft-fur-gudaha-modelcraft\"\u003ELaga bilaabo CadCraft: Fur gudaha ModelCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijka naqshadaynta CadCraft, \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EDheeraad\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFur gudaha ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu naqshadda furan u gudbiyaa ModelCraft tab cusub, sida DWG. Waxa ay yimaadaa sida DWG la soo dhoofiyay oo kale: khadad dhulka saaran, kooxda ku jira, diyaar u ah in lagu moodelo. Waxba lama soo rarin; faylku wuxuu maraa kaydinta browserkaaga gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofi\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofintu waxa ay ku darta fayl moodelka aad furan tahay; ma beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, ama dhig faylka muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl SketchUp, Collada, OBJ, glTF, FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic, STEP, \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E, USD, DWG ama DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu yimaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal kooxood\u003C/strong\u003E, la doortay, muuqaalkuna wuu soo fogaadaa si uu u muujiyo. Xaaladda (status bar) waxa ay sheegaysaa waxa soo galay, waxana ay liistaa waxa aan la soo dhoofin karin, sida &quot;Lama soo dhoofin: 2 texture&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad joomatriga si toos ah u shaqeyso, guji laba jeer kooxda si aad uga tafatirto gudaheeda, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxyaabo aad ogaato:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka iyo dhinaca sare:\u003C/strong\u003E Faylasha Collada waxay sheegaan cabbirkooda iyo dhinaca sare, ModelCraft-na way beddelaa. glTF had iyo jeer mitir buu yahay. Faylasha OBJ ma lahaan cabbir: ModelCraft wuxuu u akhriyaa mitir, Y oo sare. Haddii OBJ uu yimaado 1000 jeer oo weyn ama yar, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/a\u003E iyo qaybiye sida \u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG iyo DXF\u003C/strong\u003E waxay yimaadaan khadad (geesaha) dhulka saaran, ma aha wejiyo. Haddii naqshaddu aysan sheegin cabbirkeeda, daaqad magaceedu yahay &quot;Cabbirka naqshadda&quot; ayaa weydiinaysa inta ay tahay hal unug naqshadeed. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EMoodel khariidada goobta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaddidaadyada:\u003C/strong\u003E faylasha ka weyn 300 MB looma soo dhoofin, iyo kuwa ka weyn 200 MB looma furo. Faylasha leh in ka badan 2 milyan oo vertex ama wejiyo waa la diidaa inay weyn yihiin. OBJ ka weyn 64 MB waa la diidaa ka hor inta aan la akhrin. Faylasha qoraalka (Collada, OBJ, ASCII STL, USD text) waxa lagu akhriyaa qayb mar, qiyaastii 4 MB, sidaas darteed ma jiro block qoraal oo keliya oo hayo fayl oo dhan; OBJ 16 MB ah wuxuu isticmaalay qiyaastii 0.5 GB xusuus markii uu furmay tijaabadeenna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saar\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaab: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ (.obj)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL oo loo daabacayo (.stl, millimitir)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPLY oo midab leh (.ply)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDWG oo loogu talagalay CAD (.dwg, 2004)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo loogu talagalay CAD (.dxf, R12)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowserku wuxuu soo dejiyaa faylka, magaciisu wuxuu sida moodelka oo kale yahay. Moodelka oo dhan ayaa la soo saaraa, ma aha xulashada keliya. Faylasha glTF, Collada iyo OBJ waxa lagu qoraa asalka (background), sidaas darteed ModelCraft wuu sii shaqeeyaa intii moodel weyn la soo saarayo; soo dejintu waxay bilaabataa markii faylku diyaar yahay. Moodel madhan lama soo saaro: &quot;Moodelku waa madhan yahay: marka hore wax sawir.&quot; Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003ESoo saar moodel barnaamijyo kale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadka-ku-jira-iyo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKhadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba oo ModelCraft ah waxa uu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, sidaas darteed moodelinta, furista, kaydinta, soo dhoofinta iyo soo saarista oo dhan way shaqeeyaan xidhiidh la&#039;aan markii app-ka la soo rido.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ModelCraft u furto xidhiidh la&#039;aan oo dhan, u kaydi isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan intaad khadka ku jirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E bar-ka app-ka ee sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadanku wuxuu tirinayaa (&quot;Kaydinaya 40 ka 212&quot;) intuu kaydinayo. ModelCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa faylashiisa (dhexdooda akhriyaha DWG), caawiskan, iyo maktabadda 3D, sidaas darteed waxay qaadan kartaa waqti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii badanku akhriyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, ModelCraft wuxuu ka furaa isla cinwaankii xidhiidh la&#039;aan, soo dhoofinta DWG ayaa sidoo kale khadka ka baxsan shaqeysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar dambe guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hesho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii badanku akhriyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E, qaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin: hubi xidhiidhka oo guji mar kale si aad isku daydo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E waxa ay macnaheedu tahay daaqaddan browserka ma hayn karto nuqul (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada la maamulo qaarkood). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar. Moodel kasta wuxuu ku nool yahay meesha aad ku kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka ka baxsan baad tahay. Waad sii moodeli kartaa oo kaydin kartaa. Haddii bar-ka app-ka uusan tusin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E, ha dib u soo rarin tab-kan ilaa aad mar kale khadka ku jirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-ka-desktopka\"\u003EApp-ka desktopka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft waxaad ku isticmaalaysaa CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktopka oo leh siddeedda app oo dhan. Faylasha way furmaan oo way kaydsamaan meesha aad doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:web\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EIn the browser\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browserka Mac, Windows iyo Linux, iyo CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktopka oo leh siddeedda app hal rakib ah, oo laga soo dejiyo getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"ModelCraft wuxuu akhrisaa oo qoraa faylasha kombiyuutarkaaga. Wax lagu soo raro ma jiro: faylka aad furto waxa lagu akhriyaa browserkaaga gudihiisa, faylka aad kaydiso waa soo dejin. Eeg Meesha faylashaadu tagaan. Qaababka marlabaad Qaab Fur Soo dhoofi Soo saar Waxa loogu talagalay ModelCraft (.modelcraft) haa maya Kaydi Faylkaaga shaqada. Wax walba wuu hayaa. USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz) haa haa U kaydi sida, Soo saar Barnaamijyada rendarka iyo isku-dhiska muuqaalka. USD-ga ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa wax walba. Eeg Kaydi, fur iyo soo saar USD. SketchUp (.skp) maya haa maya Soo dhoofinta moodelada SketchUp. Waxay hayaan kooxaha, komponentiyada, midabyada, tekstuurada wejiyada, tagaha iyo geesaha jilicsan. Eeg Soo dhoofi moodel SKP. Collada (.dae) maya haa haa Is-weydaarsiga moodelada la yeelan karo kuwa kale ee 3D. Waxay hayaan kooxaha, komponentiyada iyo midabyada. OBJ (.obj) maya haa haa Barnaamijyada rendarka iyo muuqaalka. glTF (.glb, .gltf) maya haa .glb oo keliya Muuqaallada webka, injiinnada ciyaaraha, AR. STL (.stl) maya haa haa Daabacaadda 3D (millimitir). PLY (.ply) maya haa haa Meshyo midab leh: iskaanka, daabacaadda midabka. FBX (.fbx) maya haa maya Moodelada barnaamijyada xoogsiga iyo ciyaaraha (FBX 2011 iyo kuwa cusub). Alembic (.abc) maya haa maya Kaydka joomatriga, muunadkiisa ugu horreeya. STEP (.step, .stp) maya haa maya Qaybaha barnaamijyada qaybaha iyo kuwa bixiyaha, sida meshyo xidhan oo cabbirkooda run ah. Eeg Qaababka faylasha. .3dm maya haa maya Moodelada NURBS: polysurfaces, meshyo, curves, blocks iyo layers, sida meshyo, geesaha, komponentiyada iyo tagaha. Eeg Soo dhoofi moodel .3dm. 3MF (.3mf) maya maya haa Daabacaadda 3D, midabada leh (millimitir). Ka yimid Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…: eeg Diyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D. IFC (.ifc) maya maya haa Barnaamijyada BIM, iyo BimCraft. DWG (.dwg) maya haa haa Khariidada goobta ama qorshaha dabaqa si loo moodelo; u dirida moodelka barnaamij CAD. DXF (.dxf) maya haa haa Isku mid, barnaamij CAD kasta. Qaababka faylasha si faahfaahsan waxa ay si sax ah u liistaa waxa qaab kasta hayo iyo waxa ka tago. Faylka ModelCraft Fayl .modelcraft wuxuu hayaa moodelka oo dhan: joomatriga, kooxaha, komponentiyada, hagayaasha, mashaadyada, cabbirrada, iyo kaamarada iyo qaabka aad isticmaalayay markaad kaydisay. Ma hayo taariikhda ka noqoshada. Fur moodel Guji Fur kooxda Fayl, ama riix Ctrl+O. Haddii moodelka shaashadda ku jira uu leeyahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, ModelCraft wuxuu weydiiyaa: \"Moodelkan wuxuu leeyahay isbeddello aan la kaydin. Marka hore nuqul kaydi?\" Dooro Kaydi nuqul, Tirtir isbeddellada ama Jooji. Dooro faylka .modelcraft. Moodelka wuxuu ku furmaa cabbirrada uu lagu kaydiyay, kaamarada uu lagu kaydiyay. Waxaad sidoo kale ku rididi kartaa fayl .modelcraft muuqaalka 3D, ama guji mid ka mid ah liiska faylasha dhowaan ee kaarta bilowga (browserrada ku furi kara fayl, iyo app-ka desktopka). App-ka desktopka, laba jeer ku dhufo fayl .modelcraft wuxuu ku furaa ModelCraft, sidaas oo kalena wuxuu sameeyaa Fur ku fayl Collada, OBJ, glTF, DWG ama DXF (waxaa loo soo dhoofiyaa moodel cusub). Kaydi moodel Guji Kaydi ama riix Ctrl+S. Browserku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.modelcraft, halkaas oo magaca yahay faylka aad furtay, ama \"Untitled\" moodel cusub. App-ka desktopka, Kaydi wuxuu qoraa faylka aad furtay isla meeshiisii. Moodel cusub wuxuu weydiiyaa meesha loo kaydinayo. U kaydi sida (Ctrl+Shift+S) wuxuu kaydiyaa nuqul ahaan fayl .modelcraft ama USD; meel ay browserku ku kari karto, wuxuu weydiiyaa magaca iyo meesha. Haddii kale, magacii soo dejisay beddel: kaydinta xigta ee ka dib markaad furto faylka magaca cusub leh waxay isticmaalaysaa magaca cusub. Kaydin kasta waa soo dejin cusub. Iyadoo la eegayo dejinta browserka, waxay toos ugu aadaa folder-ka soo dejinta ama way weydiisaa meesha ay kaydinta ku tahay. Haddii fayl magacaas leh horay u jiro, browserka intiisa badan wuxuu ku daraa tiro, sida Untitled (1).modelcraft. Si aad folder kasta u doorato, fur dejinta browserka, ka raadi \"downloads\" oo shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\". Si aad folder kasta u doorato, fur Settings, kadibna General, oo hoosta \"Downloads\" dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\". Si aad u beddesho meesha soo dejintu tagto, fur Safari, kadibna Settings, kadibna General, oo deji \"File download location\". Bilow moodel cusub Guji Cusub. Haddii ay jiraan isbeddello aan la kaydin, ModelCraft marka hore wuu weydiiyaa. Moodel cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa madhan, cabbirka dalkaaga (feet iyo inches Maraykanka, millimitir meelo kale), mana leh mashaadyo. Haddii browserku xirmo ka hor intaadan kaydin ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul shaqada aan la kaydin browserkaaga, laba ilbiriqsi kadib isbeddel kasta. Nuqulka waxa lagu qoraa asal ahaan, sidaas darteed moodel weyn ma sugo adiga markii la hayo. Haddii tab-ka ama browserku xirmo ka hor intaadan kaydin, markii xigta ee aad furto ModelCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \"Soo celi shaqadaada?\". Soo celinta waxa ay furaa moodelka sidii uu ahaa, oo aan wali fayl loo kaydin: kaydi si aad u hayso. Eeg Soo celi shaqadaada. Laga bilaabo CadCraft: Fur gudaha ModelCraft Barnaamijka naqshadaynta CadCraft, Muuqaal, kadibna Dheeraad, kadibna Fur gudaha ModelCraft wuxuu naqshadda furan u gudbiyaa ModelCraft tab cusub, sida DWG. Waxa ay yimaadaa sida DWG la soo dhoofiyay oo kale: khadad dhulka saaran, kooxda ku jira, diyaar u ah in lagu moodelo. Waxba lama soo rarin; faylku wuxuu maraa kaydinta browserkaaga gudihiisa. Soo dhoofi Soo dhoofintu waxa ay ku darta fayl moodelka aad furan tahay; ma beddesho. Guji Soo dhoofi kooxda Fayl, ama dhig faylka muuqaalka 3D. Dooro fayl SketchUp, Collada, OBJ, glTF, FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic, STEP, .3dm, USD, DWG ama DXF. Faylku wuxuu yimaadaa hal kooxood, la doortay, muuqaalkuna wuu soo fogaadaa si uu u muujiyo. Xaaladda (status bar) waxa ay sheegaysaa waxa soo galay, waxana ay liistaa waxa aan la soo dhoofin karin, sida \"Lama soo dhoofin: 2 texture\". Si aad joomatriga si toos ah u shaqeyso, guji laba jeer kooxda si aad uga tafatirto gudaheeda, ama guji Kala bax. Waxyaabo aad ogaato: Cabbirka iyo dhinaca sare: Faylasha Collada waxay sheegaan cabbirkooda iyo dhinaca sare, ModelCraft-na way beddelaa. glTF had iyo jeer mitir buu yahay. Faylasha OBJ ma lahaan cabbir: ModelCraft wuxuu u akhriyaa mitir, Y oo sare. Haddii OBJ uu yimaado 1000 jeer oo weyn ama yar, isticmaal Miisaan iyo qaybiye sida 0.001 ama 1000. DWG iyo DXF waxay yimaadaan khadad (geesaha) dhulka saaran, ma aha wejiyo. Haddii naqshaddu aysan sheegin cabbirkeeda, daaqad magaceedu yahay \"Cabbirka naqshadda\" ayaa weydiinaysa inta ay tahay hal unug naqshadeed. Eeg Moodel khariidada goobta. Xaddidaadyada: faylasha ka weyn 300 MB looma soo dhoofin, iyo kuwa ka weyn 200 MB looma furo. Faylasha leh in ka badan 2 milyan oo vertex ama wejiyo waa la diidaa inay weyn yihiin. OBJ ka weyn 64 MB waa la diidaa ka hor inta aan la akhrin. Faylasha qoraalka (Collada, OBJ, ASCII STL, USD text) waxa lagu akhriyaa qayb mar, qiyaastii 4 MB, sidaas darteed ma jiro block qoraal oo keliya oo hayo fayl oo dhan; OBJ 16 MB ah wuxuu isticmaalay qiyaastii 0.5 GB xusuus markii uu furmay tijaabadeenna. Soo saar Guji Soo saar kooxda Fayl. Dooro qaab: glTF binary (.glb), Collada (.dae), OBJ (.obj), STL oo loo daabacayo (.stl, millimitir), PLY oo midab leh (.ply), USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…, IFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc), DWG oo loogu talagalay CAD (.dwg, 2004) ama DXF oo loogu talagalay CAD (.dxf, R12). Browserku wuxuu soo dejiyaa faylka, magaciisu wuxuu sida moodelka oo kale yahay. Moodelka oo dhan ayaa la soo saaraa, ma aha xulashada keliya. Faylasha glTF, Collada iyo OBJ waxa lagu qoraa asalka (background), sidaas darteed ModelCraft wuu sii shaqeeyaa intii moodel weyn la soo saarayo; soo dejintu waxay bilaabataa markii faylku diyaar yahay. Moodel madhan lama soo saaro: \"Moodelku waa madhan yahay: marka hore wax sawir.\" Eeg Soo saar moodel barnaamijyo kale. Khadka ku jira iyo khadka ka baxsan Wax walba oo ModelCraft ah waxa uu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga, sidaas darteed moodelinta, furista, kaydinta, soo dhoofinta iyo soo saarista oo dhan way shaqeeyaan xidhiidh la'aan markii app-ka la soo rido. Si aad ModelCraft u furto xidhiidh la'aan oo dhan, u kaydi isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan intaad khadka ku jirto: Guji Kaydi khadka ka baxsan bar-ka app-ka ee sare. Badanku wuxuu tirinayaa (\"Kaydinaya 40 ka 212\") intuu kaydinayo. ModelCraft wuxuu kaydiyaa faylashiisa (dhexdooda akhriyaha DWG), caawiskan, iyo maktabadda 3D, sidaas darteed waxay qaadan kartaa waqti. Markii badanku akhriyo Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, ModelCraft wuxuu ka furaa isla cinwaankii xidhiidh la'aan, soo dhoofinta DWG ayaa sidoo kale khadka ka baxsan shaqeysa. Mar dambe guji Khadka ka baxsan diyaar si aad u hesho Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) ama Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Haddii badanku akhriyo Lama kaydin karin, qaar ka mid ah faylasha lama soo dejin: hubi xidhiidhka oo guji mar kale si aad isku daydo. Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo waxa ay macnaheedu tahay daaqaddan browserka ma hayn karto nuqul (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarada la maamulo qaarkood). Eeg Shaqaynta khadka ka baxsan. Kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar. Moodel kasta wuxuu ku nool yahay meesha aad ku kaydiso. Khadka ka baxsan baad tahay. Waad sii moodeli kartaa oo kaydin kartaa. Haddii bar-ka app-ka uusan tusin Khadka ka baxsan diyaar, ha dib u soo rarin tab-kan ilaa aad mar kale khadka ku jirto. App-ka desktopka ModelCraft waxaad ku isticmaalaysaa CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktopka oo leh siddeedda app oo dhan. Faylasha way furmaan oo way kaydsamaan meesha aad doorato. ModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browserka Mac, Windows iyo Linux, iyo CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktopka oo leh siddeedda app hal rakib ah, oo laga soo dejiyo getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"orbit-pan-zoom","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Wareeg, muuqaalka guuri iyo weynee","summary":"Ku dhaqaaq moodeelka adigoo isticmaalaya mouse, trackpad, shaashad taabasho ama furayaasha, oo u tag muuqaalada caadiga ah.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["wareeg","muuqaalka guuri","weynee","riix dheer","saddex farood","laba farood","taabasho","socod","kamarad","muuqaal","wareeji muuqaalka","trackpad","taabasho","pinch","badhanka dhexe","weynee oo dhan","perspective","parallel","muuqaal sare","iso"],"headings":[{"id":"mouse-saddex-badhan","text":"Mouse saddex-badhan","level":2},{"id":"badhan-dhexe-la-aan","text":"Badhan dhexe la'aan","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-taabasho","text":"Shaashad taabasho","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalada-caadiga-ah","text":"Muuqaalada caadiga ah","level":2},{"id":"qoto-dheer-iyo-muuqaal-toosan","text":"Qoto-dheer iyo muuqaal toosan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKamaradda waad dhaqaajin kartaa mar kasta, xitaa dhexda khadka sawirka ama markaad riixayso wejiga: qalabku wuxuu sugayaa meesha uu joogay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-saddex-badhan\"\u003EMouse saddex-badhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka dhexe (riix dhinaca dhexe ee wheel-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig, ama hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid badhanka dhexe. Riixitaanka ama sii-deynta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jiidista dhexdeeda ayaa u beddela wareeg iyo guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji wheel-ka. Wuxuu weynaadaa dhinaca wejiga ka hooseeya calaamadda, ama barta ka hooseysa ee qoto-dheeridda dhexe ee muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArag moodeelka oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareegidda wuxuu muuqaalka ku wareegaa qaybta moodeelka ee ka hooseysa calaamadda, sidaas darteed bartaasi waa sidii ay ahayd, intii kale oo dhan ayaa ku wareegsan. Meel bannaan ka hooseysa wuxuu ku wareegaa bartanka dhexe ee muuqaalka. Guuritaanku wuxuu ilaaliyaa barta aad qabatay ee calaamadda hoostiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad had iyo jeer ugu wareegto bartanka dhexe ee muuqaalka, ama si aad wareegidda iyo guuritaanka u dhaqsiso ama u gaabiso, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg iyo guuri\u003C/strong\u003E. Xawaaraha wuxuu khuseeyaa mouse-ka, trackpad-ka, taabashada iyo furayaasha falka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji midig adigoo aan jiidin ma sameyso wax; ModelCraft ma leh menu midig-guji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhan-dhexe-la-aan\"\u003EBadhan dhexe la&#039;aan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal qalabka kamaradda ee bar-ka qalabka, ama kiiboodhka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E) oo jiid badhanka bidix si aad u wareegto. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jiidista intaas si aad u guurto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/span\u003E) oo jiid si aad u guurto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee\u003C/span\u003E) oo jiid kor si aad u weyneyso, hoos si aad u yareyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix furaha qalabka aad rabto marka xigta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka kamaradda wuxuu beddelaa qalabka aad isticmaalaysay. Si aad u eegto dhex-dhexaadka hawl adigoo aan lumin, isticmaal kiiboodhka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha falka waxay wareegaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh furayaasha falka wuxuu guuraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka sawirka markii uu ku jiro hawl dhexdeeda (kadib riixitaanka koowaad), furayaasha falka waxay qufulaan jihooyinka halkii ay wareegi lahaayeen. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference#lock-a-direction\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\" data-hash=\"lock-a-direction\"\u003EJihada iyo ku qabsashada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka ugu fudud: fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, oo deji Scrolling \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E (ama ka tag &quot;Hawshu waa sidee&quot; ah). Kadibna laba farood ku siib si aad u wareegto, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo siib si aad u guurto, oo pinch si aad u weyneyso — ma jiro badhamada kamaradda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\"\u003Edejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka Scrolling la dejiyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynee:\u003C/strong\u003E ku siib laba farood, ama pinch. Labaduba waxay weynaadaan dhinaca calaamadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri:\u003C/strong\u003E riix laba farood (secondary click) oo ka dhig farihii hoose intaad jiidayso. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii laba-farood-guji aanu waxba samayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid hal farood, ama isticmaal furayaasha falka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad gujinayso ma tirin karto midig-guji ModelCraft-ka, iyadoo ku xidhan browser-ka: waxay u shaqayn kartaa guji leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo. Isticmaal riixitaanka laba farood si aad u guurto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynee:\u003C/strong\u003E ku siib laba farood. Pinch-ka sidoo kale wuu weynaadaa meelaha driver-ka touchpad-ka u diro sida scroll oo leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri:\u003C/strong\u003E jiid badhanka midig (touchpad badan waxay leeyihiin, riix geeska hoose ee midig oo jiid), ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid, ama isticmaal furayaasha falka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka Mouse wheel la isticmaalo, siibidda laba farood waxay weynaysaa; ma guurto. Taasi waa ka soo horjeedda bogagga websaydhka badan, waana sida mouse wheel-ku u shaqeeyo modelers-ka 3D ee badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu doortaa qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E ModelCraft-ka. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiidista ma guurto, sida ay ku samayso app-yada kale qaarkood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-taabasho\"\u003EShaashad taabasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal farood\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira: \u003Cstrong\u003Etaabo\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u guji, \u003Cstrong\u003Eriix oo jiid\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u sawirto ama u jiidto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntii farta qalabka sawirka hoos ku jirto, \u003Cstrong\u003Emuraayad yar\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka sarreysa ayaa muujinaysa waxa hoostiisa ku jira, si aad u aragto barta dhammaadka, dhexdhexaadka ama geesta uu ku qabsanayo ka hor intaadan sii dayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHay meel\u003C/strong\u003E nus ilbiriqsi si aad u dhammaysid waxa qalabku sameynayo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo kale: khad qaroo, silsilad khadad. Haddii waxba socon, hayso meel oo jiid farta isku mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareegaysa\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa aad sii dayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba farood\u003C/strong\u003E oo isku jiid \u003Cstrong\u003Eguuri\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cstrong\u003Epinch\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u weyneyso. Labadaba waxay shaqeeyaan hal dhaqdhaqaaq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaddex farood\u003C/strong\u003E oo isku jiid \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareeg\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u beddesho (laba farood wareeg, saddex guuri), fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, Shaashad taabasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFarta labaad oo hoos loo dhigo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejoojinaysa\u003C/strong\u003E wixii farta koowaad bilowday (laydh aan dhammaystirnayn, riix oo jiid oo socda). Ka qaad faraha kadibna dib u bilow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBar yar oo hoose muuqaalka waxay leedahay \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaad\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cstrong\u003EJooji\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E, marka kiiboodh aan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQabashada iyo doorashadu way ka fogaadaan mouse-ka intaa, badhamadana way weyn yihiin, sidaas darteed farta ayaa gaari karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:mouse\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMouse\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashad taabasho, farta mid wuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira (taabo si aad u guji, hay meel si aad u dhammaysid, ama hay meel oo jiid si aad u wareegto), laba farood way guurtaan oo way weynaystaan, saddex farood way wareegaan, bar yar oo ka muuqda wuxuu bixiyaa Dhammaad, Jooji iyo Ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalada-caadiga-ah\"\u003EMuuqaalada caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E xagga midig ee bar-ka qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhabar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBidix\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa jihadaas oo wuxuu ku habeeyaa moodeelka oo dhan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu eegaa waqooyiga, dhidibka cagaarka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu si toos ah u eegaa hoos, waqooyigu kor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka muuqaalka ee midig sare ee muuqaalka wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada hal guji, iyo sidoo kale geeska iyo barta, iyo nidaam wareegaya oo lagu wareejiyo moodeelka, iyo badhanka guriga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/view-cube\"\u003EKiiboodhka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoto-dheer-iyo-muuqaal-toosan\"\u003EQoto-dheer iyo muuqaal toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiif\u003C/span\u003E. Calaamad jeex waxay muujinaysaa in perspektifku shaqeeyo. Marka uu damaan yahay, muuqaalku waa isbeddel toosan (orthographic): khadadka isu-dhigga ah ee moodeelka ayay isu-dhigga ka ahaadaan shaashadda, taas oo aad rabto qaabka sare ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Perspektiif.&quot; ama &quot;Muuqaal toosan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaal kasta wuxuu xusuustaa in uu ku jiray perspektif. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EKeydi muuqaalada sida muuqaal\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kamaradda waad dhaqaajin kartaa mar kasta, xitaa dhexda khadka sawirka ama markaad riixayso wejiga: qalabku wuxuu sugayaa meesha uu joogay. Mouse saddex-badhan Si aad Samee tan Wareegto Jiid badhanka dhexe (riix dhinaca dhexe ee wheel-ka) Guuri muuqaalka Jiid badhanka midig, ama hay Shift oo jiid badhanka dhexe. Riixitaanka ama sii-deynta Shift jiidista dhexdeeda ayaa u beddela wareeg iyo guuri Weynee Wareeji wheel-ka. Wuxuu weynaadaa dhinaca wejiga ka hooseeya calaamadda, ama barta ka hooseysa ee qoto-dheeridda dhexe ee muuqaalka Arag moodeelka oo dhan Shift+Z ama Xuduudaha Wareegidda wuxuu muuqaalka ku wareegaa qaybta moodeelka ee ka hooseysa calaamadda, sidaas darteed bartaasi waa sidii ay ahayd, intii kale oo dhan ayaa ku wareegsan. Meel bannaan ka hooseysa wuxuu ku wareegaa bartanka dhexe ee muuqaalka. Guuritaanku wuxuu ilaaliyaa barta aad qabatay ee calaamadda hoostiisa. Si aad had iyo jeer ugu wareegto bartanka dhexe ee muuqaalka, ama si aad wareegidda iyo guuritaanka u dhaqsiso ama u gaabiso, fur Dejinta (Ctrl+,), tab-ka ModelCraft, Wareeg iyo guuri. Xawaaraha wuxuu khuseeyaa mouse-ka, trackpad-ka, taabashada iyo furayaasha falka. Guji midig adigoo aan jiidin ma sameyso wax; ModelCraft ma leh menu midig-guji. Badhan dhexe la'aan Isticmaal qalabka kamaradda ee bar-ka qalabka, ama kiiboodhka: Riix O (ama guji Wareeg) oo jiid badhanka bidix si aad u wareegto. Hay Shift jiidista intaas si aad u guurto. Riix H (ama guji Muuqaalka guuri) oo jiid si aad u guurto. Riix Z (ama guji Weynee) oo jiid kor si aad u weyneyso, hoos si aad u yareyso. Riix Space si aad ugu noqoto Dooro, ama riix furaha qalabka aad rabto marka xigta. Qalabka kamaradda wuxuu beddelaa qalabka aad isticmaalaysay. Si aad u eegto dhex-dhexaadka hawl adigoo aan lumin, isticmaal kiiboodhka: Furayaasha falka waxay wareegaan. Shift oo leh furayaasha falka wuxuu guuraa. Qalabka sawirka markii uu ku jiro hawl dhexdeeda (kadib riixitaanka koowaad), furayaasha falka waxay qufulaan jihooyinka halkii ay wareegi lahaayeen. Eeg Jihada iyo ku qabsashada. Trackpad Habka ugu fudud: fur Dejinta (Ctrl+,), tab-ka ModelCraft, oo deji Scrolling Trackpad (ama ka tag \"Hawshu waa sidee\" ah). Kadibna laba farood ku siib si aad u wareegto, hay Shift oo siib si aad u guurto, oo pinch si aad u weyneyso — ma jiro badhamada kamaradda. Eeg dejinta ModelCraft. Marka Scrolling la dejiyo Mouse wheel: Weynee: ku siib laba farood, ama pinch. Labaduba waxay weynaadaan dhinaca calaamadda. Guuri: riix laba farood (secondary click) oo ka dhig farihii hoose intaad jiidayso. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings, kadibna Trackpad, haddii laba-farood-guji aanu waxba samayn. Wareeg: riix O oo jiid hal farood, ama isticmaal furayaasha falka. Hay Ctrl markaad gujinayso ma tirin karto midig-guji ModelCraft-ka, iyadoo ku xidhan browser-ka: waxay u shaqayn kartaa guji leh Ctrl la hayo. Isticmaal riixitaanka laba farood si aad u guurto. Weynee: ku siib laba farood. Pinch-ka sidoo kale wuu weynaadaa meelaha driver-ka touchpad-ka u diro sida scroll oo leh Ctrl. Guuri: jiid badhanka midig (touchpad badan waxay leeyihiin, riix geeska hoose ee midig oo jiid), ama riix H oo jiid. Wareeg: riix O oo jiid, ama isticmaal furayaasha falka. Marka Mouse wheel la isticmaalo, siibidda laba farood waxay weynaysaa; ma guurto. Taasi waa ka soo horjeedda bogagga websaydhka badan, waana sida mouse wheel-ku u shaqeeyo modelers-ka 3D ee badan. Space wuxuu doortaa qalabka Dooro ModelCraft-ka. Hay Space oo jiidista ma guurto, sida ay ku samayso app-yada kale qaarkood. Shaashad taabasho Hal farood wuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira: taabo si aad u guji, riix oo jiid si aad u sawirto ama u jiidto. Intii farta qalabka sawirka hoos ku jirto, muraayad yar oo ka sarreysa ayaa muujinaysa waxa hoostiisa ku jira, si aad u aragto barta dhammaadka, dhexdhexaadka ama geesta uu ku qabsanayo ka hor intaadan sii dayn. Hay meel nus ilbiriqsi si aad u dhammaysid waxa qalabku sameynayo, sida Enter oo kale: khad qaroo, silsilad khadad. Haddii waxba socon, hayso meel oo jiid farta isku mid ah wareegaysa ilaa aad sii dayso. Laba farood oo isku jiid guuri; pinch si aad u weyneyso. Labadaba waxay shaqeeyaan hal dhaqdhaqaaq. Saddex farood oo isku jiid wareeg. Si aad u beddesho (laba farood wareeg, saddex guuri), fur Dejinta, tab-ka ModelCraft, Shaashad taabasho. Farta labaad oo hoos loo dhigo joojinaysa wixii farta koowaad bilowday (laydh aan dhammaystirnayn, riix oo jiid oo socda). Ka qaad faraha kadibna dib u bilow. Bar yar oo hoose muuqaalka waxay leedahay Dhammaad (Enter), Jooji (Esc) iyo Ka noqo, marka kiiboodh aan jirin. Qabashada iyo doorashadu way ka fogaadaan mouse-ka intaa, badhamadana way weyn yihiin, sidaas darteed farta ayaa gaari karta. Shaashad taabasho, farta mid wuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira (taabo si aad u guji, hay meel si aad u dhammaysid, ama hay meel oo jiid si aad u wareegto), laba farood way guurtaan oo way weynaystaan, saddex farood way wareegaan, bar yar oo ka muuqda wuxuu bixiyaa Dhammaad, Jooji iyo Ka noqo. Muuqaalada caadiga ah Guji Muuqaalo xagga midig ee bar-ka qalabka. Dooro Iso, Sare, Hore, Midig, Dhabar, Bidix ama Hoose. Muuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa jihadaas oo wuxuu ku habeeyaa moodeelka oo dhan. Hore wuxuu eegaa waqooyiga, dhidibka cagaarka; Sare wuxuu si toos ah u eegaa hoos, waqooyigu kor. Kiiboodhka muuqaalka ee midig sare ee muuqaalka wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada hal guji, iyo sidoo kale geeska iyo barta, iyo nidaam wareegaya oo lagu wareejiyo moodeelka, iyo badhanka guriga. Eeg Kiiboodhka muuqaalka. Qoto-dheer iyo muuqaal toosan Dooro Muuqaalo, kadibna Perspektiif. Calaamad jeex waxay muujinaysaa in perspektifku shaqeeyo. Marka uu damaan yahay, muuqaalku waa isbeddel toosan (orthographic): khadadka isu-dhigga ah ee moodeelka ayay isu-dhigga ka ahaadaan shaashadda, taas oo aad rabto qaabka sare ee Hore ama Midig. Bar-ka xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Perspektiif.\" ama \"Muuqaal toosan.\" Muuqaal kasta wuxuu xusuustaa in uu ku jiray perspektif. Eeg Keydi muuqaalada sida muuqaal.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"view-cube","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kaabka aragtida","summary":"Riix dhinac, gees ama geeska kaabka ku yaal geeska aragta si aad uga aragto meeshaas, jiid si aad u wareegto, leexi giraanta jihada, u soo dhowow aragta toosan dhinac, oo ku noqo guriga.","section":"tasks","order":11,"keywords":["kaabka aragtida","viewcube","kaab","jihada","waqooyi","aragta guriga","aragtooyinka caadiga ah","sare","hore","midig","iso","geesood","geeska","giraan","wareeji aragta","calaamadda tooska","calaamadda geeska","jihayn"],"headings":[{"id":"eeg-dhinac-gees-ama-geeska","text":"Eeg dhinac, gees ama geeska","level":2},{"id":"wareeg-kaabka-adoo-jiidaya","text":"Wareeg kaabka adoo jiidaya","level":2},{"id":"giraanta-jihada","text":"Giraanta jihada","level":2},{"id":"aragtooyinka-dhinac-toos-ah-fallaarrooyin","text":"Aragtooyinka dhinac toos ah: fallaarrooyin","level":2},{"id":"guriga","text":"Guriga","level":2},{"id":"kiiboodhka","text":"Kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-tooska-ama-waxba","text":"Calaamadda tooska ama waxba","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKaabka aragtida wuxuu ku yaal geeska midig ee sare ee aragta 3D. Wuu wareegaa aragta, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa halka aad eegayso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E waa sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u jeedaa koonfur (waxaad eegtaa waqooyi, oo tooska cagaarka ah marka aad eegto), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u jeedaa bari (dhinaca casaanka). Wuu ka muuqdaa xoogaa ilaa aad isaga taabato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-dhinac-gees-ama-geeska\"\u003EEeg dhinac, gees ama geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo kaabka. Qaybta hoostiisa jirta ayaa iftiimta: dhexda dhinac, geesta (wuxuu iftiimaa labada dhinac ee wadaaga) ama geeska (saddexda dhinac).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix. Aragtu wuu wareegaa si uu meeshaas uga eego, isagoo ilaalinaya isla dhexda iyo zoom-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa jira 26 meel oo lagu riixi karo: 6 dhinac (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhabar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBidix\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E), 12 geesood, iyo 8 geeska. Geeska waxay siisaa aragta saddex meelood meel ee caadiga ah; geesta waxay u muuqataa meel u dhexeysa labada dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E waa la mid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka, laakiin aan u weynayn si ku habboon. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E weli wuxuu u weynaysiiyaa moodeelka oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareeg-kaabka-adoo-jiidaya\"\u003EWareeg kaabka adoo jiidaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid kaabka si aad u leexiso aragta, sida aragta laftiisa loo wareejiyo. Jiidista looma tixgaliyo riix, sidaas darteed kaabka meel kasta ayaad ka qabsan kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"giraanta-jihada\"\u003EGiraanta jihada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGiraanta hoosta kaabka waxay leedahay N, E, S iyo W.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid giraanta\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u wareejiso moodeelka xarriiqda dhexe, sida haddii uu ku taagan yahay miis wareeg. Giraanta waxay raacdaa taabashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix xaraf\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga eegto dhinacaas, iyadoo la ilaalinayo sida aad u hoos ugu eegayso. Aragta ka sare oo toos ah, xarafka aad riixdo wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aragtooyinka-dhinac-toos-ah-fallaarrooyin\"\u003EAragtooyinka dhinac toos ah: fallaarrooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad si toos ah u eegto dhinac, fallaarro yar ayaa u soo baxa kaabka agtiisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfar \u003Cstrong\u003Esaddexgeesood\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa keena dhinaca dhinaca ee hore: saddexgeesoodka kor ku yaal kaabka wuxuu muujinayaa dhinaca ka sarreeyay, iwm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabo \u003Cstrong\u003Efallaarro goobaaban\u003C/strong\u003E oo geeska midig ee sare ayaa leexiya sawirka rubuc wareeg saacadda u dhiganta ama ka soo horjeedda, iyadoo aan la beddelin dhinaca aad eegayso. Isticmaal si aad u leexiso qorshe ka dib marka derbi dheer uu u dhex maro shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guriga\"\u003EGuriga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka guriga ee geeska sare ee bidix ee kaabka wuxuu ku celinayaa aragta saddex meelood meel \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, oo moodeelka oo dhan ku habeeya. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isla markaa intii kaabku haysto xulashada kiiboodhka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kiiboodhka\"\u003EKiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u gudubto kaabka, ka dibna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edooro dhinac, gees ama geeska kaabka ku wareegsan, tallaabooyin ah siddeed-leexasho (akhristayaasha shaashadda ayaa sheegaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edooro mid sare ama hoose, ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E ama ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eeeg meesha la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift →\"\u003E⇧→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eleexi aragta rubuc leexasho oo ku wareegsan tiirka toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Earagta guriga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eka bax kaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha lagu riixo kaabka waxay ku sii jiraan kaabka: ma bilaabaan qalabka ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-tooska-ama-waxba\"\u003ECalaamadda tooska ama waxba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, oo dejiso \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaabka aragtida\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadda tooska\u003C/span\u003E (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah oo ku taal geeska hoose ee bidix: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidna\u003C/span\u003E. Browser-kan wuxuu xusaa doorashada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#corner-indicator\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"corner-indicator\"\u003EDejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ma leh roll (leexasho): marka aan ka fogaano aragaha toosan ee hoose iyo sare, sare shaashadda had iyo jeer waa sare moodeelka. Kaabka iyo fallaarrooyinka goobaaban waxay leexin karaan aragta qorshe; ma leexin karaan aragta dhinac si uu u dhaco geeskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kaabka aragtida wuxuu ku yaal geeska midig ee sare ee aragta 3D. Wuu wareegaa aragta, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa halka aad eegayso: Sare waa sare, Hore wuxuu u jeedaa koonfur (waxaad eegtaa waqooyi, oo tooska cagaarka ah marka aad eegto), Midig wuxuu u jeedaa bari (dhinaca casaanka). Wuu ka muuqdaa xoogaa ilaa aad isaga taabato. Eeg dhinac, gees ama geeska Taabo kaabka. Qaybta hoostiisa jirta ayaa iftiimta: dhexda dhinac, geesta (wuxuu iftiimaa labada dhinac ee wadaaga) ama geeska (saddexda dhinac). Riix. Aragtu wuu wareegaa si uu meeshaas uga eego, isagoo ilaalinaya isla dhexda iyo zoom-ka. Waxaa jira 26 meel oo lagu riixi karo: 6 dhinac (Sare, Hoose, Hore, Dhabar, Bidix, Midig), 12 geesood, iyo 8 geeska. Geeska waxay siisaa aragta saddex meelood meel ee caadiga ah; geesta waxay u muuqataa meel u dhexeysa labada dhinac. Riix Hore waa la mid Muuqaalo, Hore ee qalabka, laakiin aan u weynayn si ku habboon. Muuqaalo weli wuxuu u weynaysiiyaa moodeelka oo dhan. Wareeg kaabka adoo jiidaya Jiid kaabka si aad u leexiso aragta, sida aragta laftiisa loo wareejiyo. Jiidista looma tixgaliyo riix, sidaas darteed kaabka meel kasta ayaad ka qabsan kartaa. Giraanta jihada Giraanta hoosta kaabka waxay leedahay N, E, S iyo W. Jiid giraanta si aad u wareejiso moodeelka xarriiqda dhexe, sida haddii uu ku taagan yahay miis wareeg. Giraanta waxay raacdaa taabashada. Riix xaraf si aad uga eegto dhinacaas, iyadoo la ilaalinayo sida aad u hoos ugu eegayso. Aragta ka sare oo toos ah, xarafka aad riixdo wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta shaashadda. Aragtooyinka dhinac toos ah: fallaarrooyin Marka aad si toos ah u eegto dhinac, fallaarro yar ayaa u soo baxa kaabka agtiisa: Afar saddexgeesood ayaa keena dhinaca dhinaca ee hore: saddexgeesoodka kor ku yaal kaabka wuxuu muujinayaa dhinaca ka sarreeyay, iwm. Labo fallaarro goobaaban oo geeska midig ee sare ayaa leexiya sawirka rubuc wareeg saacadda u dhiganta ama ka soo horjeedda, iyadoo aan la beddelin dhinaca aad eegayso. Isticmaal si aad u leexiso qorshe ka dib marka derbi dheer uu u dhex maro shaashadda. Guriga Badhanka guriga ee geeska sare ee bidix ee kaabka wuxuu ku celinayaa aragta saddex meelood meel Iso, oo moodeelka oo dhan ku habeeya. Home wuxuu sameeyaa isla markaa intii kaabku haysto xulashada kiiboodhka. Kiiboodhka Tab si aad u gudubto kaabka, ka dibna: Furaha Waxa uu sameeyaa ← / → dooro dhinac, gees ama geeska kaabka ku wareegsan, tallaabooyin ah siddeed-leexasho (akhristayaasha shaashadda ayaa sheegaa) ↑ / ↓ dooro mid sare ama hoose, ilaa Sare ama ilaa Hoose Enter ama Space eeg meesha la doortay Shift+← / Shift+→ leexi aragta rubuc leexasho oo ku wareegsan tiirka toosan Home aragta guriga Esc ka bax kaabka Furayaasha lagu riixo kaabka waxay ku sii jiraan kaabka: ma bilaabaan qalabka ModelCraft. Calaamadda tooska ama waxba Fur Dejinta (Ctrl+,), tab-ka ModelCraft, oo dejiso Calaamadda geeska Kaabka aragtida (bilowga), Calaamadda tooska (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah oo ku taal geeska hoose ee bidix: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama Midna. Browser-kan wuxuu xusaa doorashada. Eeg Dejinta ModelCraft. ModelCraft ma leh roll (leexasho): marka aan ka fogaano aragaha toosan ee hoose iyo sare, sare shaashadda had iyo jeer waa sare moodeelka. Kaabka iyo fallaarrooyinka goobaaban waxay leexin karaan aragta qorshe; ma leexin karaan aragta dhinac si uu u dhaco geeskiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"draw-faces","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sawir wajiyo xariiqyo, afar-geesle, goobo iyo qaanso","summary":"Samee wajiyo sinaan ah dhulka ama wajiyo kale, kala jarr xariiqyo, oo sawir goobo iyo poligon oo leh tirada dhinacyada aad rabto.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["sawir","xariiq","afar-geesle","goobo","poligon","ka fogaan","fareem","xuduud","qaanso","qalin","qalin siman","kable","jid","dhicin","radius","wajiga","qorshe dabaq","aasaaska","kala jarr","dhinacyo","qaybo","muuqaal","qalin-qoraal"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-afar-geesle","text":"Sawir afar-geesle","level":2},{"id":"sawir-goobo-ama-poligon","text":"Sawir goobo ama poligon","level":2},{"id":"sawir-qaanso","text":"Sawir qaanso","level":2},{"id":"sawir-qalin-siman","text":"Sawir qalin siman","level":2},{"id":"ka-fogaan-xuduud-gudaha-ama-dibadda-wajiga","text":"Ka fogaan: xuduud gudaha ama dibadda wajiga","level":2},{"id":"qaansooyinka-goobada-iyo-poligonada-waa-qalino","text":"Qaansooyinka, goobada iyo poligonada waa qalino","level":2},{"id":"sawir-xariiqyo","text":"Sawir xariiqyo","level":2},{"id":"xariiqu-meesha-uu-u-tagayo-marka-aanu-waxba-taabanin","text":"Xariiqu meesha uu u tagayo marka aanu waxba taabanin","level":3},{"id":"kala-jar-wajiga","text":"Kala jar wajiga","level":2},{"id":"wajiyo-u-jeeda-jihada-qaldan","text":"Wajiyo u jeeda jihada qaldan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-aragto-intaad-sawirayso","text":"Waxa aad aragto intaad sawirayso","level":2},{"id":"haddii-qaabku-aanu-jirin-meeshii-aad-filaysay","text":"Haddii qaabku aanu jirin meeshii aad filaysay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku jira ModelCraft oo dhan wuxuu bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ewajig\u003C/strong\u003E siman: dusha ay geesuhu xidhayaan. Wajiga waxaad si toos ah ugu sawiri kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E, ama mid mid geesaha waxaad ku hagi kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E. Wajiyadu waa waxa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/a\u003E u beddelo jirjirro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-afar-geesle\"\u003ESawir afar-geesle\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geeska koowaad: dhulka, ama wajiga kasta ee moodelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusaha dhaqdhaqaaji. Afar-geeslaha wuxuu ku sii jiraa dhulka (ama wajiga aad ka bilowday), sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu muujinayaa ballacdiisa iyo qoto-dheerkiisa. Talada waxay leedahay &quot;Labajibbaaran&quot; marka dhinacyadu isku mid yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu sawirto diyaarad kale, tusaha u tuso: wajiga ku dhex marta geeska koowaad ayaa afar-geeslaha ku dhigaya wajigaas, iyo ku qabsashada barta ka baxsan diyaaradda (dhamaadka geesta, geesta, paxda buluuga ah) ayaa afar-geeslaha taagaya oo ku dhex marta labada geesood. Dib u qabso barta diyaaradda kowaad, wuuna dhici doonaa mar kale. Si aad diyaarad keliya u ilaaliso, riix furaha fallaadha: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu afar-geeslaha ka dhigaa sinaan (diyaaradda buluuga), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E diyaaradda casaanka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E diyaaradda cagaaraha. Ku celi isla furaha si aad u furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geeska ka soo horjeedda, ama qor labada cabbir oo kala saaran koma, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E4000,3000\u003C/code\u003E moodel millimitir ah, ama \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;,10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E fit iyo inji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWajig ayaa soo muuqda oo afar geesood ayaa ku wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirrada la qoray waxay u socdaan jihada aad tusaysay: haddii tusuhu geeska koowaad ka bidix yahay markaad qorayso, afar-geeslahu bidix ayuu u fidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoomadu wuxuu kala saaraa labada cabbir, sidaas darteed ma noqon karto calaamadda dhibcaha. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, weligaaba ha qorin \u003Ccode\u003E2,5m\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-goobo-ama-poligon\"\u003ESawir goobo ama poligon\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goobo ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E poligon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad tirada dhinacyada u beddesho, qor kahor intaadan riixin: \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E keliya) kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Goobo waxay ku bilaabataa 24 dhinac, poligonna 6. Talada ayaa muujinaysa tirada hadda, ModelCraft waa ilaalinayaa goobada xigta ilaa aad beddesho ama aad qalab beddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix dhexda, dhulka ama wajiga. Si aad dhexda wajiga ugu dhigto, tusaha dhexda wajiga (&quot;Dhexda wajiga&quot;) ama dhexda mid ka mid ah geesahiisa (&quot;Dhexda geesta&quot;) u tuso, tusahuna wajigaas gudihiisa ku jiraa: goobada ayaa wajigaas lagu sawiraa, xitaa dhamaadka cidhiidhiga ah ee sanduuq dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix si aad radiusa u dejiso, ama qor (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa qiimaha) kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobo waa poligon leh dhinacyo badan. Markaad goobo kor ugu jiidto Riix/jiid, dhinacyadeeda waa la nuugaa si silinda ay u noqoto hal wajig siman.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-qaanso\"\u003ESawir qaanso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha qaansadu ka bilaabanayso, kadibna meesha ay ku dhammaanayso (ama qor dhererka u dhexeeya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusaha u dhaqdhaqaaji si aad qaansada dibadda ugu dhicisid, kadibna riix. Talada waxay leedahay &quot;Half circle&quot; marka dhicintu tahay nus masaafada u dhexeysa dhamaadyada. Ama qor sida dhexda uga fog tahay: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaansada barta ku wareegsan u sawirto, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaansada dhexdeeda\u003C/span\u003E: riix dhexda, kadibna meesha qaansadu ka bilaabanayso (ama qor radiusa), kadibna meesha ay ku dhammaanayso (ama qor xagal digrii ah, sida \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E). Waxay ku qabsanaysaa tallaabo 15°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaanso laga bilaabo wajiga ayaa lagu sawiraa wajigaas; haddii kale waxay ku jirtaa dhulka, ama waxay istaagtaa toosh haddii labada dhamaadkeeda ay yihiin dhererro kala duwan. Qaanso waxay leedahay 12 qayb; qor \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E inta aad sawirayso si aad uga badato. Qaansooyinku wajiyada waxay xidhaan siday xariiqyadu sameeyaan: qaanso ku taal geeska afar-geeslaha ayaa kala jarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-qalin-siman\"\u003ESawir qalin siman\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa xariiq siman oo ka gudba barta kasta oo aad riixdo: kable, waddada gacan-ku-haynta, geesta beerta. Wuxuu ka bixi karaa dhulka: barraduhu waxay ku qabsadaan geeska, geesaha iyo wajiyada meel kasta, furayaasha fallaadhaana waxay xidhaan casaan, cagaar ama buluug sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barraha qalinku ka gudubto. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;0,0,1&gt;\u003C/code\u003E kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barta 1 kor ka ah midda ugu dambaysay, \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E meel sax ah, ama dherer barta masaafadaas tusaha dhinaceeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer riix si aad u dhammaysato. Mar kale riix barta koowaad si aad qalinka u xidho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa barta u dambaysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalinka mid ahaan ayaa la doortaa. Si aad u beddesho, dooro oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir barar\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E: barahiisu waxay u muuqdaan labajibbaaran. Riix mid, kadibna riix meesha uu u socdo (ama qor \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu barta dib ugu celinayaa, wuxuuna dhammeeyaa wax-beddelka. Qalin fidsan oo xidhan wajig ayuu sameeyaa; qalin wajiga geeskiisa sawiraya mar dambe ma beddeli karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-fogaan-xuduud-gudaha-ama-dibadda-wajiga\"\u003EKa fogaan: xuduud gudaha ama dibadda wajiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nuqul ka dhigaa geeskiisa wajiga masaafo la dejiyay gudihiisa (ama dibaddiisa), si loo sameeyo daaqad-jaad, xuduud, sillka ama muraayadda shaashad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadibna riix wajiga, ama dooro wajiga marka hore kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusaha wajiga gudihiisa u dhaqdhaqaaji haddii aad rabto geesaha gudaha, ama dibadda haddii aad rabto geesaha dibadda. Geesaha cusub ayaa raacaya, talada waxay sheegaysaa intee ka fog.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix, ama qor masaafada kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWajigu wuxuu u kala go&#039;aa laba: wajiga gudihiisa iyo daaqad (ama wareeg cusub dibadda). Riix/jiid mid kasta si toos ah: shaashad ahaan, sanduuq sawir, u riix dhumucdiisa, wajiga hore 30 mm gudaha ugu ka fogaan, kadibna wajiga gudihiisa yar riix muraayadda. Godadka wajiga ayaa sidoo kale la ka fogaadaa, qaansana ama goobo waxay ahaataa hal qalin (yar ama weyn).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba jeer riix\u003C/strong\u003E wajiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad mar kale ugu ka fogaato masaafadii ugu dambaysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro silsilad geesaha isku xidhan oo diyaarad keliya ah (tusaale, laba xariiq oo L ah), riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqdhaqaaji dhinaca aad rabto oo qor masaafada: nuqul isbarbar ah ayaa la sawiraa, geeskooduna waa geesaha xagal-xaga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka masaafadu ka badan tahay wajiga ogolaado, ModelCraft ayaa sheegaa oo waxba ma sawiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaansooyinka-goobada-iyo-poligonada-waa-qalino\"\u003EQaansooyinka, goobada iyo poligonada waa qalino\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix qayb kasta oo qaanso, goobo ama poligon ah, qalinka oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E ayaa markaas muujinaysa radiusiisa, qaybahiisa, xagalkiisa (qaansooyinka) iyo dherertiisa. Halkaas radius cusub qor si dhexdiisa looga beddelo cabbirka; wajiyada ku sawiran diyaaradeeda ayaa raacaya. Markii wajiga qalinka la riixo ama la jiido, radiusiisa waa sidiisa ku sii jiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-xariiqyo\"\u003ESawir xariiqyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha xariiqu ka bilaabanayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha ay ku dhammaanayso, ama qor dherer kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dhererka la qoray wuxuu u socdaa jihada tusuhu muujinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii riix. Riix kasta xariiq cusub ayuu ka bilaabaa dhamaadka xariiqii u dambeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha xidh mar kale barta koowaad riix. Marka xariiqyadu wareeg siman xidhaan, wajiga ayaa buuxsamaya qalabkuna wuu joojiyaa silsiladda. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wakhti kasta si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyadu waxay raacaan jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug marka aad u soo dhowaato; xariiqu midabkaas buu qaataa, talada waxay tidhaa &quot;On red axis&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003EMalaynta iyo ku qabsashada\u003C/a\u003E si aad jihada u xidho oo barahaas ugu qabsato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"xariiqu-meesha-uu-u-tagayo-marka-aanu-waxba-taabanin\"\u003EXariiqu meesha uu u tagayo marka aanu waxba taabanin\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiq ka bilaabanaya wajiga ayaa ku sii jirta diyaarada wajigaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiq ka bilaabanaya dhulka, ama meel banaan, wuxuu ku sii jiraa heer la mid ah barta bilowga. Haddii aad moodelka geeska ka eegto, wuxuu aadayaa diyaarada toosan ee kugu soo jeedda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad xariiq u sawirto meel sax ah, qor barta: \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E barta moodelka gudihiisa, ama \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ka fogaanshaha bilowga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EQor cabbirro sax ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-jar-wajiga\"\u003EKala jar wajiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiq sawir wajiga dhex mara, gees ilaa geesle kale (ama gees ilaa geesle xariiqyo kale dhex mara). Wajigu wuxuu u kala go&#039;aa laba wajood. Mid kastaa dhinaciisa iyo midabkiisa ayuu hayaa. Isla midkaas ayaa dhaca afar-geesle ama goobo wajiga lagu sawiray: qaabku wuxuu noqdaa wajigiisa gaarka ah gudaha wajiga weyn, kaas oo hadda godad leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidaas ayaad qolalka ugu habaysaa sagxadda dabaqa, daaqadda darbiga, ama tallaabada jaranjarka ku jirta: sawir xuduudda wajiga dushiisa, kadibna riix ama jiid wajiga cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wajiyo-u-jeeda-jihada-qaldan\"\u003EWajiyo u jeeda jihada qaldan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWajig kasta wuxuu leeyahay hore iyo dambe. Dambe wuxuu muujiyaa buluug-cirro (blue-grey). Wajiyada dhulka lagu sawiray waxay u jeedaan sare; wajiyada wajiga kale lagu sawiray waxay u jeedaan sida wajigaas oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii wajigu dambeeyo meesha aad hore u filaysay, dooro oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi wajiga\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-aragto-intaad-sawirayso\"\u003EWaxa aad aragto intaad sawirayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad midab leh meesha tusuhu ku qabsado, iyo magaceeda talada hoose ee bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHorudhac xariiqa ama qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbirka toos ah sanduuqa qiimaha. Waqti kasta ayaad ku dul qori kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-qaabku-aanu-jirin-meeshii-aad-filaysay\"\u003EHaddii qaabku aanu jirin meeshii aad filaysay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad taabasho ah, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#a-shape-starts-in-the-wrong-place-on-a-touch-screen\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"a-shape-starts-in-the-wrong-place-on-a-touch-screen\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii xariiq ku qabsaday wax aad uga fog gadaashiisa, wareeg yar: barahaas wajiga gadaashiisa qarsan weligood ma qabsadaan, laakiin barahaas geeskiisa saaran ayaa qabsada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad qaabkii u dambeeyay uga noqoto; hal ka noqod wuxuu tirtiraa hal xariiq ama hal qaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa ku jira ModelCraft oo dhan wuxuu bilaabmaa wajig siman: dusha ay geesuhu xidhayaan. Wajiga waxaad si toos ah ugu sawiri kartaa Afar-geesle, Goobo ama Poligon, ama mid mid geesaha waxaad ku hagi kartaa Xarriiq. Wajiyadu waa waxa Riix/jiid u beddelo jirjirro. Sawir afar-geesle Riix R. Riix geeska koowaad: dhulka, ama wajiga kasta ee moodelka. Tusaha dhaqdhaqaaji. Afar-geeslaha wuxuu ku sii jiraa dhulka (ama wajiga aad ka bilowday), sanduuqa qiimaha (Cabbirrada) wuxuu muujinayaa ballacdiisa iyo qoto-dheerkiisa. Talada waxay leedahay \"Labajibbaaran\" marka dhinacyadu isku mid yihiin. Si aad ugu sawirto diyaarad kale, tusaha u tuso: wajiga ku dhex marta geeska koowaad ayaa afar-geeslaha ku dhigaya wajigaas, iyo ku qabsashada barta ka baxsan diyaaradda (dhamaadka geesta, geesta, paxda buluuga ah) ayaa afar-geeslaha taagaya oo ku dhex marta labada geesood. Dib u qabso barta diyaaradda kowaad, wuuna dhici doonaa mar kale. Si aad diyaarad keliya u ilaaliso, riix furaha fallaadha: ↑ wuxuu afar-geeslaha ka dhigaa sinaan (diyaaradda buluuga), → diyaaradda casaanka, ← diyaaradda cagaaraha. Ku celi isla furaha si aad u furto. Riix geeska ka soo horjeedda, ama qor labada cabbir oo kala saaran koma, kadibna riix Enter: 4m,3m, 4000,3000 moodel millimitir ah, ama 12',10'6\" fit iyo inji. Wajig ayaa soo muuqda oo afar geesood ayaa ku wareegsan. Cabbirrada la qoray waxay u socdaan jihada aad tusaysay: haddii tusuhu geeska koowaad ka bidix yahay markaad qorayso, afar-geeslahu bidix ayuu u fidaa. Koomadu wuxuu kala saaraa labada cabbir, sidaas darteed ma noqon karto calaamadda dhibcaha. Qor 2.5m,3m, weligaaba ha qorin 2,5m. Sawir goobo ama poligon Riix C goobo ama N poligon. Si aad tirada dhinacyada u beddesho, qor kahor intaadan riixin: 12s (ama 12 keliya) kadibna Enter. Goobo waxay ku bilaabataa 24 dhinac, poligonna 6. Talada ayaa muujinaysa tirada hadda, ModelCraft waa ilaalinayaa goobada xigta ilaa aad beddesho ama aad qalab beddesho. Riix dhexda, dhulka ama wajiga. Si aad dhexda wajiga ugu dhigto, tusaha dhexda wajiga (\"Dhexda wajiga\") ama dhexda mid ka mid ah geesahiisa (\"Dhexda geesta\") u tuso, tusahuna wajigaas gudihiisa ku jiraa: goobada ayaa wajigaas lagu sawiraa, xitaa dhamaadka cidhiidhiga ah ee sanduuq dheer. Riix si aad radiusa u dejiso, ama qor (Radius sanduuqa qiimaha) kadibna riix Enter. Goobo waa poligon leh dhinacyo badan. Markaad goobo kor ugu jiidto Riix/jiid, dhinacyadeeda waa la nuugaa si silinda ay u noqoto hal wajig siman. Sawir qaanso Riix A (Qaanso). Riix meesha qaansadu ka bilaabanayso, kadibna meesha ay ku dhammaanayso (ama qor dhererka u dhexeeya). Tusaha u dhaqdhaqaaji si aad qaansada dibadda ugu dhicisid, kadibna riix. Talada waxay leedahay \"Half circle\" marka dhicintu tahay nus masaafada u dhexeysa dhamaadyada. Ama qor sida dhexda uga fog tahay: 2 kadibna Enter. Si aad qaansada barta ku wareegsan u sawirto, isticmaal Qaansada dhexdeeda: riix dhexda, kadibna meesha qaansadu ka bilaabanayso (ama qor radiusa), kadibna meesha ay ku dhammaanayso (ama qor xagal digrii ah, sida 90). Waxay ku qabsanaysaa tallaabo 15°. Qaanso laga bilaabo wajiga ayaa lagu sawiraa wajigaas; haddii kale waxay ku jirtaa dhulka, ama waxay istaagtaa toosh haddii labada dhamaadkeeda ay yihiin dhererro kala duwan. Qaanso waxay leedahay 12 qayb; qor 24s inta aad sawirayso si aad uga badato. Qaansooyinku wajiyada waxay xidhaan siday xariiqyadu sameeyaan: qaanso ku taal geeska afar-geeslaha ayaa kala jarta. Sawir qalin siman Qalin wuxuu sawiraa xariiq siman oo ka gudba barta kasta oo aad riixdo: kable, waddada gacan-ku-haynta, geesta beerta. Wuxuu ka bixi karaa dhulka: barraduhu waxay ku qabsadaan geeska, geesaha iyo wajiyada meel kasta, furayaasha fallaadhaana waxay xidhaan casaan, cagaar ama buluug sida Xarriiq. Riix Qalin kooxda Sawir. Riix barraha qalinku ka gudubto. Qor \u003C0,0,1\u003E kadibna Enter barta 1 kor ka ah midda ugu dambaysay, [x,y,z] meel sax ah, ama dherer barta masaafadaas tusaha dhinaceeda. Riix Enter ama laba jeer riix si aad u dhammaysato. Mar kale riix barta koowaad si aad qalinka u xidho. Backspace wuxuu soo celinayaa barta u dambaysay. Qalinka mid ahaan ayaa la doortaa. Si aad u beddesho, dooro oo riix Tafatir barar gudaha Macluumaadka: barahiisu waxay u muuqdaan labajibbaaran. Riix mid, kadibna riix meesha uu u socdo (ama qor \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E). Esc wuxuu barta dib ugu celinayaa, wuxuuna dhammeeyaa wax-beddelka. Qalin fidsan oo xidhan wajig ayuu sameeyaa; qalin wajiga geeskiisa sawiraya mar dambe ma beddeli karo. Ka fogaan: xuduud gudaha ama dibadda wajiga Ka fogaan wuxuu nuqul ka dhigaa geeskiisa wajiga masaafo la dejiyay gudihiisa (ama dibaddiisa), si loo sameeyo daaqad-jaad, xuduud, sillka ama muraayadda shaashad. Riix F kadibna riix wajiga, ama dooro wajiga marka hore kadibna riix F. Tusaha wajiga gudihiisa u dhaqdhaqaaji haddii aad rabto geesaha gudaha, ama dibadda haddii aad rabto geesaha dibadda. Geesaha cusub ayaa raacaya, talada waxay sheegaysaa intee ka fog. Riix, ama qor masaafada kadibna riix Enter. Wajigu wuxuu u kala go'aa laba: wajiga gudihiisa iyo daaqad (ama wareeg cusub dibadda). Riix/jiid mid kasta si toos ah: shaashad ahaan, sanduuq sawir, u riix dhumucdiisa, wajiga hore 30 mm gudaha ugu ka fogaan, kadibna wajiga gudihiisa yar riix muraayadda. Godadka wajiga ayaa sidoo kale la ka fogaadaa, qaansana ama goobo waxay ahaataa hal qalin (yar ama weyn). Laba jeer riix wajiga Ka fogaan si aad mar kale ugu ka fogaato masaafadii ugu dambaysay. Geesaha: dooro silsilad geesaha isku xidhan oo diyaarad keliya ah (tusaale, laba xariiq oo L ah), riix F, u dhaqdhaqaaji dhinaca aad rabto oo qor masaafada: nuqul isbarbar ah ayaa la sawiraa, geeskooduna waa geesaha xagal-xaga ah. Marka masaafadu ka badan tahay wajiga ogolaado, ModelCraft ayaa sheegaa oo waxba ma sawiro. Qaansooyinka, goobada iyo poligonada waa qalino Riix qayb kasta oo qaanso, goobo ama poligon ah, qalinka oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. Macluumaadka ayaa markaas muujinaysa radiusiisa, qaybahiisa, xagalkiisa (qaansooyinka) iyo dherertiisa. Halkaas radius cusub qor si dhexdiisa looga beddelo cabbirka; wajiyada ku sawiran diyaaradeeda ayaa raacaya. Markii wajiga qalinka la riixo ama la jiido, radiusiisa waa sidiisa ku sii jiraa. Sawir xariiqyo Riix L. Riix meesha xariiqu ka bilaabanayso. Riix meesha ay ku dhammaanayso, ama qor dherer kadibna riix Enter. Dhererka la qoray wuxuu u socdaa jihada tusuhu muujinayo. Sii riix. Riix kasta xariiq cusub ayuu ka bilaabaa dhamaadka xariiqii u dambeeyay. Dusha xidh mar kale barta koowaad riix. Marka xariiqyadu wareeg siman xidhaan, wajiga ayaa buuxsamaya qalabkuna wuu joojiyaa silsiladda. Riix Esc wakhti kasta si aad u joojiso. Xariiqyadu waxay raacaan jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug marka aad u soo dhowaato; xariiqu midabkaas buu qaataa, talada waxay tidhaa \"On red axis\". Eeg Malaynta iyo ku qabsashada si aad jihada u xidho oo barahaas ugu qabsato. Xariiqu meesha uu u tagayo marka aanu waxba taabanin Xariiq ka bilaabanaya wajiga ayaa ku sii jirta diyaarada wajigaas. Xariiq ka bilaabanaya dhulka, ama meel banaan, wuxuu ku sii jiraa heer la mid ah barta bilowga. Haddii aad moodelka geeska ka eegto, wuxuu aadayaa diyaarada toosan ee kugu soo jeedda. Si aad xariiq u sawirto meel sax ah, qor barta: [x,y,z] barta moodelka gudihiisa, ama \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ka fogaanshaha bilowga. Eeg Qor cabbirro sax ah. Kala jar wajiga Xariiq sawir wajiga dhex mara, gees ilaa geesle kale (ama gees ilaa geesle xariiqyo kale dhex mara). Wajigu wuxuu u kala go'aa laba wajood. Mid kastaa dhinaciisa iyo midabkiisa ayuu hayaa. Isla midkaas ayaa dhaca afar-geesle ama goobo wajiga lagu sawiray: qaabku wuxuu noqdaa wajigiisa gaarka ah gudaha wajiga weyn, kaas oo hadda godad leh. Sidaas ayaad qolalka ugu habaysaa sagxadda dabaqa, daaqadda darbiga, ama tallaabada jaranjarka ku jirta: sawir xuduudda wajiga dushiisa, kadibna riix ama jiid wajiga cusub. Wajiyo u jeeda jihada qaldan Wajig kasta wuxuu leeyahay hore iyo dambe. Dambe wuxuu muujiyaa buluug-cirro (blue-grey). Wajiyada dhulka lagu sawiray waxay u jeedaan sare; wajiyada wajiga kale lagu sawiray waxay u jeedaan sida wajigaas oo kale. Haddii wajigu dambeeyo meesha aad hore u filaysay, dooro oo riix Rogi wajiga gudaha Macluumaadka. Waxa aad aragto intaad sawirayso Calaamad midab leh meesha tusuhu ku qabsado, iyo magaceeda talada hoose ee bidix. Horudhac xariiqa ama qaabka. Cabbirka toos ah sanduuqa qiimaha. Waqti kasta ayaad ku dul qori kartaa. Haddii qaabku aanu jirin meeshii aad filaysay Shaashad taabasho ah, eeg Xallinta dhibaatada. Haddii xariiq ku qabsaday wax aad uga fog gadaashiisa, wareeg yar: barahaas wajiga gadaashiisa qarsan weligood ma qabsadaan, laakiin barahaas geeskiisa saaran ayaa qabsada. Riix Ctrl+Z si aad qaabkii u dambeeyay uga noqoto; hal ka noqod wuxuu tirtiraa hal xariiq ama hal qaab.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"push-pull","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Riix iyo jiid dusha si ay u noqdaan jidh","summary":"Dusha u rog sanduuq, ka dhig dhisme dhaadheer ama gaaban, ku dar bay ama god, oo ku celi masaafo laba jeer riix.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["riix jiid","soo bixi","dherer","jidh","sanduuq","culeys","dhaadheer","god","bay","ku celi","laba jeer riix","mugga","heer","dusha","siman","isku dherer","is-dhac"],"headings":[{"id":"jidh-ka-dhig-dusha","text":"Jidh ka dhig dusha","level":2},{"id":"jiid-heerka-wax-kale","text":"Jiid heerka wax kale","level":2},{"id":"sanduuq-ka-dhig-mid-dheer-ama-gaaban","text":"Sanduuq ka dhig mid dheer ama gaaban","level":2},{"id":"bay-ama-god-ku-dar","text":"Bay ama god ku dar","level":2},{"id":"riix-ilaa-dhammaadka","text":"Riix ilaa dhammaadka","level":2},{"id":"masaafo-qor","text":"Masaafo qor","level":2},{"id":"masaafadii-ugu-dambaysay-ku-celi","text":"Masaafadii ugu dambaysay ku celi","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-og-yahay","text":"Waxyaabo la og yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu dusha u dhaqaaqaa jihadiisa: kor iyo hoos dhulka u dhigan, gudaha iyo dibada darbiga u dhigan. Wixii dhaca wuxuu ku xidhan yahay dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidh-ka-dhig-dusha\"\u003EJidh ka dhig dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir dusha, tusaale ahaan laydh ku taal dhulka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003ESawir dusha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha ku dhaaf. Waa la iftiimiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dusha, kadibna dhaqaaji mouse-ka. Dusha wuu kor u kacaa (ama hoos u dhacaa) oo dhinacyada ayaa ka soo baxa cidhifkeeda. Sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E) iyo talada ayaa muujinaya masaafada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji si aad u dhammaysid, ama qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700\u003C/code\u003E moodeel millimitir ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda waxaad haysataa jidh xidhan. Dhammaan dooro oo samee koox (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E markaas wuxuu muujinayaa &quot;Solid: Yes&quot; iyo mugga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha kali ah waxay u dhaqaaqi kartaa labada jihood: jiid kor u kac si aad mug ka sarreyso dhulka, riix hoos u dhac si aad god ama aasaas u sameysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalkii aad laba jeer guji, dusha ku riix, jiid, oo sii dhaaf. Shaashad taabasho ah habkaasu waa habka dabiiciga ah: riix, jiid, kor u qaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiid-heerka-wax-kale\"\u003EJiid heerka wax kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad jiidayso, ku dheg-dheg geesta, dhexdhexaadka, cidhifka ama hagaha qayb kale oo moodeelka ah. Dusha ayaa u kal-go heerkaas, calaamad ayaana muujinaysa barta. Isticmaal si aad laba dhisme isku dherer u sameysid, ama si aad u joogsato khadka hage aad dhigtay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Eqalabka cabbiraadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale ku dheg-dheg kartaa dusha u siman dusha aad riixayso, sida sare ee dhisme kale ama sare ee sanduuqa tiirku ku taagan yahay. Talada waxay leedahay &quot;On face&quot;, dusha aad riixayso wuxuu ku dhammaadaa isla heer. Tusaale ahaan, riix dusha gudaha ee tuubo hoos ilaa uu isla heerka la yahay sanduuqa tuubada hoosteeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha xagal la leh dusha aad riixayso ma dejiso heer. Masaafadu waxay raacdaa mouse-ka. Sidaas oo kale ayay tahay dusha ka dambeeya dusha aad riixayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka dusha la riixay mar kale uu isku siman dhammaado dusha ku xeeran, dhinacyadiisa way baxaan. Ma jiraan dhinacyo aan dherer lahayn oo hadhay, khadka aad sawirtay wuxuu dusha ku sii jiraa, sidaas darteed mar dambe mar kale ayaad riixi kartaa. Si aad mar kale u sameysid hal dusha, geesaha khadka ku tirtir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E: laba dusheba way isku xidhmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuq-ka-dhig-mid-dheer-ama-gaaban\"\u003ESanduuq ka dhig mid dheer ama gaaban\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix/jiid sare sanduuqa. Maadaama dhinacyadiisu hore u toos u socdaan kor, sareeda ayaa si fudud u dhaqaaqda: sanduuqu wuu dheer ama gaaban yahay, mana sameysmaan geesaha cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiixida sare ilaa hoos ilaa hoosta waxay tirtiraysaa sanduuqa. ModelCraft wuxuu joogsadaa dherer eber; weligiis ma rogo sanduuqa dibadda-gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESidaas oo kale waxay ku dhacaa dusha kasta oo deriskiisa oo dhan ku socda jihadiisa, sida dhamaadka darbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bay-ama-god-ku-dar\"\u003EBay ama god ku dar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir laydh dhinaca sanduuq (ka bilow dusha; wuxuu ku sii jiraa diyaaradda dusha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid laydhka cusub \u003Cstrong\u003Edibada\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu ku daraa walxo: bay, dhuumaha dabka, madal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu gooyaa god: balkoon, niche, albaab dib loo dhigay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka dhinacyada qaybta cusub ay isku toosaan dusha horay u jiray, waxay isku darmaan hal dusha, sidaas darteed ma heli doonto khadad aan loo baahnayn darbi siman.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riix-ilaa-dhammaadka\"\u003ERiix ilaa dhammaadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiixida dusha gudaha jidh waxay joogsataa dusha ugu horreeya ee ka dambeeya. Marka ay gaarto dushaas, wuxuu jarayaa furitaan dhinac kale. Sidaas ayaad daaqado iyo albaabbo ku samaysaa darbi dhumuc leh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/openings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/openings\"\u003EJar furitaan darbiga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masaafo-qor\"\u003EMasaafo qor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha guji kadibna qor masaafada oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMasaafada la qoray waxay u socotaa jihada aad dhaqaaqayday. Haddii aadan wali dhaqaaqin, waxay u socotaa xagga hore ee dusha (jidh ka baxa, dhulka ka kor u kacda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor tiro taban, sida \u003Ccode\u003E-500\u003C/code\u003E, si aad jihada kale u socoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad fikirkaaga beddesho ka hor gujinta, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dusha wuu dib u noqdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masaafadii-ugu-dambaysay-ku-celi\"\u003EMasaafadii ugu dambaysay ku celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix/jiid mar kadib, laba jeer guji dusha kale adigoo wali doortay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay u dhaqaaqdaa isla masaafadaas. Taasi waa habka degdega ah si aad darbiyo badan ama dabaqyo badan u siiso isla dhumuc ama dherer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuu xasuusanayaa masaafada ilaa aad u beddesho qalab kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-og-yahay\"\u003EWaxyaabo la og yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix/jiid wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa hal dusha mar kasta. Haddii aad guujisid wax aan dusha ahayn, xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Push/pull works on a face. Click a face.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad dusha dhex ku jirta kooxda ama qaybta riix/jiido, marka hore fur (laba jeer guji).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003EIs-dhac\u003C/strong\u003E uu furan yahay, riix ama jiid oo gaarta jidh kale wuxuu joogsadaa meesha taabtaa, talooyinkuna wuxuu sheegaa waxa taabtay (magaca shayga, ama &quot;loose geometry in this group&quot;) oo wuxuu iftiimiyaa dushii la kulmay. Godka aad riixdo jidhkiisa u gaar ah (tusaale ahaan dusha la kala wareejiyay oo dib loo riixay) waa qayb jidhkaas ah oo waligeed ma joogsado darbiyadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jidh oo midba midka kale lagu riixay ma jaraan, mana isku xidhaan: dusheyda way dhex mari. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Riix/jiid (P) wuxuu dusha u dhaqaaqaa jihadiisa: kor iyo hoos dhulka u dhigan, gudaha iyo dibada darbiga u dhigan. Wixii dhaca wuxuu ku xidhan yahay dusha. Jidh ka dhig dusha Sawir dusha, tusaale ahaan laydh ku taal dhulka (Sawir dusha). Riix P. Dusha ku dhaaf. Waa la iftiimiyaa. Guji dusha, kadibna dhaqaaji mouse-ka. Dusha wuu kor u kacaa (ama hoos u dhacaa) oo dhinacyada ayaa ka soo baxa cidhifkeeda. Sanduuqa qiimaha (Masaafo) iyo talada ayaa muujinaya masaafada. Guji si aad u dhammaysid, ama qor masaafo oo riix Enter: 3m, 10', 2700 moodeel millimitir ah. Hadda waxaad haysataa jidh xidhan. Dhammaan dooro oo samee koox (eeg Kooxaha iyo qaybaha): Macluumaadka markaas wuxuu muujinayaa \"Solid: Yes\" iyo mugga. Dusha kali ah waxay u dhaqaaqi kartaa labada jihood: jiid kor u kac si aad mug ka sarreyso dhulka, riix hoos u dhac si aad god ama aasaas u sameysid. Halkii aad laba jeer guji, dusha ku riix, jiid, oo sii dhaaf. Shaashad taabasho ah habkaasu waa habka dabiiciga ah: riix, jiid, kor u qaad. Jiid heerka wax kale Markaad jiidayso, ku dheg-dheg geesta, dhexdhexaadka, cidhifka ama hagaha qayb kale oo moodeelka ah. Dusha ayaa u kal-go heerkaas, calaamad ayaana muujinaysa barta. Isticmaal si aad laba dhisme isku dherer u sameysid, ama si aad u joogsato khadka hage aad dhigtay qalabka cabbiraadda. Waxaad sidoo kale ku dheg-dheg kartaa dusha u siman dusha aad riixayso, sida sare ee dhisme kale ama sare ee sanduuqa tiirku ku taagan yahay. Talada waxay leedahay \"On face\", dusha aad riixayso wuxuu ku dhammaadaa isla heer. Tusaale ahaan, riix dusha gudaha ee tuubo hoos ilaa uu isla heerka la yahay sanduuqa tuubada hoosteeda. Dusha xagal la leh dusha aad riixayso ma dejiso heer. Masaafadu waxay raacdaa mouse-ka. Sidaas oo kale ayay tahay dusha ka dambeeya dusha aad riixayso. Marka dusha la riixay mar kale uu isku siman dhammaado dusha ku xeeran, dhinacyadiisa way baxaan. Ma jiraan dhinacyo aan dherer lahayn oo hadhay, khadka aad sawirtay wuxuu dusha ku sii jiraa, sidaas darteed mar dambe mar kale ayaad riixi kartaa. Si aad mar kale u sameysid hal dusha, geesaha khadka ku tirtir Tirtiraha: laba dusheba way isku xidhmaan. Sanduuq ka dhig mid dheer ama gaaban Riix/jiid sare sanduuqa. Maadaama dhinacyadiisu hore u toos u socdaan kor, sareeda ayaa si fudud u dhaqaaqda: sanduuqu wuu dheer ama gaaban yahay, mana sameysmaan geesaha cusub. Riixida sare ilaa hoos ilaa hoosta waxay tirtiraysaa sanduuqa. ModelCraft wuxuu joogsadaa dherer eber; weligiis ma rogo sanduuqa dibadda-gudaha. Sidaas oo kale waxay ku dhacaa dusha kasta oo deriskiisa oo dhan ku socda jihadiisa, sida dhamaadka darbi. Bay ama god ku dar Sawir laydh dhinaca sanduuq (ka bilow dusha; wuxuu ku sii jiraa diyaaradda dusha). Riix P oo jiid laydhka cusub dibada. Wuxuu ku daraa walxo: bay, dhuumaha dabka, madal. Ama riix gudaha. Wuxuu gooyaa god: balkoon, niche, albaab dib loo dhigay. Marka dhinacyada qaybta cusub ay isku toosaan dusha horay u jiray, waxay isku darmaan hal dusha, sidaas darteed ma heli doonto khadad aan loo baahnayn darbi siman. Riix ilaa dhammaadka Riixida dusha gudaha jidh waxay joogsataa dusha ugu horreeya ee ka dambeeya. Marka ay gaarto dushaas, wuxuu jarayaa furitaan dhinac kale. Sidaas ayaad daaqado iyo albaabbo ku samaysaa darbi dhumuc leh. Eeg Jar furitaan darbiga. Masaafo qor Dusha guji kadibna qor masaafada oo riix Enter. Masaafada la qoray waxay u socotaa jihada aad dhaqaaqayday. Haddii aadan wali dhaqaaqin, waxay u socotaa xagga hore ee dusha (jidh ka baxa, dhulka ka kor u kacda). Qor tiro taban, sida -500, si aad jihada kale u socoto. Haddii aad fikirkaaga beddesho ka hor gujinta, riix Esc. Dusha wuu dib u noqdaa. Masaafadii ugu dambaysay ku celi Riix/jiid mar kadib, laba jeer guji dusha kale adigoo wali doortay Riix/jiid. Waxay u dhaqaaqdaa isla masaafadaas. Taasi waa habka degdega ah si aad darbiyo badan ama dabaqyo badan u siiso isla dhumuc ama dherer. ModelCraft wuu xasuusanayaa masaafada ilaa aad u beddesho qalab kale. Waxyaabo la og yahay Riix/jiid wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa hal dusha mar kasta. Haddii aad guujisid wax aan dusha ahayn, xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu leeyahay \"Push/pull works on a face. Click a face.\" Si aad dusha dhex ku jirta kooxda ama qaybta riix/jiido, marka hore fur (laba jeer guji). Marka Is-dhac uu furan yahay, riix ama jiid oo gaarta jidh kale wuxuu joogsadaa meesha taabtaa, talooyinkuna wuxuu sheegaa waxa taabtay (magaca shayga, ama \"loose geometry in this group\") oo wuxuu iftiimiyaa dushii la kulmay. Godka aad riixdo jidhkiisa u gaar ah (tusaale ahaan dusha la kala wareejiyay oo dib loo riixay) waa qayb jidhkaas ah oo waligeed ma joogsado darbiyadiisa. Laba jidh oo midba midka kale lagu riixay ma jaraan, mana isku xidhaan: dusheyda way dhex mari. Eeg Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"divide","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kala qaybi gees ama qalin qaybo isku mid ah","summary":"Jarjar xariiq qaybo isku mid ah, ama qaanso ama goobo u samee tiro cusub oo qeybo ah, adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka {{ui:Kala qaybi}}.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["kala qaybi","kala qaybi geesta","qaybo isku mid ah","qayb isku mid ah","jarjar geesta","qaybo","qaybi geesaha","qaybo qaanso","qaybo goobo","barar xariiqa dhexdeeda"],"headings":[{"id":"geesta-kala-qaybi","text":"Geesta kala qaybi","level":2},{"id":"qaanso-ama-goobo-kala-qaybi","text":"Qaanso ama goobo kala qaybi","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-modeler-ka","text":"Furayaasha modeler-ka","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-rabo-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxyaabo la rabo in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geesta u gooyaa qaybo isku mid ah, geesna kasta jarista ayuu ku leeyahay geesood. Geeskooda isticmaal si aad ugu qabsato, ama si aad xariiqyo uga bilowdo, ama si aad qayb ka mid ah wajiga u riixdo ama u jiidto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesta-kala-qaybi\"\u003EGeesta kala qaybi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare, ama dooro geesta oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybi…\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusaha geesta ku tuso. Calaamadaha waxay muujinayaan meesha jarista ku dhici doonto: dhexda geesta waa laba qayb; u dhaw dhinac kasta si aad qaybo badan u hesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix si aad ugu qaybiso qaybaha la muujiyay. Ama qor tiro, sida \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E5s\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: wuu isla markiiba qaybin doonaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha waxay ku sii hadhaan inay la doortay, waana hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Wajiga ay geestu ka mid tahay wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaabkiisa oo wuxuu helaa geeskii cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaanso-ama-goobo-kala-qaybi\"\u003EQaanso ama goobo kala qaybi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaha qayb kasta oo qaanso ama goobo ah ku tuso: wuxuu u qaybsanayaa oo dhammaantiis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaanso ama goobo aan geeskooda midna isticmaalin, oo wajiga ku fidsan, \u003Cstrong\u003Emar kale waa la sawiraa qaybo tiradaas ah\u003C/strong\u003E qaansada dhabta ah. Dhamaadyadiisu meeshoodii ayay ku sii hadhaan, waana hal qalin weli, markaa weli waad mar kale dooran kartaa hal riix oo keliya, oo radiusiisa ku beddeli kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E. Goobo 24 geesood leh oo loo qaybiyay 8 ayaa noqda poligon sideed geesood leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalin kasta oo kale — gees silinda la jiidey, qalin lagu sawiray \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E, ama qaanso xariiqyo geeskooda ku xidhan — wuxuu helaa geesas cusub oo dheer isku mid ah dhexdiisa, wax kalena ma dhaqdhaqaaqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-modeler-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha modeler-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabku waa isku mid furayaasha modeler-ka (Dejinta › ModelCraft › Furayaasha, ama habka menu-ga Modeler), halkaas oo uu ku yaal menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh\u003C/span\u003E oo ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybi geesaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-rabo-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxyaabo la rabo in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyinka la qoro waxay u dhexeeyaan 2 ilaa 1000; tusaha dhaqdhaqaaqa ilaa 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalin lagu sawiray \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaalinayaa barraradiisa: ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir barar\u003C/span\u003E, mar kale waa laga sawiraa barrahaas, geeskii cusubna waa baabbi&#039;ay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003ESawir wajiyo xariiqyo, afar-geesle, goobo iyo qaanso\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EQor cabbirro sax ah sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kala qaybi wuxuu geesta u gooyaa qaybo isku mid ah, geesna kasta jarista ayuu ku leeyahay geesood. Geeskooda isticmaal si aad ugu qabsato, ama si aad xariiqyo uga bilowdo, ama si aad qayb ka mid ah wajiga u riixdo ama u jiidto. Geesta kala qaybi Riix Kala qaybi qalabka sare, ama dooro geesta oo riix Qaybi… gudaha Macluumaadka. Tusaha geesta ku tuso. Calaamadaha waxay muujinayaan meesha jarista ku dhici doonto: dhexda geesta waa laba qayb; u dhaw dhinac kasta si aad qaybo badan u hesho. Riix si aad ugu qaybiso qaybaha la muujiyay. Ama qor tiro, sida 5 (ama 5s, ama /5), kadibna riix Enter: wuu isla markiiba qaybin doonaa. Qaybaha waxay ku sii hadhaan inay la doortay, waana hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Wajiga ay geestu ka mid tahay wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaabkiisa oo wuxuu helaa geeskii cusub. Qaanso ama goobo kala qaybi Tusaha qayb kasta oo qaanso ama goobo ah ku tuso: wuxuu u qaybsanayaa oo dhammaantiis. Qaanso ama goobo aan geeskooda midna isticmaalin, oo wajiga ku fidsan, mar kale waa la sawiraa qaybo tiradaas ah qaansada dhabta ah. Dhamaadyadiisu meeshoodii ayay ku sii hadhaan, waana hal qalin weli, markaa weli waad mar kale dooran kartaa hal riix oo keliya, oo radiusiisa ku beddeli kartaa Macluumaadka. Goobo 24 geesood leh oo loo qaybiyay 8 ayaa noqda poligon sideed geesood leh. Qalin kasta oo kale — gees silinda la jiidey, qalin lagu sawiray Qalin, ama qaanso xariiqyo geeskooda ku xidhan — wuxuu helaa geesas cusub oo dheer isku mid ah dhexdiisa, wax kalena ma dhaqdhaqaaqo. Furayaasha modeler-ka Qalabku waa isku mid furayaasha modeler-ka (Dejinta › ModelCraft › Furayaasha, ama habka menu-ga Modeler), halkaas oo uu ku yaal menu-ga Mesh oo ah Qaybi geesaha. Waxyaabo la rabo in la ogaado Tirooyinka la qoro waxay u dhexeeyaan 2 ilaa 1000; tusaha dhaqdhaqaaqa ilaa 100. Qalin lagu sawiray Qalin wuxuu ilaalinayaa barraradiisa: ka dib Tafatir barar, mar kale waa laga sawiraa barrahaas, geeskii cusubna waa baabbi'ay. Eeg sidoo kale Sawir wajiyo xariiqyo, afar-geesle, goobo iyo qaanso iyo Qor cabbirro sax ah sanduuqa qiimaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"scale-factors","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Miisaan qiimayaal iyo ogolaansho yareyn","summary":"Miisaan xulasho qiimo kasta oo dhinac ah barta aad doorato, ama samee nashqad weyn boqolkiiba ah ee qaybta shubma yaraanaysa.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["miisaan","qiimayaal","aan isku mid ahayn","boqolkiiba","jiid","yareyn","shubid","nashqad","warshad shubis","ogolaansho","dib u cabbir"],"headings":[{"id":"ogolaanshaha-yareynta","text":"Ogolaanshaha yareynta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabka Miisaan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu si siman u miisaanaa ama wuxuu jiidaa grip si uu hal ama laba dhinac u fidiyo. \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan qiimayaal…\u003C/strong\u003E (liiska Qalabka, ama kooxda Beddel) waa qaabka qoran: lambar dhinac kasta, saddexda dhinac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro geeso, dusha, kooxo, ama component-yo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan qiimayaal…\u003C/span\u003E. Qor qiimo casaan, cagaar iyo buluug. Qiimuhu wuxuu noqon karaa \u003Ccode\u003E1.015\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E101.5%\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E+1.5%\u003C/code\u003E (iyo \u003Ccode\u003E-2%\u003C/code\u003E si uu u yaraado). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku mid saddexda tiir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nuqulka koowaad u koobiyeeyaa labada kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa \u003Cstrong\u003Eku sii jiraya\u003C/strong\u003E: dhexda xulashada, geeska hoose, dhexda hoosteeda, ama asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqa hoosta goobaha wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka hadda iyo kadib. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhidibbada waa kuwa kooxda aad furtay (kan heerka sare ee moodeelka). Kooxda ama component-ka la wareejiyey wuxuu u soo baxayaa mid la jiido haddii qiimayaashu kala duwan yihiin; ku miisaan kooxda ku hayso taas. Waxa gudaha component-ka ku jira ma taabto, sidaas darteed nuqullada kale sidii ayay ahaadaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ogolaanshaha-yareynta\"\u003EOgolaanshaha yareynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBirta la shubo way yaraataa markay qabowdo, sidaas darteed nashqadeeda waa la weyn gareeyaa. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolaanshaha yareynta\u003C/strong\u003E qor boqolkiiba dhinac kasta (warshadaadu ama soo-saaraha nashqadda ayaa siinaya birtaada; 1.5% hoose waa tusaale oo keliya) oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal sida qiimayaasha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoqolkiiba laftiisa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qiimaha ka dhigaa 1 oo lagu daro boqolkiiba: 1.5% wuxuu siinayaa 1.015, taas oo ah waxa qalabka yaraynta uu calaamadeeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu filan oo sax ah\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qiimaha ka dhigaa 1 oo loo qaybiyo 1 ka dhimmo boqolkiiba: 1.5% wuxuu siinayaa 1.0152, si shubku u soo baxo cabbirka qaybta ka dib markii ay yaraatay boqolkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoqolkaagii ugu dambeeyay waxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoqolkiiba waa kan adiga kuu gaar ah: ModelCraft ma ogta birtaada, dhuumaha ama habka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qalabka Miisaan (S) wuxuu si siman u miisaanaa ama wuxuu jiidaa grip si uu hal ama laba dhinac u fidiyo. Miisaan qiimayaal… (liiska Qalabka, ama kooxda Beddel) waa qaabka qoran: lambar dhinac kasta, saddexda dhinac. Dooro geeso, dusha, kooxo, ama component-yo. Fur Miisaan qiimayaal…. Qor qiimo casaan, cagaar iyo buluug. Qiimuhu wuxuu noqon karaa 1.015, 101.5% ama +1.5% (iyo -2% si uu u yaraado). Isku mid saddexda tiir wuxuu nuqulka koowaad u koobiyeeyaa labada kale. Dooro waxa ku sii jiraya: dhexda xulashada, geeska hoose, dhexda hoosteeda, ama asalka. Xariiqa hoosta goobaha wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka hadda iyo kadib. Miisaan wuxuu sameeyaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Dhidibbada waa kuwa kooxda aad furtay (kan heerka sare ee moodeelka). Kooxda ama component-ka la wareejiyey wuxuu u soo baxayaa mid la jiido haddii qiimayaashu kala duwan yihiin; ku miisaan kooxda ku hayso taas. Waxa gudaha component-ka ku jira ma taabto, sidaas darteed nuqullada kale sidii ayay ahaadaan. Ogolaanshaha yareynta Birta la shubo way yaraataa markay qabowdo, sidaas darteed nashqadeeda waa la weyn gareeyaa. Hoosta Ogolaanshaha yareynta qor boqolkiiba dhinac kasta (warshadaadu ama soo-saaraha nashqadda ayaa siinaya birtaada; 1.5% hoose waa tusaale oo keliya) oo riix Isticmaal sida qiimayaasha. Boqolkiiba laftiisa wuxuu qiimaha ka dhigaa 1 oo lagu daro boqolkiiba: 1.5% wuxuu siinayaa 1.015, taas oo ah waxa qalabka yaraynta uu calaamadeeyo. Ku filan oo sax ah wuxuu qiimaha ka dhigaa 1 oo loo qaybiyo 1 ka dhimmo boqolkiiba: 1.5% wuxuu siinayaa 1.0152, si shubku u soo baxo cabbirka qaybta ka dib markii ay yaraatay boqolkaas. Boqolkaagii ugu dambeeyay waxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan. Boqolkiiba waa kan adiga kuu gaar ah: ModelCraft ma ogta birtaada, dhuumaha ama habka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"follow-me","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Iga raac: u dhaqaaji wajig jid ah","summary":"Samee tuubooyin, kable, gacan-qabsiyo, qaab-jaranjar iyo giraan adigoo wajig u dhaqaajinaya geesaha, qaansada ama qalin.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["iga raac","dhaqaaji","jid","tuubo","kable","tuub","gacan-qabsi","qaab-jaranjar","mirood","giraan","torus","khraad","jirjiri jid ku dhex"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-kable","text":"Samee kable","level":2},{"id":"iyada-oo-aan-jidka-marka-hore-la-dooran","text":"Iyada oo aan jidka marka hore la dooran","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIga raac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wajig u dhaqaajiyaa jid, wuxuuna dhisaa jirka uu marayo. Wajigu wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaabkiisa oo wuxuu ku sii joogaa xagal-xaga jidka; geesta kasta oo jidka ah qaybaha way isugu yimaadaan xagal-xaga nadiif ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-kable\"\u003ESamee kable\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir jidka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E oo ka gudubta barraha kable-ku mara (wuu kor u kici karaa, hoos u dhici karaa), ama xariiqyo iyo qaansooyin (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E) oo geeska-geeska isku xidhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilowga jidka, sawir qaybta kable-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E yar oo jidka dhex mara. Goobada ka bilow barta dhamaadka jidka oo u jeedi si ay jidka u raacdo; ama ku sawir wajig jidka halkaas gooyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro jidka (hal riix wuxuu dooraa qalin ama qaanso oo dhan; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix wuxuu ku daraa geesaha kale).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIga raac\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix goobada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubada waa jir xidhan, dhinacyo siman (nuugan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iyada-oo-aan-jidka-marka-hore-la-dooran\"\u003EIyada oo aan jidka marka hore la dooran\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIga raac\u003C/span\u003E, riix wajiga, kadibna riix gees kasta oo jidka ka mid ah. Jidku waa silsiladda geesaha geeskaas dhex mara, ilaa meesha saddex geesood ama in ka badan isku kulmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidadka xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E (goobo, qalin xidhan, xuduudda afar-geesle) waxay sameeyaan giraan: wajigu waa la isticmaalaa oo giraanku naftiisa ayuu xidhaa. Goobo dhulka ku sawir jidka, goobo yar oo toosan oo jidka dhex mara ku sawir donut.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa baxsan jidka:\u003C/strong\u003E wajigu ma aha inuu taabto jidka. Qaab la sawiray jidka dhinac ayuu ku dhaqaaqaa, sida qaab-jaranjar dhanka sare ee darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidku ma laami karo\u003C/strong\u003E, waana inuu noqdaa hal silsilad isku xidhan. ModelCraft ayaa sheegaa marka aanu noqon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWajig jidka dheer ku jiifa\u003C/strong\u003E (diyaarad isku mid ah geesta koowaad ee jidka) lama dhaqaajin karo: u rog si uu jidka dhex mariyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Iga raac wuxuu wajig u dhaqaajiyaa jid, wuxuuna dhisaa jirka uu marayo. Wajigu wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaabkiisa oo wuxuu ku sii joogaa xagal-xaga jidka; geesta kasta oo jidka ah qaybaha way isugu yimaadaan xagal-xaga nadiif ah. Samee kable Sawir jidka: Qalin oo ka gudubta barraha kable-ku mara (wuu kor u kici karaa, hoos u dhici karaa), ama xariiqyo iyo qaansooyin (Xarriiq, Qaanso) oo geeska-geeska isku xidhan. Bilowga jidka, sawir qaybta kable-ka: Goobo yar oo jidka dhex mara. Goobada ka bilow barta dhamaadka jidka oo u jeedi si ay jidka u raacdo; ama ku sawir wajig jidka halkaas gooyo. Dooro jidka (hal riix wuxuu dooraa qalin ama qaanso oo dhan; Ctrl+riix wuxuu ku daraa geesaha kale). Riix Iga raac kooxda Beddel, kadibna riix goobada. Tuubada waa jir xidhan, dhinacyo siman (nuugan). Iyada oo aan jidka marka hore la dooran Riix Iga raac, riix wajiga, kadibna riix gees kasta oo jidka ka mid ah. Jidku waa silsiladda geesaha geeskaas dhex mara, ilaa meesha saddex geesood ama in ka badan isku kulmaan. Waxa la ogaado Jidadka xidhan (goobo, qalin xidhan, xuduudda afar-geesle) waxay sameeyaan giraan: wajigu waa la isticmaalaa oo giraanku naftiisa ayuu xidhaa. Goobo dhulka ku sawir jidka, goobo yar oo toosan oo jidka dhex mara ku sawir donut. Ka baxsan jidka: wajigu ma aha inuu taabto jidka. Qaab la sawiray jidka dhinac ayuu ku dhaqaaqaa, sida qaab-jaranjar dhanka sare ee darbiga. Jidku ma laami karo, waana inuu noqdaa hal silsilad isku xidhan. ModelCraft ayaa sheegaa marka aanu noqon. Wajig jidka dheer ku jiifa (diyaarad isku mid ah geesta koowaad ee jidka) lama dhaqaajin karo: u rog si uu jidka dhex mariyo. Waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"text3d","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qoraal 3D","summary":"Ku dar xarfo moodeelka sida dusha, oo fidsan ama adag, oo taagan dusha kasta: calaamad, lambarka guriga, magaca albaabka ku jira.","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["qoraal 3d","qoraal","xarfo","xarfaha","calaamad","calaamadaynta","lambarka guriga","sumad","nakhsh","font","erayo"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-qoraal","text":"Ku dar qoraal","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah","text":"Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal 3D\u003C/span\u003E gudaha kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xarfo ka sameeyaa dusha, kuwaas oo aad rinji karto, riix/jiid ama ku gooyn karto jirmaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-qoraal\"\u003EKu dar qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal 3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor qoraalka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqa dhexdiisa si aad u hesho sadar labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoogga xarfaha\u003C/span\u003E (joogga xarfa weyn, sida \u003Ccode\u003E30cm\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto\u003C/span\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exarfo siman\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha uu ku taagan yahay wax kasta oo aad ku dhigto, diyaar u ah in la rinjiyo ama riix/jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoto sida \u003Ccode\u003E5cm\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exarfo adag\u003C/strong\u003E, jirmaalo xidhan oo aad ku isticmaali karto \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Eqalabka jirmaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dhufo meesha uu qoraalku tagi doono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha dushiisa ayuu qoraalku ku jiraa, akhrinta bidix ilaa midig: darbi ku dhig wuxuu u taagan yahay toosan; dhulka ama miis wuxuu u jiifaa siman casaanka dhinac. Dusha ka fog wuxuu dhulka ku jiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoraalku waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb\u003C/strong\u003E loogu magac daray, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta wuu isbeddelaa haddii aad mid wax ka beddesho, wuxuuna ka muuqdaa liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E si aad mar kale u dhigto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah\"\u003EWaxyaabaha muhiimka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarfaha waa font-ka hal-khad ee ModelCraft, oo la adkeeyay: nadiif iyo fudud in la akhriyo, laakiin weli ma jiro dooro nooca far.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarfaha, lambarrada iyo calaamadaha caadiga ah (oo ay ku jiraan xarfaha xidhan) waa la sawiraa; jilaa aan font-ka ku jirin wuxuu muuqdaa sanduuq yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad erayada u beddesho, tirtir qoraalka oo mar kale ku dar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad xarfo ugu gooyso dusha, samee xarfo adag, ku dhig bartamaha jirmaal kooxeed, kadibna \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Eka jar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qoraal 3D gudaha kooxda Sawir wuxuu xarfo ka sameeyaa dusha, kuwaas oo aad rinji karto, riix/jiid ama ku gooyn karto jirmaal. Ku dar qoraal Riix Qoraal 3D. Qor qoraalka. Riix Enter sanduuqa dhexdiisa si aad u hesho sadar labaad. Deji Joogga xarfaha (joogga xarfa weyn, sida 30cm ama 1') iyo Qoto: 0 wuxuu siinayaa xarfo siman: dusha uu ku taagan yahay wax kasta oo aad ku dhigto, diyaar u ah in la rinjiyo ama riix/jiid. Qoto sida 5cm wuxuu siinayaa xarfo adag, jirmaalo xidhan oo aad ku isticmaali karto qalabka jirmaalka. Riix Dhig, kadibna dhufo meesha uu qoraalku tagi doono. Dusha dushiisa ayuu qoraalku ku jiraa, akhrinta bidix ilaa midig: darbi ku dhig wuxuu u taagan yahay toosan; dhulka ama miis wuxuu u jiifaa siman casaanka dhinac. Dusha ka fog wuxuu dhulka ku jiraa. Qoraalku waa qayb loogu magac daray, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta wuu isbeddelaa haddii aad mid wax ka beddesho, wuxuuna ka muuqdaa liiska Qaybaha si aad mar kale u dhigto. Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah Xarfaha waa font-ka hal-khad ee ModelCraft, oo la adkeeyay: nadiif iyo fudud in la akhriyo, laakiin weli ma jiro dooro nooca far. Xarfaha, lambarrada iyo calaamadaha caadiga ah (oo ay ku jiraan xarfaha xidhan) waa la sawiraa; jilaa aan font-ka ku jirin wuxuu muuqdaa sanduuq yar. Si aad erayada u beddesho, tirtir qoraalka oo mar kale ku dar. Si aad xarfo ugu gooyso dusha, samee xarfo adag, ku dhig bartamaha jirmaal kooxeed, kadibna ka jar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"starter","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Maktabadda bilowga","summary":"Ku dhawaad soddon shay oo diyaar ah oo lagu dhigo moodeelka: albaabyo iyo daaqado, alaabta guriga, jikada iyo musqusha, tiirarka iyo tallaabooyinka, geedo, dad iyo gaari.","section":"tasks","order":39,"keywords":["alaab","qol alaab u dhig","qorshaha alaabta","qolka jiifka","qolka fadhiga","jikada","musqusha","xafiiska","muuqaal","maktabad","bilow","entourage","geedo","dad","gaadiid","dhir","geedo yar","geed-hoose","qaybaha","alaab","albaab","daaqad","kursi","miis","sofa","sariir","jikada","musqusha","tallaabo","tiir","geed","qof","gaari","warshad","diyaar ah"],"headings":[{"id":"dhig-mid","text":"Dhig mid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira","text":"Waxa ku jira","level":2},{"id":"qolka-alaabta-u-dhig-sawir","text":"Qolka alaabta u dhig sawir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabadda bilowga\u003C/span\u003E waxay kuu siinaysaa waxyaabo maalinlaha ah cabbirka dhabta ah, si moodeelku u muuqdo mar-hal-qaad: albaab si cabbirka qolka loo muujiyo, gaari jidka gaadiidka, dad iyo geedo dhismaha ku wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-mid\"\u003EDhig mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E bidixda, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaktabadda bilowga\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro shay, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKursi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDabaq, miis ama dhulka ayuu ku istaagaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EAlbaabyada iyo daaqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa loo sameeyay in lagu galo derbiyada: guji derbi, waxay ku istaagaan gudaha, u wajahan dibadda. (Dusha derbiga ayay ku jiraan; ma jaraan furitaan. Si aad mid u samayso, samee afar-geesle meesha daaqada derbiga ku taal kadibna riix/jiid mid ku dhex maray.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay kasta waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb\u003C/strong\u003E: haddii aad mar kale isla shay doorato, nuqul kale ayaa la dhigaa, oo nuqul kasta wuu isbeddelaa haddii aad mid tafatirto. Waxaa sidoo kale ku muuqda liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dartid mid kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxyaabaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlbaabyo iyo daaqado\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlbaab, albaab labo, daaqad, daaqad ballaaran, albaabka garaashka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlaabta guriga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiis cunto, miis wareega, kursi, kursiga baarka, sofa, kursi gacan-leh, sariir labo iyo mid kali ah, miis qoraal, kabadh kitaabka, kabadh dharka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJikada iyo musqusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKabadhka hoose iyo kan darbiga, miiska jikada, foorno, qolka dhaqidda, musqusha, mar-shaashad, musqul, tub, qulqulaha, lavabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETallaabo toosan (15 tallaabo oo 18 cm), tiir wareega iyo tiir afar-geesle, beam\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobta iyo dadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeed, geed-hoose, qof (1.75 m), gaari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEntourage: geedo, dad iyo gaarii\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeedo qalaad (4, 6 iyo 10 m), geed dhir-leh, geed tiir-tiir ah, geed-hoose wareeg iyo yar, geed-hoose ku hab, dhir koob ku jirta, dad taagan iyo socda, carruur, sedan iyo SUV: qaabab wareegsan oo midabkooda u gaar ah, loogu talagalay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawirada la sameeyay\u003C/a\u003E iyo qorshayaasha goobaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa qaabab fudud, oo laga sameeyay jirdillo aad rinji karto, cabbiri karto ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Ekaligaa samayn karto\u003C/a\u003E oo beddeli karto. Kabadhka darbiga wuxuu ku dhex dhegtaa 1.45 m meesha aad gujisay ka sareysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEntourage-ka waxaa sameeyay CadCraft oo xor u ah in lagu isticmaalo wax kasta (CC0); geedaha, dadka iyo gaarida isku mid ahi waxay ku jiraan Library library-ga BimCraft iyo CadCraft. Daaqadaha gaariga waxaa lagu rinjiyaa agabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad midab leh\u003C/span\u003E, sidaas darteed waa hufan yihiin sawirrada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qolka-alaabta-u-dhig-sawir\"\u003EQolka alaabta u dhig sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro dabaqa qolka (dhinac heer ah oo kor u eegaya, moodeelka ama kooxda gudaheeda) oo isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EHabee › Qolka alaabta u dhig…\u003C/strong\u003E (badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta u dhig\u003C/strong\u003E). Dooro waxa qolku yahay — qolka jiifka, qolka fadhiga, qolka cuntada, musqusha, musqusha ama xafiiska — ama u ogolow inuu qiyaaso cabbirka. Alaabta bilowga waxay u socotaa darbiyada, si ay u bilowdo darbiga ugu dheer, hadba meel ay jirto; waxba ma isku dhacayo, iyo jiidista albaabka bilowga ah ee lagu dhigay derbiyada qolka (iyo ballaca daaqadahooda, hortaal alaabta dheer) waa ka bilaa. Waa qorshe caadi ah oo xeerar ah oo aad dib u eegtid, ma aha naqshad: qolka isku mid waa had iyo jeer isla qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba waxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal kooxda\u003C/strong\u003E oo calaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta\u003C/strong\u003E (Furniture), hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah: Ka noqo, tirtir kooxda ama qari calaamadda si aad uga saarto. Shay aan ku habboonayn waa la magacaabaa xaaladda, waxaana lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E sida xusuus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maktabadda bilowga waxay kuu siinaysaa waxyaabo maalinlaha ah cabbirka dhabta ah, si moodeelku u muuqdo mar-hal-qaad: albaab si cabbirka qolka loo muujiyo, gaari jidka gaadiidka, dad iyo geedo dhismaha ku wareegsan. Dhig mid Qaybaha bidixda, guji Maktabadda bilowga. Dooro shay, sida Kursi. Guji meesha ay tagayso. Dabaq, miis ama dhulka ayuu ku istaagaa. Albaabyada iyo daaqadaha waxaa loo sameeyay in lagu galo derbiyada: guji derbi, waxay ku istaagaan gudaha, u wajahan dibadda. (Dusha derbiga ayay ku jiraan; ma jaraan furitaan. Si aad mid u samayso, samee afar-geesle meesha daaqada derbiga ku taal kadibna riix/jiid mid ku dhex maray.) Shay kasta waa qayb: haddii aad mar kale isla shay doorato, nuqul kale ayaa la dhigaa, oo nuqul kasta wuu isbeddelaa haddii aad mid tafatirto. Waxaa sidoo kale ku muuqda liiska Qaybaha, oo leh Dhig si aad u dartid mid kale. Waxa ku jira Kooxda Waxyaabaha Albaabyo iyo daaqado Albaab, albaab labo, daaqad, daaqad ballaaran, albaabka garaashka Alaabta guriga Miis cunto, miis wareega, kursi, kursiga baarka, sofa, kursi gacan-leh, sariir labo iyo mid kali ah, miis qoraal, kabadh kitaabka, kabadh dharka Jikada iyo musqusha Kabadhka hoose iyo kan darbiga, miiska jikada, foorno, qolka dhaqidda, musqusha, mar-shaashad, musqul, tub, qulqulaha, lavabo Dhismaha Tallaabo toosan (15 tallaabo oo 18 cm), tiir wareega iyo tiir afar-geesle, beam Goobta iyo dadka Geed, geed-hoose, qof (1.75 m), gaari Entourage: geedo, dad iyo gaarii Geedo qalaad (4, 6 iyo 10 m), geed dhir-leh, geed tiir-tiir ah, geed-hoose wareeg iyo yar, geed-hoose ku hab, dhir koob ku jirta, dad taagan iyo socda, carruur, sedan iyo SUV: qaabab wareegsan oo midabkooda u gaar ah, loogu talagalay sawirada la sameeyay iyo qorshayaasha goobaha Waa qaabab fudud, oo laga sameeyay jirdillo aad rinji karto, cabbiri karto ama kaligaa samayn karto oo beddeli karto. Kabadhka darbiga wuxuu ku dhex dhegtaa 1.45 m meesha aad gujisay ka sareysa. Entourage-ka waxaa sameeyay CadCraft oo xor u ah in lagu isticmaalo wax kasta (CC0); geedaha, dadka iyo gaarida isku mid ahi waxay ku jiraan Library library-ga BimCraft iyo CadCraft. Daaqadaha gaariga waxaa lagu rinjiyaa agabka Muraayad midab leh, sidaas darteed waa hufan yihiin sawirrada. Qolka alaabta u dhig sawir Dooro dabaqa qolka (dhinac heer ah oo kor u eegaya, moodeelka ama kooxda gudaheeda) oo isticmaal Habee › Qolka alaabta u dhig… (badhanka Alaabta u dhig). Dooro waxa qolku yahay — qolka jiifka, qolka fadhiga, qolka cuntada, musqusha, musqusha ama xafiiska — ama u ogolow inuu qiyaaso cabbirka. Alaabta bilowga waxay u socotaa darbiyada, si ay u bilowdo darbiga ugu dheer, hadba meel ay jirto; waxba ma isku dhacayo, iyo jiidista albaabka bilowga ah ee lagu dhigay derbiyada qolka (iyo ballaca daaqadahooda, hortaal alaabta dheer) waa ka bilaa. Waa qorshe caadi ah oo xeerar ah oo aad dib u eegtid, ma aha naqshad: qolka isku mid waa had iyo jeer isla qorshaha. Wax walba waxay ku jiraan hal kooxda oo calaamadda Alaabta (Furniture), hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah: Ka noqo, tirtir kooxda ama qari calaamadda si aad uga saarto. Shay aan ku habboonayn waa la magacaabaa xaaladda, waxaana lagu liistaa Dhibaatooyinka sida xusuus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"openings","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Samee furaha darbiga dhex-marka","summary":"Sawir daaqad ama albaab darbi ah oo leh dhumuc, kadibna riix, si darbigu u helo god dhab ah.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["daaqad","albaab","furaha","god","darbi","jar","riix-dhex-marka","madhan","dhumuc","facade"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-darbi-aad-ku-tababarto","text":"Samee darbi aad ku tababarto","level":2},{"id":"sawir-furka","text":"Sawir furka","level":2},{"id":"riix-dhex-marka","text":"Riix dhex-marka","level":2},{"id":"albaab","text":"Albaab","level":2},{"id":"daaqado-badan-oo-cabbir-isku-mid-ah","text":"Daaqado badan oo cabbir isku mid ah","level":2},{"id":"haddii-aanu-gooyin-dhex-mara","text":"Haddii aanu gooyin dhex-mara","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFuraha waxaa loo baahan yahay darbi leh laba dhinac: sanduuq, ama darbi aad ku samaysay isagoo sare u jiiday laydh dheer oo khafiif ah. Wejiga keli ah ee taagan ma laha wax uu ku dhex mari karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-darbi-aad-ku-tababarto\"\u003ESamee darbi aad ku tababarto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji geesta dhulka oo qor \u003Ccode\u003E6m,0.3m\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E20&#039;,12&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji laydhka oo qor \u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad leedahay darbi dhumucdiisu tahay 300 mm (12 in).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-furka\"\u003ESawir furka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg si aad u aragto dhinaca dheer ee darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU tilmaam wejiga darbiga, kadibna guji meesha geesta hoose ee daaqadda ay tahay. Talada waxay leedahay &quot;Wejiga dushiisa&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor ballaca iyo dherer daaqadda, sida \u003Ccode\u003E1.2m,1.5m\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E4&#039;,5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqaddu waa wejigeeda gaarka ah gudaha wejiga darbiga, kaas oo hadda god ku wareegsan leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu dhigto masaafo saxda ah geesta iyo dhulka, marka hore isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Ehagayaasha\u003C/a\u003E: leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeef\u003C/span\u003E, jiid khadad hagaya ka soo baxa geesaha hoose iyo dhamaadka darbiga, kadibna bilow laydhka meesha laba hage isku gudbaan (talada waxay leedahay &quot;Hagaha dushiisa&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riix-dhex-marka\"\u003ERiix dhex-marka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga daaqadda oo riix gudaha darbiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaajiso ilaa uu ku joogsado wejiga dambe, kadibna guji. Ama qor dhumucda darbiga, \u003Ccode\u003E300\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu joogsadaa wejiga ka dambeeya oo wuu furaa: darbigu hadda wuxuu leeyahay god toos ah oo dhex mara, afar wejiyo dhinac ah (jambs, head iyo sill) oo ku xidhan godka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka shayga\u003C/span\u003E weli wuxuu u yeedhaa darbiga jidh xidhan markii la kooxeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad riixdo ka yar dhumucda oo dhan, waxaad heleysaa godka halkii aad ka heli lahayd god dhex-mara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"albaab\"\u003EAlbaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir laydhka adigoo bilaabaya geesta hoose ee wejiga darbiga (talada waxay leedahay &quot;Dhinaca dushiisa&quot; ama &quot;Dhamaadka&quot;), si furku dhulka u gaaro. Riix isla siyaabaha kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daaqado-badan-oo-cabbir-isku-mid-ah\"\u003EDaaqado badan oo cabbir isku mid ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee furka koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurka xigta, sawir laydhka, kadibna laba jibbaar ku dhufo mid kasta oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E: laba jibbaarka wuxuu ku celiyaa masaafadii u dambaysay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/push-pull#repeat-the-last-distance\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/push-pull\" data-hash=\"repeat-the-last-distance\"\u003ERiix oo jiid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-aanu-gooyin-dhex-mara\"\u003EHaddii aanu gooyin dhex-mara\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaydhka waa in lagu sawiraa \u003Cstrong\u003Edushiisa\u003C/strong\u003E darbiga. Haddii laga sawiray hawada hortiisa, waa wejiga gooni ah: ka noqo oo mar kale sawir, bilaw wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiixitaanku wuxuu joogsadaa wejiga ugu horreeya ee ka dambeeya furka. Haddii wax kale ku jiro darbiga dhexdiisa (wejiga dhexe ee ka haray sawirkii hore), wuu halkaas joogsanayaa; tirtir geesaha wejigaas kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJoomitari ku jira kooxda gaarka ah lama jarin. Fur kooxda ku haysa darbiga oo sawir furka gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Furaha waxaa loo baahan yahay darbi leh laba dhinac: sanduuq, ama darbi aad ku samaysay isagoo sare u jiiday laydh dheer oo khafiif ah. Wejiga keli ah ee taagan ma laha wax uu ku dhex mari karo. Samee darbi aad ku tababarto Riix R, guji geesta dhulka oo qor 6m,0.3m (ama 20',12\"), kadibna Enter. Riix P, guji laydhka oo qor 3m (ama 10'), kadibna Enter. Waxaad leedahay darbi dhumucdiisu tahay 300 mm (12 in). Sawir furka Wareeg si aad u aragto dhinaca dheer ee darbiga. Riix R. U tilmaam wejiga darbiga, kadibna guji meesha geesta hoose ee daaqadda ay tahay. Talada waxay leedahay \"Wejiga dushiisa\". Qor ballaca iyo dherer daaqadda, sida 1.2m,1.5m (ama 4',5'), kadibna riix Enter. Daaqaddu waa wejigeeda gaarka ah gudaha wejiga darbiga, kaas oo hadda god ku wareegsan leh. Si aad ugu dhigto masaafo saxda ah geesta iyo dhulka, marka hore isticmaal hagayaasha: leh Teef, jiid khadad hagaya ka soo baxa geesaha hoose iyo dhamaadka darbiga, kadibna bilow laydhka meesha laba hage isku gudbaan (talada waxay leedahay \"Hagaha dushiisa\"). Riix dhex-marka Riix P. Guji wejiga daaqadda oo riix gudaha darbiga. Dhaqaajiso ilaa uu ku joogsado wejiga dambe, kadibna guji. Ama qor dhumucda darbiga, 300 (ama 12), kadibna riix Enter. ModelCraft wuxuu joogsadaa wejiga ka dambeeya oo wuu furaa: darbigu hadda wuxuu leeyahay god toos ah oo dhex mara, afar wejiyo dhinac ah (jambs, head iyo sill) oo ku xidhan godka. Macluumaadka shayga weli wuxuu u yeedhaa darbiga jidh xidhan markii la kooxeeyo. Haddii aad riixdo ka yar dhumucda oo dhan, waxaad heleysaa godka halkii aad ka heli lahayd god dhex-mara. Albaab Sawir laydhka adigoo bilaabaya geesta hoose ee wejiga darbiga (talada waxay leedahay \"Dhinaca dushiisa\" ama \"Dhamaadka\"), si furku dhulka u gaaro. Riix isla siyaabaha kale. Daaqado badan oo cabbir isku mid ah Samee furka koowaad. Furka xigta, sawir laydhka, kadibna laba jibbaar ku dhufo mid kasta oo Riix/jiid: laba jibbaarka wuxuu ku celiyaa masaafadii u dambaysay. Eeg Riix oo jiid. Haddii aanu gooyin dhex-mara Laydhka waa in lagu sawiraa dushiisa darbiga. Haddii laga sawiray hawada hortiisa, waa wejiga gooni ah: ka noqo oo mar kale sawir, bilaw wejiga. Riixitaanku wuxuu joogsadaa wejiga ugu horreeya ee ka dambeeya furka. Haddii wax kale ku jiro darbiga dhexdiisa (wejiga dhexe ee ka haray sawirkii hore), wuu halkaas joogsanayaa; tirtir geesaha wejigaas kadibna isku day mar kale. Joomitari ku jira kooxda gaarka ah lama jarin. Fur kooxda ku haysa darbiga oo sawir furka gudaha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"stretch","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qaybaha ballaadhaya","summary":"Samee mid ka mid ah nuqullada qayb ballac, qoto ama joog ka weyn iyada oo qaybaha ku jira cabbirradooda ku sii haya: miis dheer oo lugaha isku mid ah, rafka buugaag oo dheer oo rafyadiisu kala fidsan, iyo waardiye oo tiirarkiisu ku celcelinayaan.","section":"tasks","order":41,"keywords":["qayb firfircoon","ballaadhi","dib u cabbir qayb","parametric","magacyada cabbirka","ku celi","array","lugaha","rafyada","waardiyaha","xeerarka","doorsoomayaasha"],"headings":[{"id":"fidi-nuqul","text":"Fidi nuqul","level":2},{"id":"xeerarka","text":"Xeerarka","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah","text":"Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka qayb wax kasta oo ku jira ayuu weynaysiinayaa, lugaha iyo xariiqyadana. \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFidi nuqulkan…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu beddelaa ballaca, qotada ama joogta qayb, iyada oo qayb kasta raacaysa xeer: sariirta miiska ayaa weyneysa, lugihiisana dhumucdooda ayay ku sii haysaan oo dhamaadyada ayay ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay shaqeysaa qaybaha ka kooban qaybo, yacni kooxo ama qaybo gudaha qaybta ku jira, sida wax kasta oo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/starter\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/starter\"\u003Emaktabadda bilowga\u003C/a\u003E ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fidi-nuqul\"\u003EFidi nuqul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFidi nuqulkan…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallac (casaan)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto (cagaar)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog (buluug)\u003C/span\u003E cusub, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulkaas kaliya ayaa isbeddelaya: wuxuu noqonayaa qayb u gaar ah, oo xasuusanaysa asalka uu ka soo jeedo. Mar kasta oo aad mar kale ballaadhiso, dib ayaa loo xisaabinayaa asalka, sidaas darteed waxba ma kala jabaan. Nuqullada kale ee asalka ayaa sidii ay ahaayeen ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xeerarka\"\u003EXeerarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta (ku dhufo laba jeer) oo dooro mid ka mid ah qaybaheeda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka qaybtu fidayso\u003C/span\u003E, oo xeer ku jira casaan, cagaar iyo buluug:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXeer\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaybtu waxa ay sameysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu weynaadaa marka qaybta la weynaysiiyo; masaafadiisa labada dhinac way sii jiraan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESariirta miiska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu sii jir bilowga\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu sii jir dhamaadka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirkiisa iyo masaafadiisa dhinacaas ayuu ku sii haystaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELugaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU guuri isbarbar dhig\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirkiisa ayuu ku sii haystaa; dhexdiisu isbarbar dhig ayay u guurtaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaafyada, gacanta albaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir isbarbar dhig\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeeshiisa iyo cabbirkiisa labaduba isbarbar dhig ayay ku jiraan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETallaabooyinka jaranjarada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqullo ka mid ah, mar-mar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMid kasta\u003C/span\u003E), meeshii ay ka bilaabanto ilaa dhinaca fog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirarka waardiyaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToos ah\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ayuu xeerka hal mid u go&#039;aamiyaa oo wuxuu muujiyaa kan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E marka qaybtu qaybta oo dhan ku fidsan tahay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU guuri isbarbar dhig\u003C/span\u003E marka ay dhexda ku sii jirto, haddii kale waxay ku sii jirtaa dhinaca ay ugu dhow tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah\"\u003EWaxyaabaha muhiimka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha qaabkooda gaarka ah way wadaagaan, sidaas darteed nuqulka la fidiyay waa fudud yahay. Wax ka beddelka qayb wuxuu isbeddelaa nuqul kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la fidiyay ma raaco isbeddelada dambe ee xeerarka ama qaabka asalka: dib u fidi si aad u soo gashid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDusha si xor ah loogu sawiray qaybta gudaheeda (ma aha qayb) cabbirkooda way ku sii haystaan; ka dhig qayb si ay u raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXeerarka iyo asalka nuqul kasta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Cabbirka qayb wax kasta oo ku jira ayuu weynaysiinayaa, lugaha iyo xariiqyadana. Fidi nuqulkan… wuxuu beddelaa ballaca, qotada ama joogta qayb, iyada oo qayb kasta raacaysa xeer: sariirta miiska ayaa weyneysa, lugihiisana dhumucdooda ayay ku sii haysaan oo dhamaadyada ayay ku sii jiraan. Waxay shaqeysaa qaybaha ka kooban qaybo, yacni kooxo ama qaybo gudaha qaybta ku jira, sida wax kasta oo maktabadda bilowga ku jira. Fidi nuqul Dooro qaybta. Gudaha Macluumaadka, riix Fidi nuqulkan…. Ku qor Ballac (casaan), Qoto (cagaar) iyo Joog (buluug) cusub, kadibna riix Ballaadhi. Nuqulkaas kaliya ayaa isbeddelaya: wuxuu noqonayaa qayb u gaar ah, oo xasuusanaysa asalka uu ka soo jeedo. Mar kasta oo aad mar kale ballaadhiso, dib ayaa loo xisaabinayaa asalka, sidaas darteed waxba ma kala jabaan. Nuqullada kale ee asalka ayaa sidii ay ahaayeen ku sii jiraan. Xeerarka Fur qaybta (ku dhufo laba jeer) oo dooro mid ka mid ah qaybaheeda. Macluumaadka wuxuu muujinayaa Marka qaybtu fidayso, oo xeer ku jira casaan, cagaar iyo buluug: Xeer Qaybtu waxa ay sameysaa Tusaale Ballaadhi Wuu weynaadaa marka qaybta la weynaysiiyo; masaafadiisa labada dhinac way sii jiraan Sariirta miiska Ku sii jir bilowga / Ku sii jir dhamaadka Cabbirkiisa iyo masaafadiisa dhinacaas ayuu ku sii haystaa Lugaha U guuri isbarbar dhig Cabbirkiisa ayuu ku sii haystaa; dhexdiisu isbarbar dhig ayay u guurtaa Raafyada, gacanta albaabka Cabbir isbarbar dhig Meeshiisa iyo cabbirkiisa labaduba isbarbar dhig ayay ku jiraan Tallaabooyinka jaranjarada Ku celi Nuqullo ka mid ah, mar-mar (Mid kasta), meeshii ay ka bilaabanto ilaa dhinaca fog Tiirarka waardiyaha Toos ah (bilowga) ayuu xeerka hal mid u go'aamiyaa oo wuxuu muujiyaa kan: Ballaadhi marka qaybtu qaybta oo dhan ku fidsan tahay, U guuri isbarbar dhig marka ay dhexda ku sii jirto, haddii kale waxay ku sii jirtaa dhinaca ay ugu dhow tahay. Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah Qaybaha qaabkooda gaarka ah way wadaagaan, sidaas darteed nuqulka la fidiyay waa fudud yahay. Wax ka beddelka qayb wuxuu isbeddelaa nuqul kasta. Nuqulka la fidiyay ma raaco isbeddelada dambe ee xeerarka ama qaabka asalka: dib u fidi si aad u soo gashid. Dusha si xor ah loogu sawiray qaybta gudaheeda (ma aha qayb) cabbirkooda way ku sii haystaan; ka dhig qayb si ay u raacaan. Xeerarka iyo asalka nuqul kasta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"select","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dooro waxyaabaha","summary":"Riix, riix laba jeer iyo saddex jeer, jiid daaqad ama sanduuq taabasho, ku dar iyo ka saar furayaasha wax-beddelka, iyo tirtir.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["dooro","doorasho","daaqad","taabasho","ku dar doorasho","ka saar doorasho","dooro dhammaan","riix saddex jeer","riix laba jeer","tirtir","masax"],"headings":[{"id":"riix","text":"Riix","level":2},{"id":"jiid-sanduuq","text":"Jiid sanduuq","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-iyo-ka-saar","text":"Ku dar iyo ka saar","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-doorashada","text":"Ka saar doorashada","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-waxa-la-doortay","text":"Tirtir waxa la doortay","level":2},{"id":"dooro-gudaha-kooxda","text":"Dooro gudaha kooxda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) waa qalabka ModelCraft ku bilaabato, oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku soo celiyo. Waxyaabaha la doortay waxay u rogmadaan buluug, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E midig ayaa sheegaya waxa ay yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riix\"\u003ERiix\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu doortaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix dhinac ama geeso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinaca ama geesta taas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxda oo dhan ama qaybta oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer riix dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinaca iyo geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer riix geeso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta iyo labada dhinac ee dhinacyada ku taal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer riix kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la furaa si loo tafatiro (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex jeer riix dhinac ama geeso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax kasta oo ku xiran: shayga oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix meel banaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba (nadiifi doorashada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer riix meel banaan intaad kooxda tafatirayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxda waa la xirayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha way fudud yihiin in la taabto marka dhinacyada: marka mouse-ku ku dhow yahay geeso dhowr pixel gudahood, riixitaanku wuxuu doortaa geesta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiid-sanduuq\"\u003EJiid sanduuq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBidix ilaa midig\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq adag: doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003Edaaqad\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxa kaliya ee gudaha ku jira oo dhan ayaa la doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidig ilaa bidix\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq xariiqyo ah: doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003Etaabasho\u003C/strong\u003E. Wax kasta oo sanduuqu taabto ayaa la doortaa, dhinac waa la doortaa markii sanduuqu gudaha ku jiro oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda ama qaybtu waa hal shay: daaqadu waa inay haysataa oo dhan, taabashadu waxay u baahan tahay oo keliya inay taabato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-iyo-ka-saar\"\u003EKu dar iyo ka saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHay furaha markaad riixayso ama jiidayso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESaamaynta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddelaa: ku darta wax aan la dooran, ka saarta wax la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad wax walba oo moodeelka ku jira u doorato (ama wax walba oo kooxda aad tafatirayso ku jira), riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-doorashada\"\u003EKa saar doorashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E ahaan), ama riix meel banaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-waxa-la-doortay\"\u003ETirtir waxa la doortay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Dhinacyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo hagayaasha ku jira doorashada waa la tirtiraa hal tallaabo; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtirida geeso waxay tirtirtaa dhinacyada u baahan, marka laga reebo geesta oo keliya labo dhinac oo heer isku mid ah kala saarta: markaas labada dhinac waxay isku mid noqdaan. Tirtirida dhinac waxay iska tagtaa geesihiisa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/erase\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/erase\"\u003EMasax iyo nadiifi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-gudaha-kooxda\"\u003EDooro gudaha kooxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix kooxda wuxuu doortaa kooxda oo dhan. Si aad dhinac gudaha ugu doorato, laba jeer riix kooxda si aad u furto, ka dibna riix. Intii kooxdu furan tahay, riixitaanku wuxuu gaaraa oo keliya waxa gudaha ku jira; waxa kale waa la dhaadhacaa. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyada oo aan wax la dooran, ama laba jeer riix meel banaan, si aad u xirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha ku doorta magacyadooda, taas oo caawiso marka ay ka qarsoon yihiin waxyaabaha kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dooro (Space) waa qalabka ModelCraft ku bilaabato, oo Esc ku soo celiyo. Waxyaabaha la doortay waxay u rogmadaan buluug, Macluumaadka midig ayaa sheegaya waxa ay yihiin. Riix Samee tan Wuxuu doortaa Riix dhinac ama geeso Dhinaca ama geesta taas Riix kooxda ama qaybta Kooxda oo dhan ama qaybta oo dhan Laba jeer riix dhinac Dhinaca iyo geesaha Laba jeer riix geeso Geesta iyo labada dhinac ee dhinacyada ku taal Laba jeer riix kooxda ama qaybta Waa la furaa si loo tafatiro (eeg Kooxaha iyo qaybaha) Saddex jeer riix dhinac ama geeso Wax kasta oo ku xiran: shayga oo dhan Riix meel banaan Waxba (nadiifi doorashada) Laba jeer riix meel banaan intaad kooxda tafatirayso Kooxda waa la xirayaa Geesaha way fudud yihiin in la taabto marka dhinacyada: marka mouse-ku ku dhow yahay geeso dhowr pixel gudahood, riixitaanku wuxuu doortaa geesta. Jiid sanduuq Bidix ilaa midig wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq adag: doorasho daaqad. Waxa kaliya ee gudaha ku jira oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. Midig ilaa bidix wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq xariiqyo ah: doorasho taabasho. Wax kasta oo sanduuqu taabto ayaa la doortaa, dhinac waa la doortaa markii sanduuqu gudaha ku jiro oo dhan. Kooxda ama qaybtu waa hal shay: daaqadu waa inay haysataa oo dhan, taabashadu waxay u baahan tahay oo keliya inay taabato. Ku dar iyo ka saar Hay furaha markaad riixayso ama jiidayso: Furaha Saamaynta Shift Beddelaa: ku darta wax aan la dooran, ka saarta wax la doortay Ctrl Ku dara Shift iyo Ctrl wada Ka saara Si aad wax walba oo moodeelka ku jira u doorato (ama wax walba oo kooxda aad tafatirayso ku jira), riix Ctrl+A. Ka saar doorashada Riix Esc (qalabka Dooro ahaan), ama riix meel banaan. Tirtir waxa la doortay Riix Delete ama Backspace. Dhinacyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo hagayaasha ku jira doorashada waa la tirtiraa hal tallaabo; Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celiya. Tirtirida geeso waxay tirtirtaa dhinacyada u baahan, marka laga reebo geesta oo keliya labo dhinac oo heer isku mid ah kala saarta: markaas labada dhinac waxay isku mid noqdaan. Tirtirida dhinac waxay iska tagtaa geesihiisa. Eeg Masax iyo nadiifi. Dooro gudaha kooxda Riix kooxda wuxuu doortaa kooxda oo dhan. Si aad dhinac gudaha ugu doorato, laba jeer riix kooxda si aad u furto, ka dibna riix. Intii kooxdu furan tahay, riixitaanku wuxuu gaaraa oo keliya waxa gudaha ku jira; waxa kale waa la dhaadhacaa. Riix Esc iyada oo aan wax la dooran, ama laba jeer riix meel banaan, si aad u xirto. Liiska bidixda ayaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha ku doorta magacyadooda, taas oo caawiso marka ay ka qarsoon yihiin waxyaabaha kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"paint","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Rinji midabyo iyo agab","summary":"Wejiyada, kooxaha iyo komponentiyada ku sii midab adag ama agab sida brick, siding, shingles ama alwaax, oo hay markaad soo saarto.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["rinji","midab","agab","tekstuur","brick","siding","shingles","roofing","alwaax","dhagax","tile","concrete","stucco","cawsha","kaarar","glass","bir","baalasha rinjiga","buuxi","muunad","qalin midab","caadi","glb","obj","mtl","collada"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-midab","text":"Dooro midab","level":2},{"id":"rinji","text":"Rinji","level":2},{"id":"rinji-agab","text":"Rinji agab","level":2},{"id":"komponentiyada-iyo-midabyada","text":"Komponentiyada iyo midabyada","level":2},{"id":"midabyada-faylasha","text":"Midabyada faylasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMidabyadu waxay kaa caawiyaan inaad kala soocdo qaybaha moodelka, \u003Cstrong\u003Eagabyada\u003C/strong\u003E (brick, siding, roofing, alwaax, dhagax, tile, concrete, stucco, cawsha, glass, bir) ayaana ka dhigaya inay u eg yihiin waxa ay ka dhisan yihiin. Labaduba si isku mid ah ayay u rinjiyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-midab\"\u003EDooro midab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabyada\u003C/span\u003E ee midig waxa ay muujinaysaa safka midabyada adag, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E (kan khad lagu gudbiyay: midab la&#039;aan) iyo muunad midab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E midab kasta oo kale. Guji mid si uu noqdo midabka hadda. Qalabka Rinji wuxuu ku bilaabaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rinji\"\u003ERinji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E), ama, markaad waxba dooran, guji midab. (Markaad wax dooran, guji midab wuxuu isla markiiba rinjiyaa xulashada.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga si aad u rinjiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji kooxda ama komponentka si aad nuqulkaas u rinjiso: wejigiisa aan midab u lahayn wuxuu qaadanayaa midabkan. Wejiyada aad gudaheeda ku rinjisay way hayaan kuwoodii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad wax badan isla mar u rinjiso, marka hore dooro, kadibna guji midab, ama guji mid ka mid ah iyaga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOo guji wejiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la rinjiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejigaas keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada oo dhan ee isku xidhan oo midab isku mid ah leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada oo dhan ee midabkaas leh kooxda aad ku shaqeyso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba: waxaad qaadaysaa midabkaas halkii\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad wejiga midab la&#039;aan ugu celiso, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E oo guji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rinji-agab\"\u003ERinji agab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgabka\u003C/span\u003E, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabyada\u003C/span\u003E, waxay liisteysaa maktabadda agabka nooca ahaan: brick iyo block, siding, roofing, alwaax, dhagax, tile, concrete, stucco, dhul, glass iyo bir. Ku dul mari muunadka si aad magacooda u aragto. Guji mid, kadibna ku rinji si isku mid ah sida midabka: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji wejiyada, kooxaha ama komponentiyada; ama marka hore dooro oo guji agabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabka \u003Cstrong\u003EShaded\u003C/strong\u003E wejiyadu waxay muujiyaan tekstuurka agabka. Hidden line, wireframe iyo x-ray waxay muujiyaan midabkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETekstuuradu waxay \u003Cstrong\u003Eu socdaan siman dhinac kasta wejiga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Esare ahaan\u003C/strong\u003E: safka brick-ka wuu siman yahay derbi kasta, shingles waxay ku socdaan jiidda saqafka, alwaaxyada sagxadda waxay raacaan jihada casaanka. Waxay ku yaalliyaan cabbirkooda dhabta ah (brick qiyaastii 215 mm dherer), sidaas darteed way u muuqdaan sax meel kasta oo ay ka arkaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawir rendar\u003C/a\u003E agabku waxa ay hayaan tekstuurkooda, xagnimadooda (roughness) iyo, glass iyo bir, dhalaalkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa agabka wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETekstuuradan ModelCraft laftiisa ayaa naqshadeeya, sidaas darteed way shaqeeyaan khadka ka baxsan, waxaana bilaash loo isticmaali karaa wax kasta (CC0).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"komponentiyada-iyo-midabyada\"\u003EKomponentiyada iyo midabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMidab lagu rinjiyo wejiga \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha\u003C/strong\u003E komponent kasta wuxuu muuqdaa nuqul kasta, sababtoo ah nuqullada waxay wadaagaan hal qeexid. Midab lagu rinjiyo \u003Cstrong\u003Enuqul\u003C/strong\u003E dibadda ka (komponentka oo xidhan) waxa uu u gaar yahay nuqulkaas oo keliya, sidaas darteed laba nuqul oo komponent isku mid ah midabyo kala duwan ayey yeelan karaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa midabka wejiga, kooxda ama komponentka la doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midabyada-faylasha\"\u003EMidabyada faylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa midab kasta iyo agab kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka kale waxay helaan \u003Cstrong\u003Emidabka agabka\u003C/strong\u003E (muuqiisa marka laga fogeeyo) halkii tekstuurka: glTF, Collada, OBJ, DWG iyo DXF, iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D. glTF, Collada iyo OBJ-ga agabku wuxuu hayaa magacisa, sida \u003Ccode\u003EMaterial_brick-red\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EglTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/strong\u003E: midab kasta wuxuu noqdaa agab. Komponent lagu muujiyo midabyo kala duwan waxa loo qoraa midab kasta mar. glTF wuxuu sidoo kale qoraa tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay sida tekstuur.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E: soo saaristu waxay soo dejisaa laba fayl, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E iyo fayl agabka \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E oo midabyada leh. Ku hay isla folder. Tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyo sawirradu waxay yimaadaan hal \u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa midabyada saxda ah; \u003Cstrong\u003EDXF\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa midabka ugu dhow ee 255 midab CAD caadi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EPLY\u003C/strong\u003E waxay qaadaan midabyo: STL waxa uu raacaa habka VisCAM / SolidView (barnaamijyada aan akhrin ka tegaan), PLY waxa uu midab ku yeelaa dhibic kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\"\u003EQaababka faylasha si faahfaahsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u moodeesho shaashad, rinji xudunta midab dhuxul ah iyo glass-ka midab buluug ah kadib markaad \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/draw-faces\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/draw-faces\"\u003Eoffset\u003C/a\u003E wejiga hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Midabyadu waxay kaa caawiyaan inaad kala soocdo qaybaha moodelka, agabyada (brick, siding, roofing, alwaax, dhagax, tile, concrete, stucco, cawsha, glass, bir) ayaana ka dhigaya inay u eg yihiin waxa ay ka dhisan yihiin. Labaduba si isku mid ah ayay u rinjiyaan. Dooro midab Qaybta Midabyada ee midig waxa ay muujinaysaa safka midabyada adag, Caadi (kan khad lagu gudbiyay: midab la'aan) iyo muunad midab + midab kasta oo kale. Guji mid si uu noqdo midabka hadda. Qalabka Rinji wuxuu ku bilaabaa. Rinji Riix B (Rinji), ama, markaad waxba dooran, guji midab. (Markaad wax dooran, guji midab wuxuu isla markiiba rinjiyaa xulashada.) Guji wejiga si aad u rinjiso. Guji kooxda ama komponentka si aad nuqulkaas u rinjiso: wejigiisa aan midab u lahayn wuxuu qaadanayaa midabkan. Wejiyada aad gudaheeda ku rinjisay way hayaan kuwoodii. Si aad wax badan isla mar u rinjiso, marka hore dooro, kadibna guji midab, ama guji mid ka mid ah iyaga Rinji. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo. Hay Oo guji wejiga Waxa la rinjiyo — Wejigaas keliya Ctrl Wejiyada oo dhan ee isku xidhan oo midab isku mid ah leh Shift Wejiyada oo dhan ee midabkaas leh kooxda aad ku shaqeyso Alt Waxba: waxaad qaadaysaa midabkaas halkii Si aad wejiga midab la'aan ugu celiso, dooro Caadi oo guji. Rinji agab Qaybta Agabka, hoosta Midabyada, waxay liisteysaa maktabadda agabka nooca ahaan: brick iyo block, siding, roofing, alwaax, dhagax, tile, concrete, stucco, dhul, glass iyo bir. Ku dul mari muunadka si aad magacooda u aragto. Guji mid, kadibna ku rinji si isku mid ah sida midabka: B, guji wejiyada, kooxaha ama komponentiyada; ama marka hore dooro oo guji agabka. Habka Shaded wejiyadu waxay muujiyaan tekstuurka agabka. Hidden line, wireframe iyo x-ray waxay muujiyaan midabkiisa. Tekstuuradu waxay u socdaan siman dhinac kasta wejiga iyo sare ahaan: safka brick-ka wuu siman yahay derbi kasta, shingles waxay ku socdaan jiidda saqafka, alwaaxyada sagxadda waxay raacaan jihada casaanka. Waxay ku yaalliyaan cabbirkooda dhabta ah (brick qiyaastii 215 mm dherer), sidaas darteed way u muuqdaan sax meel kasta oo ay ka arkaan. Sawirka sawir rendar agabku waxa ay hayaan tekstuurkooda, xagnimadooda (roughness) iyo, glass iyo bir, dhalaalkooda. Alt-guji Rinji wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa agabka wejiga. Tekstuuradan ModelCraft laftiisa ayaa naqshadeeya, sidaas darteed way shaqeeyaan khadka ka baxsan, waxaana bilaash loo isticmaali karaa wax kasta (CC0). Komponentiyada iyo midabyada Midab lagu rinjiyo wejiga gudaha komponent kasta wuxuu muuqdaa nuqul kasta, sababtoo ah nuqullada waxay wadaagaan hal qeexid. Midab lagu rinjiyo nuqul dibadda ka (komponentka oo xidhan) waxa uu u gaar yahay nuqulkaas oo keliya, sidaas darteed laba nuqul oo komponent isku mid ah midabyo kala duwan ayey yeelan karaan. Macluumaadka wuxuu muujiyaa midabka wejiga, kooxda ama komponentka la doortay. Midabyada faylasha Faylka ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa midab kasta iyo agab kasta. Qaababka kale waxay helaan midabka agabka (muuqiisa marka laga fogeeyo) halkii tekstuurka: glTF, Collada, OBJ, DWG iyo DXF, iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D. glTF, Collada iyo OBJ-ga agabku wuxuu hayaa magacisa, sida Material_brick-red. glTF (.glb) iyo Collada (.dae): midab kasta wuxuu noqdaa agab. Komponent lagu muujiyo midabyo kala duwan waxa loo qoraa midab kasta mar. glTF wuxuu sidoo kale qoraa tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay sida tekstuur. OBJ: soo saaristu waxay soo dejisaa laba fayl, .obj iyo fayl agabka .mtl oo midabyada leh. Ku hay isla folder. Tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay, .obj, .mtl iyo sawirradu waxay yimaadaan hal .zip. DWG wuxuu hayaa midabyada saxda ah; DXF wuxuu isticmaalaa midabka ugu dhow ee 255 midab CAD caadi ah. STL iyo PLY waxay qaadaan midabyo: STL waxa uu raacaa habka VisCAM / SolidView (barnaamijyada aan akhrin ka tegaan), PLY waxa uu midab ku yeelaa dhibic kasta. Eeg Qaababka faylasha si faahfaahsan. Si aad u moodeesho shaashad, rinji xudunta midab dhuxul ah iyo glass-ka midab buluug ah kadib markaad offset wejiga hore.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solids","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qalabka jirdilka: isku geyn, jar, isgoys","summary":"Ku xidh kooxaha iyo qaybaha xidhan mid, ka jar mid mid kale, ama hay kaliya waxa ay wada leeyihiin.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["jirdil","jirdillo","baaritaanka jirdilka","mid aan jirdil ahayn","hagaaji jirdilka","god","geeso kala go'an","gudaha dibadda","isku geyn","isku dhufo","isku darso","ka jar","farqiga","jar","isgoys","isgoysyada","boolean","qolof dibadeed"],"headings":[{"id":"marka-wax-aan-jirdil-ahayn","text":"Marka wax aan jirdil ahayn","level":2},{"id":"isku-geyn","text":"Isku geyn","level":2},{"id":"ka-jar","text":"Ka jar","level":2},{"id":"isgoys","text":"Isgoys","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-ogaan-karo","text":"Waxyaabo la ogaan karo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabka jirdilka waxay isku daraan \u003Cstrong\u003Ejirdillada\u003C/strong\u003E: kooxyada iyo qaybaha dhinacyadoodu xidhaan mugga, geesaha kasta oo isku xidhaya laba dhinac oo saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirdil\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHaa\u003C/span\u003E mid kasta, wuxuuna muujinayaa mugga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ku jiraan menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-wax-aan-jirdil-ahayn\"\u003EMarka wax aan jirdil ahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro kooxda ama qaybta. Haddii aanay jirdil ahayn, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E waxay sheegaysaa sababta, tusaale ahaan &quot;Ma aha jirdil: 4 geesood godka ku dhow · 1 geeso kala go&#039;an&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhibaatada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheeda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha godka ku dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac ayaa maqan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha saddex dhinac ama ka badan wada leeyihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac ayaa qaybinaya gudaha, ama labada qaab ayaa isku taabta geeso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyada gudaha qaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDerbi ka hadhay gudaha mugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha kala go&#039;an\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo aan dhinac xidhin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyada gudaha dibadda loo rogay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyadooda hore gudaha ayay ku jiraan, ka soo horjeeda jaarahooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETus dhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa iyadoo geesaha iyo dhinacyada taas ku jira la doortay, si aad u aragto. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tuntaa kiisaska fudud hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah: wuxuu tirtiraa geesaha kala go&#039;an iyo dhinacyada gudaha qaabka, wuxuu soo rogaa dhinacyada si saxda ah, wuxuuna xidhaa godadka haddii gidaarkoodu siman yahay. Waxa aan la tuntan karin si nabad ah (god aan siman, geeso ay wada leeyihiin dhinacyo badan) wuu ka tagaa adiga, wuuna sheegaa waxa ka hadhay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-geyn\"\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro laba ama ka badan jirdil (riix mid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix kuwa kale).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay noqdaan hal jirdil, hal kooxda. Halkii ay isku dhacayeen, dhinacyada gudaha ayaa baaba&#039;a.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-jar\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa jar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix jirdilka si aad \u003Cstrong\u003Euga saarto\u003C/strong\u003E (jarista).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix jirdilka si aad \u003Cstrong\u003Eu jarto\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ka hadhay jirdilka labaad ayaa jiraa; jarista waa la isticmaalaa. Tusaale ahaan, si aad godad uga samayso bloke, samee tiir ka gudbaya, u samee tiirka kooxda, kadibna ka jar tiirka bloke-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isgoys\"\u003EIsgoys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro laba ama ka badan jirdil, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsgoys\u003C/span\u003E. Kaliya qaybta ay wada leeyihiin ayaa la hayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-ogaan-karo\"\u003EWaxyaabo la ogaan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENatiijadu waa kooxda cusub. Waxay hayaa magaca, midabka iyo tagga jirdilka koowaad (Ka jar: kan aad jartay). Midabyadii dhinacyada lagu rinjiyay looma hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinacyada toosan ee natiijada waa dhinacyo keliya. Dhinacyada wareegsan waxay u muuqdaan dhinacyo toosan oo lagu sawiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii kooxda ama qaybta aan jirdil ahayn, qalabku wuxuu sheegaa kii, mana beddelo wax. Ka raadi dhinac maqan ama dhinac kala go&#039;an oo gudaha ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha kooxda furan, qalabka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kooxda iyo qaybaha kooxdaas ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalab kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay ee aad isticmaasho qalab jirdil, injineerkiisa (manifold-3d) wuu soo kacaa, taasna waxay qaadan kartaa wakhti yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qalabka jirdilka waxay isku daraan jirdillada: kooxyada iyo qaybaha dhinacyadoodu xidhaan mugga, geesaha kasta oo isku xidhaya laba dhinac oo saxda ah. Macluumaadka wuxuu sheegaa Jirdil: Haa mid kasta, wuxuuna muujinayaa mugga. Waxay ku jiraan menu-ga Jirarka kooxda Habee. Marka wax aan jirdil ahayn Dooro kooxda ama qaybta. Haddii aanay jirdil ahayn, Macluumaadka waxay sheegaysaa sababta, tusaale ahaan \"Ma aha jirdil: 4 geesood godka ku dhow · 1 geeso kala go'an\". Dhibaatada Macnaheeda Geesaha godka ku dhow Dhinac ayaa maqan Geesaha saddex dhinac ama ka badan wada leeyihiin Dhinac ayaa qaybinaya gudaha, ama labada qaab ayaa isku taabta geeso Dhinacyada gudaha qaabka Derbi ka hadhay gudaha mugga Geesaha kala go'an Xariiqyo aan dhinac xidhin Dhinacyada gudaha dibadda loo rogay Dhinacyadooda hore gudaha ayay ku jiraan, ka soo horjeeda jaarahooda Tus dhibaatooyinka wuxuu furaa iyadoo geesaha iyo dhinacyada taas ku jira la doortay, si aad u aragto. Hagaaji wuxuu tuntaa kiisaska fudud hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah: wuxuu tirtiraa geesaha kala go'an iyo dhinacyada gudaha qaabka, wuxuu soo rogaa dhinacyada si saxda ah, wuxuuna xidhaa godadka haddii gidaarkoodu siman yahay. Waxa aan la tuntan karin si nabad ah (god aan siman, geeso ay wada leeyihiin dhinacyo badan) wuu ka tagaa adiga, wuuna sheegaa waxa ka hadhay. Isku geyn Dooro laba ama ka badan jirdil (riix mid, Ctrl+riix kuwa kale). Jirarka › Isku geyn. Waxay noqdaan hal jirdil, hal kooxda. Halkii ay isku dhacayeen, dhinacyada gudaha ayaa baaba'a. Ka jar Jirarka › Ka jar. Riix jirdilka si aad uga saarto (jarista). Riix jirdilka si aad u jarto. Waxa ka hadhay jirdilka labaad ayaa jiraa; jarista waa la isticmaalaa. Tusaale ahaan, si aad godad uga samayso bloke, samee tiir ka gudbaya, u samee tiirka kooxda, kadibna ka jar tiirka bloke-ka. Isgoys Dooro laba ama ka badan jirdil, kadibna Jirarka › Isgoys. Kaliya qaybta ay wada leeyihiin ayaa la hayaa. Waxyaabo la ogaan karo Natiijadu waa kooxda cusub. Waxay hayaa magaca, midabka iyo tagga jirdilka koowaad (Ka jar: kan aad jartay). Midabyadii dhinacyada lagu rinjiyay looma hayo. Dhinacyada toosan ee natiijada waa dhinacyo keliya. Dhinacyada wareegsan waxay u muuqdaan dhinacyo toosan oo lagu sawiray. Haddii kooxda ama qaybta aan jirdil ahayn, qalabku wuxuu sheegaa kii, mana beddelo wax. Ka raadi dhinac maqan ama dhinac kala go'an oo gudaha ku jira. Gudaha kooxda furan, qalabka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kooxda iyo qaybaha kooxdaas ku jira. Qalab kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad isticmaasho qalab jirdil, injineerkiisa (manifold-3d) wuu soo kacaa, taasna waxay qaadan kartaa wakhti yar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"hide-isolate","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qari, kala saar iyo muujin","summary":"Ka dhig waxyaabaha meel fog si aad uga shaqeysid dhexdooda, ama muuji kaliya waxa aad ka shaqeyso; waxyaabaha la qariyey way qarsoon yihiin faylka dhexdiisa.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["qari","muuji","muuji dhammaan","kala saar","qari kuwa kale","tus","la qariyey","aragti maxalli ah","muuqaal","meel ka baxsan"],"headings":[{"id":"qari","text":"Qari","level":2},{"id":"kala-saar","text":"Kala saar","level":2},{"id":"muuji-dhammaan","text":"Muuji dhammaan","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-ogaado","text":"Waxyaabo la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQarinta waxay waxyaabaha meel ka baxsan dhigtaa iyadoo aan la tirtirin. Wajiga, geeska, kooxda ama qaybta la qariyey lama muujiyo, mana dhejin karo, mana guji karo, mana dooran karo. Sidaas darteed waad ka shaqayn kartaa wax ka dambeeya ama ka dhexeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qari\"\u003EQari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa la qarinayo: wajiyada, geesaha, kooxaha ama qaybaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaale ahaan, si aad uga shaqeyso meesha cidhiidhi ah ee u dhexaysa labo koox oo isku dhow, dooro kooxda hore oo qari: guji iyo dhejinta hadda waxay gaari doonaan wajiga ka dambeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-saar\"\u003EKala saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro waxa aad rabto inaad ku hayso aragtida, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsolate (hide the rest)\u003C/span\u003E. Wax kasta oo kale moodelka ka jira waa la qarinayaa, ama, markaad ku jirto tafatirka kooxda, wax kasta oo kooxda ka mid ah kuwa kale. Wajiga la doortay wuxuu hayaa geeskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-dhammaan\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mar kale muujinayaa wax kasta, kooxaha oo dhan gudahooda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa inta shay ee la qariyey marka wax la dooran, oo leh badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E halkaas sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha la qariyey xarfo jiifka ah, iyo indho xariigan; guji indhaha si aad mar kale u muujiso mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha Modeler, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu qariyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift H\"\u003E⇧H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu kala saaraa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option H\"\u003E⌥H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu muujinayaa dhammaan. (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E ayaa doorta nooca furayaasha.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxyaabo la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWixii la qariyey waa la keydiyaa faylka ModelCraft, wuxuuna ku soo noqdaa qarsoon marka la furo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxyaabaha qarsoon weli waa moodelka dhexdiisa: dhoofinta way ku jiraan, sidoo kale mugga iyo cabbirrada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQari, kala saar ama muuji kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qarinta waxay waxyaabaha meel ka baxsan dhigtaa iyadoo aan la tirtirin. Wajiga, geeska, kooxda ama qaybta la qariyey lama muujiyo, mana dhejin karo, mana guji karo, mana dooran karo. Sidaas darteed waad ka shaqayn kartaa wax ka dambeeya ama ka dhexeeya. Qari Dooro waxa la qarinayo: wajiyada, geesaha, kooxaha ama qaybaha. Edit › More › Hide. Tusaale ahaan, si aad uga shaqeyso meesha cidhiidhi ah ee u dhexaysa labo koox oo isku dhow, dooro kooxda hore oo qari: guji iyo dhejinta hadda waxay gaari doonaan wajiga ka dambeeya. Kala saar Dooro waxa aad rabto inaad ku hayso aragtida, kadibna Edit › More › Isolate (hide the rest). Wax kasta oo kale moodelka ka jira waa la qarinayaa, ama, markaad ku jirto tafatirka kooxda, wax kasta oo kooxda ka mid ah kuwa kale. Wajiga la doortay wuxuu hayaa geeskiisa. Muuji dhammaan Edit › More › Unhide all wuxuu mar kale muujinayaa wax kasta, kooxaha oo dhan gudahooda. Entity info wuxuu sheegayaa inta shay ee la qariyey marka wax la dooran, oo leh badhanka Unhide all halkaas sidoo kale. Outliner wuxuu muujinayaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha la qariyey xarfo jiifka ah, iyo indho xariigan; guji indhaha si aad mar kale u muujiso mid. Furayaasha Modeler, H wuu qariyaa, Shift+H wuu kala saaraa, Alt+H wuu muujinayaa dhammaan. (Settings › ModelCraft ayaa doorta nooca furayaasha.) Waxyaabo la ogaado Wixii la qariyey waa la keydiyaa faylka ModelCraft, wuxuuna ku soo noqdaa qarsoon marka la furo. Waxyaabaha qarsoon weli waa moodelka dhexdiisa: dhoofinta way ku jiraan, sidoo kale mugga iyo cabbirrada Entity info. Qari, kala saar ama muuji kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tags","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Calaamadaha: muuji iyo qari kooxo iyo walxo","summary":"Kooxaha iyo qaybaha ku sii calaamad, sida **Alaabta guriga**, **Darbiyada** ama **Goobta**, si aad hal mar wixii calaamadaas leh oo dhan ku qari ama ku muujiso.","section":"tasks","order":48,"keywords":["calaamadaha","calaamad","lakabyada","lakab","muuji","qari","muuqaal","habaynta","alaabta guriga","darbiyada","calaamad aan lahayn","magac calaamad","tirtir calaamad"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-calaamad","text":"Samee calaamad","level":2},{"id":"calaamee-kooxaha-iyo-qaybaha","text":"Calaamee kooxaha iyo qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"qari-iyo-muuji","text":"Qari iyo muuji","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-calaamad","text":"Tirtir calaamad","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah","text":"Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad waa magac aad siiso kooxaha iyo qaybaha, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta guriga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiyada\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta\u003C/strong\u003E, si aad hal mar wixii calaamadaas leh oo dhan ugu qarin ama ugu muujin karto. Calaamadaha ayaa barnaamijyada CAD ku yaqaan lakabyo. Si aad mid mid u qariso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003EQari, keli ka dhig iyo soo muuji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-calaamad\"\u003ESamee calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E midig, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar calaamad\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor magaceeda oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad calaamad u magac beddesho, riix magaceeda gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E, qor mid cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Laba calaamadood magac isku mid ah ma wadaagi karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamee-kooxaha-iyo-qaybaha\"\u003ECalaamee kooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro hal ama in ka badan oo kooxo ama qaybo ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E, dooro calaamadda gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad cusub…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa calaamad cusub oo xulashada calaamadeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad aan lahayn\u003C/span\u003E ayaa calaamadda ka saaraa. Lambarka ku xigta calaamad kasta gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa inta kooxood iyo qayb ayaa leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha calaamadee, ma aha dusha iyo geesaha si xor ah u jira: marka hore walxaha aad calaamadeyso ka dhig kooxo (dooro, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qari-iyo-muuji\"\u003EQari iyo muuji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix indhaha ku xigta calaamad. Wax kasta oo calaamadaas leh ayaa ka baxa aragga, meel kasta oo ay ku jiraanba moodeelka (sidoo kale gudaha kooxaha kale), riixitaanka iyo ku dhejinta way ka dhex maraan. Mar kale riix indhaha si aad u muujiso. Walxaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad aan lahayn\u003C/span\u003E marwalba way muuqdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad gudaha kooxda ka wax beddelayso oo calaamaddeeda aad qarisay, kooxdu way xirmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-calaamad\"\u003ETirtir calaamad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix qashinka ku xigta. Waxa calaamadda lahaa wuxuu noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad aan lahayn\u003C/span\u003E, wuuna muuqdaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah\"\u003EWaxyaabaha muhiimka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadaha, magacyadooda iyo kuwa qarsan ayaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Koobiyeynta kooxda calaamadeysan ee moodeel kale waxay calaamadda ku wadataa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQari iyo muujinta calaamad, iyo wax kasta oo kale oo calaamadaha ku saabsan, waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo saarista wax kasta ayaa ku jira, calaamadaha qarsanba, sida walxaha qarsan ay sameeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELakabyada naqshadaha goobta DWG iyo DXF weli ma soo gelaan calaamad ahaan: naqshadda oo dhan waxay soo gashaa hal kooxo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Calaamad waa magac aad siiso kooxaha iyo qaybaha, sida Alaabta guriga, Darbiyada ama Goobta, si aad hal mar wixii calaamadaas leh oo dhan ugu qarin ama ugu muujin karto. Calaamadaha ayaa barnaamijyada CAD ku yaqaan lakabyo. Si aad mid mid u qariso, eeg Qari, keli ka dhig iyo soo muuji. Samee calaamad Gudaha Calaamadaha midig, riix Ku dar calaamad. Qor magaceeda oo riix Enter. Si aad calaamad u magac beddesho, riix magaceeda gudaha Calaamadaha, qor mid cusub oo riix Enter. Laba calaamadood magac isku mid ah ma wadaagi karaan. Calaamee kooxaha iyo qaybaha Dooro hal ama in ka badan oo kooxo ama qaybo ah. Gudaha Macluumaadka, dooro calaamadda gudaha Calaamad. Calaamad cusub… wuxuu sameeyaa calaamad cusub oo xulashada calaamadeeyaa. Calaamad aan lahayn ayaa calaamadda ka saaraa. Lambarka ku xigta calaamad kasta gudaha Calaamadaha wuxuu sheegayaa inta kooxood iyo qayb ayaa leh. Kooxaha iyo qaybaha calaamadee, ma aha dusha iyo geesaha si xor ah u jira: marka hore walxaha aad calaamadeyso ka dhig kooxo (dooro, kadibna Shift+G). Qari iyo muuji Riix indhaha ku xigta calaamad. Wax kasta oo calaamadaas leh ayaa ka baxa aragga, meel kasta oo ay ku jiraanba moodeelka (sidoo kale gudaha kooxaha kale), riixitaanka iyo ku dhejinta way ka dhex maraan. Mar kale riix indhaha si aad u muujiso. Walxaha Calaamad aan lahayn marwalba way muuqdaan. Haddii aad gudaha kooxda ka wax beddelayso oo calaamaddeeda aad qarisay, kooxdu way xirmaysaa. Tirtir calaamad Riix qashinka ku xigta. Waxa calaamadda lahaa wuxuu noqdaa Calaamad aan lahayn, wuuna muuqdaa. Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah Calaamadaha, magacyadooda iyo kuwa qarsan ayaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Koobiyeynta kooxda calaamadeysan ee moodeel kale waxay calaamadda ku wadataa. Qari iyo muujinta calaamad, iyo wax kasta oo kale oo calaamadaha ku saabsan, waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Soo saarista wax kasta ayaa ku jira, calaamadaha qarsanba, sida walxaha qarsan ay sameeyaan. Lakabyada naqshadaha goobta DWG iyo DXF weli ma soo gelaan calaamad ahaan: naqshadda oo dhan waxay soo gashaa hal kooxo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sections","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Diyaaradaha goynta: fur moodeelka","summary":"Ku dhig diyaarad goynta si aad u aragto gudaha moodeelka, u dhaqaaji, rog, ama damee goynta.","section":"tasks","order":49,"keywords":["goyn","qorshaha goynta","goynta","goyn ka baxsan","jiid","gudaha","qorshaha dabaqa","jeexjeex","goyn toosan"],"headings":[{"id":"dhig-mid","text":"Dhig mid","level":2},{"id":"u-dhaqaaji-rog-damee","text":"U dhaqaaji, rog, damee","level":2},{"id":"muuji-iyo-qari","text":"Muuji iyo qari","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato","text":"Waxyaabo aad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDiyaaraddu goynta waxay furtaa moodeelka si aad uga shaqeyso gudihiisa: qorshaha dabaqa guri, gudaha kabaad. Moodeelka lama beddelo; goynta waa muuqaal keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-mid\"\u003EDhig mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaamerada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji dusha. Diyaaraddu waxa lagu dhigaa dusha, afar fallaado ah oo kuu soo jeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa guji meel kasta oo aan dusha ahayn si aad u dhigto diyaarad laba-geesood ah oo ugu toosan jihada aad inta badan eegto. Riix fallaadha hore (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) si aad u dhigto casaan toosan, (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) cagaar ama (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) buluug halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca fallaadhaha ku tilmaamaya waa \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga gooyay\u003C/strong\u003E. Diyaarad lagu dhigay dusha weli wax ma goynayso: u dhaqaaji gudaha moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dhaqaaji-rog-damee\"\u003EU dhaqaaji, rog, damee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji xariiqa diyaaraddu si aad u doorato. Ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFallaadhaheeda dhinac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa meesha ay ku taal. Qor masaafo cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u jiidto moodeelka; qorista \u003Ccode\u003E-1m\u003C/code\u003E diyaaradda aad ku dhigtay dusha hore waxay u dhaqaajinaysaa 1 m gudaha moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu rogaa fallaadhaha, si dhinaca kale loo goyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFirfircoon (moodeelka ayuu goynayaa)\u003C/span\u003E: hal diyaarad ayaa mar goynaysa. Calaamee sanduuqa diyaarad kale, ama dhig mid cusub, oo kanu wuu goynayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagacee ku qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac\u003C/span\u003E; tirtir \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha diyaaraddu ka gudubto jidh xidhan oo xal ah, goynta waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab madow. Geometry aan xidhnayn (dusha keliya, sanduuq furan) waa la goyaa laakiin lama buuxiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuji-iyo-qari\"\u003EMuuji iyo qari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji qorshayaasha goynta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa xariiqyada iyo fallaadhaha diyaaradaha (goynta ayaa sii jirta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji goynta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu damiyaa goynta oo wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka oo dhan, isagoo aan tirtirin diyaaradaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003EMuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu qariyaa xariiqyada sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato\"\u003EWaxyaabo aad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa la goyey oo la dhaafay ma la riixi karo ama lagama xidhi karo, sidaas darteed waad sawirtaa waxa goynta muujinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDiyaaradaha goynta, midka firfircoon iyo laba badhanka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo saarista marwalba waxay ka kooban tahay moodeelka oo dhan: goyn waa muuqaal, ma aha tafatir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Diyaaraddu goynta waxay furtaa moodeelka si aad uga shaqeyso gudihiisa: qorshaha dabaqa guri, gudaha kabaad. Moodeelka lama beddelo; goynta waa muuqaal keliya. Dhig mid Guji Goyn kooxda Kaamerada. Guji dusha. Diyaaraddu waxa lagu dhigaa dusha, afar fallaado ah oo kuu soo jeeda. Ka guji meel kasta oo aan dusha ahayn si aad u dhigto diyaarad laba-geesood ah oo ugu toosan jihada aad inta badan eegto. Riix fallaadha hore (→) si aad u dhigto casaan toosan, (←) cagaar ama (↑) buluug halkii. Dhinaca fallaadhaha ku tilmaamaya waa laga gooyay. Diyaarad lagu dhigay dusha weli wax ma goynayso: u dhaqaaji gudaha moodeelka. U dhaqaaji, rog, damee Guji xariiqa diyaaraddu si aad u doorato. Ku jira Macluumaadka: Fallaadhaheeda dhinac wuxuu sheegayaa meesha ay ku taal. Qor masaafo cusub oo riix Enter si aad u jiidto moodeelka; qorista -1m diyaaradda aad ku dhigtay dusha hore waxay u dhaqaajinaysaa 1 m gudaha moodeelka. Rogi wuxuu rogaa fallaadhaha, si dhinaca kale loo goyo. Firfircoon (moodeelka ayuu goynayaa): hal diyaarad ayaa mar goynaysa. Calaamee sanduuqa diyaarad kale, ama dhig mid cusub, oo kanu wuu goynayaa. Magacee ku qor Magac; tirtir Delete ama Tirtiraha. Meesha diyaaraddu ka gudubto jidh xidhan oo xal ah, goynta waxa lagu buuxiyaa midab madow. Geometry aan xidhnayn (dusha keliya, sanduuq furan) waa la goyaa laakiin lama buuxiyo. Muuji iyo qari Ku jira Muuqaalo: Muuji qorshayaasha goynta wuxuu qariyaa xariiqyada iyo fallaadhaha diyaaradaha (goynta ayaa sii jirta). Muuji goynta wuxuu damiyaa goynta oo wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka oo dhan, isagoo aan tirtirin diyaaradaha. Muuqaalka soo bandhigga wuxuu qariyaa xariiqyada sidoo kale. Waxyaabo aad ogaato Waxa la goyey oo la dhaafay ma la riixi karo ama lagama xidhi karo, sidaas darteed waad sawirtaa waxa goynta muujinayso. Diyaaradaha goynta, midka firfircoon iyo laba badhanka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Soo saarista marwalba waxay ka kooban tahay moodeelka oo dhan: goyn waa muuqaal, ma aha tafatir.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"move-copy","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Guuri, koobiyee oo samee safaf","summary":"Wax ku guuri adigoo riixaya ama masaafo saxan, koobiyee ku samee furaha wax-beddelka, oo samee safaf koobiyo isku masaafo ah.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["guuri","koobiyee","laba-nuqul","safaf","safka","masaafo","kala qaybi","kala-fogee","fidi","tiirarka","celi","koobiyo badan"],"headings":[{"id":"wax-guuri","text":"Wax guuri","level":2},{"id":"qayb-ka-mid-ah-qaab-ayaa-ballaarta","text":"Qayb ka mid ah qaab ayaa ballaarta","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-wax","text":"Koobiyee wax","level":2},{"id":"koobiyee-jar-dhaji-iyo-laba-nuqul","text":"Koobiyee, jar, dhaji iyo laba-nuqul","level":2},{"id":"safka-koobiyada","text":"Safka koobiyada","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-tiirarka-mar-kasta-6-mitir","text":"Tusaale: tiirarka mar kasta 6 mitir","level":3},{"id":"waxyaabaha-aad-ku-garanayso","text":"Waxyaabaha aad ku garanayso","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu wax la doortay ka guuraa hal meel oo ilaa meel kale. Haddii furaha wax-beddelka la hayo, waxay noqonaysaa koobi, kadib koobiga ka dib waad qori kartaa inta kale ee aad rabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-guuri\"\u003EWax guuri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad rabto inaad guurto (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/select\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/select\"\u003EDooro waxyaabaha\u003C/a\u003E). Haddii waxba la dooranin, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa wixii aad riixdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix barta aad ka guurayso. Dooro meel muhiim ah, sida geeska: bartaas ayaa u degi doonta meesha aad riixdo marka xigta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaaji calaamadda. Doorashadu way raacaysaa. Waxay ku qabsataa dhibcaha, geesaha iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug, sida xariiqu sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha barta u socoto, ama qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETalada xaaladda ee bar-ka sare waxay ku noqotaa &quot;Riix barta aad ka guurayso…&quot; guuritaanka xigta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasaafo la qoray wuxuu u socdaa jihada aad tilmaamayso. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa fogaansho saxan, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;2m,0,0&gt;\u003C/code\u003E (2 m ee jihada casaanka), ama meel saxan oo loogu talagalay barta aad doorateen, \u003Ccode\u003E[0,0,0]\u003C/code\u003E (bilowga). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\"\u003EQor cabbirrada saxda ah\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad ugu guurto hal dhidibka oo keliya, riix furaha falka ka dib riixitaanka koowaad: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku xidhaa casaanka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E cagaarka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E buluugga. Ku celi isla falkaas si aad u furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayb-ka-mid-ah-qaab-ayaa-ballaarta\"\u003EQayb ka mid ah qaab ayaa ballaarta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoomitari aan wada xidhnayn waa isku xiran. Haddii aad hal wajiga ama dhowr geesood doorato oo aad guurto, wajiyada la xidhiidha ayaa ballaarta si ay u raacaan. Haddii aad sare-wajiga sanduuqa ee sare u guurisid dhinac, sanduuqu wuu janjeeraysanaa; haddii aad geesa saqafka hal mar guurisid, jiifka ayaa isbedelaya. Wajiyada aan mar dambe sii fiicnaan karin inay siman yihiin waxay u jeexjeexmaan saddex-geesood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u guurto shay oo dhan adigoo aan ballaarin, marka hore dhammaan ka dooro (saddex jeer riix), ama ugu wanaagsan, ka dhig koox ama qayb (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-wax\"\u003EKoobiyee wax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad rabto inaad koobiyeyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo riix barta aad ka guurayso. Mac-ka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isku mar ayey samaysaa. Talada waxay leedahay &quot;Ctrl wuu guuraa halkii&quot;, taas oo macnaheedu yahay inaad koobiyeyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale riixi kartaa oo sii dayn kartaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E riixitaanka koowaad ka dib si aad u beddesho guurid iyo koobiyeyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix meesha koobiga la dhigayo, ama qor masaafo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobiga asalka ahi wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshiisii, koobiguna waa la doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koobiyee-jar-dhaji-iyo-laba-nuqul\"\u003EKoobiyee, jar, dhaji iyo laba-nuqul\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa doorashada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu jaraa (koobiyeeyaa ka dibna tirtiraa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E waa sidoo kale badhamada bar-ka qalabka ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E oo ag taal iyaguna wuxuu leeyahay jar, dhaji meeshii la joogo iyo laba-nuqul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dhajiyaa: qaabka koobiga ayaa raacaya taxanaha, wuuna qabsadaa sida qalab kasta, riix kasta ayaa dhigta iyada oo geeskeeda ugu hooseeya halkaas la joogo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa jooji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhajiyaa meeshii ay ka timid, taas oo waxtar u leh marka aad wax u guurinayso kooxda aad furtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E habka Modeler) wuu laba-nuqulaysaa: koobi ayaa la sameeyaa oo isla markiiba calaamadda raacaysa; riix si aad u dhigto, qor masaafo, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhigtid. Isla markiiba ka dib, qor \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E koobiyo badan oo isdaba joog ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoox la dhajiyay waxay noqotaa koox cusub. Qayb la dhajiyay waa meel kale oo ka mid ah isla qaybtaas, marka wax laga beddelo mid kasta, kuwa kale oo dhammaan way beddelmaan. Koobiyada waxa kale oo lagu dhajin karaa tab kale oo ModelCraft ah oo ku jira isla browser-kan (halkaas waxay ku imanayaan qeexitaan cusub).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-koobiyada\"\u003ESafka koobiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla markiiba koobi ka dib, intaad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E weli tahay qalabka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E) oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad saddex koobi isdaba joog ah u hesho, mid kastaa masaafo isku mid ah oo koobiga koowaad. Waxaad heshaa saddex koobi cusub oo ku dheeraada asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u kala qaybiso: saddex koobi oo si siman u kala firdhay asalka ilaa meeshii aad koobiga koowaad dhigtay, kan ugu dambeeya meeshaas. Tan isticmaal si aad u buuxiso masaafo: dhig hal koobi cidhifka fog, kadibna kala qaybi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad qori kartaa tiro kale isla markaas: \u003Ccode\u003E5x\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu beddelaa safka \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E. Talada way xusuusinaysaa: &quot;Koobiyeeyay. Qor 3x koobiyo badan oo isdaba joog ah, ama /3 si aad masaafada u kala qaybiso.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tusaale-tiirarka-mar-kasta-6-mitir\"\u003ETusaale: tiirarka mar kasta 6 mitir\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee tiir oo ka dhig qayb (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), si dhammaan koobiyada ay isla markaas isu beddelaan marka dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo riix geeska saldhigga tiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu guuro dhidibka casaanka oo qor \u003Ccode\u003E6m\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E4x\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Waxaad heshaa shan tiir, oo mid kastaa 6 m ka fogaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-aad-ku-garanayso\"\u003EWaxyaabaha aad ku garanayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka hor riixitaanka labaad si aad u joojiso; wax walba waxay ku laabtaan meeshii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kooxda aad wax ka beddelayso. Si aad u guurto kooxda oo dhan, mar hore xidh, kadibna ka dooro gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dhac\u003C/span\u003E la shido (hoose midig, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#solids-stop-where-they-touch\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"solids-stop-where-they-touch\"\u003Edejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E), guuritaanku wuu joogsadaa meesha doorashadu taabato jidh kale halkii ay ka gudubi lahayd. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dhac\u003C/span\u003E si aad u damiso guurid u baahan in ay gudubto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad koobi ugu dhigto kooxda kale, koobiyee, kadibna fur kooxda kale oo dhaji (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku hayaa isla meeshii).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Guuri (M) wuxuu wax la doortay ka guuraa hal meel oo ilaa meel kale. Haddii furaha wax-beddelka la hayo, waxay noqonaysaa koobi, kadib koobiga ka dib waad qori kartaa inta kale ee aad rabto. Wax guuri Dooro waxa aad rabto inaad guurto (eeg Dooro waxyaabaha). Haddii waxba la dooranin, Guuri wuxuu qaadaa wixii aad riixdo. Riix M. Riix barta aad ka guurayso. Dooro meel muhiim ah, sida geeska: bartaas ayaa u degi doonta meesha aad riixdo marka xigta. Dhaqaaji calaamadda. Doorashadu way raacaysaa. Waxay ku qabsataa dhibcaha, geesaha iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug, sida xariiqu sameeyo. Riix meesha barta u socoto, ama qor masaafo oo riix Enter. Talada xaaladda ee bar-ka sare waxay ku noqotaa \"Riix barta aad ka guurayso…\" guuritaanka xigta. Masaafo la qoray wuxuu u socdaa jihada aad tilmaamayso. Waxaad sidoo kale qori kartaa fogaansho saxan, \u003C2m,0,0\u003E (2 m ee jihada casaanka), ama meel saxan oo loogu talagalay barta aad doorateen, [0,0,0] (bilowga). Eeg Qor cabbirrada saxda ah. Si aad ugu guurto hal dhidibka oo keliya, riix furaha falka ka dib riixitaanka koowaad: → wuxuu ku xidhaa casaanka, ← cagaarka, ↑ buluugga. Ku celi isla falkaas si aad u furto. Qayb ka mid ah qaab ayaa ballaarta Joomitari aan wada xidhnayn waa isku xiran. Haddii aad hal wajiga ama dhowr geesood doorato oo aad guurto, wajiyada la xidhiidha ayaa ballaarta si ay u raacaan. Haddii aad sare-wajiga sanduuqa ee sare u guurisid dhinac, sanduuqu wuu janjeeraysanaa; haddii aad geesa saqafka hal mar guurisid, jiifka ayaa isbedelaya. Wajiyada aan mar dambe sii fiicnaan karin inay siman yihiin waxay u jeexjeexmaan saddex-geesood. Si aad u guurto shay oo dhan adigoo aan ballaarin, marka hore dhammaan ka dooro (saddex jeer riix), ama ugu wanaagsan, ka dhig koox ama qayb (eeg Kooxaha iyo qaybaha). Koobiyee wax Dooro waxa aad rabto inaad koobiyeyso. Riix M. Hay Ctrl (ama Alt) oo riix barta aad ka guurayso. Mac-ka, Ctrl ama Alt isku mar ayey samaysaa. Talada waxay leedahay \"Ctrl wuu guuraa halkii\", taas oo macnaheedu yahay inaad koobiyeyso. Waxaad sidoo kale riixi kartaa oo sii dayn kartaa Ctrl ama Alt riixitaanka koowaad ka dib si aad u beddesho guurid iyo koobiyeyn. Riix meesha koobiga la dhigayo, ama qor masaafo oo riix Enter. Koobiga asalka ahi wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshiisii, koobiguna waa la doortay. Koobiyee, jar, dhaji iyo laba-nuqul Ctrl+C wuxuu koobiyeeyaa doorashada, Ctrl+X wuxuu jaraa (koobiyeeyaa ka dibna tirtiraa), Koobiyee iyo Dhaji waa sidoo kale badhamada bar-ka qalabka ee kooxda Tafatir, Dheeraad oo ag taal iyaguna wuxuu leeyahay jar, dhaji meeshii la joogo iyo laba-nuqul. Ctrl+V wuu dhajiyaa: qaabka koobiga ayaa raacaya taxanaha, wuuna qabsadaa sida qalab kasta, riix kasta ayaa dhigta iyada oo geeskeeda ugu hooseeya halkaas la joogo. Esc waa jooji. Ctrl+Shift+V wuxuu dhajiyaa meeshii ay ka timid, taas oo waxtar u leh marka aad wax u guurinayso kooxda aad furtay. Ctrl+D (Shift+D habka Modeler) wuu laba-nuqulaysaa: koobi ayaa la sameeyaa oo isla markiiba calaamadda raacaysa; riix si aad u dhigto, qor masaafo, ama riix Esc si aad u dhigtid. Isla markiiba ka dib, qor 3x koobiyo badan oo isdaba joog ah. Koox la dhajiyay waxay noqotaa koox cusub. Qayb la dhajiyay waa meel kale oo ka mid ah isla qaybtaas, marka wax laga beddelo mid kasta, kuwa kale oo dhammaan way beddelmaan. Koobiyada waxa kale oo lagu dhajin karaa tab kale oo ModelCraft ah oo ku jira isla browser-kan (halkaas waxay ku imanayaan qeexitaan cusub). Safka koobiyada Isla markiiba koobi ka dib, intaad Guuri weli tahay qalabka: Qor 3x (ama *3) oo riix Enter si aad saddex koobi isdaba joog ah u hesho, mid kastaa masaafo isku mid ah oo koobiga koowaad. Waxaad heshaa saddex koobi cusub oo ku dheeraada asalka. Qor /3 oo riix Enter si aad u kala qaybiso: saddex koobi oo si siman u kala firdhay asalka ilaa meeshii aad koobiga koowaad dhigtay, kan ugu dambeeya meeshaas. Tan isticmaal si aad u buuxiso masaafo: dhig hal koobi cidhifka fog, kadibna kala qaybi. Waxaad qori kartaa tiro kale isla markaas: 5x wuxuu beddelaa safka 3x. Talada way xusuusinaysaa: \"Koobiyeeyay. Qor 3x koobiyo badan oo isdaba joog ah, ama /3 si aad masaafada u kala qaybiso.\" Tusaale: tiirarka mar kasta 6 mitir Samee tiir oo ka dhig qayb (G), si dhammaan koobiyada ay isla markaas isu beddelaan marka dambe. Riix M, hay Ctrl oo riix geeska saldhigga tiirka. Ku guuro dhidibka casaanka oo qor 6m, kadibna Enter. Qor 4x iyo Enter. Waxaad heshaa shan tiir, oo mid kastaa 6 m ka fogaan. Waxyaabaha aad ku garanayso Riix Esc ka hor riixitaanka labaad si aad u joojiso; wax walba waxay ku laabtaan meeshii ay ahaayeen. Guuri wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kooxda aad wax ka beddelayso. Si aad u guurto kooxda oo dhan, mar hore xidh, kadibna ka dooro gudaha. Marka Isku dhac la shido (hoose midig, iyo dejinta ModelCraft), guuritaanku wuu joogsadaa meesha doorashadu taabato jidh kale halkii ay ka gudubi lahayd. Riix Isku dhac si aad u damiso guurid u baahan in ay gudubto. Si aad koobi ugu dhigto kooxda kale, koobiyee, kadibna fur kooxda kale oo dhaji (Ctrl+Shift+V wuxuu ku hayaa isla meeshii).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"soften","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Nuugi oo jilciyo geesaha","summary":"Qari geesaha dhinacyada isku dhaca xagal yar, si qaababka godan u muuqdaan sida dusha isku mid ah, ModelCraft iyo faylasha la dhoofiyay.","section":"tasks","order":52,"keywords":["nuugi","jilci","geesaha nacaan","jilicsan","qari geesaha","jilicsanaanta","godan","faceted","curved","normals","adkee","xagal"],"headings":[{"id":"nuugi-xagal","text":"Nuugi xagal","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-ogaan-karo","text":"Waxyaabo la ogaan karo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaab godan ModelCraft ku jira waxa uu ka samaysmaa dhinacyo siman. Geesaha \u003Cstrong\u003Enacaan\u003C/strong\u003E ee u dhexeeya dhinacyadaas lama sawiro, dhinacyada ay isku xidhaan waxay u muuqdaan dusha jilicsan oo keliya, sidaas darteed silinder 24-geesood ah wuu wareegsan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad wareegtaa goobo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E ah, geesihiisa waa loo nuugaa adiga. Qaabab kale, ku nuug xagal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuugi-xagal\"\u003ENuugi xagal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa la nuugayo: dhinacyada iyo geesaha, ama kooxda ama qaybta (geesaha oo dhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E gudihiisa, ku qor xagal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuugi ilaa\u003C/span\u003E sida \u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E, oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuugi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha kasta ee doorashada ku jira kaas oo labadooda dhinac ay u wareegaan xaggaas ama ka yar, waxay noqonayaan kuwo nacaan; geesaha wareeg adag wuxuu noqdaa adag. Prism 12-geesood ah dhinacyadiisu waxay u wareegaan 30°, gidaarradiisuna 90°, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E31\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu nuugaa oo keliya dhinacyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdkee dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib u adkeeyaa geesaha oo dhan ee doorashada. Mid kastaa waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-ogaan-karo\"\u003EWaxyaabo la ogaan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha u dhexeeya laba dhinac oo saxda ah oo keliya ayaa la nuugaa. Geesaha kala go&#039;an way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIftiinka siman wuxuu shaqeeyaa geesaha nuugan oo keliya: dhinac aan geeso nuugan lahayn wuu iftiimaa toos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha nuugan waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Dhoofinta \u003Cstrong\u003EglTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ\u003C/strong\u003E waxay qaadaan iftiinka siman (normal kasta oo geesta ah), sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale waxay muujiyaan isla dusha. Collada iyo STL waxay dhoofiyaan dhinacyo siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha nuugan waa la qariyaa qaab kasta oo dhinac ah, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Si aad u aragto, dooro qaabka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdkee dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E; dib-u-qaadku wuxuu soo celinayaa nuugista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qaab godan ModelCraft ku jira waxa uu ka samaysmaa dhinacyo siman. Geesaha nacaan ee u dhexeeya dhinacyadaas lama sawiro, dhinacyada ay isku xidhaan waxay u muuqdaan dusha jilicsan oo keliya, sidaas darteed silinder 24-geesood ah wuu wareegsan yahay. Markaad wareegtaa goobo oo Riix/jiid ah, geesihiisa waa loo nuugaa adiga. Qaabab kale, ku nuug xagal. Nuugi xagal Dooro waxa la nuugayo: dhinacyada iyo geesaha, ama kooxda ama qaybta (geesaha oo dhan). Macluumaadka gudihiisa, ku qor xagal Nuugi ilaa sida 20, oo guji Nuugi. Geesaha kasta ee doorashada ku jira kaas oo labadooda dhinac ay u wareegaan xaggaas ama ka yar, waxay noqonayaan kuwo nacaan; geesaha wareeg adag wuxuu noqdaa adag. Prism 12-geesood ah dhinacyadiisu waxay u wareegaan 30°, gidaarradiisuna 90°, sidaas darteed 31 wuxuu nuugaa oo keliya dhinacyada. Adkee dhammaan wuxuu dib u adkeeyaa geesaha oo dhan ee doorashada. Mid kastaa waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah. Waxyaabo la ogaan karo Geesaha u dhexeeya laba dhinac oo saxda ah oo keliya ayaa la nuugaa. Geesaha kala go'an way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Iftiinka siman wuxuu shaqeeyaa geesaha nuugan oo keliya: dhinac aan geeso nuugan lahayn wuu iftiimaa toos. Geesaha nuugan waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. Dhoofinta glTF (.glb) iyo OBJ waxay qaadaan iftiinka siman (normal kasta oo geesta ah), sidaas darteed barnaamijyada kale waxay muujiyaan isla dusha. Collada iyo STL waxay dhoofiyaan dhinacyo siman. Geesaha nuugan waa la qariyaa qaab kasta oo dhinac ah, X-ray iyo Silig sidoo kale. Si aad u aragto, dooro qaabka oo guji Adkee dhammaan; dib-u-qaadku wuxuu soo celinayaa nuugista.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"intersect","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Isgoys wajiyada","summary":"Rinjiyee xariiqyada halka wajiyadu isu jaraan, si aad u riixi, tirtirto ama rinjiso qaybaha.","section":"tasks","order":53,"keywords":["isgoys","isgoys wajiyada","isgoys moodelka","jar","god","isku xidh","xariiqyada wajiyada ku jaraan","boolean"],"headings":[{"id":"isgoys-moodelka","text":"Isgoys moodelka","level":2},{"id":"isgoys-doorashada","text":"Isgoys doorashada","level":2},{"id":"xariiqyada-halka-ay-tagaan","text":"Xariiqyada halka ay tagaan","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-ogaado","text":"Waxyaabo la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka hal qaab uu mid kale dhex maro, ModelCraft ma rinjiyeeyo xariiqa halka wajiyadooda ay kulmaan: way isku daba dhacaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoys\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu rinjiyeeyaa xariiqyadaas, sida geesaha, si wajiyadu halkaas u jeexmaan. Kadibna waad riixi, tirtiri ama rinjin kartaa qaybaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada amar waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isgoys-moodelka\"\u003EIsgoys moodelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu jaraa waxa aad doortay, wajiga kasta ee shaashadda ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaale ahaan, biim (kooxda) wuxuu dhex maraa darbi (kooxda kale), oo waxaad rabtaa god darbiga ku jira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer gucsi darbiga si aad u furto, kadibna dooro wajiyadiisa oo dhan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control A\"\u003E⌃A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntersect with model\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqa qaabka biimka waxaa lagu rinjiyeeyaa labada wajiyood ee darbiga, sida labo wajiyo cusub. Riix mid ka mid ah si aad u samayso godka, kadibna xir darbiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isgoys-doorashada\"\u003EIsgoys doorashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu jaraa wajiyada, kooxaha iyo qaybaha la doortay \u003Cstrong\u003Eis-dhexdooda kaliya\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro ugu yaraan laba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiqyada-halka-ay-tagaan\"\u003EXariiqyada halka ay tagaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyadu had iyo jeer waxay ku rinjiyeeyaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ekontekstka furan\u003C/strong\u003E: moodelka marka koox aan furnayn, ama kooxda aad tafatirayso. Kooxaha iyo qaybaha aan furnayn lama beddelo. Sidaas darteed, si aad u jarto wajiyada kooxda, marka hore fur, sida tusaalaha kor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxyaabo la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWajiyada ku jira isla diyaaradda lama isgoysiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada xidha wareeg dusheyaal waxay sameeyaan wajiga cusub, sida xariiqyada la rinjiyeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsgoys kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Haddii waxba isku jeexmin, waxba ma beddelmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaababka xiran, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003Eqalabka jirka\u003C/a\u003E (Union, Subtract) ayaa shaqada oo dhan hal tallaabo ku qabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Marka hal qaab uu mid kale dhex maro, ModelCraft ma rinjiyeeyo xariiqa halka wajiyadooda ay kulmaan: way isku daba dhacaan. Isgoys wuxuu rinjiyeeyaa xariiqyadaas, sida geesaha, si wajiyadu halkaas u jeexmaan. Kadibna waad riixi, tirtiri ama rinjin kartaa qaybaha. Labada amar waxay ku jiraan Edit › More. Isgoys moodelka Wuxuu jaraa waxa aad doortay, wajiga kasta ee shaashadda ku jira. Tusaale ahaan, biim (kooxda) wuxuu dhex maraa darbi (kooxda kale), oo waxaad rabtaa god darbiga ku jira: Laba jeer gucsi darbiga si aad u furto, kadibna dooro wajiyadiisa oo dhan (Ctrl+A). Edit › More › Intersect with model. Xariiqa qaabka biimka waxaa lagu rinjiyeeyaa labada wajiyood ee darbiga, sida labo wajiyo cusub. Riix mid ka mid ah si aad u samayso godka, kadibna xir darbiga. Isgoys doorashada Wuxuu jaraa wajiyada, kooxaha iyo qaybaha la doortay is-dhexdooda kaliya. Dooro ugu yaraan laba. Xariiqyada halka ay tagaan Xariiqyadu had iyo jeer waxay ku rinjiyeeyaan kontekstka furan: moodelka marka koox aan furnayn, ama kooxda aad tafatirayso. Kooxaha iyo qaybaha aan furnayn lama beddelo. Sidaas darteed, si aad u jarto wajiyada kooxda, marka hore fur, sida tusaalaha kor. Waxyaabo la ogaado Wajiyada ku jira isla diyaaradda lama isgoysiyo. Xariiqyada xidha wareeg dusheyaal waxay sameeyaan wajiga cusub, sida xariiqyada la rinjiyeeyay. Isgoys kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib loo celin karo. Haddii waxba isku jeexmin, waxba ma beddelmo. Qaababka xiran, qalabka jirka (Union, Subtract) ayaa shaqada oo dhan hal tallaabo ku qabta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"axes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dhaqdhaqaaq oo wareeji tiirarka sawirka","summary":"Wareeji tiirarka cas, cagaar iyo buluug si ay ula mid noqdaan dhismo aan ku toosnayn, ama u hagaaji wejiga, si sawirka iyo qorista ay u raacaan.","section":"tasks","order":54,"keywords":["tiirar","tiirarka sawirka","asal","hagaaji tiirarka","wareeji tiirarka","dib u deji tiirarka","dhismo xagal","ucs","nidaamka isku-xidhka"],"headings":[{"id":"tiirarka-dhig","text":"Tiirarka dhig","level":2},{"id":"tiirarka-u-hagaaji-wejiga","text":"Tiirarka u hagaaji wejiga","level":2},{"id":"tiirarka-dib-u-deji","text":"Tiirarka dib u deji","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETiirarka cas, cagaar iyo buluug waxay hagaan wax kasta oo aad sawirto: laabyada waxay ku toosnaadaan, khadadka waxay ku xidhmaan, dhulkuna waa diyaarad cas-cagaar. Marka dhismuhu xagal ku yaal (qorshe goobeed aan u toosnayn woqooyi, dhinac xagal 30°), tiirarka ku dhaqaaji si sawirku u raaco darbiyadiisa. Moodeelka laftiisu ma dhaqaaqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdaba amarka waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka-dhig\"\u003ETiirarka dhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace axes\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha bilowgu u tagayo, sida geeska dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta ku taal tiirka cas ee cusub, sida dhinac darbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta u jeedda tiirka cagaarka cusub. Cagaarku wuxuu noqonayaa mid toosan cas, buluuguna wuu taagan yahay labadaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirarka waxaa lagu sawiraa meeshooda cusub. Laabta aad hadda ku sawirto dhulka, ama aad ku qorto sida \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, waxay socdaa cas iyo cagaar oo la leexiyey; furayaasha fallaadhaha waa ku xidhan yihiin; bilowga snap-ku wuxuu noqonayaa bilowga cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka-u-hagaaji-wejiga\"\u003ETiirarka u hagaaji wejiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro hal wejiga, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlign axes to face\u003C/span\u003E. Buluuguna wuxuu markaas tilmaamaa dibadda wejiga, cas wuxuu ku dhex socdaa geesta ugu dheer, bilowguna wuxuu ku yaal bilowga geeskaas. Isticmaal si aad ugu sawirto saqaf janjeeran sidii dhul.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka-dib-u-deji\"\u003ETiirarka dib u deji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset axes\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa meeshii moodeelku ka bilaabmay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha kooxda ama qaybta furan, tiirarkeeda ayaa la isticmaalaa (way wareegaan iyaga); moodeelka tiirarkiisa ayaa khuseeya heerka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirarka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExport-yada iyo aragga caadiga ah (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETop\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFront\u003C/span\u003E…) weli waxay isticmaalaan jihooyinka moodelka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Tiirarka cas, cagaar iyo buluug waxay hagaan wax kasta oo aad sawirto: laabyada waxay ku toosnaadaan, khadadka waxay ku xidhmaan, dhulkuna waa diyaarad cas-cagaar. Marka dhismuhu xagal ku yaal (qorshe goobeed aan u toosnayn woqooyi, dhinac xagal 30°), tiirarka ku dhaqaaji si sawirku u raaco darbiyadiisa. Moodeelka laftiisu ma dhaqaaqo. Saddexdaba amarka waa Edit › More. Tiirarka dhig Edit › More › Place axes. Guji meesha bilowgu u tagayo, sida geeska dhismaha. Guji barta ku taal tiirka cas ee cusub, sida dhinac darbi. Guji barta u jeedda tiirka cagaarka cusub. Cagaarku wuxuu noqonayaa mid toosan cas, buluuguna wuu taagan yahay labadaba. Tiirarka waxaa lagu sawiraa meeshooda cusub. Laabta aad hadda ku sawirto dhulka, ama aad ku qorto sida 4m,3m, waxay socdaa cas iyo cagaar oo la leexiyey; furayaasha fallaadhaha waa ku xidhan yihiin; bilowga snap-ku wuxuu noqonayaa bilowga cusub. Tiirarka u hagaaji wejiga Dooro hal wejiga, kadibna Edit › More › Align axes to face. Buluuguna wuxuu markaas tilmaamaa dibadda wejiga, cas wuxuu ku dhex socdaa geesta ugu dheer, bilowguna wuxuu ku yaal bilowga geeskaas. Isticmaal si aad ugu sawirto saqaf janjeeran sidii dhul. Tiirarka dib u deji Edit › More › Reset axes wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa meeshii moodeelku ka bilaabmay. Waxa la ogaado Gudaha kooxda ama qaybta furan, tiirarkeeda ayaa la isticmaalaa (way wareegaan iyaga); moodeelka tiirarkiisa ayaa khuseeya heerka sare. Tiirarka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah. Export-yada iyo aragga caadiga ah (Top, Front…) weli waxay isticmaalaan jihooyinka moodelka laftiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"terrain","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dhulka: dhul khadadka kontuurka ka samaysan iyo sawirinta","summary":"Dhul ka samee khadadka kontuurka ama shabakad, kadibna kor u qaad ama hoos u dhig iyada oo burush jilicsan la adeegsanayo.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["dhul","dhulka","dhulka dabiiciga ah","muuqaalka dhulka","kontuur","khadadka kontuurka","goobta","sare","buur","buur yar","sanduuq dhulka","sawir","sawirinta dhulka","heer","TIN"],"headings":[{"id":"khadadka-kontuurka","text":"Khadadka kontuurka","level":2},{"id":"shabakad-lagu-sawiro","text":"Shabakad lagu sawiro","level":2},{"id":"sawir-kor-u-qaad-oo-hoos-u-dhig-dhulka","text":"Sawir: kor u qaad oo hoos u dhig dhulka","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah","text":"Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhulku waa dhul ka samaysan saddex-xagal, sidaas darteed wuxuu raaci karaa qaab kasta. Waa kooxa: ku dhufo laba jeer si aad u tafatirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadadka-kontuurka\"\u003EKhadadka kontuurka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel khadadka kontuurka heerarkooda: samee, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003Esoo dhoofi khariidadda goobta\u003C/a\u003E oo kontuur kasta u kor u qaad heerkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro (dhammaan geesaha kontuurada oo dhan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhul ka samee khadadka xuduudka la doortay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu dhibcaha kontuurka isku xidhaa saddex-xagal (TIN), wuxuuna jilciyaa geesaha gudaha oo dhan si dhulku u iftiimo si nacnac ah. Khadadka laftoodu way sii jiraan; tirtir ama qari marka aanad u baahnayn. Kontuuro aad u dhow-dhow ah waxaa loo yareeyaa 8 000 dhibcood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shabakad-lagu-sawiro\"\u003EShabakad lagu sawiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShabakadda dhulka…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka codsadaa ballac, qoto iyo cabbirka unugga, kadibna wuxuu dhigaa shabakad saddex-xagal oo siman meesha aad ku dhufato geeskeeda. Unugyada yaryar way sawiraan si nacnac ah, laakiin dusho badan ayay sameeyaan (ugu badnaan 200 × 200 unug).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-kor-u-qaad-oo-hoos-u-dhig-dhulka\"\u003ESawir: kor u qaad oo hoos u dhig dhulka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhufo laba jeer dhulka si aad u furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir dhulka\u003C/span\u003E. Goob wareeg ah ayaa muujinaysa burushka dhulka hoosteeda ee suulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid sare si aad dhulka hoosta burushka kor u qaaddo, ama hoos si aad hoos u dhigto. Dhexda ayaa ugu badan dhaqaaqa, dhulkuna wuxuu u jilcaa eber geeska wareegga, sidaas darteed buuraha iyo godadku way jilicsanaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad buur u samayso joog sax ah, dhufo mar, kadibna qor joogta, sida \u003Ccode\u003E1.5m\u003C/code\u003E (calaamadda jaray ayaa hoos u dhigta), oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Si aad burushka u beddesho, qor dherer ka hor intaadan dhufan: \u003Ccode\u003E5m\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siinayaa burush radiusheeda 5 m ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah\"\u003EWaxyaabaha muhiimka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirku wuxuu kaliya dhaqaajiyaa dusha saddex-xagalka, sidaas darteed dusha kasta wali waa siman tahay. Dusha gacanta lagu sawiray (afar-geesle, poligon) dhul ma aha: qalabku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirku wuxuu dhibcaha si toos ah u dhaqaajiyaa kor iyo hoos, ma daro dhibco cusub. Faahfaahin ka fiican, samee shabakad unugyo yaryar leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulku wuxuu u soo baxaa sida qayb kasta oo kale. Marka IFC, wuxuu noqonayaa wakiil qayb dhismeed, sida wax kasta oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Dhulku waa dhul ka samaysan saddex-xagal, sidaas darteed wuxuu raaci karaa qaab kasta. Waa kooxa: ku dhufo laba jeer si aad u tafatirto. Khadadka kontuurka Hel khadadka kontuurka heerarkooda: samee, ama soo dhoofi khariidadda goobta oo kontuur kasta u kor u qaad heerkiisa. Dooro (dhammaan geesaha kontuurada oo dhan). Tafatir › Dheeraad › Dhul ka samee khadadka xuduudka la doortay. ModelCraft wuxuu dhibcaha kontuurka isku xidhaa saddex-xagal (TIN), wuxuuna jilciyaa geesaha gudaha oo dhan si dhulku u iftiimo si nacnac ah. Khadadka laftoodu way sii jiraan; tirtir ama qari marka aanad u baahnayn. Kontuuro aad u dhow-dhow ah waxaa loo yareeyaa 8 000 dhibcood. Shabakad lagu sawiro Tafatir › Dheeraad › Shabakadda dhulka… wuxuu ka codsadaa ballac, qoto iyo cabbirka unugga, kadibna wuxuu dhigaa shabakad saddex-xagal oo siman meesha aad ku dhufato geeskeeda. Unugyada yaryar way sawiraan si nacnac ah, laakiin dusho badan ayay sameeyaan (ugu badnaan 200 × 200 unug). Sawir: kor u qaad oo hoos u dhig dhulka Ku dhufo laba jeer dhulka si aad u furto. Tafatir › Dheeraad › Sawir dhulka. Goob wareeg ah ayaa muujinaysa burushka dhulka hoosteeda ee suulka. Jiid sare si aad dhulka hoosta burushka kor u qaaddo, ama hoos si aad hoos u dhigto. Dhexda ayaa ugu badan dhaqaaqa, dhulkuna wuxuu u jilcaa eber geeska wareegga, sidaas darteed buuraha iyo godadku way jilicsanaadaan. Si aad buur u samayso joog sax ah, dhufo mar, kadibna qor joogta, sida 1.5m (calaamadda jaray ayaa hoos u dhigta), oo riix Enter. Si aad burushka u beddesho, qor dherer ka hor intaadan dhufan: 5m wuxuu siinayaa burush radiusheeda 5 m ah. Sawir kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod. Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah Sawirku wuxuu kaliya dhaqaajiyaa dusha saddex-xagalka, sidaas darteed dusha kasta wali waa siman tahay. Dusha gacanta lagu sawiray (afar-geesle, poligon) dhul ma aha: qalabku wuu sheegaa. Sawirku wuxuu dhibcaha si toos ah u dhaqaajiyaa kor iyo hoos, ma daro dhibco cusub. Faahfaahin ka fiican, samee shabakad unugyo yaryar leh. Dhulku wuxuu u soo baxaa sida qayb kasta oo kale. Marka IFC, wuxuu noqonayaa wakiil qayb dhismeed, sida wax kasta oo kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"meshes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Mesh-yada","summary":"U beddel kooxda ama komponentka mesh, nooca walxaha ay qalabyada waxyaabaha 3D ku moodeelaan, iyo dib u celi joomatari riix-jiid.","section":"tasks","order":58,"keywords":["mesh","meshes","polygon","polygons","n-gon","quad","quads","dhibcaha","half-edge","uv","uvs","beddel","u beddel mesh","u beddel joomatari","subdivision","sculpt","moodeelka","waxyaabaha 3D"],"headings":[{"id":"u-beddel-kooxda-ama-komponentka-mesh","text":"U beddel kooxda ama komponentka mesh","level":2},{"id":"waxa-macluumaadka-muujiyo","text":"Waxa Macluumaadka muujiyo","level":2},{"id":"u-beddel-mesh-ka-joomatari-riix-jiid","text":"U beddel mesh-ka joomatari riix-jiid","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-la-ogaado","text":"Waxyaabaha la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay laba nooc joomatari. \u003Cstrong\u003EJoomatariga riix-jiid\u003C/strong\u003E waa wixii aad sawirto: wejiyo toosan oo isku xidhan, isku jaraya oo isku bogsada. \u003Cstrong\u003EMesh\u003C/strong\u003E waa nooca walxaha ay qalabyada waxyaabaha 3D ku moodeelaan: wejiyo leh tiro kasta oo geesood ah, geesood kasta oo ku qaadan kara coordinates-ka texture-ka (UV), normals iyo midabyo, iyo dhibcood kasta oo ku leh qiyamo sida miisaanka. Mesh waxa loo dhigaa sida kooxda ama komponentka, wuxuuna ku jiraa joomatariga riix-jiid isla moodeelka gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-beddel-kooxda-ama-komponentka-mesh\"\u003EU beddel kooxda ama komponentka mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda ama komponentka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU beddel mesh\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWejiyadiisu waxay noqonayaan wejiyada mesh-ka (wejiga leh godad wuxuu imanayaa sida saddex-geesood), xarriiqyada adag way adkaadaan, xarriiqyada jilicsan waxay iftiimaan si siman, rinjiga, agabka iyo texture-yada la soo dhoofiyay waxay ku sii jiraan wejiyadooda. Kooxaha iyo komponentada ku jira waxa lagu isku daraa hal mesh. Xarriiqyada furan waa la reebayaa: mesh-ku wuxuu hayaa wejiyo. Komponent kasta oo meel kasta lagu dhigay wuxuu muujinayaa mesh-ka. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-macluumaadka-muujiyo\"\u003EWaxa Macluumaadka muujiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh dooro si aad u aragto wejiyadiisa, dhibcahiisa iyo xarriiqyadiisa, haddii uu yahay solid xidhan (iyo mugiisa), iyo cabbirkiisa marka la dhigay. Mesh leh xarriiqyo furan ayaa sheegaya tiradooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-beddel-mesh-ka-joomatari-riix-jiid\"\u003EU beddel mesh-ka joomatari riix-jiid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro mesh-ka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU beddel joomatari\u003C/span\u003E. Wejiyada toosan way soo laabanayaan sida ay ahaayeen; wejiga geesihiisu aan ku jirin diyaarad hal ah wuxuu soo laabanayaa saddex-geesood. Xarriiqyada adag way adkaadaan, kuwa kale jilicsan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wejiyada mesh-ka si toos ah u geliyaa kooxda ku wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxyaabaha la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMesh-ka laba jeer guji si aad \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003Eu tafatirto dhibcaha, xarriiqyada iyo wejiyada\u003C/a\u003E goobta Mesh. U beddel joomatari si aad riix-jiid ugu tafatirto; guuri, wareeji, miisaan, koobiyee, rinji, qari iyo calaamee sida kooxda kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhoofinta, daabacaadda 3D, rendarka iyo VR waxay mesh-ka u arkaan sida wejiyadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka uu mesh ku jiro wuxuu kaydiyaa nooc cusub oo faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E ah, sidaas darteed ModelCraft 0.6 iyo kuwa ka hortii ma furi karaan; faylasha aan mesh lahayn waxay ku furmaan sida hore. U beddel mesh-ka joomatari marka hore si faylka loo wadaago qof nooc hore haysta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa noqoshada mesh-ka waxay kaydisaa kaliya wixii tallaabo kasta bedelay, sidaas darteed mesh aad u weyn ayaa si degdeg ah u noqonaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003EKooxaha iyo komponentada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay laba nooc joomatari. Joomatariga riix-jiid waa wixii aad sawirto: wejiyo toosan oo isku xidhan, isku jaraya oo isku bogsada. Mesh waa nooca walxaha ay qalabyada waxyaabaha 3D ku moodeelaan: wejiyo leh tiro kasta oo geesood ah, geesood kasta oo ku qaadan kara coordinates-ka texture-ka (UV), normals iyo midabyo, iyo dhibcood kasta oo ku leh qiyamo sida miisaanka. Mesh waxa loo dhigaa sida kooxda ama komponentka, wuxuuna ku jiraa joomatariga riix-jiid isla moodeelka gudihiisa. U beddel kooxda ama komponentka mesh Dooro kooxda ama komponentka. Gudaha Macluumaadka, guji U beddel mesh. Wejiyadiisu waxay noqonayaan wejiyada mesh-ka (wejiga leh godad wuxuu imanayaa sida saddex-geesood), xarriiqyada adag way adkaadaan, xarriiqyada jilicsan waxay iftiimaan si siman, rinjiga, agabka iyo texture-yada la soo dhoofiyay waxay ku sii jiraan wejiyadooda. Kooxaha iyo komponentada ku jira waxa lagu isku daraa hal mesh. Xarriiqyada furan waa la reebayaa: mesh-ku wuxuu hayaa wejiyo. Komponent kasta oo meel kasta lagu dhigay wuxuu muujinayaa mesh-ka. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo. Waxa Macluumaadka muujiyo Mesh dooro si aad u aragto wejiyadiisa, dhibcahiisa iyo xarriiqyadiisa, haddii uu yahay solid xidhan (iyo mugiisa), iyo cabbirkiisa marka la dhigay. Mesh leh xarriiqyo furan ayaa sheegaya tiradooda. U beddel mesh-ka joomatari riix-jiid Dooro mesh-ka oo guji U beddel joomatari. Wejiyada toosan way soo laabanayaan sida ay ahaayeen; wejiga geesihiisu aan ku jirin diyaarad hal ah wuxuu soo laabanayaa saddex-geesood. Xarriiqyada adag way adkaadaan, kuwa kale jilicsan. Kala bax wuxuu wejiyada mesh-ka si toos ah u geliyaa kooxda ku wareegsan. Waxyaabaha la ogaado Mesh-ka laba jeer guji si aad u tafatirto dhibcaha, xarriiqyada iyo wejiyada goobta Mesh. U beddel joomatari si aad riix-jiid ugu tafatirto; guuri, wareeji, miisaan, koobiyee, rinji, qari iyo calaamee sida kooxda kasta. Dhoofinta, daabacaadda 3D, rendarka iyo VR waxay mesh-ka u arkaan sida wejiyadiisa. Faylka uu mesh ku jiro wuxuu kaydiyaa nooc cusub oo faylka .modelcraft ah, sidaas darteed ModelCraft 0.6 iyo kuwa ka hortii ma furi karaan; faylasha aan mesh lahayn waxay ku furmaan sida hore. U beddel mesh-ka joomatari marka hore si faylka loo wadaago qof nooc hore haysta. Ka noqoshada mesh-ka waxay kaydisaa kaliya wixii tallaabo kasta bedelay, sidaas darteed mesh aad u weyn ayaa si degdeg ah u noqonaysa. Eeg sidoo kale Kooxaha iyo komponentada iyo Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"mesh-edit","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Tafatir mesh goobta Mesh","summary":"Dooro dhibcaha, xarriiqaha iyo wejiyada mesh-ka, guuri, oo soo fidi, gudo, jaranjaro, goy, isku dar, buuxi iyo buundo, oo leh qaab furayaasha labada nooc.","section":"tasks","order":59,"keywords":["mesh","habka tafatirka","goobta mesh","dhibcaha","dhibcood","xarriiq","xarriiqyo","wejiyo","wejiyada","soo fidi","gudo","jaranjaro","goy wareeg","mindi","kala qaybi","wareeji","isku dar","milmi","buuxi","buuxi shabakad","buundo","kala qaybi","jiid","saamayn","goobta shaqada"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"guuri-wareeji-miisaan","text":"Guuri, wareeji, miisaan","level":2},{"id":"beddel-qaabka","text":"Beddel qaabka","level":2},{"id":"remesh","text":"Remesh","level":2},{"id":"retopology","text":"Retopology","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-hawlgalkii-ugu-dambeeyay","text":"Hagaaji hawlgalkii ugu dambeeyay","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha","text":"Furayaasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta Mesh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tafatiraa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E dhibic dhibic: dhibcaha, xarriiqaha iyo wejiyada. Joometriga riix-jiid wuxuu ku sii jiraa goobta \u003Cstrong\u003EMoodeel\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh\u003C/span\u003E liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca bidix ee toolbar-ka. Mesh-ka la doortay ayaa la furaa si loo tafatiro; kooxda ama komponentka la doortay waxa marka hore loo beddelaa mesh (hal tallaabo ka noqo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma laba jeer guji mesh-ka, ama haddii furayaasha moodeelka la isticmaalayo, dooro oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aan wax la dooran, panelku wuxuu soo bandhigayaa mesh-yada la ku darayo: diyaarad, grid, kuub, goobo, silinda, koone, sfeero, ico sphere iyo torus. Mid cusub ayaa meesha uu muuqaalku eegayo ku tagaya, wuuna furmaa si loo tafatiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo Model\u003C/span\u003E (ama liiska, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E furayaasha moodeelka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka aan wax la dooran oo furayaasha riix-jiid) wuxuu ku laabanayaa Model oo mesh-ka la doortay. Intii goobta Mesh la furan tahay, moodeelka kale waa la dhuumaalay oo qalabyada sawirka Model waa la kaydiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi uu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"1\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"2\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhibcaha, xarriiqyada ama wejiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro mid; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wuu ku daraa ama wuu ka saaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid sanduuq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wixii dhexdiisa ku jira oo la arko; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu ku daraa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu ka saaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji xarriiq, ama laba jeer guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegga xarriiqda (wareeg wejiyada habka wejiyada; xuduudda oo dhan xarriiq furan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji xarriiq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGiraanta xarriiqda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex jeer guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax kasta oo ku xiran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E waxa kale oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xiran\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGiraan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYaree\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-wareeji-miisaan\"\u003EGuuri, wareeji, miisaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E waxay ka bilaabmaan taabashada: guuri, kadibna guji ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhigto doorashada, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama furayaasha falaarta) waxay qufulaan hal dhinac. Ku qor masaafo, xagal ama factor si aad u sax u hesho; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/value-box#calculations\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/value-box\" data-hash=\"calculations\"\u003Exisaabinta\u003C/a\u003E waa sidoo kale ku shaqeysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETafatirka saamaynta\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaamayn\u003C/span\u003E, ama panelka): dhibcaha ku dhow doorashada waxay raacaan guuritaanka, kuwa ka fogna way ka yaraadaan, ilaa fogaanta aad dejiso, oo leh qaabka hoos u dhaca ee aad doorato. Shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaliya dhinaca mesh-ka\u003C/span\u003E si aad u cabbirto dhinacyada xarriiqyada halkii toos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJiid\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu guuraa xarriiqda wareeg la doortay dhinacyada ku dhow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-qaabka\"\u003EBeddel qaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo fidi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada la doortay wuxuu ka soo jiidaa jihada ay ku taagan yihiin, isagoo wejiyo cusub oo dhinac ah ku daraya (ama wejiyo ka sameeya xuduudaha furan). Ku qor masaafada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta gudaha outline-ka wejiyada la doortay; riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kasta oo wejiga kasta si gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJaranjaro\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyada la doortay (ama, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dhibcaha) ballac ku goya; mouse-ka dhexe ama furayaasha plus iyo minus ayaa ku daraya qaybo, si loo helo xarriiq wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoy wareeg\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiq ku tilmaam: wareeg cusub oo ku wareegsan giraanta wejiyada afar-geesle ah; mouse-ka dhexe wuxuu dejiyaa inta wareeg; guji si aad u goyto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMindi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhibcaha xarriiqyada ama geeska; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu si toosan u goyaa wejiyada u dhexeeya, sida aad arkayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiq shaashad ku sawir: wejiyada la doortay (ama dhammaan) ayaa lagu goyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu wareejiyaa wejiyada la doortay ama xarriiqyada furan wareegga buluuga ah tallaabooyin; mouse-ka dhexe wuxuu dejiyaa tallaabooyinka; wareeg oo buuxa wuu xiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiqyada la doortay waxay u kala baxaan laba; wejiyada oo dhan waxay noqdaan shabakad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha la doortay waxay noqdaan hal, dhexdooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMilmi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa la doortay wuu ka saaraa, laakiin dusha wuu hayaa: wejiyada way isku xidhmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiga u dhexeeya xuduud furan oo la doortay (ama laba xarriiq furan dhexdooda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi shabakad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuduud furan oo leh tiro xarriiq oo siman ayaa lagu buuxiyaa shabakad quads ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuundo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba wareeg oo xarriiq furan oo la doortay ayaa lagu xidhaa wejiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida xarriiqyada la doortay u adkaadaan marka mesh-ka lagu siibo Subdivision surface: u dhaqaaq dhexdhexaadka ka fogaan, isticmaal wheel-ka (tallaabooyin 0.1) ama ku qor 0 ilaa 1. Panelku wuxuu muujinayaa crease-ka xarriiqyada la doortay wuuna aqbalaa qiime la qoro. Xarriiqyada crease waxay ku muuqdaan magenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada rogi; dhibcaha siib oo u soo dhowaad jaarkooda; tirtir sida habka dooridda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta waa hal tallaabo ka noqo. Coordinates-ka texture-ka, midabyada iyo miisaanka waxay ku raacaan wejiyada iyo dhibcaha cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"remesh\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mesh-ka oo dhan dib uga sameeyaa saddex-geesood siman oo hal cabbir ah, kaas oo la weydiiyo markaad riixdo (yar waa fiican oo gaabis badan). Wuxuu xidhaa godadka, isku xidhaa qaybaha isku dhex mara, wuxuuna siman yeelaa mesh-ka uu sculpting-ku fidiyey. Xarriiqyada adag wax yar ayay ku noqdaan kuwo wareegsan. UV-ga, rinjiga iyo crease-yada mar kale bilaabmaan. Hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"retopology\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad mesh cusub oo nadiif ah u dhisto mid faahfaahsan oo sare (sculpt, scan), dooro mid faahfaahsan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dhis\u003C/strong\u003E panelka, kadibna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha la dhaqaajiyay ku qabo:\u003C/strong\u003E dhibcaha aad dhaqaajiso, iyo xarriiqyada aad soo fidiso, dusheeda ayay ku dhacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha la doortay ku dhig\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hadda dhibcaha la doortay dusheeda ku dhigaa (hal tallaabo ka noqo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXarriiqyada mesh-kan muuji hore\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa mesh-ka aad dhisayso dusha dhexdeeda, si aad u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-hawlgalkii-ugu-dambeeyay\"\u003EHagaaji hawlgalkii ugu dambeeyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJaranjaro\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoy wareeg\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi shabakad\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E, panelku wuxuu muujiyaa dejintiisa (ballac, qaybo, qaab, goyo…). Mid bedel oo hawlgalku mar kale ayaa laga bilaabaa meeshii uu ka bilaabmay, wuxuuna weli yahay hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha\"\u003EFurayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFurayaasha riix-jiid\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFurayaasha moodeelka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri, wareeji, miisaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E laba jeer jiid)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo fidi, gudo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrease\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift E\"\u003E⇧E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhammaan, midna, rogid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control A\"\u003E⌃A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabaduba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control B\"\u003E⌃B\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+B\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jaranjaro, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control R\"\u003E⌃R\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+R\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goy wareeg, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mindi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisku mid, iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E buuxi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isku dar, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control X\"\u003E⌃X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E milmi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control L\"\u003E⌃L\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+L\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isku xiran, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option N\"\u003E⌥N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E rogid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E saamayn, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift V\"\u003E⇧V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E jiid dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EMesh-yada\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EWax-beddeliyayaasha mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Goobta Mesh wuxuu tafatiraa mesh dhibic dhibic: dhibcaha, xarriiqaha iyo wejiyada. Joometriga riix-jiid wuxuu ku sii jiraa goobta Moodeel. Fur Dooro Mesh liiska Goobta shaqada ee dhinaca bidix ee toolbar-ka. Mesh-ka la doortay ayaa la furaa si loo tafatiro; kooxda ama komponentka la doortay waxa marka hore loo beddelaa mesh (hal tallaabo ka noqo). Ama laba jeer guji mesh-ka, ama haddii furayaasha moodeelka la isticmaalayo, dooro oo riix Tab. Haddii aan wax la dooran, panelku wuxuu soo bandhigayaa mesh-yada la ku darayo: diyaarad, grid, kuub, goobo, silinda, koone, sfeero, ico sphere iyo torus. Mid cusub ayaa meesha uu muuqaalku eegayo ku tagaya, wuuna furmaa si loo tafatiro. Dib u noqo Model (ama liiska, Tab furayaasha moodeelka, Esc marka aan wax la dooran oo furayaasha riix-jiid) wuxuu ku laabanayaa Model oo mesh-ka la doortay. Intii goobta Mesh la furan tahay, moodeelka kale waa la dhuumaalay oo qalabyada sawirka Model waa la kaydiyay. Dooro Samee Si uu 1 2 3 Dooro dhibcaha, xarriiqyada ama wejiyada Guji Dooro mid; Shift+guji wuu ku daraa ama wuu ka saaraa Jiid sanduuq Dooro wixii dhexdiisa ku jira oo la arko; Shift wuu ku daraa, Ctrl wuu ka saaraa Alt+guji xarriiq, ama laba jeer guji Wareegga xarriiqda (wareeg wejiyada habka wejiyada; xuduudda oo dhan xarriiq furan) Ctrl+Alt+guji xarriiq Giraanta xarriiqda Saddex jeer guji Wax kasta oo ku xiran Kooxda Dooro waxa kale oo ku jira Dhammaan, Isku xiran, Wareeg, Giraan, Dheeraad iyo Yaree. Guuri, wareeji, miisaan Guuri, Wareeji iyo Miisaan waxay ka bilaabmaan taabashada: guuri, kadibna guji ama riix Enter si aad u dhigto doorashada, ama Esc si aad u joojiso. X, Y ama Z (ama furayaasha falaarta) waxay qufulaan hal dhinac. Ku qor masaafo, xagal ama factor si aad u sax u hesho; xisaabinta waa sidoo kale ku shaqeysaa. Tafatirka saamaynta (Saamayn, ama panelka): dhibcaha ku dhow doorashada waxay raacaan guuritaanka, kuwa ka fogna way ka yaraadaan, ilaa fogaanta aad dejiso, oo leh qaabka hoos u dhaca ee aad doorato. Shid Kaliya dhinaca mesh-ka si aad u cabbirto dhinacyada xarriiqyada halkii toos. Jiid wuxuu guuraa xarriiqda wareeg la doortay dhinacyada ku dhow. Beddel qaabka Qalabka Waxa uu sameeyo Soo fidi Wejiyada la doortay wuxuu ka soo jiidaa jihada ay ku taagan yihiin, isagoo wejiyo cusub oo dhinac ah ku daraya (ama wejiyo ka sameeya xuduudaha furan). Ku qor masaafada Gudo Qaybta gudaha outline-ka wejiyada la doortay; riix I mar kasta oo wejiga kasta si gaar ah Jaranjaro Xarriiqyada la doortay (ama, Ctrl+Shift+B, dhibcaha) ballac ku goya; mouse-ka dhexe ama furayaasha plus iyo minus ayaa ku daraya qaybo, si loo helo xarriiq wareegsan Goy wareeg Xarriiq ku tilmaam: wareeg cusub oo ku wareegsan giraanta wejiyada afar-geesle ah; mouse-ka dhexe wuxuu dejiyaa inta wareeg; guji si aad u goyto Mindi Guji dhibcaha xarriiqyada ama geeska; Enter wuxuu si toosan u goyaa wejiyada u dhexeeya, sida aad arkayso Kala qaybi Xarriiq shaashad ku sawir: wejiyada la doortay (ama dhammaan) ayaa lagu goyaa Wareeji Wuxuu wareejiyaa wejiyada la doortay ama xarriiqyada furan wareegga buluuga ah tallaabooyin; mouse-ka dhexe wuxuu dejiyaa tallaabooyinka; wareeg oo buuxa wuu xiraa Kala qaybi Xarriiqyada la doortay waxay u kala baxaan laba; wejiyada oo dhan waxay noqdaan shabakad Isku dar Dhibcaha la doortay waxay noqdaan hal, dhexdooda Milmi Waxa la doortay wuu ka saaraa, laakiin dusha wuu hayaa: wejiyada way isku xidhmaan Buuxi Wejiga u dhexeeya xuduud furan oo la doortay (ama laba xarriiq furan dhexdooda) Buuxi shabakad Xuduud furan oo leh tiro xarriiq oo siman ayaa lagu buuxiyaa shabakad quads ah Buundo Laba wareeg oo xarriiq furan oo la doortay ayaa lagu xidhaa wejiyo Crease Sida xarriiqyada la doortay u adkaadaan marka mesh-ka lagu siibo Subdivision surface: u dhaqaaq dhexdhexaadka ka fogaan, isticmaal wheel-ka (tallaabooyin 0.1) ama ku qor 0 ilaa 1. Panelku wuxuu muujinayaa crease-ka xarriiqyada la doortay wuuna aqbalaa qiime la qoro. Xarriiqyada crease waxay ku muuqdaan magenta Rogid, Siib, Tirtir Wejiyada rogi; dhibcaha siib oo u soo dhowaad jaarkooda; tirtir sida habka dooridda Mid kasta waa hal tallaabo ka noqo. Coordinates-ka texture-ka, midabyada iyo miisaanka waxay ku raacaan wejiyada iyo dhibcaha cusub. Remesh Remesh wuxuu mesh-ka oo dhan dib uga sameeyaa saddex-geesood siman oo hal cabbir ah, kaas oo la weydiiyo markaad riixdo (yar waa fiican oo gaabis badan). Wuxuu xidhaa godadka, isku xidhaa qaybaha isku dhex mara, wuxuuna siman yeelaa mesh-ka uu sculpting-ku fidiyey. Xarriiqyada adag wax yar ayay ku noqdaan kuwo wareegsan. UV-ga, rinjiga iyo crease-yada mar kale bilaabmaan. Hal tallaabo ka noqo. Retopology Si aad mesh cusub oo nadiif ah u dhisto mid faahfaahsan oo sare (sculpt, scan), dooro mid faahfaahsan Retopology › Ku dhis panelka, kadibna: Dhibcaha la dhaqaajiyay ku qabo: dhibcaha aad dhaqaajiso, iyo xarriiqyada aad soo fidiso, dusheeda ayay ku dhacaan. Dhibcaha la doortay ku dhig wuxuu hadda dhibcaha la doortay dusheeda ku dhigaa (hal tallaabo ka noqo). Xarriiqyada mesh-kan muuji hore wuxuu muujiyaa mesh-ka aad dhisayso dusha dhexdeeda, si aad u aragto. Hagaaji hawlgalkii ugu dambeeyay Kadib Gudo, Jaranjaro, Goy wareeg, Kala qaybi, Siib, Buuxi shabakad ama Wareeji, panelku wuxuu muujiyaa dejintiisa (ballac, qaybo, qaab, goyo…). Mid bedel oo hawlgalku mar kale ayaa laga bilaabaa meeshii uu ka bilaabmay, wuxuuna weli yahay hal tallaabo ka noqo. Furayaasha Furayaasha riix-jiid Furayaasha moodeelka Guuri, wareeji, miisaan M Q S G R S (G laba jeer jiid) Soo fidi, gudo P, F E, I Tirtir E ama Delete X ama Delete Crease Shift+C Shift+E Dooro dhammaan, midna, rogid Ctrl+A, Esc, Ctrl+I A, Alt+A, Ctrl+I Labaduba Ctrl+B jaranjaro, Ctrl+R goy wareeg, K mindi isku mid, iyo F buuxi, M isku dar, Ctrl+X milmi, L / Ctrl+L isku xiran, Alt+N rogid, O saamayn, Shift+V jiid dhibic Eeg sidoo kale Mesh-yada, Wax-beddeliyayaasha mesh-ka iyo Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rotate-scale","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Wareeji iyo miisaan","summary":"Waxyaabaha ku wareeji barta ah marka la gujiyo ama darajo la qoro, oo siman u cabbir qaybiye.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["miisaan","qabasho miisaan","fidi","aan siman","dhinac kasta","rogid","nuqul muraayad","rogid ku","wareeji","leexo","xagal","darajo","kaashka xagal","cabbir","weynee","yaree","qaybiye","miisaan siman"],"headings":[{"id":"wareeji","text":"Wareeji","level":2},{"id":"miisaan","text":"Miisaan","level":2},{"id":"fidi-ama-miisaan-qabsashada","text":"Fidi ama miisaan qabsashada","level":3},{"id":"miisaan-barta-kasta","text":"Miisaan barta kasta","level":3},{"id":"miisaan-cabbir-sax-ah","text":"Miisaan cabbir sax ah","level":3},{"id":"sax-cabbirka-soo-dhoofin-khaldan","text":"Sax cabbirka soo dhoofin khaldan","level":3},{"id":"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato","text":"Waxyaabo aad ogaato","level":2},{"id":"rogid","text":"Rogid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"wareeji\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu xulashada ku wareejiyaa barta dhexe. Waxay qaadaa saddex guji: dhexdhexaadka, jihada bilowga, iyo jihada dhamaadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad wareejin doonto. Haddii aan waxba la dooran, Wareeji wuxuu qaadanayaa waxa aad marka hore guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Giraan ayaa raacda mu&#039;aaliga, oo muujinaysa diyaaradda aad ku wareejin doonto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta wareejinta dhexe.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhulka ama meel bannaan, giraanta waa siman tahay (buluug): wareejintu waxa ay ku dhacda tiir toosan, sida dhismo lagu wareejiyo goobteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWejiga dushiisa, giraanta waxa ay ku jirtaa diyaaradda wejigaas: wareejintu waxa ay ku dhacda jihada wejigaas. Guji derbi si aad wax ugu wareejiso tiir siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta bilaabaysa xagalka, tusaale ahaan dhinaca geeska waxa aad wareejinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaqaaq mu&#039;aaliga dhexdhexaadka ku wareeg. Xagalka waxa uu muuqdaa qodobka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E). Waxa uu u jiidaa tallaabooyin 15° markaad u dhowaato mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji si aad dhamayso, ama ku qor xagalka darajooyinka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-30\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXagalada wajab ah waxay wareegaan dhinaca saacadda ka soo horjeedda, marka laga eego dhinaca giraanta wejigeedu u jeedo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) intaad wareejinayso si aad u wareejiso \u003Cstrong\u003Enuqul\u003C/strong\u003E oo aad asalka uga tagto meeshiisa, sida Guuri; talooyinka ayaa sheegaya in nuqulku shaqeeyo ama uusan shaqeynin, riixitaanka furaha mar kale ayaa demiya. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E isla markiiba nuqul la wareejiyay ka dib si aad nuqullo dheeraad ah u hesho dhexdhexaadka isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida Guuri, qayb joomatriga isku xidhan wareejinta waxa ay ku qallooca wejiyada ku lifaaqan. Marka hore kooxee waxyaabaha si aad u wareejiso oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETalooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa in furayaasha fallaadhaha ay doortaan tiirka wareejinta, laakiin dhismahan, ka hor guji kowaad, waxa ay ku wareegaan muuqaalka. Si aad tiirka u doorato, guji dhexdhexaadka wejiga kaaga jihaysan jihada aad rabto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaan\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu xulashada dib u cabbiraa. Marka hore dooro waxa aad rabto inaad dib u cabbirto, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: labajibaaro yaryar (qabsashada) ayaa soo muuqda geeska, geesaha iyo dhexda dhinacyada sanduuqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fidi-ama-miisaan-qabsashada\"\u003EFidi ama miisaan qabsashada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQabsasho \u003Cstrong\u003Egeeska\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu miisaanayaa si siman dhinac kasta, geeska ka soo horjeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQabsashada dhexda \u003Cstrong\u003Edhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu fidiyaa jihadaas keliya, dhinaca ka soo horjeeda: sanduuq dheer ka dhig adoon sare u kordhin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQabsashada dhexda \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesaha sanduuqa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu fidiyaa laba jihood oo ka gudbaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E markaad qabsasho gujiso si aad miisaanka ugu dhex-dhexaadiso sanduuqa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji qabsasho, ku dhaqaaq tilmaame, kadibna mar kale guji; ama guji qabsasho oo qor cabbir (\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E wuu laba jibbaarayaa, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E wuu badhaa) oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Si dhinac kasta cabbirkiisa gaarka ah u siiso, qor saddex, casaan, cagaar iyo buluug: \u003Ccode\u003E2,1,0.5\u003C/code\u003E. Kooxda furan gudaheeda, jihooyinka waa jihooyinka kooxdaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"miisaan-barta-kasta\"\u003EMiisaan barta kasta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji meel kasta oo aan ahayn qabsasho si aad siman u miisaanto barta aad doorato. Waxay qaadaa saddex guji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad rabto inaad cabbirto. Haddii aan waxba la dooran, Miisaan wuxuu qaadanayaa waxa aad marka hore guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta ku sugan (ma aha qabsasho), tusaale ahaan geeska hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta tixraacda. Masaafadeeda barta koowaad waxay u tirtaa 1×.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhaqaaq tilmaame u dhow ama fogaado barta koowaad. Cabbirka waxa uu muuqdaa qodobka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji si aad dhamayso, ama qor cabbir oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu laba jibbaarayaa cabbirka, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E wuu badhaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"miisaan-cabbir-sax-ah\"\u003EMiisaan cabbir sax ah\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad wax u dhigto dherer sax ah, xisaabi cabbirka: dhererka cusub oo lagu qaybiyo dhererka hadda jira. Habka saddex guji sanduuqa qiimuhu wuu xisaabiyaa, sidaas darteed qor \u003Ccode\u003E4.2/3.6\u003C/code\u003E si aad u dhigto derbi 3.6 m ah mid 4.2 m dherer leh. Sanduuqa qiimaha qabsashada wuxuu qaataa lambarro cad oo keliya: marka hore xisaabi cabbirka (4.2 oo lagu qaybiyo 3.6 waa qiyaastii 1.1667). Marka hore dooro geesta si aad u akhriso dhererkeeda hadda ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sax-cabbirka-soo-dhoofin-khaldan\"\u003ESax cabbirka soo dhoofin khaldan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylasha OBJ ma lahaan cabbir, sidaas darteed moodel lagu sawiray millimitir wuxuu yimaadaa 1000 jeer oo weyn. Dooro kooxda la soo dhoofiyay, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji qabsasho geeska, kadibna qor \u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Moodel lagu sawiray inch, qor \u003Ccode\u003E0.0254\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato\"\u003EWaxyaabo aad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaanka barta saddex guji waa siman yahay. Si aad u fidiso hal jihood oo keliya, isticmaal qabsashada dhinaca ama geesaha (eeg kor).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaan kooxda ama komponentka wuxuu beddelaa nuqulka aad miisaantay; nuqullada kale ee komponentka waxa ay hayaan cabbirkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E guji dambe ka hor si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rogid\"\u003ERogid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rogo jihada casaanka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rogo jihada cagaarka\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rogo jihada buluugga\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xulashada muraayad ka dhigaa meeshiisa, dhexda sanduuqeeda: jiid bidix-gacan ah wuxuu noqdaa midig-gacan ah. Wejiyadu way sii hayaan inay dibada u jeedaan, kooxda ama komponentka waxa loo muraayadeeyaa isaga oo keliya (gudaheeda lama qoro dib).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqul la rogay jihada casaanka\u003C/span\u003E (iyo cagaar, buluug) wuxuu asalka uga tagaa meeshiisa oo wuxuu dhigaa nuqul muraayad ah dhinacdeeda, dhinaca kale ee sanduuqa xulashada: albaabka kale ee labada, dhinaca kale ee dhismaha. Joomatriga furan ee halkaas taabanaya wuxuu ku biiraa asalka, sida joomatriga taabanaya had iyo jeer sameeya; marka hore asalka ka dhig kooxda si aad u kala saarto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda furan gudaheeda, casaan, cagaar iyo buluug waa jihooyinka kooxda gaarka ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Wareeji Wareeji (Q) wuxuu xulashada ku wareejiyaa barta dhexe. Waxay qaadaa saddex guji: dhexdhexaadka, jihada bilowga, iyo jihada dhamaadka. Dooro waxa aad wareejin doonto. Haddii aan waxba la dooran, Wareeji wuxuu qaadanayaa waxa aad marka hore guji. Riix Q. Giraan ayaa raacda mu'aaliga, oo muujinaysa diyaaradda aad ku wareejin doonto. Guji barta wareejinta dhexe. Dhulka ama meel bannaan, giraanta waa siman tahay (buluug): wareejintu waxa ay ku dhacda tiir toosan, sida dhismo lagu wareejiyo goobteeda. Wejiga dushiisa, giraanta waxa ay ku jirtaa diyaaradda wejigaas: wareejintu waxa ay ku dhacda jihada wejigaas. Guji derbi si aad wax ugu wareejiso tiir siman. Guji barta bilaabaysa xagalka, tusaale ahaan dhinaca geeska waxa aad wareejinayso. Ku dhaqaaq mu'aaliga dhexdhexaadka ku wareeg. Xagalka waxa uu muuqdaa qodobka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (Xagal). Waxa uu u jiidaa tallaabooyin 15° markaad u dhowaato mid. Guji si aad dhamayso, ama ku qor xagalka darajooyinka oo riix Enter: 90, 45, -30. Xagalada wajab ah waxay wareegaan dhinaca saacadda ka soo horjeedda, marka laga eego dhinaca giraanta wejigeedu u jeedo. Riix Ctrl (ama Alt) intaad wareejinayso si aad u wareejiso nuqul oo aad asalka uga tagto meeshiisa, sida Guuri; talooyinka ayaa sheegaya in nuqulku shaqeeyo ama uusan shaqeynin, riixitaanka furaha mar kale ayaa demiya. Qor 3x isla markiiba nuqul la wareejiyay ka dib si aad nuqullo dheeraad ah u hesho dhexdhexaadka isku mid. Sida Guuri, qayb joomatriga isku xidhan wareejinta waxa ay ku qallooca wejiyada ku lifaaqan. Marka hore kooxee waxyaabaha si aad u wareejiso oo dhan. Talooyinka wuxuu sheegayaa in furayaasha fallaadhaha ay doortaan tiirka wareejinta, laakiin dhismahan, ka hor guji kowaad, waxa ay ku wareegaan muuqaalka. Si aad tiirka u doorato, guji dhexdhexaadka wejiga kaaga jihaysan jihada aad rabto. Eeg Weli lama dhisin. Miisaan Miisaan (S) wuxuu xulashada dib u cabbiraa. Marka hore dooro waxa aad rabto inaad dib u cabbirto, kadibna riix S: labajibaaro yaryar (qabsashada) ayaa soo muuqda geeska, geesaha iyo dhexda dhinacyada sanduuqa. Fidi ama miisaan qabsashada Qabsasho geeska wuxuu miisaanayaa si siman dhinac kasta, geeska ka soo horjeeda. Qabsashada dhexda dhinaca wuxuu fidiyaa jihadaas keliya, dhinaca ka soo horjeeda: sanduuq dheer ka dhig adoon sare u kordhin. Qabsashada dhexda geesaha sanduuqa wuxuu fidiyaa laba jihood oo ka gudbaya. Hay Ctrl markaad qabsasho gujiso si aad miisaanka ugu dhex-dhexaadiso sanduuqa halkaas. Guji qabsasho, ku dhaqaaq tilmaame, kadibna mar kale guji; ama guji qabsasho oo qor cabbir (2 wuu laba jibbaarayaa, 0.5 wuu badhaa) oo riix Enter. Si dhinac kasta cabbirkiisa gaarka ah u siiso, qor saddex, casaan, cagaar iyo buluug: 2,1,0.5. Kooxda furan gudaheeda, jihooyinka waa jihooyinka kooxdaas. Miisaan barta kasta Guji meel kasta oo aan ahayn qabsasho si aad siman u miisaanto barta aad doorato. Waxay qaadaa saddex guji: Dooro waxa aad rabto inaad cabbirto. Haddii aan waxba la dooran, Miisaan wuxuu qaadanayaa waxa aad marka hore guji. Riix S. Guji barta ku sugan (ma aha qabsasho), tusaale ahaan geeska hoose. Guji barta tixraacda. Masaafadeeda barta koowaad waxay u tirtaa 1×. Ku dhaqaaq tilmaame u dhow ama fogaado barta koowaad. Cabbirka waxa uu muuqdaa qodobka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (Miisaan). Guji si aad dhamayso, ama qor cabbir oo riix Enter: 2 wuxuu laba jibbaarayaa cabbirka, 0.5 wuu badhaa. Miisaan cabbir sax ah Si aad wax u dhigto dherer sax ah, xisaabi cabbirka: dhererka cusub oo lagu qaybiyo dhererka hadda jira. Habka saddex guji sanduuqa qiimuhu wuu xisaabiyaa, sidaas darteed qor 4.2/3.6 si aad u dhigto derbi 3.6 m ah mid 4.2 m dherer leh. Sanduuqa qiimaha qabsashada wuxuu qaataa lambarro cad oo keliya: marka hore xisaabi cabbirka (4.2 oo lagu qaybiyo 3.6 waa qiyaastii 1.1667). Marka hore dooro geesta si aad u akhriso dhererkeeda hadda ee Macluumaadka. Sax cabbirka soo dhoofin khaldan Faylasha OBJ ma lahaan cabbir, sidaas darteed moodel lagu sawiray millimitir wuxuu yimaadaa 1000 jeer oo weyn. Dooro kooxda la soo dhoofiyay, riix S, guji qabsasho geeska, kadibna qor 0.001 oo riix Enter. Moodel lagu sawiray inch, qor 0.0254. Waxyaabo aad ogaato Miisaanka barta saddex guji waa siman yahay. Si aad u fidiso hal jihood oo keliya, isticmaal qabsashada dhinaca ama geesaha (eeg kor). Miisaan kooxda ama komponentka wuxuu beddelaa nuqulka aad miisaantay; nuqullada kale ee komponentka waxa ay hayaan cabbirkooda. Riix Esc guji dambe ka hor si aad u joojiso. Rogid Tafatir › Dheeraad › Ku rogo jihada casaanka, Ku rogo jihada cagaarka ama Ku rogo jihada buluugga wuxuu xulashada muraayad ka dhigaa meeshiisa, dhexda sanduuqeeda: jiid bidix-gacan ah wuxuu noqdaa midig-gacan ah. Wejiyadu way sii hayaan inay dibada u jeedaan, kooxda ama komponentka waxa loo muraayadeeyaa isaga oo keliya (gudaheeda lama qoro dib). Nuqul la rogay jihada casaanka (iyo cagaar, buluug) wuxuu asalka uga tagaa meeshiisa oo wuxuu dhigaa nuqul muraayad ah dhinacdeeda, dhinaca kale ee sanduuqa xulashada: albaabka kale ee labada, dhinaca kale ee dhismaha. Joomatriga furan ee halkaas taabanaya wuxuu ku biiraa asalka, sida joomatriga taabanaya had iyo jeer sameeya; marka hore asalka ka dhig kooxda si aad u kala saarto. Kooxda furan gudaheeda, casaan, cagaar iyo buluug waa jihooyinka kooxda gaarka ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"modifiers","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Wax-beddeliyayaasha mesh-ka, kooxda ama komponentka","summary":"Miisaan, muraayad, safka, siib, jaranjaro, goy iyo qallooc mesh-ka adigoo aan beddelin; ku celi ama miisaan kooxda ama komponentka isla kaydka, oo ka dhig mid joogto ah markaad diyaar tahay.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["wax-beddeliye","wax-beddeliyayaal","kayd","kooxda","komponentka","miisaan","bake","tafatir isha","aan dib loo beddelin","muraayad","safka","dusha kala qaybinta","siib","jaranjaro","adeegso jirid","boolean","goy","ku riix","isku xidh","yaree","lattice","qafas","qallooc curve","qallooc","ku qabo","codso"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-wax-beddeliye","text":"Ku dar wax-beddeliye","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-wax-beddeliye-kasta","text":"Badhamada wax-beddeliye kasta","level":2},{"id":"wax-beddeliyayaasha","text":"Wax-beddeliyayaasha","level":2},{"id":"kooxda-ama-komponentka","text":"Kooxda ama komponentka","level":2},{"id":"dusha-kala-qaybinta","text":"Dusha kala qaybinta","level":2},{"id":"qallooc-qafas-lattice","text":"Qallooc qafas lattice","level":2},{"id":"mesh-yada-weyn","text":"Mesh-yada weyn","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wax-beddeliyayaasha-weli-aan-samaynin","text":"Waxa wax-beddeliyayaasha weli aan samaynin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax-beddeliye\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu beddelaa wixii mesh-ku muujiyo, isagoo aan mesh-ka laftiisa beddelin. Muraayad mid qaybta mid ah oo kaliya moodeel, ama geesood dhismee oo sid aad u tafatirto. Wax-beddeliyayaasha waxay ku jiraan \u003Cstrong\u003Ekayd\u003C/strong\u003E, wayna shaqeeyaan tallaabo tallaabo, sare ilaa hoose. Wixii aad aragto, dhoofiso, daabacdo iyo rendarto waa mesh leh wax-beddeliyayaasha oo dhammaan shidan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-wax-beddeliye\"\u003EKu dar wax-beddeliye\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mesh. Goobta Model qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EWax-beddeliyayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E; goobta Mesh waxay ku jirtaa panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mid ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar wax-beddeliye…\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta kaydka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel dejintiisa hoosta magaciisa. Dherer waxay qaataan qiimaha isla sida sanduuqa qiimaha, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E600mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E(6m)/4\u003C/code\u003E oo dhammaantood waa shaqeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo ka noqo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqonaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-wax-beddeliye-kasta\"\u003EBadhamada wax-beddeliye kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa calaamadda ayaa shidaya ama demiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka shaashadda wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa muuqaalka (wuxuu weli ku jiraa kaydka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka kamaradda wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa sawirada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyada, sidaas darteed wax-beddeliye wuxuu u noqon karaa kuwa rendarka oo keliya (ama muuqaalka oo keliya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFallaadhaha ayaa u dhaqaajiya kaydka sare ama hoos. Kala horreysku waa muhiim: muraayad ka dibna dusha kala qaybin waxay siinaysaa xidh siman; dusha kala qaybin ka dibna muraayad ma siinayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaabka ka dhigaa qayb mesh-ka ah: wax-beddeliyayaasha ka sarreeya iyo kan ku jira waxay ku dhacaan mesh-ka laftiisa oo ka baxaan kaydka. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamada xaashku waa ka saaraysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-beddeliyayaasha\"\u003EWax-beddeliyayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWax-beddeliye\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaan ku dhaqan dhexda walaxda, factor ku dhaca cas, cagaar iyo buluug. Kooxda ama komponentka sidoo kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuraayad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul muraayad ah oo ku dhaca cas, cagaar ama buluug mesh-ka dhexdiisa, wuxuuna isku xidhaa qaybaha halka ay kulmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqulada siman (dherer yar oo ah cabbirkiisa iyo tirooyinka aad siiso, oo dheeraad ah), wareeg tiir, ama dhigan qaab curve ah moodeelka. Kooxda ama komponentka safka ayay raacaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha kala qaybinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh-ka wuu siibayaa Catmull-Clark subdivision. Xarriiqyada adag adag ayay sii joogaan. Rendarka wuxuu isticmaali karaa heerar ka badan muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJaranjaro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWixii xarriiq ka adag xaddiga xagal aad siiso wuu wareegsanayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdeegso jirid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha wuxuu siinayaa dhumuc, wuxuuna xidhaa geeskiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoolean\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa ka gooya, isku xidha, ama ka hayo isku-kalifidda walax kale oo moodeelka ku jirta. Labadaba waa inay noqdaan solid xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu riix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha u riixa gudaha ama dibadda iyada oo la adeegsanayo noise siman. Isla seed-ka wuxuu had iyo jeer siinayaa isla buuq-buuqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku xidh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku xidha dhibcaha ka dhow masaafo la siiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYaree\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu hayaa qayb saddex-geesoodyada, isagoo ka saaraya kuwa ugu yar ee beddelaya qaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiib\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha u fidiya deriskooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELattice\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh-ka qaloocinaya qafas: dhaqaaji dhibcaha qafaska, mesh-ku wuu raacayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQallooc curve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh-ka ku qallooca curve moodeelka, oo ku dhaqan cas, cagaar ama buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha kasta u dhaqaajiya dhibcaha ugu dhow walax kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooxda-ama-komponentka\"\u003EKooxda ama komponentka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda ama komponentka ayaa sidoo kale hayn kara cunto, sidaas darteed hoodhka mindi wuxuu noqon karaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESafka\u003C/strong\u003E oo hal mindi ah, isla markaana lambarka beddelo wuxuu beddelaa laambadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda ama komponentka. Gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EWax-beddeliyayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay liistaa kaydka (madhan markii hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafka\u003C/span\u003E oo ka mid ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar wax-beddeliye…\u003C/span\u003E. Kooxdu waxay noqonaysaa komponent ah oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003Easalka, oo kaydka u dhigay\u003C/strong\u003E. Asalka waa la hayaa: wixii aad ku beddesho nuqul kasta ayaa isla markiiba raacaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaan waxa lagu qaadaa factor cas, cagaar iyo buluug (\u003Ccode\u003E1, 1, 2\u003C/code\u003E waxay laba jeer ka dhigaysaa dhererka). Safka waxa lagu qaadaa tirada nuqulada, tallaabo ah qayb natiijada hadda, iyo tallaabo dheeraad ah dherer ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydku wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kor ilaa hoos dhuruhu asalkiisa, xagalkiisa, si ay dalabku muhiim u yahay: safka saddex nuqul oo 3 m u kala dhexeeya, kadibna Miisaan 2 cas ahaan, wuxuu nuqullada u dhigaa 6 m u kala dhexeeya; Miisaan marka hore, kadibna safka, wuxuu hayaa 3 m. Sanduuqa calaamadda, fallaadhaha iyo dhadhaaqa waxay u shaqeeyaan sida mesh-ka; badhamada shaashadda iyo kamaradda, iyo Codso wax-beddeliye keli ah ma shaqeeyaan, maxaa yeelay kaydku waa hal shay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir isha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa asalka meesha uu ku yaallo. Isbeddelka waxa lagu arkaa nuqul kasta; xirida waxay kuu celinaysaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhig wax-beddelayaasha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa natiijada xarriiqyo iyo wejiyo caadi ah, wuxuuna ka saaraa kaydka hal tallaabo ka noqo. Nuqullada isku dhex mara ayaa weli u sii jiraan joomatari kala gaar ah; ma aha isku-kalifid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqullada komponentka waxay wadaagaan cuntada; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E ayaa kala saara (asalka ayaa weli la wadaago).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxaa lagu qaadaa koobiyeynta iyo dhaqidda iyo ka noqoshada, Purge unused ayaa hayna asalka. Barnaamij aan wax-beddeliyayaasha garanayn wuxuu weli muujinayaa nuqullada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa Ku dhig, natiijada laguma geli karo, laguma burburin karo, looma beddeli karo cabbir ama luqsad: waa dib loo dhisi doonaa isbeddel kasta marka xiga. Mid kasta wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXadka waa 32 wax-beddeliye iyo 1,000 nuqul. Komponent loo sameeyay in la kala fidiyo (Stretch) iyo kaydku ma wadaagi karaan qeexid hadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-kala-qaybinta\"\u003EDusha kala qaybinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESubdivision wuxuu siibaa mesh-ka Catmull-Clark: wejiga kasta wuxuu noqdaa wejiyo afar-geesood ah, heer kasta wuxuu sameeyaa afar jeer wejiyo badan. Sanduuq leh laba ama saddex heer ayaa horey u muuqda sida qaab wareegsan, adna waad sii tafatiri kartaa sanduuqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa sida siibka u badan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeerarka sawirada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa sida sawirada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyadu siib u yihiin; rendarku wuxuu isticmaali karaa heerar ka badan muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERendarrada dusha siibka dhab ah\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhibcaha mesh-ka la rendarayo ku dhigaa dusha xadka heerarku u dhowaanayaan, sidaas darteed xitaa laba heer ayaa sida badan u rendara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrease-yada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay xarriiqyada adag ka dhigaan: goobta Mesh dooro xarriiqyada oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E (1 wuu adkaadaa, 0.5 wuu wareegaa yar, 0 waa siib). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003ETafatir mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDami heerka muuqaalka mesh weyn:\u003C/strong\u003E marka heerarka aad codsanayso ay wejiyo badan siinayaan intii kombiyuutarkan muuqaalka uu si wanaagsan u maamuli karo, muuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa heer hoose wuuna sheegayaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E had iyo jeer wuxuu isticmaalaa heerarka oo dhan. Inta wejiyo ayaa lagu dejiyaa heerka kombiyuutarkaaga oo ku yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › Rendering › Kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuduudaha furan waxay hayaan geesahooda oo waxay ku sii joogaan khadka xarriiqyadooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qallooc-qafas-lattice\"\u003EQallooc qafas lattice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar wax-beddeliye \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELattice\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar qafas lattice shabakadda ku wareegsan\u003C/span\u003E. Qafas ah 3 × 3 × 3 dhibcood ayaa soo baxa mesh-ka ku wareegsan, oo wadno ahaan loo muujiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQafaska goobta Mesh ku fur (laba jeer guji), kadibna dhaqaaji dhibcaha. Mesh-ku wuu si nacasi ah u raacayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQafasku waa mesh sida mid kale: markaad dhammaysato, qari isagoo adeegsanaya calaamadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mesh-yada-weyn\"\u003EMesh-yada weyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydka yar ayaa mar dhow la shaqeeyaa. Mid weyn ayaa background-ka lagu shaqeeyaa dhammaan core-yada kombiyuutarkaaga: muuqaalku wuxuu weli muujinayaa natiijadii ugu dambaysay ilaa cusbo ay diyaar tahay. Booleans waxay soo rarayaan solid modeler-ka markii ugu horreysay; muuqaalku wuxuu sheegaa tan wakhti kooban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wax-beddeliyayaasha-weli-aan-samaynin\"\u003EWaxa wax-beddeliyayaasha weli aan samaynin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibcood kasta miisaan (falloff lagu rinjiyay mesh-ka) Ku riix, Siib iyo Ku qabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWax-beddeliyayaal aan ahayn Miisaan iyo Safka toosan ee joomatariga riix-jiid (kooxaha iyo komponentada): mesh u beddel marka hore (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU beddel mesh\u003C/span\u003E). Muraayad, Safka wareegsan ama curve, Qallooc iyo Taper kooxaha ayaa iman doona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Wax-beddeliye wuxuu beddelaa wixii mesh-ku muujiyo, isagoo aan mesh-ka laftiisa beddelin. Muraayad mid qaybta mid ah oo kaliya moodeel, ama geesood dhismee oo sid aad u tafatirto. Wax-beddeliyayaasha waxay ku jiraan kayd, wayna shaqeeyaan tallaabo tallaabo, sare ilaa hoose. Wixii aad aragto, dhoofiso, daabacdo iyo rendarto waa mesh leh wax-beddeliyayaasha oo dhammaan shidan. Ku dar wax-beddeliye Dooro mesh. Goobta Model qaybta Wax-beddeliyayaasha waxay ku jirtaa Macluumaadka; goobta Mesh waxay ku jirtaa panelka midig. Dooro mid ka Ku dar wax-beddeliye…. Wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta kaydka. Beddel dejintiisa hoosta magaciisa. Dherer waxay qaataan qiimaha isla sida sanduuqa qiimaha, sidaas darteed 600mm, 2'6\" iyo (6m)/4 oo dhammaantood waa shaqeeyaan. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo ka noqo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqonaysa. Badhamada wax-beddeliye kasta Sanduuqa calaamadda ayaa shidaya ama demiya. Badhanka shaashadda wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa muuqaalka (wuxuu weli ku jiraa kaydka). Badhanka kamaradda wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa sawirada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyada, sidaas darteed wax-beddeliye wuxuu u noqon karaa kuwa rendarka oo keliya (ama muuqaalka oo keliya). Fallaadhaha ayaa u dhaqaajiya kaydka sare ama hoos. Kala horreysku waa muhiim: muraayad ka dibna dusha kala qaybin waxay siinaysaa xidh siman; dusha kala qaybin ka dibna muraayad ma siinayso. Codso wuxuu qaabka ka dhigaa qayb mesh-ka ah: wax-beddeliyayaasha ka sarreeya iyo kan ku jira waxay ku dhacaan mesh-ka laftiisa oo ka baxaan kaydka. Waa hal tallaabo ka noqo. Calaamada xaashku waa ka saaraysa. Wax-beddeliyayaasha Wax-beddeliye Waxa uu sameeyo Miisaan Miisaan ku dhaqan dhexda walaxda, factor ku dhaca cas, cagaar iyo buluug. Kooxda ama komponentka sidoo kale Muraayad Nuqul muraayad ah oo ku dhaca cas, cagaar ama buluug mesh-ka dhexdiisa, wuxuuna isku xidhaa qaybaha halka ay kulmaan Safka Nuqulada siman (dherer yar oo ah cabbirkiisa iyo tirooyinka aad siiso, oo dheeraad ah), wareeg tiir, ama dhigan qaab curve ah moodeelka. Kooxda ama komponentka safka ayay raacaan Dusha kala qaybinta Mesh-ka wuu siibayaa Catmull-Clark subdivision. Xarriiqyada adag adag ayay sii joogaan. Rendarka wuxuu isticmaali karaa heerar ka badan muuqaalka Jaranjaro Wixii xarriiq ka adag xaddiga xagal aad siiso wuu wareegsanayaa Adeegso jirid Dusha wuxuu siinayaa dhumuc, wuxuuna xidhaa geeskiisa Boolean Waxa ka gooya, isku xidha, ama ka hayo isku-kalifidda walax kale oo moodeelka ku jirta. Labadaba waa inay noqdaan solid xidhan Ku riix Dusha u riixa gudaha ama dibadda iyada oo la adeegsanayo noise siman. Isla seed-ka wuxuu had iyo jeer siinayaa isla buuq-buuqa Isku xidh Isku xidha dhibcaha ka dhow masaafo la siiyay Yaree Wuxuu hayaa qayb saddex-geesoodyada, isagoo ka saaraya kuwa ugu yar ee beddelaya qaabka Siib Dhibcaha u fidiya deriskooda Lattice Mesh-ka qaloocinaya qafas: dhaqaaji dhibcaha qafaska, mesh-ku wuu raacayaa Qallooc curve Mesh-ka ku qallooca curve moodeelka, oo ku dhaqan cas, cagaar ama buluug Ku qabo Dhibcaha kasta u dhaqaajiya dhibcaha ugu dhow walax kale Kooxda ama komponentka Kooxda ama komponentka ayaa sidoo kale hayn kara cunto, sidaas darteed hoodhka mindi wuxuu noqon karaa Miisaan iyo Safka oo hal mindi ah, isla markaana lambarka beddelo wuxuu beddelaa laambadda. Dooro kooxda ama komponentka. Gudaha Macluumaadka qaybta Wax-beddeliyayaasha waxay liistaa kaydka (madhan markii hore). Dooro Miisaan ama Safka oo ka mid ah Ku dar wax-beddeliye…. Kooxdu waxay noqonaysaa komponent ah oo ah asalka, oo kaydka u dhigay. Asalka waa la hayaa: wixii aad ku beddesho nuqul kasta ayaa isla markiiba raacaya. Miisaan waxa lagu qaadaa factor cas, cagaar iyo buluug (1, 1, 2 waxay laba jeer ka dhigaysaa dhererka). Safka waxa lagu qaadaa tirada nuqulada, tallaabo ah qayb natiijada hadda, iyo tallaabo dheeraad ah dherer ahaan. Kaydku wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa kor ilaa hoos dhuruhu asalkiisa, xagalkiisa, si ay dalabku muhiim u yahay: safka saddex nuqul oo 3 m u kala dhexeeya, kadibna Miisaan 2 cas ahaan, wuxuu nuqullada u dhigaa 6 m u kala dhexeeya; Miisaan marka hore, kadibna safka, wuxuu hayaa 3 m. Sanduuqa calaamadda, fallaadhaha iyo dhadhaaqa waxay u shaqeeyaan sida mesh-ka; badhamada shaashadda iyo kamaradda, iyo Codso wax-beddeliye keli ah ma shaqeeyaan, maxaa yeelay kaydku waa hal shay. Tafatir isha wuxuu furaa asalka meesha uu ku yaallo. Isbeddelka waxa lagu arkaa nuqul kasta; xirida waxay kuu celinaysaa meeshii aad ka timid. Ku dhig wax-beddelayaasha wuxuu ka dhigaa natiijada xarriiqyo iyo wejiyo caadi ah, wuxuuna ka saaraa kaydka hal tallaabo ka noqo. Nuqullada isku dhex mara ayaa weli u sii jiraan joomatari kala gaar ah; ma aha isku-kalifid. Nuqullada komponentka waxay wadaagaan cuntada; Ka dhig gaar ah ayaa kala saara (asalka ayaa weli la wadaago). Kaydka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxaa lagu qaadaa koobiyeynta iyo dhaqidda iyo ka noqoshada, Purge unused ayaa hayna asalka. Barnaamij aan wax-beddeliyayaasha garanayn wuxuu weli muujinayaa nuqullada. Ilaa Ku dhig, natiijada laguma geli karo, laguma burburin karo, looma beddeli karo cabbir ama luqsad: waa dib loo dhisi doonaa isbeddel kasta marka xiga. Mid kasta wuu sheegaa. Xadka waa 32 wax-beddeliye iyo 1,000 nuqul. Komponent loo sameeyay in la kala fidiyo (Stretch) iyo kaydku ma wadaagi karaan qeexid hadda. Dusha kala qaybinta Subdivision wuxuu siibaa mesh-ka Catmull-Clark: wejiga kasta wuxuu noqdaa wejiyo afar-geesood ah, heer kasta wuxuu sameeyaa afar jeer wejiyo badan. Sanduuq leh laba ama saddex heer ayaa horey u muuqda sida qaab wareegsan, adna waad sii tafatiri kartaa sanduuqa. Heerarka muuqaalka wuxuu go'aamiyaa sida siibka u badan yahay. Heerarka sawirada wuxuu go'aamiyaa sida sawirada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyadu siib u yihiin; rendarku wuxuu isticmaali karaa heerar ka badan muuqaalka. Rendarrada dusha siibka dhab ah wuxuu dhibcaha mesh-ka la rendarayo ku dhigaa dusha xadka heerarku u dhowaanayaan, sidaas darteed xitaa laba heer ayaa sida badan u rendara. Crease-yada waxay xarriiqyada adag ka dhigaan: goobta Mesh dooro xarriiqyada oo isticmaal Crease (1 wuu adkaadaa, 0.5 wuu wareegaa yar, 0 waa siib). Eeg Tafatir mesh. Dami heerka muuqaalka mesh weyn: marka heerarka aad codsanayso ay wejiyo badan siinayaan intii kombiyuutarkan muuqaalka uu si wanaagsan u maamuli karo, muuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa heer hoose wuuna sheegayaa. Codso had iyo jeer wuxuu isticmaalaa heerarka oo dhan. Inta wejiyo ayaa lagu dejiyaa heerka kombiyuutarkaaga oo ku yaal Dejinta › Rendering › Kombiyuutarkaaga. Xuduudaha furan waxay hayaan geesahooda oo waxay ku sii joogaan khadka xarriiqyadooda. Qallooc qafas lattice Ku dar wax-beddeliye Lattice oo riix Ku dar qafas lattice shabakadda ku wareegsan. Qafas ah 3 × 3 × 3 dhibcood ayaa soo baxa mesh-ka ku wareegsan, oo wadno ahaan loo muujiyo. Qafaska goobta Mesh ku fur (laba jeer guji), kadibna dhaqaaji dhibcaha. Mesh-ku wuu si nacasi ah u raacayaa. Qafasku waa mesh sida mid kale: markaad dhammaysato, qari isagoo adeegsanaya calaamadiisa. Mesh-yada weyn Kaydka yar ayaa mar dhow la shaqeeyaa. Mid weyn ayaa background-ka lagu shaqeeyaa dhammaan core-yada kombiyuutarkaaga: muuqaalku wuxuu weli muujinayaa natiijadii ugu dambaysay ilaa cusbo ay diyaar tahay. Booleans waxay soo rarayaan solid modeler-ka markii ugu horreysay; muuqaalku wuxuu sheegaa tan wakhti kooban. Waxa wax-beddeliyayaasha weli aan samaynin Dhibcood kasta miisaan (falloff lagu rinjiyay mesh-ka) Ku riix, Siib iyo Ku qabo. Wax-beddeliyayaal aan ahayn Miisaan iyo Safka toosan ee joomatariga riix-jiid (kooxaha iyo komponentada): mesh u beddel marka hore (U beddel mesh). Muraayad, Safka wareegsan ama curve, Qallooc iyo Taper kooxaha ayaa iman doona.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"uv","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Habee UV-yada mesh-ka","summary":"Calaamadi xagallada, unwrap, mudee oo rar UV-yada mesh-ka goobta UV, oo hubi adoo isticmaalaya shaxan iyo midabyada ballaadhinta.","section":"tasks","order":61,"keywords":["uv","uvs","unwrap","unwrapping","xagal","xagallo","tekstuur","texture coordinates","atlas","rar","packing","island","islands","shaxan","ballaadhin","qalooca","box projection","cylinder projection","sphere projection","conformal","angle based","lscm","abf"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"calaamadi-xagallada","text":"Calaamadi xagallada","level":2},{"id":"unwrap","text":"Unwrap","level":2},{"id":"mudee","text":"Mudee","level":2},{"id":"dhig","text":"Dhig","level":2},{"id":"hubi","text":"Hubi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETekstuur waa sawir siman; mesh-ku ma siman. \u003Cstrong\u003EUV\u003C/strong\u003E-yadiisu waxay sheegaan halka geeska kasta oo dhinac kasta uu ku yaal sawirka. Goobta UV-ga ayaa samaysa: waxaad mesh-ka ka gooysaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exagallo\u003C/strong\u003E (seams), waxaad qaybaha ku fidisaa (\u003Cstrong\u003Eunwrap\u003C/strong\u003E), oo waxaad ku dhex geliysaa lammaanaha (\u003Cstrong\u003Erar\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro mesh oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUV\u003C/span\u003E liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/span\u003E. Kooxda ama komponentka waxay marka hore noqonaysaa mesh, sida goobta Mesh. Aragta 3D waxay u guurtaa nus bidix; \u003Cstrong\u003Etafatiraha UV\u003C/strong\u003E midig wuxuu muujinayaa dhinacyada mesh-ka oo lagu habeeyay lammaanaha tekstuurka. Doorashadu waxay u shaqaysaa sida goobta Mesh, wixii aad doorato hal aragta ayaa lagu doortaa kan kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadi-xagallada\"\u003ECalaamadi xagallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXagallada waa meelaha mesh-ka laga gooyn karo; waxay u muuqdaan casaan labada aragoodba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro geesaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesta\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"2\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamadi xagal\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control E\"\u003E⌃E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar xagal\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift E\"\u003E⌃⇧E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ayaa ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagallo geeska adag\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa geesaha adag oo dhan iyo geesaha dhinacyadu ka kulmaan in ka badan 60°: boks wuxuu u kala go&#039;aa lix dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagallada UV-yada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa xagallada meesha UV-yadu horeyba u jabaan, tusaale ka dib mudayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb xidhan ayaa u baahan xagallo si ay u fidaan: kubbadda waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan hal goyn, tuubada goyn dhererkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unwrap\"\u003EUnwrap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro dhinacyada la habeeyo (ama midna, mesh-ka oo dhan) oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnwrap\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"U\"\u003EU\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EU\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Qayb kasta oo u dhexeysa xagallada waa la fidiyaa, xagalkeeda ilaalinaya sida ugu sax ee ay suurtogal tahay (fidinta xagal ku salaysan), kadibna qaybaha waa la rari dhinaca lammaanaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConformal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu unwrap-ka ku sameeyaa khariidado conformal ee least-squares: way degdegtaa, wuxuuna yar ka kala fog yahay qaybaha aad u foorarsan. Qaab ka samayn karta xaashi fidsan, sida dhinaca silindar oo mar la gooyay, wuxuu unwrap-ka u sameeyaa iyada oo aan wax ballaadhin lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mudee\"\u003EMudee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka fudud, mudayn badanaa way ku filan tahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMudayn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoks\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac kasta ilaa dhinaca boksa uu ku wajahan yahay ugu badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilindar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg tiirka buluugga ah: ballaca waa xagalka wareegga, kor waa dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKubbad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa xarunta: ballaca waa xagalka wareegga, kor waa digriiga latitude-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida dhinacyada loo arko aragta 3D hadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinaca ku taal xidhiidhka silindarka ama kubbadda waxa lagu hayaa hal qayb, sidaas darteed UV-yadiisu way ka sii bixi karaan xagga midig ee lammaanaha wax yar; tekstuurradu halkaas way ku celcelinayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig\"\u003EDhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa qaybaha (islands) lammaanaha hal cabbir texel ah, mid kastaa waa la leexiyay si uu u qaato meel yar. Panelku wuxuu dejiyaa booska ka harsan ee u dhexeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERog 90°\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayadee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leexiyaa ama muraayadeeyaa UV-yada dhinacyada la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETafatiraha UV-ga, riix dhinac la doortay si aad u dhaqaajiso UV-yada doorashada, ama dhanka tafatiraha taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka dibna dhaqaaq si aad u leexiso ama u cabbirto (gujin wuu hayaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa joojiya). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dhaqaajiyaa adoon jiidin. Riix laba jeer dhinac (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) si aad u doorato qaybta oo dhan. Mouse-ka wheel-ka ayaa weynaynaya; jiid badhanka dhexe ama midig si aad u guurto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u habeeya lammaanaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi\"\u003EHubi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaxan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa shaxan calaamadaysan mesh-ka UV-yadiisa: shaxanno siman oo labajibbaaran waxay tilmaamaan in tekstuurku siman yahay; calaamadaha waxay muujinayaan jihada ay socoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa dhinac kasta sida UV-yadu u ballaadhiso: buluug waa midna, marka uu cagaar ka soo baxo, ilaa casaan badan. Panelku wuxuu doortaa inuu cabbiro \u003Cstrong\u003Exagal foorarsan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ecabbir isbeddelay\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuuna muujiyaa celceliska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003ETafatir mesh\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EMesh-yada\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EBeddelayaasha mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tekstuur waa sawir siman; mesh-ku ma siman. UV-yadiisu waxay sheegaan halka geeska kasta oo dhinac kasta uu ku yaal sawirka. Goobta UV-ga ayaa samaysa: waxaad mesh-ka ka gooysaa xagallo (seams), waxaad qaybaha ku fidisaa (unwrap), oo waxaad ku dhex geliysaa lammaanaha (rar). Fur Dooro mesh oo dooro UV liiska Goobta shaqada. Kooxda ama komponentka waxay marka hore noqonaysaa mesh, sida goobta Mesh. Aragta 3D waxay u guurtaa nus bidix; tafatiraha UV midig wuxuu muujinayaa dhinacyada mesh-ka oo lagu habeeyay lammaanaha tekstuurka. Doorashadu waxay u shaqaysaa sida goobta Mesh, wixii aad doorato hal aragta ayaa lagu doortaa kan kale. Calaamadi xagallada Xagallada waa meelaha mesh-ka laga gooyn karo; waxay u muuqdaan casaan labada aragoodba. Dooro geesaha (Geesta, ama 2) oo riix Calaamadi xagal (Ctrl+E). Ka saar xagal (Ctrl+Shift+E) ayaa ka saaraa. Xagallo geeska adag wuxuu calaamadiyaa geesaha adag oo dhan iyo geesaha dhinacyadu ka kulmaan in ka badan 60°: boks wuxuu u kala go'aa lix dhinac. Xagallada UV-yada wuxuu calaamadiyaa xagallada meesha UV-yadu horeyba u jabaan, tusaale ka dib mudayn. Qayb xidhan ayaa u baahan xagallo si ay u fidaan: kubbadda waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan hal goyn, tuubada goyn dhererkeeda. Unwrap Dooro dhinacyada la habeeyo (ama midna, mesh-ka oo dhan) oo riix Unwrap (U). Qayb kasta oo u dhexeysa xagallada waa la fidiyaa, xagalkeeda ilaalinaya sida ugu sax ee ay suurtogal tahay (fidinta xagal ku salaysan), kadibna qaybaha waa la rari dhinaca lammaanaha. Conformal wuxuu unwrap-ka ku sameeyaa khariidado conformal ee least-squares: way degdegtaa, wuxuuna yar ka kala fog yahay qaybaha aad u foorarsan. Qaab ka samayn karta xaashi fidsan, sida dhinaca silindar oo mar la gooyay, wuxuu unwrap-ka u sameeyaa iyada oo aan wax ballaadhin lahayn. Mudee Qaababka fudud, mudayn badanaa way ku filan tahay: Mudayn Waxa uu sameeyo Boks Dhinac kasta ilaa dhinaca boksa uu ku wajahan yahay ugu badan Silindar Wareeg tiirka buluugga ah: ballaca waa xagalka wareegga, kor waa dherer Kubbad Ka xarunta: ballaca waa xagalka wareegga, kor waa digriiga latitude-ka Muuqaalka Sida dhinacyada loo arko aragta 3D hadda Dhinaca ku taal xidhiidhka silindarka ama kubbadda waxa lagu hayaa hal qayb, sidaas darteed UV-yadiisu way ka sii bixi karaan xagga midig ee lammaanaha wax yar; tekstuurradu halkaas way ku celcelinayaan. Dhig Rar wuxuu geliyaa qaybaha (islands) lammaanaha hal cabbir texel ah, mid kastaa waa la leexiyay si uu u qaato meel yar. Panelku wuxuu dejiyaa booska ka harsan ee u dhexeeya. Rog 90° iyo Muraayadee wuxuu leexiyaa ama muraayadeeyaa UV-yada dhinacyada la doortay. Tafatiraha UV-ga, riix dhinac la doortay si aad u dhaqaajiso UV-yada doorashada, ama dhanka tafatiraha taabo R ama S ka dibna dhaqaaq si aad u leexiso ama u cabbirto (gujin wuu hayaa, Esc ayaa joojiya). G wuu dhaqaajiyaa adoon jiidin. Riix laba jeer dhinac (ama L) si aad u doorato qaybta oo dhan. Mouse-ka wheel-ka ayaa weynaynaya; jiid badhanka dhexe ama midig si aad u guurto Muuqaalka guuri; F ayaa dib u habeeya lammaanaha. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo. Hubi Shaxan wuxuu muujinayaa shaxan calaamadaysan mesh-ka UV-yadiisa: shaxanno siman oo labajibbaaran waxay tilmaamaan in tekstuurku siman yahay; calaamadaha waxay muujinayaan jihada ay socoto. Ballaadhi wuxuu midabeeyaa dhinac kasta sida UV-yadu u ballaadhiso: buluug waa midna, marka uu cagaar ka soo baxo, ilaa casaan badan. Panelku wuxuu doortaa inuu cabbiro xagal foorarsan ama cabbir isbeddelay, wuxuuna muujiyaa celceliska. Eeg sidoo kale Tafatir mesh, Mesh-yada iyo Beddelayaasha mesh-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"shading","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Samee agabyo nuqadood","summary":"Ka dhis agab textures, sawirro iyo xisaab meel shaqada Hoosaad, ku arag muuqaalka markaad socoto, oo dhinacyada ku rinji.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["hoosaad","shading","dubid","bake","dubidda texture-ka","ambient occlusion","ao","curvature","dubidda normal","high poly","low poly","light map","decal","nalkiyo","sticker","logo","label","rinjiga texture-ka","paint texture","brush","agab","material","materials","materialx","mtlx","openpbr","standard surface","maktabadda agabka","librarycraft","texture set","pbr","soo dhoofi textures","zip","cc0","jiid","nuqad","nuqadaha","tafatiraha nuqadaha","node editor","shader","texture","procedural","noise","checker","voronoi","cells","waves","bricks","tiles","wood","marble","gradient","dirt","edge wear","color ramp","mix","bump","normal map","roughness","metalness","opacity","cut-out","emission","glow","displacement","box mapping","triplanar","uv","sawir","image texture","openpbr"],"headings":[{"id":"furo","text":"Furo","level":2},{"id":"agabyada-maktabadda","text":"Agabyada maktabadda","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofi-texture-set","text":"Soo dhoofi texture set","level":2},{"id":"materialx","text":"MaterialX","level":2},{"id":"decal-yada","text":"Decal-yada","level":2},{"id":"rinji-texture-ka","text":"Rinji texture-ka","level":2},{"id":"dub-texture-yada","text":"Dub texture-yada","level":2},{"id":"samee-graph","text":"Samee graph","level":2},{"id":"soo-saarka-agabka","text":"Soo saarka agabka","level":2},{"id":"sawirada-tayada-sare-leh","text":"Sawirada tayada sare leh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAgab la sameeyay meel shaqada \u003Cstrong\u003EHoosaad\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku jiraa faylka. Waa grafik yar oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003Enuqado\u003C/strong\u003E samaynaya textures, sawirro iyo lambarro, oo isku xidhan \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saarka agabka\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo galinta uu yeelo muuqaalka dusha — base color, roughness, metalness, normal, opacity, emission iyo inta kale ee moodelka OpenPBR. Dhinacyada waxaad ku rinjiysaa sida agab kasta oo maktabada ka yimid, isbeddel kasta wuxuu isla markiiba ku muuqdaa muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furo\"\u003EFuro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoosaad\u003C/span\u003E liiska meelaha shaqada. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu haysta sare-ta shaashadda, \u003Cstrong\u003Etafatiraha nuqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaataa hoose. Dhinaca midig ee liiska wuxuu soo bandhigayaa agabyada faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa mid cawl ah oo keliya Soo saarka agabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESamee koobiyo la tafatiri karo oo agab maktabad ah\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa brick, wood, tile iyo kuwa kale graph aad bedeli karto: texture-kiisa wuxuu ka imanayaa nuqad Library texture, bump-kiisana nuqad Bump.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rinji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu rinjiyaa dhinacyada ama kooxaha la doortay, ama wuxuu doortaa agabka qalabka rinjiga. Agabyada qalabka rinjiga waxay sidoo kale liistaan agabyada faylka hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylkan dhexdiisa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku shaqeeyaan agabka aad tafatirayso. Tirtirida lama soo celin karo: dhinacyada lagu rinjiyay wuxuu muujinayaa midabka caadiga ah ilaa aad mar kale rinjiyayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agabyada-maktabadda\"\u003EAgabyada maktabadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadda agabka (Library)\u003C/strong\u003E ee liiska ayaa soo bandhigaysa agabyada maktabadda, mid kastaa leh muuqaal la sameeyay raadiyaha (path tracer) ee CadCraft. Waa texture sets la sii daayay CC0, oo lagu xusay dadkii sameeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji mid si aad faylka ugu keento (sawirradiisa ayaa la socda) iyo, markii dhinacyo ama kooxo la doortay, rinji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid mid dhinac ama kooxo muuqaalka ku jira si aad kaliya taas rinjiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu noqonayaa mid ka mid ah agabyada faylka: beddel nuqadihiisa sida kuwa kale. Tixraaciisa wuxuu ka muuqdaa liiska, wuuna ku sii jiraa faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofi-texture-set\"\u003ESoo dhoofi texture set\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirro ama zip…\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGal…\u003C/span\u003E hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi texture set\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa agab ka yimid kooxda khariidadaha. Khariidadaha waxaa la helaa erayada magacyada faylalkooda: color, albedo, diffuse ama basecolor; roughness (ama gloss, oo loo beddelay roughness); metalness ama metallic; normal (OpenGL ama DirectX, oo laga helo \u003Ccode\u003Egl\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Edx\u003C/code\u003E magaca ku jira); height ama displacement; ambient occlusion; opacity; emission. Khariidadaha la isku duubay (ARM, ORM) waa la fogeeyay. Tile-ku wuxuu bilaabmaa 1 × 1 m: cabirkiisa dhabta ah deji Soo saarka agabka. Height wuxuu u gudbaa displacement oo miisaankiisu yahay 0 — kor u qaad miisaanka si aad ugu isticmaasho meshes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaterialX waa qaab furan oo barnaamijyada kale ee 3D iyo muuqaalka ay ku wada wareegaan agabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi sida MaterialX…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa agabka aad tafatirayso: qiyamkiisa, iyo texture kasta oo PNG sawir ah oo ku taal faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.mtlx\u003C/code\u003E (zip gudihiisa). Dooro shader-ka lagu qoro: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpenPBR Surface\u003C/strong\u003E (MaterialX 1.39, isla moodelka ModelCraft isticmaalo) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EStandard Surface\u003C/strong\u003E (MaterialX 1.38, oo barnaamijyo badan maanta akhrin karaan). Texture-yada waxaa lagu meeleeyaa UV coordinates oo ku qoran mitir; box iyo triplanar waxaa loo qoraa sida UV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo geli MaterialX…\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGal…\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu akhrinayaa faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.mtlx\u003C/code\u003E oo leh shader-yada OpenPBR, Standard Surface, UsdPreviewSurface ama glTF PBR. Sawirrada ku dar, ama zip oo wax walba ku jira: sawir waxaa laga helaa jidkiisa, magacyada, ama magaca oo nooca kale ee sawirka ah (faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E ee magaca ku jira waxaa laga soo qaadi karaa \u003Ccode\u003E.jpg\u003C/code\u003E oo ag taal). Texture-yada, khariidadaha caadiga ah, xisaabaha iyo isku-darka waxay u soo galaan nuqado; wax kasta oo kale wuxuu hayaa qiyamkiisa, sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya wixii la ka reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"decal-yada\"\u003EDecal-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDecal waa sawir lagu dhejiyo dusha — logo, calaamad, label, ama wasakh — oo leh agab u gaar ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca decal cusub\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDecal dhig…\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDecal\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ku jira), dooro sawir PNG, JPEG ama WebP oo guji dhinac. Sawirka waxaa lagu saadaa dusha halkaas, isagoo ilaalinaya saamiyadiisa; qaybaha hufan ee PNG waxay ahaadaan hufan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay ka tirsan tahay kooxda ama qaybta aad gujisay oo waxay la dhaqaaqdaa. Waxay daboolaysaa dhinacyada gudaha sanduuqeeda ee u wajahan isla jiho, waxayna istaagaa geesaha wax kasta oo ay saaran tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDecal kasta wuxuu leeyahay agab u gaar ah, oo loo magacaabay \u003Cstrong\u003EDecal: &lt;sawir&gt;\u003C/strong\u003E, liiska faylka: tafatiri sida kuwa kale (roughness, bump, iw). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab\u003C/span\u003E oo decal-ka ku xiga ayaa furta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca decal kasta: ballaadhkiisa (dhererka wuu raacaa sawirka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi\u003C/span\u003E (wareeg rubuc) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E. Decal-yada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa agabyada faylka, dibadda Ka noqo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay muuqdaan muuqaalka hooseeyay, muuqaalka degdegga ah iyo sawirrada tayada sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rinji-texture-ka\"\u003ERinji texture-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji texture\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ERinji texture-ka\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu tilmaameyaa mouse-ka brush wareega. Jiid dhinac ku xidhan mid ka mid ah agabyada faylkan: brush-ka wuxuu rinjiyaa sawirka ka dambeeya base color-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMesh dushiisa wuxuu rinjiyaa iyadoo raacaysa UVs-ka mesh-ka (marka hore u fur meeshiisa UV workspace-ka); dhinacyada kale wuxuu ku rinjiyaa dhinaca oo dhan, sidaas darteed rinjiyeyntu waxay ku celisaa tile-ka agabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgab base color-keedu yahay midab fudud ayaa sawir cusub oo 512 × 512 ah oo midabkaas ah helaa markii ugu horreysay ee la rinjiyo. Agab base color-keedu ka yimid nuqado kale wuxuu u baahan yahay nuqad Picture oo lagu xidho Base color.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro midabka brush-ka, cabbirka (pixels-ka sawirka), xoogga iyo adkaanta panel-ka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo jiidista\u003C/span\u003E ama Ctrl+Z (intii aad rinjiyeyso) ayaa dib u qaada jiid, ilaa 20-ka ugu dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirka la rinjiyay waa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Agabyada maktabadda ma rinjiyeyn karaan: marka hore samee koobiyo la tafatiri karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dub-texture-yada\"\u003EDub texture-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#bake-textures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"bake-textures\"\u003EDub texture-yada\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu qoraa waxa qaabka iyo muuqaalka siiyaan dusha sawirro, iyagoo raacaya UVs-ka mesh-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mesh leh UVs (u fur UV workspace-ka), calaamadi khariidadaha oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubi\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAmbient occlusion\u003C/strong\u003E — sida uu u furan yahay nuqad kasta: xagasha, jaalaha iyo meelaha ka hoosaysa waxyaabo kale way mugdi noqdaan. Wax kasta oo muuqda moodelka ayaa hoos u dhigaya, ilaa masaafada occlusion-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurvature\u003C/strong\u003E — iftiin ku yahay geesaha dibadda, mugdi ku ah xagasha gudaha, boor dhexdhexaad ah meelaha siman iyo kuwa kor u fiican, iyadoo ka dhaqaaqaysa ballaca geesta aad dejisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormals from the high-detail object\u003C/strong\u003E — dooro sidoo kale nuqul faahfaahsan: faahfaahinta dusheeda waxaa loo qoraa khariidada normal mesh-ka fudud (shayga leh saddex-geesood yar ayaa lagu dubayaa). Masaafada raadinta waa intee le&#039;eg ayay labada dusheba kala fogaan karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELighting\u003C/strong\u003E — qorraxda meesha moodelka iyo taariikhdiisa (Style) iyo hooseedyadeeda, iyo cirka, sida khariidada iftiinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirada waxay ku biiraan faylka oo ka muuqdaan nuqadaha Picture. Haddii agabka aad tafatirayso leedahay nuqad \u003Cstrong\u003EDirt and edge wear\u003C/strong\u003E, waxay isla markiiba akhrinaysaa occlusion-ka iyo curvature-ka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhibco-yar kasta oo texel ah oo dheeraad ah wuxuu samaynayaa occlusion iyo iftiin siman, laakiin waa uu dheeraadaa. Dubidda waxay ku shaqeysaa core-yada processor-ka kombiyuutarka dhexdhexaadka ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji dubista\u003C/span\u003E ayaa joojisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-graph\"\u003ESamee graph\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqad…\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift A\"\u003E⇧A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tafatiraha nuqadaha) wuxuu ku daraa nuqad dhexda tafatiraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhibicda wax soo saarka (midig nuqadda) ilaa dhibicda gelinta (bidix nuqadda) si aad isugu xidho. Xidhid labaad oo ku dhex jirta gelinta mid hore ayuu beddelaa; jiid gelinta xidhan si aad uga furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGelinta aan xidhnayn waxay muujinaysaa qiimaheeda: qor lambar ama dooro midab. Dejinta waxay ku taalla hoosta nuqad kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid nuqad adigoo riixaya magaceeda si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid meel banaan si aad u guurto, oo isticmaal wheel-ka si aad u weynaysiiso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa nuqadaha ama xidhiidhka la doortay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dib u qaadaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu koobiyeeyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa nuqad walba. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah oo tafatiraha nuqadaha ah. Dib-u-qaadka moodelka ma beddelo agabyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENuqadaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxay soo saaraan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETexture coordinates\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalka barta ku taalla tile-ka: ku celi, u wareeji, rogo rubuc.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EValue, Color\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambar, midab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPicture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir faylka ka mid ah (mid ka yimid moodel la soo dhoofiyay, ama mid aad ku dartay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E). Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EColors\u003C/strong\u003E sawir sawir ah, \u003Cstrong\u003EData\u003C/strong\u003E khariidada roughness ama normal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELibrary texture\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETexture-ka, roughness-ka iyo height-ka agabka maktabadda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChecker, Noise\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabajibbaaran; noise fractal oo siman oo leh faahfaahin, roughness iyo seed.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVoronoi cells, Waves, Gradient\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnugyo (masaafada ilaa barta ugu dhow, geesaha u dhexeeya unugyada, midab unug kasta); xariiqyo dhex-dhexaad, kor ama dhexdhexaad ah, sine, saw ama triangle, oo ay noise-ku foorarsado; gradient-yo toosan, quadratic, radial iyo spherical.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBricks, Tiles\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafafka block-yada oo leh kala-sarayn socota, ama shabakad tile-yo ah: midabyo, maad ama grout, farqi iyo bevel mitir ahaan, height bump-yada, lambar random ah oo qayb kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWood, Marble\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareegyo ku jira hadhaanta iyo cadaadis fiber-yo yar; xarigaleyaasha la foorarsaday turbulence.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDirt and edge wear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xoqaa geesaha qaloocan wuxuuna wasakheeyaa godadka ka soo baxa sawirrada curvature iyo occlusion ee mesh-ka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#bake-textures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"bake-textures\"\u003EDub texture-yada\u003C/a\u003E ayaa sameeya; ama deji labada dejin ee sawirka, UV layout-ka mesh-ka: meel dheh agabka UV coordinates ahaan). Aan iyaga lahayn wax ma beddelo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMix colors, Color ramp, Hue/saturation/value, Brightness and contrast, Invert, Gamma, Separate and Combine RGB\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaqada midabka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMath, Map range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXisaabta lambarada (ku dar, ku dhufo, awood, smooth step iyo kuwa kale).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBump, Normal map\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENormal ka yimid height (Bump) ama sawir normal-map (Normal map: dooro jihada kanaalka cagaaran).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saarka-agabka\"\u003ESoo saarka agabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintiisu waxay sheegtaa sida texture-ku u dhigmo dusha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca tile-ka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDherer tile-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: intee mitir ah ayuu hal tile oo texture ah daboolayaa. Wax kasta oo graph-ku sameeyo wuu ku celiyaa tile-ka iyada oo aan xarig lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELagu meeleeyay\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EUV coordinates\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa dhinacyada (riix/jiid dhinacyada: dhinac kasta gudihiisa; meshes: UVs-kooda, hal UV unit = hal tile), \u003Cstrong\u003EBox\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka saadaa saddexda dhidib ee ugu dhow, \u003Cstrong\u003ETriplanar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku daraa saddexda saadaal dusha janjeeraysan (\u003Cstrong\u003EBlend sharpness\u003C/strong\u003E: kor u ah, isku-darka waa adkaanayaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal strength\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu miisaameeyaa gelinta normal-ka. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisplacement scale\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa intee le&#039;eg gelinta displacement-ku u dhaqaajiso mesh-ka vertices-keeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGelin dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa galinta kale ee OpenPBR: coat, fuzz, subsurface, thin film, transmission iyo midabkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada-tayada-sare-leh\"\u003ESawirada tayada sare leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaadiyaha (path tracer) wuxuu akhrinayaa base color, roughness, metalness, opacity, normal iyo emission graph-ka sida ay u beddelmayaan dusha oo dhan. Gelin kasta oo kale aad xidhayso (tusaale ahaan coat oo beddelmaya) waxaa loo isticmaalaa celceliskeeda; panel-ku wuxuu sheegaa kaas. Cut-out ka opacity texture wuxuu muujinayaa qaabkiisa, hoosaadkiisuna si siman buu u hufan yahay. Texture iftiinka leh wuxuu iftiimiyaa wixii uu u jeeda, iyada oo aan loo qaadan sida nalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDisplacement\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa vertices-ka meshes oo keliya, sidaas darteed ku dar Subdivision modifier faahfaahin ahaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EModifiers\u003C/a\u003E). Riix/jiid dhinacyada qaabkooda way hayaan oo bumps-ka normal-ka ayay ka helaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKombiyuutar leh WebGPU graph-ka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa kaarka garaafka; aan lahayn, processor-ka. Natiijadu waa isku mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Agab la sameeyay meel shaqada Hoosaad wuxuu ku jiraa faylka. Waa grafik yar oo ah nuqado samaynaya textures, sawirro iyo lambarro, oo isku xidhan Soo saarka agabka, kaas oo galinta uu yeelo muuqaalka dusha — base color, roughness, metalness, normal, opacity, emission iyo inta kale ee moodelka OpenPBR. Dhinacyada waxaad ku rinjiysaa sida agab kasta oo maktabada ka yimid, isbeddel kasta wuxuu isla markiiba ku muuqdaa muuqaalka. Furo Dooro Hoosaad liiska meelaha shaqada. Muuqaalka 3D wuxuu haysta sare-ta shaashadda, tafatiraha nuqadaha wuxuu qaataa hoose. Dhinaca midig ee liiska wuxuu soo bandhigayaa agabyada faylka. Agab cusub wuxuu sameeyaa mid cawl ah oo keliya Soo saarka agabka. Samee koobiyo la tafatiri karo oo agab maktabad ah wuxuu u beddelaa brick, wood, tile iyo kuwa kale graph aad bedeli karto: texture-kiisa wuxuu ka imanayaa nuqad Library texture, bump-kiisana nuqad Bump. Ku rinji wuxuu rinjiyaa dhinacyada ama kooxaha la doortay, ama wuxuu doortaa agabka qalabka rinjiga. Agabyada qalabka rinjiga waxay sidoo kale liistaan agabyada faylka hoos Faylkan dhexdiisa. Koobiyee iyo Tirtir waxay ku shaqeeyaan agabka aad tafatirayso. Tirtirida lama soo celin karo: dhinacyada lagu rinjiyay wuxuu muujinayaa midabka caadiga ah ilaa aad mar kale rinjiyayso. Agabyada maktabadda Maktabadda agabka (Library) ee liiska ayaa soo bandhigaysa agabyada maktabadda, mid kastaa leh muuqaal la sameeyay raadiyaha (path tracer) ee CadCraft. Waa texture sets la sii daayay CC0, oo lagu xusay dadkii sameeyay. Guji mid si aad faylka ugu keento (sawirradiisa ayaa la socda) iyo, markii dhinacyo ama kooxo la doortay, rinji. Jiid mid dhinac ama kooxo muuqaalka ku jira si aad kaliya taas rinjiso. Wuxuu noqonayaa mid ka mid ah agabyada faylka: beddel nuqadihiisa sida kuwa kale. Tixraaciisa wuxuu ka muuqdaa liiska, wuuna ku sii jiraa faylka. Soo dhoofi texture set Sawirro ama zip… ama Gal… hoos Soo dhoofi texture set wuxuu sameeyaa agab ka yimid kooxda khariidadaha. Khariidadaha waxaa la helaa erayada magacyada faylalkooda: color, albedo, diffuse ama basecolor; roughness (ama gloss, oo loo beddelay roughness); metalness ama metallic; normal (OpenGL ama DirectX, oo laga helo gl / dx magaca ku jira); height ama displacement; ambient occlusion; opacity; emission. Khariidadaha la isku duubay (ARM, ORM) waa la fogeeyay. Tile-ku wuxuu bilaabmaa 1 × 1 m: cabirkiisa dhabta ah deji Soo saarka agabka. Height wuxuu u gudbaa displacement oo miisaankiisu yahay 0 — kor u qaad miisaanka si aad ugu isticmaasho meshes. MaterialX MaterialX waa qaab furan oo barnaamijyada kale ee 3D iyo muuqaalka ay ku wada wareegaan agabka. U dhoofi sida MaterialX… wuxuu kaydiyaa agabka aad tafatirayso: qiyamkiisa, iyo texture kasta oo PNG sawir ah oo ku taal faylka .mtlx (zip gudihiisa). Dooro shader-ka lagu qoro: OpenPBR Surface (MaterialX 1.39, isla moodelka ModelCraft isticmaalo) ama Standard Surface (MaterialX 1.38, oo barnaamijyo badan maanta akhrin karaan). Texture-yada waxaa lagu meeleeyaa UV coordinates oo ku qoran mitir; box iyo triplanar waxaa loo qoraa sida UV. Soo geli MaterialX… (ama Gal…) wuxuu akhrinayaa faylasha .mtlx oo leh shader-yada OpenPBR, Standard Surface, UsdPreviewSurface ama glTF PBR. Sawirrada ku dar, ama zip oo wax walba ku jira: sawir waxaa laga helaa jidkiisa, magacyada, ama magaca oo nooca kale ee sawirka ah (faylka .exr ee magaca ku jira waxaa laga soo qaadi karaa .jpg oo ag taal). Texture-yada, khariidadaha caadiga ah, xisaabaha iyo isku-darka waxay u soo galaan nuqado; wax kasta oo kale wuxuu hayaa qiyamkiisa, sadarka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya wixii la ka reebay. Decal-yada Decal waa sawir lagu dhejiyo dusha — logo, calaamad, label, ama wasakh — oo leh agab u gaar ah. Deji Ballaca decal cusub, kadibna Decal dhig… (ama Decal qalabka ku jira), dooro sawir PNG, JPEG ama WebP oo guji dhinac. Sawirka waxaa lagu saadaa dusha halkaas, isagoo ilaalinaya saamiyadiisa; qaybaha hufan ee PNG waxay ahaadaan hufan. Waxay ka tirsan tahay kooxda ama qaybta aad gujisay oo waxay la dhaqaaqdaa. Waxay daboolaysaa dhinacyada gudaha sanduuqeeda ee u wajahan isla jiho, waxayna istaagaa geesaha wax kasta oo ay saaran tahay. Decal kasta wuxuu leeyahay agab u gaar ah, oo loo magacaabay Decal: \u003Csawir\u003E, liiska faylka: tafatiri sida kuwa kale (roughness, bump, iw). Agab oo decal-ka ku xiga ayaa furta. Dhinaca decal kasta: ballaadhkiisa (dhererka wuu raacaa sawirka), Rogi (wareeg rubuc) iyo Tirtir. Decal-yada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa agabyada faylka, dibadda Ka noqo. Waxay muuqdaan muuqaalka hooseeyay, muuqaalka degdegga ah iyo sawirrada tayada sare. Rinji texture-ka Rinji texture (ama Rinji hoos Rinji texture-ka) wuxuu tilmaameyaa mouse-ka brush wareega. Jiid dhinac ku xidhan mid ka mid ah agabyada faylkan: brush-ka wuxuu rinjiyaa sawirka ka dambeeya base color-ka. Mesh dushiisa wuxuu rinjiyaa iyadoo raacaysa UVs-ka mesh-ka (marka hore u fur meeshiisa UV workspace-ka); dhinacyada kale wuxuu ku rinjiyaa dhinaca oo dhan, sidaas darteed rinjiyeyntu waxay ku celisaa tile-ka agabka. Agab base color-keedu yahay midab fudud ayaa sawir cusub oo 512 × 512 ah oo midabkaas ah helaa markii ugu horreysay ee la rinjiyo. Agab base color-keedu ka yimid nuqado kale wuxuu u baahan yahay nuqad Picture oo lagu xidho Base color. Dooro midabka brush-ka, cabbirka (pixels-ka sawirka), xoogga iyo adkaanta panel-ka. Ka noqo jiidista ama Ctrl+Z (intii aad rinjiyeyso) ayaa dib u qaada jiid, ilaa 20-ka ugu dambeeya. Sawirka la rinjiyay waa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Agabyada maktabadda ma rinjiyeyn karaan: marka hore samee koobiyo la tafatiri karo. Dub texture-yada Dub texture-yada wuxuu qoraa waxa qaabka iyo muuqaalka siiyaan dusha sawirro, iyagoo raacaya UVs-ka mesh-ka. Dooro mesh leh UVs (u fur UV workspace-ka), calaamadi khariidadaha oo riix Dubi: Ambient occlusion — sida uu u furan yahay nuqad kasta: xagasha, jaalaha iyo meelaha ka hoosaysa waxyaabo kale way mugdi noqdaan. Wax kasta oo muuqda moodelka ayaa hoos u dhigaya, ilaa masaafada occlusion-ka. Curvature — iftiin ku yahay geesaha dibadda, mugdi ku ah xagasha gudaha, boor dhexdhexaad ah meelaha siman iyo kuwa kor u fiican, iyadoo ka dhaqaaqaysa ballaca geesta aad dejisay. Normals from the high-detail object — dooro sidoo kale nuqul faahfaahsan: faahfaahinta dusheeda waxaa loo qoraa khariidada normal mesh-ka fudud (shayga leh saddex-geesood yar ayaa lagu dubayaa). Masaafada raadinta waa intee le'eg ayay labada dusheba kala fogaan karaan. Lighting — qorraxda meesha moodelka iyo taariikhdiisa (Style) iyo hooseedyadeeda, iyo cirka, sida khariidada iftiinka. Sawirada waxay ku biiraan faylka oo ka muuqdaan nuqadaha Picture. Haddii agabka aad tafatirayso leedahay nuqad Dirt and edge wear, waxay isla markiiba akhrinaysaa occlusion-ka iyo curvature-ka cusub. Dhibco-yar kasta oo texel ah oo dheeraad ah wuxuu samaynayaa occlusion iyo iftiin siman, laakiin waa uu dheeraadaa. Dubidda waxay ku shaqeysaa core-yada processor-ka kombiyuutarka dhexdhexaadka ah; Jooji dubista ayaa joojisa. Samee graph Ku dar nuqad… (ama Shift+A tafatiraha nuqadaha) wuxuu ku daraa nuqad dhexda tafatiraha. Jiid dhibicda wax soo saarka (midig nuqadda) ilaa dhibicda gelinta (bidix nuqadda) si aad isugu xidho. Xidhid labaad oo ku dhex jirta gelinta mid hore ayuu beddelaa; jiid gelinta xidhan si aad uga furto. Gelinta aan xidhnayn waxay muujinaysaa qiimaheeda: qor lambar ama dooro midab. Dejinta waxay ku taalla hoosta nuqad kasta. Jiid nuqad adigoo riixaya magaceeda si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid meel banaan si aad u guurto, oo isticmaal wheel-ka si aad u weynaysiiso. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa nuqadaha ama xidhiidhka la doortay, Ctrl+Z wuu dib u qaadaa, Ctrl+D wuu koobiyeeyaa, F wuxuu muujinayaa nuqad walba. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah oo tafatiraha nuqadaha ah. Dib-u-qaadka moodelka ma beddelo agabyada. Nuqadaha Waxay soo saaraan Texture coordinates Halka barta ku taalla tile-ka: ku celi, u wareeji, rogo rubuc. Value, Color Lambar, midab. Picture Sawir faylka ka mid ah (mid ka yimid moodel la soo dhoofiyay, ama mid aad ku dartay Ku dar sawir…). Dooro Colors sawir sawir ah, Data khariidada roughness ama normal. Library texture Texture-ka, roughness-ka iyo height-ka agabka maktabadda. Checker, Noise Labajibbaaran; noise fractal oo siman oo leh faahfaahin, roughness iyo seed. Voronoi cells, Waves, Gradient Unugyo (masaafada ilaa barta ugu dhow, geesaha u dhexeeya unugyada, midab unug kasta); xariiqyo dhex-dhexaad, kor ama dhexdhexaad ah, sine, saw ama triangle, oo ay noise-ku foorarsado; gradient-yo toosan, quadratic, radial iyo spherical. Bricks, Tiles Safafka block-yada oo leh kala-sarayn socota, ama shabakad tile-yo ah: midabyo, maad ama grout, farqi iyo bevel mitir ahaan, height bump-yada, lambar random ah oo qayb kasta. Wood, Marble Wareegyo ku jira hadhaanta iyo cadaadis fiber-yo yar; xarigaleyaasha la foorarsaday turbulence. Dirt and edge wear Wuxuu xoqaa geesaha qaloocan wuxuuna wasakheeyaa godadka ka soo baxa sawirrada curvature iyo occlusion ee mesh-ka (Dub texture-yada ayaa sameeya; ama deji labada dejin ee sawirka, UV layout-ka mesh-ka: meel dheh agabka UV coordinates ahaan). Aan iyaga lahayn wax ma beddelo. Mix colors, Color ramp, Hue/saturation/value, Brightness and contrast, Invert, Gamma, Separate and Combine RGB Shaqada midabka. Math, Map range Xisaabta lambarada (ku dar, ku dhufo, awood, smooth step iyo kuwa kale). Bump, Normal map Normal ka yimid height (Bump) ama sawir normal-map (Normal map: dooro jihada kanaalka cagaaran). Soo saarka agabka Dejintiisu waxay sheegtaa sida texture-ku u dhigmo dusha: Ballaca tile-ka iyo Dherer tile-ka: intee mitir ah ayuu hal tile oo texture ah daboolayaa. Wax kasta oo graph-ku sameeyo wuu ku celiyaa tile-ka iyada oo aan xarig lahayn. Lagu meeleeyay: UV coordinates wuxuu raacaa dhinacyada (riix/jiid dhinacyada: dhinac kasta gudihiisa; meshes: UVs-kooda, hal UV unit = hal tile), Box wuxuu ka saadaa saddexda dhidib ee ugu dhow, Triplanar wuxuu isku daraa saddexda saadaal dusha janjeeraysan (Blend sharpness: kor u ah, isku-darka waa adkaanayaa). Normal strength wuxuu miisaameeyaa gelinta normal-ka. Displacement scale wuxuu dejiyaa intee le'eg gelinta displacement-ku u dhaqaajiso mesh-ka vertices-keeda. Gelin dheeraad ah wuxuu muujinayaa galinta kale ee OpenPBR: coat, fuzz, subsurface, thin film, transmission iyo midabkooda. Sawirada tayada sare leh Raadiyaha (path tracer) wuxuu akhrinayaa base color, roughness, metalness, opacity, normal iyo emission graph-ka sida ay u beddelmayaan dusha oo dhan. Gelin kasta oo kale aad xidhayso (tusaale ahaan coat oo beddelmaya) waxaa loo isticmaalaa celceliskeeda; panel-ku wuxuu sheegaa kaas. Cut-out ka opacity texture wuxuu muujinayaa qaabkiisa, hoosaadkiisuna si siman buu u hufan yahay. Texture iftiinka leh wuxuu iftiimiyaa wixii uu u jeeda, iyada oo aan loo qaadan sida nalka. Displacement wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa vertices-ka meshes oo keliya, sidaas darteed ku dar Subdivision modifier faahfaahin ahaan (Modifiers). Riix/jiid dhinacyada qaabkooda way hayaan oo bumps-ka normal-ka ayay ka helaan. Kombiyuutar leh WebGPU graph-ka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa kaarka garaafka; aan lahayn, processor-ka. Natiijadu waa isku mid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"curves","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Shayada khadka qalloocan","summary":"Samee khadad Bézier, NURBS iyo khadad jajab toosan, ku sii dhumuc, ballac ama taper, buuxi kuwa fiiqan, qoraal u dhig khadad qalloocan, oo u beddel mesh.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["khad","khadad","bezier","nurbs","spline","splines","jid","tuubo","pipe","kable","xadhig","bevel","extrude","taper","tilt","radius","buuxi","profile","qoraal","xarfo","calaamad","khad u beddel mesh"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-khad","text":"Samee khad","level":2},{"id":"tafatir-barahooda","text":"Tafatir barahooda","level":2},{"id":"qaabka","text":"Qaabka","level":2},{"id":"u-beddel-mesh","text":"U beddel mesh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShayga khadka qalloocan\u003C/strong\u003E waa khad wax qaabeeya: tuubo ku socota (bevel), suux (extrude), kafiin dhumuc yar (taper), ama — marka uu fiiqan yahay oo xidhan yahay — dhalaal buuxa ama xarfo. Qaabku wuu raacaa khadka: qodob dhaqaajiso tuubadu way la dhaqaaqaysaa. Marka qaabku sax yahay, u beddel mesh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-khad\"\u003ESamee khad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E liiska Workspace-ka oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooc\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaa maxay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka Bézier, goobada Bézier\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay mari barahooda; qodob kasta wuxuu leeyahay laba gacmo oo dhigaya jihada khadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka NURBS, goobada NURBS, Path\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiilan, waxay u rogtaa barahooda (waxay bilaabmaa oo dhamaataa barahooda dhamaadka); qodob kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EText\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraalkaaga oo ah xarfo fiiqan oo buuxa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhad cusub wuxuu helaa tuubo khafiif ah si loo arko oo loo dooran karo; u deji bevel depth 0 si aad u hesho khad fudud.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale ka bilaabi kartaa wax la sawiray: dooro qaansada, goobada, poligon-ka ama khadka la sawiray Model workspace-ka oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a curve object\u003C/span\u003E gudaha Entity info. Khadadka la sawiray way sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatir-barahooda\"\u003ETafatir barahooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabo-guji shay khadka qalloocan (ama dooro oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E) si aad u tafatirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qodob ama gacan (Shift wuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa); jiid si aad u guurisid. Jiid meel bannaan si aad sanduuq ugu doorato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtend\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji) wuxuu ku daraa qodob dhamaadka la doortay ka dib, meesha mouse-ku joogo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESubdivide\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu dhig u geliyaa labada deriska ah ee la doortay inta u dhaxaysa; Bézier wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaabkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E waxay guuriyaan qodobada la doortay iyada oo mouse-ka lagu raacayo (furayaasha modeler \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, furayaasha push/pull \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); guji si aad u hayso, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu xiraa spline furan ama furaa mid xidhan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift R\"\u003E⇧R\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+R\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu u socodsiiyaa jihada kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGacmaha Bézier: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu dhigaa si khad siilan loo helo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorner\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift V\"\u003E⇧V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu u jeediyaa deriska, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFree\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option V\"\u003E⌥V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu ku daayaa meeshii aad dhigtay. Jiidista gacan wuxuu ka dhigaa mid xor ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBézier\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENURBS\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoly\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan nooca spline-yada la doortay, iyagoo ilaalinaya barahooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabka\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta waxay ku jirtaa panel-ka (iyo Entity info Model workspace-ka):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShape:\u003C/strong\u003E khadadka 3D way u socdaan meel walba; khad fiiqan wuxuu ku sii jiraa diyaaraddiisa wuuna buuxi karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFill closed splines\u003C/strong\u003E (fiiqan): khadadka dibadda ayaa noqda dhalaal; khad gudaha khad kale waa godka, sidaas darteed xarfuhu godadkooda way ilaaliyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude:\u003C/strong\u003E half the band&#039;s width (khadadka furan ama 3D), ama half the plate&#039;s thickness (buuxa): badhka ballaca, ama badhka dhumucda dhalaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBevel depth\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eroundness:\u003C/strong\u003E tuubo wareegsan oo ku socota khadka (extrude ku jiraa: suux wareegsan); shaqada buuxa, geesta wareegsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClose the ends:\u003C/strong\u003E koofiyado tuubo furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaper along it:\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu siman yahay ku dhex socda spline kasta, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003E1, 0.2\u003C/code\u003E kafiin, \u003Ccode\u003E0, 1, 0\u003C/code\u003E dhoobo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESmoothness\u003C/strong\u003E iyo, NURBS, \u003Cstrong\u003Eorder\u003C/strong\u003E: sida ay u fiican tahay sawirkeeda, iyo sida ay siila tahay (2 toosan … 6 ugu siilan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qodobo la doortay: \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius\u003C/strong\u003E (dhumucda tuubada halkaas, ku dhufan bevel-ka), \u003Cstrong\u003Etilt\u003C/strong\u003E (wareejinta suux ee khadka ku wareegta) iyo, NURBS, \u003Cstrong\u003Eweight\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModifiers way shaqeeyaan korka shay khad qalloocan sida mesh-ka: Array oo khadka dhex socda, Mirror, Subdivision surface. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EModifiers mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-beddel-mesh\"\u003EU beddel mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETo mesh\u003C/span\u003E (Curve workspace-ka ama Entity info, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve to mesh\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu shayga khadka qalloocan u beddelaa mesh uu hadda muujinayo; modifiers-kiisa way sii jiraan korka. Kadibna tafatir Mesh workspace-ka. Undo wuxuu dib u celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EMeshes\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003ETafatir mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Shayga khadka qalloocan waa khad wax qaabeeya: tuubo ku socota (bevel), suux (extrude), kafiin dhumuc yar (taper), ama — marka uu fiiqan yahay oo xidhan yahay — dhalaal buuxa ama xarfo. Qaabku wuu raacaa khadka: qodob dhaqaajiso tuubadu way la dhaqaaqaysaa. Marka qaabku sax yahay, u beddel mesh. Samee khad Dooro Curve liiska Workspace-ka oo riix Add: Nooc Waa maxay Khadka Bézier, goobada Bézier Waxay mari barahooda; qodob kasta wuxuu leeyahay laba gacmo oo dhigaya jihada khadka Khadka NURBS, goobada NURBS, Path Siilan, waxay u rogtaa barahooda (waxay bilaabmaa oo dhamaataa barahooda dhamaadka); qodob kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaan Text Qoraalkaaga oo ah xarfo fiiqan oo buuxa Khad cusub wuxuu helaa tuubo khafiif ah si loo arko oo loo dooran karo; u deji bevel depth 0 si aad u hesho khad fudud. Waxaad sidoo kale ka bilaabi kartaa wax la sawiray: dooro qaansada, goobada, poligon-ka ama khadka la sawiray Model workspace-ka oo riix Make a curve object gudaha Entity info. Khadadka la sawiray way sii jiraan. Tafatir barahooda Labo-guji shay khadka qalloocan (ama dooro oo dooro Curve) si aad u tafatirto. Guji qodob ama gacan (Shift wuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa); jiid si aad u guurisid. Jiid meel bannaan si aad sanduuq ugu doorato. Extend (E, ama Ctrl+guji) wuxuu ku daraa qodob dhamaadka la doortay ka dib, meesha mouse-ku joogo. Subdivide (W) wuxuu dhig u geliyaa labada deriska ah ee la doortay inta u dhaxaysa; Bézier wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaabkiisa. Move, Turn, Scale waxay guuriyaan qodobada la doortay iyada oo mouse-ka lagu raacayo (furayaasha modeler G R S, furayaasha push/pull M Q S); guji si aad u hayso, Esc si aad u joojiso. Close (C) wuxuu xiraa spline furan ama furaa mid xidhan; Reverse (Shift+R) wuxuu u socodsiiyaa jihada kale. Gacmaha Bézier: Smooth (V) wuxuu dhigaa si khad siilan loo helo, Corner (Shift+V) wuxuu u jeediyaa deriska, Free (Alt+V) wuxuu ku daayaa meeshii aad dhigtay. Jiidista gacan wuxuu ka dhigaa mid xor ah. Bézier, NURBS iyo Poly waxay beddelaan nooca spline-yada la doortay, iyagoo ilaalinaya barahooda. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo undo ah. Qaabka Dejinta waxay ku jirtaa panel-ka (iyo Entity info Model workspace-ka): Shape: khadadka 3D way u socdaan meel walba; khad fiiqan wuxuu ku sii jiraa diyaaraddiisa wuuna buuxi karaa. Fill closed splines (fiiqan): khadadka dibadda ayaa noqda dhalaal; khad gudaha khad kale waa godka, sidaas darteed xarfuhu godadkooda way ilaaliyaan. Extrude: half the band's width (khadadka furan ama 3D), ama half the plate's thickness (buuxa): badhka ballaca, ama badhka dhumucda dhalaalka. Bevel depth iyo roundness: tuubo wareegsan oo ku socota khadka (extrude ku jiraa: suux wareegsan); shaqada buuxa, geesta wareegsan. Close the ends: koofiyado tuubo furan. Taper along it: wuxuu siman yahay ku dhex socda spline kasta, tusaale 1, 0.2 kafiin, 0, 1, 0 dhoobo. Smoothness iyo, NURBS, order: sida ay u fiican tahay sawirkeeda, iyo sida ay siila tahay (2 toosan … 6 ugu siilan). Haddii qodobo la doortay: radius (dhumucda tuubada halkaas, ku dhufan bevel-ka), tilt (wareejinta suux ee khadka ku wareegta) iyo, NURBS, weight. Modifiers way shaqeeyaan korka shay khad qalloocan sida mesh-ka: Array oo khadka dhex socda, Mirror, Subdivision surface. Eeg Modifiers mesh-ka. U beddel mesh To mesh (Curve workspace-ka ama Entity info, Curve to mesh) wuxuu shayga khadka qalloocan u beddelaa mesh uu hadda muujinayo; modifiers-kiisa way sii jiraan korka. Kadibna tafatir Mesh workspace-ka. Undo wuxuu dib u celiyaa. Eeg sidoo kale Meshes iyo Tafatir mesh.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sculpt","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sculpt mesh-ka","summary":"Qaabeey mesh sida dhoobo oo leh brush-yada — sawir, dhoobo, siib, qabo, buufi, crease, pinch, simee — ilaali qaybaha maaska, muraayad X, oo ku dar faahfaahin meesha aad sculpt-ka ku sameyso.","section":"tasks","order":63,"keywords":["sculpt","sculpting","brush","brushes","dhoobo","sawir","siib","qabo","buufi","crease","pinch","simee","mask","symmetry","muraayad","faahfaahin","dynamic topology","qalin","cadaadis","tablet","stylus"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow","text":"Bilow","level":2},{"id":"brushes","text":"Brushes","level":2},{"id":"cabbirka-iyo-xoogga","text":"Cabbirka iyo xoogga","level":2},{"id":"muraayad-maaska-iyo-faahfaahin","text":"Muraayad, maaska iyo faahfaahin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka Sculpt wuxuu qaabeeyaa mesh-ka brush-yada, sida dhoobada: jiid dusha oo waa kor u kacaa, hoos u dhacaa, siibaa ama raacaa pointer-ka brush-ka wareega, xooggiisu wuu badanyahay bartamaha oo wuu baabbi&#039;aa geeskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow\"\u003EBilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro mesh oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/span\u003E liiska Workspace. Kooxda ama component-ku wuxuu noqdaa mesh marka hore, sida Workspace-ka Mesh. Brush-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan vertex-yada mesh-ka, sidaas darteed mesh leh vertex badan wuxuu qaadan karaa qaabab yar yar: marka hore kala qaybi (amarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E ee Workspace-ka Mesh, ama modifier-ka Subdivision surface oo aad Apply gareyso), ama shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brushes\"\u003EBrushes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrush\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha hoosteeda brush-ka wuu kor u qaadaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClay\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyo siman oo dhoobo ah ayuu dhisaa, godadka marka hore buuxiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESiib\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu siibaa buuqyada; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u siibto brush kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ayuu la jiidaa pointer-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuufi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ayuu ka buufiyaa jihadiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodad fiiqan ayuu jaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ayuu u jiidaa dhexda brush-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ayuu ku riixaa diyaaradda celceliska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMask\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaaska ayuu rinjiyeeyaa kaas oo dusha ka ilaaliya brush-yada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta aad sarakaysid si aad u shaqeyso dhinac kale (hoos halkii sare, xiidmo halkii godad, ka saar maaska), ama shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirka-iyo-xoogga\"\u003ECabbirka iyo xoogga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka brush-ka waa pixel-yada shaashadda ku yaal, sidaas darteed waxay u dareemaa isku mid sida aad u fogaato: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayuu yaraysiiyaa iyo weynaysiiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift [\"\u003E⇧[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ]\"\u003E⇧]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayuu beddelaa xoogga. Panel-ku wuxuu muujiyaa labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalin tablet-ka, cadaadis badan ayaa brush-ka dhigaya mid weyn oo xoog badan; panel-ku wuxuu labadaba damiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muraayad-maaska-iyo-faahfaahin\"\u003EMuraayad, maaska iyo faahfaahin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMirror X\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu sculpt-gareeyaa labada dhinac casaan kulmiya isku mar, wejiyada iyo sawirrada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaaskadu wuu madowdaa inta aad sculpt-gareyso. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear mask\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option M\"\u003E⌥M\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+M\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ayuu ka saaraa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvert mask\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control I\"\u003E⌃I\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+I\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu maaskeeyaa waxa bilaa ahaa, wuxuuna bilaayaa waxa la maaskeeyey. Maaskada waxa lagu kaydiyaa mesh-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDetail\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa triangles meesha aad sculpt-gareyso: geesaha ka dheer cabbirka panel-ka (pixel-yada shaashadda) waa la kala qaybiyaa brush-ka hoosteeda. Waxay u baahan tahay mesh triangles ah, wuxuuna weydiiyaa in marka hore la sameeyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid kasta hal tallaabo ayuu ka noqdaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaahfaahintu waxay keliya ku darta triangles; ma tirtirto kuwii noqday kuwo yaraan. Remesh (Workspace-ka Mesh) wuxuu dib u siman yeelaa mesh-ka oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003ETafatir mesh\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003EMeshes\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003EModifiers mesh-ka dushiisa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Workspace-ka Sculpt wuxuu qaabeeyaa mesh-ka brush-yada, sida dhoobada: jiid dusha oo waa kor u kacaa, hoos u dhacaa, siibaa ama raacaa pointer-ka brush-ka wareega, xooggiisu wuu badanyahay bartamaha oo wuu baabbi'aa geeskiisa. Bilow Dooro mesh oo dooro Sculpt liiska Workspace. Kooxda ama component-ku wuxuu noqdaa mesh marka hore, sida Workspace-ka Mesh. Brush-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan vertex-yada mesh-ka, sidaas darteed mesh leh vertex badan wuxuu qaadan karaa qaabab yar yar: marka hore kala qaybi (amarka Kala qaybi ee Workspace-ka Mesh, ama modifier-ka Subdivision surface oo aad Apply gareyso), ama shid Faahfaahin. Brushes Brush Furaha Waxa uu sameeyo Sawir D Dusha hoosteeda brush-ka wuu kor u qaadaa Clay C Lakabyo siman oo dhoobo ah ayuu dhisaa, godadka marka hore buuxiyaa Siib S Wuu siibaa buuqyada; hay Shift si aad u siibto brush kasta Qabo G Dusha ayuu la jiidaa pointer-ka Buufi I Dusha ayuu ka buufiyaa jihadiisa Crease Shift+C Godad fiiqan ayuu jaraa Pinch P Dusha ayuu u jiidaa dhexda brush-ka Simee T Dusha ayuu ku riixaa diyaaradda celceliska Mask M Maaska ayuu rinjiyeeyaa kaas oo dusha ka ilaaliya brush-yada kale Riix Ctrl inta aad sarakaysid si aad u shaqeyso dhinac kale (hoos halkii sare, xiidmo halkii godad, ka saar maaska), ama shid Ka saar. Cabbirka iyo xoogga Cabbirka brush-ka waa pixel-yada shaashadda ku yaal, sidaas darteed waxay u dareemaa isku mid sida aad u fogaato: [ iyo ] ayuu yaraysiiyaa iyo weynaysiiyaa, Shift+[ iyo Shift+] ayuu beddelaa xoogga. Panel-ku wuxuu muujiyaa labadaba. Qalin tablet-ka, cadaadis badan ayaa brush-ka dhigaya mid weyn oo xoog badan; panel-ku wuxuu labadaba damiyaa. Muraayad, maaska iyo faahfaahin Mirror X (X) wuxuu sculpt-gareeyaa labada dhinac casaan kulmiya isku mar, wejiyada iyo sawirrada. Maaskadu wuu madowdaa inta aad sculpt-gareyso. Clear mask (Alt+M) ayuu ka saaraa, Invert mask (Ctrl+I) wuxuu maaskeeyaa waxa bilaa ahaa, wuxuuna bilaayaa waxa la maaskeeyey. Maaskada waxa lagu kaydiyaa mesh-ka. Detail wuxuu ku daraa triangles meesha aad sculpt-gareyso: geesaha ka dheer cabbirka panel-ka (pixel-yada shaashadda) waa la kala qaybiyaa brush-ka hoosteeda. Waxay u baahan tahay mesh triangles ah, wuxuuna weydiiyaa in marka hore la sameeyo. Jiid kasta hal tallaabo ayuu ka noqdaa. Faahfaahintu waxay keliya ku darta triangles; ma tirtirto kuwii noqday kuwo yaraan. Remesh (Workspace-ka Mesh) wuxuu dib u siman yeelaa mesh-ka oo dhan. Eeg sidoo kale Tafatir mesh, Meshes iyo Modifiers mesh-ka dushiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"groups-components","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kooxaha iyo qaybaha","summary":"Ka dhig walxaha inay isku dhejin, wax ka beddel hal nuqul si dhammaantood isu beddelmaan, oo isticmaal jaantuska Liiska iyo Qaybaha.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["koox","qayb","samee koox","samee qayb","kala bax","ka dhig gaar ah","liiska","tusaalooyin","nuqullo","bloog","ku dhex jira","tafatir kooxda","dhig"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-koox-ama-qayb","text":"Samee koox ama qayb","level":2},{"id":"wax-ka-beddel-gudaha-kooxda-ama-qaybta","text":"Wax ka beddel gudaha kooxda ama qaybta","level":2},{"id":"dhig-nuqullo-dheeraad-ah-oo-qayb-ah","text":"Dhig nuqullo dheeraad ah oo qayb ah","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-habee-liiska","text":"Dib u habee liiska","level":2},{"id":"hal-nuqul-ka-dhig-mid-kala-duwan","text":"Hal nuqul ka dhig mid kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-kooxda-qayb","text":"Ka dhig kooxda qayb","level":2},{"id":"kala-bax","text":"Kala bax","level":2},{"id":"adag-iyo-mugga","text":"Adag iyo mugga","level":2},{"id":"markii-nuqulka-ugu-dambeeya-baxo","text":"Markii nuqulka ugu dambeeya baxo","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-la-ogaado","text":"Waxyaabo la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJoomatariga furan ee ModelCraft waa isku dhejisa: xariiqyada taabanaya way is jeexaan, wajiyada wadaaga hal geesle waa wada guurayaan. Taasi waxay ka dhigtaa rinjiyeynta wajiyada mid shaqeeya, laakiin waxay kaloo tahay in darbi laga sameeyay sanduuq kale uu ku dhex milmo. \u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay waxyaabaha ka dhigaan kuwo kala go&#039;an.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal \u003Cstrong\u003Ekoox\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu duubaa joomatari si uu u shaqeeyo sida hal walax. Wax ka baxsan kooxda ma ku dhejin karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb\u003C/strong\u003E waa koox la geli karo tiro badan. Nuqul kasta wuxuu wadaagaa waxa ku jira: midkood wax ka beddel, dhammaantood way beddelmaan. Isticmaal qaybaha wax kasta oo soo noqnoqda: daaqadaha, tiirarka, miisaska, geedaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-koox-ama-qayb\"\u003ESamee koox ama qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro joomatariga. Saddex jeer gucsi wajiga ayaa dooranaya walxa oo dhan ee isku xidhan; jiid daaqad ayaa dooranaya wax kasta oo sanduuqa ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kooxda, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qaybta. Waxaad sidoo kale guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroup\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponent\u003C/span\u003E qalabka hoose ee kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrganize\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee koox (Shift+G)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee qayb (G)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la kooxeeyay sida Group#1.&quot; ama &quot;Waa la sameeyay qayb Component#1.&quot;, walxa cusub ayaa la doortay, waxayna ku muuqataa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u magacowdo, ku qor magac goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji meel kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii wajiga la doorto, geeskiisuna way la socdaan. Haddii wax aan la dooran, joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Marka hore dooro joomatari (jiid daaqad, ama saddex jeer gucsi si aad u doorato wax kasta oo isku xidhan).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha waad kooxeyn kartaa: dooro dhowr koox oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa isku dhejiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha furayaasha waxay la mid yihiin caadiyaadka SketchUp: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa qayb, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E koox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-ka-beddel-gudaha-kooxda-ama-qaybta\"\u003EWax ka beddel gudaha kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer gucsi (aragtida ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E), ama dooro oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E-da.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta kale ee moodelka way lumaysaa, dhuumaha waxay u guuraan dhuumaha kooxda laftiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa &quot;Editing: Model › Group#1&quot;. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Editing Group#1. Esc ama laba jeer gucsi meel ka baxsan ayaa xira.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee, riix, guuri, tirtir sida caadiga ah. Wax kasta oo aad samaynayso waxay ku sii jiraan kooxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir: riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (laba jeer haddii wax la doortay), laba jeer gucsi meel bannaan, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose group\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E-da.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb furan ayaa markaad shaqaynayso, nuqul kasta oo ka mid ah way beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-nuqullo-dheeraad-ah-oo-qayb-ah\"\u003EDhig nuqullo dheeraad ah oo qayb ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqul ka samee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003EGuuri iyo koobiyee\u003C/a\u003E). Nuqul kasta waa meel kale oo ka mid ah isla qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E ee ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E gudaha, kadibna guji meesha aad rabto. Barta bilowga, oo ah geeska ugu hooseeya sanduuqa ku wareegsan wixii aad dooratay markaad sameysay, ayaa halkaas ku dhacaysa meesha aad guujiso. Qalabka ayaa markaas ku laabta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa inta nuqul ee la dhigay (&quot;4×&quot;), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa tirada ka dib magaca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-habee-liiska\"\u003EDib u habee liiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid safka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E si aad u beddesho meesha uu ku jiro. Waxba ma dhaqaaqo jaantuska: koox waxay ku sii haysaa meeshii ay ku taal moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGudaha kooxda:\u003C/strong\u003E ku rid bartamaha safka kooxda (safku wuxuu helaa khadka dhibcaha leh). Wuxuu gudaha galaa, dhammaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDalab kale:\u003C/strong\u003E ku rid geeska sare ama hoose ee safka (khad ayaa muuqda). Wuxuu ka horreeyaa ama ka dambeeyaa safkaas, gudaha isla kooxda safkaas, sidaas darteed wuxuu sidoo kale ku dhejinayaa kooxda meel la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa bax heerka sare:\u003C/strong\u003E ku rid madaxa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutliner\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu u dambeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celinaysa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta jiidista socoto wax ma dhigo. Koox ma gelin karto laftiisa ama kooxda ay haysato. Jiidista waa la joojiyaa marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFind by name\u003C/span\u003E qoraal ku jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGacanta ku hay safka wakhti yar, kadibna jiid. Taabasho degdeg ah ayaa liiska sare u dhaqaajiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-nuqul-ka-dhig-mid-kala-duwan\"\u003EHal nuqul ka dhig mid kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro nuqulka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E-da (waxay muuqataa marka qaybta lagu dhigay in ka badan hal jeer). Nuqulkaas wuxuu helaa qeex gaar ah, oo magac u eg asalka lambar cusub. Wax ka beddel iyada iyadoo kuwa kale aan taabanin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-kooxda-qayb\"\u003EKa dhig kooxda qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro kooxda oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee qayb\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E-da. Waxay helaysaa magac cusub, sida Component#2, xitaa haddii aad kooxda magac siisay; mar kale ku qor magaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-bax\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro kooxda ama qaybta oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E (qalabka ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E). Waxa ku jira wuxuu noqonayaa joomatari furan meeshii uu ahaa, wuxuuna ku dhejinayaa waxa taabanaya. Kooxaha gudihiisa ku jira way sii ahaanayaan kooxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adag-iyo-mugga\"\u003EAdag iyo mugga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dooranayso kooxda ama qaybta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid: Yes\u003C/strong\u003E haddii wajiyadiisu si buuxda u xirmaan oo aan wax godan lahayn (geesaha kasta waxaa wadaaga laba wajiyood oo kaliya), iyo haddii aan kooxo gudihiisa ku jirin. Markaas wuxuu muujinayaa sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003Emugga\u003C/strong\u003E. Sanduuq, darbi daaqad lagu jaray, iyo silinda la jiiyay waa adag; sanduuq sare oo laga tirtiray ma aha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"markii-nuqulka-ugu-dambeeya-baxo\"\u003EMarkii nuqulka ugu dambeeya baxo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtirida nuqulka ugu dambeeya ee qayb ayaa sidoo kale ka saaraysa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComponents\u003C/span\u003E gudaha. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxyaabo la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqullada \u003Cstrong\u003Ekooxda\u003C/strong\u003E ee lagu sameeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E waxay wadaagaan waxa ku jira dhismahan, sida nuqullada qaybta: wax ka beddelka mid wuxuu beddelaa kuwa kale. Si uu mid u noqdo mid madaxbannaan, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybuhu ma jarin furaha darbiyada, ma-na xidhmaan wajiyada, mana jirto maktabad qaybo diyaar ah. Adigu samee, ama soo dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylalka la soo dhoofiyay waxay yimaadaan kooxda. Faylalka Collada waxay ku hayaan kooxahooda iyo qaybahooda gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Joomatariga furan ee ModelCraft waa isku dhejisa: xariiqyada taabanaya way is jeexaan, wajiyada wadaaga hal geesle waa wada guurayaan. Taasi waxay ka dhigtaa rinjiyeynta wajiyada mid shaqeeya, laakiin waxay kaloo tahay in darbi laga sameeyay sanduuq kale uu ku dhex milmo. Kooxaha iyo qaybaha waxay waxyaabaha ka dhigaan kuwo kala go'an. Hal koox wuxuu duubaa joomatari si uu u shaqeeyo sida hal walax. Wax ka baxsan kooxda ma ku dhejin karaan. Qayb waa koox la geli karo tiro badan. Nuqul kasta wuxuu wadaagaa waxa ku jira: midkood wax ka beddel, dhammaantood way beddelmaan. Isticmaal qaybaha wax kasta oo soo noqnoqda: daaqadaha, tiirarka, miisaska, geedaha. Samee koox ama qayb Dooro joomatariga. Saddex jeer gucsi wajiga ayaa dooranaya walxa oo dhan ee isku xidhan; jiid daaqad ayaa dooranaya wax kasta oo sanduuqa ku jira. Riix Shift+G kooxda, ama G qaybta. Waxaad sidoo kale guji Group ama Component qalabka hoose ee kooxda Organize, ama Samee koox (Shift+G) ama Samee qayb (G) oo ku jira Entity info. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la kooxeeyay sida Group#1.\" ama \"Waa la sameeyay qayb Component#1.\", walxa cusub ayaa la doortay, waxayna ku muuqataa Outliner. Si aad u magacowdo, ku qor magac goobta Name ee Entity info oo riix Enter ama guji meel kale. Haddii wajiga la doorto, geeskiisuna way la socdaan. Haddii wax aan la dooran, joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Marka hore dooro joomatari (jiid daaqad, ama saddex jeer gucsi si aad u doorato wax kasta oo isku xidhan).\" Kooxaha waad kooxeyn kartaa: dooro dhowr koox oo riix Shift+G. Outliner wuxuu muujinayaa isku dhejiska. Xarfaha furayaasha waxay la mid yihiin caadiyaadka SketchUp: G wuxuu sameeyaa qayb, Shift+G koox. Wax ka beddel gudaha kooxda ama qaybta Laba jeer gucsi (aragtida ama Outliner), ama dooro oo guji Edit Entity info-da. Qaybta kale ee moodelka way lumaysaa, dhuumaha waxay u guuraan dhuumaha kooxda laftiisa, Outliner wuxuu akhrinayaa \"Editing: Model › Group#1\". Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Editing Group#1. Esc ama laba jeer gucsi meel ka baxsan ayaa xira.\" Samee, riix, guuri, tirtir sida caadiga ah. Wax kasta oo aad samaynayso waxay ku sii jiraan kooxda. Xir: riix Esc (laba jeer haddii wax la doortay), laba jeer gucsi meel bannaan, ama guji Close group Outliner-da. Qayb furan ayaa markaad shaqaynayso, nuqul kasta oo ka mid ah way beddelmaan. Dhig nuqullo dheeraad ah oo qayb ah Nuqul ka samee Move iyo Ctrl (eeg Guuri iyo koobiyee). Nuqul kasta waa meel kale oo ka mid ah isla qaybta. Ama guji Place ee ku xiga Components gudaha, kadibna guji meesha aad rabto. Barta bilowga, oo ah geeska ugu hooseeya sanduuqa ku wareegsan wixii aad dooratay markaad sameysay, ayaa halkaas ku dhacaysa meesha aad guujiso. Qalabka ayaa markaas ku laabta Select. Components wuxuu muujinayaa inta nuqul ee la dhigay (\"4×\"), Outliner wuxuu muujinayaa tirada ka dib magaca. Dib u habee liiska Jiid safka Outliner si aad u beddesho meesha uu ku jiro. Waxba ma dhaqaaqo jaantuska: koox waxay ku sii haysaa meeshii ay ku taal moodelka. Gudaha kooxda: ku rid bartamaha safka kooxda (safku wuxuu helaa khadka dhibcaha leh). Wuxuu gudaha galaa, dhammaadka. Dalab kale: ku rid geeska sare ama hoose ee safka (khad ayaa muuqda). Wuxuu ka horreeyaa ama ka dambeeyaa safkaas, gudaha isla kooxda safkaas, sidaas darteed wuxuu sidoo kale ku dhejinayaa kooxda meel la doortay. Ka bax heerka sare: ku rid madaxa Outliner. Wuxuu u dambeeyaa. Riix kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celinaysa. Esc inta jiidista socoto wax ma dhigo. Koox ma gelin karto laftiisa ama kooxda ay haysato. Jiidista waa la joojiyaa marka Find by name qoraal ku jiro. Gacanta ku hay safka wakhti yar, kadibna jiid. Taabasho degdeg ah ayaa liiska sare u dhaqaajiya. Hal nuqul ka dhig mid kala duwan Dooro nuqulka oo guji Make unique Entity info-da (waxay muuqataa marka qaybta lagu dhigay in ka badan hal jeer). Nuqulkaas wuxuu helaa qeex gaar ah, oo magac u eg asalka lambar cusub. Wax ka beddel iyada iyadoo kuwa kale aan taabanin. Ka dhig kooxda qayb Dooro kooxda oo guji Samee qayb Entity info-da. Waxay helaysaa magac cusub, sida Component#2, xitaa haddii aad kooxda magac siisay; mar kale ku qor magaca Name-ga. Kala bax Dooro kooxda ama qaybta oo guji Explode (qalabka ama Entity info). Waxa ku jira wuxuu noqonayaa joomatari furan meeshii uu ahaa, wuxuuna ku dhejinayaa waxa taabanaya. Kooxaha gudihiisa ku jira way sii ahaanayaan kooxo. Adag iyo mugga Markaad dooranayso kooxda ama qaybta, Entity info wuxuu muujinayaa Solid: Yes haddii wajiyadiisu si buuxda u xirmaan oo aan wax godan lahayn (geesaha kasta waxaa wadaaga laba wajiyood oo kaliya), iyo haddii aan kooxo gudihiisa ku jirin. Markaas wuxuu muujinayaa sidoo kale mugga. Sanduuq, darbi daaqad lagu jaray, iyo silinda la jiiyay waa adag; sanduuq sare oo laga tirtiray ma aha. Markii nuqulka ugu dambeeya baxo Tirtirida nuqulka ugu dambeeya ee qayb ayaa sidoo kale ka saaraysa Components gudaha. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaysa. Waxyaabo la ogaado Nuqullada kooxda ee lagu sameeyay Move waxay wadaagaan waxa ku jira dhismahan, sida nuqullada qaybta: wax ka beddelka mid wuxuu beddelaa kuwa kale. Si uu mid u noqdo mid madaxbannaan, guji Make component, kadibna Make unique. Eeg Xallinta dhibaatooyinka. Qaybuhu ma jarin furaha darbiyada, ma-na xidhmaan wajiyada, mana jirto maktabad qaybo diyaar ah. Adigu samee, ama soo dhoofi. Faylalka la soo dhoofiyay waxay yimaadaan kooxda. Faylalka Collada waxay ku hayaan kooxahooda iyo qaybahooda gudihiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"guides-measure","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qiyaas iyo dhigista hagayaasha","summary":"Akhri dheerka iyo bedka, qiyaas labo barood oo dhex marta teefka, oo dhig xariiqyada iyo barooyinka hagaha aad ku rinjiyeyso.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["qiyaas","teef","protraktor","xagal","hagaha xagal","hage","xariiqda hagaha","xariiqda dhismaha","masaafo","cabbir","dherer","bed","ka fogaan","qorshe","barta hagaha"],"headings":[{"id":"akhri-cabbirka-adigoon-qiyaasin","text":"Akhri cabbirka adigoon qiyaasin","level":2},{"id":"qiyaas-labo-barood-dhexdooda","text":"Qiyaas labo barood dhexdooda","level":2},{"id":"dhig-xariiqda-hagaha","text":"Dhig xariiqda hagaha","level":2},{"id":"hage-xagal-ah-protraktor","text":"Hage xagal ah: Protraktor","level":2},{"id":"rinjiyee-iyadoo-lagu-xidhayo-hagayaasha","text":"Rinjiyee iyadoo lagu xidhayo hagayaasha","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-hagayaasha","text":"Ka saar hagayaasha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-cabbirka-adigoon-qiyaasin\"\u003EAkhri cabbirka adigoon qiyaasin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro wax oo fiiri \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edheerkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWajigu wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ebedkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E iyo inta godad ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhowr wajiyood waxay muujinayaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ewadarta bedkooda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKooxda ama qaybtu waxay muujinayaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ecabbirkooda\u003C/strong\u003E (ballaadhka × qoto × dhererka sanduuqa ku wareegsan) iyo, haddii ay tahay jirka adag, \u003Cstrong\u003Emugga\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aan wax la dooran, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka moodelka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDheerka iyo bedka waxay isticmaalaan halbeegga ku jira doorashada hoose ee midig. Moodel millimeter ah wuxuu muujiyaa bedka 0.01 m² iyo ka sareeya meter laba jibbaaran (qol 4 × 3 m ah wuxuu akhrinayaa &quot;12 m²&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad rinjiyeynayso, sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu muujinayaa dherer, cabbir, radius ama masaafo toos ah, marka aadan badanaa u baahnayn qiyaas kadib.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad cabbir uga beddesho kadib rinjiyeynta, dooro geesle ama kooxda oo mar kale ku qor dheerka ama cabbirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E-da. Ama geli \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Ecabbir\u003C/a\u003E oo ku qor dherer cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas-labo-barood-dhexdooda\"\u003EQiyaas labo barood dhexdooda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u hesho qiyaasta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeef\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta: geesle, dhexe, barta wajiga, ama dhulka. (Guji geesle wax kale ayuu sameeyaa; eeg hoose.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU gudub barta labaad. Qalabka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E) waxay muujinayaan masaafada. Waxay ku dhejiyaan barooyinka iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la qiyaasay 4&#039; 6&quot;.&quot; iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta hagaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa laga tagaa barta labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad barta hagaha uga dhigto masaafo saxda ah, ku qor kadib guji koowaad oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: waxay u gaaraysaa jihada aad u tilmaamayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-xariiqda-hagaha\"\u003EDhig xariiqda hagaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqda hagaha waa xariiq dhibcaha ah oo aan dhammaad lahayn, oo la mid geesle, masaafo aad doorato. Isticmaal hagayaasha si aad u dhigto dhabarka, dhererka dabaqa, ama meesha daaqaddu ka bilaabanto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesle\u003C/strong\u003E (ma aha dhammaadkiisa). Qalabka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;On edge&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa guuri geesha, dhinaca uu hagaha ku dhici doono. Xariiq dhibic ah ayaa raacaysa, la mid geesha, sanduuqa qiimaha (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu muujinayaa masaafada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji, ama qor ka fogaanta kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1.5m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Xariiqda hagaha 1.5 m ka fogaan geeska.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilaabida xariiq hagaha jira wuxuu sameeyaa xariiq kale oo la mid ah, si aad u fidiso gridka hal hage oo ka fogaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad qorto ka fogaanta adigoo aan marka hore ka guurin geeska, ModelCraft ma garan karo dhinaca aad ula jeeddo: &quot;Marka hore ka guuri geeska si aad u muujiso dhinaca.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hage-xagal-ah-protraktor\"\u003EHage xagal ah: Protraktor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProtractor\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji bartamaha: barta uu xariiqda hagaha mari doono. Wajiga dushiisa, protraktorku wuxuu ku jiraa wajigaas; meel kale wuxuu fidsan yahay. Kadib guujintan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka dhigayaa toosan casaan, cagaar ama buluug (riix mar kale si aad u soo celiso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta dejinaysa 0°, tusaale ahaan dhex geesle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU guuri xagalka aad rabto kadibna guji: wuxuu ku dhacaa kor ama hoos 15° meelaha. Ama qor xagalka darajo, sida \u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hagaha wuxuu u gudbaa dhinaca mawshaarku ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqda hagaha wuxuu mara bartamaha xagal taas. Kala rinjiyee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E si aad u rinjiso dhinaca saqafka, gees jajaban ama darbi fidsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rinjiyee-iyadoo-lagu-xidhayo-hagayaasha\"\u003ERinjiyee iyadoo lagu xidhayo hagayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada rinjiyeynta waxay ku dhejiyaan xariiqyada hagaha (&quot;On guide&quot;) iyo barooyinka hagaha (&quot;Guide point&quot;), iyo meesha xariiqda hagaha ay ka gudubto jihada tiirka. Bilow afar-geesle meel ay labo hage isgoyaan si aad u dhigto saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-hagayaasha\"\u003EKa saar hagayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal hage: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhammaan hagayaasha: marka wax la dooran ma jiro, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete all guides\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E-da.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHagayaasha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Qaababka kale lama dhoofiyo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Akhri cabbirka adigoon qiyaasin Dooro wax oo fiiri Entity info: Geesku wuxuu muujinayaa dheerkiisa. Wajigu wuxuu muujinayaa bedkiisa iyo inta godad ay leedahay. Dhowr wajiyood waxay muujinayaan wadarta bedkooda. Kooxda ama qaybtu waxay muujinayaan cabbirkooda (ballaadhka × qoto × dhererka sanduuqa ku wareegsan) iyo, haddii ay tahay jirka adag, mugga. Haddii aan wax la dooran, Entity info wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka moodelka oo dhan. Dheerka iyo bedka waxay isticmaalaan halbeegga ku jira doorashada hoose ee midig. Moodel millimeter ah wuxuu muujiyaa bedka 0.01 m² iyo ka sareeya meter laba jibbaaran (qol 4 × 3 m ah wuxuu akhrinayaa \"12 m²\"). Intaad rinjiyeynayso, sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu muujinayaa dherer, cabbir, radius ama masaafo toos ah, marka aadan badanaa u baahnayn qiyaas kadib. Si aad cabbir uga beddesho kadib rinjiyeynta, dooro geesle ama kooxda oo mar kale ku qor dheerka ama cabbirka Entity info-da. Ama geli cabbir oo ku qor dherer cusub. Qiyaas labo barood dhexdooda Riix T si aad u hesho qiyaasta Teef. Guji barta: geesle, dhexe, barta wajiga, ama dhulka. (Guji geesle wax kale ayuu sameeyaa; eeg hoose.) U gudub barta labaad. Qalabka iyo sanduuqa qiimaha (Length) waxay muujinayaan masaafada. Waxay ku dhejiyaan barooyinka iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug. Guji. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la qiyaasay 4' 6\".\" iyo barta hagaha waxaa laga tagaa barta labaad. Si aad barta hagaha uga dhigto masaafo saxda ah, ku qor kadib guji koowaad oo riix Enter: waxay u gaaraysaa jihada aad u tilmaamayso. Dhig xariiqda hagaha Xariiqda hagaha waa xariiq dhibcaha ah oo aan dhammaad lahayn, oo la mid geesle, masaafo aad doorato. Isticmaal hagayaasha si aad u dhigto dhabarka, dhererka dabaqa, ama meesha daaqaddu ka bilaabanto. Riix T. Guji geesle (ma aha dhammaadkiisa). Qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \"On edge\". Ka guuri geesha, dhinaca uu hagaha ku dhici doono. Xariiq dhibic ah ayaa raacaysa, la mid geesha, sanduuqa qiimaha (Offset) wuxuu muujinayaa masaafada. Guji, ama qor ka fogaanta kadibna riix Enter: 1.5m, 5'. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Xariiqda hagaha 1.5 m ka fogaan geeska.\" Bilaabida xariiq hagaha jira wuxuu sameeyaa xariiq kale oo la mid ah, si aad u fidiso gridka hal hage oo ka fogaan. Haddii aad qorto ka fogaanta adigoo aan marka hore ka guurin geeska, ModelCraft ma garan karo dhinaca aad ula jeeddo: \"Marka hore ka guuri geeska si aad u muujiso dhinaca.\" Hage xagal ah: Protraktor Guji Protractor kooxda Modify. Guji bartamaha: barta uu xariiqda hagaha mari doono. Wajiga dushiisa, protraktorku wuxuu ku jiraa wajigaas; meel kale wuxuu fidsan yahay. Kadib guujintan, →, ← ama ↑ wuxuu ka dhigayaa toosan casaan, cagaar ama buluug (riix mar kale si aad u soo celiso). Guji barta dejinaysa 0°, tusaale ahaan dhex geesle. U guuri xagalka aad rabto kadibna guji: wuxuu ku dhacaa kor ama hoos 15° meelaha. Ama qor xagalka darajo, sida 22.5, kadibna riix Enter; hagaha wuxuu u gudbaa dhinaca mawshaarku ku yaal. Xariiqda hagaha wuxuu mara bartamaha xagal taas. Kala rinjiyee Line si aad u rinjiso dhinaca saqafka, gees jajaban ama darbi fidsan. Rinjiyee iyadoo lagu xidhayo hagayaasha Qalabyada rinjiyeynta waxay ku dhejiyaan xariiqyada hagaha (\"On guide\") iyo barooyinka hagaha (\"Guide point\"), iyo meesha xariiqda hagaha ay ka gudubto jihada tiirka. Bilow afar-geesle meel ay labo hage isgoyaan si aad u dhigto saxda ah. Ka saar hagayaasha Hal hage: dooro Select oo riix Delete, ama guji Eraser. Dhammaan hagayaasha: marka wax la dooran ma jiro, guji Delete all guides Entity info-da. Hagayaasha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Qaababka kale lama dhoofiyo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dimensions","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Cabbir oo dib u cabbir wax aad sawirtay","summary":"Dhig cabbirro between geesaha, qaansooyin iyo goobooyin, ama laba geesood; qor dherer cusub si aad moodeelka u cabbirto. Dib u qor dherer geesta ama ballac, qoto iyo joogta kooxda gudaha Entity info.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["cabbir","cabbirro","dib u cabbir","beddel cabbirka","tafatir cabbirka","dherer","ballac","qoto","joog","balaadhin","cabbir wadid","faallo","cabbir","dhexroor","radius","dhexroor","xagal","qaanso","goobo","R","Ø"],"headings":[{"id":"dhig-cabbir","text":"Dhig cabbir","level":2},{"id":"radius-dhexroor-iyo-xagal","text":"Radius, dhexroor iyo xagal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-cabbir-moodeelka-cabbir-ahaan","text":"Dib u cabbir moodeelka cabbir ahaan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-dhaqaaqa","text":"Waxa dhaqaaqa","level":3},{"id":"marka-dib-u-cabbirka-la-diido","text":"Marka dib u cabbirka la diido","level":3},{"id":"dib-u-deji-cabbirka-gudaha-entity-info","text":"Dib u deji cabbirka gudaha Entity info","level":2},{"id":"cabbirradu-waxay-raacaan-moodeelka","text":"Cabbirradu waxay raacaan moodeelka","level":2},{"id":"ka-saar-cabbirrada","text":"Ka saar cabbirrada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka ModelCraft ma aha mid go&#039;an markii wax la sawiro. \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa dherer moodeelka ku saabsan, qorista dherer cusub oo ku dhex-dhigtaa wuxuu moodeelka u beddelaa si uu u la mid noqdo. Waxaad sidoo kale dib u qori kartaa dherer geesta, ama ballaca, qotada iyo joogta kooxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E gudaheeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-cabbir\"\u003EDhig cabbir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta aad ka cabbirto. Waxay ku dhaqmaa geesaha, dhexda iyo geesaha, sida sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma guji mar \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesta\u003C/strong\u003E (tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;On edge&quot;) si aad geesta oo dhan ugu cabbirto hal guji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha khadka cabbirku ku taagnaan doono, ama qor offset-ka, sida \u003Ccode\u003E0.5m\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadka cabbirku wuxuu sii joogaa sinnaanta geesta toosan, marka aan laga eegin dhinaca. Geesta toosan wuxuu ku sii joogaa diyaaradda toosan ee kugu wajahan ugu wanaagsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStatus bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Dimension 4 m.&quot; Cabbirradu waxay muujiyaan dherer unit-ka moodeelka wayna cusboonaadaan marka aad unit-ka beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"radius-dhexroor-iyo-xagal\"\u003ERadius, dhexroor iyo xagal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E ayaa cabbira wareegyada iyo xagallada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaanso:\u003C/strong\u003E guji qaansada. Tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E. Guuri mouse-ka meesha qoraalku ku taagnaan doono, guji: wuxuu akhrinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ER 1.5 m\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobo:\u003C/strong\u003E guji goobada. Waxaad heshaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edhexroor\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003EØ 3 m\u003C/strong\u003E) oo khad goobada dhexdeeda ka gudba. Poligonnadu si isku mid ah ayay u shaqeeyaan, geesahooda oo goobada saaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagasha u dhaxaysa laba geesood:\u003C/strong\u003E guji geesta koowaad, kadibna guji geesta labaad ee ku kulanta geesta (intaad ku jirto, tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle between the edges\u003C/span\u003E). Kadibna u gudub xagasha aad rabto, oo guji. Gudaha geeska waxaad heshaa xagasha u dhaxaysa geesaha; markaad u gudubto dhinac, waxaad heshaa xagasha ku dhinac-dhinac ah (tusaale 150° halkii 30°). Fogaanta aad ka guuto geeska ayaa dejinaysa meesha qaansadu marayso; ama qor fogaantaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad radius u beddesho dhexroor ama dib, dooro cabbirka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow as\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir-dib-u-dhigistu:\u003C/strong\u003E qor radius ama dhexroor cusub isla markii aad mid dhigtay, ama dooro markii dambe oo qor. Qaansada ama goobada ayaa dhexdeeda hayn, cabbirkeeda oo beddelan; wejiga ay xidhayso (diska, dhamaadka godka) ayaa isaga la beddelaa. Laba waxba kaliya ayaa cabbira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka xagasha\u003C/strong\u003E marna ma beddelo moodeelka. Si aad xagasha u beddesho, geesaha wareeji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobada dhamaadka silindarka\u003C/strong\u003E (goobo aad ku jiidday \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E) ma beddeli karto cabbirkeeda, sababtoo ah dhinacyadeeda ayaa beddelmi lahaa. Silindarka ku miisaan beddel, dhinaca tiirkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-cabbir-moodeelka-cabbir-ahaan\"\u003EDib u cabbir moodeelka cabbir ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii aad cabbir dhigto, ku qor dherer cusub oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E6m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3500\u003C/code\u003E moodeel millimeter ah. Moodeelku wuxuu u beddelaa cabbirkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar dambe, waqti kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsagoo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ku jira, guji qoraalka cabbirka ama khadkiisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EDimension\u003C/strong\u003E oo muujinaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor dherer cusub oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Waxaad ku qori kartaa sanduuqa qiimaha, ama sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-dhaqaaqa\"\u003EWaxa dhaqaaqa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeeska labaad ee aad guuto ayaa dhaqaaqa, iyo wax kasta oo ka dambeeya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabada geesood hal qayb ah\u003C/strong\u003E (ballaca sanduuqa, joogta darbiga): dhinaca geesta dhaqaaqaysa ayaa dibadda ama dhex u socda, wejiyada ku xidhan ayaa u fidaan. Sanduuqu wuxuu sii joogaa jidh xidhan, wax kasta oo dhinaca hoose saaran, sida qayb daaqadeed, ayaa la socda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha laba qayb oo kala duwan\u003C/strong\u003E (dhexda laba sanduuq): qaybta geesta dhaqaaqda ayaa si buuxda u dhaqaaqda, dhexdu waa beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta dhaqaaqaysa gudaha kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E oo geeska kale aanu ku jirin: kooxda oo dhan ayaa dhaqaaqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabada geesood gudaha isla kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E: gudaha ayaa lagu fidiyaa. Qaybta wax kasta meeshaas ayay ka beddelantaa, sida tafatirka mar kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho geesta dhaqaaqda, dooro cabbirka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESecond end\u003C/span\u003E (caadiga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta aad labaad guuday ayaa dhaqaaqda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFirst end\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta aad marka hore guuday ayaa dhaqaaqda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBoth ends (centered)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta mid kasta badhka beddelka ayuu dhaqaaqaa, dhexdu waa joogtaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"marka-dib-u-cabbirka-la-diido\"\u003EMarka dib u cabbirka la diido\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wax ma beddelo, wuxuuna sheegaa sababta status bar-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;a face would bend out of its plane&quot; (wejigu wuxuu ka ban-baxayaa diyaaraddiisa): cabbirku wuxuu ku socdaa janjeer qaabka. Cabbir geesta dhexdeeda, ama red, green ama blue.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;a face would shrink to nothing or turn inside out&quot; (wejigu wuxuu ku yaraanayaa wax aan lahayn ama wuxuu u rogmanayaa dibadda-gudaha): dherer cusub ayaa gaaban qaabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;the end that moves is not on a corner of the model&quot; (dhamaadka dhaqaaqa ma aha geesta moodeelka): wuxuu ku yaal meel bannaan ama dhexda geesta. Dooro dhamaadka kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves\u003C/span\u003E ama dhig cabbirka laba geeso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;a length must be above zero&quot; (dherer waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u cabbir kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dib u celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-deji-cabbirka-gudaha-entity-info\"\u003EDib u deji cabbirka gudaha Entity info\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar walba uma baahnid cabbir:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E waa sanduuq aad ku qori karto. Qorista dherer sanduuqa qiimaha ayaa sidoo kale shaqaysa. Geesta ka fog ee red, kadibna green, kadibna blue ayaa dhaqaaqa, wax kasta oo ku xidhan ayaa fidaya. Tusaale ahaan, dib u qorista geesta hoose ee hore ee sanduuqa ayaa ka dhigta mid ballac u dhan midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxda ama qaybta:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWidth (red)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth (green)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight (blue)\u003C/span\u003E waa sanduuqyo. Dhinaca fog (midig, gadaal, sare) ayaa dhaqaaqa. Kuwani waa tiirarka kooxda, ka hor wareeg kasta oo aad siisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dabaqdo, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad qiimihii hore dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirradu-waxay-raacaan-moodeelka\"\u003ECabbirradu waxay raacaan moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirku wuxuu ku xidhan yahay laba geesood oo lagu dhigay (xagasha: geeskeeda iyo dhamaadka labada geesood ee ka fog; qaansada ama goobada: qaansadeeda ama goobadeeda). Dhaqaaq, riix/jiid ama dib u cabbir geometry-ga, cabbirku wuu raacaa oo muujinayaa dherer cusub. Wuu ku xidhan yahay markii aad geometry-ga u beddesho kooxda ama qayb.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii dhamaadka lagu dhigay meel aan geesta ahayn (wejiga ama meel bannaan), ama geeskiisa la tirtiray, dhamaadkaas wuxuu sii joogaa meeshii uu joogay. Cabbirku wali wuu cabbiraa, laakiin wuxuu ka dib u cabbiri karaa dhamaadkiisa kale oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-saar-cabbirrada\"\u003EKa saar cabbirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal cabbir: dooro oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhammaan cabbirrada: marka aan wax la dooran, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete all dimensions\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirradu waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Lama dhoofiyo qaababka kale, kuwaas oo keliya moodeelka 3D qaada. Fayl leh cabbirro ayaa weli furmaya ModelCraft hore, laakiin aan cabbirro lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Cabbirka ModelCraft ma aha mid go'an markii wax la sawiro. Cabbir wuxuu muujiyaa dherer moodeelka ku saabsan, qorista dherer cusub oo ku dhex-dhigtaa wuxuu moodeelka u beddelaa si uu u la mid noqdo. Waxaad sidoo kale dib u qori kartaa dherer geesta, ama ballaca, qotada iyo joogta kooxda, Entity info gudaheeda. Dhig cabbir Riix D, ama guji Dimension toolbar-ka. Guji geesta aad ka cabbirto. Waxay ku dhaqmaa geesaha, dhexda iyo geesaha, sida sawirka. Guji geesta labaad. Ama guji mar geesta (tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"On edge\") si aad geesta oo dhan ugu cabbirto hal guji. Guji meesha khadka cabbirku ku taagnaan doono, ama qor offset-ka, sida 0.5m, kadibna taabo Enter. Khadka cabbirku wuxuu sii joogaa sinnaanta geesta toosan, marka aan laga eegin dhinaca. Geesta toosan wuxuu ku sii joogaa diyaaradda toosan ee kugu wajahan ugu wanaagsan. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Dimension 4 m.\" Cabbirradu waxay muujiyaan dherer unit-ka moodeelka wayna cusboonaadaan marka aad unit-ka beddesho. Radius, dhexroor iyo xagal Isla qalabka Dimension ayaa cabbira wareegyada iyo xagallada: Qaanso: guji qaansada. Tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay Radius. Guuri mouse-ka meesha qoraalku ku taagnaan doono, guji: wuxuu akhrinayaa R 1.5 m. Goobo: guji goobada. Waxaad heshaa dhexroor (Ø 3 m) oo khad goobada dhexdeeda ka gudba. Poligonnadu si isku mid ah ayay u shaqeeyaan, geesahooda oo goobada saaran. Xagasha u dhaxaysa laba geesood: guji geesta koowaad, kadibna guji geesta labaad ee ku kulanta geesta (intaad ku jirto, tip-ku wuxuu leeyahay Angle between the edges). Kadibna u gudub xagasha aad rabto, oo guji. Gudaha geeska waxaad heshaa xagasha u dhaxaysa geesaha; markaad u gudubto dhinac, waxaad heshaa xagasha ku dhinac-dhinac ah (tusaale 150° halkii 30°). Fogaanta aad ka guuto geeska ayaa dejinaysa meesha qaansadu marayso; ama qor fogaantaas. Si aad radius u beddesho dhexroor ama dib, dooro cabbirka oo dooro Show as gudaha Entity info. Cabbir-dib-u-dhigistu: qor radius ama dhexroor cusub isla markii aad mid dhigtay, ama dooro markii dambe oo qor. Qaansada ama goobada ayaa dhexdeeda hayn, cabbirkeeda oo beddelan; wejiga ay xidhayso (diska, dhamaadka godka) ayaa isaga la beddelaa. Laba waxba kaliya ayaa cabbira: Cabbirka xagasha marna ma beddelo moodeelka. Si aad xagasha u beddesho, geesaha wareeji Rotate. Goobada dhamaadka silindarka (goobo aad ku jiidday Push/pull) ma beddeli karto cabbirkeeda, sababtoo ah dhinacyadeeda ayaa beddelmi lahaa. Silindarka ku miisaan beddel, dhinaca tiirkiisa. Dib u cabbir moodeelka cabbir ahaan Markii aad cabbir dhigto, ku qor dherer cusub oo taabo Enter: 6m, 12', 3500 moodeel millimeter ah. Moodeelku wuxuu u beddelaa cabbirkaas. Mar dambe, waqti kasta: Isagoo Select ku jira, guji qoraalka cabbirka ama khadkiisa. Entity info wuxuu leeyahay Dimension oo muujinaya Length-kiisa. Qor dherer cusub oo taabo Enter. Waxaad ku qori kartaa sanduuqa qiimaha, ama sanduuqa Length gudaha Entity info. Waxa dhaqaaqa Geeska labaad ee aad guuto ayaa dhaqaaqa, iyo wax kasta oo ka dambeeya: Labada geesood hal qayb ah (ballaca sanduuqa, joogta darbiga): dhinaca geesta dhaqaaqaysa ayaa dibadda ama dhex u socda, wejiyada ku xidhan ayaa u fidaan. Sanduuqu wuxuu sii joogaa jidh xidhan, wax kasta oo dhinaca hoose saaran, sida qayb daaqadeed, ayaa la socda. Geesaha laba qayb oo kala duwan (dhexda laba sanduuq): qaybta geesta dhaqaaqda ayaa si buuxda u dhaqaaqda, dhexdu waa beddelaa. Geesta dhaqaaqaysa gudaha kooxda ama qaybta oo geeska kale aanu ku jirin: kooxda oo dhan ayaa dhaqaaqda. Labada geesood gudaha isla kooxda ama qaybta: gudaha ayaa lagu fidiyaa. Qaybta wax kasta meeshaas ayay ka beddelantaa, sida tafatirka mar kasta. Si aad u beddesho geesta dhaqaaqda, dooro cabbirka oo dooro Moves gudaha Entity info: Doorasho Waxa dhaca Second end (caadiga) Geesta aad labaad guuday ayaa dhaqaaqda First end Geesta aad marka hore guuday ayaa dhaqaaqda Both ends (centered) Geesta mid kasta badhka beddelka ayuu dhaqaaqaa, dhexdu waa joogtaa Marka dib u cabbirka la diido ModelCraft wax ma beddelo, wuxuuna sheegaa sababta status bar-ka: \"a face would bend out of its plane\" (wejigu wuxuu ka ban-baxayaa diyaaraddiisa): cabbirku wuxuu ku socdaa janjeer qaabka. Cabbir geesta dhexdeeda, ama red, green ama blue. \"a face would shrink to nothing or turn inside out\" (wejigu wuxuu ku yaraanayaa wax aan lahayn ama wuxuu u rogmanayaa dibadda-gudaha): dherer cusub ayaa gaaban qaabka. \"the end that moves is not on a corner of the model\" (dhamaadka dhaqaaqa ma aha geesta moodeelka): wuxuu ku yaal meel bannaan ama dhexda geesta. Dooro dhamaadka kale Moves ama dhig cabbirka laba geeso. \"a length must be above zero\" (dherer waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber). Dib u cabbir kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z wuu dib u celiyaa. Dib u deji cabbirka gudaha Entity info Mar walba uma baahnid cabbir: Geesta: dooro. Length gudaha Entity info waa sanduuq aad ku qori karto. Qorista dherer sanduuqa qiimaha ayaa sidoo kale shaqaysa. Geesta ka fog ee red, kadibna green, kadibna blue ayaa dhaqaaqa, wax kasta oo ku xidhan ayaa fidaya. Tusaale ahaan, dib u qorista geesta hoose ee hore ee sanduuqa ayaa ka dhigta mid ballac u dhan midig. Kooxda ama qaybta: dooro. Width (red), Depth (green) iyo Height (blue) waa sanduuqyo. Dhinaca fog (midig, gadaal, sare) ayaa dhaqaaqa. Kuwani waa tiirarka kooxda, ka hor wareeg kasta oo aad siisay. Riix Enter si aad u dabaqdo, ama Esc si aad qiimihii hore dib ugu celiso. Cabbirradu waxay raacaan moodeelka Cabbirku wuxuu ku xidhan yahay laba geesood oo lagu dhigay (xagasha: geeskeeda iyo dhamaadka labada geesood ee ka fog; qaansada ama goobada: qaansadeeda ama goobadeeda). Dhaqaaq, riix/jiid ama dib u cabbir geometry-ga, cabbirku wuu raacaa oo muujinayaa dherer cusub. Wuu ku xidhan yahay markii aad geometry-ga u beddesho kooxda ama qayb. Haddii dhamaadka lagu dhigay meel aan geesta ahayn (wejiga ama meel bannaan), ama geeskiisa la tirtiray, dhamaadkaas wuxuu sii joogaa meeshii uu joogay. Cabbirku wali wuu cabbiraa, laakiin wuxuu ka dib u cabbiri karaa dhamaadkiisa kale oo keliya. Ka saar cabbirrada Hal cabbir: dooro oo riix Delete, ama guji Eraser. Dhammaan cabbirrada: marka aan wax la dooran, guji Delete all dimensions gudaha Entity info. Cabbirradu waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Lama dhoofiyo qaababka kale, kuwaas oo keliya moodeelka 3D qaada. Fayl leh cabbirro ayaa weli furmaya ModelCraft hore, laakiin aan cabbirro lahayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"erase","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Tirtir iyo nadiifi","summary":"Tirtir geesaha, kooxaha iyo hagayaasha adigoo isticmaalaya tirtiraha ama furaha Delete, isku dhaf wajiyada kala jaran, oo hagaaji wajiyada u jeeda jihada qaldan.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["tirtir","tirtiraha","delete","ka saar","isku dhaf wajiyada","nadiifi","xariiqyo bannaan","rogi wajiga","dambe wajiga","ka noqo","kooxda"],"headings":[{"id":"tirtir-adigoo-isticmaalaya-tirtiraha","text":"Tirtir adigoo isticmaalaya tirtiraha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wajiyada-ka-dhaca","text":"Waxa wajiyada ka dhaca","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-furaha-delete","text":"Tirtir furaha Delete","level":2},{"id":"nadiifi-xariiqyo-bannaan-wajig-siman","text":"Nadiifi xariiqyo bannaan wajig siman","level":2},{"id":"wajig-u-jeeda-jihada-qaldan","text":"Wajig u jeeda jihada qaldan","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo-qalad","text":"Ka noqo qalad","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-adigoo-isticmaalaya-tirtiraha\"\u003ETirtir adigoo isticmaalaya tirtiraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u isticmaasho \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix gees, koox ama qayb, ama hage. Waa la tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad dhowr tirtirto, riix oo jiid oo ka gudub. Wax kasta oo aad ka gudubto waa iftiimaa, waxaana dhammaan la tirtiraa markaad sii daayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtiraha ma dooro wajiyada: wajigu wuu baxaa marka aad tirtirto geesaha uu u baahan yahay. Wajiyadu waa waxa tirtiraha ku baadho si uu geesaha u helo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wajiyada-ka-dhaca\"\u003EWaxa wajiyada ka dhaca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGees u dhexeeya laba wajood oo diyaarad mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale, xariiq aad dhulka ku sawirtay) ayaa baabba&#039;a, labada wajiga-na \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaxay isku dhafaan\u003C/strong\u003E hal wajig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGees wajigu u baahan yahay inuu xidhan yahay\u003C/strong\u003E (geesta sanduuqa) ayaa wajigaas la socodsiinaysa. Geesta sare ee sanduuq mid tirtir oo sare iyo hal dhinac ayay baxaan, sanduuqana wuxuu noqdaa mid furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaadyo furan\u003C/strong\u003E (barar aan gees mar dambe isticmaalin) ayaa la nadiifiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtirida nuqulka u dambeeya ee qayb ayaa sidoo kale qaybta ka saarta gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-furaha-delete\"\u003ETirtir furaha Delete\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad ka saarayso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani wajiyada ayaa sidoo kale ka saara. Wajig loo tirtiray siyaabahan geesihiisa ayuu ka sii hadhaa, sidaas darteed waxaad tirtiri kartaa sare ee sanduuq oo xuduuddeeda ilaali, kadibna halkaas wax kale sawir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nadiifi-xariiqyo-bannaan-wajig-siman\"\u003ENadiifi xariiqyo bannaan wajig siman\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii darbi ama sagxad ay muujiyaan xariiqyo aanad doonayn (ka hadhay sawirka), ku tirtir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E. Xariiqyada wajiga ku jira ayaa isku dhafa oo baabba&#039;aa; wajigu wuu sii joogaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wajig-u-jeeda-jihada-qaldan\"\u003EWajig u jeeda jihada qaldan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWajig laga arko gadaashiisa waa buluug-cirro. Haddii wajig muujiyo buluug-cirro dibadda moodelkaaga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro wajiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi wajiga\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJihada wajigu waxba ugu muhiimsan marka aad soo saarayso: rendar-keenayaasha, mishiinka ciyaarta iyo daabacayaasha 3D ayaa qarin karta ama si qaldan u akhrin karta wajiyada dhinaca gudihiisa u jeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-qalad\"\u003EKa noqo qalad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa hal tallaabo mar, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib u sameeyaa. Jiidista tirtiraha waa hal tallaabo, inta waxyaabood oo ay qaadatay. Bar xaaladda wuxuu magacaabaa waxa laga noqday: &quot;Tirtirida waa laga noqday.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tirtir adigoo isticmaalaya tirtiraha Riix E si aad u isticmaasho Tirtiraha. Riix gees, koox ama qayb, ama hage. Waa la tirtiraa. Si aad dhowr tirtirto, riix oo jiid oo ka gudub. Wax kasta oo aad ka gudubto waa iftiimaa, waxaana dhammaan la tirtiraa markaad sii daayso. Tirtiraha ma dooro wajiyada: wajigu wuu baxaa marka aad tirtirto geesaha uu u baahan yahay. Wajiyadu waa waxa tirtiraha ku baadho si uu geesaha u helo. Waxa wajiyada ka dhaca Gees u dhexeeya laba wajood oo diyaarad mid ah (tusaale, xariiq aad dhulka ku sawirtay) ayaa baabba'a, labada wajiga-na waxay isku dhafaan hal wajig. Gees wajigu u baahan yahay inuu xidhan yahay (geesta sanduuqa) ayaa wajigaas la socodsiinaysa. Geesta sare ee sanduuq mid tirtir oo sare iyo hal dhinac ayay baxaan, sanduuqana wuxuu noqdaa mid furan. Dhamaadyo furan (barar aan gees mar dambe isticmaalin) ayaa la nadiifiyaa. Tirtirida nuqulka u dambeeya ee qayb ayaa sidoo kale qaybta ka saarta gudaha Qaybaha. Tirtir furaha Delete Dooro waxa aad ka saarayso Dooro. Riix Delete ama Backspace. Tani wajiyada ayaa sidoo kale ka saara. Wajig loo tirtiray siyaabahan geesihiisa ayuu ka sii hadhaa, sidaas darteed waxaad tirtiri kartaa sare ee sanduuq oo xuduuddeeda ilaali, kadibna halkaas wax kale sawir. Nadiifi xariiqyo bannaan wajig siman Haddii darbi ama sagxad ay muujiyaan xariiqyo aanad doonayn (ka hadhay sawirka), ku tirtir Tirtiraha. Xariiqyada wajiga ku jira ayaa isku dhafa oo baabba'aa; wajigu wuu sii joogaa. Wajig u jeeda jihada qaldan Wajig laga arko gadaashiisa waa buluug-cirro. Haddii wajig muujiyo buluug-cirro dibadda moodelkaaga: Dooro wajiga. Riix Rogi wajiga gudaha Macluumaadka. Jihada wajigu waxba ugu muhiimsan marka aad soo saarayso: rendar-keenayaasha, mishiinka ciyaarta iyo daabacayaasha 3D ayaa qarin karta ama si qaldan u akhrin karta wajiyada dhinaca gudihiisa u jeeda. Ka noqo qalad Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa hal tallaabo mar, Ctrl+Y (ama Ctrl+Shift+Z) wuu dib u sameeyaa. Jiidista tirtiraha waa hal tallaabo, inta waxyaabood oo ay qaadatay. Bar xaaladda wuxuu magacaabaa waxa laga noqday: \"Tirtirida waa laga noqday.\"","lang":"so"},{"slug":"site-plan","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Moodel ku samee qorshe goob oo DWG ama DXF ah","summary":"Soo geli qorshe goob CAD ama qorshe dabaq sida xariiqyo dhulka saaran, jawaab su'aasha cutubyada, oo u beddel dhinacyo iyo mass-yo.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["qorshe goob","dwg","dxf","cad","soo dhoofi","sketch","sawir gacmeed","sawirka warqadda","sawir","warqad","midabka qalinka","dynamic blocks","visibility states","qoraal","hatch","spline","ellipse","3d face","trace","qorshe dabaq","lot","property line","cutubyo","underlay","context"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-geli-sawirka","text":"Soo geli sawirka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-soo-galaya","text":"Waxa soo galaya","level":2},{"id":"ku-rid-qorshaha-dusha","text":"Ku rid qorshaha dusha","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyin","text":"Dhibaatooyin","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacan-qoran-oo-ka-yimid-sawir","text":"Sawir gacan-qoran oo ka yimid sawir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu soo geli karaa xariiqyada sawir CAD 2D ah, qorshe goob ama qorshe dabaq, oo dhulka ku dhigi karaa si aad uga moodelayso dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli-sawirka\"\u003ESoo geli sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku rid faylka muuqaalka 3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.dwg\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDWG weyn wakhti ayuu qaadanayaa: saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Akhrinaya plan.dwg…&quot; ilaa uu soo gasho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii sawirku aanu sheegin cutubyadiisa, wada-hadal oo cinwaankiisu yahay &quot;Cutubyada sawirka&quot; ayaa waydiinaya: &quot;Midkee ayaa unug sawir ah?&quot; Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFiit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMillimitir\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMitir\u003C/span\u003E. Qorshayaasha goobaha Mareykanka badanaa waa fiit, qorshayaasha dhismaha inji, qorshayaasha metric millimitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirku wuxuu imanayaa kooxda geesaha dhulka, la doortay, muuqaalkuna wuxuu u weynaadaa. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa geesaha imanay tirada, tusaale ahaan &quot;Waa la soo dhoofiyay site.dwg: 1697 geesood dhulka, kooxda gudaheeda. Kala bax si aad si toos ah ugu sawirto.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-soo-galaya\"\u003EWaxa soo galaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada, polylines (oo ay ku jiraan qaansooyinkooda), goobooyinka iyo qaansooyinka, iyo blocks oo waxyaabahooda oo dhan, \u003Cstrong\u003Emodel space\u003C/strong\u003E oo keliya. Egriyada waxay noqdaan qaybo toos ah oo gaagaaban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqyada, polylines, qaansooyinka, goobooyinka, ellipses iyo splines waxay dhulka ku degaan siman, sida geesood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHatches\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan dhinacyo dhulka ku yaal, jasiiradahooda oo ah godad, si aad si toos ah u riixi/jiidi karto aagga hatch-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3D faces\u003C/strong\u003E iyo buuxinta jirdilka waxay noqdaan dhinacyo; 3D faces waxay ilaalinayaan dhererkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraalka\u003C/strong\u003E (qoraal hal-xariiq ah, qoraal multiline iyo qiyamka attribute-yada) waxa lagu sawiraa geesood qoraal fudud oo hal-xariiq ah, dhererka, xagasha iyo isu-dhigidda qoraalka. Font-ka ma aha sawirkii, sidaas darteed ereyadu way dheer ama gaaban yihiin. Xarfaha aan qaabkooda lahayn waxay noqdaan sanduuqyo yaryar oo la tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDimensions\u003C/strong\u003E waxay u muuqdaan sida sawirku u muujinayo (xariiqyadooda, madaxyada fallaadhaha iyo qoraalkooda, sida geesood iyo dhinacyo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDynamic blocks\u003C/strong\u003E waxay u yimaadaan sida sawirku u muujinayo: block kasta oo la dhigay gudaha xaaladda muuqashada ee la keydiyay, iyo xariiqyada xaalada keliya. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu liistaa iyaga iyo xaaladaha la muujiyay iyo kuwa kale ee mid kastaa leeyahay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Receptacle shown as Duplex ×38, GFI ×7 (states: Duplex, GFI)&quot;. ModelCraft ma beddelo xaaladaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJirdilalka 3D, gobolada iyo jidhadhka\u003C/strong\u003E (xogta ACIS ee sawirka) waxay u yimaadaan kooxyo u gaar ah: jirdil xidhan sida jirdil, gobol ama jidh furan sida dhinacyo. Dhinacyada siman waa la soo geliyaa oo dhan; dhinacyada qaloocan (silinder, koone, sphere, torus, dusha spline fudud) sida saddex-geesood yar oo geesaha nacaan ah ku xidhan, sidaas darteed geesaha jirdilka keliya ayaa muuqda. Dhinac ku yaal nooc kale oo dusha ah waa la reebay oo la liistaa: &quot;Weli lama sawirin (3D solids): …&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELama soo geli: dhibcaha, miisaska, multileaders, sawirrada iyo nooc kale oo shay ah. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu liistaa iyaga nooc ahaan, sida &quot;Lama soo geli: 12 POINT.&quot; Wax kasta oo ku yaal layout-ka (paper space) sidaas oo kale ayaa la reebaa, iyadoo aan la liisan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELayers-ka lama ilaaliyo: xariiqyada oo dhan waxay u yimaadaan siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii sawirku ka fog yahay asalkiisa (tusaale ahaan koordinates state plane), wuu soo galaa, laakiin wuu ku dhici karaa meel fog asalka ModelCraft. Sawirrada ka fog 10,000 km asalkooda waa la diidaa: mari sawirka dhinaca 0,0 barnaamijka CAD ka hor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-rid-qorshaha-dusha\"\u003EKu rid qorshaha dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyada la soo dhoofiyay ma isku xidhaan dhinacyo si fiican naftooda. Laba habood oo shaqo ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQorshaha u hay sida underlay (waa lagu talinayaa)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshaha u hay kooxdiisa gaarka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhismahaaga ku sawir kore ee qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E, adoo ku xidhaya geesaha qorshaha (&quot;Endpoint&quot;) iyo geesaha (&quot;On edge&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix/jiid dhinacyadaada sare. Qorshuhu wuxuu ka hadhaa hoose aan la taabanin, waxaadna tirtiri kartaa kooxda oo dhan hal riix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu xidhidhku wuu ka shaqeeyaa kooxyada dhexdooda: waxaad ku xidhi kartaa geesaha qorshaha adigoo aan furin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu sawir xariiqyada qorshaha laftiisa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda qorshaha oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E. Xariiqyadiisu waxay noqdaan geesood kala go&#039;an.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha qaab xidhan oo dhinac u ah, xariiq ku sawir mid ka mid ah geesaheeda adoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E, geeska ilaa geeska. Marka qaabku xidhan yahay oo siman yahay, dhinacu badanaa wuu buuxmaa. Haddii aanu buuxmin, raadi meel ku wada jira ama xadhig ku dhex jira qaabka oo ku sawir dusheeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix/jiid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan waxay ugu fiican tahay qorshe nadiif ah. Sahan mashquul ah, sawir-sare waa ka dhakhso badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyin\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Tani waa binary DXF. Ku kaydi ASCII DXF oo mar kale isku day.&quot; Mar kale ku kaydi DXF-ka barnaamijka CAD sida ASCII (qoraal).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;…ma lahan xariiqyo, qaansoo ama goobo model space-ka ku jira oo la soo geliyo.&quot; Sawirku waxaa laga yaabaa inuu dhan yahay layouts, ama qoraal iyo hatches oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Sawirkan lama akhrin karo (…). Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu burbursan yahay, ama lagu kaydiyay nooca DWG ee aan akhriyaha la socon…&quot; Xidhkaha waxa uu sababta sheegayaa, tusaale ahaan &quot;DWG version AC1009 is not supported&quot;. Ku kaydi DXF, ama DWG AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018, barnaamijka CAD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorshuhu cabbir khaldan ayuu leeyahay: unugga khaldan ayaad doorteen. Dib u qaad (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo mar kale soo geli, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003Emiisaan\u003C/a\u003E kooxda isagoo isticmaalaya factor-ka saxda ah (12 u dhexeeya feet iyo inch, 25.4 u dhexeeya inch iyo millimitir).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad xariiqyada heerka ugu beddesho dhulka aad sawiri karto, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/terrain\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/terrain\"\u003EDhulka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacan-qoran-oo-ka-yimid-sawir\"\u003ESawir gacan-qoran oo ka yimid sawir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFile › Soo geli sawir gacan-qoran…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa sawir gacan-qoran oo ku yaal warqad (JPEG, PNG ama TIFF, si toos ah telefoon ka timaad waa fiican) wuxuuna sameeyaa noocii geesaha dhulka ee isku mid ahaa. Sheeg warqadda ay tahay (ama u oggolow inuu helo xaashida, oo loo qaato A4) iyo miisaanka gacan-qorka, tusaale ahaan 1 : 100. Geesta warqadda waa la helaa, sawirkana waa la toosiyaa, indha-indhaha waa la raacaa xariiqyo iyo qaansooyin, midkiiba midabka qalinka (madow, casaan, buluug, cagaar) wuxuu noqdaa kooxda u gaarka ah oo calaamad leh (\u003Cstrong\u003ESketch black\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESketch red\u003C/strong\u003E, …), dhammaantoodna waxay ku jiraan hal kooxda loo magacaabay sawirka. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah, wax kasta waxay ku dhacaan kombiyuutarkan: wax meel kale looma diro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii geesta warqadda aan la heli karin, sawirka oo dhan ayaa loo qaadaa xaashi, saddex-xarriiqeedka waxaa sheegta: cabbir wax aad yaqaan oo kooxda miisaan haddii ay khaldan tahay. Xariiqyada u raac dhinacyo sida kor.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft wuxuu soo geli karaa xariiqyada sawir CAD 2D ah, qorshe goob ama qorshe dabaq, oo dhulka ku dhigi karaa si aad uga moodelayso dusha. Soo geli sawirka Riix Soo dhoofi kooxda Fayl (ama ku rid faylka muuqaalka 3D). Dooro fayl .dwg ama .dxf. DWG weyn wakhti ayuu qaadanayaa: saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Akhrinaya plan.dwg…\" ilaa uu soo gasho. Haddii sawirku aanu sheegin cutubyadiisa, wada-hadal oo cinwaankiisu yahay \"Cutubyada sawirka\" ayaa waydiinaya: \"Midkee ayaa unug sawir ah?\" Dooro Inji, Fiit, Millimitir ama Mitir. Qorshayaasha goobaha Mareykanka badanaa waa fiit, qorshayaasha dhismaha inji, qorshayaasha metric millimitir. Sawirku wuxuu imanayaa kooxda geesaha dhulka, la doortay, muuqaalkuna wuxuu u weynaadaa. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa geesaha imanay tirada, tusaale ahaan \"Waa la soo dhoofiyay site.dwg: 1697 geesood dhulka, kooxda gudaheeda. Kala bax si aad si toos ah ugu sawirto.\" Waxa soo galaya Xariiqyada, polylines (oo ay ku jiraan qaansooyinkooda), goobooyinka iyo qaansooyinka, iyo blocks oo waxyaabahooda oo dhan, model space oo keliya. Egriyada waxay noqdaan qaybo toos ah oo gaagaaban. Xariiqyada, polylines, qaansooyinka, goobooyinka, ellipses iyo splines waxay dhulka ku degaan siman, sida geesood. Hatches waxay noqdaan dhinacyo dhulka ku yaal, jasiiradahooda oo ah godad, si aad si toos ah u riixi/jiidi karto aagga hatch-ka. 3D faces iyo buuxinta jirdilka waxay noqdaan dhinacyo; 3D faces waxay ilaalinayaan dhererkooda. Qoraalka (qoraal hal-xariiq ah, qoraal multiline iyo qiyamka attribute-yada) waxa lagu sawiraa geesood qoraal fudud oo hal-xariiq ah, dhererka, xagasha iyo isu-dhigidda qoraalka. Font-ka ma aha sawirkii, sidaas darteed ereyadu way dheer ama gaaban yihiin. Xarfaha aan qaabkooda lahayn waxay noqdaan sanduuqyo yaryar oo la tiriyaa. Dimensions waxay u muuqdaan sida sawirku u muujinayo (xariiqyadooda, madaxyada fallaadhaha iyo qoraalkooda, sida geesood iyo dhinacyo). Dynamic blocks waxay u yimaadaan sida sawirku u muujinayo: block kasta oo la dhigay gudaha xaaladda muuqashada ee la keydiyay, iyo xariiqyada xaalada keliya. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu liistaa iyaga iyo xaaladaha la muujiyay iyo kuwa kale ee mid kastaa leeyahay, tusaale ahaan \"Receptacle shown as Duplex ×38, GFI ×7 (states: Duplex, GFI)\". ModelCraft ma beddelo xaaladaha. Jirdilalka 3D, gobolada iyo jidhadhka (xogta ACIS ee sawirka) waxay u yimaadaan kooxyo u gaar ah: jirdil xidhan sida jirdil, gobol ama jidh furan sida dhinacyo. Dhinacyada siman waa la soo geliyaa oo dhan; dhinacyada qaloocan (silinder, koone, sphere, torus, dusha spline fudud) sida saddex-geesood yar oo geesaha nacaan ah ku xidhan, sidaas darteed geesaha jirdilka keliya ayaa muuqda. Dhinac ku yaal nooc kale oo dusha ah waa la reebay oo la liistaa: \"Weli lama sawirin (3D solids): …\". Lama soo geli: dhibcaha, miisaska, multileaders, sawirrada iyo nooc kale oo shay ah. Saldhigga xaaladda wuxuu liistaa iyaga nooc ahaan, sida \"Lama soo geli: 12 POINT.\" Wax kasta oo ku yaal layout-ka (paper space) sidaas oo kale ayaa la reebaa, iyadoo aan la liisan. Layers-ka lama ilaaliyo: xariiqyada oo dhan waxay u yimaadaan siman. Haddii sawirku ka fog yahay asalkiisa (tusaale ahaan koordinates state plane), wuu soo galaa, laakiin wuu ku dhici karaa meel fog asalka ModelCraft. Sawirrada ka fog 10,000 km asalkooda waa la diidaa: mari sawirka dhinaca 0,0 barnaamijka CAD ka hor. Ku rid qorshaha dusha Xariiqyada la soo dhoofiyay ma isku xidhaan dhinacyo si fiican naftooda. Laba habood oo shaqo ah: Qorshaha u hay sida underlay (waa lagu talinayaa) Qorshaha u hay kooxdiisa gaarka ah. Dhismahaaga ku sawir kore ee qorshaha adigoo isticmaalaya Afar-geesle iyo Xarriiq, adoo ku xidhaya geesaha qorshaha (\"Endpoint\") iyo geesaha (\"On edge\"). Riix/jiid dhinacyadaada sare. Qorshuhu wuxuu ka hadhaa hoose aan la taabanin, waxaadna tirtiri kartaa kooxda oo dhan hal riix. Ku xidhidhku wuu ka shaqeeyaa kooxyada dhexdooda: waxaad ku xidhi kartaa geesaha qorshaha adigoo aan furin. Ku sawir xariiqyada qorshaha laftiisa Dooro kooxda qorshaha oo guji Kala bax. Xariiqyadiisu waxay noqdaan geesood kala go'an. Meesha qaab xidhan oo dhinac u ah, xariiq ku sawir mid ka mid ah geesaheeda adoo isticmaalaya Xarriiq, geeska ilaa geeska. Marka qaabku xidhan yahay oo siman yahay, dhinacu badanaa wuu buuxmaa. Haddii aanu buuxmin, raadi meel ku wada jira ama xadhig ku dhex jira qaabka oo ku sawir dusheeda. Riix/jiid. Tan waxay ugu fiican tahay qorshe nadiif ah. Sahan mashquul ah, sawir-sare waa ka dhakhso badan. Dhibaatooyin \"Tani waa binary DXF. Ku kaydi ASCII DXF oo mar kale isku day.\" Mar kale ku kaydi DXF-ka barnaamijka CAD sida ASCII (qoraal). \"…ma lahan xariiqyo, qaansoo ama goobo model space-ka ku jira oo la soo geliyo.\" Sawirku waxaa laga yaabaa inuu dhan yahay layouts, ama qoraal iyo hatches oo keliya. \"Sawirkan lama akhrin karo (…). Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu burbursan yahay, ama lagu kaydiyay nooca DWG ee aan akhriyaha la socon…\" Xidhkaha waxa uu sababta sheegayaa, tusaale ahaan \"DWG version AC1009 is not supported\". Ku kaydi DXF, ama DWG AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018, barnaamijka CAD. Qorshuhu cabbir khaldan ayuu leeyahay: unugga khaldan ayaad doorteen. Dib u qaad (Ctrl+Z) oo mar kale soo geli, ama miisaan kooxda isagoo isticmaalaya factor-ka saxda ah (12 u dhexeeya feet iyo inch, 25.4 u dhexeeya inch iyo millimitir). Si aad xariiqyada heerka ugu beddesho dhulka aad sawiri karto, eeg Dhulka. Sawir gacan-qoran oo ka yimid sawir File › Soo geli sawir gacan-qoran… wuxuu qaadaa sawir gacan-qoran oo ku yaal warqad (JPEG, PNG ama TIFF, si toos ah telefoon ka timaad waa fiican) wuxuuna sameeyaa noocii geesaha dhulka ee isku mid ahaa. Sheeg warqadda ay tahay (ama u oggolow inuu helo xaashida, oo loo qaato A4) iyo miisaanka gacan-qorka, tusaale ahaan 1 : 100. Geesta warqadda waa la helaa, sawirkana waa la toosiyaa, indha-indhaha waa la raacaa xariiqyo iyo qaansooyin, midkiiba midabka qalinka (madow, casaan, buluug, cagaar) wuxuu noqdaa kooxda u gaarka ah oo calaamad leh (Sketch black, Sketch red, …), dhammaantoodna waxay ku jiraan hal kooxda loo magacaabay sawirka. Waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah, wax kasta waxay ku dhacaan kombiyuutarkan: wax meel kale looma diro. Haddii geesta warqadda aan la heli karin, sawirka oo dhan ayaa loo qaadaa xaashi, saddex-xarriiqeedka waxaa sheegta: cabbir wax aad yaqaan oo kooxda miisaan haddii ay khaldan tahay. Xariiqyada u raac dhinacyo sida kor.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"site-from-civilcraft","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qaado goob CivilCraft ka","summary":"Fur faylka cinwaanka-ilaa-goobta ah ee CivilCraft sameeyo oo ku dar dhismayaasha iyo parcel-ka ku wareegsan sida mass-yo iyo xariiq goob, kuwa aad calaamadiso oo keliya.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["goob","civilcraft","cinwaan","parcel","dhismayaasha deriska ah","masses","context","ccsite","xog furan","openstreetmap"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-geli-faylka","text":"Soo geli faylka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft wuxuu raadin karaa cinwaan oo kaydin wuxa ay ilaha xogta furan ogyihiin ku wareegsan: dhismayaasha deriska ah, parcel-ka, iyo qaabka daadka, qorshaynta iyo ciidda. ModelCraft wuxuu faylkaas u qaataa soo jeedin. Waxba lagu ma darin ilaa aad sheegto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli-faylka\"\u003ESoo geli faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu CivilCraft, u dir goobta ModelCraft, ama kaydi faylka (wuxuu ku dhamaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E.ccsite.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu ModelCraft, fur ama dhig faylka. Liis ayaa furmaysa oo leh sanduuq calaamad oo loo yaal dhismaha kasta iyo parcel-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor dhererka dhismayaasha ilaha aan dhererka u siin. Sadar kasta oo ku xiga ayaa sheegaysa meesha dhererkiisu ka yimid: tirada dabaqyadiisa oo mid kasta 3 m, ama dhererka aad qortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar kuwa calaamadeeyay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismayaasha la calaamadeeyay waxay noqdaan mass-yo la soo saaray hal qayb, parcel-kana wuxuu noqdaa xariiq goobta ku wareegsan. Waxaas oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah. Dhibcda cinwaanku waxay ku taalla asalka, mitirro bari iyo waqooyi ka fog.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka daadka, qorshaynta iyo ciidda waa la liistaa macluumaad oo keliya; lama sawirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXogta waxay ka timid ilahyada furan waxayna soo bandhigtaa aqoonsigooda hoosta liiska. Dhererada aan la siin waa male-awaal, sidaas darteed hubi ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CivilCraft wuxuu raadin karaa cinwaan oo kaydin wuxa ay ilaha xogta furan ogyihiin ku wareegsan: dhismayaasha deriska ah, parcel-ka, iyo qaabka daadka, qorshaynta iyo ciidda. ModelCraft wuxuu faylkaas u qaataa soo jeedin. Waxba lagu ma darin ilaa aad sheegto. Soo geli faylka Ku CivilCraft, u dir goobta ModelCraft, ama kaydi faylka (wuxuu ku dhamaadaa .ccsite.json). Ku ModelCraft, fur ama dhig faylka. Liis ayaa furmaysa oo leh sanduuq calaamad oo loo yaal dhismaha kasta iyo parcel-ka. Ku qor dhererka dhismayaasha ilaha aan dhererka u siin. Sadar kasta oo ku xiga ayaa sheegaysa meesha dhererkiisu ka yimid: tirada dabaqyadiisa oo mid kasta 3 m, ama dhererka aad qortay. Riix Ku dar kuwa calaamadeeyay. Dhismayaasha la calaamadeeyay waxay noqdaan mass-yo la soo saaray hal qayb, parcel-kana wuxuu noqdaa xariiq goobta ku wareegsan. Waxaas oo dhan waa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-qaad ah. Dhibcda cinwaanku waxay ku taalla asalka, mitirro bari iyo waqooyi ka fog. Qaabka daadka, qorshaynta iyo ciidda waa la liistaa macluumaad oo keliya; lama sawirin. Xogta waxay ka timid ilahyada furan waxayna soo bandhigtaa aqoonsigooda hoosta liiska. Dhererada aan la siin waa male-awaal, sidaas darteed hubi ka hor intaadan isku hallayn.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"import-sketchup-files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Soo dhoofi moodel SKP ah","summary":"Soo dhoofi fayl .skp oo leh kooxahooda, qaybahooda, midabkooda, tekstuurradooda, calaamadahooda iyo geesaha jilicsan, arag waxa soo galay iyo waxa soo galin, kadibna sii shaqee.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["skp","soo dhoofi","fur skp","qaybaha","kooxaha","calaamado","layers","agabka","midabo","tekstuur","la qariyey","geesaha jilicsan","3D Warehouse","u guur","beddelid"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-geli-faylka","text":"Soo geli faylka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-soo-galaya","text":"Waxa soo galaya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-soo-gelin","text":"Waxa soo gelin","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyin","text":"Dhibaatooyin","level":2},{"id":"ku-celi-moodelka","text":"Ku celi moodelka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylalka SketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E) isagoo isticmaalaya akhristihiisa, bogga gudihiisa. Waxba lama soo raro, waxayna shaqeysaa marwalba oo ModelCraft khad la&#039;aan shaqeyso. Faylalka SketchUp 3 ilaa 2026 waa la tijaabiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli-faylka\"\u003ESoo geli faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku tuur faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E aragtida 3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Akhrinta house.skp…&quot; intuu akhrinayo, kadibna waxa soo galay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Soo dhoofiyay house.skp (SketchUp 25.0.575): 1240 wajiyo, 6 qaybood, hal kooxda gudihiisa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka oo dhan wuxuu u yimaadaa hal koox oo magac u ah faylka, la doortay, aragtidana waa u soo dhowaataa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hal mar ayaa dhammaantood ka saaraa, calaamadahana oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda soo dhoofinta ka kala bax (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E) marka aad rabto in waxa ku jira uu ku jiro moodelkaaga si furan, halkii uu ku jiri lahaa hal kooxda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-soo-galaya\"\u003EWaxa soo galaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWajiyo\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh godadkooda, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesaha\u003C/strong\u003E aan qayb ka ahayn wajiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay yimaadaan kooxo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay yimaadaan qaybo: nuqul kasta oo qayb ah waa dhigitaan hal qeex ah, sidaas darteed wax ka beddelka nuqul mid wuu beddelaa dhammaantood, sida SketchUp-ka. Magacyadooduna way la socdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidabada.\u003C/strong\u003E Agabka wajiga ayaa siiya midabkiisa. Agab lagu rinjiyeeyay kooxda ama qaybta wuxuu noqdaa rinjiga dhigitaankaas, wajiyada ku jira oo aan midab lahayn ayaa qaadaa, sida SketchUp-ka. Qayb casaan ah meel ka mid ah iyo buluug meel kale weli waa hal qayb.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETekstuurrada.\u003C/strong\u003E Wajiga lagu rinjiyeeyay agab tekstuur leh wuxuu yimaadaa tekstuurkiisa, oo wajiga lagu dhejiyay sida faylka, qaabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShaded\u003C/span\u003E ayaa muujinaya. Sawirka waa la kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft markaad kaydiso, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawirka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E ayaa sidoo kale muujinaya. Agab tekstuur leh oo lagu rinjiyeeyay kooxda oo dhan ama qaybta oo dhan waxay siisaa nuqulkaas midabka agabka oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Kooxda ama qaybta ku taal calaamada SketchUp waxay heshaa calaamada ModelCraft ee isla magaca, oo lagu soo bandhigay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETags\u003C/span\u003E, muuqda ama qarsoon sida ay ahayd SketchUp-ka. Haddii moodelkaaga horey u lahaa calaamad magacaas, calaamadaas ayaa la isticmaalaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxyaabaha qarsoon waxay yimaadaan qarsoon:\u003C/strong\u003E wajiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo qaybaha, iyo wajiyada iyo geesaha calaamad qarsoon ku jira. Waxaad aragtaa waxa SketchUp muujinayay, wax lumaa ma jiro: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E ayaa muujinaya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003EQari, kala saar iyo muujin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha jilicsan iyo kuwa siman\u003C/strong\u003E way jilicsan yihiin, sidaas darteed dusheyaasha qalloocan way siman yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirradu\u003C/strong\u003E way saxan yihiin halbeeg kasta: faylasha SketchUp dhexdooda inch-yada ayay ku jiraan, ModelCraft ayaa u beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-soo-gelin\"\u003EWaxa soo gelin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa waxa laga reebay, iyo tirada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETekstuurro qaarkood\u003C/strong\u003E waxay haystaan midabka agabkooda oo keliya: tekstuur aan faylka ku jirin, sawir qaab aan browserku akhrin karin (sida faylka Photoshop), ama tekstuur aan cabbir lahayn. Wajiyada tekstuur la mariyey waxay yimaadaan tekstuurka meel qiyaas ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadaha wajiyada iyo geesaha furan.\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft wuxuu calaamadeeyaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha kaliya, sidaas darteed wajiga ama geeska calaamad gaar ah leh ayaa yimaada aan calaamad lahayn, joogtana way tirisaa. Samee wajiyadaas kooxo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo calaamadee kooxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirrada\u003C/strong\u003E lagu dhigay moodelka, qoraalka, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha qaybinta, muuqaalada iyo qaababka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyin\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;This is not a SketchUp file.&quot; ama &quot;This SketchUp file is damaged&quot;: faylku waa la jaray ama waa wax kale oo magac \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E leh. Mar kale ku kaydi SketchUp-ka, ama weydii nuqul cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl nooca SketchUp ka cusub ModelCraft ayaa la diidaa, iyada oo lagu sheegayo nooca la helay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodel oo sawirro, qoraal ama cabbirro oo keliya ah ayaa sheegta inaysan wax muujin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-celi-moodelka\"\u003EKu celi moodelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ma kaydin karo faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E. Dhoofi Collada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E) oo soo dhoofi SketchUp: kooxaha, qaybaha iyo midabyadu way gudbaan; tekstuurrada waxay u gudbaan midabka agabkooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003ESoo saar moodelkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylalka SketchUp (.skp) isagoo isticmaalaya akhristihiisa, bogga gudihiisa. Waxba lama soo raro, waxayna shaqeysaa marwalba oo ModelCraft khad la'aan shaqeyso. Faylalka SketchUp 3 ilaa 2026 waa la tijaabiyay. Soo geli faylka Guji Import kooxda File (ama ku tuur faylka .skp aragtida 3D). Dooro faylka. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Akhrinta house.skp…\" intuu akhrinayo, kadibna waxa soo galay, tusaale ahaan \"Soo dhoofiyay house.skp (SketchUp 25.0.575): 1240 wajiyo, 6 qaybood, hal kooxda gudihiisa.\" Moodelka oo dhan wuxuu u yimaadaa hal koox oo magac u ah faylka, la doortay, aragtidana waa u soo dhowaataa. Ctrl+Z hal mar ayaa dhammaantood ka saaraa, calaamadahana oo dhan. Kooxda soo dhoofinta ka kala bax (Entity info › Explode) marka aad rabto in waxa ku jira uu ku jiro moodelkaaga si furan, halkii uu ku jiri lahaa hal kooxda. Waxa soo galaya Wajiyo oo leh godadkooda, iyo geesaha aan qayb ka ahayn wajiga. Kooxaha waxay yimaadaan kooxo, qaybaha waxay yimaadaan qaybo: nuqul kasta oo qayb ah waa dhigitaan hal qeex ah, sidaas darteed wax ka beddelka nuqul mid wuu beddelaa dhammaantood, sida SketchUp-ka. Magacyadooduna way la socdaan. Midabada. Agabka wajiga ayaa siiya midabkiisa. Agab lagu rinjiyeeyay kooxda ama qaybta wuxuu noqdaa rinjiga dhigitaankaas, wajiyada ku jira oo aan midab lahayn ayaa qaadaa, sida SketchUp-ka. Qayb casaan ah meel ka mid ah iyo buluug meel kale weli waa hal qayb. Tekstuurrada. Wajiga lagu rinjiyeeyay agab tekstuur leh wuxuu yimaadaa tekstuurkiisa, oo wajiga lagu dhejiyay sida faylka, qaabka Shaded ayaa muujinaya. Sawirka waa la kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft markaad kaydiso, sawirka rendarka ayaa sidoo kale muujinaya. Agab tekstuur leh oo lagu rinjiyeeyay kooxda oo dhan ama qaybta oo dhan waxay siisaa nuqulkaas midabka agabka oo keliya. Calaamadaha. Kooxda ama qaybta ku taal calaamada SketchUp waxay heshaa calaamada ModelCraft ee isla magaca, oo lagu soo bandhigay Tags, muuqda ama qarsoon sida ay ahayd SketchUp-ka. Haddii moodelkaaga horey u lahaa calaamad magacaas, calaamadaas ayaa la isticmaalaa. Waxyaabaha qarsoon waxay yimaadaan qarsoon: wajiyada, geesaha, kooxaha iyo qaybaha, iyo wajiyada iyo geesaha calaamad qarsoon ku jira. Waxaad aragtaa waxa SketchUp muujinayay, wax lumaa ma jiro: Edit › More › Unhide all ayaa muujinaya. Eeg Qari, kala saar iyo muujin. Geesaha jilicsan iyo kuwa siman way jilicsan yihiin, sidaas darteed dusheyaasha qalloocan way siman yihiin. Cabbirradu way saxan yihiin halbeeg kasta: faylasha SketchUp dhexdooda inch-yada ayay ku jiraan, ModelCraft ayaa u beddelaa. Waxa soo gelin Joogta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa waxa laga reebay, iyo tirada. Tekstuurro qaarkood waxay haystaan midabka agabkooda oo keliya: tekstuur aan faylka ku jirin, sawir qaab aan browserku akhrin karin (sida faylka Photoshop), ama tekstuur aan cabbir lahayn. Wajiyada tekstuur la mariyey waxay yimaadaan tekstuurka meel qiyaas ah. Calaamadaha wajiyada iyo geesaha furan. ModelCraft wuxuu calaamadeeyaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha kaliya, sidaas darteed wajiga ama geeska calaamad gaar ah leh ayaa yimaada aan calaamad lahayn, joogtana way tirisaa. Samee wajiyadaas kooxo (Shift+G) oo calaamadee kooxda. Sawirrada lagu dhigay moodelka, qoraalka, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha qaybinta, muuqaalada iyo qaababka. Dhibaatooyin \"This is not a SketchUp file.\" ama \"This SketchUp file is damaged\": faylku waa la jaray ama waa wax kale oo magac .skp leh. Mar kale ku kaydi SketchUp-ka, ama weydii nuqul cusub. Fayl nooca SketchUp ka cusub ModelCraft ayaa la diidaa, iyada oo lagu sheegayo nooca la helay. Moodel oo sawirro, qoraal ama cabbirro oo keliya ah ayaa sheegta inaysan wax muujin karin. Ku celi moodelka ModelCraft ma kaydin karo faylalka .skp. Dhoofi Collada (Export › .dae) oo soo dhoofi SketchUp: kooxaha, qaybaha iyo midabyadu way gudbaan; tekstuurrada waxay u gudbaan midabka agabkooda. Eeg Soo saar moodelkaaga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-3d","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Diyaari moodeelka daabacaadda 3D","summary":"Hubi in moodeelku xidhan yahay oo wejiyadu u jeedaan jihada saxda ah, eeg cabbirkiisa, saldhigga iyo dhiidhiyada, hagaaji wixii khaldan, oo u soo deji sida STL ama 3MF slicer-kaaga.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["daabacaadda 3d","printer","daabac","slicer","stl","3mf","watertight","closed","manifold","solid","holes","inside out","overhang","supports","base","bed","millimeters","export","fix","repair","hollow","bed size","beginner","wall thickness","print tools"],"headings":[{"id":"hubi-oo-soo-deji","text":"Hubi oo soo deji","level":2},{"id":"waxa-hubintu-eegto","text":"Waxa hubintu eegto","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-dhibaatooyinka","text":"Hagaaji dhibaatooyinka","level":2},{"id":"jidh-godan","text":"Jidh godan","level":2},{"id":"saldhigga-printer-kaaga","text":"Saldhigga printer-kaaga","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-daabacaadda","text":"Qalabka daabacaadda","level":2},{"id":"lama-hubin","text":"Lama hubin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESlicer-ka daabacaadda 3D wuxuu u baahan yahay qaab xidhan: aan godad lahayn, wejiyo kasta oo u jeedaa dibadda, aan wax isku dhex marin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raadiyaa tan saxda ah ka hor inta aadan soo dejin faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-oo-soo-deji\"\u003EHubi oo soo deji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad rabto inaad daabacdo: hal ama dhowr koox ama qayb, ama wejiyo. Haddii waxba la dooranin, wax kasta oo muuqda ayaa la daabacayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu bilaabmaa hal sadar: &quot;Diyaar u ah daabacaadda&quot;, ama inta dhibaato ee la hagaajiyo ka hor daabacaadda, ama inta la eego marka hore. Dhibaato kasta waxay leedahay saddex qayb: waxa khaldan, sababta ay muhiim u tahay, iyo waxa la sameeyo. Kadibna waxaa soo baxa cabbirka millimitir, mugga, tirada saddex-geesaha iyo saldhigga printer-kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii wada-hadalku liisto wax lagu hagaajinayo, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji wixii la hagaajin karo\u003C/span\u003E (eeg hoos). Hubinta mar kale ayey si toos ah u socotaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji 3MF\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji STL\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa daabacaadda la sameeyo waa waxa aad aragto: wejiyada qarsoon, kooxaha iyo qaybaha qarsoon, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira calaamad qarsoon ayaa laga reebaa. Cabbirrada had iyo jeer waa millimitir, unug-ka slicer-yadu filayaan, iyada oo aan loo eegin unugga moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu door 3MF haddii slicer-kaagu akhri karo: wuxuu hayaa midabka iyo unugyada. STL ma lahan labadaba, slicer-yaduna waxay u qaataan millimitir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-hubintu-eegto\"\u003EWaxa hubintu eegto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay joojiyaan daabacaadda ama waxay ku khaaseeyaan, waxayna ka dhigaan wada-hadalka &quot;Diyaar uma ah daabacaadda&quot;:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhibaato\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheedu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiga hal dhinac oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod: geesta mid ayaa wejiga dhinac ka leh, kan kalena waa madhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee wejiga ka maqan (khad u jeedka qaybta ayaa inta badan xidha), ama isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E (hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex wejiyo ama ka badan ayaa wadaagaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada ku kulmaan fin ama darbi gudaha jidh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir wejiga gudaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyo jihooyin kala duwan u jeedaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaar gudaha ayay u jeedaan, qaar dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wejiyada gudaha u jeedaa oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi wajiga\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka shayga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac ka soo horjeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb xidhan oo oo dhan gudaha ayay u jeedaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wejiyadeeda oo rog\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax isku dhex mara\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb wuxuu isku dhex maraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsgoys moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna tirtir wixii dhex jira. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EIsgoys wajiyada\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa digniino: moodeelku waa la daabacayaa, laakiin marka hore eeg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo kala duwan oo isku dhacaya\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eisku taabtaa wejiga-wejiga\u003C/strong\u003E: slicer-yadu badanaa way isku dhejiyaan; qaab nadiif ah oo faylka ah, isku xidh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJirarka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EQalabka jidhka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba kuma jiifo hoosta\u003C/strong\u003E: rog moodeelka si wejigu ugu jiifo saldhigga, si kale slicer-ku wuu ku dari doonaa taageero ama raft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa fogaanaya 45° oo aan toos ahayn\u003C/strong\u003E: wejiyadaas waxay u baahan yihiin taageero. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dusha ee sidaas ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa yar 1 mm dhererka\u003C/strong\u003E: waxaa la yaqiinaa in unuggu khaldan yahay. Hubi unugga bar-ka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb godan (jidh xidhan oo gudaha jidh kale) way fiican tahay: wejiyadiisu waxay u jeedaan godka, mugguna waa laga jaraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-dhibaatooyinka\"\u003EHagaaji dhibaatooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos \u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha ay dhibaatooyinku ku yaalliin\u003C/strong\u003E, wada-hadalku wuxuu magacaabaa kooxda ama qayb kasta oo wax khaldan ku jira, iyo waxa khaldan gudaheeda (wejiyada ka soo go&#039;ay kooxda aan lahayn waxaa lagu liistaa &quot;Wejiyada aan kooxda ku jirin&quot;). Qayb loo koobiyeeyay dhowr jeer waxaa lagu liistaa mar keliya: hagaajinta mid waxay hagaajinaysaa koobi kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa kooxdaas oo dooranayaa geesaha iyo wejiyada khaldan, si ay u muuqdaan iftiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji wixii la hagaajin karo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hagaajiyaa dhammaantood mar keliya: wuxuu xidhaa godadka oo sinaan ku yaal, wuxuu tirtiraa wejiyada gudaha qaabka iyo geesaha kala go&#039;ay, wuxuuna rogaa wejiyada si saxda ah dibadda. Waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqota. Kadibna hubinta mar kale ayaa socota oo waxa hadhay muujinaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aan hagaajin karin (god aan geesihiisu sinaan ahayn, qayb isku dhex marta) wuxuu ku sii jiraa liiska oo leh waxa gacanta lagu sameeyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhaqaaqaa wax ka sii badan: wuxuu xidhaa godadka aan sinaanka ahayn, wuxuu tirtiraa qaybaha kala go&#039;ay iyo wejiyada laba-laba ah, wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo la sameeyay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003ETaageerooyinka, cidhibta darbiga, godadka iyo hagaajinta\u003C/a\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale hagaajin kartaa hal kooxa mar keliya: dooro, kadibna isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETus dhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka shayga\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EQalabka jidhka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidh-godan\"\u003EJidh godan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qodaa qayb cidhibta darbiga aad siiso, leh godad ka-baxa meelaha aad guji. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#hollow\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"hollow\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale naqshad ka samayn kartaa godka adigoo isticmaalaya: kooxda xidhan ee qaybta gudaheeda, aan taabanin, oo dhammaan wejiyadeeda la rogay si ay u jeedaan gudaha godka. Hubintu waxay u tirtaa sida godan, mugguna wuu ka dhimaa; ma liisanayso wax la hagaajinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saldhigga-printer-kaaga\"\u003ESaldhigga printer-kaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro cabbirka saldhigga printer-kaaga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E. Hubintu waxay digtaa marka moodeelku ka weyn yahay saldhigga, iyadoo la rogayo labada dhinacba. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#3d-printer-bed\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"3d-printer-bed\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-daabacaadda\"\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos natiijooyinka wada-hadalka, \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHormarinta taageerooyinka\u003C/span\u003E (meesha taageerooyinka tagaan iyo qiyaasta), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca darbiga\u003C/span\u003E (darbiyada khafiifka ah ee aan la daabacin karin), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003ETaageerooyinka, cidhibta darbiga, godadka iyo hagaajinta\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu jaraa moodeel ka weyn saldhigga qaybo leh isku-xidho iyo isku-xidhyo lambaraysan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-split\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-split\"\u003EKala qaybi moodeel weyn daabacaadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lama-hubin\"\u003ELama hubin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubintu ma slice-gareeyo: faahfaahinta yar ee nozzle-kaagu aanu sawirin karin iyo taageerooyinka dhabta ah waa kuwa slicer-kaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet#3d-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-hash=\"3d-printing\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Slicer-ka daabacaadda 3D wuxuu u baahan yahay qaab xidhan: aan godad lahayn, wejiyo kasta oo u jeedaa dibadda, aan wax isku dhex marin. Soo saar › Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)… wuxuu raadiyaa tan saxda ah ka hor inta aadan soo dejin faylka. Hubi oo soo deji Dooro waxa aad rabto inaad daabacdo: hal ama dhowr koox ama qayb, ama wejiyo. Haddii waxba la dooranin, wax kasta oo muuqda ayaa la daabacayaa. Guji Soo saar kooxda Fayl, kadibna Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu bilaabmaa hal sadar: \"Diyaar u ah daabacaadda\", ama inta dhibaato ee la hagaajiyo ka hor daabacaadda, ama inta la eego marka hore. Dhibaato kasta waxay leedahay saddex qayb: waxa khaldan, sababta ay muhiim u tahay, iyo waxa la sameeyo. Kadibna waxaa soo baxa cabbirka millimitir, mugga, tirada saddex-geesaha iyo saldhigga printer-kaaga. Haddii wada-hadalku liisto wax lagu hagaajinayo, guji Hagaaji wixii la hagaajin karo (eeg hoos). Hubinta mar kale ayey si toos ah u socotaa. Guji Soo deji 3MF ama Soo deji STL. Waxa daabacaadda la sameeyo waa waxa aad aragto: wejiyada qarsoon, kooxaha iyo qaybaha qarsoon, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira calaamad qarsoon ayaa laga reebaa. Cabbirrada had iyo jeer waa millimitir, unug-ka slicer-yadu filayaan, iyada oo aan loo eegin unugga moodeelka. Ku door 3MF haddii slicer-kaagu akhri karo: wuxuu hayaa midabka iyo unugyada. STL ma lahan labadaba, slicer-yaduna waxay u qaataan millimitir. Waxa hubintu eegto Kuwan waxay joojiyaan daabacaadda ama waxay ku khaaseeyaan, waxayna ka dhigaan wada-hadalka \"Diyaar uma ah daabacaadda\": Dhibaato Macnaheedu Waxa la sameeyo Wejiga hal dhinac oo keliya God: geesta mid ayaa wejiga dhinac ka leh, kan kalena waa madhan Samee wejiga ka maqan (khad u jeedka qaybta ayaa inta badan xidha), ama isticmaal Hagaaji (hoos) Saddex wejiyo ama ka badan ayaa wadaagaan Wejiyada ku kulmaan fin ama darbi gudaha jidh Tirtir wejiga gudaha Wejiyo jihooyin kala duwan u jeedaan Qaar gudaha ayay u jeedaan, qaar dibadda Dooro wejiyada gudaha u jeedaa oo guji Rogi wajiga gudaha Macluumaadka shayga Dhinac ka soo horjeeda Qayb xidhan oo oo dhan gudaha ayay u jeedaa Dooro wejiyadeeda oo rog Wax isku dhex mara Qayb wuxuu isku dhex maraa Tafatir › Dheeraad › Isgoys moodeelka, kadibna tirtir wixii dhex jira. Eeg Isgoys wajiyada Kuwani waa digniino: moodeelku waa la daabacayaa, laakiin marka hore eeg. Qaybo kala duwan oo isku dhacaya, ama isku taabtaa wejiga-wejiga: slicer-yadu badanaa way isku dhejiyaan; qaab nadiif ah oo faylka ah, isku xidh Jirarka › Isku geyn. Eeg Qalabka jidhka. Waxba kuma jiifo hoosta: rog moodeelka si wejigu ugu jiifo saldhigga, si kale slicer-ku wuu ku dari doonaa taageero ama raft. Ka fogaanaya 45° oo aan toos ahayn: wejiyadaas waxay u baahan yihiin taageero. Wada-hadalku wuxuu sheegayaa inta dusha ee sidaas ah. Ka yar 1 mm dhererka: waxaa la yaqiinaa in unuggu khaldan yahay. Hubi unugga bar-ka xaaladda. Qayb godan (jidh xidhan oo gudaha jidh kale) way fiican tahay: wejiyadiisu waxay u jeedaan godka, mugguna waa laga jaraa. Hagaaji dhibaatooyinka Hoos Meesha ay dhibaatooyinku ku yaalliin, wada-hadalku wuxuu magacaabaa kooxda ama qayb kasta oo wax khaldan ku jira, iyo waxa khaldan gudaheeda (wejiyada ka soo go'ay kooxda aan lahayn waxaa lagu liistaa \"Wejiyada aan kooxda ku jirin\"). Qayb loo koobiyeeyay dhowr jeer waxaa lagu liistaa mar keliya: hagaajinta mid waxay hagaajinaysaa koobi kasta. Muuji wuxuu furaa kooxdaas oo dooranayaa geesaha iyo wejiyada khaldan, si ay u muuqdaan iftiin. Hagaaji wixii la hagaajin karo wuxuu hagaajiyaa dhammaantood mar keliya: wuxuu xidhaa godadka oo sinaan ku yaal, wuxuu tirtiraa wejiyada gudaha qaabka iyo geesaha kala go'ay, wuxuuna rogaa wejiyada si saxda ah dibadda. Waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqota. Kadibna hubinta mar kale ayaa socota oo waxa hadhay muujinaysa. Waxa aan hagaajin karin (god aan geesihiisu sinaan ahayn, qayb isku dhex marta) wuxuu ku sii jiraa liiska oo leh waxa gacanta lagu sameeyo. Hagaaji oo ku jira Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu dhaqaaqaa wax ka sii badan: wuxuu xidhaa godadka aan sinaanka ahayn, wuxuu tirtiraa qaybaha kala go'ay iyo wejiyada laba-laba ah, wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo la sameeyay. Eeg Taageerooyinka, cidhibta darbiga, godadka iyo hagaajinta. Waxaad sidoo kale hagaajin kartaa hal kooxa mar keliya: dooro, kadibna isticmaal Tus dhibaatooyinka iyo Hagaaji ee Macluumaadka shayga. Eeg Qalabka jidhka. Jidh godan Dhex-madhan oo ku jira Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu qodaa qayb cidhibta darbiga aad siiso, leh godad ka-baxa meelaha aad guji. Eeg Dhex-madhan. Waxaad sidoo kale naqshad ka samayn kartaa godka adigoo isticmaalaya: kooxda xidhan ee qaybta gudaheeda, aan taabanin, oo dhammaan wejiyadeeda la rogay si ay u jeedaan gudaha godka. Hubintu waxay u tirtaa sida godan, mugguna wuu ka dhimaa; ma liisanayso wax la hagaajinayo. Saldhigga printer-kaaga Dooro cabbirka saldhigga printer-kaaga Dejinta › ModelCraft › Miiska daabacaadda 3D. Hubintu waxay digtaa marka moodeelku ka weyn yahay saldhigga, iyadoo la rogayo labada dhinacba. Eeg Dejinta. Qalabka daabacaadda Hoos natiijooyinka wada-hadalka, Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu furaa Hormarinta taageerooyinka (meesha taageerooyinka tagaan iyo qiyaasta), Ballaca darbiga (darbiyada khafiifka ah ee aan la daabacin karin), Dhex-madhan iyo Hagaaji. Eeg Taageerooyinka, cidhibta darbiga, godadka iyo hagaajinta. Kala qaybi daabacaadda wuxuu jaraa moodeel ka weyn saldhigga qaybo leh isku-xidho iyo isku-xidhyo lambaraysan: eeg Kala qaybi moodeel weyn daabacaadda. Lama hubin Hubintu ma slice-gareeyo: faahfaahinta yar ee nozzle-kaagu aanu sawirin karin iyo taageerooyinka dhabta ah waa kuwa slicer-kaaga. Eeg Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"import-3dm-files","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Soo dhoofi moodel .3dm ah","summary":"Soo dhoofi fayl .3dm oo leh shabakadaha, dusheyaasha, curves, blocks, layers iyo midabada; meesha saddexagalladu ka yimaadaan iyo waxa la reebay.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["3dm","soo dhoofi","nurbs","polysurface","brep","dusheyaal","shabakad","soo saarid","curves","blocks","layers","calaamado","midabo","cabbirro","beddelid","u guur"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-geli-faylka","text":"Soo geli faylka","level":2},{"id":"saddexagallada-ka-yimaadaan","text":"Saddexagallada ka yimaadaan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-soo-galaya","text":"Waxa soo galaya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-reebay-iyo-la-sheegay","text":"Waxa la reebay (iyo la sheegay)","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyada","text":"Xaddidaadyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E isagoo isticmaalaya akhristihiisa, bogga gudihiisa. Waxba lama soo raro, waxayna shaqeysaa marwalba oo ModelCraft khad la&#039;aan shaqeyso. Faylalka lagu kaydiyay nidaamyada nooca 5, 6, 7 iyo 8 waa la tijaabiyay; kuwa hore (nooca 2 ilaa 4) waa inay furmaan, laakiin wali lama tijaabin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli-faylka\"\u003ESoo geli faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku tuur faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E aragtida 3D).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro faylka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Akhrinta chair.3dm…&quot; intuu akhrinayo, kadibna waxa soo galay, tusaale ahaan &quot;Soo dhoofiyay chair.3dm: 14 shabakadood (8330 wajiyo), 8 curves, 5 meel-dhigid oo block ah, 3 layers oo ah calaamado. Dusheyaal: 7 wajiyo oo ka yimid shabakadaha faylka lagu kaydiyay, 29 oo ay CadCraft samaysay.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka oo dhan wuxuu u yimaadaa hal kooxa oo magac u ah faylka, la doortay, aragtidana waa u soo dhowaataa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hal mar ayaa dhammaantood ka saaraa, calaamadaha oo dhan ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saddexagallada-ka-yimaadaan\"\u003ESaddexagallada ka yimaadaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu moodelkiisa ka dhigaa wajiyo iyo shabakado, sidaas darteed dusheyaal kasta oo faylka ku jira wuxuu u yimaadaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Eshabakad\u003C/a\u003E oo ka kooban saddexagallo yaryar oo fidsan. Wajiga kasta oo polysurface ah (iyo extrusion kasta) ModelCraft wuxuu qaadaa, taxanahan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadda bixinta ee faylka lagu kaydiyay.\u003C/strong\u003E Barnaamijyada badankood waxay kaydiyaan shabakadda ay shaashadda ku muujiyeen dusha kasta; markii ay jirto, ModelCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa sidii ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETessellation-kiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, marka faylku shabakad kaydsan lahayn: diyaaradaha, dusheyaasha NURBS, dusheyaasha wareegga (kubbadaha, koonaha, torus-ka, qaababka kharaadka), curves la soo saaray iyo extrusion-ka (oo leh godadkooda iyo dhammaadkooda), oo lagu jaray geeskooda. Wajiyada polysurface hal mid ahi waxay wadaagaan barooyinka geeskooda, sidaas darteed polysurface xidhan wuxuu u yimaadaa shabakad xidhan. Meelaha qalloocan waa la kala jaraa ilaa saddexagalladu ku dhacaan qiyaastii 0.15 % cabbirka shayga dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba\u003C/strong\u003E, wajiga dusheyaal nooc ModelCraft weli aan akhrin. Joogta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa inta wajiyo iyo nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta &quot;Surfaces:&quot; ee joogta xaaladda waxay sheegaysaa inta wajiyo ka yimid shabakadaha kaydsan iyo inta ModelCraft samaysay. Geesaha gudaha hal wajiga faylka way jilicsan yihiin, geesaha ka dhexeeya labo wajiyood way adkaan, sidaas darteed wajiga qalloocan wuu si siman u iftiimaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka ugu saxda ah, kaydi faylka shabakadaha bixinta barnaamijka uu sameeyay (taasi badanaa waa default; ikhtiyaarka &quot;save small&quot; ayaa ka saaraa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-soo-galaya\"\u003EWaxa soo galaya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShabakadaha\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh midabka geesaha iyo isku xidhka tekstuurka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPolysurfaces, dusheyaal iyo extrusion\u003C/strong\u003E, sida kor ku qoran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E (xariiqyo, polilines, qaansooyin, goobo, curves NURBS iyo kuwa laga xidhay) sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Egeesaha\u003C/a\u003E, kooxda geesaha mid layer kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlocks\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Eqaybo\u003C/a\u003E: meel kasta oo block la dhigo waa dhigitaan ka mid ah hal qayb, sidaas darteed wax ka beddelka nuqul kasta wuu beddelaa dhammaantood. Blocks ku jira blocks waa la hayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayers\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Ecalaamado\u003C/a\u003E magaca layer-ka oo buuxa (&quot;Furniture::Chairs&quot;), qarsoon marka layer-ku damay. Dhigitaan kasta wuxuu qaadaa calaamada layer-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidabada.\u003C/strong\u003E Midabka shay kasta wuxuu ka yimaadaa meesha faylku sheegayo: midabkiisa, layer-kiisa, ama midabka aasaasiga ah ee agabkiisa. Wuxuu noqdaa rinjiga wajiyadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalxaha qarsoon waxay yimaadaan qarsoon\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnhide all\u003C/span\u003E ayaa muujiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHalbeegyada:\u003C/strong\u003E faylku wuxuu sheegaa halbeegiisa; moodelku wuxuu yimaadaa cabbirkiisa dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-reebay-iyo-la-sheegay\"\u003EWaxa la reebay (iyo la sheegay)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta &quot;Notes:&quot; ee joogta xaaladda waxay magacaabaa wax kasta oo aan yimid, iyo tirada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebarooyin iyo daruuro barooyin, qoraal, dhibco qoraal, cabbirro, xariiqyada tilmaamaha, xarriijin (hatches), ivaloyinka iftiinka, diyaaradaha jarista iyo faahfaahinta qaabaynta;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ewalxaha SubD: u beddel shabakado ama polysurfaces barnaamijka uu faylka sameeyay marka hore;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ewajiyada dusheyaasha la kala saaray (offset) iyo noocyada dusheyaasha kale ee ModelCraft weli aan akhrin, marka faylku shabakad uma kaydin;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eblocks laga xidhay faylal kale (waxaa la akhriyaa kaliya faylka aad soo dhoofinayso);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eextrusions oo leh dhammaadyo jiiran waxay yimaadaan dhammaadyo laba jibbaaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETekstuurada agabka, dejinta rendarka, aragtiyada magacaysan, kooxaha iyo qoraalka isticmaalaha lama akhrin; agab kasta wuxuu bixiyaa midabkiisa aasaasiga ah oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyada\"\u003EXaddidaadyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal ilaa 300 MB. Fayl dhaawacan ayaa sheegta waxa khaldan, wax ku darna ma jiro; shay aan la akhriyi karin waa la reebaa oo la tiriyaa, kuwa kale way soo galaan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"ModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylalka .3dm isagoo isticmaalaya akhristihiisa, bogga gudihiisa. Waxba lama soo raro, waxayna shaqeysaa marwalba oo ModelCraft khad la'aan shaqeyso. Faylalka lagu kaydiyay nidaamyada nooca 5, 6, 7 iyo 8 waa la tijaabiyay; kuwa hore (nooca 2 ilaa 4) waa inay furmaan, laakiin wali lama tijaabin. Soo geli faylka Guji Import kooxda File (ama ku tuur faylka .3dm aragtida 3D). Dooro faylka. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Akhrinta chair.3dm…\" intuu akhrinayo, kadibna waxa soo galay, tusaale ahaan \"Soo dhoofiyay chair.3dm: 14 shabakadood (8330 wajiyo), 8 curves, 5 meel-dhigid oo block ah, 3 layers oo ah calaamado. Dusheyaal: 7 wajiyo oo ka yimid shabakadaha faylka lagu kaydiyay, 29 oo ay CadCraft samaysay.\" Moodelka oo dhan wuxuu u yimaadaa hal kooxa oo magac u ah faylka, la doortay, aragtidana waa u soo dhowaataa. Ctrl+Z hal mar ayaa dhammaantood ka saaraa, calaamadaha oo dhan ku jira. Saddexagallada ka yimaadaan ModelCraft wuxuu moodelkiisa ka dhigaa wajiyo iyo shabakado, sidaas darteed dusheyaal kasta oo faylka ku jira wuxuu u yimaadaa shabakad oo ka kooban saddexagallo yaryar oo fidsan. Wajiga kasta oo polysurface ah (iyo extrusion kasta) ModelCraft wuxuu qaadaa, taxanahan: Shabakadda bixinta ee faylka lagu kaydiyay. Barnaamijyada badankood waxay kaydiyaan shabakadda ay shaashadda ku muujiyeen dusha kasta; markii ay jirto, ModelCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa sidii ay tahay. Tessellation-kiisa, marka faylku shabakad kaydsan lahayn: diyaaradaha, dusheyaasha NURBS, dusheyaasha wareegga (kubbadaha, koonaha, torus-ka, qaababka kharaadka), curves la soo saaray iyo extrusion-ka (oo leh godadkooda iyo dhammaadkooda), oo lagu jaray geeskooda. Wajiyada polysurface hal mid ahi waxay wadaagaan barooyinka geeskooda, sidaas darteed polysurface xidhan wuxuu u yimaadaa shabakad xidhan. Meelaha qalloocan waa la kala jaraa ilaa saddexagalladu ku dhacaan qiyaastii 0.15 % cabbirka shayga dhabta ah. Waxba, wajiga dusheyaal nooc ModelCraft weli aan akhrin. Joogta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa inta wajiyo iyo nooca. Qaybta \"Surfaces:\" ee joogta xaaladda waxay sheegaysaa inta wajiyo ka yimid shabakadaha kaydsan iyo inta ModelCraft samaysay. Geesaha gudaha hal wajiga faylka way jilicsan yihiin, geesaha ka dhexeeya labo wajiyood way adkaan, sidaas darteed wajiga qalloocan wuu si siman u iftiimaa. Qaababka ugu saxda ah, kaydi faylka shabakadaha bixinta barnaamijka uu sameeyay (taasi badanaa waa default; ikhtiyaarka \"save small\" ayaa ka saaraa). Waxa soo galaya Shabakadaha oo leh midabka geesaha iyo isku xidhka tekstuurka. Polysurfaces, dusheyaal iyo extrusion, sida kor ku qoran. Curves (xariiqyo, polilines, qaansooyin, goobo, curves NURBS iyo kuwa laga xidhay) sida geesaha, kooxda geesaha mid layer kasta. Blocks waxay noqdaan qaybo: meel kasta oo block la dhigo waa dhigitaan ka mid ah hal qayb, sidaas darteed wax ka beddelka nuqul kasta wuu beddelaa dhammaantood. Blocks ku jira blocks waa la hayaa. Layers waxay noqdaan calaamado magaca layer-ka oo buuxa (\"Furniture::Chairs\"), qarsoon marka layer-ku damay. Dhigitaan kasta wuxuu qaadaa calaamada layer-kiisa. Midabada. Midabka shay kasta wuxuu ka yimaadaa meesha faylku sheegayo: midabkiisa, layer-kiisa, ama midabka aasaasiga ah ee agabkiisa. Wuxuu noqdaa rinjiga wajiyadiisa. Walxaha qarsoon waxay yimaadaan qarsoon; Unhide all ayaa muujiya. Halbeegyada: faylku wuxuu sheegaa halbeegiisa; moodelku wuxuu yimaadaa cabbirkiisa dhabta ah. Waxa la reebay (iyo la sheegay) Qaybta \"Notes:\" ee joogta xaaladda waxay magacaabaa wax kasta oo aan yimid, iyo tirada: barooyin iyo daruuro barooyin, qoraal, dhibco qoraal, cabbirro, xariiqyada tilmaamaha, xarriijin (hatches), ivaloyinka iftiinka, diyaaradaha jarista iyo faahfaahinta qaabaynta; walxaha SubD: u beddel shabakado ama polysurfaces barnaamijka uu faylka sameeyay marka hore; wajiyada dusheyaasha la kala saaray (offset) iyo noocyada dusheyaasha kale ee ModelCraft weli aan akhrin, marka faylku shabakad uma kaydin; blocks laga xidhay faylal kale (waxaa la akhriyaa kaliya faylka aad soo dhoofinayso); extrusions oo leh dhammaadyo jiiran waxay yimaadaan dhammaadyo laba jibbaaran. Tekstuurada agabka, dejinta rendarka, aragtiyada magacaysan, kooxaha iyo qoraalka isticmaalaha lama akhrin; agab kasta wuxuu bixiyaa midabkiisa aasaasiga ah oo keliya. Xaddidaadyada Faylal ilaa 300 MB. Fayl dhaawacan ayaa sheegta waxa khaldan, wax ku darna ma jiro; shay aan la akhriyi karin waa la reebaa oo la tiriyaa, kuwa kale way soo galaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"live-3dm-link","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ku hay moodeel .3dm oo toos ah","summary":"Ka beddel moodeelka barnaamijka uu ku sameeyay oo halkan ka arag isbeddelka, Rhino 8 ama qeexidda Grasshopper, adigoo mar kale dhoofin ama kaydin.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["rhino","grasshopper","xiriir toos ah","xiriirka toosa ah","3dm","nurbs","parametric","xidh","isku-waafaqsan","script","moodeel tixraac","riix"],"headings":[{"id":"deji","text":"Deji","level":2},{"id":"rhino-gudaha","text":"Rhino gudaha","level":2},{"id":"grasshopper-gudaha","text":"Grasshopper gudaha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ku-samayn-karto-kooxda","text":"Waxa aad ku samayn karto kooxda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-soo-gala","text":"Waxa soo gala","level":2},{"id":"haddii-wax-khalad-ah-dhaco","text":"Haddii wax khalad ah dhaco","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESii wad moodeelka meesha aad ku moodeeleyso, natiijadana halkan isticmaal: si aad u rendarto, u iftiimiso, ama goob ku habayso. Isbeddel kasta oo ka dhaca barnaamijka kale wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa hal koox oo ModelCraft ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirku wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E isla kombiyuutarkan. Tab browser ma qaadi karo xiriirka. Waxba ma marayo internetka: qoraalku wuxuu la hadlaa Studio ciwaanka kombiyuutarkan, oo leh calaamad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirkan waxaa lagu tijaabiyay qoraalka qoraha faylka iyo barnaamij ku badal ah, weli ma aha Rhino ama Grasshopper laftoodu. Haddii halkaas wax fashilmaan, nagu sheeg waxa ay yidhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji\"\u003EDeji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio gudihiisa, fur ModelCraft. Gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow kaaliyada AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETafatir\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio gudihiisa, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh kaaliye\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay tusinaysaa ciwaanka iyo calaamadda aad ku dhejin doonto hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo deji qoraalka: \u003Ca href=\"https://getcadcraft.com/assets/link3dm/cadcraft_link.py\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rhino-gudaha\"\u003ERhino gudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaqee \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E tafatiraha qoraalka ee Rhino (Python 3 ee Rhino 8).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay, geli ciwaanka iyo calaamadda. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin \u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-link.json\u003C/code\u003E faylka guriga, weligeedna kuma jiraan moodeelka. Studio wuxuu sameeyaa calaamad cusub mar kasta oo bilaabmo, sidaas darteed qoraalku mar kale wuu weydiin doonaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeelka oo dhan wuxuu imanayaa hal koox oo magaceeda ah sida dukumentiga, tusaale ahaan &quot;chair (linked)&quot;. Kadibna isbeddel kasta wuxuu imanayaa marka aad wax yar joogsato, oo kaliya walxaha isbeddelay ayaa la diraa. Shaqee qoraalka mar kale si aad u joojiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"grasshopper-gudaha\"\u003EGrasshopper gudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqee qoraalka mar hore Rhino, si ciwaanka iyo calaamaddu u kaydsamaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar component Script (Python 3) oo ku dheji qoraalka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiso gelinnadan: \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E (joomatariga, oo leh liis-helid), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (magac, ikhtiyaari), \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E (badhanka haa/maya), iyo \u003Ccode\u003ETarget\u003C/code\u003E (ikhtiyaari: \u003Ccode\u003Emodel\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, haddii labada app ay furan yihiin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaaji \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E inuu noqdo true.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXal kasta, \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu diraa oo wuxuu beddelaa waxa component-kan u diray markii hore. Sidaas darteed jiidista xagxagga ayaa cusboonaysiinaysa kooxda halkan. Natiijadiisa \u003Ccode\u003Ea\u003C/code\u003E waxay sheegaysaa waxa dhacay. Component kasta wuxuu leeyahay kooxdiisa gaarka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ku-samayn-karto-kooxda\"\u003EWaxa aad ku samayn karto kooxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq, calaamee, ku dhis agteeda.\u003C/strong\u003E Meesha aad kooxda ku dhigtay iyo calaamaddeeda waxay joogtaan cusboonaysiin kasta, sidaas oo kalena wax kasta oo ku dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHa ku tafatirin gudaheeda.\u003C/strong\u003E Cusboonaysiin kasta wuxuu beddelaa wixii ku jira kooxda. Barnaamijka kale ayaa leh walxahaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo.\u003C/strong\u003E Cusboonaysiinta laba ilbiriqsi ku dhow midba midka kale wuxuu wadaagaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqonayaa jiid oo dhan. Cusboonaysiinta xigta ayaa soo celinaysa moodeelka si uu ula mid noqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka la kaydiyay wuxuu hayaa xiriirka. Shaqee qoraalka mar kale marka aad dib u furto, kooxda isku mid ahna way cusboonaysiinaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-soo-gala\"\u003EWaxa soo gala\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh-yada, polysurface-yada, surface-yada iyo extrusion-yada, oo ah mesh-ka aad ku aragto shaashadda; SubD oo ah mesh-kiisa; curve-yada oo ah xuduudo; blocks-yada oo ah walxo kala gaar ah meesha ay taagan yihiin (ma aha components); layers-yada oo ah calaamado, midabyo iyo unitiyo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ESoo geli moodeel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E si aad u ogaato sida ay halkan u muuqdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa laga reebay, oo tirada ku taal barnaamijka kale: dhibcaha, qoraalka, cabbiraadyada iyo waxyaabaha la mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal jihood oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Isbeddelada halkan ma soo laabanayaan barnaamijka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-wax-khalad-ah-dhaco\"\u003EHaddii wax khalad ah dhaco\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Ma jiro daaqad ModelCraft ama PartCraft oo ogolaanaysa&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E samee tallaabada 1 ee deynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Studio diiday calaamadda&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E Studio dib ayuu u bilaabay. Koobiyee calaamadda cusub oo shaqee qoraalka mar kale. Grasshopper ahaan, marka hore ku shaqee Rhino.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Ma gaari karo CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E Studio ma shaqaynayo, ama ciwaanku waa isbeddelay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Sii wad moodeelka meesha aad ku moodeeleyso, natiijadana halkan isticmaal: si aad u rendarto, u iftiimiso, ama goob ku habayso. Isbeddel kasta oo ka dhaca barnaamijka kale wuxuu cusboonaysiinayaa hal koox oo ModelCraft ah. Xiriirku wuxuu u baahan yahay CadCraft Studio isla kombiyuutarkan. Tab browser ma qaadi karo xiriirka. Waxba ma marayo internetka: qoraalku wuxuu la hadlaa Studio ciwaanka kombiyuutarkan, oo leh calaamad. Xiriirkan waxaa lagu tijaabiyay qoraalka qoraha faylka iyo barnaamij ku badal ah, weli ma aha Rhino ama Grasshopper laftoodu. Haddii halkaas wax fashilmaan, nagu sheeg waxa ay yidhi. Deji Studio gudihiisa, fur ModelCraft. Gudaha Dejinta › ModelCraft › Kaaliyayaasha, calaamee Ogolow kaaliyada AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan ModelCraft, kadibna Tafatir. Studio gudihiisa, dooro Ku xidh kaaliye. Waxay tusinaysaa ciwaanka iyo calaamadda aad ku dhejin doonto hoose. Soo deji qoraalka: cadcraft_link.py. Rhino gudaha Shaqee cadcraft_link.py tafatiraha qoraalka ee Rhino (Python 3 ee Rhino 8). Markii ugu horreysay, geli ciwaanka iyo calaamadda. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin .cadcraft-link.json faylka guriga, weligeedna kuma jiraan moodeelka. Studio wuxuu sameeyaa calaamad cusub mar kasta oo bilaabmo, sidaas darteed qoraalku mar kale wuu weydiin doonaa. Moodeelka oo dhan wuxuu imanayaa hal koox oo magaceeda ah sida dukumentiga, tusaale ahaan \"chair (linked)\". Kadibna isbeddel kasta wuxuu imanayaa marka aad wax yar joogsato, oo kaliya walxaha isbeddelay ayaa la diraa. Shaqee qoraalka mar kale si aad u joojiso. Grasshopper gudaha Shaqee qoraalka mar hore Rhino, si ciwaanka iyo calaamaddu u kaydsamaan. Ku dar component Script (Python 3) oo ku dheji qoraalka cadcraft_link.py oo dhan. Siiso gelinnadan: G (joomatariga, oo leh liis-helid), N (magac, ikhtiyaari), On (badhanka haa/maya), iyo Target (ikhtiyaari: model ama part, haddii labada app ay furan yihiin). Hagaaji On inuu noqdo true. Xal kasta, G wuxuu diraa oo wuxuu beddelaa waxa component-kan u diray markii hore. Sidaas darteed jiidista xagxagga ayaa cusboonaysiinaysa kooxda halkan. Natiijadiisa a waxay sheegaysaa waxa dhacay. Component kasta wuxuu leeyahay kooxdiisa gaarka ah. Waxa aad ku samayn karto kooxda Dhaqdhaqaaq, calaamee, ku dhis agteeda. Meesha aad kooxda ku dhigtay iyo calaamaddeeda waxay joogtaan cusboonaysiin kasta, sidaas oo kalena wax kasta oo ku dhow. Ha ku tafatirin gudaheeda. Cusboonaysiin kasta wuxuu beddelaa wixii ku jira kooxda. Barnaamijka kale ayaa leh walxahaas. Ka noqo. Cusboonaysiinta laba ilbiriqsi ku dhow midba midka kale wuxuu wadaagaa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqonayaa jiid oo dhan. Cusboonaysiinta xigta ayaa soo celinaysa moodeelka si uu ula mid noqdo. Kaydi. Faylka la kaydiyay wuxuu hayaa xiriirka. Shaqee qoraalka mar kale marka aad dib u furto, kooxda isku mid ahna way cusboonaysiinaysaa. Waxa soo gala Mesh-yada, polysurface-yada, surface-yada iyo extrusion-yada, oo ah mesh-ka aad ku aragto shaashadda; SubD oo ah mesh-kiisa; curve-yada oo ah xuduudo; blocks-yada oo ah walxo kala gaar ah meesha ay taagan yihiin (ma aha components); layers-yada oo ah calaamado, midabyo iyo unitiyo. Eeg Soo geli moodeel .3dm si aad u ogaato sida ay halkan u muuqdaan. Waxa laga reebay, oo tirada ku taal barnaamijka kale: dhibcaha, qoraalka, cabbiraadyada iyo waxyaabaha la mid ah. Hal jihood oo keliya. Isbeddelada halkan ma soo laabanayaan barnaamijka kale. Haddii wax khalad ah dhaco \"Ma jiro daaqad ModelCraft ama PartCraft oo ogolaanaysa\": samee tallaabada 1 ee deynta. \"Studio diiday calaamadda\": Studio dib ayuu u bilaabay. Koobiyee calaamadda cusub oo shaqee qoraalka mar kale. Grasshopper ahaan, marka hore ku shaqee Rhino. \"Ma gaari karo CadCraft Studio\": Studio ma shaqaynayo, ama ciwaanku waa isbeddelay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-tools","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Taageerooyinka, dhumucda darbiga, godaynta iyo hagaajinta","summary":"Eeg meesha daabacaaddu u baahan taageerooyin iyo qiyaasta ku filan, hel darbiyada khafiifka ah ee aan la daabaci karin, god qayb oo dhumucdeeda loo siiyo darbiga iyo godad biyo-kaxeyn, oo hagaaji mesh iyo dhammaan hagaajinta oo la liistay.","section":"tasks","order":103,"keywords":["daabacaadda 3d","taageerooyin","hordhaca taageerooyinka","hoos u dhac","dhumucda darbiga","darbiyada khafiifka ah","khafiif","nozzle","godayn","qolof","god biyo-kaxeyn","resin","hagaaji","hagaaji mesh","non-manifold","dusha rogan","godad","qolofyada yaryar","is-jaris","isku dhac","isku xidh","taageerada geedka","taageerada tiirka"],"headings":[{"id":"hormarinta-taageerooyinka","text":"Hormarinta taageerooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dhumucda-darbiga","text":"Dhumucda darbiga","level":2},{"id":"dhex-madhan","text":"Dhex-madhan","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji","text":"Hagaaji","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAfar qalab oo lagu diyaarinayo moodeelka printer 3D. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E; sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHormarinta taageerooyinka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaca darbiga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E. Mid kasta wuxuu furmaa kaar oo ku taal muuqaalka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E (xiriiriyaha) wuxuu qaadaa kaarka iyo calaamadihiisa. Hal kaar ayaa muuqda hal mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab kasta wuxuu shaqeeyaa waxa la daabacayo: xulashada, ama wax kasta oo muuqda haddii wax aan la xulin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E waxay u baahan yihiin hal koox, qayb ama mesh la xulay, sababtoo ah waxay beddelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hormarinta-taageerooyinka\"\u003EHormarinta taageerooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha ka soo baxa wax ka badan \u003Cstrong\u003Exagasha hoos u dhaca\u003C/strong\u003E ee toosan ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa casaan, taageerooyin fudud ayaana ka soo jeedsada (oo liin ah) ilaa darbiga, ama qaybta moodeelka ee hoosteeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagasha hoos u dhaca\u003C/strong\u003E: 45° waa waxa inta badan printer-yadu ku maamulaan iyada oo aan taageero lahayn. Kor u qaad printer-ka oo u fiican bridge-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirarka\u003C/strong\u003E: tiir toosan 3 mm kasta hoos u dhac kasta hoosteeda. Qiyaasta waxay u tirisaa sida nidaamka taageerada 15%.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeed\u003C/strong\u003E: meelaha dhow waxay ku biiraan hal gabal hoosta dhexdooda; laan ma leexdo ka badan 45°. Geedaha badanaa agab yar bay qaataan, waxayna taabtaan darbiga meelo ka yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta dusha u baahan taageero, inta dhibcood ee taageerada ah iyo qiyaasta agabka ay qaadanayaan. Taageerooyinka ku istaagaya moodeelka (ma aha darbiga) waa la tiriyaa: waxay halkaas ka tagaan calaamado. Haddii darbiga printer-ka la doortay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E, darbiga ayaa lagu sawiraa hoosta moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa hordhac, ma aha slicer: slicer-kaaga ayaa go&#039;aaminaya taageerooyinka dhabta ah. Hoos u dhac aad u weyn dhexdiisa dhibcaha taageerada waa la kala fidiyaa si hordhacu u dhaqso u yahay; kaarku wuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhumucda-darbiga\"\u003EDhumucda darbiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha kasta waxaa la cabbiraa si toosan jidhka dhex-mara ilaa dhinaca kale. Darbiyada ka hooseeya \u003Cstrong\u003Edarbiga ugu khafiifka ah ee la ogol yahay\u003C/strong\u003E waa casaan, darbiyada ka hooseeya 1.5 jeer taas waa liin: way daabacmaan, laakiin waxay soo bixi karaan kuwo daciif ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeelaha khafiifka ah waa la liistaa, kan ugu khafiifka badanba horta, iyo sida khafiifka ah iyo sida weyn ee mid kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kamarada u rogaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrinter-ku ma samayn karo darbi ka khafiif ah sida laba ballac oo nozzle-kiisa: 0.8 mm nozzle 0.4 mm oo caadi ah (marka hore). Printer-yada resin-ka waxay maamulaan wax ka yar; hubi buuga printer-kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeel aad u weyn dhexdiisa dusha qaarkood ayaa kaliya cabbiraan, kuwa kalena dhumucda deriskooda ayay qaataan; kaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta la cabbiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhex-madhan\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodaynta waxay ilaalisaa dibada sida ay tahay oo waxay bixisaa gudaha, iyadoo darbiyada ay ahaadaan dhumuc aad codsatay. Daabacaadda resin-ka waxay isticmaashaa resin yar oo waxay ku jiidaa darbiga dhismaha yar; daabacaadda filament-ka waxay isticmaashaa plastik ka yar intii infill-ku sameyn lahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda, qaybta ama mesh-ka, kadibna fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003Edarbiga\u003C/strong\u003E (2 mm marka hore) iyo inta ballaca \u003Cstrong\u003Egodadka biyo-kaxeyn\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii daabacaadda resin tahay, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig god biyo-kaxeyn\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji dibada moodeelka halka uu tago: hoos, u dhow darbiga dhismaha, si resin-ka dareeraha ah u soo bixi karo. Dhig inta aad u baahan tahay; mid kasta wuxuu muuqdaa giraan buluug ah oo waxaa lagu liistaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHordhac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa inta godaynta ay ka saarayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhex-madhi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isbeddelka: hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka noqon karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijadu waa hal jidh xidhan oo hubinta daabacaadda 3D aqbasho: ModelCraft wuu hubiyaa marka hore wuxuuna wax ka beddelayaa haddii aanu gudbi karin. Halka moodeelku ka khafiifsan yahay laba darbi, wuu adag yahay. Natiijadu waa koox ay dusheedu yihiin dusha keli ah, sidaas awgeed waad sii samayn kartaa moodelkeeda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E; qayb wareegsan oo lagu godayay grid-ka fiican badanaa waxay leedahay dusha aad u badan oo taas u ah, oo beddelaysa mesh; xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka badankood gudaha waa dibada oo la riixay darbiga qaddarkiisa saxda ah. Meelaha geesaha ama qaybaha khafiifka ahi ka dhigaan taas mid aan suurta gal ahayn, ModelCraft wuxuu raacaa dibada masaafada darbiga grid-ka fiican; kaarku markaas wuxuu sheegaa sida ay u dhow tahay (dhex-jira qayb ka mid ah millimitir).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu eegaa qaybta la xulay sida slicer-ka printer-ku u eegi doono, wuxuuna hagaajiyaa waxa uu si ammaan ah u hagaajin karo, wuxuuna liistaa hagaaji kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu hagaajiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay ka dhigan tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex-geesood aan dhul lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elaga tago\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex-geesood la sawiray laba jeer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emid keliya ayaa la ilaaliyaa; dusha isla dib-u-dhigan (aan dhumuc lahayn) waa la saaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybo furan oo ka hooseeya 0.5 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ela saaraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex-geesood u jeeda jihada qaldan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ela rogaa si ay ula mid noqdaan deriskooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodad, siman ama aan sinnayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewaa la xidhaa, marawad saddex-geesood cusub oo laga bilaabo dhexda godkasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb dibadda-gudaha loo rogay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewaa la rogaa dibada (godayn gudaha qayb kale ah waa la inoo daayaa: waa inay u jeeddo gudaha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji kuwa ammaanka ah\u003C/span\u003E dhammaan waxaa samaynaya hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka noqon karta, xarriiqda xaaladduna wuxuu liistaa hagaaji kasta. Qaybta la hagaajiyay waxay noqotaa koox ay dusheedu yihiin dusha keli ah. Haddii aanay wali xidhmin (wax hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EAdiga kuu harsan\u003C/strong\u003E ka hadhay), ama waxay leedahay dusha aad u badan koox ahaan, waxay noqonaysaa mesh halkii: dusheeda waxay ahaan doontaa saddex-geesood, dusha toosanna wali waa toosan tahay. Xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kaas. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xidh qaybaha isku dhex jira\u003C/span\u003E waxay u shaqeysaa siday tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax aan si ammaan ah loo hagaajin karin waa lagu liistaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EAdiga kuu harsan\u003C/strong\u003E oo calaamad guduudan ah muuqaalka, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E ku jirta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXuduudyo ay saddex dusha ama ka badan isku kulmaan\u003C/strong\u003E: go&#039;aan ka qaado dusha ku habboon, oo kuwa kale tirtir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb isha ku dhex maraysa\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybtaas dhaqaaji ama dib u sawir. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EIsgoysii dusha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGodad aad u weyn ama aad u isku qabsan si loo xidho\u003C/strong\u003E: sawir dusha dhexdooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo kala duwan oo isku dhacaya\u003C/strong\u003E: slicer-yadu siduba ayay isku daraan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku xidh qaybaha isku dhex jira\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid jidh xidhan (wuxuu dib u dhisaa dusha meelaha ay isku kulmaan, sidaas darteed waa badhan kala gooshan, marna lagama samayn sidaad aan ogolaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxaha riix/jiid waxaad sidoo kale mid mid ugu hagaajin kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETus dhibaatooyinka\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/span\u003E, taas oo ilaalisa dusha aad sawirtay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EQalabka jidhka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELa xiriira: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari moodeel daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EHabka bilowga\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet#3d-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-hash=\"3d-printing\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Afar qalab oo lagu diyaarinayo moodeelka printer 3D. Fur Soo saar › Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…; sanduuqa Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu leeyahay Hormarinta taageerooyinka, Ballaca darbiga, Dhex-madhan iyo Hagaaji. Mid kasta wuxuu furmaa kaar oo ku taal muuqaalka; Xir (xiriiriyaha) wuxuu qaadaa kaarka iyo calaamadihiisa. Hal kaar ayaa muuqda hal mar. Qalab kasta wuxuu shaqeeyaa waxa la daabacayo: xulashada, ama wax kasta oo muuqda haddii wax aan la xulin. Dhex-madhan iyo Hagaaji waxay u baahan yihiin hal koox, qayb ama mesh la xulay, sababtoo ah waxay beddelaan. Hormarinta taageerooyinka Dusha ka soo baxa wax ka badan xagasha hoos u dhaca ee toosan ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa casaan, taageerooyin fudud ayaana ka soo jeedsada (oo liin ah) ilaa darbiga, ama qaybta moodeelka ee hoosteeda. Xagasha hoos u dhaca: 45° waa waxa inta badan printer-yadu ku maamulaan iyada oo aan taageero lahayn. Kor u qaad printer-ka oo u fiican bridge-yada. Tiirarka: tiir toosan 3 mm kasta hoos u dhac kasta hoosteeda. Qiyaasta waxay u tirisaa sida nidaamka taageerada 15%. Geed: meelaha dhow waxay ku biiraan hal gabal hoosta dhexdooda; laan ma leexdo ka badan 45°. Geedaha badanaa agab yar bay qaataan, waxayna taabtaan darbiga meelo ka yar. Kaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta dusha u baahan taageero, inta dhibcood ee taageerada ah iyo qiyaasta agabka ay qaadanayaan. Taageerooyinka ku istaagaya moodeelka (ma aha darbiga) waa la tiriyaa: waxay halkaas ka tagaan calaamado. Haddii darbiga printer-ka la doortay Dejinta, darbiga ayaa lagu sawiraa hoosta moodeelka. Tani waa hordhac, ma aha slicer: slicer-kaaga ayaa go'aaminaya taageerooyinka dhabta ah. Hoos u dhac aad u weyn dhexdiisa dhibcaha taageerada waa la kala fidiyaa si hordhacu u dhaqso u yahay; kaarku wuu sheegaa. Dhumucda darbiga Dusha kasta waxaa la cabbiraa si toosan jidhka dhex-mara ilaa dhinaca kale. Darbiyada ka hooseeya darbiga ugu khafiifka ah ee la ogol yahay waa casaan, darbiyada ka hooseeya 1.5 jeer taas waa liin: way daabacmaan, laakiin waxay soo bixi karaan kuwo daciif ah. Meelaha khafiifka ah waa la liistaa, kan ugu khafiifka badanba horta, iyo sida khafiifka ah iyo sida weyn ee mid kasta. Muuji wuxuu kamarada u rogaa. Printer-ku ma samayn karo darbi ka khafiif ah sida laba ballac oo nozzle-kiisa: 0.8 mm nozzle 0.4 mm oo caadi ah (marka hore). Printer-yada resin-ka waxay maamulaan wax ka yar; hubi buuga printer-kaaga. Moodeel aad u weyn dhexdiisa dusha qaarkood ayaa kaliya cabbiraan, kuwa kalena dhumucda deriskooda ayay qaataan; kaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta la cabbiray. Dhex-madhan Godaynta waxay ilaalisaa dibada sida ay tahay oo waxay bixisaa gudaha, iyadoo darbiyada ay ahaadaan dhumuc aad codsatay. Daabacaadda resin-ka waxay isticmaashaa resin yar oo waxay ku jiidaa darbiga dhismaha yar; daabacaadda filament-ka waxay isticmaashaa plastik ka yar intii infill-ku sameyn lahaa. Dooro kooxda, qaybta ama mesh-ka, kadibna fur Dhex-madhan. Deji darbiga (2 mm marka hore) iyo inta ballaca godadka biyo-kaxeyn. Haddii daabacaadda resin tahay, guji Dhig god biyo-kaxeyn, kadibna guji dibada moodeelka halka uu tago: hoos, u dhow darbiga dhismaha, si resin-ka dareeraha ah u soo bixi karo. Dhig inta aad u baahan tahay; mid kasta wuxuu muuqdaa giraan buluug ah oo waxaa lagu liistaa Ka saar. Hordhac wuxuu sheegaa inta godaynta ay ka saarayso. Dhex-madhi wuxuu sameeyaa isbeddelka: hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z ka noqon karta. Natiijadu waa hal jidh xidhan oo hubinta daabacaadda 3D aqbasho: ModelCraft wuu hubiyaa marka hore wuxuuna wax ka beddelayaa haddii aanu gudbi karin. Halka moodeelku ka khafiifsan yahay laba darbi, wuu adag yahay. Natiijadu waa koox ay dusheedu yihiin dusha keli ah, sidaas awgeed waad sii samayn kartaa moodelkeeda Riix/jiid; qayb wareegsan oo lagu godayay grid-ka fiican badanaa waxay leedahay dusha aad u badan oo taas u ah, oo beddelaysa mesh; xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kaas. Qaababka badankood gudaha waa dibada oo la riixay darbiga qaddarkiisa saxda ah. Meelaha geesaha ama qaybaha khafiifka ahi ka dhigaan taas mid aan suurta gal ahayn, ModelCraft wuxuu raacaa dibada masaafada darbiga grid-ka fiican; kaarku markaas wuxuu sheegaa sida ay u dhow tahay (dhex-jira qayb ka mid ah millimitir). Hagaaji Hagaaji wuxuu eegaa qaybta la xulay sida slicer-ka printer-ku u eegi doono, wuxuuna hagaajiyaa waxa uu si ammaan ah u hagaajin karo, wuxuuna liistaa hagaaji kasta: Waxa uu hagaajiyaa Waxa ay ka dhigan tahay Saddex-geesood aan dhul lahayn laga tago Saddex-geesood la sawiray laba jeer mid keliya ayaa la ilaaliyaa; dusha isla dib-u-dhigan (aan dhumuc lahayn) waa la saaraa Qaybo furan oo ka hooseeya 0.5 mm la saaraa Saddex-geesood u jeeda jihada qaldan la rogaa si ay ula mid noqdaan deriskooda Godad, siman ama aan sinnayn waa la xidhaa, marawad saddex-geesood cusub oo laga bilaabo dhexda godkasta Qayb dibadda-gudaha loo rogay waa la rogaa dibada (godayn gudaha qayb kale ah waa la inoo daayaa: waa inay u jeeddo gudaha) Hagaaji kuwa ammaanka ah dhammaan waxaa samaynaya hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z ka noqon karta, xarriiqda xaaladduna wuxuu liistaa hagaaji kasta. Qaybta la hagaajiyay waxay noqotaa koox ay dusheedu yihiin dusha keli ah. Haddii aanay wali xidhmin (wax hoosta Adiga kuu harsan ka hadhay), ama waxay leedahay dusha aad u badan koox ahaan, waxay noqonaysaa mesh halkii: dusheeda waxay ahaan doontaa saddex-geesood, dusha toosanna wali waa toosan tahay. Xarriiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kaas. Isku xidh qaybaha isku dhex jira waxay u shaqeysaa siday tahay. Wax aan si ammaan ah loo hagaajin karin waa lagu liistaa hoosta Adiga kuu harsan oo calaamad guduudan ah muuqaalka, oo Muuji ku jirta: Xuduudyo ay saddex dusha ama ka badan isku kulmaan: go'aan ka qaado dusha ku habboon, oo kuwa kale tirtir. Qayb isha ku dhex maraysa: qaybtaas dhaqaaji ama dib u sawir. Eeg Isgoysii dusha. Godad aad u weyn ama aad u isku qabsan si loo xidho: sawir dusha dhexdooda. Qaybo kala duwan oo isku dhacaya: slicer-yadu siduba ayay isku daraan. Isku xidh qaybaha isku dhex jira wuxuu ka dhigaa mid jidh xidhan (wuxuu dib u dhisaa dusha meelaha ay isku kulmaan, sidaas darteed waa badhan kala gooshan, marna lagama samayn sidaad aan ogolaan). Kooxaha riix/jiid waxaad sidoo kale mid mid ugu hagaajin kartaa Macluumaadka › Tus dhibaatooyinka / Hagaaji, taas oo ilaalisa dusha aad sawirtay. Eeg Qalabka jidhka. La xiriira: Diyaari moodeel daabacaadda 3D · Habka bilowga · Weli lama dhisin","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-split","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kala qaybi moodeel weyn daabacaadda","summary":"Ka jar moodeel ka weyn daabacahaaga qaybo ku habboon darbiga, oo leh dhimbiil, furayaal, dovetail, godad dowel ama magnet, iyo lambarka isku xidhka labada dhinac, iyo inaad soo deegsato qayb kasta iyo warqadda isku dhisidda hal zip.","section":"tasks","order":104,"keywords":["daabacaadda 3d","kala qaybi","jiifsi","jar jiifsan","jar xagal","jiif","kala qaybiye","jar","aad u weyn","cabirka darbiga","mugga dhismaha","qaybaha","qayb","xidhiidhiyayaal","dhimbiil","furayaal","dovetail","dowel","magnet","kiliyaransi","dulqaad","lambarada qaybaha","isku-dhis","muuqaal kala fidsan","zip","stl","3mf","liisan","license","furaha usb","dongle"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-loo-jarayo","text":"Sida loo jarayo","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidhiyayaasha","text":"Xidhiidhiyayaasha","level":2},{"id":"lambarada-qaybaha","text":"Lambarada qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"hordhac-soo-dejin-kala-qaybi-moodeelka","text":"Hordhac, soo dejin, kala qaybi moodeelka","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidhiyayaasha-adigu-u-dhaqaaq","text":"Xidhiidhiyayaasha adigu u dhaqaaq","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka moodeelku uu ka weyn yahay darbiga printer-kaaga, \u003Cstrong\u003EKala qaybi daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jarayaa qaybo ku habboon, wuxuuna ku daraa xidhiidhiyayaal si qaybaha isugu jira marka aad isku geliso, wuxuuna isla lambar ku qoraa labada dhinac ee isku xidh kasta. Fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E; sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EKala qaybi daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu ku furmaa kaar oo ku taal muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay shaqeysaa waxa la daabacayo: xulashada, ama wax kasta oo muuqda haddii wax aan la xulin. Waxa la daabacayo waa inuu noqdaa jidh xidhan; haddii hubinta ay heliso godad, marka hore isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ku shaqeysaa ModelCraft, kombiyuutarkaaga: ma jiro server liisan, ma jiro furaha USB, waxba lama soo geyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-jarayo\"\u003ESida loo jarayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu habee darbiga, qaybaha ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E: geli ballaca, qotada iyo joogta darbiga (waxay ka bilaabmaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › ModelCraft › daabacaha 3D). Kaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta qayb ay qaadanayso iyo cabirka mid kasta; wuxuu moodeelka u jarayaa qaybo isku mid ah, sida ugu yar ee ku habboon. Qayb waxay ku jiri kartaa dhinac fayllada haddii taasi ku habboonaato. Xidhiidhiyayaasha ka soo baxa qayb kasta waxay ku tiriyaan cabirkeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeelaha aan bixiyo\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro dhinaca la jarayo oo ku qor meesha, millimitir laga bilaabo dhinaca hoose ee moodeelka, commas ku dhex jira (\u003Ccode\u003E100, 200\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa saddex qayb). \u003Cstrong\u003EJiifsi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jarista u rogaa ilaa 60° ku wareegsan mid ka mid ah laba dhinaca kale (tusaale ahaan jar ku jirta Z oo jiifsatay X): jar kasta oo jiifsan wuxuu maraa dhexda moodeelka meeshiisa, wuxuuna siiyaa qaybaha meel dheeraad ah oo lagu dhejiyo, wuxuuna qariyaa isku xidhka dusha jiifsan si fiican. Xidhiidhiyayaashu waxay istaagaan toosan jarista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirrada jarista waxay ku muuqdaan moodeelka agagaarka sida khadadka xariijimaha ah intii kaarku furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidhiyayaasha\"\u003EXidhiidhiyayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeel kasta oo laba qayb isku taabtaan waxay helaysaa xidhiidhiyayaal, oo lagu dhigo iyagoo keli ah meesha ugu bannaan badan: ugu yaraan \u003Cstrong\u003Edarbiga ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu daro \u003Cstrong\u003Ekiliyaransi\u003C/strong\u003E oo lagu daro cabirkooda, oo ka fog dibada, iyo inta ka fog jar kasta oo kale in laba god aysan waligood isku kulmin. Dhinac dheer oo dusha ah laba xidhiidhiyayaal ayaa lagu kala fidiyaa, si qaybaha aysan u wareegi karin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhimbiil wareega\u003C/strong\u003E: dhimbil qayb ku yaal (geesta gees ka jarran), god qayb kale ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaal afar-geesood\u003C/strong\u003E: sida oo kale, laba-geesood, si qaybtu u geli karto hal jihooyin oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDovetail\u003C/strong\u003E: lisaan ku siibanaya dhuunta dhinaca ka galaya. Meesha dhamaadka dhuunta ay ku kulmi lahayd jar kale, dovetail-ka wuu joogsadaa oo wuxuu ka galaa furitaanka dhamaadka. Dovetail-ku waxa ku habboon jarista hal jihada (safka jeexjeexyada); shabakad dhexdeeda, isticmaal dhimbiil ama dowel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGodad dowel\u003C/strong\u003E: god dhinac kasta; pinnadiisa waxaa sidoo kale la daabacaa (zip-ka dhexdiisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhuumaha magnet-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: dhuun dhinac kasta oo magnet wareega ah oo ballaca iyo dhumucda aad siiso. Hore u hubi polesyada ka hor intaadan ku dhejin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidna (kolley)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKiliyaransi\u003C/strong\u003E waa dheelitirka dhinac kasta oo u dhexeeya dhimbilka iyo godkiisa (0.2 mm marka hore). Waxay runta tahay lambarka aad bixiso: godadka wareega waxaa loo sameeyaa in yar oo ka weyn si dhinacyadooda toosan, ma aha geesahooda, ay ilaaliyaan dheelitirkaas. Kor u qaad haddii qaybaha printer-kaaga ay ku soo baxaan adag.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka isku xidhku aanu meel u lahayn xidhiidhiye (darbi khafiif ah, meel yar oo taabta), kaarku wuu sheegaa: kolley ku xidh kaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lambarada-qaybaha\"\u003ELambarada qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003EQoro lambarada isku xidhka labada dhinac\u003C/strong\u003E la shido, isku xidh kasta wuxuu helaa lambarka labada qaybood, sida \u003Ccode\u003E3-4\u003C/code\u003E, oo lagu xardho 0.6 mm qoto dheer labada dhinac, si dhinac kasta u akhriyo si sax ah. Lambarada waxay bilaabaan 5 mm dherer, waxayna yaraadaan si ay ugu habboon yihiin, ilaa 2.5 mm; isku xidh aan meel u lahayn lambarkiisa ayaa la liistaa. Qaybaha lambar ayaa la siiyaa laga bilaabo lakabka hoose ilaa sare.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hordhac-soo-dejin-kala-qaybi-moodeelka\"\u003EHordhac, soo dejin, kala qaybi moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHordhac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu jarayaa moodeelka oo wuxuu sheegaa inta qayb, isku xidh iyo xidhiidhiye ay jiraan, haddii qayb kasta ay gudubto hubinta daabacaadda 3D iyo haddii ay ku habboon tahay darbiga, wuxuuna liistaa cabirka qayb kasta. Giraan ayaa calaamadeynaya xidhiidhiye kasta iyo lambar kasta muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji qaybaha (.zip)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu keydiyaa hal zip: fayl qayb kasta (STL ama 3MF, sida aad dooratid hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka\u003C/strong\u003E), mid kasta oo taagan darbiga; pinnadii dowel-ka; iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewarqadda isku dhisidda\u003C/strong\u003E — sawir qaybaha oo la kala qaaday oo lambarradooda (\u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.svg\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.png\u003C/code\u003E) iyo liis qaybaha iyo isku xidhka (\u003Ccode\u003Eassembly.txt\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa qaybaha moodeelka meesha kooxaha ama qaybaha la xulay, oo loo magacaabay sida warqadda isku dhisidda, hal tallaabo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa asalka. Waxay u baahan tahay kooxaha ama qaybaha la kala qaybinayo in la xulo; soo dejintu waxay shaqeysaa wax kasta oo la daabacayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidhiyayaasha-adigu-u-dhaqaaq\"\u003EXidhiidhiyayaasha adigu u dhaqaaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHordhac kadib, \u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhiyayaasha gacanta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kuu oggolaanayaa inaad saxdo meesha xidhiidhiyayaashu u tagayaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove one\u003C/span\u003E: guji giraan casaan ah muuqaalka (wuu cagaan noqdaa), kadibna guji meesha uu ku tagi lahaa jarista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd one\u003C/span\u003E: guji muuqaalka meesha xidhiidhiye ku tagi lahaa. Wuxuu ku tagaa dusha jarista ay gujintaadu gaarto, labada qaybood ee halkaas ku dhex jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove one\u003C/span\u003E: guji giraan casaan ah si aad xidhiidhiyaha uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddel kasta mar kale waa la hubiyaa sida kuwa otomaatiga ah: meel aad ugu dhow dhigga, jar kale ama xidhiidhiye kale lama sameeyo, kaarkuna wuu sheegaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale otomaatig\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu illoobaa meelahaaga. Waxay joogaan intii moodeelka, xulashada iyo jarista ay sidaas ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHordhacu wuu joogaa ilaa moodeelka, xulashada ama dejintu ay isbeddelaan; markaas kaarku wuxuu kuu waydiinayaa inaad mar kale hordhacdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta waxaa la hubiyaa sida hubinta daabacaadda 3D ay u hubin lahayd ka hor intaadan soo dejin. Slicer-kaaga ayaa weli go&#039;aaminaya sida qayb kasta loo daabacayo: eeg mid kasta halkaas, oo marka hore daabac hal isku xidh si aad u aragto sida printer-kaagu u maamulayo kiliyaransiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Marka moodeelku uu ka weyn yahay darbiga printer-kaaga, Kala qaybi daabacaadda wuxuu jarayaa qaybo ku habboon, wuxuuna ku daraa xidhiidhiyayaal si qaybaha isugu jira marka aad isku geliso, wuxuuna isla lambar ku qoraa labada dhinac ee isku xidh kasta. Fur Soo saar › Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…; sanduuqa Qalabka daabacaadda wuxuu leeyahay Kala qaybi daabacaadda. Wuxuu ku furmaa kaar oo ku taal muuqaalka. Waxay shaqeysaa waxa la daabacayo: xulashada, ama wax kasta oo muuqda haddii wax aan la xulin. Waxa la daabacayo waa inuu noqdaa jidh xidhan; haddii hubinta ay heliso godad, marka hore isticmaal Hagaaji. Waxay ku shaqeysaa ModelCraft, kombiyuutarkaaga: ma jiro server liisan, ma jiro furaha USB, waxba lama soo geyo. Sida loo jarayo Ku habee darbiga, qaybaha ugu yar: geli ballaca, qotada iyo joogta darbiga (waxay ka bilaabmaan Dejinta › ModelCraft › daabacaha 3D). Kaarku wuxuu sheegaa inta qayb ay qaadanayso iyo cabirka mid kasta; wuxuu moodeelka u jarayaa qaybo isku mid ah, sida ugu yar ee ku habboon. Qayb waxay ku jiri kartaa dhinac fayllada haddii taasi ku habboonaato. Xidhiidhiyayaasha ka soo baxa qayb kasta waxay ku tiriyaan cabirkeeda. Meelaha aan bixiyo: dooro dhinaca la jarayo oo ku qor meesha, millimitir laga bilaabo dhinaca hoose ee moodeelka, commas ku dhex jira (100, 200 wuxuu sameeyaa saddex qayb). Jiifsi wuxuu jarista u rogaa ilaa 60° ku wareegsan mid ka mid ah laba dhinaca kale (tusaale ahaan jar ku jirta Z oo jiifsatay X): jar kasta oo jiifsan wuxuu maraa dhexda moodeelka meeshiisa, wuxuuna siiyaa qaybaha meel dheeraad ah oo lagu dhejiyo, wuxuuna qariyaa isku xidhka dusha jiifsan si fiican. Xidhiidhiyayaashu waxay istaagaan toosan jarista. Sawirrada jarista waxay ku muuqdaan moodeelka agagaarka sida khadadka xariijimaha ah intii kaarku furan yahay. Xidhiidhiyayaasha Meel kasta oo laba qayb isku taabtaan waxay helaysaa xidhiidhiyayaal, oo lagu dhigo iyagoo keli ah meesha ugu bannaan badan: ugu yaraan darbiga ugu yar oo lagu daro kiliyaransi oo lagu daro cabirkooda, oo ka fog dibada, iyo inta ka fog jar kasta oo kale in laba god aysan waligood isku kulmin. Dhinac dheer oo dusha ah laba xidhiidhiyayaal ayaa lagu kala fidiyaa, si qaybaha aysan u wareegi karin. Dhimbiil wareega: dhimbil qayb ku yaal (geesta gees ka jarran), god qayb kale ku yaal. Furayaal afar-geesood: sida oo kale, laba-geesood, si qaybtu u geli karto hal jihooyin oo keliya. Dovetail: lisaan ku siibanaya dhuunta dhinaca ka galaya. Meesha dhamaadka dhuunta ay ku kulmi lahayd jar kale, dovetail-ka wuu joogsadaa oo wuxuu ka galaa furitaanka dhamaadka. Dovetail-ku waxa ku habboon jarista hal jihada (safka jeexjeexyada); shabakad dhexdeeda, isticmaal dhimbiil ama dowel. Godad dowel: god dhinac kasta; pinnadiisa waxaa sidoo kale la daabacaa (zip-ka dhexdiisa). Dhuumaha magnet-ka: dhuun dhinac kasta oo magnet wareega ah oo ballaca iyo dhumucda aad siiso. Hore u hubi polesyada ka hor intaadan ku dhejin. Midna (kolley). Kiliyaransi waa dheelitirka dhinac kasta oo u dhexeeya dhimbilka iyo godkiisa (0.2 mm marka hore). Waxay runta tahay lambarka aad bixiso: godadka wareega waxaa loo sameeyaa in yar oo ka weyn si dhinacyadooda toosan, ma aha geesahooda, ay ilaaliyaan dheelitirkaas. Kor u qaad haddii qaybaha printer-kaaga ay ku soo baxaan adag. Marka isku xidhku aanu meel u lahayn xidhiidhiye (darbi khafiif ah, meel yar oo taabta), kaarku wuu sheegaa: kolley ku xidh kaas. Lambarada qaybaha Marka Qoro lambarada isku xidhka labada dhinac la shido, isku xidh kasta wuxuu helaa lambarka labada qaybood, sida 3-4, oo lagu xardho 0.6 mm qoto dheer labada dhinac, si dhinac kasta u akhriyo si sax ah. Lambarada waxay bilaabaan 5 mm dherer, waxayna yaraadaan si ay ugu habboon yihiin, ilaa 2.5 mm; isku xidh aan meel u lahayn lambarkiisa ayaa la liistaa. Qaybaha lambar ayaa la siiyaa laga bilaabo lakabka hoose ilaa sare. Hordhac, soo dejin, kala qaybi moodeelka Hordhac wuxuu jarayaa moodeelka oo wuxuu sheegaa inta qayb, isku xidh iyo xidhiidhiye ay jiraan, haddii qayb kasta ay gudubto hubinta daabacaadda 3D iyo haddii ay ku habboon tahay darbiga, wuxuuna liistaa cabirka qayb kasta. Giraan ayaa calaamadeynaya xidhiidhiye kasta iyo lambar kasta muuqaalka. Soo deji qaybaha (.zip) wuxuu keydiyaa hal zip: fayl qayb kasta (STL ama 3MF, sida aad dooratid hoosta Faylalka), mid kasta oo taagan darbiga; pinnadii dowel-ka; iyo warqadda isku dhisidda — sawir qaybaha oo la kala qaaday oo lambarradooda (assembly.svg iyo assembly.png) iyo liis qaybaha iyo isku xidhka (assembly.txt). Kala qaybi moodeelka wuxuu geliyaa qaybaha moodeelka meesha kooxaha ama qaybaha la xulay, oo loo magacaabay sida warqadda isku dhisidda, hal tallaabo: Ka noqo wuxuu soo celinayaa asalka. Waxay u baahan tahay kooxaha ama qaybaha la kala qaybinayo in la xulo; soo dejintu waxay shaqeysaa wax kasta oo la daabacayo. Xidhiidhiyayaasha adigu u dhaqaaq Hordhac kadib, Xidhiidhiyayaasha gacanta wuxuu kuu oggolaanayaa inaad saxdo meesha xidhiidhiyayaashu u tagayaan: Move one: guji giraan casaan ah muuqaalka (wuu cagaan noqdaa), kadibna guji meesha uu ku tagi lahaa jarista. Add one: guji muuqaalka meesha xidhiidhiye ku tagi lahaa. Wuxuu ku tagaa dusha jarista ay gujintaadu gaarto, labada qaybood ee halkaas ku dhex jira. Remove one: guji giraan casaan ah si aad xidhiidhiyaha uga saarto. Isbeddel kasta mar kale waa la hubiyaa sida kuwa otomaatiga ah: meel aad ugu dhow dhigga, jar kale ama xidhiidhiye kale lama sameeyo, kaarkuna wuu sheegaa. Mar kale otomaatig wuxuu illoobaa meelahaaga. Waxay joogaan intii moodeelka, xulashada iyo jarista ay sidaas ahaayeen. Hordhacu wuu joogaa ilaa moodeelka, xulashada ama dejintu ay isbeddelaan; markaas kaarku wuxuu kuu waydiinayaa inaad mar kale hordhacdo. Qayb kasta waxaa la hubiyaa sida hubinta daabacaadda 3D ay u hubin lahayd ka hor intaadan soo dejin. Slicer-kaaga ayaa weli go'aaminaya sida qayb kasta loo daabacayo: eeg mid kasta halkaas, oo marka hore daabac hal isku xidh si aad u aragto sida printer-kaagu u maamulayo kiliyaransiga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-stage","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dhig waxyaabaha darbiga daabacaadda oo u dir printer-ka","summary":"Ku dar alaabta Maktabadda ama moodeelkaaga darbiga printer-kaaga, u habee, eeg lakabyada la jarjaray, oo u dir daabacaadda USB ama shabakadda, ama kaydi G-code, iyada oo aan marka hore STL la soo saarin.","section":"tasks","order":105,"keywords":["heerka daabacaadda","daabacaadda 3d","printer","darbi","u dir printer 3d","slicer","gcode","g-code","usb","klipper","moonraker","octoprint","prusalink","maktabad","u habee","ku dhammaan ku habee","hordhac lakabyada","infill","taageerooyin","filament","pla","petg","kordhin","kordhinta daabacaadda 3d"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"xusuusyo","text":"Xusuusyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerka daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa waxyaabaha darbiga printer-kaaga, wuxuu jarayaa, wuxuuna u diraa printer-ka. Ma aad marka hore fayl soo saarin. Waxay ku jirtaa kordhinta \u003Cstrong\u003EKordhinta daabacaadda 3D\u003C/strong\u003E, taas oo marka hore la shido.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli wax lagu daabacin printer dhab ah oo lagu isticmaalay. Slicer-ku waa cusub: fiiri lakabyada hore ee daabacaadda koowaad, oo isticmaal hordhaca lakabyada ka hor intaadan dirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig moodeel darbiga, hubi inuu ku habboon yahay, eeg lakabyada la jarjaray, oo u dir printer ama kaydi G-code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeerka daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E qalabka. Kaar ayaa furmaa muuqaalka dushiisa, oo qaab jeexjeexyo ah ayaa muujinaya darbigaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar Maktabadda\u003C/strong\u003E, ku qor magac sanduuqa raadinta, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E natiijo kasta. Shayga wuxuu ku dhacaa darbiga cabirka buuxa, ama wuu yaraadaa si uu ugu habboono. Wax kasta oo horay u sawirtay ama u soo dhoofisay oo aad ku aragto muuqaalka ayaa sidoo kale darbiga ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKu darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E, hubi cabirka shay kasta. Shay ku calaamadsan \u003Cstrong\u003EKa baxsan darbiga\u003C/strong\u003E waa in la dhaqaajiyo. Guuri, wareeji oo cabbir waxyaabaha muuqaalka adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee darbiga\u003C/span\u003E si aad shayada u kala fidiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan ku habee darbiga\u003C/span\u003E si aad u yaraysid ilaa ay ku habboon yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EPrinter-kaaga\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro cabirka \u003Cstrong\u003EDarbiga\u003C/strong\u003E ama mid ka mid ah profaylka printer-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDejinta daabacaadda\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETayada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EInfill %\u003C/strong\u003E, oo calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar taageerooyinka hoosta dhaadheera\u003C/strong\u003E haddii qaabku u baahdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHordhac lakabyada\u003C/span\u003E oo guuri slider-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ELakabka\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u eegto lakabyada la jarjaray. Haddii aad wax ka beddesho heerka ama dejinta ka dib, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHordhac lakabyada\u003C/span\u003E mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKable USB\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKlipper (Moonraker)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOctoPrint\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrusaLink\u003C/span\u003E. USB ahaan riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidh\u003C/span\u003E. Printer shabakad ah, ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka\u003C/strong\u003E (iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFuraha API\u003C/strong\u003E haddii ay weydiiso), kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETijaabi xidhiidhka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir daabacaha 3D\u003C/span\u003E. Kaarku wuxuu weydiinayaa in darbiga uu nadiif yahay iyo in agabka saxda ah la rido, wuxuuna muujinayaa waqtiga, agabka iyo heerkulka. Xaqiiji si aad u dirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad heshaa fariin ah in printer-ku bilaabayo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu demiyaa kulaylkii, fanka iyo mootooradii. Haddii aad kaliya fayl rabto, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu kaydi G-code halkii\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xusuusyo\"\u003EXusuusyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUSB waxay u baahan tahay Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar, bogga waa inuu furan yahay ilaa daabacaaddu dhammaato. Xirashadiisu waxay joojisaa socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrinter shabakad ah waa inuu ogolaadaa degaankan (Moonraker ku dar \u003Ccode\u003Ecors_domains\u003C/code\u003E; OctoPrint hur CORS oo koobi furaha API). Browser-kaagu wuu weydiin karaa inuu gaari karo qalabka shabakaddaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba ma xidho, mana dirto gujintaada la&#039;aantood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska slicer-ka waa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESlicer\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft basic (ku jira, ugu degdeg badan)\u003C/span\u003E waa la dhisay. Kiri:Moto, PrusaSlicer, OrcaSlicer iyo Bambu Lab P2S waa kordhin u gaar ah oo aad ku shido kaarka ama hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E. PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waxay isticmaalaan nuqulkaaga u gaar ah oo waxay ka shaqeeyaan CadCraft Studio kombiyuutar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha aan ahayn jidh xidhan waa la reebay, kaarkuna wuxuu kuu sheegaa inta qaabka ay ka mid tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrinter-yada resin-ka, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/resin-printing\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/resin-printing\"\u003EJarista lakabyada printer-ka resin-ka\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad u hubiso ama u hagaajiso moodeel marka hore, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\"\u003ETaageerooyinka, dhumucda darbiga, godaynta iyo hagaajinta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Heerka daabacaadda wuxuu dhigaa waxyaabaha darbiga printer-kaaga, wuxuu jarayaa, wuxuuna u diraa printer-ka. Ma aad marka hore fayl soo saarin. Waxay ku jirtaa kordhinta Kordhinta daabacaadda 3D, taas oo marka hore la shido. Weli wax lagu daabacin printer dhab ah oo lagu isticmaalay. Slicer-ku waa cusub: fiiri lakabyada hore ee daabacaadda koowaad, oo isticmaal hordhaca lakabyada ka hor intaadan dirin. Waxa aad samayn doontid Dhig moodeel darbiga, hubi inuu ku habboon yahay, eeg lakabyada la jarjaray, oo u dir printer ama kaydi G-code. Tallaabooyinka Guji Heerka daabacaadda qalabka. Kaar ayaa furmaa muuqaalka dushiisa, oo qaab jeexjeexyo ah ayaa muujinaya darbigaaga. Hoosta Ku dar Maktabadda, ku qor magac sanduuqa raadinta, riix Raadi oo riix Ku dar natiijo kasta. Shayga wuxuu ku dhacaa darbiga cabirka buuxa, ama wuu yaraadaa si uu ugu habboono. Wax kasta oo horay u sawirtay ama u soo dhoofisay oo aad ku aragto muuqaalka ayaa sidoo kale darbiga ku jira. Hoosta Ku darbiga, hubi cabirka shay kasta. Shay ku calaamadsan Ka baxsan darbiga waa in la dhaqaajiyo. Guuri, wareeji oo cabbir waxyaabaha muuqaalka adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka caadiga ah. Riix Ku habee darbiga si aad shayada u kala fidiso, ama Dhammaan ku habee darbiga si aad u yaraysid ilaa ay ku habboon yihiin. Hoosta Printer-kaaga, dooro cabirka Darbiga ama mid ka mid ah profaylka printer-ka. Hoosta Dejinta daabacaadda, dooro Agabka, Tayada iyo Infill %, oo calaamee Ku dar taageerooyinka hoosta dhaadheera haddii qaabku u baahdo. Riix Hordhac lakabyada oo guuri slider-ka Lakabka si aad u eegto lakabyada la jarjaray. Haddii aad wax ka beddesho heerka ama dejinta ka dib, riix Hordhac lakabyada mar kale. Hoosta Xidhiidh, dooro Kable USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint ama PrusaLink. USB ahaan riix Xidh. Printer shabakad ah, ku qor Cinwaanka (iyo Furaha API haddii ay weydiiso), kadibna riix Tijaabi xidhiidhka. Riix U dir daabacaha 3D. Kaarku wuxuu weydiinayaa in darbiga uu nadiif yahay iyo in agabka saxda ah la rido, wuxuuna muujinayaa waqtiga, agabka iyo heerkulka. Xaqiiji si aad u dirto. Waxaad heshaa fariin ah in printer-ku bilaabayo. Jooji daabacaadda wuxuu demiyaa kulaylkii, fanka iyo mootooradii. Haddii aad kaliya fayl rabto, riix Ku kaydi G-code halkii. Xusuusyo USB waxay u baahan tahay Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar, bogga waa inuu furan yahay ilaa daabacaaddu dhammaato. Xirashadiisu waxay joojisaa socodka. Printer shabakad ah waa inuu ogolaadaa degaankan (Moonraker ku dar cors_domains; OctoPrint hur CORS oo koobi furaha API). Browser-kaagu wuu weydiin karaa inuu gaari karo qalabka shabakaddaada. Waxba ma xidho, mana dirto gujintaada la'aantood. Liiska slicer-ka waa hoosta Slicer. CadCraft basic (ku jira, ugu degdeg badan) waa la dhisay. Kiri:Moto, PrusaSlicer, OrcaSlicer iyo Bambu Lab P2S waa kordhin u gaar ah oo aad ku shido kaarka ama hoosta Dejinta › Kordhinno. PrusaSlicer iyo OrcaSlicer waxay isticmaalaan nuqulkaaga u gaar ah oo waxay ka shaqeeyaan CadCraft Studio kombiyuutar. Qaybaha aan ahayn jidh xidhan waa la reebay, kaarkuna wuxuu kuu sheegaa inta qaabka ay ka mid tahay. Printer-yada resin-ka, eeg Jarista lakabyada printer-ka resin-ka. Si aad u hubiso ama u hagaajiso moodeel marka hore, eeg Taageerooyinka, dhumucda darbiga, godaynta iyo hagaajinta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nurbs-surfaces","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dusha bilaa qaab (NURBS)","summary":"Khadad iyo dusha jilicsan oo loogu talagalay qolofyada alaabta, jidhka baabuurka iyo qolofyada doonta — loft, sweep, shabakadaha khadadka, daboolka afar-geesood, isku-darka, jarka — iyo G0, G1 iyo G2 oo lagu cabbiray dusha saxda ah, jidhad leh isgeyn, ka jar iyo isgoys, aragga zebra iyo curvature, wajiyo lagu habeeyay scan iyo khaladkiisa la cabbiray, iyo faylalka STEP ama IGES.","section":"tasks","order":106,"keywords":["nurbs","scan","reverse engineering","fit","mesh to surface","point cloud","stl","trim","trimmed","hole","cut","solid","solids","boolean","union","subtract","intersect","difference","sew","closed","freeform","free-form","surface","surfaces","b-spline","bspline","curve","spline","loft","sweep","rail","network","coons","patch","blend","match","continuity","g0","g1","g2","tangent","curvature","zebra","control points","knots","degree","step","iges","class a"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-amarku-u-shaqeeyo","text":"Sida amarku u shaqeeyo","level":2},{"id":"khadad","text":"Khadad","level":2},{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-tayada","text":"Hubinta tayada","level":2},{"id":"jarka-dusha","text":"Jarka dusha","level":2},{"id":"jidhadka-iyo-boolean","text":"Jidhadka iyo Boolean","level":2},{"id":"jilicsanaynta-iyo-qaro-yeelka","text":"Jilicsanaynta iyo qaro-yeelka","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo-faylka-step-iyo-iges","text":"Ka noqo, faylka, STEP iyo IGES","level":2},{"id":"dusha-ka-scan-ka-reverse-engineering","text":"Dusha ka scan-ka (reverse engineering)","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka wuxuu sameeyaa khadad iyo dusha jilicsan oo nooca loo isticmaalo qolofyada alaabta, jidhka baabuurka iyo qolofyada doonta: NURBS, isla xisaabta ay isticmaalaan dhismeyaasha dusha kale. Wax walba waxaa lagu cabbiraa dusha saxda ah, weligeed ma aha saddex-geesaha aad aragto. Cabbirrada panel-ka waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitir\u003C/strong\u003E, ayay muujisaa moodeelku unug kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa fur bar-ka midig: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur guddiga Dusha\u003C/span\u003E. Moodeel horey u leh dusha ayaa isla gaarkiisa furmaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-amarku-u-shaqeeyo\"\u003ESida amarku u shaqeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix amar (tusaale ahaan \u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E). Panel-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu wali u baahan yahay: dhibic, khad, geesta dusha ama geesta khadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro: guji iyaga muuqaalka 3D, ama riix \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E (ama badhamada geesta iyo dhamaadka) ee ku xigta mid kasta liiska. Geesta, guji meel u dhow geesta dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi ikhtiyaarrada (darajada, cidhibta, isku-xidhka, …) kadibna riix \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKhadadka laga sameeyo dhibcaha waxaa la siiyaa dhibcaha hal sadar oo kasta (\u003Ccode\u003Ex, y, z\u003C/code\u003E mm), ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro dhibcaha muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E: guji kasta wuxuu isticmaalaa isla isku-xidhka qalabka sawirka; riix &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; ama laba-jibbaar si aad u dhammaysato, &lt;kbd&gt;Esc&lt;/kbd&gt; si aad u joogsato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadad\"\u003EKhadad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhad dhibcaha ku dhex mara\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu mar kasta dhibic walba ku dhex mara. \u003Cstrong\u003EKhad iyo xadhig-xadhig\u003C/strong\u003E waxay raacaa qaab dhibcaha xadhigga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeli koorka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKor u qaad darajada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos u dhig darajada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay beddelaan sida khadka loo qeexo iyada oo aan la dhaqaajin (hoos u dhigidda waa diidaa haddii khadku uu ka dhaqaaqi lahaa cidhibta). \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u dhis khadka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu siiyaa tiro cusub oo xadhigyo ah wuxuuna sheegaa inta uu dhaqaaqay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dheel khadka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa geesta khad mid taabta geesta kale oo G0 (taabasho), G1 (isku jiho) ama G2 (sidoo kale isku qalloocan). \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee khad isku xidh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u dhexeeyaa laba geesood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dar khadadka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKala qaybi khadka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E laba ama ka badan oo khad ah ku dhex mara, \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha toosan\u003C/strong\u003E labo dhexdooda, \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha khadka lagu fidiyo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha khadka lagu wareejiyo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESweep hal rail ku dhex\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaab ku qaadaa jid iyadoo aan la lalaabin, \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep laba rail ku dhex\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa geesaha qaabka labada rail-ka dhexdood. Sweep-yada waa la habeeyay: khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay ku dhowaatay sweep-ka runta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha shabakad khadadka ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku dhex mara shabakad khadadka (dooradda koowaad waa qaabka, kuwa kale waa hagayaasha). \u003Cstrong\u003EDaboolka afar geesood\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa afar khadad oo isku dhacaya geesahooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dheel dusha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa geesta dusha inay taabato deriska G0, G1 ama G2; \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee dusha isku xidh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u dhexeeyaa laba geesood dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha ka-dheelo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFidi dusha\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha way sii socotaa sida ay socotay), \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u dhis dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo koorka iyo darajada dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-tayada\"\u003EHubinta tayada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha wadaagga ah\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa geesaha laba dusha wadaagaan, iyadoo leh furitaanka (mm), xagasha u dhexaysa (°) iyo kor-u-kacida qalloocanka (1/mm), iyo haddii taasi ka dhigayso G0, G1 ama G2. Geesta ka xun intaad codsatay waxaa sidoo kale ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E (badhanka ⚠ app bar-ka) oo leh hagaajin \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dheel\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji sida\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EXariiqyada zebra\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECurvature (Gaussian)\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka yimaadaan dusha saxda ah: xariiqyadu si aan jajab lahayn ugu dhex maraan geesta waxay ka dhigan yihiin G1; xariiqyada kuwaas oo ballaadhintooda ilaalinaya waxay ka dhigan yihiin G2. Curvature waa buluug meesha dusha ay tahay saddle, casaan meesha ay tahay qubbad, cad meesha ay siman tahay. \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta xakamaynta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawiraa shabakadaha xakamaynta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EG0–G2 waxaa lagu cabbiraa 33 dhibcood geesta kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EG3 iyo tayada &quot;class A&quot; lama cabbiro\u003C/strong\u003E mana sheegno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarka-dusha\"\u003EJarka dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJarka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jaraa dusha isaga oo aan beddelin qaabkiisa: dusha wuxuu haya dhammaan xakamaynta dhibcaha, waxaana kaliya lagu muujiyaa, lagu tiriyaa, lagu qorayaa qaybta ku jirta geesta. \u003Cstrong\u003EJar gudaha laydh\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJar goobo\u003C/strong\u003E waxay shaqeeyaan wadaagga (0 ilaa 1) ee dusha jihada kasta, sidaas darteed ma u baahna dooro muuqaalka; \u003Cstrong\u003EJar khad\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa khad xidhan oo ku jira dusha (waa la mashruuciyaa dusha gudaheeda, waana la diidaa haddii ay furan tahay ama ka fog tahay cidhibta). Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EJar hal godad\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u tirtirto gudaha geesta; ka tag madhan si aad u hayso gudaha keliya. Dusha wuxuu haysan karaa hal geesood oo la hayo iyo godad badan; geesood ku dhex jaranaya mid kale waa la diidaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar jarka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa dusha oo dhan. Geesaha jarka ah waxay raacaan geesta si saxda ah; Ka noqo ee panel-ka waxaa lagu qaadaa jarka sida tallaabo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESTEP wuxuu qaadaa jarka sida xadka wejiga, IGES na sida dusha la jaray (entity 144); labadaba way akhriyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidhadka-iyo-boolean\"\u003EJidhadka iyo Boolean\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay dusha u beddeshaa jidh xidhan oo isku darta. Jidh halkan waa set dusha panel-ka oo gaar ah oo wada xidha mugga; wejiyadiisu waxay ahaanayaan dusha NURBS oo saxda ah oo leh jarkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESilinda jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKuraha jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sameeyaan mid cabbirro la qoray (mm): sanduuq oo lix wajiyo siman, silinda oo dhinac wareegsan iyo labo dhamaad siman oo lagu jaray goobada, kuraha dusha wareeg hal mar lagu rogay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidh dusha ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kooxeeyaa dusha aad adigu sameysay. Dooro, ama ha dooran si aad u isticmaasho dhammaan dusha muuqda oo aan weli jidh ku jirin. Waa la isku xidhaa cidhibta: haddii aysan xidhmin, waxba ma beddelmo, panel-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ay furan yihiin iyo sida ay u dhow yihiin ay isku xidhmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jar\u003C/strong\u003E (jidhka labaad waa laga qaadaa kan koowaad) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoys\u003C/strong\u003E (kaliya waxa labaduba wadaagaan) waxay qaadaan laba jidh: guji wejiga mid kasta muuqaalka, ama riix \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EHay labada jidh\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga tagto dhinac natiijada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoolean wuxuu wejiga kasta ku hayaa dusha saxda ah ee u gaar ah, wuxuuna jaraa jarka cusub oo ku salaysan isgoysiga. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siiyaa tirooyinka la cabbiray: intee in le&#039;eg ayay dhibcaha injineriyada jidhka u baahdeen inay ku dhex-dhacaan dusha saxda ah (weligeed ma ka badan cidhibta), intee le&#039;eg ayay dhibcaha isgoysiga u dhow yihiin labada dusha (badanaa dhowr boqolkiiba oo millimitir), mugga, iyo haddii wejiyada cusub mar kale isku xidhmaan markii dib loo xidho dusha saxda ah. Mugga waxaa lagu cabbiraa saddex-geesood cidhibta dhexdeeda (0.05 mm haddii aadan dooran kale), sidaas darteed mugga kubbad ama silinda wuxuu ka akhrisanayaa kan saxda ah wax yar: cidhib yar ayaa dhow. Boolean aan si nadiif ah loo samayn karin (jidhadku waxba ma wadaagaan, jarku wuu isgoysan lahaa) waa la diidaa oo waa la sheegaa, waxna ma beddelo. Boolean hal ayaa tallaabo ka mid ah panel-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka\u003C/strong\u003E dhexdiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa furi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wejiyada ka dhigaa dusha fudud; mashiinka qashinka wuxuu jidhka iyo wejiyadiisa tirtiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E (liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuu koobi ka dhigaa jidhka moodeelka sida koox xidhan oo keliya, wejiyadiisu waa saddex-geesood cidhibta 0.05 mm dhexdeeda, hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo moodeelka. Kadibna wuxuu la shaqeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoys\u003C/strong\u003E ee moodeelka, riix-jiid iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D; jidhka saxda ah wuxuu ku sii jiraa panel-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jilicsanaynta-iyo-qaro-yeelka\"\u003EJilicsanaynta iyo qaro-yeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGees-ku-xidhka ka dhexeeya wajiyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta ay laba wejiyo jidh kulmaan: dooro laba wejiga (muuqaalka, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E liiska), geli \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius\u003C/strong\u003E iyo, haddii radiusku isbedelo geesta dhexdeeda, \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E (0 wuxuu ilaalinayaa hal radius). Kubbad radiuskaas ah ayaa loo rogaa geesta isla markaana taabta labada wejiba; gees-ku-xidhku waa qaansada goobeed ee saxda ah ee ay ka dhigto nuqad kasta, ee la isku xidho hal dusha, labada wejina waa la jaraa meesha kubbadu taabato. Geesta dibadda waxay lumisaa walxo, geesta gudaha ee xagasha ayaa helaysa. Natiijada khadku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa la cabbiray: intee ka fog ayuu gees-ku-xidhku ka yahay kubbadii la rogayay inta u dhaxeysa dhibcaha laga dhisay (dhibcaha waa lagu daraa ilaa ay ku jirto rubuc cidhibta), xagasha ugu weyn ee u dhaxaysa gees-ku-xidhka iyo wejiga kasta khadka taabashada, iyo tirooyinka isku mar ah sida Isku geyn. Radius aan ku habboonayn (kubbadu ka bixi lahayd wejiga, ama wejiga uu ka qalloocan yahay radiuska) waa la diidaa, magaca wejiga la sheegayo, waxna ma beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGees-ku-xidh geesaha badan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa geesaha badan hal tallaabo: dooro laba wejiga geesta koowaad, kadibna laba wejiga geesta xigta, iyo kuwa kale (wejiga wuxuu ku jiri karaa lammaano dhowr ah, tusaale ahaan wejiga sare ee sanduuqa afar ka mid ah); dhammaan geesaha waxay helaan radiuska aad qortay. Wareejinta kastaa waxa lagu soo saaraa jidhka sida uu ahaa, kadibna waa la jaraa mid mid, sidaas darteed amarka ma muhiimka. Meelaha laba geesood oo wareegsan ay isku kulmaan geesaha kale ee adag, gees-ku-xidhka ayaa isku dhaca khadka isgoysiga (laga yaabo inuu isu soo dhowaado). Meelaha saddex geesood oo wareegsan oo saddex wejiyo siman isku kulmaan oo radius isku mid ah leh, geesta waxay noqotaa hal \u003Cstrong\u003Esphere patch\u003C/strong\u003E taabta saddexdaas gees-ku-xidh; ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003EGeeska\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u hesho geesta adag ee dillaacday (geesta waa in ay ahaataa ugu yaraan laba jibbaar radiuska dhererkeeda meelaha labada dhamaadka geeskaas. Natiijada khadku wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ee la wareejiyay iyo sida geeskuna u soo baxay. Geesaha gudaha ayaa sidoo kale la wareejin karaa wadaag, laakiin natiijada aan mar kale xidhmin waxaa kaliya la sheegaa (khadku wuu sheegayaa), sidaas darteed hubi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dhex-dhig jidh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dusha siiyaa qaro: dooro, geli \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaro\u003C/strong\u003E kadibna calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinaca kale\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u kordhiso dhinac kale. Wejiga kor u kacay waa la qaabeeyay oo waa la cabbiray dusha ka dhan (khadka natiijadu wuxuu siiyaa farqiga ugu weyn ee qaroo); darbiyadu waxay raacaan geesta kasta iyo jarka kasta. Haddii dusha uu ka qalloocan yahay qaroo ee dhinacaas, ama qayb kale oo ka mid ah uu ku dhow yahay qaroo, waa la diidaa, magaca dusha iyo goobta la sheegayaa, waxna ma beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-faylka-step-iyo-iges\"\u003EKa noqo, faylka, STEP iyo IGES\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E gaar ah (hal tallaabo amar kasta). Dusha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E iyada oo moodeelka la socda; ma ahan qayb ka mid ah ka-noqoshada moodeelka, sida agabka faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP…\u003C/strong\u003E (AP242) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIGES…\u003C/strong\u003E waxay kaydiyaan khadadka iyo dusha sida ay yihiin (xadhigyada B-spline iyo dusha, waxba looma beddelin saddex-geesood). Dusha kasta waa wejigeeda, leh jarkeeda; jidhka waxaa loo qoraa hal shell xidhan, geesta kasta oo labada wejiyo wadaagaan, sida ay u rabaan barnaamijyada CAD ee kale (qoraalka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa jidhadka inta la dhoofiyay sidaas). IGES-ka jidhka isku mid waa hal B-rep jidh manifold ah (entity 186 oo ku xidhan shell xidhan 514, wejiyo 510, loops 508, hal liis geesood 504 iyo liis dhibcood 502); jidh aan wejiyadiisu si geesood ahaan u isku dhicin waa la qoraa wejiyo gooni ah, khadku wuu sheegaa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa jidh sida jidh, STEP-ka iyo IGES-ka labadaba. Wuxuu akhriyaa khadad iyo dusha oo sidaas loo qoray, iyo kooxyada \u003Ccode\u003E.ccnurbs\u003C/code\u003E; jidhadka STEP ee barnaamijyada kale waxay ku furmaan File › Import sida meshes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-ka-scan-ka-reverse-engineering\"\u003EDusha ka scan-ka (reverse engineering)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro mesh-ka la scan-gareeyay moodeelka (haddii waxba la doorto, waa wax kasta oo la muujiyay), fur \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EKu habee dusha scan-ka\u003C/strong\u003E. Qalabku wuxuu raadiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ediyaaradaha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esilinderrada\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubbadaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekonsyada\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha saxda ah ee qaybta shaqaysan ka samaysan tahay; safka kastaa wuxuu muujiyaa radiuska ama nus-xagasha uu helay), wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egees-ku-xidhyada\u003C/strong\u003E (geesaha iyo geesaha wareegsan: silinder yar ama kubbad yar oo taabta laba ama in ka badan wejiyo kale, lagu muujiyay radiuskeeda iyo wejiyada ay isku xidhayaan), \u003Cstrong\u003Egees-ku-xidhyada geesha\u003C/strong\u003E (torus: geesta wareegsan ee wejiga siman uu kulmo silinder ama koon, lagu muujiyay radiuskeeda iyo radiuska giraanta) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Egees-ku-xidhyo doorsoon\u003C/strong\u003E (geesta wareegsan ee radiuskeeda uu isbedelo geesta dhexdeeda, lagu muujiyay radiuska dhamaan labada dhamaadka), wuxuu ku habeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal qayb dusha bilaa qaab\u003C/strong\u003E qayb jilicsan oo khafiif ah, wuxuuna jaraa wejiga kasta jihada qayb scan-ka uu ka yimid, sidaas darteed godadka iyo geesaha way ilaalisaa. Ikhtiyaarrada: \u003Cstrong\u003Ecidhibta\u003C/strong\u003E (intee le&#039;eg mm ayuu dhibic scan-ka ka fogaan karaa diyaaradda ama silinderka oo wali uu ka mid yahay, iyo bartilmaameedka qaybta bilaa qaab), \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E (qayb ka mid ah dusha dhulka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewejiyada ugu badan\u003C/strong\u003E. Scan-ka iyo ikhtiyaarradaas isku mar had iyo jeer waxay soo saaraan wejiyo isku mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijadu waa miis, hal safka wejigiiba: nooceeda, inta saddex-geesood ay ka timid, iyo khaladka \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga cabbiray scan-ka wejiga\u003C/strong\u003E (rms, kan ugu weyn, iyo qaybta dhibcaha ku jira cidhibta). Dhibcaha la cabbiray waa dhibcaha scan-ka iyo dhexda saddex-geesood kasta. Khaladka lama cabbiro dhinaca kale (wejiga ilaa scan-ka), sidaas darteed dusha ka fog scan-ka ma muuqan doono. Qoraalka hoose miiska ayaa sidoo kale sheegaa inta dhulka ay ahayd mid yar oo aan lagu habayn karin. Muuqaalka, dhibcaha scan-ka waxaa midabeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003Ekhariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha\u003C/strong\u003E: buluug wejiga dushiisa, cagaar nus-jid cidhibta, casaan cidhibta ama ka badan (ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji khariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u qariso). Qaybaha isu-soo-noqda (tiyuub la xidhay oo lagu habeeyay dusha bilaa qaab, tusaale ahaan) waxaa lagu liistaa inaan la habeyn, weligeed looma qasbo dusha mid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha ku-xidh jidh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku dhejiyaa dusha kasta oo la muujiyay oo aan jidh ku jirin jidh xidhan oo keliya. Waxay isku xidhaan cidhibta: dusha scan-ka wuxuu isku taabtaa oo keliya khaladka scan-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu isku dayaa masaafada isku xidhka ugu yar ee xidha (weligeed kan ugu badan ee aad dejiso \u003Cstrong\u003Emasaafada ku xidhka\u003C/strong\u003E) wuxuuna diidaa qoraal ahaan marka wejiyadu aan xidhmin. Ma sameeyo godad; ka dibna jidhka waxaa lagu shaqeeyaa Isku geyn, Ka jar, Isgoys iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aan sameyn: \u003Cstrong\u003Erim fillet\u003C/strong\u003E (torus) waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya wareegga silinder ama koon horey loo helay, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Evariable fillet\u003C/strong\u003E oo keliya geesta toos u ah (qaybaha ayaa laga jaraa hal jihada si toos ah); meelaha kale waxay ku soo baxaan sida daboolyo dusha bilaa qaab markii ay siman yihiin, waxaana laga reebaa markii kale; kubbadaha, konsyada iyo gees-ku-xidhyada waxaa la helaa iyada oo la isticmaalayo tusaale aan kala-saarnayn, sidaas darteed kuwa aad u yar (dhowr saddex-geesood) way lumi karaan; khariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha waxay muujisaa masaafada ka scan-ka ilaa wejiyada, ma aha dhinaca kale; scan-ka aad u weyn (ka badan 300,000 saddex-geesood) waa la diidaa halkan. Wejiyada silinder wareeg buuxa ah waxaa lagu jaraa godadka ku wareegsan, ilkaha waxaa la dhigaa meel aan godad ku jirin. Hubi wejiga kasta scan-kaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha isku dhaca geesaha dusha wareegsan ama leh radiuska kala duwan (isku-xidhka dhibcaha), gees-ku-xidh laba wejiyo aan isku taabanin, gees-ku-xidh gudaha oo ku dhammaysa wejiga xagasha ama wareegsan, iyo Boolean-ka iyo gees-ku-xidhyada lagu xisaabiyo dusha aan saddex-geesood lahayn (halkan injineriyada jidhka wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa saddex-geesood cidhibta dhexdeeda, dhibic walbana ayaa markaas dib loogu celiyaa dusha saxda ah).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dusha panel-ka wuxuu sameeyaa khadad iyo dusha jilicsan oo nooca loo isticmaalo qolofyada alaabta, jidhka baabuurka iyo qolofyada doonta: NURBS, isla xisaabta ay isticmaalaan dhismeyaasha dusha kale. Wax walba waxaa lagu cabbiraa dusha saxda ah, weligeed ma aha saddex-geesaha aad aragto. Cabbirrada panel-ka waa millimitir, ayay muujisaa moodeelku unug kasta. Ka fur bar-ka midig: Dusha › Fur guddiga Dusha. Moodeel horey u leh dusha ayaa isla gaarkiisa furmaya. Sida amarku u shaqeeyo Riix amar (tusaale ahaan Loft). Panel-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa uu wali u baahan yahay: dhibic, khad, geesta dusha ama geesta khadka. Dooro: guji iyaga muuqaalka 3D, ama riix Dooro (ama badhamada geesta iyo dhamaadka) ee ku xigta mid kasta liiska. Geesta, guji meel u dhow geesta dusha. Hubi ikhtiyaarrada (darajada, cidhibta, isku-xidhka, …) kadibna riix Samee. Khadadka laga sameeyo dhibcaha waxaa la siiyaa dhibcaha hal sadar oo kasta (x, y, z mm), ama Dooro dhibcaha muuqaalka: guji kasta wuxuu isticmaalaa isla isku-xidhka qalabka sawirka; riix \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba-jibbaar si aad u dhammaysato, \u003Ckbd\u003EEsc\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joogsato. Khadad Khad dhibcaha ku dhex mara wuxuu mar kasta dhibic walba ku dhex mara. Khad iyo xadhig-xadhig waxay raacaa qaab dhibcaha xadhigga ah. Geli koorka, Kor u qaad darajada iyo Hoos u dhig darajada waxay beddelaan sida khadka loo qeexo iyada oo aan la dhaqaajin (hoos u dhigidda waa diidaa haddii khadku uu ka dhaqaaqi lahaa cidhibta). Dib u dhis khadka wuxuu siiyaa tiro cusub oo xadhigyo ah wuxuuna sheegaa inta uu dhaqaaqay. Isku-dheel khadka wuxuu ka dhigaa geesta khad mid taabta geesta kale oo G0 (taabasho), G1 (isku jiho) ama G2 (sidoo kale isku qalloocan). Samee khad isku xidh wuxuu u dhexeeyaa laba geesood. Isku-dar khadadka iyo Kala qaybi khadka. Dusha Loft laba ama ka badan oo khad ah ku dhex mara, Dusha toosan labo dhexdooda, Dusha khadka lagu fidiyo, Dusha khadka lagu wareejiyo. Sweep hal rail ku dhex wuxuu qaab ku qaadaa jid iyadoo aan la lalaabin, Sweep laba rail ku dhex wuxuu ilaaliyaa geesaha qaabka labada rail-ka dhexdood. Sweep-yada waa la habeeyay: khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay ku dhowaatay sweep-ka runta ah. Dusha shabakad khadadka ka wuxuu ku dhex mara shabakad khadadka (dooradda koowaad waa qaabka, kuwa kale waa hagayaasha). Daboolka afar geesood wuxuu buuxiyaa afar khadad oo isku dhacaya geesahooda. Isku-dheel dusha wuxuu ka dhigaa geesta dusha inay taabato deriska G0, G1 ama G2; Samee dusha isku xidh wuxuu u dhexeeyaa laba geesood dusha. Dusha ka-dheelo, Fidi dusha (dusha way sii socotaa sida ay socotay), Dib u dhis dusha, iyo koorka iyo darajada dusha. Hubinta tayada Miiska Geesaha wadaagga ah wuxuu liistaa geesaha laba dusha wadaagaan, iyadoo leh furitaanka (mm), xagasha u dhexaysa (°) iyo kor-u-kacida qalloocanka (1/mm), iyo haddii taasi ka dhigayso G0, G1 ama G2. Geesta ka xun intaad codsatay waxaa sidoo kale ku jira Dhibaatooyinka (badhanka ⚠ app bar-ka) oo leh hagaajin Isku-dheel. Muuji sida › Xariiqyada zebra iyo Curvature (Gaussian) waxay ka yimaadaan dusha saxda ah: xariiqyadu si aan jajab lahayn ugu dhex maraan geesta waxay ka dhigan yihiin G1; xariiqyada kuwaas oo ballaadhintooda ilaalinaya waxay ka dhigan yihiin G2. Curvature waa buluug meesha dusha ay tahay saddle, casaan meesha ay tahay qubbad, cad meesha ay siman tahay. Barta xakamaynta wuxuu sawiraa shabakadaha xakamaynta. G0–G2 waxaa lagu cabbiraa 33 dhibcood geesta kasta. G3 iyo tayada \"class A\" lama cabbiro mana sheegno. Jarka dusha Kooxda Jarka wuxuu jaraa dusha isaga oo aan beddelin qaabkiisa: dusha wuxuu haya dhammaan xakamaynta dhibcaha, waxaana kaliya lagu muujiyaa, lagu tiriyaa, lagu qorayaa qaybta ku jirta geesta. Jar gudaha laydh iyo Jar goobo waxay shaqeeyaan wadaagga (0 ilaa 1) ee dusha jihada kasta, sidaas darteed ma u baahna dooro muuqaalka; Jar khad wuxuu qaadaa khad xidhan oo ku jira dusha (waa la mashruuciyaa dusha gudaheeda, waana la diidaa haddii ay furan tahay ama ka fog tahay cidhibta). Calaamadee Jar hal godad si aad u tirtirto gudaha geesta; ka tag madhan si aad u hayso gudaha keliya. Dusha wuxuu haysan karaa hal geesood oo la hayo iyo godad badan; geesood ku dhex jaranaya mid kale waa la diidaa. Ka saar jarka wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa dusha oo dhan. Geesaha jarka ah waxay raacaan geesta si saxda ah; Ka noqo ee panel-ka waxaa lagu qaadaa jarka sida tallaabo kasta. STEP wuxuu qaadaa jarka sida xadka wejiga, IGES na sida dusha la jaray (entity 144); labadaba way akhriyaan. Jidhadka iyo Boolean Kooxda Jidhka waxay dusha u beddeshaa jidh xidhan oo isku darta. Jidh halkan waa set dusha panel-ka oo gaar ah oo wada xidha mugga; wejiyadiisu waxay ahaanayaan dusha NURBS oo saxda ah oo leh jarkooda. Sanduuqa jidhka, Silinda jidhka iyo Kuraha jidhka waxay sameeyaan mid cabbirro la qoray (mm): sanduuq oo lix wajiyo siman, silinda oo dhinac wareegsan iyo labo dhamaad siman oo lagu jaray goobada, kuraha dusha wareeg hal mar lagu rogay. Jidh dusha ka wuxuu kooxeeyaa dusha aad adigu sameysay. Dooro, ama ha dooran si aad u isticmaasho dhammaan dusha muuqda oo aan weli jidh ku jirin. Waa la isku xidhaa cidhibta: haddii aysan xidhmin, waxba ma beddelmo, panel-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ay furan yihiin iyo sida ay u dhow yihiin ay isku xidhmaan. Isku geyn, Ka jar (jidhka labaad waa laga qaadaa kan koowaad) iyo Isgoys (kaliya waxa labaduba wadaagaan) waxay qaadaan laba jidh: guji wejiga mid kasta muuqaalka, ama riix Dooro liiska Jidhka. Calaamadee Hay labada jidh si aad uga tagto dhinac natiijada. Boolean wuxuu wejiga kasta ku hayaa dusha saxda ah ee u gaar ah, wuxuuna jaraa jarka cusub oo ku salaysan isgoysiga. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siiyaa tirooyinka la cabbiray: intee in le'eg ayay dhibcaha injineriyada jidhka u baahdeen inay ku dhex-dhacaan dusha saxda ah (weligeed ma ka badan cidhibta), intee le'eg ayay dhibcaha isgoysiga u dhow yihiin labada dusha (badanaa dhowr boqolkiiba oo millimitir), mugga, iyo haddii wejiyada cusub mar kale isku xidhmaan markii dib loo xidho dusha saxda ah. Mugga waxaa lagu cabbiraa saddex-geesood cidhibta dhexdeeda (0.05 mm haddii aadan dooran kale), sidaas darteed mugga kubbad ama silinda wuxuu ka akhrisanayaa kan saxda ah wax yar: cidhib yar ayaa dhow. Boolean aan si nadiif ah loo samayn karin (jidhadku waxba ma wadaagaan, jarku wuu isgoysan lahaa) waa la diidaa oo waa la sheegaa, waxna ma beddelo. Boolean hal ayaa tallaabo ka mid ah panel-ka Ka noqo. Liiska Jidhka dhexdiisa, Ka furi wuxuu wejiyada ka dhigaa dusha fudud; mashiinka qashinka wuxuu jidhka iyo wejiyadiisa tirtiraa. Ku dar moodeelka (liiska Jidhka) wuxuu koobi ka dhigaa jidhka moodeelka sida koox xidhan oo keliya, wejiyadiisu waa saddex-geesood cidhibta 0.05 mm dhexdeeda, hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo moodeelka. Kadibna wuxuu la shaqeeyaa Isku geyn, Ka jar iyo Isgoys ee moodeelka, riix-jiid iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D; jidhka saxda ah wuxuu ku sii jiraa panel-ka. Jilicsanaynta iyo qaro-yeelka Gees-ku-xidhka ka dhexeeya wajiyada wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta ay laba wejiyo jidh kulmaan: dooro laba wejiga (muuqaalka, ama Dooro liiska), geli radius iyo, haddii radiusku isbedelo geesta dhexdeeda, radius dhamaadka (0 wuxuu ilaalinayaa hal radius). Kubbad radiuskaas ah ayaa loo rogaa geesta isla markaana taabta labada wejiba; gees-ku-xidhku waa qaansada goobeed ee saxda ah ee ay ka dhigto nuqad kasta, ee la isku xidho hal dusha, labada wejina waa la jaraa meesha kubbadu taabato. Geesta dibadda waxay lumisaa walxo, geesta gudaha ee xagasha ayaa helaysa. Natiijada khadku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa la cabbiray: intee ka fog ayuu gees-ku-xidhku ka yahay kubbadii la rogayay inta u dhaxeysa dhibcaha laga dhisay (dhibcaha waa lagu daraa ilaa ay ku jirto rubuc cidhibta), xagasha ugu weyn ee u dhaxaysa gees-ku-xidhka iyo wejiga kasta khadka taabashada, iyo tirooyinka isku mar ah sida Isku geyn. Radius aan ku habboonayn (kubbadu ka bixi lahayd wejiga, ama wejiga uu ka qalloocan yahay radiuska) waa la diidaa, magaca wejiga la sheegayo, waxna ma beddelo. Gees-ku-xidh geesaha badan wuxuu wareejiyaa geesaha badan hal tallaabo: dooro laba wejiga geesta koowaad, kadibna laba wejiga geesta xigta, iyo kuwa kale (wejiga wuxuu ku jiri karaa lammaano dhowr ah, tusaale ahaan wejiga sare ee sanduuqa afar ka mid ah); dhammaan geesaha waxay helaan radiuska aad qortay. Wareejinta kastaa waxa lagu soo saaraa jidhka sida uu ahaa, kadibna waa la jaraa mid mid, sidaas darteed amarka ma muhiimka. Meelaha laba geesood oo wareegsan ay isku kulmaan geesaha kale ee adag, gees-ku-xidhka ayaa isku dhaca khadka isgoysiga (laga yaabo inuu isu soo dhowaado). Meelaha saddex geesood oo wareegsan oo saddex wejiyo siman isku kulmaan oo radius isku mid ah leh, geesta waxay noqotaa hal sphere patch taabta saddexdaas gees-ku-xidh; ka saar Geeska si aad u hesho geesta adag ee dillaacday (geesta waa in ay ahaataa ugu yaraan laba jibbaar radiuska dhererkeeda meelaha labada dhamaadka geeskaas. Natiijada khadku wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ee la wareejiyay iyo sida geeskuna u soo baxay. Geesaha gudaha ayaa sidoo kale la wareejin karaa wadaag, laakiin natiijada aan mar kale xidhmin waxaa kaliya la sheegaa (khadku wuu sheegayaa), sidaas darteed hubi. Ku dhex-dhig jidh wuxuu dusha siiyaa qaro: dooro, geli qaro kadibna calaamadee Dhinaca kale si aad u kordhiso dhinac kale. Wejiga kor u kacay waa la qaabeeyay oo waa la cabbiray dusha ka dhan (khadka natiijadu wuxuu siiyaa farqiga ugu weyn ee qaroo); darbiyadu waxay raacaan geesta kasta iyo jarka kasta. Haddii dusha uu ka qalloocan yahay qaroo ee dhinacaas, ama qayb kale oo ka mid ah uu ku dhow yahay qaroo, waa la diidaa, magaca dusha iyo goobta la sheegayaa, waxna ma beddelo. Ka noqo, faylka, STEP iyo IGES Panel-ka wuxuu leeyahay Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale gaar ah (hal tallaabo amar kasta). Dusha waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft iyada oo moodeelka la socda; ma ahan qayb ka mid ah ka-noqoshada moodeelka, sida agabka faylka. STEP… (AP242) iyo IGES… waxay kaydiyaan khadadka iyo dusha sida ay yihiin (xadhigyada B-spline iyo dusha, waxba looma beddelin saddex-geesood). Dusha kasta waa wejigeeda, leh jarkeeda; jidhka waxaa loo qoraa hal shell xidhan, geesta kasta oo labada wejiyo wadaagaan, sida ay u rabaan barnaamijyada CAD ee kale (qoraalka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa jidhadka inta la dhoofiyay sidaas). IGES-ka jidhka isku mid waa hal B-rep jidh manifold ah (entity 186 oo ku xidhan shell xidhan 514, wejiyo 510, loops 508, hal liis geesood 504 iyo liis dhibcood 502); jidh aan wejiyadiisu si geesood ahaan u isku dhicin waa la qoraa wejiyo gooni ah, khadku wuu sheegaa. Soo dhoofi… wuxuu akhriyaa jidh sida jidh, STEP-ka iyo IGES-ka labadaba. Wuxuu akhriyaa khadad iyo dusha oo sidaas loo qoray, iyo kooxyada .ccnurbs; jidhadka STEP ee barnaamijyada kale waxay ku furmaan File › Import sida meshes. Dusha ka scan-ka (reverse engineering) Dooro mesh-ka la scan-gareeyay moodeelka (haddii waxba la doorto, waa wax kasta oo la muujiyay), fur Dusha, kadibna kooxda Scan dooro Ku habee dusha scan-ka. Qalabku wuxuu raadiyaa diyaaradaha, silinderrada, kubbadaha iyo konsyada (dusha saxda ah ee qaybta shaqaysan ka samaysan tahay; safka kastaa wuxuu muujiyaa radiuska ama nus-xagasha uu helay), wuxuu helaa gees-ku-xidhyada (geesaha iyo geesaha wareegsan: silinder yar ama kubbad yar oo taabta laba ama in ka badan wejiyo kale, lagu muujiyay radiuskeeda iyo wejiyada ay isku xidhayaan), gees-ku-xidhyada geesha (torus: geesta wareegsan ee wejiga siman uu kulmo silinder ama koon, lagu muujiyay radiuskeeda iyo radiuska giraanta) iyo gees-ku-xidhyo doorsoon (geesta wareegsan ee radiuskeeda uu isbedelo geesta dhexdeeda, lagu muujiyay radiuska dhamaan labada dhamaadka), wuxuu ku habeeyaa hal qayb dusha bilaa qaab qayb jilicsan oo khafiif ah, wuxuuna jaraa wejiga kasta jihada qayb scan-ka uu ka yimid, sidaas darteed godadka iyo geesaha way ilaalisaa. Ikhtiyaarrada: cidhibta (intee le'eg mm ayuu dhibic scan-ka ka fogaan karaa diyaaradda ama silinderka oo wali uu ka mid yahay, iyo bartilmaameedka qaybta bilaa qaab), qaybta ugu yar (qayb ka mid ah dusha dhulka) iyo wejiyada ugu badan. Scan-ka iyo ikhtiyaarradaas isku mar had iyo jeer waxay soo saaraan wejiyo isku mid ah. Natiijadu waa miis, hal safka wejigiiba: nooceeda, inta saddex-geesood ay ka timid, iyo khaladka laga cabbiray scan-ka wejiga (rms, kan ugu weyn, iyo qaybta dhibcaha ku jira cidhibta). Dhibcaha la cabbiray waa dhibcaha scan-ka iyo dhexda saddex-geesood kasta. Khaladka lama cabbiro dhinaca kale (wejiga ilaa scan-ka), sidaas darteed dusha ka fog scan-ka ma muuqan doono. Qoraalka hoose miiska ayaa sidoo kale sheegaa inta dhulka ay ahayd mid yar oo aan lagu habayn karin. Muuqaalka, dhibcaha scan-ka waxaa midabeeyay khariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha: buluug wejiga dushiisa, cagaar nus-jid cidhibta, casaan cidhibta ama ka badan (ka saar Muuji khariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha si aad u qariso). Qaybaha isu-soo-noqda (tiyuub la xidhay oo lagu habeeyay dusha bilaa qaab, tusaale ahaan) waxaa lagu liistaa inaan la habeyn, weligeed looma qasbo dusha mid. Dusha ku-xidh jidh wuxuu isku dhejiyaa dusha kasta oo la muujiyay oo aan jidh ku jirin jidh xidhan oo keliya. Waxay isku xidhaan cidhibta: dusha scan-ka wuxuu isku taabtaa oo keliya khaladka scan-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu isku dayaa masaafada isku xidhka ugu yar ee xidha (weligeed kan ugu badan ee aad dejiso masaafada ku xidhka) wuxuuna diidaa qoraal ahaan marka wejiyadu aan xidhmin. Ma sameeyo godad; ka dibna jidhka waxaa lagu shaqeeyaa Isku geyn, Ka jar, Isgoys iyo Ku dar moodeelka. Waxa aan sameyn: rim fillet (torus) waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya wareegga silinder ama koon horey loo helay, iyo variable fillet oo keliya geesta toos u ah (qaybaha ayaa laga jaraa hal jihada si toos ah); meelaha kale waxay ku soo baxaan sida daboolyo dusha bilaa qaab markii ay siman yihiin, waxaana laga reebaa markii kale; kubbadaha, konsyada iyo gees-ku-xidhyada waxaa la helaa iyada oo la isticmaalayo tusaale aan kala-saarnayn, sidaas darteed kuwa aad u yar (dhowr saddex-geesood) way lumi karaan; khariidadda kala-duwanaanshaha waxay muujisaa masaafada ka scan-ka ilaa wejiyada, ma aha dhinaca kale; scan-ka aad u weyn (ka badan 300,000 saddex-geesood) waa la diidaa halkan. Wejiyada silinder wareeg buuxa ah waxaa lagu jaraa godadka ku wareegsan, ilkaha waxaa la dhigaa meel aan godad ku jirin. Hubi wejiga kasta scan-kaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan. Weli lama dhisin Geesaha isku dhaca geesaha dusha wareegsan ama leh radiuska kala duwan (isku-xidhka dhibcaha), gees-ku-xidh laba wejiyo aan isku taabanin, gees-ku-xidh gudaha oo ku dhammaysa wejiga xagasha ama wareegsan, iyo Boolean-ka iyo gees-ku-xidhyada lagu xisaabiyo dusha aan saddex-geesood lahayn (halkan injineriyada jidhka wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa saddex-geesood cidhibta dhexdeeda, dhibic walbana ayaa markaas dib loogu celiyaa dusha saxda ah).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nodes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Nuqadaha: samee moodeel adigoo isku xidhaya","summary":"Lambaro tirooyin ku xidh barta, barta ku xidh khadadka, khadadka ku xidh dusha. Tiro beddel oo wax kasta oo ka dambeeya ayaa dib u dhisma. Nuqad walba waa khad CraftScript, jaantuskuna waxa uu ku kaydsan yahay faylka.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["nuqadaha","tafatirka nuqadaha","qoraal muuqaal","cabbir","jaantus","silig","isku xidhka","xuduudaha","bilaa qaab","freeform","nurbs","loft","extrude","revolve","goobo","khad","dusha","taxane","kala duwan","random","liis","script","craftscript","grasshopper"],"headings":[{"id":"xidhka","text":"Xidhka","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-iyo-cabbirrada","text":"Noocyada iyo cabbirrada","level":2},{"id":"jidh-iyo-boolean-nuqadahaan","text":"Jidh iyo Boolean nuqadahaan","level":2},{"id":"qaladaad","text":"Qaladaad","level":2},{"id":"nuqad-walba-waa-khad-qoraal","text":"Nuqad walba waa khad qoraal","level":2},{"id":"waxa-lagu-kaydiyay-faylka","text":"Waxa lagu kaydiyay faylka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhex-dhig-moodeelka","text":"Ku dhex dhig moodeelka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETafatirka nuqadaha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhisaa joomitari isagoo isku xidhaya sanduuqyo. Sanduuq kasta (nuqad) wuxuu qabtaa shaqo yar: wuxuu sameeyaa tiro, barta, goobo, loft. Natiijada mid ayaad ku xidhaysaa geliska xigta, moodeelkuna wuu raacaa marka aad tiro bilowga ku beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa fur bar-ka midig: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqadaha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENuqadaha…\u003C/span\u003E. Fayl horey u leh jaantus ayaa isla gaarkiisa furmaysa. Waa daaqad ku taal muuqaalka 3D: jiid cinwaanka si aad u guurto, jiid geeska si aad u cabbirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhka\"\u003EXidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nuqad liiska bidix (ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u yareyso, &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; wuxuu ku daraa kan ugu horreeya ee iswaafaqa). Waxay ka soo muuqataa bartanka dhexe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa jiid dhibic wareegsan \u003Cstrong\u003Ewax-soo-saar\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal midig nuqad, ilaa dhibic wareegsan \u003Cstrong\u003Egeli\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal bidix nuqad kale. Dhibicdu waxay noqotaa cagaar marka ay ku habboonaato, casaan marka aysan habboonayn; u tilmaam si aad sababta u hesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeli aan wax lagu xidhin wuxuu muujiyaa sanduuq qiimo qori karo. Qor tiro oo riix &lt;kbd&gt;Tab&lt;/kbd&gt;: natiijadu dib ayey u dhisma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeggii yar ee ku taal cinwaanka nuqadda waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eindhaha\u003C/strong\u003E. Nuqad indhaha lagu daray waxay ku muuqataa muuqaalka 3D, khadad ahaan khadadka, dusha iftiin-ku-wareegsan, dhibcaha dhibic ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqad jiid cinwaankeeda. Jiid asalka si aad u dhaqaaqdo, dabka wheel-ka si aad u weynayso. &lt;kbd&gt;Delete&lt;/kbd&gt; wuxuu tirtiraa nuqadda la doortay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nuqadaha u habeeyaa tiirar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammaantood ku keenaa aragga, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku socdaan tafatirradaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-iyo-cabbirrada\"\u003ENoocyada iyo cabbirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeliyada waxay leeyihiin nooc: tiro, haa/maya, barta, vector, khad, dusha, mesh, jidh, ama &quot;joomitari&quot; oo ah mid kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ah. Barta waxay quudin kartaa geli vector ah iyo dib. Tirooyinku waxay leeyihiin cabbir: \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku qoran yahay millimitir, \u003Cstrong\u003Exagal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku qoran yahay darajo. Dherer ma quudin karo xagal, dherer marka lagu dhufto dherer (sare) waa la diidaa, sidaas darteed silig qaldan waa la joojiyaa markaad sameysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba-jibbaaran oo madow waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eliis\u003C/strong\u003E. Liis marka uu gaaro geli hal qiimo ah, nuqaddu waxay ku shaqeysaa mar kasta oo shay walba oo liiska ka mid ah, natiijadeedna waxay noqotaa liis. Liiska gaaban qiimihiisii ugu dambeeyay ayuu ku celiyaa. Tusaale ahaan, \u003Cstrong\u003ETaxane\u003C/strong\u003E oo dhererro ah oo gashay \u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa xidh koobiyo ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidh-iyo-boolean-nuqadahaan\"\u003EJidh iyo Boolean nuqadahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sameysaa jidhar xidhan oo ka yimid dusha isku mid ah sida bartanka Dusha: \u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESilinda jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKuraha jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E (cabbirada millimitir), \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoys\u003C/strong\u003E (jidhka labaad waxaa laga qaadaa kan koowaad; cidhibta waa fogaanta ay saxanaanta ku dhacdaan ee jidhka injineriyaha ay ka durkaan dusha saxda ah), \u003Cstrong\u003EGees-ku-xidhka ka dhexeeya wajiyada\u003C/strong\u003E (wajiyada iyada oo lambarkooda ku jira jidhka, 1 waa kan koowaad; halkan waxaa ku jira radius iyo, ka weyn 0, radius dhamaadka), \u003Cstrong\u003EMugga jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E (mm³) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka u beddel mesh\u003C/strong\u003E (si loo arko ama loo kaydiyo). Jidhka wuxuu leeyahay nooc gaar ah oo geli ah: dhibic ama tiro ma xidhmi karaan geli jidh, dhibicna waxay ahaanaysaa casaan. Nuqadaha Boolean iyo Gees-ku-xidhka waxay isticmaalaan injineriyada jidhka ee barnaamijka, oo la soo rari karo markii ugu horreysay ee tafatirku furmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaladaad\"\u003EQaladaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqad aan qabanin shaqadeeda waxay sheegaa sababta magaceeda hoostiisa, casaan ahaan (&quot;Radiusku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber.&quot;), nuqadaha ka dambeeyana way sugaan. Isla fariintaas waxay ku muuqataa Dhibaato bartanka Dhibaatooyinka, halkaas laga heli karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqad-walba-waa-khad-qoraal\"\u003ENuqad walba waa khad qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto jaantuska sida CraftScript: hal khad nuqad kasta, sida \u003Ccode\u003En3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);\u003C/code\u003E. Qoraalka wax ka beddel, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa samee jaantuska qoraalkan\u003C/span\u003E si aad jaantuska dib ugu soo celiso. Shaqooyinka \u003Ccode\u003End_\u003C/code\u003E ee isla CraftScript-ka ee PartCraft ayey shaqeeyaan, sidaas darteed jaantuska waa la socon karaa, wareegi karaa, ama tijaabin karaa halkaas. Tirooyinka random had iyo jeer waxay qaadaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eseed\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed isla jaantuska wuxuu siiyaa isla natiijada kombuterka kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-lagu-kaydiyay-faylka\"\u003EWaxa lagu kaydiyay faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJaantuska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka moodeelka. Nuqadaha waxay sameeyaan khadad, dusha iyo mesh gaar ah: ma beddelayaan wejiyada moodeelka ilaa aad weydiisato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhex-dhig-moodeelka\"\u003EKu dhex dhig moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIndhaha nuqad dusha ama mesh sameysa u shid, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhex dhig moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda Nuqadaha. Dusha ama mesh kasta oo la muujiyay wuxuu noqonayaa kooxda wejiyada moodeelka, oo ku qoran mitir, sida qayb kasta oo kale. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Jaantuska ayuu hadhaa, laakiin nuqulka ma raacayo tan: tiro beddel oo ku dhex dhig mar kale si aad mid cusub u hesho. Dhibcaha iyo khadadka lama dhigi karo jidh, sidaas darteed waa laga tagaa, fariintuna waxay sheegaysaa tirada.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tafatirka nuqadaha wuxuu dhisaa joomitari isagoo isku xidhaya sanduuqyo. Sanduuq kasta (nuqad) wuxuu qabtaa shaqo yar: wuxuu sameeyaa tiro, barta, goobo, loft. Natiijada mid ayaad ku xidhaysaa geliska xigta, moodeelkuna wuu raacaa marka aad tiro bilowga ku beddesho. Ka fur bar-ka midig: Nuqadaha › Nuqadaha…. Fayl horey u leh jaantus ayaa isla gaarkiisa furmaysa. Waa daaqad ku taal muuqaalka 3D: jiid cinwaanka si aad u guurto, jiid geeska si aad u cabbirto. Xidhka Dooro nuqad liiska bidix (ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u yareyso, \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku daraa kan ugu horreeya ee iswaafaqa). Waxay ka soo muuqataa bartanka dhexe. Ka jiid dhibic wareegsan wax-soo-saar oo ku taal midig nuqad, ilaa dhibic wareegsan geli oo ku taal bidix nuqad kale. Dhibicdu waxay noqotaa cagaar marka ay ku habboonaato, casaan marka aysan habboonayn; u tilmaam si aad sababta u hesho. Geli aan wax lagu xidhin wuxuu muujiyaa sanduuq qiimo qori karo. Qor tiro oo riix \u003Ckbd\u003ETab\u003C/kbd\u003E: natiijadu dib ayey u dhisma. Wareeggii yar ee ku taal cinwaanka nuqadda waa indhaha. Nuqad indhaha lagu daray waxay ku muuqataa muuqaalka 3D, khadad ahaan khadadka, dusha iftiin-ku-wareegsan, dhibcaha dhibic ahaan. Nuqad jiid cinwaankeeda. Jiid asalka si aad u dhaqaaqdo, dabka wheel-ka si aad u weynayso. \u003Ckbd\u003EDelete\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa nuqadda la doortay. Nadiifi wuxuu nuqadaha u habeeyaa tiirar, Ku habee wuxuu dhammaantood ku keenaa aragga, Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waxay ku socdaan tafatirradaada. Noocyada iyo cabbirrada Geliyada waxay leeyihiin nooc: tiro, haa/maya, barta, vector, khad, dusha, mesh, jidh, ama \"joomitari\" oo ah mid kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ah. Barta waxay quudin kartaa geli vector ah iyo dib. Tirooyinku waxay leeyihiin cabbir: dherer wuxuu ku qoran yahay millimitir, xagal wuxuu ku qoran yahay darajo. Dherer ma quudin karo xagal, dherer marka lagu dhufto dherer (sare) waa la diidaa, sidaas darteed silig qaldan waa la joojiyaa markaad sameysid. Laba-jibbaaran oo madow waa liis. Liis marka uu gaaro geli hal qiimo ah, nuqaddu waxay ku shaqeysaa mar kasta oo shay walba oo liiska ka mid ah, natiijadeedna waxay noqotaa liis. Liiska gaaban qiimihiisii ugu dambeeyay ayuu ku celiyaa. Tusaale ahaan, Taxane oo dhererro ah oo gashay Guuri wuxuu sameeyaa xidh koobiyo ah. Jidh iyo Boolean nuqadahaan Kooxda Jidhka waxay sameysaa jidhar xidhan oo ka yimid dusha isku mid ah sida bartanka Dusha: Sanduuqa jidhka, Silinda jidhka iyo Kuraha jidhka (cabbirada millimitir), Isku geyn, Ka jar iyo Isgoys (jidhka labaad waxaa laga qaadaa kan koowaad; cidhibta waa fogaanta ay saxanaanta ku dhacdaan ee jidhka injineriyaha ay ka durkaan dusha saxda ah), Gees-ku-xidhka ka dhexeeya wajiyada (wajiyada iyada oo lambarkooda ku jira jidhka, 1 waa kan koowaad; halkan waxaa ku jira radius iyo, ka weyn 0, radius dhamaadka), Mugga jidhka (mm³) iyo Jidhka u beddel mesh (si loo arko ama loo kaydiyo). Jidhka wuxuu leeyahay nooc gaar ah oo geli ah: dhibic ama tiro ma xidhmi karaan geli jidh, dhibicna waxay ahaanaysaa casaan. Nuqadaha Boolean iyo Gees-ku-xidhka waxay isticmaalaan injineriyada jidhka ee barnaamijka, oo la soo rari karo markii ugu horreysay ee tafatirku furmo. Qaladaad Nuqad aan qabanin shaqadeeda waxay sheegaa sababta magaceeda hoostiisa, casaan ahaan (\"Radiusku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber.\"), nuqadaha ka dambeeyana way sugaan. Isla fariintaas waxay ku muuqataa Dhibaato bartanka Dhibaatooyinka, halkaas laga heli karo. Nuqad walba waa khad qoraal Riix Qoraal si aad u aragto jaantuska sida CraftScript: hal khad nuqad kasta, sida n3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);. Qoraalka wax ka beddel, kadibna riix Ka samee jaantuska qoraalkan si aad jaantuska dib ugu soo celiso. Shaqooyinka nd_ ee isla CraftScript-ka ee PartCraft ayey shaqeeyaan, sidaas darteed jaantuska waa la socon karaa, wareegi karaa, ama tijaabin karaa halkaas. Tirooyinka random had iyo jeer waxay qaadaan seed, sidaas darteed isla jaantuska wuxuu siiyaa isla natiijada kombuterka kasta. Waxa lagu kaydiyay faylka Jaantuska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka moodeelka. Nuqadaha waxay sameeyaan khadad, dusha iyo mesh gaar ah: ma beddelayaan wejiyada moodeelka ilaa aad weydiisato. Ku dhex dhig moodeelka Indhaha nuqad dusha ama mesh sameysa u shid, kadibna riix Ku dhex dhig moodeelka daaqadda Nuqadaha. Dusha ama mesh kasta oo la muujiyay wuxuu noqonayaa kooxda wejiyada moodeelka, oo ku qoran mitir, sida qayb kasta oo kale. Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Jaantuska ayuu hadhaa, laakiin nuqulka ma raacayo tan: tiro beddel oo ku dhex dhig mar kale si aad mid cusub u hesho. Dhibcaha iyo khadadka lama dhigi karo jidh, sidaas darteed waa laga tagaa, fariintuna waxay sheegaysaa tirada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"resin-printing","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qaybi daabacaha resin-ka","summary":"Qaybi aasaaska daabacaadda ee daabacaha resin-ka, godi oo taageer qaybta, ku eeg lakabyada, kaydi faylka daabacaha, oo tijaabi exposure-ka aad u baahan tahay.","section":"tasks","order":108,"keywords":["resin","daabacaadda resin-ka","sla","msla","dlp","qaybiye","goo","sl1","ctb","cbddlp","chitubox","anycubic","pwmx","pws","elegoo","godan","godka hawada","raft","taageero","tijaabada exposure","sullamka exposure","calibration","lakabyo","kordhin"],"headings":[{"id":"waxaad-samayn-doontaa","text":"Waxaad samayn doontaa","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"ogow-exposure-kaaga","text":"Ogow exposure-kaaga","level":2},{"id":"qoraallo","text":"Qoraallo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKordhinnada resin-ka waxay qaybiyaan waxa ku yaal aasaaska daabacaadda sawirro lakab-lakab ah oo u ah shaashadda daabacahaaga, waxayna kaydiyaan faylka uu daabacuhu akhristo. Waa bilaash, waxba lagama xidho, waxaana la damiyaa ilaa aad furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli ma jiro fayl la furay daabacaha dhabta ah. Faylalka waxaa akhriyay oo keliya akhristayaasha CadCraft, taageerayaashuna waa cusub yihiin. Lakabyada eeg, daabacaadda kowaad gacanta ku samee.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxaad-samayn-doontaa\"\u003EWaxaad samayn doontaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybi qayb resin-ka, eeg lakabyada, kaydi faylka oo koobiyee daabacahaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E oo shid kordhinta qaybinta resin-ka iyo kordhinta nooca faylka daabacahaaga (Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox ama Anycubic). Waxaad sidoo kale riixi kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar daabacaadda resin-ka\u003C/span\u003E kaarka marxaladda daabacaadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhig qaybtaada aasaaska sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-stage\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-stage\"\u003EDhig walxaha aasaaska daabacaadda\u003C/a\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EResin\u003C/span\u003E xagga \u003Cstrong\u003EPrinting with\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EResin print settings\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EPrinter\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EResin\u003C/strong\u003E. Kaarku wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka shaashadda pixel-ka. Kuwani waa cabbirrada soo saaraha la daabaciyay, sidaas darteed hubi kaaga; waad wax ka beddeli kartaa hoosta Custom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer height (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EExposure (s)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBottom exposure (s)\u003C/strong\u003E. Tirooyinka resin kasta waa bilow oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EHollow it, with a vent hole\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad rabto qayb godan, kadibna dejiso \u003Cstrong\u003EWall (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHole width (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cstrong\u003ESupports and a raft\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESupport density\u003C/strong\u003E: Light, Medium ama Heavy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFile format\u003C/strong\u003E. Haddii kaarku sheegayo in weli aan la darin, riix badhanka akhriya Add iyo magaca nooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi lakabyada\u003C/span\u003E oo dhaqaaji slider-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ELayer\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybaha go&#039;da leh waa la giraangiraa. Sadarka hoose wuxuu siinayaa lakabyada, waqtiga, iyo resin-ka mL, garaam iyo qiimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi faylka daabacaadda\u003C/span\u003E, hubi koobka, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E. Koobiyee faylka daabacahaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ogow-exposure-kaaga\"\u003EOgow exposure-kaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid kordhinta tijaabada exposure-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig qaybta tijaabada aasaaska\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sullamka exposure-ka\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad heleysaa hal fayl exposure kasta, zip gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaabac fayl kasta isku resin, oo ku hay exposure-ka ugu cad ee tiirarka dhuuban iyo godadka furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraallo\"\u003EQoraallo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybintu waxay ku shaqeysaa asalka, sidaas darteed bogga wuu shaqeyn karaa xitaa saxan weyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha aan ahayn jidh xidhan waa la dhaafaa, kaarkuna wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii daabacahaagu diido fayl, kaarka nooca wuxuu leeyahay ikhtiyaaro ku saabsan waxa nooca uu ka tagayo furan. Mid beddel, mar kale kaydi, oo naga ogeysii kan shaqeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnycubic nooca 517 iyo 518 lama qoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Kordhinnada resin-ka waxay qaybiyaan waxa ku yaal aasaaska daabacaadda sawirro lakab-lakab ah oo u ah shaashadda daabacahaaga, waxayna kaydiyaan faylka uu daabacuhu akhristo. Waa bilaash, waxba lagama xidho, waxaana la damiyaa ilaa aad furto. Weli ma jiro fayl la furay daabacaha dhabta ah. Faylalka waxaa akhriyay oo keliya akhristayaasha CadCraft, taageerayaashuna waa cusub yihiin. Lakabyada eeg, daabacaadda kowaad gacanta ku samee. Waxaad samayn doontaa Qaybi qayb resin-ka, eeg lakabyada, kaydi faylka oo koobiyee daabacahaaga. Tallaabooyinka Fur Dejinta › Kordhinno oo shid kordhinta qaybinta resin-ka iyo kordhinta nooca faylka daabacahaaga (Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox ama Anycubic). Waxaad sidoo kale riixi kartaa Ku dar daabacaadda resin-ka kaarka marxaladda daabacaadda. Dhig qaybtaada aasaaska sida ku qoran Dhig walxaha aasaaska daabacaadda, kadibna dooro Resin xagga Printing with. Hoosta Resin print settings, dooro Printer iyo Resin. Kaarku wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka shaashadda pixel-ka. Kuwani waa cabbirrada soo saaraha la daabaciyay, sidaas darteed hubi kaaga; waad wax ka beddeli kartaa hoosta Custom. Dejiso Layer height (mm), Exposure (s) iyo Bottom exposure (s). Tirooyinka resin kasta waa bilow oo keliya. Calaamee Hollow it, with a vent hole haddii aad rabto qayb godan, kadibna dejiso Wall (mm) iyo Hole width (mm). Calaamee Supports and a raft, kadibna dooro Support density: Light, Medium ama Heavy. Dooro File format. Haddii kaarku sheegayo in weli aan la darin, riix badhanka akhriya Add iyo magaca nooca. Riix Hubi lakabyada oo dhaqaaji slider-ka Layer. Qaybaha go'da leh waa la giraangiraa. Sadarka hoose wuxuu siinayaa lakabyada, waqtiga, iyo resin-ka mL, garaam iyo qiimaha. Riix Kaydi faylka daabacaadda, hubi koobka, kadibna riix Kaydi. Koobiyee faylka daabacahaaga. Ogow exposure-kaaga Shid kordhinta tijaabada exposure-ka Dejinta › Kordhinno gudihiisa. Riix Dhig qaybta tijaabada aasaaska. Riix Kaydi sullamka exposure-ka. Waxaad heleysaa hal fayl exposure kasta, zip gudihiisa. Daabac fayl kasta isku resin, oo ku hay exposure-ka ugu cad ee tiirarka dhuuban iyo godadka furan. Qoraallo Qaybintu waxay ku shaqeysaa asalka, sidaas darteed bogga wuu shaqeyn karaa xitaa saxan weyn. Qaybaha aan ahayn jidh xidhan waa la dhaafaa, kaarkuna wuu sheegaa. Haddii daabacahaagu diido fayl, kaarka nooca wuxuu leeyahay ikhtiyaaro ku saabsan waxa nooca uu ka tagayo furan. Mid beddel, mar kale kaydi, oo naga ogeysii kan shaqeeyay. Anycubic nooca 517 iyo 518 lama qoro.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"styles-shadows","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Habka iyo hooska qorraxda","summary":"Muuji moodeelka iftiin-hoosaad, khad qarsan, silig, ama si aad ugu aragto, oo daraasee hooska uu saaro taariikh, waqti iyo meel kasta.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["muuqaalka soo bandhigga","muuqaal nadiif ah","qari hage-yada","qari dhidibada","habka","iftiin-hoosaad","khad qarsan","silig","x-ray","geesaha","hooska","qorraxda","daraasadda qorraxda","solar","taariikh","waqti","latitude","longitude","kala-duwanaanshaha waqtiga","woqooyi"],"headings":[{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":2},{"id":"shid-hooska-qorraxda","text":"Shid hooska qorraxda","level":2},{"id":"moodeelka-u-jiheey-woqooyi","text":"Moodeelka u jiheey woqooyi","level":2},{"id":"daraasad-qorraxda","text":"Daraasad qorraxda","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah","text":"Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-soo-bandhigga","text":"Muuqaalka soo bandhigga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGuddiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E ee midig wuxuu beddelaa sida moodeelka loo sawiro. Waxba kama beddelo moodeelka lafteeda, mana ku jiro Ka noqo. Muuqaal kasta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Emuuqaal\u003C/a\u003E) habkiisa ayuu xasuustaa, faylkuna habka aad lahayd markii aad kaydisay ayuu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro mid ka mid ah liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa u eg\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin-hoosaad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha adag, si jilicsan u iftiimaya. Dusha laga arko dhabarka waa buluug-cawl. Midabada la soo dhoofiyay ayaa muuqda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhad qarsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha midabka duruufta gadaasha ah, geesaha oo khad madow leh: sawir khad oo nadiif ah, khadadka qarsan laga saaray. Cad oo ku saabsan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarqad\u003C/span\u003E, madow oo ku saabsan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha keliya. Dusha lama sawiro, laakiin weli way tiriyaan markaad riixayso ama ku dhejinayso: ma aad dhex-mari karto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha wax ka muuqda, si aad wax u aragto oo gadaashood ama gudahood ku jira. Sida silig oo kale, riixitaanka iyo ku dhejinta waxay weli istaaga dusha ugu dhow.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji geesaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geesaha ku daaraa ama ka demiyaa habka kasta marka laga reebo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii la demiyo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhad qarsan\u003C/span\u003E wax yar ayuu muujinayaa, maxaa yeelay dusheeda waxay la mid yihiin duruufta gadaasha. Geesaha jilicsan, sida dhinacyada goobo la soo jiiday, waligood lama sawirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid-hooska-qorraxda\"\u003EShid hooska qorraxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooska qorraxda\u003C/span\u003E. Dejinta qorraxda ee hoosteeda ayaa shaqeynaysa, moodeelkuna wuxuu hooska saarayaa isagiisa iyo dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji meesha:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELatitude\u003C/span\u003E: woqooyi waa togan, koonfur taban (New York qiyaas ahaan 40.7, Sydney qiyaas ahaan -33.9).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELongitude\u003C/span\u003E: bari waa togan, galbeed taban (New York qiyaas ahaan -74.0).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUTC offset\u003C/span\u003E: kala duwanaanshaha goobta UTC-ga saacadaha, sida \u003Ccode\u003E-5\u003C/code\u003E New York bilaha qaboobaha. ModelCraft ma adeegsado wakhtiga iftiinka xagaaga; New York xagaaga isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003E-4\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaariikh\u003C/span\u003E (bil iyo maalin) oo jiid slider-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqti\u003C/span\u003E. Waqtigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa 15 daqiiqo ah, wuxuuna ku muuqdaa xagga slider-ka, sida &quot;3:00 pm&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadarka hoosta dejinta ayaa sheegaysa meesha qorraxdu ku taallo, sida &quot;Sun 52° up, 250° from north. North is the green axis.&quot; Habeenkii waxay leedahay &quot;The sun is down at this time.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa qorraxda 21 Juun saacadda 3:00 pm, latitude 40, longitude -105, UTC offset -7.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodeelka-u-jiheey-woqooyi\"\u003EMoodeelka u jiheey woqooyi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWoqooyiga ModelCraft had iyo jeer waa \u003Cstrong\u003Edhidibka cagaaran\u003C/strong\u003E. Si aad goob dhab ah u barato, moodeelka u leexi si dhinaca woqooyi u wajahan cagaar: dhammaan dooro (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dhufo dhexda dhulka, oo u leexi xagal goobta ka timaada woqooyi (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\"\u003EWareeji iyo cabbir\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daraasad-qorraxda\"\u003EDaraasad qorraxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji meesha iyo taariikhda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar muuqaal (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar muuqaal\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid slider-ka waqtiga, kadibna ku dar muuqaal kale. Ku celi saacad kasta oo aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaar\u003C/span\u003E si aad mid mid u dhaqaaqdo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EKaydi muuqaallada sida muuqaallo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-muhiimka-ah\"\u003EWaxyaabaha muhiimka ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHooska ayaa u muuqan kara mid jajab ah moodeel aad u weyn, maxaa yeelay hal khariidad hooska ayaa daboolaysa moodeelka oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHooska lama sawiro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBooska qorraxda wuxuu raacaa xisaabinta NOAA ee qorraxda, waana sax ilaa qayb ka mid ah darajo, taas oo ku filan daraasadaha qaabka. Dhalaalka hawada waa la iska indha tirayaa, sidaas darteed booska qorraxda ee hooseeya subaxa iyo galabta wax yar ayay khaldan karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-soo-bandhigga\"\u003EMuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka keliya: dhidibada, khadadka hagaha iyo dhibcaha hagaha, khadadka diyaaradaha goynta (goyntu way sii jirtaa), calaamadaha laydhadhka, sanduuqa kooxda furan, calaamadaha iyo talooyinka ku dhejinta, iyo iftiinka xulashada oo dhan way baxaan. Isticmaal si aad moodeelka si cad u eegto, ama ka hor sawir-shaashadeed. Qalabyada weli way shaqeeyaan, way ku dhejiyaanna; calaamadaha uun ma aragto. Mar kale \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E riix si ay dib ugu soo noqdaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E way sii joogaan, maxaa yeelay qayb ka mid ah sawirka ayay tahay. Markaad gudaha kooxda ka wax beddelayso, qaybta kale ee moodeelka ma dhumo: sidii ay tahay ayay muuqdaan, tekstuurradiina ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Guddiga Habka ee midig wuxuu beddelaa sida moodeelka loo sawiro. Waxba kama beddelo moodeelka lafteeda, mana ku jiro Ka noqo. Muuqaal kasta (muuqaal) habkiisa ayuu xasuustaa, faylkuna habka aad lahayd markii aad kaydisay ayuu xasuustaa. Dusha Dooro mid ka mid ah liiska Dusha: Habka Waxa u eg Iftiin-hoosaad Dusha adag, si jilicsan u iftiimaya. Dusha laga arko dhabarka waa buluug-cawl. Midabada la soo dhoofiyay ayaa muuqda. Khad qarsan Dusha midabka duruufta gadaasha ah, geesaha oo khad madow leh: sawir khad oo nadiif ah, khadadka qarsan laga saaray. Cad oo ku saabsan Warqad, madow oo ku saabsan Moodeel. Silig Geesaha keliya. Dusha lama sawiro, laakiin weli way tiriyaan markaad riixayso ama ku dhejinayso: ma aad dhex-mari karto. X-ray Dusha wax ka muuqda, si aad wax u aragto oo gadaashood ama gudahood ku jira. Sida silig oo kale, riixitaanka iyo ku dhejinta waxay weli istaaga dusha ugu dhow. Muuji geesaha wuxuu geesaha ku daaraa ama ka demiyaa habka kasta marka laga reebo Silig. Haddii la demiyo, Khad qarsan wax yar ayuu muujinayaa, maxaa yeelay dusheeda waxay la mid yihiin duruufta gadaasha. Geesaha jilicsan, sida dhinacyada goobo la soo jiiday, waligood lama sawirin. Shid hooska qorraxda Calaamadi Hooska qorraxda. Dejinta qorraxda ee hoosteeda ayaa shaqeynaysa, moodeelkuna wuxuu hooska saarayaa isagiisa iyo dhulka. Deji meesha: Latitude: woqooyi waa togan, koonfur taban (New York qiyaas ahaan 40.7, Sydney qiyaas ahaan -33.9). Longitude: bari waa togan, galbeed taban (New York qiyaas ahaan -74.0). UTC offset: kala duwanaanshaha goobta UTC-ga saacadaha, sida -5 New York bilaha qaboobaha. ModelCraft ma adeegsado wakhtiga iftiinka xagaaga; New York xagaaga isticmaal -4. Deji Taariikh (bil iyo maalin) oo jiid slider-ka Waqti. Waqtigu wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa 15 daqiiqo ah, wuxuuna ku muuqdaa xagga slider-ka, sida \"3:00 pm\". Sadarka hoosta dejinta ayaa sheegaysa meesha qorraxdu ku taallo, sida \"Sun 52° up, 250° from north. North is the green axis.\" Habeenkii waxay leedahay \"The sun is down at this time.\" Moodeel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa qorraxda 21 Juun saacadda 3:00 pm, latitude 40, longitude -105, UTC offset -7. Moodeelka u jiheey woqooyi Woqooyiga ModelCraft had iyo jeer waa dhidibka cagaaran. Si aad goob dhab ah u barato, moodeelka u leexi si dhinaca woqooyi u wajahan cagaar: dhammaan dooro (Ctrl+A), riix Q, dhufo dhexda dhulka, oo u leexi xagal goobta ka timaada woqooyi (eeg Wareeji iyo cabbir). Daraasad qorraxda Deji meesha iyo taariikhda. Ku dar muuqaal (Ku dar muuqaal gudaha Muuqaallada). Jiid slider-ka waqtiga, kadibna ku dar muuqaal kale. Ku celi saacad kasta oo aad rabto. Riix Ciyaar si aad mid mid u dhaqaaqdo. Eeg Kaydi muuqaallada sida muuqaallo. Waxyaabaha muhiimka ah Hooska ayaa u muuqan kara mid jajab ah moodeel aad u weyn, maxaa yeelay hal khariidad hooska ayaa daboolaysa moodeelka oo dhan. Hooska lama sawiro Silig gudaha. Booska qorraxda wuxuu raacaa xisaabinta NOAA ee qorraxda, waana sax ilaa qayb ka mid ah darajo, taas oo ku filan daraasadaha qaabka. Dhalaalka hawada waa la iska indha tirayaa, sidaas darteed booska qorraxda ee hooseeya subaxa iyo galabta wax yar ayay khaldan karaan. Muuqaalka soo bandhigga Muuqaallada › Muuqaalka soo bandhigga (ama Shift+P) wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka keliya: dhidibada, khadadka hagaha iyo dhibcaha hagaha, khadadka diyaaradaha goynta (goyntu way sii jirtaa), calaamadaha laydhadhka, sanduuqa kooxda furan, calaamadaha iyo talooyinka ku dhejinta, iyo iftiinka xulashada oo dhan way baxaan. Isticmaal si aad moodeelka si cad u eegto, ama ka hor sawir-shaashadeed. Qalabyada weli way shaqeeyaan, way ku dhejiyaanna; calaamadaha uun ma aragto. Mar kale Shift+P riix si ay dib ugu soo noqdaan. Cabbirrada way sii joogaan, maxaa yeelay qayb ka mid ah sawirka ayay tahay. Markaad gudaha kooxda ka wax beddelayso, qaybta kale ee moodeelka ma dhumo: sidii ay tahay ayay muuqdaan, tekstuurradiina ku jira.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Rendar sawir oo ka mid ah moodeelka","summary":"Samee sawir u eg iftiinka maalinta: samo, qorraxda oo ku taal meesha iyo taariikhda moodeelkaaga, hooska jilicsan, muuqaalka muraayadda iyo birta, kadibna kaydi PNG ahaan.","section":"tasks","order":112,"keywords":["rendar","preset","presets","goob preset","gudaha","dibadda","muuqaalka goynta","habeen","hal riix","rendering","path tracing","path traced","ray tracing","global illumination","reflections","refraction","tayo sare","photo","photoreal","dabiici","sawir","png","still","samo","qorraxda","iftiinka maalinta","hooska jilicsan","ambient occlusion","muraayad","bir","glossy","agab","exposure","iftiin","daruur","galabta","studio","bandhig","ceeryaan","dhaqdhaqaaq","iftiinka gudaha","nalal","noise"],"headings":[{"id":"rendar-muuqaalka","text":"Rendar muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"diyaarinta-goobaha-sawir-wanaagsan-hal-riix","text":"Diyaarinta goobaha: sawir wanaagsan hal riix","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-midabka-u-eg-muraayad-ama-bir","text":"Ka dhig midabka u eg muraayad ama bir","level":2},{"id":"tayo-sare","text":"Tayo sare","level":2},{"id":"rendar-muuqaalka-gudihiisa","text":"Rendar muuqaalka gudihiisa","level":2},{"id":"samada-iyo-profiilada-iftiinka-kaarka-garaafka","text":"Samada iyo profiilada iftiinka kaarka garaafka","level":2},{"id":"kaamerada","text":"Kaamerada","level":2},{"id":"dhammeynta-sawirka","text":"Dhammeynta sawirka","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-sawirka","text":"Kaydi sawirka","level":2},{"id":"isku-dar-iftiinka-ka-dib-rendarka","text":"Isku dar iftiinka ka dib rendarka","level":2},{"id":"safka-rendarka","text":"Safka rendarka","level":2},{"id":"dhaaqa-qiiqa-dhawaaqa-iyo-caustics","text":"Dhaaqa, qiiqa, dhawaaqa iyo caustics","level":2},{"id":"intee-baa-qaadata","text":"Intee baa qaadata","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawir ka sameeyaa muuqaalka oo u eg iftiinka maalinta, sawir-gacmeed ma aha: samo, qorraxda oo ku taal meesha iyo taariikhda moodeelkaaga, hooska jilicsan, iftiin ka yimid samada oo dhan oo daloolinta iyo godadka mugdiyeeya, iyo midabo u eg muraayad, bir ama rinji dhalaalaya. Moodeelka lama beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rendar-muuqaalka\"\u003ERendar muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso muuqaalka sida aad rabto sawirka: hareeyso, weynee, dooro \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Egoob\u003C/a\u003E, qari waxa aan inta lagu muuqan. Sawirku wuxuu isticmaalaa kaamerada muuqaalka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoob\u003C/span\u003E haddii midka la riixay aanu ahayn waxa aad rabtay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"scene-presets-a-good-picture-in-one-click\"\u003EDiyaarinta goobaha\u003C/a\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirku wuu buuxmaa inta uu rendaraynayo, wuuna nadiifaa marxaladda kasta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu joojiyaa hore wuuna kaydinayaa sawirka ilaa halkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo dejiso (PNG ah, haddii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E aanu wax kale sheegin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu bilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hubiso kaamerada iyo muuqaalka, kadibna soo saar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWanaagsan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgu wanaagsan\u003C/span\u003E cabbir weyn oo sawirka dhammaadka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"diyaarinta-goobaha-sawir-wanaagsan-hal-riix\"\u003EDiyaarinta goobaha: sawir wanaagsan hal riix\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESare ee wada-hadalka waxaa ku yaal afar badhan oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoob\u003C/span\u003E. Mid kasta wuxuu dejiyaa samada, iftiinka, dhulka, xariiqyada geesaha, tayada iyo qorraxda hal riix oo keliya, sidaas darteed ma jiro wax lagu baro ka hor sawirka koowaad. Riix mid, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoob\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu dejiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loo isticmaalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDibadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECir daahsan, qorraxda moodeelka laftiisa, dhulka oo shidan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha dibadda ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaruur (iftiin siman, aan qorraxda adag lahayn), hal nus istoob oo ka iftiimi badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal qol gudaha ka yimid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka goynta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIstuudiyo cad, dhul la&#039;aan, xariiqyada geesaha rendarka degdega ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeel goyn lagu gooyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabeen\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorraxda hoos ayay u dhacday (bartamaha jiilaalka nuska kale ee dunida ee goobta), hal istoob oo ka iftiimi badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENalalka oo moodeelka iftiimiya. Nal la&#039;aan, sawirku wuu madoobaadaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro muuqaalkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu doortaa adigoo aan wax weydiin: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka goynta\u003C/span\u003E marka goyn la shido, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGudaha\u003C/span\u003E marka kaamerada ku jirto moodeelka, haddii kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDibadda\u003C/span\u003E. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto wada-hadalka, si toos ah ayuu habkan ugu bilaabmaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejinta hoose oo dhan way ku jirtaa oo waad beddeli kartaa. Markii aad wax beddesho oo goobta ka soo horjeeddo, badhan ma jiro oo riixan, safka hoose ayaa sheegaya in dejintu tahay tiyaaga. Mar kale guji goobta si qiimayaashii ay ugu soo noqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobaha ma taabtaan injineerka, habka, cabbirka, agabka, kaamerada ama nalalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha waxay siiyaan qiimayaal isku mid ah ModelCraft iyo BimCraft. Sawirka dhammaadka sida uu u eg yahay waxa ku xidhan moodeelkaaga iyo kaarka garaafkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka muuqaalka, laba jibbaar cabbirka muuqaalka, Full HD, 4K ama labajibbaaran. Cabbirrada go&#039;an waxay haystaa kaamerada muuqaalka, waxayna muujinaysaa wax badan ama wax yar dhinacyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E (hoose) oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXadka waqtiga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta marood (ama, tayo sare, tusaalooyin) la celceliyo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E 16, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWanaagsan\u003C/span\u003E 64, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgu wanaagsan\u003C/span\u003E 256. Marood badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo geesaha jilicsan, laakiin waxay qaadaan waqti dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECir daahsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruur\u003C/span\u003E (iftiin jilicsan, hooska yar), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGalabta\u003C/span\u003E (iftiin hoose, diirran) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIstuudiyo cad\u003C/span\u003E (dib cad oo fudud)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQorraxda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorraxdu waxay ka timaadaa taariikhda, saacadda iyo meesha ku jirta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E › qorraxda. Calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal taariikh iyo saac kale sawirkan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u isku daydo waqti kale adigoo habka moodeelka aan beddelin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiin badan ama yar, tallaabooyin (stops) ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhulka hoose ee moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhul hoostiisa moodeelka qaadata hooska oo ku dhammaada fagaaraha. Demi moodeel dhulka ka kor joogsada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesaha sawiri\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha moodeelka oo khafiif ah ayuu sawirka dul ku sawiraa, si uu u eg yahay mid la sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii qorraxdu hoos ka tahay fagaaraha waqtiga la doortay waa habeen: samadu waa mugdi, moodeelkana \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Enalalka\u003C/a\u003E ayaa iftiinka siinaya. Dialogka ayaa sidaas sheegaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed sawirka xiga ee isla moodeelka wuxuu ka bilaabmi doonaa meeshii aad ka tagtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-midabka-u-eg-muraayad-ama-bir\"\u003EKa dhig midabka u eg muraayad ama bir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgabka\u003C/span\u003E, midab kasta oo shaashadda ku jira wuxuu leeyahay muuqaal: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQallafsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhalaalaya jilicsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhalaalaya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBir dhalaalaya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad barafeysan\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWejiyada aan la rinjiyeyn\u003C/span\u003E waa wejiyada aan midab gaar ah lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad daaqadaha muraayad uga dhigto, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003Erinji\u003C/a\u003E xaashida daaqadda hal midab, kadibna midabkaas dhig \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E. Muraayaddu waxay u oggolaatay samada iyo wixii ka dambeeya inay muuqdaan, midabkeeda ayay dhex mareen, waxayna samada ka muujisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E, muraayadda iyo birta waxay muujiyaan samada, ma aha qaybta kale ee moodeelka, iftiinkuna muraayadda ma dhex maro. Habka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E ee hoose labadaba wuu sameeyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tayo-sare\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare (path traced)\u003C/span\u003E sawir u raacaya iftiinka sida kamarad u aragto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eiftiinku wuu dhacaa oo dusha ka soo noqdaa, sidaas darteed qol iftiin ka galaya daaqad ama nal ayaa dhan oo dhan laga iftiimaa, midabkuna wuxuu u gudbaa jaarkiisa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emuraayaddu waa muraayad dhab ah: iftiinku wuu ku dhex maraa, wuxuuna muujiyaa moodeelka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebirta iyo dusha dhalaalaysa waxay muujiyaan qaybta kale ee moodeelka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epanelada iftiinka waxay u iftiimaan sida panelada, hooska jilicsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa aad uga gaabiyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E: marxaladda kasta wuxuu dib u raacaa iftiinka pixel kasta. Sawirku wuu cadaadaa, wuuna cad yahay sida tusaalooyinku u kordhaan, sidaas darteed bilow mid yar (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E) oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXadka waqtiga\u003C/span\u003E: markii uu dhammaado, sawirka hadda jira ayaa la kaydiyaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya. Marxaladda koowaad waa sugtaa inta browser-ku diyaarinayo raacaha iftiinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, raacaha iftiinka waa mid CadCraft u gaar ah oo kaarka garaafka ayuu ku shaqeeyaa; safka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaacaysan kaarka garaafka (WebGPU)\u003C/span\u003E. Ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E ama xadka waqtiga, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii wad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sii wadaa isla sawirka ilaa uu helo tusaalooyinkiisa oo dhan; beddelka dejinta ama markii aad mar kale riixdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E wuu mar kale bilaabaa. Haddii WebGPU aanu jirin, sawirka waxa lagu raacaa WebGL (safku wuu sheegaa), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii wad\u003C/span\u003E ma bixiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox iyo inta badan Chrome ee Linux weli ma leh WebGPU, sidaas darteed tayo sare halkaas waxay isticmaalaa WebGL.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabkan geesaha lama sawiro, teksturada maktabadda waxay muujiyaan midabkooda iyo go&#039;naanta, laakiinse kor-u-kacyadooda ma muujiyaan (a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#in-high-quality-pictures\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"in-high-quality-pictures\"\u003Eagab nood lagu sameeyay\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa jihadiisa iyo kor-u-kacyadiisa), goynta moodeelka ayaa lagu sameeyaa ka hor inta sawirku bilaabmin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi hadhaaga dhawaaqa (kadib tusaalooyinka)\u003C/span\u003E waa daaran tahay caadi ahaan: markii sawirku dhammaado ama la joojiyo, hadhaaga dhawaaqa ayaa la nadiifiyaa shabakad neural ah oo loo sameeyay (Intel Open Image Denoise, oo kombiyuutarkaaga ku shaqeysa: kaarka garaafka, haddii kale processor-ka). Sawirka tusaalooyin yar leh wuu nadiifaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka ka hor nadiifinta\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa sida loo rendaray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rendar-muuqaalka-gudihiisa\"\u003ERendar muuqaalka gudihiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu shido raacaha iftiinka muuqaalka laftiisa: hareeyso, wax ka beddel ama beddel nal wuxuu mar kale bilaabaa isla markiiba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGobol\u003C/span\u003E: jiid laabjibbaaran oo kaliya ayaa rendaraya; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal oo dhan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dib u soo celinaysa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiiradda\u003C/span\u003E: guji waxa aad rabto inuu cad yahay, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka ayaa diiradda halkaas saaraysa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa inta pixel ee muuqaalka ah ee uu rendarayo (ka yar waa degdeg). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESii dheji\u003C/span\u003E wuu joojiyaa oo wuu sii socdaa. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU: haddii aanu jirin, workspace-ku wuu sheegaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E weli way shaqeysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samada-iyo-profiilada-iftiinka-kaarka-garaafka\"\u003ESamada iyo profiilada iftiinka kaarka garaafka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIyada oo WebGPU jirto, tayo sare waxay leedahay laba samo oo dheeraad ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamada jireed\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xisaabiyaa iftiinka maalinta iyadoo laga eegayo dhererka qorraxda: buluug qoto dheer oo madax kor ah, dhir cad oo xagga horizon-ka ah, iyo qorraxda oo kulul oo hoosaysa markay hoos u dhacdo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECeeryaan\u003C/span\u003E waxay ka dhaqaaqdaa maalin aad caafimaad leh (2) ilaa mid uumi leh (10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka samada (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu moodeelka ka iftiimiyaa sawir panorama oo meel dhab ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro sawir…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.hdr\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.exr\u003C/code\u003E oo equirectangular ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku wareejiyaa moodeelka agteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka sawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan ama yar. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay qorraxdiisa, sidaas darteed qorraxda moodeelka lama daro. Waxa ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay: kadib markii dib loo furo, mar kale dooro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENal kasta oo liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENalalka\u003C/span\u003E ku jira wuxuu qaadan karaa profile iftiin oo soo saaraha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProfiilka IES…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa fayl IES (LM-63) kadibna nalku wuxuu iftiinkiisa u saaraa siday qalabkaasi yeelo (downlight fiiqan, wall washer). Nal kasta oo magacaas leh ayaa isticmaala, nalku wuxuu hayaa iftiinkiisa. Guji magaca profile-ka si aad u joojiso isticmaalkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadaha muraayad cad waxay caawiyaan iftiinka samada inuu galo qolka, sidaas darteed sawirrada gudaha ee samada hoosteeda ayaa dhakhso u dhammaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E iyo raacaha WebGL waxay muujiyaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamada jireed\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka samada (HDRI)\u003C/span\u003E sida samo cad, waxayna iska indho-tiraan profiilada iftiinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaamerada\"\u003EKaamerada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaamerada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawirka u diyaariyaa sida sawir-qaad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka\u003C/span\u003E: ku hay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimaha iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta kameradda\u003C/span\u003E oo dejiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurka (f-stop)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXawaaraha shutter-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EISO\u003C/span\u003E sida kamarad kasta; EV-ga ku xiga waa qiimaha iftiinka ee caadiga ah. f/16 oo ah 1/100 s iyo ISO 100 waxay u eg tahay maalin qorrax leh; goob mugdi ah waxay u baahan tahay furka ballaaran, shutter-ka gaabanaya ama ISO sare. Tan wuxuu shaqeeyaa habka kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto-dheerta muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu daboolaa waxa ka dhow ama ka fog \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada diiradda (m)\u003C/span\u003E sida lens-ka f-stop-kaas u sameeyo (ka tag madhan si aad diiradda ugu dhigto waxa ku jira bartamaha muuqaalka); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabka furka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa iftiinka diiradda ka baxsan qaab wareeg ama laf-leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal laba-barood ah (khadadka toosan ayaa toosan ku sii jira)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaamerada sinaysiiyaa oo sawirka wuu dhaqaajiyaa, sida lens-ka tilt-shift ee dhismaha, si darbiyadu uma janjeeran markaad madax u qaaddo ama hoos u eegto dhismo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dheelitirka cadaanka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa midabka iftiinka ee cad lagu arko: hoose (tusaale 3000 K) nalalka diirran, sare hooska iyo maalmaha daruuraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMashruuca\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanorama 360°\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa sawir 2:1 ah oo ah wax kasta oo kaamerada ku wareegsan, muuqaal-aaliyayaasha panorama-da; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanorama stereo 360°\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku dhigaa panorama indhaha bidix iyo midig, madaxyada; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKuubka khariidadda (6 wejiyo)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa lix muuqaal labajibbaaran oo ku jira shabakad 3 × 2. Ballacu wuxuu ka imanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashruuca, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka, muuqaalka laba-barood iyo isku-dheelitirka cadaanka waxay u baahan yihiin raacaha iftiinka ee kaarka garaafka (WebGPU), sidaas darteed waxay muuqdaan oo keliya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammeynta-sawirka\"\u003EDhammeynta sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawirka tayo sare u qiimeeyaa sida sawir-qaad, wax kasta oo aad beddesho sawirka dhammaadka ah isla markiiba, iyada oo aan mar kale la rendarin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaabka muuqaalka (view transform)\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EACES filmic\u003C/span\u003E (sawirka sida hore), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgX\u003C/span\u003E (jilicsan, midabka wuu ilaaliyaa iftiinka aad u sarreeya), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFilmic\u003C/span\u003E (khad filim jilicsan) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/span\u003E (fudud, iftiinka sare ayaa cad noqda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIska horjeedka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhufashada iftiinka sare\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu soo celiyaa faahfaahin qaybaha aad u iftiimaya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBloom\u003C/span\u003E (dhalaalaysi jilicsan oo iftiinka wareega), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlare\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqyada glare\u003C/span\u003E (xariiqyada xiddigta ee meelaha ugu iftiinka badan) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVignette\u003C/span\u003E (geeska mugdi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska midabka (.cube)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku dabaqaa midab-garaadin fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cube\u003C/code\u003E ah, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXoogga miiska midabka\u003C/span\u003E; sida sawirka samada, waxa ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-sawirka\"\u003EKaydi sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa faylka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJPEG\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebP\u003C/span\u003E la wadaagto (JPEG iyo WebP waxay jiraan meelaha browser-ku qori karo), iyo kadib rendar tayo sare oo kaarka garaafka ku yaal, sidoo kale:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG, 16 bit\u003C/span\u003E: sawirka dhammeysan oo leh tallaabooyin kala duwan oo fiican, si loo daabaco ama loo tafatiro dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEXR, lakab kasta (32-bit float)\u003C/span\u003E: sawirka sida la rendaray (iftiin toosan, aan grade lahayn), oo leh qayb kasta oo rendar iyo kooxda iftiinka oo lakab u gaar ah, barnaamijyada ku-dhejinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl rendar (.ccrender, si dib loo habeeyo mar dambe)\u003C/span\u003E: wax kasta oo dialogka u baahan si dib loo isku qaso oo loo habeeyo sawirka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur fayl rendar…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa isku-darkiisa iyo habeyntiisa, iyada oo aan la rendarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dar-iftiinka-ka-dib-rendarka\"\u003EIsku dar iftiinka ka dib rendarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKahor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E, daar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-darka iftiinka (beddel midabka iyo iftiinka nal kasta kadib rendarka)\u003C/span\u003E. Markii sawirku dhammaado (ama la joojiyo), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku qas sawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa iftiinkiisa kooxo ahaan: samada, qorraxda, iyo nalalka magacooda (nal kasta oo magac isku mid ah ah hal kooxood). Kooxda mid ka demi, midab siiso, ama ka dhig mid iftiin badan ama yar, sawirku isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan mar kale la rendarin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi isku-darka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa isku-darka magac hoose si aad mar dambe dib u doorato; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESida la rendaray\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku soo celinayaa sawirkii sida loo sameeyay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sawirka la isku daray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha rendarka (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaybaha sawirka sidoo kale. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa muuqaalka mid ka mid ah: midabka dusha (albedo), normals, depth, iftiinka diffuse, specular iyo kan la gudbiyay (kan toosan iyo kan dadban labaduba), waxa dhalaalaya iyo samada, iyo midab shay kasta ama agab kasta si loo sameeyo maskada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabaduba layer dheeraad ah ayay kaarka garaafka ku hayaan. Cabbirrada waaweyn kaarka garaafku ma yeelan karo meel; dialogku wuu sheegaa, cabbir yar ayaa shaqeysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-rendarka\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejin tayo sare ka dib, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar sawirkan safka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa sawirka sida hadda loo dejiyey; dialogka fiidiyada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar dhaqdhaqaaqan safka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid dhaqdhaqaaq oo dhan, frame kasta oo raacaha iftiinka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilow safka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu rendaraa midkood midka kale ee kombiyuutarkan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E oo ka xiga kasta oo dhammaatay ayaa soo dejiya. Safka waa ilaaliyaa markii bogga la xirayo: fur isla moodeelka, wuu ka sii socdaa meeshii uu joojiyey. Safku wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaaqa-qiiqa-dhawaaqa-iyo-caustics\"\u003EDhaaqa, qiiqa, dhawaaqa iyo caustics\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaaqa, qiiqa iyo dhawaaqa\u003C/span\u003E waxayna shaqeeyaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayo sare\u003C/span\u003E kaarka garaafka; injiniyaashii kale way ka reebaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaaqa iyo ceeryaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa hawada ilaa dherer leh uumi uu iftiinka qorraxda, samada iyo nalalku iftiimiyaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIntee ayaad ilaalin kartaa, mitir ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa inta uu qaro yahay (qiyaastii 100 m waa ceeryaan fudud, 20 m waa dhaaq qaro), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhererka hooska ka sarreeya dhulka, mitir ahaan\u003C/span\u003E waa halka uu ku dhammaado, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiqyada iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E waa inta uu dhaaqu u iftiimo xagga iftiinka. Iftiinka qorraxda wuxuu ka baxaa dhaaqa sare, sidaas darteed meesha qorraxdu ka soo gasho daaqad ama dhismayaal dhex ah waxaad u aragtaa xariiqyo iftiin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiiq ama daruur\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa hal mugga qiiq ama daruur oo iftiinka dhaaqa oo kale loo siiyo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooca\u003C/span\u003E waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaruur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETiirka qiiqa\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaylka mugga (.ccvol)\u003C/span\u003E, oo ah qaab shabakad oo CadCraft u gaar ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala duwanaansho\u003C/span\u003E waxay beddelaan daruurta ama tiirka la sameeyay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka dhinaca ugu dheer, mitir ahaan (0 = cabbirka moodelka)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji X (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji Y (m)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaqaaji Z (m)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi\u003C/span\u003E ayay dhigaan (wuxuu ku bilaabaa bartamaha moodeelka), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaro\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka dhigaa mid qiiq badan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin hore\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan xagga iftiinka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidabka\u003C/span\u003E wuu midab siiyaa. Faylka mugga waa la ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay, sida sawirka samada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu joojiya hore meelaha sawirku nadiif yahay (adaptive sampling)\u003C/span\u003E ma siiyo tusaalooyin dheeraad ah pixel-yada degganaaday, sidaas darteed qaybta kale ee sawirku degdeg ayay u dhammaysataa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhawaaqa la aqbalo\u003C/span\u003E waa inta hadhaaga dhawaaqa ah ee la tirtiro markii pixel-ku joogsado. Xariiqda hoose ee sawirka waxay sheegaysaa inta tusaale ah pixel kasta ay heshay celcelis ahaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaustics (iftiin ka gudba muraayad ama ka dhabbaqa muraayadaha)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raacaa iftiinka nalalka iyo qorraxda, si meeshii dhalaalaysa ee hoosta kubbadda muraayadda ama iftiinka muraayadda ee darbiga uu nadiif noqdo halkii uu hadhaaga dhawaaqa leeyahay. Waa la damiyaa markii fog, qiiq, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku isku-darka iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E ama qaybaha rendarka ay shidan yihiin, waxayna u tahay sawirrada oo keliya, ma aha sawirrada 360°, dhaqdhaqaaqa ama workspace-ka Rendar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intee-baa-qaadata\"\u003EIntee baa qaadata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirku wuxuu ku sameysmaa kombiyuutarkaaga, kaarka garaafka; wax lasoo dirin. Intee baa qaadata waxa ku xidhan kaarkaas. Waqtigu wuu kordhaa marka marooyinka iyo pixel-yada la kordhiyo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgu wanaagsan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay 16 jeer marooyinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E, sawirka 4K wuxuu leeyahay qiyaastii afar jeer pixel-yada Full HD. Kombiyuutar aan kaarka garaafka lahayn ayuu weli rendaraa, laakiin si gaabis ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii dialogku sheegayo in browser-ku aanu rendari karin sawirrada, browser-ka ma leh WebGL 2. Cusboonaysii, ama shid hardware acceleration dejintiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Rendar sawir… wuxuu sawir ka sameeyaa muuqaalka oo u eg iftiinka maalinta, sawir-gacmeed ma aha: samo, qorraxda oo ku taal meesha iyo taariikhda moodeelkaaga, hooska jilicsan, iftiin ka yimid samada oo dhan oo daloolinta iyo godadka mugdiyeeya, iyo midabo u eg muraayad, bir ama rinji dhalaalaya. Moodeelka lama beddelo. Rendar muuqaalka Dejiso muuqaalka sida aad rabto sawirka: hareeyso, weynee, dooro goob, qari waxa aan inta lagu muuqan. Sawirku wuxuu isticmaalaa kaamerada muuqaalka laftiisa. Guji Soo saar kooxda Fayl, kadibna Rendar sawir…. Dooro Goob haddii midka la riixay aanu ahayn waxa aad rabtay (eeg Diyaarinta goobaha), dooro Cabbirka, kadibna guji Soo saar. Sawirku wuu buuxmaa inta uu rendaraynayo, wuuna nadiifaa marxaladda kasta. Jooji (ama Esc) wuu joojiyaa hore wuuna kaydinayaa sawirka ilaa halkaas. Guji Kaydi si aad u soo dejiso (PNG ah, haddii Kaydi sida aanu wax kale sheegin). Ku bilow Qabyo oo leh Cabbirka muuqaalka si aad u hubiso kaamerada iyo muuqaalka, kadibna soo saar Wanaagsan ama Ugu wanaagsan cabbir weyn oo sawirka dhammaadka ah. Diyaarinta goobaha: sawir wanaagsan hal riix Sare ee wada-hadalka waxaa ku yaal afar badhan oo Goob. Mid kasta wuxuu dejiyaa samada, iftiinka, dhulka, xariiqyada geesaha, tayada iyo qorraxda hal riix oo keliya, sidaas darteed ma jiro wax lagu baro ka hor sawirka koowaad. Riix mid, kadibna Soo saar. Goob Waxa uu dejiyo Waxa loo isticmaalo Dibadda Cir daahsan, qorraxda moodeelka laftiisa, dhulka oo shidan Dhismaha dibadda ka Gudaha Daruur (iftiin siman, aan qorraxda adag lahayn), hal nus istoob oo ka iftiimi badan Muuqaal qol gudaha ka yimid Muuqaalka goynta Istuudiyo cad, dhul la'aan, xariiqyada geesaha rendarka degdega ah Moodeel goyn lagu gooyay Habeen Qorraxda hoos ayay u dhacday (bartamaha jiilaalka nuska kale ee dunida ee goobta), hal istoob oo ka iftiimi badan Nalalka oo moodeelka iftiimiya. Nal la'aan, sawirku wuu madoobaadaa Dooro muuqaalkan wuxuu kuu doortaa adigoo aan wax weydiin: Muuqaalka goynta marka goyn la shido, Gudaha marka kaamerada ku jirto moodeelka, haddii kale Dibadda. Markii ugu horreysay ee aad furto wada-hadalka, si toos ah ayuu habkan ugu bilaabmaa. Dejinta hoose oo dhan way ku jirtaa oo waad beddeli kartaa. Markii aad wax beddesho oo goobta ka soo horjeeddo, badhan ma jiro oo riixan, safka hoose ayaa sheegaya in dejintu tahay tiyaaga. Mar kale guji goobta si qiimayaashii ay ugu soo noqdaan. Goobaha ma taabtaan injineerka, habka, cabbirka, agabka, kaamerada ama nalalka. Goobaha waxay siiyaan qiimayaal isku mid ah ModelCraft iyo BimCraft. Sawirka dhammaadka sida uu u eg yahay waxa ku xidhan moodeelkaaga iyo kaarka garaafkaaga. Dejinta Dejin Waxa uu sameeyo Cabbirka Cabbirka muuqaalka, laba jibbaar cabbirka muuqaalka, Full HD, 4K ama labajibbaaran. Cabbirrada go'an waxay haystaa kaamerada muuqaalka, waxayna muujinaysaa wax badan ama wax yar dhinacyada Habka Degdeg, ama Tayo sare (path traced) (hoose) oo leh Xadka waqtiga Tayada Inta marood (ama, tayo sare, tusaalooyin) la celceliyo: Qabyo 16, Wanaagsan 64, Ugu wanaagsan 256. Marood badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo geesaha jilicsan, laakiin waxay qaadaan waqti dheer Samada Cir daahsan, Daruur (iftiin jilicsan, hooska yar), Galabta (iftiin hoose, diirran) ama Istuudiyo cad (dib cad oo fudud) Qorraxda Qorraxdu waxay ka timaadaa taariikhda, saacadda iyo meesha ku jirta Habka › qorraxda. Calaamee Isticmaal taariikh iyo saac kale sawirkan si aad u isku daydo waqti kale adigoo habka moodeelka aan beddelin Iftiinka Iftiin badan ama yar, tallaabooyin (stops) ah Dhulka hoose ee moodeelka Dhul hoostiisa moodeelka qaadata hooska oo ku dhammaada fagaaraha. Demi moodeel dhulka ka kor joogsada Geesaha sawiri Geesaha moodeelka oo khafiif ah ayuu sawirka dul ku sawiraa, si uu u eg yahay mid la sawiray Markii qorraxdu hoos ka tahay fagaaraha waqtiga la doortay waa habeen: samadu waa mugdi, moodeelkana nalalka ayaa iftiinka siinaya. Dialogka ayaa sidaas sheegaya. Dejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft, sidaas darteed sawirka xiga ee isla moodeelka wuxuu ka bilaabmi doonaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Ka dhig midabka u eg muraayad ama bir Hoosta Agabka, midab kasta oo shaashadda ku jira wuxuu leeyahay muuqaal: Qallafsan, Dhalaalaya jilicsan, Dhalaalaya, Bir, Bir dhalaalaya, Muraayad ama Muraayad barafeysan. Wejiyada aan la rinjiyeyn waa wejiyada aan midab gaar ah lahayn. Si aad daaqadaha muraayad uga dhigto, rinji xaashida daaqadda hal midab, kadibna midabkaas dhig Muraayad. Muraayaddu waxay u oggolaatay samada iyo wixii ka dambeeya inay muuqdaan, midabkeeda ayay dhex mareen, waxayna samada ka muujisaa. Habka Degdeg, muraayadda iyo birta waxay muujiyaan samada, ma aha qaybta kale ee moodeelka, iftiinkuna muraayadda ma dhex maro. Habka Tayo sare (path traced) ee hoose labadaba wuu sameeyaa. Tayo sare Dooro Habka › Tayo sare (path traced) sawir u raacaya iftiinka sida kamarad u aragto: iftiinku wuu dhacaa oo dusha ka soo noqdaa, sidaas darteed qol iftiin ka galaya daaqad ama nal ayaa dhan oo dhan laga iftiimaa, midabkuna wuxuu u gudbaa jaarkiisa; muraayaddu waa muraayad dhab ah: iftiinku wuu ku dhex maraa, wuxuuna muujiyaa moodeelka; birta iyo dusha dhalaalaysa waxay muujiyaan qaybta kale ee moodeelka; panelada iftiinka waxay u iftiimaan sida panelada, hooska jilicsan. Waa aad uga gaabiyo Degdeg: marxaladda kasta wuxuu dib u raacaa iftiinka pixel kasta. Sawirku wuu cadaadaa, wuuna cad yahay sida tusaalooyinku u kordhaan, sidaas darteed bilow mid yar (Cabbirka muuqaalka, Qabyo) oo dooro Xadka waqtiga: markii uu dhammaado, sawirka hadda jira ayaa la kaydiyaa. Jooji ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya. Marxaladda koowaad waa sugtaa inta browser-ku diyaarinayo raacaha iftiinka. Halka browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU, raacaha iftiinka waa mid CadCraft u gaar ah oo kaarka garaafka ayuu ku shaqeeyaa; safka hoose ee sawirka wuxuu leeyahay Raacaysan kaarka garaafka (WebGPU). Ka dib Jooji ama xadka waqtiga, Sii wad wuxuu sii wadaa isla sawirka ilaa uu helo tusaalooyinkiisa oo dhan; beddelka dejinta ama markii aad mar kale riixdo Soo saar wuu mar kale bilaabaa. Haddii WebGPU aanu jirin, sawirka waxa lagu raacaa WebGL (safku wuu sheegaa), Sii wad ma bixiyo. Firefox iyo inta badan Chrome ee Linux weli ma leh WebGPU, sidaas darteed tayo sare halkaas waxay isticmaalaa WebGL. Habkan geesaha lama sawiro, teksturada maktabadda waxay muujiyaan midabkooda iyo go'naanta, laakiinse kor-u-kacyadooda ma muujiyaan (a agab nood lagu sameeyay wuxuu muujiyaa jihadiisa iyo kor-u-kacyadiisa), goynta moodeelka ayaa lagu sameeyaa ka hor inta sawirku bilaabmin. Nadiifi hadhaaga dhawaaqa (kadib tusaalooyinka) waa daaran tahay caadi ahaan: markii sawirku dhammaado ama la joojiyo, hadhaaga dhawaaqa ayaa la nadiifiyaa shabakad neural ah oo loo sameeyay (Intel Open Image Denoise, oo kombiyuutarkaaga ku shaqeysa: kaarka garaafka, haddii kale processor-ka). Sawirka tusaalooyin yar leh wuu nadiifaa; Muuji › Sawirka ka hor nadiifinta wuxuu muujiyaa sida loo rendaray. Rendar muuqaalka gudihiisa Workspace-ka Rendar wuxuu shido raacaha iftiinka muuqaalka laftiisa: hareeyso, wax ka beddel ama beddel nal wuxuu mar kale bilaabaa isla markiiba. Gobol: jiid laabjibbaaran oo kaliya ayaa rendaraya; Muuqaal oo dhan ayaa dib u soo celinaysa. Diiradda: guji waxa aad rabto inuu cad yahay, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka ayaa diiradda halkaas saaraysa. Faahfaahin wuxuu dejiyaa inta pixel ee muuqaalka ah ee uu rendarayo (ka yar waa degdeg). Sii dheji wuu joojiyaa oo wuu sii socdaa. Waxay u baahan tahay WebGPU: haddii aanu jirin, workspace-ku wuu sheegaa, Export › Rendar sawir… weli way shaqeysaa. Samada iyo profiilada iftiinka kaarka garaafka Iyada oo WebGPU jirto, tayo sare waxay leedahay laba samo oo dheeraad ah: Samada jireed wuxuu xisaabiyaa iftiinka maalinta iyadoo laga eegayo dhererka qorraxda: buluug qoto dheer oo madax kor ah, dhir cad oo xagga horizon-ka ah, iyo qorraxda oo kulul oo hoosaysa markay hoos u dhacdo. Ceeryaan waxay ka dhaqaaqdaa maalin aad caafimaad leh (2) ilaa mid uumi leh (10). Sawirka samada (HDRI) wuxuu moodeelka ka iftiimiyaa sawir panorama oo meel dhab ah. Dooro sawir… wuxuu qaadaa fayl .hdr ama .exr oo equirectangular ah; Rogi wuxuu ku wareejiyaa moodeelka agteeda, Iftiinka sawirka wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan ama yar. Sawirku wuxuu leeyahay qorraxdiisa, sidaas darteed qorraxda moodeelka lama daro. Waxa ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay: kadib markii dib loo furo, mar kale dooro. Nal kasta oo liiska Nalalka ku jira wuxuu qaadan karaa profile iftiin oo soo saaraha: Profiilka IES… wuxuu akhriyaa fayl IES (LM-63) kadibna nalku wuxuu iftiinkiisa u saaraa siday qalabkaasi yeelo (downlight fiiqan, wall washer). Nal kasta oo magacaas leh ayaa isticmaala, nalku wuxuu hayaa iftiinkiisa. Guji magaca profile-ka si aad u joojiso isticmaalkiisa. Daaqadaha muraayad cad waxay caawiyaan iftiinka samada inuu galo qolka, sidaas darteed sawirrada gudaha ee samada hoosteeda ayaa dhakhso u dhammaada. Habka Degdeg iyo raacaha WebGL waxay muujiyaan Samada jireed iyo Sawirka samada (HDRI) sida samo cad, waxayna iska indho-tiraan profiilada iftiinka. Kaamerada Kaamerada wuxuu sawirka u diyaariyaa sida sawir-qaad: Iftiinka: ku hay Qiimaha iftiinka, ama dooro Dejinta kameradda oo dejiso Furka (f-stop), Xawaaraha shutter-ka iyo ISO sida kamarad kasta; EV-ga ku xiga waa qiimaha iftiinka ee caadiga ah. f/16 oo ah 1/100 s iyo ISO 100 waxay u eg tahay maalin qorrax leh; goob mugdi ah waxay u baahan tahay furka ballaaran, shutter-ka gaabanaya ama ISO sare. Tan wuxuu shaqeeyaa habka kasta. Qoto-dheerta muuqaalka wuxuu daboolaa waxa ka dhow ama ka fog Masaafada diiradda (m) sida lens-ka f-stop-kaas u sameeyo (ka tag madhan si aad diiradda ugu dhigto waxa ku jira bartamaha muuqaalka); Qaabka furka wuxuu siinayaa iftiinka diiradda ka baxsan qaab wareeg ama laf-leh. Muuqaal laba-barood ah (khadadka toosan ayaa toosan ku sii jira) wuxuu kaamerada sinaysiiyaa oo sawirka wuu dhaqaajiyaa, sida lens-ka tilt-shift ee dhismaha, si darbiyadu uma janjeeran markaad madax u qaaddo ama hoos u eegto dhismo. Isku-dheelitirka cadaanka wuxuu dejiyaa midabka iftiinka ee cad lagu arko: hoose (tusaale 3000 K) nalalka diirran, sare hooska iyo maalmaha daruuraha. Mashruuca: Panorama 360° wuxuu sameeyaa sawir 2:1 ah oo ah wax kasta oo kaamerada ku wareegsan, muuqaal-aaliyayaasha panorama-da; Panorama stereo 360° wuxuu isku dhigaa panorama indhaha bidix iyo midig, madaxyada; Kuubka khariidadda (6 wejiyo) wuxuu sameeyaa lix muuqaal labajibbaaran oo ku jira shabakad 3 × 2. Ballacu wuxuu ka imanayaa Cabbirka. Mashruuca, qoto-dheerta muuqaalka, muuqaalka laba-barood iyo isku-dheelitirka cadaanka waxay u baahan yihiin raacaha iftiinka ee kaarka garaafka (WebGPU), sidaas darteed waxay muuqdaan oo keliya Tayo sare. Dhammeynta sawirka Sawirka wuxuu sawirka tayo sare u qiimeeyaa sida sawir-qaad, wax kasta oo aad beddesho sawirka dhammaadka ah isla markiiba, iyada oo aan mar kale la rendarin: Qaabka muuqaalka (view transform): ACES filmic (sawirka sida hore), AgX (jilicsan, midabka wuu ilaaliyaa iftiinka aad u sarreeya), Filmic (khad filim jilicsan) ama Caadi (fudud, iftiinka sare ayaa cad noqda). Iska horjeedka iyo Isku-dhufashada iftiinka sare (wuxuu soo celiyaa faahfaahin qaybaha aad u iftiimaya). Bloom (dhalaalaysi jilicsan oo iftiinka wareega), Glare oo leh Xariiqyada glare (xariiqyada xiddigta ee meelaha ugu iftiinka badan) iyo Vignette (geeska mugdi). Miiska midabka (.cube)… wuxuu ku dabaqaa midab-garaadin fayl .cube ah, oo leh Xoogga miiska midabka; sida sawirka samada, waxa ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay. Kaydi sawirka Kaydi sida oo ku xiga Kaydi wuxuu doortaa faylka: PNG, JPEG ama WebP la wadaagto (JPEG iyo WebP waxay jiraan meelaha browser-ku qori karo), iyo kadib rendar tayo sare oo kaarka garaafka ku yaal, sidoo kale: PNG, 16 bit: sawirka dhammeysan oo leh tallaabooyin kala duwan oo fiican, si loo daabaco ama loo tafatiro dambe. EXR, lakab kasta (32-bit float): sawirka sida la rendaray (iftiin toosan, aan grade lahayn), oo leh qayb kasta oo rendar iyo kooxda iftiinka oo lakab u gaar ah, barnaamijyada ku-dhejinta. Fayl rendar (.ccrender, si dib loo habeeyo mar dambe): wax kasta oo dialogka u baahan si dib loo isku qaso oo loo habeeyo sawirka. Fur fayl rendar… wuxuu soo celinayaa isku-darkiisa iyo habeyntiisa, iyada oo aan la rendarin. Isku dar iftiinka ka dib rendarka Kahor Soo saar, daar Isku-darka iftiinka (beddel midabka iyo iftiinka nal kasta kadib rendarka). Markii sawirku dhammaado (ama la joojiyo), Isku qas sawirka wuxuu liistaa iftiinkiisa kooxo ahaan: samada, qorraxda, iyo nalalka magacooda (nal kasta oo magac isku mid ah ah hal kooxood). Kooxda mid ka demi, midab siiso, ama ka dhig mid iftiin badan ama yar, sawirku isla markiiba wuu beddelaa, iyada oo aan mar kale la rendarin. Kaydi isku-darka wuxuu kaydiyaa isku-darka magac hoose si aad mar dambe dib u doorato; Sida la rendaray wuxuu ku soo celinayaa sawirkii sida loo sameeyay. Kaydi wuxuu kaydiyaa sawirka la isku daray. Qaybaha rendarka (albedo, normals, depth, diffuse, specular, transmission, emission, IDs) wuxuu ilaaliyaa qaybaha sawirka sidoo kale. Muuji wuxuu muujiyaa muuqaalka mid ka mid ah: midabka dusha (albedo), normals, depth, iftiinka diffuse, specular iyo kan la gudbiyay (kan toosan iyo kan dadban labaduba), waxa dhalaalaya iyo samada, iyo midab shay kasta ama agab kasta si loo sameeyo maskada. Labaduba layer dheeraad ah ayay kaarka garaafka ku hayaan. Cabbirrada waaweyn kaarka garaafku ma yeelan karo meel; dialogku wuu sheegaa, cabbir yar ayaa shaqeysa. Safka rendarka Dejin tayo sare ka dib, Ku dar sawirkan safka oo ku jira Safka rendarka wuxuu hayaa sawirka sida hadda loo dejiyey; dialogka fiidiyada Ku dar dhaqdhaqaaqan safka wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid dhaqdhaqaaq oo dhan, frame kasta oo raacaha iftiinka. Bilow safka wuxuu rendaraa midkood midka kale ee kombiyuutarkan, Kaydi oo ka xiga kasta oo dhammaatay ayaa soo dejiya. Safka waa ilaaliyaa markii bogga la xirayo: fur isla moodeelka, wuu ka sii socdaa meeshii uu joojiyey. Safku wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU. Dhaaqa, qiiqa, dhawaaqa iyo caustics Kuwan waxay ku jiraan Dhaaqa, qiiqa iyo dhawaaqa waxayna shaqeeyaan Tayo sare kaarka garaafka; injiniyaashii kale way ka reebaan. Dhaaqa iyo ceeryaan wuxuu buuxiyaa hawada ilaa dherer leh uumi uu iftiinka qorraxda, samada iyo nalalku iftiimiyaan. Intee ayaad ilaalin kartaa, mitir ahaan wuxuu dejiyaa inta uu qaro yahay (qiyaastii 100 m waa ceeryaan fudud, 20 m waa dhaaq qaro), Dhererka hooska ka sarreeya dhulka, mitir ahaan waa halka uu ku dhammaado, Xariiqyada iftiinka waa inta uu dhaaqu u iftiimo xagga iftiinka. Iftiinka qorraxda wuxuu ka baxaa dhaaqa sare, sidaas darteed meesha qorraxdu ka soo gasho daaqad ama dhismayaal dhex ah waxaad u aragtaa xariiqyo iftiin ah. Qiiq ama daruur wuxuu ku daraa hal mugga qiiq ama daruur oo iftiinka dhaaqa oo kale loo siiyo. Nooca waa Daruur, Tiirka qiiqa ama Faylka mugga (.ccvol), oo ah qaab shabakad oo CadCraft u gaar ah. Faahfaahin iyo Kala duwanaansho waxay beddelaan daruurta ama tiirka la sameeyay, Cabbirka dhinaca ugu dheer, mitir ahaan (0 = cabbirka moodelka), Dhaqaaji X (m), Dhaqaaji Y (m), Dhaqaaji Z (m) iyo Rogi ayay dhigaan (wuxuu ku bilaabaa bartamaha moodeelka), Qaro wuu ka dhigaa mid qiiq badan, Iftiin hore wuxuu ka dhigaa mid iftiin badan xagga iftiinka, Midabka wuu midab siiyaa. Faylka mugga waa la ilaaliyaa oo keliya inta bogga furan yahay, sida sawirka samada. Ku joojiya hore meelaha sawirku nadiif yahay (adaptive sampling) ma siiyo tusaalooyin dheeraad ah pixel-yada degganaaday, sidaas darteed qaybta kale ee sawirku degdeg ayay u dhammaysataa. Dhawaaqa la aqbalo waa inta hadhaaga dhawaaqa ah ee la tirtiro markii pixel-ku joogsado. Xariiqda hoose ee sawirka waxay sheegaysaa inta tusaale ah pixel kasta ay heshay celcelis ahaan. Caustics (iftiin ka gudba muraayad ama ka dhabbaqa muraayadaha) wuxuu raacaa iftiinka nalalka iyo qorraxda, si meeshii dhalaalaysa ee hoosta kubbadda muraayadda ama iftiinka muraayadda ee darbiga uu nadiif noqdo halkii uu hadhaaga dhawaaqa leeyahay. Waa la damiyaa markii fog, qiiq, Isku isku-darka iftiinka ama qaybaha rendarka ay shidan yihiin, waxayna u tahay sawirrada oo keliya, ma aha sawirrada 360°, dhaqdhaqaaqa ama workspace-ka Rendar. Intee baa qaadata Sawirku wuxuu ku sameysmaa kombiyuutarkaaga, kaarka garaafka; wax lasoo dirin. Intee baa qaadata waxa ku xidhan kaarkaas. Waqtigu wuu kordhaa marka marooyinka iyo pixel-yada la kordhiyo: Ugu wanaagsan wuxuu leeyahay 16 jeer marooyinka Qabyo, sawirka 4K wuxuu leeyahay qiyaastii afar jeer pixel-yada Full HD. Kombiyuutar aan kaarka garaafka lahayn ayuu weli rendaraa, laakiin si gaabis ah. Haddii dialogku sheegayo in browser-ku aanu rendari karin sawirrada, browser-ka ma leh WebGL 2. Cusboonaysii, ama shid hardware acceleration dejintiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-engines","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dooro barnaamijka sawirka sameeya","summary":"Doorashada Matoorka ee sanduuqa Rendar: laba matoorradeenna, barnaamijyada kale ee CadCraft Studio ku jira, iyo waxa webka uu sameeyo.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["rendar","matoor","matoorka rendarka","plug-in","plugin","studio","barnaamij dibada","lagu sawiray","safka","matoorka kordhinta"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-doorashadu-u-shaqeeyo","text":"Sida doorashadu u shaqeeyo","level":2},{"id":"waxa-matoor-kasta-la-siiyo","text":"Waxa matoor kasta la siiyo","level":2},{"id":"safka-rendarka","text":"Safka rendarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay doorasho \u003Cstrong\u003EMatoor\u003C/strong\u003E oo kor ka taal Mode. Laba matoorradeenna had iyo jeer way jiraan oo meel kasta ayay shaqeeyaan; kordhinno ayaa matoorro dheeraad ah ku dari kara, CadCraft Studio-na liiska ayaa sidoo kale ku jiraan barnaamijyada qaadaya muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMatoor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex ku jira: Dhakhso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka degdega ah: iftiinka maalinta, hooska jilicsan, muuqaalka aaladda iyo biraha, ilbiriqsiyo gudahood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka iyo Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex ku jira: Path tracer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka oo ka dhacaya dusha ilaa dusha kale, kaarka muuqaalkaaga ama processor-ka, safka rendarka iyo kombiyuutarada kale ee shabakaddaada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka iyo Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatoorka kordhinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu sawiraa oo sawirka dib ayuu u soo celiyaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003ESawirka barnaamij kale ku sawir\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrowser-ka (matoor JavaScript ku qoran) ama Studio (matoor barnaamij socodsiiya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamij muuqaalka la wareega\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio wuxuu geliyaa muuqaalka folderkiisa oo wuu ku ilaaliyaa wada-socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStudio\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ku …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka wuu kaydiyaa oo barnaamij ayuu ku furaa; waxba ma soo noqdo: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EMuuqaalka barnaamij kale ku fur\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebku wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-doorashadu-u-shaqeeyo\"\u003ESida doorashadu u shaqeeyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashada Dhakhso ama Path tracer waxay beddeshaa Mode-ka isagoo la socda, iyo sidoo kale dhinaca kale. Sanduuqa waxba kale kama beddelo dadka aan waligood matoor kale isticmaalin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMatoor aan la heli karin ayaa liiska ku sii jira sababta (&quot;not found&quot;, &quot;needs a newer version&quot;); ma dooran kartid. Browser-ka matoor ka shaqeeya Studio kaliya wuxuu muujiyaa &quot;saves a file&quot;: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E markaas wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka iyo dejintiisa fayl aad u qaadato barnaamijkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDoorashada waa la kaydiyaa dejinta rendarka faylka, matoorka aad ugu dambaysay dooratay wuxuu ahaadaa matoorka bilowga ah faylasha aan doorasho u gaar ah lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir ka yimid barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka uu sawirka sameeyay iyo nooca, sanduuqa iyo safka rendarka. Ballanqaadyada bogga \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar\u003C/a\u003E waxay daboolaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ematooradeenna\u003C/strong\u003E keliya: barnaamij kale wuxuu iftiimiyaa, midabeeyaa oo tusaaleeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed laba sawir oo muuqaal isku mid ah ayaa isku eg kamarada, qorraxda, laydhadhka iyo iftiinka, laakiin ma aha pixel ka pixel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-matoor-kasta-la-siiyo\"\u003EWaxa matoor kasta la siiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka wuxuu u gudbaa barnaamij kale sida \u003Cstrong\u003Epakaj\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelka sida fayl USD (isla faylka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EKaydi sida USD\u003C/a\u003E qorayo), iyo fayl dejin oo wax ka mid ah u hayaa wixii USD importer aan lagu kalsoonaan karin: qiyamka saxda ah ee agabka, laydhadhka shidan ee awoodooda iyo profaylka iftiinka, qorraxda, cirka, iftiinka iyo kamarada sida sanduuqu u sawiri lahaa. Waxba halkii lagu soo rarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"safka-rendarka\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir ama animation loo qabanayo barnaamij kale wuxuu sugi karaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Esafka rendarka\u003C/a\u003E sida kan aynu leenahay; shaqadiisu xasuusanaysaa matoorka ay u tahay. Animation-ku wuxuu barnaamijka u gaadhaa hal socod.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Rendar sawir… wuxuu leeyahay doorasho Matoor oo kor ka taal Mode. Laba matoorradeenna had iyo jeer way jiraan oo meel kasta ayay shaqeeyaan; kordhinno ayaa matoorro dheeraad ah ku dari kara, CadCraft Studio-na liiska ayaa sidoo kale ku jiraan barnaamijyada qaadaya muuqaalka. Matoor Waxa uu sameeyo Halka Dhex ku jira: Dhakhso Sawirka degdega ah: iftiinka maalinta, hooska jilicsan, muuqaalka aaladda iyo biraha, ilbiriqsiyo gudahood Browser-ka iyo Studio Dhex ku jira: Path tracer Iftiinka oo ka dhacaya dusha ilaa dusha kale, kaarka muuqaalkaaga ama processor-ka, safka rendarka iyo kombiyuutarada kale ee shabakaddaada Browser-ka iyo Studio Matoorka kordhinta Wuu sawiraa oo sawirka dib ayuu u soo celiyaa: eeg Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sawir Browser-ka (matoor JavaScript ku qoran) ama Studio (matoor barnaamij socodsiiya) Barnaamij muuqaalka la wareega Studio wuxuu geliyaa muuqaalka folderkiisa oo wuu ku ilaaliyaa wada-socodka Studio Fur ku … Muuqaalka wuu kaydiyaa oo barnaamij ayuu ku furaa; waxba ma soo noqdo: eeg Muuqaalka barnaamij kale ku fur Webku wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka Sida doorashadu u shaqeeyo Doorashada Dhakhso ama Path tracer waxay beddeshaa Mode-ka isagoo la socda, iyo sidoo kale dhinaca kale. Sanduuqa waxba kale kama beddelo dadka aan waligood matoor kale isticmaalin. Matoor aan la heli karin ayaa liiska ku sii jira sababta (\"not found\", \"needs a newer version\"); ma dooran kartid. Browser-ka matoor ka shaqeeya Studio kaliya wuxuu muujiyaa \"saves a file\": Rendar sawir… markaas wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka iyo dejintiisa fayl aad u qaadato barnaamijkaas. Doorashada waa la kaydiyaa dejinta rendarka faylka, matoorka aad ugu dambaysay dooratay wuxuu ahaadaa matoorka bilowga ah faylasha aan doorasho u gaar ah lahayn. Sawir ka yimid barnaamij kale wuxuu sheegaa barnaamijka uu sawirka sameeyay iyo nooca, sanduuqa iyo safka rendarka. Ballanqaadyada bogga Rendar waxay daboolaan matooradeenna keliya: barnaamij kale wuxuu iftiimiyaa, midabeeyaa oo tusaaleeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed laba sawir oo muuqaal isku mid ah ayaa isku eg kamarada, qorraxda, laydhadhka iyo iftiinka, laakiin ma aha pixel ka pixel. Waxa matoor kasta la siiyo Muuqaalka wuxuu u gudbaa barnaamij kale sida pakaj: moodeelka sida fayl USD (isla faylka Kaydi sida USD qorayo), iyo fayl dejin oo wax ka mid ah u hayaa wixii USD importer aan lagu kalsoonaan karin: qiyamka saxda ah ee agabka, laydhadhka shidan ee awoodooda iyo profaylka iftiinka, qorraxda, cirka, iftiinka iyo kamarada sida sanduuqu u sawiri lahaa. Waxba halkii lagu soo rarin. Safka rendarka Sawir ama animation loo qabanayo barnaamij kale wuxuu sugi karaa safka rendarka sida kan aynu leenahay; shaqadiisu xasuusanaysaa matoorka ay u tahay. Animation-ku wuxuu barnaamijka u gaadhaa hal socod.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"lights","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ku iftiimi moodeelka laambadaha","summary":"Geli laambadaha, iftiin-xiriqyada iyo dhigaha iftiinka moodeelka, si sawirada la rendaray ay u muujiyaan qolalka habeenka ama gudaha oo iftiinsan, leh hooska jilicsan.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["iftiin","iftiimiyayaal","laambad","laambadaha","iftiin-xiriq","bambeel","iftiinka saqafka","downlight","dhigta iftiinka","iftiinka aagga","lumens","iftiin-badnaan","heerkulka midabka","diiran","habeen","gudaha","render"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-laambad","text":"Ku dar laambad","level":2},{"id":"beddel-laambad","text":"Beddel laambad","level":2},{"id":"sawirada-habeenka","text":"Sawirada habeenka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaambadaha waxay iftiimiyaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawirada la rendaray\u003C/a\u003E. Ma beddelaan muuqaalka 3D, halkaas oo laambad kasta u muuqdo calaamad yar oo midabkeeda leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-laambad\"\u003EKu dar laambad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiimiyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E ee midig, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaambad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiin-xiriq\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhigta iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayso. Isku-xidhku wuxuu shaqeeyaa sida marka la sawirayo.\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqaf ama darbi dusheeda, \u003Cstrong\u003Elaambadu\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka dhex dhacaysaa 25 cm dusha, dhinaca aad ka eegayso; \u003Cstrong\u003Edhigta iftiinka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku jirtaa dusha wayna iftiinkeeda ka sii dirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIftiin-xiriqu\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadanayaa laba guji: marka hore meesha uu ku yaallo, kadibna waxa uu tilmaamayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaambadii cusub waxa lagu xulayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiimiyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, diyaar u ah in la beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-laambad\"\u003EBeddel laambad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji magaca laambadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiimiyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, ama calaamaddeeda muuqaalka adoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E. Kadibna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka (lumens)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta iftiin ay bixiso. Bambeelka guriga wuxuu ku dhow yahay 800 lumens; panelka saqafka oo iftiinsan 3000\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiiran\u003C/span\u003E (bambeelka guriga), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexdhexaad\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECad maalinta\u003C/span\u003E, ama midab kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShucaaca (darajo)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka iftiin-xiriqa, xagga ilaa xagga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka bambeelka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallac\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoto\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBambeelada iyo panelada waaweyn waxay siiyaan hooska jilicsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECasaan (x)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECagaar (y)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoog\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha uu ku yaallo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda ku taal magaca laambadda ayaa shidaysa ama demisa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir iftiinka\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka saaraysa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqonaysa. Laambadaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirada-habeenka\"\u003ESawirada habeenka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E, calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal taariikh iyo saac kale sawirkan\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro saac fiid ah. Marka qorraxdu hoos u dhacdo, samadu way madowdaa oo laambadaha kaliya ayaa moodeelka iftiimiya. Kor u qaad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka\u003C/span\u003E wadahadalka haddii sawirku aad u madow yahay, ama ku dar laambado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQolka laga arko gudaha, kaamerada geli qolka gudihiisa (orbit iyo zoom, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Emuuqaal\u003C/a\u003E), ku dar laambad saqafka, kadibna rendar habeenka. Habka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDegdeg\u003C/span\u003E geesaha ka fog laambadda way ka madow yihiin sawir dhab ah; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003Ehabka tayada sare\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu ogolaanayaa iftiinka inuu ka dib u soo noqdo darbiyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Laambadaha waxay iftiimiyaan sawirada la rendaray. Ma beddelaan muuqaalka 3D, halkaas oo laambad kasta u muuqdo calaamad yar oo midabkeeda leh. Ku dar laambad Qaybta Iftiimiyayaasha ee midig, guji Laambad, Iftiin-xiriq ama Dhigta iftiinka. Guji meesha ay tagayso. Isku-xidhku wuxuu shaqeeyaa sida marka la sawirayo. Saqaf ama darbi dusheeda, laambadu waxay ka dhex dhacaysaa 25 cm dusha, dhinaca aad ka eegayso; dhigta iftiinka waxay ku jirtaa dusha wayna iftiinkeeda ka sii dirta. Iftiin-xiriqu wuxuu qaadanayaa laba guji: marka hore meesha uu ku yaallo, kadibna waxa uu tilmaamayo. Laambadii cusub waxa lagu xulayaa Iftiimiyayaasha, diyaar u ah in la beddelo. Beddel laambad Guji magaca laambadda Iftiimiyayaasha, ama calaamaddeeda muuqaalka adoo isticmaalaya Dooro. Kadibna: Dejinta Waxa uu sameeyo Iftiinka (lumens) Inta iftiin ay bixiso. Bambeelka guriga wuxuu ku dhow yahay 800 lumens; panelka saqafka oo iftiinsan 3000 Midab Diiran (bambeelka guriga), Dhexdhexaad ama Cad maalinta, ama midab kasta Shucaaca (darajo) Qaabka iftiin-xiriqa, xagga ilaa xagga Cabbirka bambeelka, Ballac, Qoto Bambeelada iyo panelada waaweyn waxay siiyaan hooska jilicsan Casaan (x), Cagaar (y), Joog Meesha uu ku yaallo Calaamadda ku taal magaca laambadda ayaa shidaysa ama demisa. Tirtir iftiinka ayaa ka saaraysa. Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqonaysa. Laambadaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Sawirada habeenka Gudaha Rendar sawir…, calaamee Isticmaal taariikh iyo saac kale sawirkan oo dooro saac fiid ah. Marka qorraxdu hoos u dhacdo, samadu way madowdaa oo laambadaha kaliya ayaa moodeelka iftiimiya. Kor u qaad Iftiinka wadahadalka haddii sawirku aad u madow yahay, ama ku dar laambado. Qolka laga arko gudaha, kaamerada geli qolka gudihiisa (orbit iyo zoom, ama muuqaal), ku dar laambad saqafka, kadibna rendar habeenka. Habka Degdeg geesaha ka fog laambadda way ka madow yihiin sawir dhab ah; habka tayada sare wuxuu ogolaanayaa iftiinka inuu ka dib u soo noqdo darbiyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"live-view","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Muuqaalka tooska ah","summary":"Daaqad ku taal moodeelka oo muujisa habka wakhtiga dhabta ah, oo leh qorrax iyo hooska, oo raacda isbeddel kasta oo aad samayso; ku soco gudihiisa, oo dej saacadda maalinta iyo bilaha.","section":"tasks","order":113,"keywords":["wadaag","panorama","360","safar","safarka virtual","muuqaal madaxbannaan","muuqaaliye offline","u dir macmiil","fiidiyow","fiidiyowga socodka","scatter","kala firid","cawska","buuraha","dhagaxyada","dhirta","geedaha","dad badan","rinji dhirta","wakhtiga dhabta ah","realtime","rendar wakhtiga dhabta ah","socod","qof koowaad","soo bandhigid","macmiil","shaashad labaad","daaqad labaad","monitor","saacadda maalinta","qorrax","xilli","bil","hooska","occlusion","muuqaalka dib u celinta","iftiinka dib u celinta","global illumination","webgpu","webgl"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"socod-moodeelka-gudihiisa","text":"Socod moodeelka gudihiisa","level":2},{"id":"kala-firid-dhir-dhagaxyo-iyo-dad","text":"Kala firid dhir, dhagaxyo iyo dad","level":2},{"id":"wadaag-panoramo-safar-muuqaaliye-fiidiyow","text":"Wadaag: panoramo, safar, muuqaaliye, fiidiyow","level":2},{"id":"tayada","text":"Tayada","level":2},{"id":"iftiinka-dib-u-celinta","text":"Iftiinka dib u celinta","level":2},{"id":"iftiinka-iyo-midabyada","text":"Iftiinka iyo midabyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa panel dusha ku taal app-ka oo muujisa moodeelka habka wakhtiga dhabta ah: samada iyo qorraxda meesha moodeelka iyo taariikhdiisa, hooska qorraxda, muuqaalka iyo agabka aad siisay wejiyada, laambadaha, iyo iftiinka oo darbiyada iyo dhulka ka dib u soo noqda. Wixii aad samayso wuu raacaa: muuqaalka u wareeji oo wuu wareegayaa, moodeelka beddel oo wuxuu muujiyaa isbeddelka wakhtiga yar kadib. Waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah\u003C/span\u003E. Panelka wuxuu ku furmaa geeska hoose ee midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid cinwaankiisa si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid geeskiisa si aad u weyneyso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaaqad cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u guuraa daaqad gaar ah, shaashad labaad. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah daaqad cusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku furaa halkaas isla markiiba. Haddii browser-kaagu xayiran yahay daaqadaha pop-up-ka, wuxuu ku furmaa sida panel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuu xiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaac muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaddii on: muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu eegaa meesha ay eegayso muuqaalka ModelCraft. Socodka wuu demiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodso moodeelka gudihiisa (hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuf\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkii la socdo: taag dabaqyada oo kor u kac jaranjarada. Demsan: duul\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqti\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaacadda maalinta, 05:00 ilaa 21:00. Qorraxdu way dhaqaaqdaa markaad jiidayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBil\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilaha (21-ka), si aad u aragto qorraxda jiilaalka iyo xagaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKombiyuutarkan\u003C/span\u003E (waxa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003Ekombiyuutarkaagu\u003C/a\u003E helo), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooseeya\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexe\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESadarka hoose wuxuu sheegayaa waxa muuqaalka sawira (WebGPU ama WebGL 2), tayada, iyo iftiinka dib u celinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socod-moodeelka-gudihiisa\"\u003ESocod moodeelka gudihiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU rog muuqaalka ugu weyn meesha aad rabto inaad taagnaato, oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocod\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad taagan tahay dhulka hoose ee barta indhaha muuqaalka, oo dheer 1.6 m.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji muuqaalka tooska ah, kadibna isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama furayaasha falaarta. Hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u orodo. Jiid si aad u eegto wareeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabooyin ilaa 40 cm ayaa lagu kor fuulaa (jaranjaro); wax ka sarreeya waa darbi. Darbiyada ayaa ku joojiya, adna waad ku dhaqaaqaysaa dhinacooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECuf\u003C/span\u003E oo demsan waad duushaa: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa sare, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa socodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-firid-dhir-dhagaxyo-iyo-dad\"\u003EKala firid dhir, dhagaxyo iyo dad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala firid\u003C/span\u003E ee sadarka muuqaalka tooska ah ayaa furaa panelka kala firidda dhinaca sawirka. Set kala firid ah wuxuu kala firiyaa walxaha maktabadda entourage-ka (geedo, dhir yar, cawl, ubaxyo, dhagaxyo, dad, baabuur) qayb ka mid ah moodeelka. Walxahaasi waxa lagu muujiyaa muuqaalka tooska ah oo kaliya: maahan joomatari ku jira moodeelka, muuqaalka dhexe ma muujiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuuxi wejiyada:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro wejiyada (ama kooxda, sida dhulka) ModelCraft, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi xulashada\u003C/span\u003E. Setku wuu daboolaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERinji:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna jiid muuqaalka tooska ah. Haddii wejiyo la doortay, rinjigu wuxuu ku dhacaa kaliya; haddii aan wax la dooran, wuxuu ku dhacaa wax kasta oo burushka ka hooseeya, dhulka oo dhan ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka burushka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa burushka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa meelaha la rinjiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee waxa la kala firinayo. Tirada ku xigta mid kasta waa miisaankiisa: 3 iyo 1 waxay sameeyaan saddex midka hore mid kasta oo midka labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMitir laba jibbaaran kasta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta walax ee mitir laba jibbaaran kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogow (m)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxo ma dhowaan doonaan intaas ka hooseeya walxaha kale, mana jiraan saqaf ama miis hoosteeda. 0 wuu demiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg (°)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida walax kasta u wareegto isaga oo random ah, goobta toosan ee dhererka ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgu jilicsan (°)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalxo ma jiraan meelaha dusha ay ka sii jilicsan tahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka ugu yar iyo kan ugu weyn, isagoo ah factor ku saleysan cabbirka walaxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhererka laga bilaabo, ilaa (m)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya dhererkan dhexdiisa (madhan = wax kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dhaqaaq dusha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0 walxaha waxay ku jiraan toosan; 1 waxay u taagaan jilcinta si siman\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilaw\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu shub\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilaw isku mid ah had iyo jeer wuxuu siiyaa kala firid isku mid ah; Ku shub wuxuu doortaa mid kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESetyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft, waxayna raacaan wejiyada ay daboolaan markaad wax bedesho. Inta walax ee ugu badan ee muuqaalka tooska ah ay soo bandhigi karto waxaa lagu go&#039;aamiyaa heerka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/your-machine\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/your-machine\"\u003Ekombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/a\u003E: 20 000 \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor kaliya\u003C/span\u003E, 100 000 \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaarka garaafyada, aasaasi\u003C/span\u003E, hal milyan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaarka garaafyada, sare\u003C/span\u003E. Panelka wuxuu sheegayaa inta la dhigay iyo inta kala firintu codsanayso: waxa la dhigaa wax yar marka miisaaniyadda la gaaro, ama meelaha walxuhu ka ilaaliyaan. Walxaha dhow kamarada waxa loo muujiyaa sida nafteeda; kuwa fog waxa loo muujiyaa qaabab fudud oo midabkooda leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWalxaha la kala firiyay waa ku jira muuqaalka tooska ah (iyo socodkiisa, panoramaha iyo muuqaaliyaha madaxbannaan). Rendarka sawirka weli ma muujiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wadaag-panoramo-safar-muuqaaliye-fiidiyow\"\u003EWadaag: panoramo, safar, muuqaaliye, fiidiyow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWadaag\u003C/span\u003E ee sadarka muuqaalka tooska ah ayaa faylal ka sameeya muuqaalka tooska ah. Wax kasta kombiyuutarkan ayaa lagu sameeyaa; waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanorama 360°\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir 360° ah meesha muuqaalku taagan yahay (ama meesha aad socoto), oo ah PNG equirectangular ah oo muuqaalka panorama-ka iyo inta badan goobaha sawirada ay furi karaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar goobtan safarka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi safarka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal bog web ah oo leh panorama goob kasta iyo fallaadho u tilmaamaya goobaha kasta ee ay arki karto (darbi u dhexeeya ayaa qarisa fallaadha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi muuqaaliye\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal bog web ah oo leh moodeelka muuqaalkan wakhtiga dhabta ah: u wareeg, ku soco, u gudub goobahaas la kaydiyay. Waxa uu ka furmaa offline browser-ka leh WebGPU ama WebGL 2, folder, USB ama email, iyada oo aan wax la rakibin, akoon la&#039;aan, oo aan wax internetka ka soo rarin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFiidiyow jidka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidka kaamerada ee khadka waqtiga (ama goobaha la kaydiyay oo siday u kala horreeyaan) fiidiyow ahaan muuqaalkan wakhtiga dhabta ah, cabbirka muuqaalka tooska ah: WebM ama MP4 meesha browser-ku samayn karo, haddii kale sawiro lambaro leh oo ZIP ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka panorama-ka wuxuu raacaa tayada: 1024, 2048 ama 4096 pixel ballac ah marka Hooseeya, Dhexe iyo Sare. Faylka muuqaaliyaha wuxuu ahaan doonaa qiyaastii 5 MB oo ku daraan moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafarka iyo muuqaaliyaha waxaa loogu sameeyay muujinta, maahan tafatirka: waxay hayaan moodeelka sida uu yahay markaad kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tayada\"\u003ETayada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHooseeya\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhexe\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESare\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHooska qorraxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehal map hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esaddex cascade\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eafar cascade\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAmbient occlusion (hooska xiriirka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓, oo fiican\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka dib u celinta biraha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBloom (marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E dejiyo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E✓\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha la jilciyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFXAA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhowr frame (TAA)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edhowr frame (TAA)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka dib u celinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eqallafsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efiican\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eugu fiican\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKombiyuutarkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa Hooseeya kombiyuutar aan kaarka garaafyada la isticmaali karin, Dhexe marka chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira, Sare marka uu jiro kaarka garaafyada gaarka ah. Hooseeya waxa loogu talagalay laptop 8 GB ah oo aan kaarka garaafyada lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiinka-dib-u-celinta\"\u003EIftiinka dib u celinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIftiinka oo ka dib u soo noqda darbi qorraxda ka iftiimaysa oo soo gala dhulka, iyo gudaha qolka oo mugdi ah, waxaa xisaabiya isla path tracer-ka ah ee samaysa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawirada la rendaray\u003C/a\u003E: wuxuu rendarka sameeyaa panorama yar barta moodeelka ku jirta, background-ka processor kasta oo kombiyuutarka ah. Intuu shaqeynayo, sadarka hoose wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIftiinka dib u celinta: 40 %\u003C/span\u003E; markay diyaar tahay, muuqaalku wuu qaataa. Isbeddel kasta ka dib wuu dib u bilaabaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa qiyaas muuqaalka tooska ah, maahan sawir la rendaray: faahfaahinta yar ee u dhexaysa barta ayaa heleysa iftiinka dib u celinta barta ku dhow. Sawir dhammaystiran u isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iftiinka-iyo-midabyada\"\u003EIftiinka iyo midabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa iftiinka, dheelitirka cad, kontrastka iyo qaabka muuqaalka (ACES, AgX, filmic ama caadi) isla sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir\u003C/a\u003E: halkaas ku dejiso, muuqaalka tooska ahna wuu raacayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Meelaha browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU (Chrome iyo Edge oo Windows, macOS iyo ChromeOS, Safari 26) muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU; meelaha kale (inta badan browser-yada Linux, nidaamyada Apple ee hore) wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGL 2 wuuna la mid yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Export › Muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu furaa panel dusha ku taal app-ka oo muujisa moodeelka habka wakhtiga dhabta ah: samada iyo qorraxda meesha moodeelka iyo taariikhdiisa, hooska qorraxda, muuqaalka iyo agabka aad siisay wejiyada, laambadaha, iyo iftiinka oo darbiyada iyo dhulka ka dib u soo noqda. Wixii aad samayso wuu raacaa: muuqaalka u wareeji oo wuu wareegayaa, moodeelka beddel oo wuxuu muujiyaa isbeddelka wakhtiga yar kadib. Waxba lama soo rarayo. Fur Dooro Export › Muuqaalka tooska ah. Panelka wuxuu ku furmaa geeska hoose ee midig. Jiid cinwaankiisa si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid geeskiisa si aad u weyneyso. Daaqad cusub wuxuu u guuraa daaqad gaar ah, shaashad labaad. Export › Muuqaalka tooska ah daaqad cusub wuxuu ku furaa halkaas isla markiiba. Haddii browser-kaagu xayiran yahay daaqadaha pop-up-ka, wuxuu ku furmaa sida panel. Xir wuu xiraa. Qalabka Qalabka Waxa uu sameeyo Raac muuqaalka Haddii on: muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu eegaa meesha ay eegayso muuqaalka ModelCraft. Socodka wuu demiyaa Socod Socodso moodeelka gudihiisa (hoos) Cuf Markii la socdo: taag dabaqyada oo kor u kac jaranjarada. Demsan: duul Waqti Saacadda maalinta, 05:00 ilaa 21:00. Qorraxdu way dhaqaaqdaa markaad jiidayso Bil Bilaha (21-ka), si aad u aragto qorraxda jiilaalka iyo xagaaga Tayada Kombiyuutarkan (waxa kombiyuutarkaagu helo), ama Hooseeya, Dhexe ama Sare Sadarka hoose wuxuu sheegayaa waxa muuqaalka sawira (WebGPU ama WebGL 2), tayada, iyo iftiinka dib u celinta. Socod moodeelka gudihiisa U rog muuqaalka ugu weyn meesha aad rabto inaad taagnaato, oo dooro Socod. Waxaad taagan tahay dhulka hoose ee barta indhaha muuqaalka, oo dheer 1.6 m. Guji muuqaalka tooska ah, kadibna isticmaal W A S D ama furayaasha falaarta. Hay Shift si aad u orodo. Jiid si aad u eegto wareeg. Tallaabooyin ilaa 40 cm ayaa lagu kor fuulaa (jaranjaro); wax ka sarreeya waa darbi. Darbiyada ayaa ku joojiya, adna waad ku dhaqaaqaysaa dhinacooda. Cuf oo demsan waad duushaa: E waa sare, Q waa hoos. Esc wuu joojiyaa socodka. Kala firid dhir, dhagaxyo iyo dad Kala firid ee sadarka muuqaalka tooska ah ayaa furaa panelka kala firidda dhinaca sawirka. Set kala firid ah wuxuu kala firiyaa walxaha maktabadda entourage-ka (geedo, dhir yar, cawl, ubaxyo, dhagaxyo, dad, baabuur) qayb ka mid ah moodeelka. Walxahaasi waxa lagu muujiyaa muuqaalka tooska ah oo kaliya: maahan joomatari ku jira moodeelka, muuqaalka dhexe ma muujiyo. Buuxi wejiyada: dooro wejiyada (ama kooxda, sida dhulka) ModelCraft, kadibna dooro Buuxi xulashada. Setku wuu daboolaa. Rinji: dooro Rinji, kadibna jiid muuqaalka tooska ah. Haddii wejiyo la doortay, rinjigu wuxuu ku dhacaa kaliya; haddii aan wax la dooran, wuxuu ku dhacaa wax kasta oo burushka ka hooseeya, dhulka oo dhan ku jira. Cabbirka burushka wuxuu dejiyaa burushka; Tirtiraha wuxuu ka saaraa meelaha la rinjiyay. Calaamee waxa la kala firinayo. Tirada ku xigta mid kasta waa miisaankiisa: 3 iyo 1 waxay sameeyaan saddex midka hore mid kasta oo midka labaad. Qalabka Waxa uu sameeyo Mitir laba jibbaaran kasta Inta walax ee mitir laba jibbaaran kasta Ka fogow (m) Walxo ma dhowaan doonaan intaas ka hooseeya walxaha kale, mana jiraan saqaf ama miis hoosteeda. 0 wuu demiyaa Wareeg (°) Sida walax kasta u wareegto isaga oo random ah, goobta toosan ee dhererka ah Ugu jilicsan (°) Walxo ma jiraan meelaha dusha ay ka sii jilicsan tahay Cabbirka Cabbirka ugu yar iyo kan ugu weyn, isagoo ah factor ku saleysan cabbirka walaxda Dhererka laga bilaabo, ilaa (m) Kaliya dhererkan dhexdiisa (madhan = wax kasta) Ku dhaqaaq dusha 0 walxaha waxay ku jiraan toosan; 1 waxay u taagaan jilcinta si siman Bilaw, Ku shub Bilaw isku mid ah had iyo jeer wuxuu siiyaa kala firid isku mid ah; Ku shub wuxuu doortaa mid kale Setyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft, waxayna raacaan wejiyada ay daboolaan markaad wax bedesho. Inta walax ee ugu badan ee muuqaalka tooska ah ay soo bandhigi karto waxaa lagu go'aamiyaa heerka kombiyuutarkaaga: 20 000 Processor kaliya, 100 000 Kaarka garaafyada, aasaasi, hal milyan Kaarka garaafyada, sare. Panelka wuxuu sheegayaa inta la dhigay iyo inta kala firintu codsanayso: waxa la dhigaa wax yar marka miisaaniyadda la gaaro, ama meelaha walxuhu ka ilaaliyaan. Walxaha dhow kamarada waxa loo muujiyaa sida nafteeda; kuwa fog waxa loo muujiyaa qaabab fudud oo midabkooda leh. Walxaha la kala firiyay waa ku jira muuqaalka tooska ah (iyo socodkiisa, panoramaha iyo muuqaaliyaha madaxbannaan). Rendarka sawirka weli ma muujiyo. Wadaag: panoramo, safar, muuqaaliye, fiidiyow Wadaag ee sadarka muuqaalka tooska ah ayaa faylal ka sameeya muuqaalka tooska ah. Wax kasta kombiyuutarkan ayaa lagu sameeyaa; waxba lama soo rarayo. Doorasho Waxa aad hesho Panorama 360° Sawir 360° ah meesha muuqaalku taagan yahay (ama meesha aad socoto), oo ah PNG equirectangular ah oo muuqaalka panorama-ka iyo inta badan goobaha sawirada ay furi karaan Ku dar goobtan safarka, kadibna Kaydi safarka Hal bog web ah oo leh panorama goob kasta iyo fallaadho u tilmaamaya goobaha kasta ee ay arki karto (darbi u dhexeeya ayaa qarisa fallaadha) Kaydi muuqaaliye Hal bog web ah oo leh moodeelka muuqaalkan wakhtiga dhabta ah: u wareeg, ku soco, u gudub goobahaas la kaydiyay. Waxa uu ka furmaa offline browser-ka leh WebGPU ama WebGL 2, folder, USB ama email, iyada oo aan wax la rakibin, akoon la'aan, oo aan wax internetka ka soo rarin Fiidiyow jidka Jidka kaamerada ee khadka waqtiga (ama goobaha la kaydiyay oo siday u kala horreeyaan) fiidiyow ahaan muuqaalkan wakhtiga dhabta ah, cabbirka muuqaalka tooska ah: WebM ama MP4 meesha browser-ku samayn karo, haddii kale sawiro lambaro leh oo ZIP ku jira Cabbirka panorama-ka wuxuu raacaa tayada: 1024, 2048 ama 4096 pixel ballac ah marka Hooseeya, Dhexe iyo Sare. Faylka muuqaaliyaha wuxuu ahaan doonaa qiyaastii 5 MB oo ku daraan moodeelka. Safarka iyo muuqaaliyaha waxaa loogu sameeyay muujinta, maahan tafatirka: waxay hayaan moodeelka sida uu yahay markaad kaydiso. Tayada Hooseeya Dhexe Sare Hooska qorraxda hal map hoose saddex cascade afar cascade Ambient occlusion (hooska xiriirka) ✓ ✓, oo fiican Muuqaalka dib u celinta biraha ✓ Bloom (marka Rendar sawir… dejiyo) ✓ ✓ Geesaha la jilciyay FXAA dhowr frame (TAA) dhowr frame (TAA) Iftiinka dib u celinta qallafsan fiican ugu fiican Kombiyuutarkan wuxuu doortaa Hooseeya kombiyuutar aan kaarka garaafyada la isticmaali karin, Dhexe marka chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira, Sare marka uu jiro kaarka garaafyada gaarka ah. Hooseeya waxa loogu talagalay laptop 8 GB ah oo aan kaarka garaafyada lahayn. Iftiinka dib u celinta Iftiinka oo ka dib u soo noqda darbi qorraxda ka iftiimaysa oo soo gala dhulka, iyo gudaha qolka oo mugdi ah, waxaa xisaabiya isla path tracer-ka ah ee samaysa sawirada la rendaray: wuxuu rendarka sameeyaa panorama yar barta moodeelka ku jirta, background-ka processor kasta oo kombiyuutarka ah. Intuu shaqeynayo, sadarka hoose wuxuu leeyahay Iftiinka dib u celinta: 40 %; markay diyaar tahay, muuqaalku wuu qaataa. Isbeddel kasta ka dib wuu dib u bilaabaa. Tani waa qiyaas muuqaalka tooska ah, maahan sawir la rendaray: faahfaahinta yar ee u dhexaysa barta ayaa heleysa iftiinka dib u celinta barta ku dhow. Sawir dhammaystiran u isticmaal Rendar sawir. Iftiinka iyo midabyada Muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa iftiinka, dheelitirka cad, kontrastka iyo qaabka muuqaalka (ACES, AgX, filmic ama caadi) isla sida Rendar sawir: halkaas ku dejiso, muuqaalka tooska ahna wuu raacayaa. Browser-yadu way kala duwan yihiin. Meelaha browser-ku leeyahay WebGPU (Chrome iyo Edge oo Windows, macOS iyo ChromeOS, Safari 26) muuqaalka tooska ah wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGPU; meelaha kale (inta badan browser-yada Linux, nidaamyada Apple ee hore) wuxuu isticmaalaa WebGL 2 wuuna la mid yahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"animation","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dhaqdhaqaaqa kamaradda iyo shayada, oo fiidiyo rendar garee","summary":"Dheji furayaal kamaradda, kooxaha iyo qaybaha jadwal, ku ciyaar aragga, oo rendar dhaqdhaqaaqa fiidiyow WebM ah iyada oo leh sanbaadhka, qorraxda iyo alaabta rendar-ka.","section":"tasks","order":114,"keywords":["dhaqdhaqaaq","dhaqdhaqaaq","jadwal","furaha fraamka","furayaal","furayaasha","jid kamaradda","socod kamaradda","fiidiyo","filim","webm","rendar fiidiyo","fraamyo","xawaaraha sawirka","fps","jeexda ciyaarta","furaha otomaatig","ease","siilin","hay","goobaha","taxane PNG","dhaqdhaqaaq"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-jadwalka","text":"Fur jadwalka","level":2},{"id":"kamaradda-dhaqaaqi","text":"Kamaradda dhaqaaqi","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaajiso-kooxda-ama-qaybta","text":"Dhaqaajiso kooxda ama qaybta","level":2},{"id":"beddel-furayaasha","text":"Beddel furayaasha","level":2},{"id":"rendar-fiidiyowga","text":"Rendar fiidiyowga","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJadwalku\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa kamaradda iyo kooxda kasta ama qayb waqti ku jirta. Waxaad dejisaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efurayaal\u003C/strong\u003E (meesha wax ku sugan yihiin waqti gaar ah); ModelCraft wuxuu si nabad leh ugu dhaqaajiyaa furayaal ilaa furayaal. Ku ciyaar aragga, kadibna rendar fiidiyow isla sanbaadhka, qorraxda, alaabta iyo laydhadka sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003Esawirka la rendaray\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-jadwalka\"\u003EFur jadwalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECamera\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimation timeline\u003C/span\u003E. Jadwalku wuxuu furmaa hoosta aragga: xakameynta sare, kadibna safka \u003Cstrong\u003ECamera\u003C/strong\u003E iyo safka kasta oo kooxda ama qaybta dhaqaaqda. Calaamadaha waa furayaal; jeexda casaanka ah waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ejeexda ciyaarta\u003C/strong\u003E, waqtiga ay aragga muujinayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETelefoonka jadwalku wuxuu sidoo kale hoosta aragga furmaa. Xakamaynta waa hal safaf: u jiid si aad u gaadho kuwa kale; badhanka xidhaya jadwalka wuxuu ku sii jiraa dhamaadkiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid slider-ka (ama guji safka) si aad u guurisid jeexda ciyaarta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa jeexda ciyaarta ka bilaabmaya wuxuuna noqdaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPause\u003C/span\u003E markuu ciyaarayo; mar kale guji si aad joogsato meesha uu joogo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada markii jadwalku furan yahay (jadwalka xidhan, Space wuxuu weli yahay Select). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrevious key\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext key\u003C/span\u003E waxay u boodaan furayaasha. Style-kaaga ayaa ka dhigi kara ciyaar/joogso fure kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna menus, keys iyo mouse, amarka \u003Cem\u003EPlay or pause the animation\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kamaradda-dhaqaaqi\"\u003EKamaradda dhaqaaqi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeeso jeexda ciyaarta bilowga muuqaalka (0 s), dejiso aragga, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeeso jeexda ciyaarta dambe (tusaale 4 s), wareeji, rari ama socod aragga booska xiga, kadibna mar kale guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar furayaal inta aad rabto, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKamaraddu waxay si nabad leh uga gudubtaa fur kasta, waxayna ka bilaabataa oo ku dhammaataa nasasho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHorey ma haysaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Egoobaha\u003C/a\u003E? \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom scenes\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu jidka kamaradda ka dhigaa iyaga: wuxuu joogsadaa goob kasta, kadibna wuxuu u guurayaa midka xiga. Haddii jadwalku aan furayaal lahayn, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video…\u003C/span\u003E wuu sameeyaa isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed laba goob ama ka badan waa ku filan fiidiyow socod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaajiso-kooxda-ama-qaybta\"\u003EDhaqaajiso kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda ama qaybta (kooxaha oo dhan iyo qaybaha oo kaliya ayaa dhaqaaqa; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Esamee kooxda\u003C/a\u003E marka hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilowga 0 s, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeeso jeexda ciyaarta dambe, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003Eguuri, wareeji ama miisaan\u003C/a\u003E kooxda meesha ay ku qasan tahay, kadibna mar kale guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa siibtaa, wareegtaa, weynaataa inta u dhaxaysa furayaashiisa. Wareegyadu waxay qaataan jid gaaban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAuto key\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa guji-ga tallaabada 3: markii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto key\u003C/span\u003E la shido, kooxda ama qaybta la doortay ee aad guurisid, wareegtid ama weynaysid waxay helaysaa fur jeexda ciyaarta (iyo, markii ugu horeysay, fur 0 s meeshii ay ahayd).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda dhaqaajiska ah ee aan fur lahayn waxay sii jirtaa ilaa jeexda ciyaarta dhaqaaqo: markii aad ciyaarto ama dhaqaajiso, waxay ku noqonaysaa meeshii furayaashu ku dhigeen. Status bar-ku wuu sheegaa. Riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-furayaasha\"\u003EBeddel furayaasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro fur\u003C/strong\u003E isagoo guji calaamaddeeda: jeexda ciyaarta ayaa u gudubta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri fur\u003C/strong\u003E isagoo jiidaya calaamaddeeda safkeeda, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hal fraam; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka dib, toban).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete key\u003C/span\u003E (furta la doortay, ama furayaasha oo dhan ee jeexda ciyaarta) ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E calaamada la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESidee u dhaqaaqa\u003C/strong\u003E, furta la doortay: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E (khad mari furayaasha ku xeeran), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteady\u003C/span\u003E (khad toosan oo hal xawaare), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlow in and out\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu ku nasanayaa furtan) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E (wuu joogaa ilaa fur xiga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELength (s)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejinayaa intee dheer ee dhaqdhaqaaqu yahay; fur la dhigo ka dambeeya dhammaadka wuu dheereeyaa. Si aad u gaabiso, guuri ama tirtir furayaasha ka dambeeya dhammaadka cusub marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E ee safka kooxda wuxuu joojiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJadwalku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E gaar ah: undo-ga moodelka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu beddelaa moodelka, ma aha furayaasha. Dhaqdhaqaaqu waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E. Xidhidda jadwalka wuxuu kooxaha dhaqaaqa ku celiyaa jihadooda ugu horeysay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rendar-fiidiyowga\"\u003ERendar fiidiyowga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E jadwalka (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video…\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame rate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality of each frame\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E. Fraam kasta wuu muuqdaa markii la sameynayo, iyo waqtiga harsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii uu dhammaado, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu dhammeeyaa hore; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E markaas wuxuu kaydinayaa fraamyada la sameeyay fiidiyow gaaban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanbaadhka, qorraxda, alaabta, laydhadka iyo iftiinka waa kuwa lagu dejiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E: halkaas hore ku deji, adigoo hubinaya sawir hal taagan. Fraam kasta kombuyuutarkan ayaa lagu rendaraa; waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E480p, 720p HD, 1080p Full HD, ama qaabka aragga (ilaa 1920 pixel ballac)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame rate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24, 25, 30 ama 60 fraam ilbiriqsi kasta. Fraam laba jeer ah waxay qaadataa laba jeer waqti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuality of each frame\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuick\u003C/span\u003E (4 marxaladood), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E (16) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E (64): marxaladaha badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo geesaha sooyaal fiican\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWebM video\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMP4 video (H.264)\u003C/span\u003E meesha browser-ku qori karo, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP)\u003C/span\u003E tafatiraha fiidiyowga (iyo browsers aan encoder fiidiyow lahayn)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFiidiyow 10 ilbiriqsi ah oo 30 fraam ilbiriqsi kasta ah waa 301 fraam. Isku day \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuick\u003C/span\u003E 480p marka hore si aad u hubiso dhaqdhaqaaqa, kadibna rendar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGood\u003C/span\u003E cabbir weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebM waxay ku ciyaartaa browser-yada iyo VLC, tafatiraha fiidiyowga ayaa beddela. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMP4 video (H.264)\u003C/span\u003E waa la siiyaa meesha browser-ku qori karo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa rendar degdeg ah; si aad fraam kasta u path trace-gareyso, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd this animation to the queue\u003C/span\u003E isla wada-hadalka: fraamyada waxay ku rendaraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#the-render-queue\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"the-render-queue\"\u003Esafka rendar-ka\u003C/a\u003E, taas oo u baahan WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERendar fiidiyo wuxuu u baahan yahay browser ku qori kara fiidiyow laftiisa (WebCodecs): Chrome cusub, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari 17 ayaa sidaas sameeya. Haddii aanu jirin, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha oo kaliya ayaa dhaqaaqa. Wejiyada, geesaha, waqtiga qorraxda iyo style-ku weli waxba kuma beddelmaan waqtiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport animation\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003EGoobaha\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu weli duubaa aragga sida uu shaashadda ku yahay, wakhtiga dhabta ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender video\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu rendaraa fraam kasta oo leh sanbaadhka, hooska iyo alaabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Jadwalku wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa kamaradda iyo kooxda kasta ama qayb waqti ku jirta. Waxaad dejisaa furayaal (meesha wax ku sugan yihiin waqti gaar ah); ModelCraft wuxuu si nabad leh ugu dhaqaajiyaa furayaal ilaa furayaal. Ku ciyaar aragga, kadibna rendar fiidiyow isla sanbaadhka, qorraxda, alaabta iyo laydhadka sida sawirka la rendaray. Fur jadwalka Riix Views kooxda Camera, kadibna Animation timeline. Jadwalku wuxuu furmaa hoosta aragga: xakameynta sare, kadibna safka Camera iyo safka kasta oo kooxda ama qaybta dhaqaaqda. Calaamadaha waa furayaal; jeexda casaanka ah waa jeexda ciyaarta, waqtiga ay aragga muujinayso. Telefoonka jadwalku wuxuu sidoo kale hoosta aragga furmaa. Xakamaynta waa hal safaf: u jiid si aad u gaadho kuwa kale; badhanka xidhaya jadwalka wuxuu ku sii jiraa dhamaadkiisa. Jiid slider-ka (ama guji safka) si aad u guurisid jeexda ciyaarta. Play wuxuu ciyaaraa jeexda ciyaarta ka bilaabmaya wuxuuna noqdaa Pause markuu ciyaarayo; mar kale guji si aad joogsato meesha uu joogo. Space wuxuu sameeyaa isla shaqada markii jadwalku furan yahay (jadwalka xidhan, Space wuxuu weli yahay Select). Previous key iyo Next key waxay u boodaan furayaasha. Style-kaaga ayaa ka dhigi kara ciyaar/joogso fure kale: Settings, kadibna menus, keys iyo mouse, amarka Play or pause the animation. Kamaradda dhaqaaqi Geeso jeexda ciyaarta bilowga muuqaalka (0 s), dejiso aragga, kadibna guji Key camera. Geeso jeexda ciyaarta dambe (tusaale 4 s), wareeji, rari ama socod aragga booska xiga, kadibna mar kale guji Key camera. Ku dar furayaal inta aad rabto, kadibna Play. Kamaraddu waxay si nabad leh uga gudubtaa fur kasta, waxayna ka bilaabataa oo ku dhammaataa nasasho. Horey ma haysaa goobaha? From scenes wuxuu jidka kamaradda ka dhigaa iyaga: wuxuu joogsadaa goob kasta, kadibna wuxuu u guurayaa midka xiga. Haddii jadwalku aan furayaal lahayn, Render video… wuu sameeyaa isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed laba goob ama ka badan waa ku filan fiidiyow socod. Dhaqaajiso kooxda ama qaybta Dooro kooxda ama qaybta (kooxaha oo dhan iyo qaybaha oo kaliya ayaa dhaqaaqa; samee kooxda marka hore). Bilowga 0 s, guji Key selected. Geeso jeexda ciyaarta dambe, guuri, wareeji ama miisaan kooxda meesha ay ku qasan tahay, kadibna mar kale guji Key selected. Waa siibtaa, wareegtaa, weynaataa inta u dhaxaysa furayaashiisa. Wareegyadu waxay qaataan jid gaaban. Auto key wuxuu qaadaa guji-ga tallaabada 3: markii Auto key la shido, kooxda ama qaybta la doortay ee aad guurisid, wareegtid ama weynaysid waxay helaysaa fur jeexda ciyaarta (iyo, markii ugu horeysay, fur 0 s meeshii ay ahayd). Kooxda dhaqaajiska ah ee aan fur lahayn waxay sii jirtaa ilaa jeexda ciyaarta dhaqaaqo: markii aad ciyaarto ama dhaqaajiso, waxay ku noqonaysaa meeshii furayaashu ku dhigeen. Status bar-ku wuu sheegaa. Riix Key selected si aad u hayso. Beddel furayaasha Dooro fur isagoo guji calaamaddeeda: jeexda ciyaarta ayaa u gudubta. Guuri fur isagoo jiidaya calaamaddeeda safkeeda, ama ← iyo → (hal fraam; Shift ka dib, toban). Tirtir Delete key (furta la doortay, ama furayaasha oo dhan ee jeexda ciyaarta) ama Delete calaamada la doortay. Sidee u dhaqaaqa, furta la doortay: Smooth (khad mari furayaasha ku xeeran), Steady (khad toosan oo hal xawaare), Slow in and out (wuxuu ku nasanayaa furtan) ama Hold (wuu joogaa ilaa fur xiga). Length (s) wuxuu dejinayaa intee dheer ee dhaqdhaqaaqu yahay; fur la dhigo ka dambeeya dhammaadka wuu dheereeyaa. Si aad u gaabiso, guuri ama tirtir furayaasha ka dambeeya dhammaadka cusub marka hore. Calaamadda × ee safka kooxda wuxuu joojiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqeeda. Jadwalku wuxuu leeyahay Undo iyo Redo gaar ah: undo-ga moodelka (Ctrl+Z) wuxuu beddelaa moodelka, ma aha furayaasha. Dhaqdhaqaaqu waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Xidhidda jadwalka wuxuu kooxaha dhaqaaqa ku celiyaa jihadooda ugu horeysay. Rendar fiidiyowga Guji Render video jadwalka (ama Export › Render video…). Dooro Size, Frame rate, Quality of each frame iyo File. Guji Render video. Fraam kasta wuu muuqdaa markii la sameynayo, iyo waqtiga harsan. Markii uu dhammaado, guji Save video. Stop (ama Esc) wuxuu dhammeeyaa hore; Save video markaas wuxuu kaydinayaa fraamyada la sameeyay fiidiyow gaaban. Sanbaadhka, qorraxda, alaabta, laydhadka iyo iftiinka waa kuwa lagu dejiyay Render a picture…: halkaas hore ku deji, adigoo hubinaya sawir hal taagan. Fraam kasta kombuyuutarkan ayaa lagu rendaraa; waxba lama soo rarayo. Dejinta Waxa ay sameyso Size 480p, 720p HD, 1080p Full HD, ama qaabka aragga (ilaa 1920 pixel ballac) Frame rate 24, 25, 30 ama 60 fraam ilbiriqsi kasta. Fraam laba jeer ah waxay qaadataa laba jeer waqti Quality of each frame Quick (4 marxaladood), Draft (16) ama Good (64): marxaladaha badan waxay siiyaan hooska iyo geesaha sooyaal fiican File WebM video, MP4 video (H.264) meesha browser-ku qori karo, ama PNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP) tafatiraha fiidiyowga (iyo browsers aan encoder fiidiyow lahayn) Fiidiyow 10 ilbiriqsi ah oo 30 fraam ilbiriqsi kasta ah waa 301 fraam. Isku day Quick 480p marka hore si aad u hubiso dhaqdhaqaaqa, kadibna rendar Draft ama Good cabbir weyn. WebM waxay ku ciyaartaa browser-yada iyo VLC, tafatiraha fiidiyowga ayaa beddela. MP4 video (H.264) waa la siiyaa meesha browser-ku qori karo. Render video wuxuu isticmaalaa rendar degdeg ah; si aad fraam kasta u path trace-gareyso, dooro Add this animation to the queue isla wada-hadalka: fraamyada waxay ku rendaraan safka rendar-ka, taas oo u baahan WebGPU. Rendar fiidiyo wuxuu u baahan yahay browser ku qori kara fiidiyow laftiisa (WebCodecs): Chrome cusub, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari 17 ayaa sidaas sameeya. Haddii aanu jirin, dooro PNG pictures, one per frame (ZIP). Waxa la ogaado Kooxaha iyo qaybaha oo kaliya ayaa dhaqaaqa. Wejiyada, geesaha, waqtiga qorraxda iyo style-ku weli waxba kuma beddelmaan waqtiga. Export animation hoosta Goobaha wuxuu weli duubaa aragga sida uu shaashadda ku yahay, wakhtiga dhabta ah; Render video wuxuu rendaraa fraam kasta oo leh sanbaadhka, hooska iyo alaabta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-other-program","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sawir","summary":"Matoorkeenna path tracer-ka ayaa sawirka Rendar sameeya; barnaamij kale wuxuu sawiri karaa kaliya kordhin matoor rendar oo CadCraft Studio ku jira. Waxa la wareejiyo iyo sababta barnaamijyada qaarkood aan waligood loo soo bandhigin.","section":"tasks","order":114,"keywords":["rendar","matoor","barnaamij dibada","kordhin matoor","studio","gadaal","safka","usd","gltf","lagu sawiray","blender","gpl"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-sawir-matoorka-kordhinta","text":"Sawir sawir matoorka kordhinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-wareejiyo","text":"Waxa la wareejiyo","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-cadcraft-weligeed-ma-socodsiiyo","text":"Barnaamijyada CadCraft weligeed ma socodsiiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESawirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E waxaa sameeya \u003Cstrong\u003Ematoorradeenna\u003C/strong\u003E: Dhakhso iyo Path tracer, browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Barnaamij kale wuxuu sawiri karaa kaliya marka \u003Cstrong\u003Ekordhin matoor rendar\u003C/strong\u003E keeno: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-engine-addons\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-engine-addons\"\u003EKu dar matoor rendar kordhin ahaan\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad muuqaalka barnaamij kale ugu qaaddo oo aad ka sii shaqeyso, isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-open-in\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-open-in\"\u003EMuuqaalka barnaamij kale ku fur\u003C/a\u003E ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EU dir muuqaalka matoorka ciyaarta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-sawir-matoorka-kordhinta\"\u003ESawir sawir matoorka kordhinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKordhinta ku shid Dejinta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E. Matoorkeeda wuxuu ku soo muuqanayaa liiska Matoorka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro. Dejintiisa gaarka ah ayaa muuqda hoosta liiska Matoorka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar\u003C/span\u003E. Studio-ga, markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, Studio wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa sanduuqiisa. Horumarka ayaa muuqda intuu sawirka sameynayo; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa joojiya. Sawirka wuxuu soo muuqdaa isagoo calaamadeysan matoorka sameeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMatoor lagu qoray JavaScript ayaa browser-ka sidoo kale ku shaqeeya. Matoor barnaamij kombiyuutarkan socodsiiya wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa sida fayl loo kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-wareejiyo\"\u003EWaxa la wareejiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMatoorku wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Epakaj\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelka sida fayl USD (iyo fayl glTF marka uu weydiiyo), iyo fayl dejin oo leh qiyamka saxda ah ee agabka, qorraxda iyo cirka, laydhadhka kasta ee shidan oo leh awoodooda iyo profaylka iftiinka, kamarada iyo iftiinka. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu iftiimiyaa, midabeeyaa oo tusaaleeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed sawirradu waxay isku eg yihiin kamarada, qorraxda, laydhadhka iyo iftiinka, laakiin ma aha pixel ka pixel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-cadcraft-weligeed-ma-socodsiiyo\"\u003EBarnaamijyada CadCraft weligeed ma socodsiiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft weligeed ma bilaabo barnaamij ku jira GNU GPL liisanka, weligeedna ma liisto matoor ama bartilmaameed Fur ku. Blender waa mid ka mid ah, sidaas darteed ma jiro liiska Matoorka. Fayl USD ama glTF oo laga kaydiyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E weli wuu ku furmaa barnaamij kasta oo akhrisa faylashaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKamarooyinka panorama iyo stereo, iyo sawirka cirka (midabada cirka ayaa loo isticmaalaa halkiisa) lama wareejiyo barnaamij kale. Wax kasta oo barnaamij kale lagu sameeyo ma soo noqdo moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Sawirka Rendar sawir… waxaa sameeya matoorradeenna: Dhakhso iyo Path tracer, browser-ka iyo CadCraft Studio. Barnaamij kale wuxuu sawiri karaa kaliya marka kordhin matoor rendar keeno: eeg Ku dar matoor rendar kordhin ahaan. Si aad muuqaalka barnaamij kale ugu qaaddo oo aad ka sii shaqeyso, isticmaal Muuqaalka barnaamij kale ku fur ama U dir muuqaalka matoorka ciyaarta. Sawir sawir matoorka kordhinta Kordhinta ku shid Dejinta › Kordhinno. Matoorkeeda wuxuu ku soo muuqanayaa liiska Matoorka ee Rendar sawir…. Dooro. Dejintiisa gaarka ah ayaa muuqda hoosta liiska Matoorka. Guji Rendar. Studio-ga, markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, Studio wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa sanduuqiisa. Horumarka ayaa muuqda intuu sawirka sameynayo; Jooji ayaa joojiya. Sawirka wuxuu soo muuqdaa isagoo calaamadeysan matoorka sameeyay. Matoor lagu qoray JavaScript ayaa browser-ka sidoo kale ku shaqeeya. Matoor barnaamij kombiyuutarkan socodsiiya wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio kaliya; browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa sida fayl loo kaydiyo. Waxa la wareejiyo Matoorku wuxuu helaa pakaj: moodeelka sida fayl USD (iyo fayl glTF marka uu weydiiyo), iyo fayl dejin oo leh qiyamka saxda ah ee agabka, qorraxda iyo cirka, laydhadhka kasta ee shidan oo leh awoodooda iyo profaylka iftiinka, kamarada iyo iftiinka. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu iftiimiyaa, midabeeyaa oo tusaaleeyaa si u gaar ah, sidaas darteed sawirradu waxay isku eg yihiin kamarada, qorraxda, laydhadhka iyo iftiinka, laakiin ma aha pixel ka pixel. Barnaamijyada CadCraft weligeed ma socodsiiyo CadCraft weligeed ma bilaabo barnaamij ku jira GNU GPL liisanka, weligeedna ma liisto matoor ama bartilmaameed Fur ku. Blender waa mid ka mid ah, sidaas darteed ma jiro liiska Matoorka. Fayl USD ama glTF oo laga kaydiyay Rendar sawir… weli wuu ku furmaa barnaamij kasta oo akhrisa faylashaas. Kamarooyinka panorama iyo stereo, iyo sawirka cirka (midabada cirka ayaa loo isticmaalaa halkiisa) lama wareejiyo barnaamij kale. Wax kasta oo barnaamij kale lagu sameeyo ma soo noqdo moodeelka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"animate","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dhaqdhaqaaqi hanti kasta, u qaabee khadad qalloocan, oo isku dar clips","summary":"Workspace-ka Animate wuxuu furaa goobta, wareegga iyo cabbirka shay, iftiinka, faafinta iyo midabka laydh, lensiga iyo furayaasha qaabka mesh; armatures waxay mesh ku foorarsadaan lafo iyo miisaan la rinjiyeeyay; IK iyo xaddidaadyadu waxay ka dhigaan lafaha iyo shayada inay gaadhaan, eegaan, nuqulaan, ku sii jiraan xadadka, ku xirmaan ama raacaan kuwa kale; jidhka adag wuxuu hoos u dhacaa, isku rari karaa oo isku dhacaa, kadibna furayaal ayuu noqdaa; darawallada ayaa qiimaha ka dhigaya wax kale; aragga Curves ee jadwalka wuxuu isbeddel kasta u qaabeeyaa gacmo Bézier iyo wareeg, aragga Clips wuxuu dhaqdhaqaaqyada u kaydiyaa sida falal aad mar kale dhigto oo isku darto.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["fiisigis","jidh adag","jidho adag","simulashan","simulee","hoos u dhac","dhac","culeyska dhulka","isku dhac","isku rar","dib u dhac","isku-xoqid","dubbee","la dubbay","ik","kinemaatig rogan","xaddidaad","xaddidaadyo","eeg","raac","beeg","koobiyee wareegyada","koobiyee goobta","koobiyee wareegga","xaddid wareegga","xadadka","ilmaha","waalid","raac jid","jid","dhinac","fabrik","silsilad","qaab-lafeed","qaab-lafeedyo","rig","rigging","lafo","laf","qalfoof","maqaar","maqaarka","miisaanno","rinjiga miisaanka","kooxaha barta","miisaanka toosan","kulaylka lafta","qaab","habka qaabka","dual quaternion","isku dar toosan","furayaasha qaabka","furaha qaabka","beddel qaab","qaababka isku dhafan","wajiga","tilmaan","darawal","darawallo","tilmaamo","goobta dhaqdhaqaaqa","dhaqdhaqaaq","furaha","furayaasha","hanti","hantiyo","beddel","goob","wareeg","miisaan","laydh","iftiin","midab","lens","aaga aragga","fov","tafatiraha grafka","khadadka qalloocan","qallooc","bézier","gacmo","taangent","isku-xidhka","wareeg","wareegyo","ku celi","dhinac-dhinac","kala-sooc","xaashida furaha","dooro furayaasha","dooro sanduuq","koobiyee furayaasha","dhaji furayaasha","ballaadhi furayaasha","miisaan furayaasha","clips","falal","nla","isku dar","saameyn","kaydi"],"headings":[{"id":"furo","text":"Furo","level":2},{"id":"fur-hanti","text":"Fur hanti","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-qaabka-morphs","text":"Furayaasha qaabka (morphs)","level":2},{"id":"armatures-lafo-mesh-ka-foorarsada","text":"Armatures: lafo mesh-ka foorarsada","level":2},{"id":"ik-iyo-xaddidaadyo","text":"IK iyo xaddidaadyo","level":2},{"id":"fiisigis-hoos-u-dhac-isku-rar-iyo-isku-dhac","text":"Fiisigis: hoos u dhac, isku rar iyo isku dhac","level":2},{"id":"darawallo","text":"Darawallo","level":2},{"id":"dooro-oo-beddel-furayaasha-aragga-keys","text":"Dooro oo beddel furayaasha (aragga Keys)","level":2},{"id":"qaabee-khadadka-aragga-curves","text":"Qaabee khadadka (aragga Curves)","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-isticmaal-dhaqdhaqaaqyada-aragga-clips","text":"Dib u isticmaal dhaqdhaqaaqyada (aragga Clips)","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ciyaara-meesha","text":"Waxa ciyaara meesha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003EJadwalku\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu kamaradda iyo kooxaha oo dhan iyo qaybaha u dhaqaajiyaa. Goobta \u003Cstrong\u003EAnimate\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wax ka badan furaa, jadwalkuna laba aragga oo dheeraad ah helaa si aad u qaabeysid oo aad dib u isticmaasho waxa aad furtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furo\"\u003EFuro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/span\u003E liiska workspace-ka ee toolbar-ka. Jadwalku wuxuu furmaa hoosta aragga, toolbar-ku wuxuu muujinayaa kooxaha Animate (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETimeline\u003C/span\u003E), panel-ka midigna wuxuu liistaa waxa aad furi karto jeexda ciyaarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-hanti\"\u003EFur hanti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ku wuxuu liistaa, jeexda ciyaarta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShayga la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn (°)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E, saddex tiro mid kasta. Qor tiro oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: waxaa lagu furayaa jeexda ciyaarta, shayguna halkaas ayuu u guurayaa. Calaamadda ku taal safka wuxuu furaa qiimaha sida uu hadda yahay; calaamad buuxa waxay muujinaysaa in furaha jeexda ciyaarta uu horeba u jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaydhadka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBrightness (lm)\u003C/span\u003E kasta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpread (°)\u003C/span\u003E (laydhadka spot) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColour\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKamaradda\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELens angle (°)\u003C/span\u003E, zoom marka kamaraddu dhaqaaqayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey transform\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu furaa dhigga, wareegga iyo cabbirka kooxda ama qaybta kasta oo la doortay isla mar; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey camera\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu furaa kamaraddda. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto key\u003C/span\u003E la shido, kooxda oo goobteeda, wareegteeda iyo cabbirkeeda si kan loo furay ayaa fur cusub helaysa mar kasta oo aad u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareegyadu waa saddex xagal, oo ku saabsan X, kadibna Y, kadibna Z. Wareeg la furay ka badan 180° wuxuu sii socdaa isla jihadii hore (190° wuxuu weli yahay 190°, ma aha −170°), sidaas darteed gurigu wuu wareegi karaa dhowr jeer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda lagu furay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey selected\u003C/span\u003E jadwalka wuxuu leeyahay furayaal dhigo oo dhan. Badhanka qalloocan ee safkeeda wuxuu u beddelaa furayaashaas dhig, wareeg iyo cabbir khadad ah (isla dhigga fur kasta) si aad ugu qaabeyn karto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurves\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-qaabka-morphs\"\u003EFurayaasha qaabka (morphs)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuraha qaabka\u003C/strong\u003E waa qaab kale oo isla \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E-ka ah: wajiga oo qoslaya, albaabka oo bararsan, caleen qallooc. Siilkiisu wuxuu ka dhex-dhalaa mesh-ka sida uu yahay (0) ilaa qaabkaas (1); furayaal dhowr ah ayaa wada isku daraya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mesh-ka goobta Animate: panel-ku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShape keys\u003C/span\u003E-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd shape key\u003C/span\u003E. ModelCraft wuxuu kugu tagayaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\"\u003EMesh workspace\u003C/a\u003E furaha cusub ee la tafatirayo: qodob dhaqaajin, soo saar, sawir — beddel mesh-ka qaabka aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu noqo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E. Mesh-ku wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa sidii uu ahaa, furuhuna wuxuu haysaa isbeddelkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadibna jiid siilka furaha (ama qor qiime) si aad u isku darto. Calaamaddu wuxuu qiimaha ku furaa jeexda ciyaarta, sidaas darteed furuhu wuu kori karaa oo wuu dhiman karaa wakhti ka dib; markii uu raad yeesho, qiime cusub ayaa jeexda ciyaarta lagu furaa. Qalinku wuxuu mar kale tafatiraa qaabka furaha (mesh-ku wuxuu si buuxda u muujiyaa ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaha ka tagaa sidii ay ahayd), indhuhu wuxuu damiyaa furaha, qashinku wuxuu ka saaraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQodob aad ku darto markii aad furaha tafatireyso wuxuu dhigan yahay mesh-ka laftiisa: wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad geliyey, qaab kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha qaabka waxay mesh-ka dhaqdhaqaajiyaan ka hor \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003Emodifiers\u003C/a\u003E: Subdivision modifier wuxuu jilciyaa qaabka isku dhafan. Sawirrada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyada waxay muujinayaan furayaasha fraam kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"armatures-lafo-mesh-ka-foorarsada\"\u003EArmatures: lafo mesh-ka foorarsada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArmature\u003C/strong\u003E waa tiro lafo ku jirta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E. Lafaha ku qaabee, mesh-kuna wuu raacaa, barta kasta sida ay \u003Cstrong\u003Emiisaankeedu\u003C/strong\u003E u sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mesh-ka goobta Animate oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd an armature\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd bone\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERig\u003C/span\u003E): lafta koowaad waxay ka sii kacaysaa badhka mesh-ka laga bilaabo cagta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka laf la doortay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a child bone\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa midka xiga gacanta ka bilaabmaya. Deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHead\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETip\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoll (°)\u003C/span\u003E iyo waxa uu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHangs from\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka; laf ku xiran mid kale wuu la socdaa. Ka saar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoves the mesh\u003C/span\u003E laf kaliya inay kuwa kale hagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic weights\u003C/span\u003E: laf kasta wuxuu qabsadaa barta ugu dhow, qabsashadaduna si nabad ah ayay mesh-ka ugu faafaysaa, sidaas darteed barta ka dhexaysa laba laf way wadaagaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENearest bones only\u003C/span\u003E waa kala-qaybin degdeg ah oo adag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPose\u003C/strong\u003E lafaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPose\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): guji laf si aad u doorato, jiid si aad u wareejiso aragga, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-jiid si aad u guurisid. Ama qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn (°)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPose\u003C/span\u003E; wareegyadu waxay ku jiraan jihooyinka lafta laftiisa, laga bilaabo meesha ay ku nasatay. Calaamadaha iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the whole pose\u003C/span\u003E waxay furaan qaabka jeexda ciyaarta; laf leh furayaal markii la pose-ayo halkaas ayay ku furaysaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this bone\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the pose\u003C/span\u003E waxay lafaha dib ugu celiyaan nasashada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERinji miisaanka\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) laf la doortay: mesh-ku wuxuu muujinayaa nasashada, wejiga kastaa midab buu leeyahay sida laftaasi u qabsato — casaan oo dhan, buluug waxba. Rinji si aad u darto qabsashada (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E way ka qaadaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E way siibtaa); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize (px)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStrength\u003C/span\u003E ayaa dejinaya burushka. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep each point&#039;s weights adding up to 1\u003C/span\u003E la shido, laf wax badan oo la siiyo, wax la mid ahna laga qaadaa kuwa kale. Mid kasta oo rinji ah waa hal tallaabo oo undo-ga moodelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkin\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa sida barta u dhaxaysa lafaha u dhaqaajiso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (fast)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku daraa dhaqdhaqaaqa lafaha, wuxuuna xidhiidh qallooc ku ruxaa shaqsi yar; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDual quaternion (keeps volume at joints)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu barta ku wareejiyaa xidhiidhka, sidaas darteed qoorta ama bararka waxay ilaalisaa dhumucdeeda (markaasna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESize\u003C/span\u003E ee laf ma sii fidinayo maqaarka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha qaabka ayaa marka hore yimaadda, kadibna armature-ka, kadibna \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\"\u003Emodifiers\u003C/a\u003E. Aragga, sawirrada iyo fiidiyowyada oo dhan waxay muujinayaan mesh-ka la foorarsaday; miisaanka mesh-ka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa, lafaha iyo pose-kooda waxay ku jiraan dhaqdhaqaaqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ik-iyo-xaddidaadyo\"\u003EIK iyo xaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaddidaad\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa laf ama shay kadib furayaashiisa, si uu xeerkiisa u raaco. Dooro shayga (ama laf armature gudaha) oo ku dar mid hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConstraints of …\u003C/span\u003E; kuwa badan ayaa socda amarka la liistay (falaarihu way beddelaan), mid kastana wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E (0 ilaa 1, oo la furay calaamaddeeda sida hanti kasta) iyo badhanka on/off.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaddidaad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loo isticmaalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReach (IK)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELafaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaf iyo lafaha uu ka xiran yahay (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBones in the chain\u003C/span\u003E) way qallooc si ay gacantooda u gaarto bartilmaameedka. Laba laf iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPole (the bend points to it)\u003C/span\u003E, qoorta ama bararka wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca dhinaca; silsiladaha dheer ayaa si nabad ah u qallooca. Haddii aan la gaari karin, silsiladdu waxay si toos ah ugu toosaysaa bartilmaameedka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELook at\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu wareegaa si \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis that points\u003C/span\u003E u eego bartilmaameedka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis kept up\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaalinayaa sidii u dhow sare.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy transforms\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu qaadaa goobta, wareegga ama cabbirka bartilmaameedka — kuwa calaamadeeyey.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELimits\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ilaalinayaa goobtiisa, wareegga (darajooyin) ama cabbirka inta u dhaxaysa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emin\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Emax\u003C/span\u003E jiho kasta; ka tag labo madhan si aad jihadaas u xorowdo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChild of\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadaba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu la socdaa bartilmaameedka sidii inuu ka xiran yahay, laga bilaabo meeshii ay labaduba joogeen markii bartilmaameedka la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFollow path\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu saaraa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/curves\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/curves\"\u003Ecurve object\u003C/a\u003E meesha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the curve\u003C/span\u003E (0 bilowgiisa, 1 dhamaadkiisa; fur si uu u safro), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn along the curve\u003C/span\u003E markaana wuxuu u eegaa jihada uu ku socdo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBartilmaameedku waa shay kale oo kooxda furan ku jirta, laf isla armature-ka ka mid ah, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA point\u003C/span\u003E aad qortay (barta shay waxay ku jirtaa isku-xidhka moodelka, barta laf waxay ku jirtaa mesh-kiisa). Lugta IK, dhig bartilmaameedka meesha cagta u baahan tahay oo fur bartilmaameedka, ama fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E si gacantu u dhex maro furayaasha iyo IK.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay u eegaya mid raacaya jid wuxuu ku arkaa jidka: ModelCraft wuxuu marka hore xisaabiyaa bartilmaameedyada, iyada oo aan loo eegin amarka shayada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fiisigis-hoos-u-dhac-isku-rar-iyo-isku-dhac\"\u003EFiisigis: hoos u dhac, isku rar iyo isku dhac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa dhig shayada inay hoos u dhacaan oo isku dhacaan, kadibna natiijada ku hay furayaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxda, qaybta ama mesh-ka, oo deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERigid body\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysics\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalls and collides\u003C/span\u003E (wuu dhaqaajaa) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStays put, gets in the way\u003C/span\u003E (miis, darbi, jiiman). Shayga dhacaya ku sii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShape\u003C/span\u003E-ka — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBox (its bounds)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBall (round its bounds)\u003C/span\u003E — iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMass (kg)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFriction\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBounce\u003C/span\u003E (0 wuxuu dhacaa si aan dib u boodin, 1 wuxuu dib ugu boodaa sida sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe whole model\u003C/span\u003E, deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom (s)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETo (s)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGravity (m/s², down)\u003C/span\u003E, iyo haddii ay jirto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA ground to land on\u003C/span\u003E (iyo dherer kiisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBake physics\u003C/span\u003E (panel-ka ama kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPhysics\u003C/span\u003E). Shay kasta oo dhacaya wuxuu helaa fur goob, wareeg iyo cabbir fraam kasta oo ka dhexeeya labada waqti; ciyaar sida dhaqdhaqaaq kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u dubbeynta waxay beddeshaa furayaashaas; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove baked keys\u003C/span\u003E way ka saaraa. Shayadu waxay ku bilaabaan nasasho, meesha ay furayaashoodu, qalloocyadoodu iyo xaddidaadyadoodu ku dhigaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom (s)\u003C/span\u003E (dhaqdhaqaaq fur leh oo ka horreeya ma sii wado dhacii). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteps a frame\u003C/span\u003E badan wuxuu ilaalinayaa xidhmooyinka dheer; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa marka wax weli dhaqaaqayo dhamaadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabadu waa sanduuqyo iyo kubbado ku wareegsan xuddunta shay kasta; sanduuqu wuxuu taabanayaa geesaha, dhexda cidhifyada iyo dhexda dhinacyada, sidaas darteed sanduuqyadu way isku rari karaan oo way ku foorari karaan sida loo filayo. Dharka, dareeraha, isku-xidhka shayada iyo qaabab sax ah lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"darawallo\"\u003EDarawallo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDarawal\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaha qaabka ka dhigaa mid ka yimaadda waxyaabo kale oo aan gacanta lagu samayn: fur darawalkiisa (badhanka xisaabiyaha), qor \u003Cstrong\u003Etilmaan\u003C/strong\u003E, oo magac kasta ku jira siiyo waxa uu akhrinayo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReads\u003C/span\u003E): waqtiga ilbiriqsiyada, fraamka, goobta, wareegga ama cabbirka shay ee X, Y ama Z, iftiinka laydh, ama furaha qaabka kale. Tusaale ahaan, markii \u003Ccode\u003Ev\u003C/code\u003E akhrinayo wareegga albaabka ee Z, \u003Ccode\u003Eclamp(v / 90, 0, 1)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu qaabka furayaa sida albaabku u furmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETilmaamuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa tirooyin, magacyada, \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / % ^\u003C/code\u003E iyo qawska, iyo shaqooyinka \u003Ccode\u003Esin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 abs sqrt exp log floor ceil round sign pow min max clamp lerp smoothstep rad deg\u003C/code\u003E oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ee\u003C/code\u003E. Qalad waa la sheegaa oo waxba ma beddelo. Siilka furaha la darawalay wuxuu muujinayaa qiimaha darawalka; darawalku wuxuu ka sarreeyaa jeexda furaha ilaa aad ka saarto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-oo-beddel-furayaasha-aragga-keys\"\u003EDooro oo beddel furayaasha (aragga Keys)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa safaf mid kasta jeexda: kamaradda, kooxda kasta oo dhaqaaqda, iyo hanti kasta (&quot;Lamp 2 · Brightness (lm)&quot;; furayaasha hantida waa wareegsan yihiin).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji fur si aad u doorato; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-guji ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa furayaasha la doortay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-jiid safafka dhexdooda wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq ku daraya dhammaan furayaasha ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid fur la doortay si ay dhammaantood u socdaan; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u dhaqaajiyaan hal fraam (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: toban).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nuqulaa furayaasha la doortay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka dhajiyaa jeexda ciyaarta safaflaha isku mid ah (tab ModelCraft kale ayaa sidoo kale dhajin karta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStretch\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furayaasha la doortay ka fidiyaa jeexda ciyaarta, tirada ku xigta ku saabsan (2 = laba jeer ka fog; 0.5 wuxuu isku soo ururiyaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska ease wuxuu dejinayaa sida furayaasha la doortay u dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabee-khadadka-aragga-curves\"\u003EQaabee khadadka (aragga Curves)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurves\u003C/span\u003E waa grafik qiime kasta oo waqti ku saabsan: waqtiga dhererka, qiimaha kor. Calaamadee khadadka ku muuqda liiska bidix (X, Y iyo Z waa casaan, cagaar iyo buluug).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji fur (laba-jibbaaran) si aad u doorato, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E-guji wax dheeraad ah, ama jiid sanduuq. Jiid fur la doortay si aad u beddesho waqtigeeda iyo qiimaha; markii dhowr la doortay, jiidista waxay ku guurisaa waqtiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa laba \u003Cstrong\u003Egacmo\u003C/strong\u003E. Jiid mid si aad u qaabeyso khadka dhinacaas. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHandles\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sida ay u dhaqmaan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic\u003C/span\u003E (khad siilan oo mari furayaasha ku xeeran), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPointing at the next key\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAligned\u003C/span\u003E (labadaba waxay ku jiraan khad toosan, sidaas darteed khadku ma leh geesi), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFree\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the chosen keys\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejinayaa sida fur kasta oo la doortay ugu dhaqaaqo ilaa xiga: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve (handles)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmooth\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESteady\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlow in and out\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBefore\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfter\u003C/span\u003E waxay dejinayaan waxa khadku sameeyo furayaashiisa dibadda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHold\u003C/span\u003E (wuxuu joogaa qiimaha hore ama dambe), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack and forth\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeat and carry on\u003C/span\u003E (ku celin kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meeshii kii hore ku dhammaaday: cajalad wuu sii wareegaa, socod wuu sii socdaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWheel-ku wuxuu zoom-ka sameeyaa (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: qiimaha kaliya, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: waqtiga kaliya); jiid badhanka dhexe ama isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u guurisid aragga; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo buuxiyaa dhammaan khadadka muuqda. Guji meel bannaan si aad jeexda ciyaarta halkaas ugu dhaqaajiso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa furayaasha la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGacmaha lama oggola inay waqtiga isku gudbaan, sidaas darteed khadku waligiis ma dib u socdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-isticmaal-dhaqdhaqaaqyada-aragga-clips\"\u003EDib u isticmaal dhaqdhaqaaqyada (aragga Clips)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClip\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa dhaqdhaqaaq la kaydiyay (\u003Cstrong\u003Eaction\u003C/strong\u003E) jadwalka. Clips-ka waxaa lagu isku daraa tartiib, safafka hoose ayaa ka sareeya kuwa sare; furayaasha jadwalka keligood ayaa ka sareeya clips kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur kooxaha iyo laydhadka sida caadiga, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a clip\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClips\u003C/span\u003E oo magacee action-ka. Safafka waxay noqdaan action, clip-na wuxuu ciyaaraa meesha ay ku taalla (kamaraddu waxay sii jirtaa jadwalka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad mar kale u isticmaasho, dooro action-ka oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd clip\u003C/span\u003E: clip cusub ayaa ka bilaabmaya jeexda ciyaarta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid clip safkiisa si aad u guurisid; guji si aad u dejisid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart (s)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E (2 = laba jeer degdeg), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERepeats\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E (0 ilaa 1), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMix\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReplace\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd on top\u003C/span\u003E clips-ka ka horreeya), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutside the clip\u003C/span\u003E (waxba, dhamaadkiisa hay, ama labada dhamaadba hay) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMute\u003C/span\u003E. Falaarihu wuxuu beddelaa amarka; qashinku wuu ka saaraa (action aan clip isticmaalin ayaa la socda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClip ka yar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHow much\u003C/span\u003E buuxa wuxuu isku dhafaa waxa ka hooseeya: clip-ka ka horreeya, ama laydhka ama goobta sida ay tahay iyada oo aan dhaqdhaqaaq lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ciyaara-meesha\"\u003EWaxa ciyaara meesha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAragga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFiidiyow la rendaray\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurayaasha kamaradda, lens angle oo leh furayaasha kamaradda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoob, wareeg iyo cabbir (furayaal, khadad, clips)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiinka laydh, faafinta iyo midabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli ma jiro: fiidiyowgu wuxuu isticmaalaa laydhadka sida ay tahay markii uu bilaabo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003Ewaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELens angle aan furayaal kamaradda lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli ma jiro: fur kamaraddana\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurayaasha qaabka iyo darawallada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArmatures (mesh-ka la foorarsaday)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIK iyo xaddidaadyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiisigiska la dubbay (furayaal)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa oo dhan waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E oo wata inta kale ee dhaqdhaqaaqa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E ee jadwalka ayaa dib u qaada mid kasta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jadwalku wuxuu kamaradda iyo kooxaha oo dhan iyo qaybaha u dhaqaajiyaa. Goobta Animate wuxuu wax ka badan furaa, jadwalkuna laba aragga oo dheeraad ah helaa si aad u qaabeysid oo aad dib u isticmaasho waxa aad furtay. Furo Dooro Animate liiska workspace-ka ee toolbar-ka. Jadwalku wuxuu furmaa hoosta aragga, toolbar-ku wuxuu muujinayaa kooxaha Animate (Keys, Play, Timeline), panel-ka midigna wuxuu liistaa waxa aad furi karto jeexda ciyaarta. Fur hanti Panel-ku wuxuu liistaa, jeexda ciyaarta: Shayga la doortay: Place, Turn (°) iyo Size, saddex tiro mid kasta. Qor tiro oo taabo Enter: waxaa lagu furayaa jeexda ciyaarta, shayguna halkaas ayuu u guurayaa. Calaamadda ku taal safka wuxuu furaa qiimaha sida uu hadda yahay; calaamad buuxa waxay muujinaysaa in furaha jeexda ciyaarta uu horeba u jiro. Laydhadka: Brightness (lm) kasta, Spread (°) (laydhadka spot) iyo Colour. Kamaradda: Lens angle (°), zoom marka kamaraddu dhaqaaqayso. Key transform (ama I) wuxuu furaa dhigga, wareegga iyo cabbirka kooxda ama qaybta kasta oo la doortay isla mar; Key camera (ama K) wuxuu furaa kamaraddda. Marka Auto key la shido, kooxda oo goobteeda, wareegteeda iyo cabbirkeeda si kan loo furay ayaa fur cusub helaysa mar kasta oo aad u dhaqaajiso. Wareegyadu waa saddex xagal, oo ku saabsan X, kadibna Y, kadibna Z. Wareeg la furay ka badan 180° wuxuu sii socdaa isla jihadii hore (190° wuxuu weli yahay 190°, ma aha −170°), sidaas darteed gurigu wuu wareegi karaa dhowr jeer. Kooxda lagu furay Key selected jadwalka wuxuu leeyahay furayaal dhigo oo dhan. Badhanka qalloocan ee safkeeda wuxuu u beddelaa furayaashaas dhig, wareeg iyo cabbir khadad ah (isla dhigga fur kasta) si aad ugu qaabeyn karto Curves. Furayaasha qaabka (morphs) Furaha qaabka waa qaab kale oo isla mesh-ka ah: wajiga oo qoslaya, albaabka oo bararsan, caleen qallooc. Siilkiisu wuxuu ka dhex-dhalaa mesh-ka sida uu yahay (0) ilaa qaabkaas (1); furayaal dhowr ah ayaa wada isku daraya. Dooro mesh-ka goobta Animate: panel-ku wuxuu muujinayaa Shape keys-kiisa. Guji Add shape key. ModelCraft wuxuu kugu tagayaa Mesh workspace furaha cusub ee la tafatirayo: qodob dhaqaajin, soo saar, sawir — beddel mesh-ka qaabka aad rabto. Ku noqo Animate oo guji Done. Mesh-ku wuxuu dib ugu noqdaa sidii uu ahaa, furuhuna wuxuu haysaa isbeddelkaaga. Kadibna jiid siilka furaha (ama qor qiime) si aad u isku darto. Calaamaddu wuxuu qiimaha ku furaa jeexda ciyaarta, sidaas darteed furuhu wuu kori karaa oo wuu dhiman karaa wakhti ka dib; markii uu raad yeesho, qiime cusub ayaa jeexda ciyaarta lagu furaa. Qalinku wuxuu mar kale tafatiraa qaabka furaha (mesh-ku wuxuu si buuxda u muujiyaa ilaa Done; Cancel wuxuu furaha ka tagaa sidii ay ahayd), indhuhu wuxuu damiyaa furaha, qashinku wuxuu ka saaraa. Qodob aad ku darto markii aad furaha tafatireyso wuxuu dhigan yahay mesh-ka laftiisa: wuxuu ku sii jiraa meeshii aad geliyey, qaab kasta. Furayaasha qaabka waxay mesh-ka dhaqdhaqaajiyaan ka hor modifiers: Subdivision modifier wuxuu jilciyaa qaabka isku dhafan. Sawirrada la rendaray iyo fiidiyowyada waxay muujinayaan furayaasha fraam kasta. Armatures: lafo mesh-ka foorarsada Armature waa tiro lafo ku jirta mesh. Lafaha ku qaabee, mesh-kuna wuu raacaa, barta kasta sida ay miisaankeedu u sheegayo. Dooro mesh-ka goobta Animate oo guji Add an armature panel-ka (ama Add bone kooxda Rig): lafta koowaad waxay ka sii kacaysaa badhka mesh-ka laga bilaabo cagta. Marka laf la doortay, Add a child bone wuxuu ku daraa midka xiga gacanta ka bilaabmaya. Deji Head, Tip, Roll (°) iyo waxa uu Hangs from panel-ka; laf ku xiran mid kale wuu la socdaa. Ka saar Moves the mesh laf kaliya inay kuwa kale hagto. Guji Automatic weights: laf kasta wuxuu qabsadaa barta ugu dhow, qabsashadaduna si nabad ah ayay mesh-ka ugu faafaysaa, sidaas darteed barta ka dhexaysa laba laf way wadaagaan. Nearest bones only waa kala-qaybin degdeg ah oo adag. Pose lafaha Pose (P): guji laf si aad u doorato, jiid si aad u wareejiso aragga, Shift-jiid si aad u guurisid. Ama qor Place, Turn (°) iyo Size hoosta Pose; wareegyadu waxay ku jiraan jihooyinka lafta laftiisa, laga bilaabo meesha ay ku nasatay. Calaamadaha iyo Key the whole pose waxay furaan qaabka jeexda ciyaarta; laf leh furayaal markii la pose-ayo halkaas ayay ku furaysaa. Reset this bone iyo Reset the pose waxay lafaha dib ugu celiyaan nasashada. Rinji miisaanka (W) laf la doortay: mesh-ku wuxuu muujinayaa nasashada, wejiga kastaa midab buu leeyahay sida laftaasi u qabsato — casaan oo dhan, buluug waxba. Rinji si aad u darto qabsashada (Ctrl way ka qaadaa, Shift way siibtaa); Size (px) iyo Strength ayaa dejinaya burushka. Marka Keep each point's weights adding up to 1 la shido, laf wax badan oo la siiyo, wax la mid ahna laga qaadaa kuwa kale. Mid kasta oo rinji ah waa hal tallaabo oo undo-ga moodelka. Skin wuxuu doortaa sida barta u dhaxaysa lafaha u dhaqaajiso: Linear (fast) wuxuu isku daraa dhaqdhaqaaqa lafaha, wuxuuna xidhiidh qallooc ku ruxaa shaqsi yar; Dual quaternion (keeps volume at joints) wuxuu barta ku wareejiyaa xidhiidhka, sidaas darteed qoorta ama bararka waxay ilaalisaa dhumucdeeda (markaasna Size ee laf ma sii fidinayo maqaarka). Furayaasha qaabka ayaa marka hore yimaadda, kadibna armature-ka, kadibna modifiers. Aragga, sawirrada iyo fiidiyowyada oo dhan waxay muujinayaan mesh-ka la foorarsaday; miisaanka mesh-ka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa, lafaha iyo pose-kooda waxay ku jiraan dhaqdhaqaaqa. IK iyo xaddidaadyo Xaddidaad wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa laf ama shay kadib furayaashiisa, si uu xeerkiisa u raaco. Dooro shayga (ama laf armature gudaha) oo ku dar mid hoosta Constraints of …; kuwa badan ayaa socda amarka la liistay (falaarihu way beddelaan), mid kastana wuxuu leeyahay How much (0 ilaa 1, oo la furay calaamaddeeda sida hanti kasta) iyo badhanka on/off. Xaddidaad Waxa loo isticmaalo Waxa ay sameyso Reach (IK) Lafaha Laf iyo lafaha uu ka xiran yahay (Bones in the chain) way qallooc si ay gacantooda u gaarto bartilmaameedka. Laba laf iyo Pole (the bend points to it), qoorta ama bararka wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca dhinaca; silsiladaha dheer ayaa si nabad ah u qallooca. Haddii aan la gaari karin, silsiladdu waxay si toos ah ugu toosaysaa bartilmaameedka. Look at Labadaba Wuu wareegaa si Axis that points u eego bartilmaameedka, Axis kept up wuxuu ilaalinayaa sidii u dhow sare. Copy transforms Labadaba Wuxuu qaadaa goobta, wareegga ama cabbirka bartilmaameedka — kuwa calaamadeeyey. Limits Labadaba Wuxuu ilaalinayaa goobtiisa, wareegga (darajooyin) ama cabbirka inta u dhaxaysa min iyo max jiho kasta; ka tag labo madhan si aad jihadaas u xorowdo. Child of Labadaba Wuxuu la socdaa bartilmaameedka sidii inuu ka xiran yahay, laga bilaabo meeshii ay labaduba joogeen markii bartilmaameedka la doortay. Follow path Shayaadka Wuxuu saaraa curve object meesha Along the curve (0 bilowgiisa, 1 dhamaadkiisa; fur si uu u safro), Turn along the curve markaana wuxuu u eegaa jihada uu ku socdo. Bartilmaameedku waa shay kale oo kooxda furan ku jirta, laf isla armature-ka ka mid ah, ama A point aad qortay (barta shay waxay ku jirtaa isku-xidhka moodelka, barta laf waxay ku jirtaa mesh-kiisa). Lugta IK, dhig bartilmaameedka meesha cagta u baahan tahay oo fur bartilmaameedka, ama fur How much si gacantu u dhex maro furayaasha iyo IK. Shay u eegaya mid raacaya jid wuxuu ku arkaa jidka: ModelCraft wuxuu marka hore xisaabiyaa bartilmaameedyada, iyada oo aan loo eegin amarka shayada. Fiisigis: hoos u dhac, isku rar iyo isku dhac Ka dhig shayada inay hoos u dhacaan oo isku dhacaan, kadibna natiijada ku hay furayaal. Dooro kooxda, qaybta ama mesh-ka, oo deji Rigid body hoosta Physics: Falls and collides (wuu dhaqaajaa) ama Stays put, gets in the way (miis, darbi, jiiman). Shayga dhacaya ku sii Shape-ka — Box (its bounds) ama Ball (round its bounds) — iyo Mass (kg), Friction iyo Bounce (0 wuxuu dhacaa si aan dib u boodin, 1 wuxuu dib ugu boodaa sida sare). Hoosta The whole model, deji From (s) iyo To (s), Gravity (m/s², down), iyo haddii ay jirto A ground to land on (iyo dherer kiisa). Guji Bake physics (panel-ka ama kooxda Physics). Shay kasta oo dhacaya wuxuu helaa fur goob, wareeg iyo cabbir fraam kasta oo ka dhexeeya labada waqti; ciyaar sida dhaqdhaqaaq kasta. Dib u dubbeynta waxay beddeshaa furayaashaas; Remove baked keys way ka saaraa. Shayadu waxay ku bilaabaan nasasho, meesha ay furayaashoodu, qalloocyadoodu iyo xaddidaadyadoodu ku dhigaan From (s) (dhaqdhaqaaq fur leh oo ka horreeya ma sii wado dhacii). Steps a frame badan wuxuu ilaalinayaa xidhmooyinka dheer; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa marka wax weli dhaqaaqayo dhamaadka. Qaabadu waa sanduuqyo iyo kubbado ku wareegsan xuddunta shay kasta; sanduuqu wuxuu taabanayaa geesaha, dhexda cidhifyada iyo dhexda dhinacyada, sidaas darteed sanduuqyadu way isku rari karaan oo way ku foorari karaan sida loo filayo. Dharka, dareeraha, isku-xidhka shayada iyo qaabab sax ah lama dhisin. Darawallo Darawal wuxuu furaha qaabka ka dhigaa mid ka yimaadda waxyaabo kale oo aan gacanta lagu samayn: fur darawalkiisa (badhanka xisaabiyaha), qor tilmaan, oo magac kasta ku jira siiyo waxa uu akhrinayo (Reads): waqtiga ilbiriqsiyada, fraamka, goobta, wareegga ama cabbirka shay ee X, Y ama Z, iftiinka laydh, ama furaha qaabka kale. Tusaale ahaan, markii v akhrinayo wareegga albaabka ee Z, clamp(v / 90, 0, 1) wuxuu qaabka furayaa sida albaabku u furmo. Tilmaamuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa tirooyin, magacyada, + - * / % ^ iyo qawska, iyo shaqooyinka sin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 abs sqrt exp log floor ceil round sign pow min max clamp lerp smoothstep rad deg oo leh pi iyo e. Qalad waa la sheegaa oo waxba ma beddelo. Siilka furaha la darawalay wuxuu muujinayaa qiimaha darawalka; darawalku wuxuu ka sarreeyaa jeexda furaha ilaa aad ka saarto. Dooro oo beddel furayaasha (aragga Keys) Keys wuxuu muujinayaa safaf mid kasta jeexda: kamaradda, kooxda kasta oo dhaqaaqda, iyo hanti kasta (\"Lamp 2 · Brightness (lm)\"; furayaasha hantida waa wareegsan yihiin). Guji fur si aad u doorato; Shift-guji ama Ctrl-guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa furayaasha la doortay. Shift-jiid safafka dhexdooda wuxuu sameeyaa sanduuq ku daraya dhammaan furayaasha ku jira. Jiid fur la doortay si ay dhammaantood u socdaan; ← / → waxay u dhaqaajiyaan hal fraam (Shift: toban). Ctrl+C wuxuu nuqulaa furayaasha la doortay, Ctrl+V wuxuu ka dhajiyaa jeexda ciyaarta safaflaha isku mid ah (tab ModelCraft kale ayaa sidoo kale dhajin karta). Stretch wuxuu furayaasha la doortay ka fidiyaa jeexda ciyaarta, tirada ku xigta ku saabsan (2 = laba jeer ka fog; 0.5 wuxuu isku soo ururiyaa). Liiska ease wuxuu dejinayaa sida furayaasha la doortay u dhaqaaqaan. Qaabee khadadka (aragga Curves) Curves waa grafik qiime kasta oo waqti ku saabsan: waqtiga dhererka, qiimaha kor. Calaamadee khadadka ku muuqda liiska bidix (X, Y iyo Z waa casaan, cagaar iyo buluug). Guji fur (laba-jibbaaran) si aad u doorato, Shift-guji wax dheeraad ah, ama jiid sanduuq. Jiid fur la doortay si aad u beddesho waqtigeeda iyo qiimaha; markii dhowr la doortay, jiidista waxay ku guurisaa waqtiga. Fur la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa laba gacmo. Jiid mid si aad u qaabeyso khadka dhinacaas. Handles wuxuu sheegaa sida ay u dhaqmaan: Automatic (khad siilan oo mari furayaasha ku xeeran), Pointing at the next key, Aligned (labadaba waxay ku jiraan khad toosan, sidaas darteed khadku ma leh geesi), ama Free. From the chosen keys wuxuu dejinayaa sida fur kasta oo la doortay ugu dhaqaaqo ilaa xiga: Curve (handles), Smooth, Steady, Slow in and out ama Hold. Before iyo After waxay dejinayaan waxa khadku sameeyo furayaashiisa dibadda: Hold (wuxuu joogaa qiimaha hore ama dambe), Repeat, Back and forth, ama Repeat and carry on (ku celin kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meeshii kii hore ku dhammaaday: cajalad wuu sii wareegaa, socod wuu sii socdaa). Wheel-ku wuxuu zoom-ka sameeyaa (Ctrl: qiimaha kaliya, Shift: waqtiga kaliya); jiid badhanka dhexe ama isticmaal Alt si aad u guurisid aragga; Show all ama Home wuxuu soo buuxiyaa dhammaan khadadka muuqda. Guji meel bannaan si aad jeexda ciyaarta halkaas ugu dhaqaajiso. Delete wuxuu tirtiraa furayaasha la doortay. Gacmaha lama oggola inay waqtiga isku gudbaan, sidaas darteed khadku waligiis ma dib u socdo. Dib u isticmaal dhaqdhaqaaqyada (aragga Clips) Clip wuxuu ciyaaraa dhaqdhaqaaq la kaydiyay (action) jadwalka. Clips-ka waxaa lagu isku daraa tartiib, safafka hoose ayaa ka sareeya kuwa sare; furayaasha jadwalka keligood ayaa ka sareeya clips kasta. Fur kooxaha iyo laydhadka sida caadiga, kadibna guji Make a clip gudaha Clips oo magacee action-ka. Safafka waxay noqdaan action, clip-na wuxuu ciyaaraa meesha ay ku taalla (kamaraddu waxay sii jirtaa jadwalka). Si aad mar kale u isticmaasho, dooro action-ka oo guji Add clip: clip cusub ayaa ka bilaabmaya jeexda ciyaarta. Jiid clip safkiisa si aad u guurisid; guji si aad u dejisid Start (s), Speed (2 = laba jeer degdeg), Repeats, How much (0 ilaa 1), Mix (Replace, ama Add on top clips-ka ka horreeya), Outside the clip (waxba, dhamaadkiisa hay, ama labada dhamaadba hay) iyo Mute. Falaarihu wuxuu beddelaa amarka; qashinku wuu ka saaraa (action aan clip isticmaalin ayaa la socda). Clip ka yar How much buuxa wuxuu isku dhafaa waxa ka hooseeya: clip-ka ka horreeya, ama laydhka ama goobta sida ay tahay iyada oo aan dhaqdhaqaaq lahayn. Waxa ciyaara meesha Waxa Aragga Fiidiyow la rendaray Furayaasha kamaradda, lens angle oo leh furayaasha kamaradda Haa Haa Goob, wareeg iyo cabbir (furayaal, khadad, clips) Haa Haa Iftiinka laydh, faafinta iyo midabka Haa Weli ma jiro: fiidiyowgu wuxuu isticmaalaa laydhadka sida ay tahay markii uu bilaabo (eeg waxa weli aan la dhisin) Lens angle aan furayaal kamaradda lahayn Haa Weli ma jiro: fur kamaraddana Furayaasha qaabka iyo darawallada Haa Haa Armatures (mesh-ka la foorarsaday) Haa Haa IK iyo xaddidaadyo Haa Haa Fiisigiska la dubbay (furayaal) Haa Haa Waxa oo dhan waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft oo wata inta kale ee dhaqdhaqaaqa, Undo iyo Redo ee jadwalka ayaa dib u qaada mid kasta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-open-in","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Muuqaalka barnaamij kale ku fur","summary":"Kaydi muuqaalka sida fayl USD ama glTF barnaamij kasta oo akhrisan karo, ama ka Studio ku fur barnaamij ku jira kombiyuutarkan.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["fur ku","usd","gltf","glb","dhoofin","barnaamijka rendarka","archviz","studio","usdview","u dir","wareejin","pakaj","folder unreal"],"headings":[{"id":"fayl-barnaamij-kasta","text":"Fayl barnaamij kasta","level":2},{"id":"studio-ku-fur-barnaamij","text":"Studio: ku fur barnaamij","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDooro ikhtiyaarka \u003Cstrong\u003EFur ku …\u003C/strong\u003E ee liiska Matoorka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E si aad muuqaalka u qaaddo barnaamij kale. Waxba ma soo noqdo moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayl-barnaamij-kasta\"\u003EFayl barnaamij kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl USD\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muuqaalka kaydiyaa sida \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E markii moodeelku qabo sawirro): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003Eisla faylka sida Kaydi sida USD\u003C/a\u003E, oo leh agabka, laydhadhka iyo kamarooyinka. Wuxuu ilaaliyaa instancing iyo qiyamka agabka saxda ah. Rendarrada badan, matoorada ciyaarta iyo muuqaal-akhristayaasha waxay akhriyaan USD.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFayl glTF (.glb)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka glTF 2.0 ee fudud oo leh agabka, tuxturada iyo laydhadhka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\"\u003EDhoofi moodeel barnaamijyada kale\u003C/a\u003E qaababka ModelCraft qoro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFolder-ka mashruuca Unreal (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa folderka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-unreal\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-unreal\"\u003EU dir muuqaalka matoorka ciyaarta\u003C/a\u003E qoro, mashruuc kasta oo kombiyuutar kasta ku jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdaas way shaqeeyaan browser-ka iyo Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"studio-ku-fur-barnaamij\"\u003EStudio: ku fur barnaamij\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio wuxuu liistaa barnaamijyada ay ka heliso kombiyuutarkan oo furi kara muuqaalka: usdview haddii uu ku jiro jidkaaga raadinta, iyo barnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaar ah nooca faylka. Dooro mid, dooro USD ama glTF meesha ay labadaba akhrido, oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender\u003C/span\u003E. Studio wuxuu pakajka ku qoraa folder cusub oo ku yaal Documents (\u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft hand-off\u003C/code\u003E; waxba lagama dhejin, dirid kasta folder u gaar ah ayaa leh) oo wuxuu barnaamijka ku bilaabaa, markaas wuxuu sheegaa halka faylasha ku yaalliin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBarnaamij\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAkhriska ugu fiican\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eusdview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUSD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWixii kombiyuutarku u leeyahay nooca faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio wuxuu bilaabaa barnaamijyada liiskan go&#039;an kaliya; ma socodsiiyo wax bogga ku codsado magac ahaan, mana bilaabo barnaamij ku dhex jira GNU GPL liisanka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program#programs-cadcraft-never-runs\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-hash=\"programs-cadcraft-never-runs\"\u003ESawirka barnaamij kale ku sawir\u003C/a\u003E). Barnaamij kasta oo akhriya USD ama glTF wuxuu furaa faylka ka \u003Cstrong\u003EFayl barnaamij kasta\u003C/strong\u003E kor ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwinmotion, Enscape iyo barnaamijyada muuqaal kale ma ku jiraan liiska: CadCraft lama hubin iyaga, mana sheegto wax iyaga ku saabsan. Fayl glTF ama USD oo halkan ka yimid waa jidka lagu galo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Dooro ikhtiyaarka Fur ku … ee liiska Matoorka ee Rendar sawir… si aad muuqaalka u qaaddo barnaamij kale. Waxba ma soo noqdo moodeelka. Fayl barnaamij kasta Fayl USD wuxuu muuqaalka kaydiyaa sida .usdc (ama .usdz markii moodeelku qabo sawirro): isla faylka sida Kaydi sida USD, oo leh agabka, laydhadhka iyo kamarooyinka. Wuxuu ilaaliyaa instancing iyo qiyamka agabka saxda ah. Rendarrada badan, matoorada ciyaarta iyo muuqaal-akhristayaasha waxay akhriyaan USD. Fayl glTF (.glb) wuxuu kaydiyaa faylka glTF 2.0 ee fudud oo leh agabka, tuxturada iyo laydhadhka; eeg Dhoofi moodeel barnaamijyada kale qaababka ModelCraft qoro. Folder-ka mashruuca Unreal (.zip) wuxuu kaydiyaa folderka U dir muuqaalka matoorka ciyaarta qoro, mashruuc kasta oo kombiyuutar kasta ku jiro. Saddexdaas way shaqeeyaan browser-ka iyo Studio. Studio: ku fur barnaamij Studio wuxuu liistaa barnaamijyada ay ka heliso kombiyuutarkan oo furi kara muuqaalka: usdview haddii uu ku jiro jidkaaga raadinta, iyo barnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaar ah nooca faylka. Dooro mid, dooro USD ama glTF meesha ay labadaba akhrido, oo guji Render. Studio wuxuu pakajka ku qoraa folder cusub oo ku yaal Documents (CadCraft hand-off; waxba lagama dhejin, dirid kasta folder u gaar ah ayaa leh) oo wuxuu barnaamijka ku bilaabaa, markaas wuxuu sheegaa halka faylasha ku yaalliin. Barnaamij Akhriska ugu fiican usdview USD Barnaamijka kombiyuutarka u gaar ah Wixii kombiyuutarku u leeyahay nooca faylka Studio wuxuu bilaabaa barnaamijyada liiskan go'an kaliya; ma socodsiiyo wax bogga ku codsado magac ahaan, mana bilaabo barnaamij ku dhex jira GNU GPL liisanka (eeg Sawirka barnaamij kale ku sawir). Barnaamij kasta oo akhriya USD ama glTF wuxuu furaa faylka ka Fayl barnaamij kasta kor ku jira. Twinmotion, Enscape iyo barnaamijyada muuqaal kale ma ku jiraan liiska: CadCraft lama hubin iyaga, mana sheegto wax iyaga ku saabsan. Fayl glTF ama USD oo halkan ka yimid waa jidka lagu galo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"vr-review","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dib u eeg moodeelka madadaalka VR","summary":"Ku soco moodeelka cabbir buuxa madadaalka VR: u boodo meel kasta, leexo, cabbir, jar, ku dar dhibaato sawir, ku arag sida moodeel miis saaran, oo la kulan kuwa kale ee kalfadhiga toosa ah.","section":"tasks","order":116,"keywords":["vr","virtual reality","madadaal","webxr","xr","immersive","quest","oculus","vive","index","pico","ku soco","dib u eeg","teleport","cabbir","muuqaal","jar","dhibaato","bcf","miis","scale model","joogitaan","avatars","toos","wada"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay","text":"Waxa aad u baahan tahay","level":2},{"id":"bilow","text":"Bilow","level":2},{"id":"sida-ay-u-muuqato","text":"Sida ay u muuqato","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhaqaaq","text":"Ku dhaqaaq","level":2},{"id":"cabbir","text":"Cabbir","level":2},{"id":"goy-oo-fur","text":"Goy oo fur","level":2},{"id":"dhig-dhibaato","text":"Dhig dhibaato","level":2},{"id":"ku-arag-miis-sare-ah","text":"Ku arag miis sare ah","level":2},{"id":"dadka-kale-toos","text":"Dadka kale, toos","level":2},{"id":"ka-bax","text":"Ka bax","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u eeg VR\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku geliyaa moodeelka gudihiisa madadaalka VR, cabbir buuxa. Waxaad istaagaysaa meesha kaamerada aragta ku taal, dhulka ka hooseeya, adigoo u jeeda isla dhinaca. Waxba lama soo geliyo: madadaalku wuxuu muujiyaa waxa browser-ku kombiyuutarkan (ama browser-ka madadaalka laftiisa) sawirayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay\"\u003EWaxa aad u baahan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadadaal browser-ku wadi karo (WebXR): browser-ka madadaalka keligiis, ama Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar PC ah oo madadaal lagu xidhay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EModelCraft oo furan bog ammaan ah (https), sida ay tahay saytkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aan madadaal jirin, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u eeg VR\u003C/span\u003E waa midab-dhimman oo sababta sheegta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow\"\u003EBilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji aragta meesha aad rabto inaad ka bilowdo: qol gudihiisa, ama dibadda oo eeg dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalo\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaamera\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u eeg VR\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiro madadaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska wuxuu ku yaal dhabarka gacanta bidix. Ku tilmaam gacanta midig controller-ka oo jiid ruxa (trigger) si aad u doorato badhan. (Hal gacan oo keliya, liiska wuxuu ka sabbaynayaa meesha aad ka bilowday.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-ay-u-muuqato\"\u003ESida ay u muuqato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMadadaalku wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Earagta toosa\u003C/a\u003E oo muuqaalkeeda ah: muuqaalada iyo agabka aad siisay dhinacyada, samada iyo qorraxda marka ay ka timaado meesha moodeelkaaga iyo taariikhdiisa iyo hooska, lambaro, dhirta iyo dhagaxyada firdhsan, iyo iftiinka dhabaha iyo dhulka ka soo dhacaya (lagu xisaabiyo kombiyuutarkan markaad eegeysid, oo ku raacaya marka aad socotid). Iftiinka iyo beddelka aragta (ACES ama AgX) waa kuwa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir\u003C/a\u003E. Inta uu muujinayo waxay ku xidhan tahay waxa browser-ka madadaalku haysto, sida kombiyuutarka; ambient occlusion, reflections iyo bloom waxay ku sii jiraan kombiyuutarka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhaqaaq\"\u003EKu dhaqaaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoodo:\u003C/strong\u003E ku jirta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, tilmaam dhul ka dibna jiid ruxa; waad degi. Ama riix joystick-ka hore si aad u tilmaamto, ka dibna sii dey si aad u boodo. Waxaad degi kartaa kaliya dhul iyo dhul-ka-sare (dusha u eegta sare), waligaa derbi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeexo:\u003C/strong\u003E riix joystick-ka bidix ama midig: waxaad leexataa 30° mar kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocod:\u003C/strong\u003E meesha ciyaarta kaaga, si fudud u soco.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbir\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna jiid ruxa laba barood. Masaafadu waxay muuqataa intooda u dhexeysa, unitada moodeelka. Barta u dhow geeska ayaa ku qabsata geeska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goy-oo-fur\"\u003EGoy oo fur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoyn\u003C/span\u003E oo jiid ruxa dusha:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhinac derbi ah (ama wax aan dhul ahayn): wax kasta oo u dhexeeya adiga iyo dusha lagu gooyo ayaa la tirtiraa, si aad u aragto gudaha. Tani waxay ugu fiican tahay dibadda, ama dhinac qol oo ka dhex jira;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhul, oo sare ka eeg: goyn qorshe 1.2 m dhulkaas sare, si derbiyadu u muujiyaan qaybtooda hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa goynta iyo cabbirrada. Haddii qorshe goyn uu jaro moodeelka aragta markaad bilaabeyso, madadaalku wuxuu ku bilaabaa iyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-dhibaato\"\u003EDhig dhibaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaato\u003C/span\u003E oo jiid ruxa meesha dhibaatadu ku taal. Pin lambar ah ayaa calaamadeeya, ModelCraft wuxuu dhibaatada la socodsiiyaa sawirka waxa aad aragtay iyo meesha aad taagnayd. Marka aad ka baxdo VR, dhibaatooyinka waxay ku jiraan liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebadhanka indhaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhibaatada meesha ay ka dhigtay;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida BCF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa dhammaantood sidii fayl BCF ah, oo barnaamijyada dib-u-eegista BIM ay furaan (kaamera iyo sawirka oo ku jira);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ewaxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaallo ku dar dhibaato ka dib markaad ka baxdo VR, barnaamij BCF ah ku jira: qorista madadaalka weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-arag-miis-sare-ah\"\u003EKu arag miis sare ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiiska sare\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu yareeyaa moodeelka si uu ugu habboon yahay miis hortaaga; ku soco wareegtiisa, ama leexi joystick-ka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir buuxa\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kugu celinayaa meeshii aad ku jirtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dadka-kale-toos\"\u003EDadka kale, toos\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalfadhi toos ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/work-live\"\u003Ekalfadhi toos ah\u003C/a\u003E) gudihiisa, qof kasta madadaalka wuxuu arkaa kuwa kale oo ah madax iyo laba gacan midabkooda, oo magacooda iyo dhibic meesha ay tilmaamayaan. Wax kasta oo qof kasta sameeyo wuxuu gaaraa madadaalkaaga wax yar kadib. Dadka miiska ku jira ma muuqdaan madadaalka weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-bax\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax VR\u003C/span\u003E (ama ka qaad madadaalka oo dhamee halkaas). Aragta shaashadda ayaa u guurta meeshii madaxaagu ku jiray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya emulator madadaal, madadaal dhab ah weli lama tijaabin. Moodeel weyn ayaa madadaalka ka dhigi kara mid kala-go&#039;an: markii hore qari waxaad u baahnayn (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003Eqari iyo kala-go&#039;i\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Dib u eeg VR wuxuu ku geliyaa moodeelka gudihiisa madadaalka VR, cabbir buuxa. Waxaad istaagaysaa meesha kaamerada aragta ku taal, dhulka ka hooseeya, adigoo u jeeda isla dhinaca. Waxba lama soo geliyo: madadaalku wuxuu muujiyaa waxa browser-ku kombiyuutarkan (ama browser-ka madadaalka laftiisa) sawirayo. Waxa aad u baahan tahay Madadaal browser-ku wadi karo (WebXR): browser-ka madadaalka keligiis, ama Chrome ama Edge kombiyuutar PC ah oo madadaal lagu xidhay. ModelCraft oo furan bog ammaan ah (https), sida ay tahay saytkan. Haddii aan madadaal jirin, Dib u eeg VR waa midab-dhimman oo sababta sheegta. Bilow Deji aragta meesha aad rabto inaad ka bilowdo: qol gudihiisa, ama dibadda oo eeg dhismaha. Riix Muuqaalo kooxda Kaamera, ka dibna Dib u eeg VR. Xiro madadaalka. Liiska wuxuu ku yaal dhabarka gacanta bidix. Ku tilmaam gacanta midig controller-ka oo jiid ruxa (trigger) si aad u doorato badhan. (Hal gacan oo keliya, liiska wuxuu ka sabbaynayaa meesha aad ka bilowday.) Sida ay u muuqato Madadaalku wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka aragta toosa oo muuqaalkeeda ah: muuqaalada iyo agabka aad siisay dhinacyada, samada iyo qorraxda marka ay ka timaado meesha moodeelkaaga iyo taariikhdiisa iyo hooska, lambaro, dhirta iyo dhagaxyada firdhsan, iyo iftiinka dhabaha iyo dhulka ka soo dhacaya (lagu xisaabiyo kombiyuutarkan markaad eegeysid, oo ku raacaya marka aad socotid). Iftiinka iyo beddelka aragta (ACES ama AgX) waa kuwa Rendar sawir. Inta uu muujinayo waxay ku xidhan tahay waxa browser-ka madadaalku haysto, sida kombiyuutarka; ambient occlusion, reflections iyo bloom waxay ku sii jiraan kombiyuutarka. Ku dhaqaaq Boodo: ku jirta Guuri, tilmaam dhul ka dibna jiid ruxa; waad degi. Ama riix joystick-ka hore si aad u tilmaamto, ka dibna sii dey si aad u boodo. Waxaad degi kartaa kaliya dhul iyo dhul-ka-sare (dusha u eegta sare), waligaa derbi. Leexo: riix joystick-ka bidix ama midig: waxaad leexataa 30° mar kasta. Socod: meesha ciyaarta kaaga, si fudud u soco. Cabbir Dooro Cabbir, ka dibna jiid ruxa laba barood. Masaafadu waxay muuqataa intooda u dhexeysa, unitada moodeelka. Barta u dhow geeska ayaa ku qabsata geeska. Goy oo fur Dooro Goyn oo jiid ruxa dusha: dhinac derbi ah (ama wax aan dhul ahayn): wax kasta oo u dhexeeya adiga iyo dusha lagu gooyo ayaa la tirtiraa, si aad u aragto gudaha. Tani waxay ugu fiican tahay dibadda, ama dhinac qol oo ka dhex jira; dhul, oo sare ka eeg: goyn qorshe 1.2 m dhulkaas sare, si derbiyadu u muujiyaan qaybtooda hoose. Nadiifi wuxuu qaadaa goynta iyo cabbirrada. Haddii qorshe goyn uu jaro moodeelka aragta markaad bilaabeyso, madadaalku wuxuu ku bilaabaa iyada. Dhig dhibaato Dooro Dhibaato oo jiid ruxa meesha dhibaatadu ku taal. Pin lambar ah ayaa calaamadeeya, ModelCraft wuxuu dhibaatada la socodsiiyaa sawirka waxa aad aragtay iyo meesha aad taagnayd. Marka aad ka baxdo VR, dhibaatooyinka waxay ku jiraan liiska Dhibaatooyin midig: badhanka indhaha wuxuu muujinayaa dhibaatada meesha ay ka dhigtay; Kaydi sida BCF wuxuu soo dejiyaa dhammaantood sidii fayl BCF ah, oo barnaamijyada dib-u-eegista BIM ay furaan (kaamera iyo sawirka oo ku jira); waxaa sidoo kale lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Faallo ku dar dhibaato ka dib markaad ka baxdo VR, barnaamij BCF ah ku jira: qorista madadaalka weli lama dhisin. Ku arag miis sare ah Miiska sare wuxuu yareeyaa moodeelka si uu ugu habboon yahay miis hortaaga; ku soco wareegtiisa, ama leexi joystick-ka. Cabbir buuxa wuxuu kugu celinayaa meeshii aad ku jirtay. Dadka kale, toos Kalfadhi toos ah (kalfadhi toos ah) gudihiisa, qof kasta madadaalka wuxuu arkaa kuwa kale oo ah madax iyo laba gacan midabkooda, oo magacooda iyo dhibic meesha ay tilmaamayaan. Wax kasta oo qof kasta sameeyo wuxuu gaaraa madadaalkaaga wax yar kadib. Dadka miiska ku jira ma muuqdaan madadaalka weli. Ka bax Dooro Ka bax VR (ama ka qaad madadaalka oo dhamee halkaas). Aragta shaashadda ayaa u guurta meeshii madaxaagu ku jiray. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay oo keliya emulator madadaal, madadaal dhab ah weli lama tijaabin. Moodeel weyn ayaa madadaalka ka dhigi kara mid kala-go'an: markii hore qari waxaad u baahnayn (qari iyo kala-go'i).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-unreal","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dir muuqaalka mishiinka ciyaarta","summary":"Studio waxay qori kartaa muuqaalka mashruuca Unreal Engine oo waxay ku ilaalisaa isku-xidhka marku kasta la diro; tafatirkaaga wuxuu ku jiraa lakab aan CadCraft waligeed qorin. Barnaamijka furaya weli lama sii deynin.","section":"tasks","order":116,"keywords":["unreal","unreal engine","mishiinka ciyaarta","xidhiidh","dir","usd stage","mashruuc","toos ah","kaamerad cine","safka rendarka fiidiyada"],"headings":[{"id":"dir-muuqaalka","text":"Dir muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"tafatirkaagu-waa-ammaan","text":"Tafatirkaagu waa ammaan","level":2},{"id":"studio-la-aanteed","text":"Studio la'aanteed","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EStudio CadCraft waxa liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EEngine\u003C/strong\u003E ku jiri kara \u003Cstrong\u003Exidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E la mashruuca Unreal Engine. Hal jihood oo keliya: CadCraft ilaa Unreal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dir-muuqaalka\"\u003EDir muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro Unreal liiska Engine. Markii ugu horreysay, Studio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad dooratid fooldhaga mashruucaaga (kan ku jira faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.uproject\u003C/code\u003E); wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDir\u003C/span\u003E. Studio wuxuu qori doonaa \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft/&lt;magaca faylka&gt;/\u003C/code\u003E gudaha mashruuca: muuqaalka oo ah fayl USD, faylka dejinta, profiilada nalalka, iyo laba fayl lakab oo yaryar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel moodeelka, kaydi, kadibna mar kale dir. Muuqaalka iyo faylka dejinta oo keliya ayaa la beddelaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tafatirkaagu-waa-ammaan\"\u003ETafatirkaagu waa ammaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarxalada Unreal furto waa lakab xidid yar oo la sameeyay mar keliya, hoostiisana laba lakab ayaa ku jira: \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaaga\u003C/strong\u003E oo sare yaal (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;magac&gt;.user.usda\u003C/code\u003E, markii hore madhan, CadCraft weligeed ma qorto) iyo muuqaalka CadCraft ee hoose. Tafatirka aad ku kaydiso lakabkaaga wuu sii jiri doonaa marka muuqaalka mar kale la diro. Nalalka iyo actor-yada kale ee aad ku dhejiso heerka Unreal waxay ka baxsan yihiin marxalada, sidaas darteedna mana taabtaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"studio-la-aanteed\"\u003EStudio la&#039;aanteed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-ka, ama kombiyuutarka aan Studio ka helin Unreal, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EUnreal project folder (.zip)\u003C/strong\u003E liiska Engine oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay kaydinaysaa isla fooldhaga zip ahaan: fur zip-ka oo ku dhig fooldhaga \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraft\u003C/code\u003E ee mashruucaaga. Markii ugu horreysay ka tag \u003Cstrong\u003EInclude the stage files\u003C/strong\u003E (Ku dar faylalka marxalada); kaydinta dambe demi, si zip-ku u hayo muuqaalka iyo faylka dejinta oo keliya, lakabkaagana aan mar walba la bedelin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug-ka Unreal ee furaya marxalada, codsada qorraxda, nalalka, kaamerooyinka iyo iftiinka, raacaya dir kasta oo kaamerad rendaraya, \u003Cstrong\u003Eweli lama sii deynin\u003C/strong\u003E oo weli Unreal lama shaqeynin. Ilaa taas, Dir waxa faylalka geliya mashruuca, qalabka USD ee Unreal ayaa furi kara. Windows ayaa nidaamka ugu horreeya; macOS ayaa raacaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Studio CadCraft waxa liiska Engine ku jiri kara xidhiidh la mashruuca Unreal Engine. Hal jihood oo keliya: CadCraft ilaa Unreal. Dir muuqaalka Dooro Unreal liiska Engine. Markii ugu horreysay, Studio wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad dooratid fooldhaga mashruucaaga (kan ku jira faylka .uproject); wuu xasuustaa. Guji Dir. Studio wuxuu qori doonaa CadCraft/\u003Cmagaca faylka\u003E/ gudaha mashruuca: muuqaalka oo ah fayl USD, faylka dejinta, profiilada nalalka, iyo laba fayl lakab oo yaryar. Beddel moodeelka, kaydi, kadibna mar kale dir. Muuqaalka iyo faylka dejinta oo keliya ayaa la beddelaa. Tafatirkaagu waa ammaan Marxalada Unreal furto waa lakab xidid yar oo la sameeyay mar keliya, hoostiisana laba lakab ayaa ku jira: kaaga oo sare yaal (\u003Cmagac\u003E.user.usda, markii hore madhan, CadCraft weligeed ma qorto) iyo muuqaalka CadCraft ee hoose. Tafatirka aad ku kaydiso lakabkaaga wuu sii jiri doonaa marka muuqaalka mar kale la diro. Nalalka iyo actor-yada kale ee aad ku dhejiso heerka Unreal waxay ka baxsan yihiin marxalada, sidaas darteedna mana taabtaan. Studio la'aanteed Browser-ka, ama kombiyuutarka aan Studio ka helin Unreal, dooro Unreal project folder (.zip) liiska Engine oo guji Soo saar. Waxay kaydinaysaa isla fooldhaga zip ahaan: fur zip-ka oo ku dhig fooldhaga CadCraft ee mashruucaaga. Markii ugu horreysay ka tag Include the stage files (Ku dar faylalka marxalada); kaydinta dambe demi, si zip-ku u hayo muuqaalka iyo faylka dejinta oo keliya, lakabkaagana aan mar walba la bedelin. Plug-ka Unreal ee furaya marxalada, codsada qorraxda, nalalka, kaamerooyinka iyo iftiinka, raacaya dir kasta oo kaamerad rendaraya, weli lama sii deynin oo weli Unreal lama shaqeynin. Ilaa taas, Dir waxa faylalka geliya mashruuca, qalabka USD ee Unreal ayaa furi kara. Windows ayaa nidaamka ugu horreeya; macOS ayaa raacaysa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"ar-on-site","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Moodeelka ku arag goobta telefoon Android (AR)","summary":"Qaado telefoon Android oo leh Chrome oo ku arag moodeelka cabbirkiisa dhabta ah kor kaamerada, oo lagu hagaajiyo dhismaha laba barood oo aad taagan tahay, leh lensiga X-ray iyo dib-u-hubin degdeg ah booqashada xigta. Waa ilaa eegista, ma aha dejinta.","section":"tasks","order":117,"keywords":["ar","xaqiiqda kordhisay","telefoon","android","chrome","webxr","goobta","goob","kaamera","cabbirka buuxa","x-ray","hagaajin","isku hagaaji","dib-u-hubin","arcore"],"headings":[{"id":"moodeelka-isku-hagaaji","text":"Moodeelka isku hagaaji","level":2},{"id":"lensiga-x-ray","text":"Lensiga X-ray","level":2},{"id":"booqashada-xigta","text":"Booqashada xigta","level":2},{"id":"ka-bax","text":"Ka bax","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView on site (AR, phone)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jirta menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka cabbirkiisa dhabta ah kor kaamerada telefoonka. Waxay ka shaqeysaa \u003Cstrong\u003Etelefoon Android oo leh Chrome\u003C/strong\u003E, bog amni leh (https), meesha telefoonku taageero AR. iPhone ama iPad, kombuyuutar, ama app Android oo kaliya bog web muujiya, shayga ayaa sheegaa sababta aan u bilaabi karin; halkaas isticmaal aragga 3D, ama fur bogganan Chrome telefoonka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETelefoon waa ilaa eegista.\u003C/strong\u003E Ha cabbirin, ha dejin, ha goynin wax kasta oo shaashaddu muujinayso: telefoonku wuu ka leexdaa markaad socotid, khaladka barista wuxuu kordhaa sida uu u fogyahay labada barood ee aad isku hagaajisay (dhowr sentimitir oo ku dhow iyaga, ka badan oo ka fog). Waxba halkan ma aha heer sahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodeelka-isku-hagaaji\"\u003EMoodeelka isku hagaaji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur moodeelka telefoonka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView on site (AR, phone)\u003C/span\u003E. Oggol kaamerada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel-ka hoose wuxuu magacaabayaa barta koowaad (geesta dhulka ee moodeelka). Taag halkaas goobta, u beeg giraanta cagaarka ah dhulka, kadibna taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace point\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocod barta labaad, ugu yaraan nus mitir oo ka fog (ka fog, ka wanaagsan ayuu ku habboonaanayaa), oo samee sidaas oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeelku wuxuu u muuqdaa cabbirkiisa buuxa, wuxuuna wareegaa oo u guurayaa si uu ugu habboono labada meel. Panel-ku wuxuu sheegayaa sida labada barood u wada heshiiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart over\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa barooyinka. Isku hagaajinta waxay ku jirtaa faylka moodeelka, sidaas darteed marka xigta ee aad moodeelka ku furto goobta wuxuu ku bilaabaa isku hagaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lensiga-x-ray\"\u003ELensiga X-ray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EX-ray lens\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka oo dhan sanduuq hor telefoonka ku jira (qiyaastii hal mitir iyo badh ballac iyo saddex mitir qoto) iyo sawir cad oo kaliya meelaha kale, si aad u aragto waxa darbiga gadaashiisa ku jira adigoo lumin darbigii dhabta ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"booqashada-xigta\"\u003EBooqashada xigta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaag barta koowaad oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERe-check\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlace point\u003C/span\u003E. Ka yar 5 sentimitir, hagaajinta way ilaalisaa. Ilaa nus mitir, moodeelku wuxuu u dhaqaajiyaa farqiga. Ka badan taas, panel-ku wuxuu weyddiinayaa inaad mar kale tilmaanto labada meel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-bax\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave AR\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammeeyaa fadhiga. Sawirka kaamerada wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-ka: waxba lama soo rarayo.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"View on site (AR, phone) oo ku jirta menu-ka Views wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka cabbirkiisa dhabta ah kor kaamerada telefoonka. Waxay ka shaqeysaa telefoon Android oo leh Chrome, bog amni leh (https), meesha telefoonku taageero AR. iPhone ama iPad, kombuyuutar, ama app Android oo kaliya bog web muujiya, shayga ayaa sheegaa sababta aan u bilaabi karin; halkaas isticmaal aragga 3D, ama fur bogganan Chrome telefoonka. Telefoon waa ilaa eegista. Ha cabbirin, ha dejin, ha goynin wax kasta oo shaashaddu muujinayso: telefoonku wuu ka leexdaa markaad socotid, khaladka barista wuxuu kordhaa sida uu u fogyahay labada barood ee aad isku hagaajisay (dhowr sentimitir oo ku dhow iyaga, ka badan oo ka fog). Waxba halkan ma aha heer sahan. Moodeelka isku hagaaji Fur moodeelka telefoonka oo dooro View on site (AR, phone). Oggol kaamerada. Panel-ka hoose wuxuu magacaabayaa barta koowaad (geesta dhulka ee moodeelka). Taag halkaas goobta, u beeg giraanta cagaarka ah dhulka, kadibna taabo Place point. Socod barta labaad, ugu yaraan nus mitir oo ka fog (ka fog, ka wanaagsan ayuu ku habboonaanayaa), oo samee sidaas oo kale. Moodeelku wuxuu u muuqdaa cabbirkiisa buuxa, wuxuuna wareegaa oo u guurayaa si uu ugu habboono labada meel. Panel-ku wuxuu sheegayaa sida labada barood u wada heshiiyaan. Start over wuxuu nadiifiyaa barooyinka. Isku hagaajinta waxay ku jirtaa faylka moodeelka, sidaas darteed marka xigta ee aad moodeelka ku furto goobta wuxuu ku bilaabaa isku hagaajin. Lensiga X-ray X-ray lens wuxuu muujinayaa moodeelka oo dhan sanduuq hor telefoonka ku jira (qiyaastii hal mitir iyo badh ballac iyo saddex mitir qoto) iyo sawir cad oo kaliya meelaha kale, si aad u aragto waxa darbiga gadaashiisa ku jira adigoo lumin darbigii dhabta ahaa. Booqashada xigta Taag barta koowaad oo guji Re-check, kadibna Place point. Ka yar 5 sentimitir, hagaajinta way ilaalisaa. Ilaa nus mitir, moodeelku wuxuu u dhaqaajiyaa farqiga. Ka badan taas, panel-ku wuxuu weyddiinayaa inaad mar kale tilmaanto labada meel. Ka bax Leave AR wuxuu dhammeeyaa fadhiga. Sawirka kaamerada wuxuu ku sii jiraa browser-ka: waxba lama soo rarayo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"scenes","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kaydi muuqaalada sida goobo","summary":"Kaydi kaamerada iyo habka sida goob, cusboonaysii oo magacee, oo u dhex dhaaq ama ciyaar goobaha si aad u soo bandhigto naqshadda.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["goob","muuqaal","muuqaal kaydsan","kaamerad","soo bandhig","dhaqdhaqaaq","ciyaar","slideshow","page up","page down","tabs","socod"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-goob","text":"Ku dar goob","level":2},{"id":"aad-goob","text":"Aad goob","level":2},{"id":"beddel-magacee-ama-tirtir-goob","text":"Beddel, magacee ama tirtir goob","level":2},{"id":"quful-kaamerada-goob","text":"Quful kaamerada goob","level":2},{"id":"soo-bandhig","text":"Soo bandhig","level":2},{"id":"waxa-goobtu-muujisa","text":"Waxa goobtu muujisa","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-dhaqdhaqaaq","text":"Dhoofi dhaqdhaqaaq","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato","text":"Waxyaabo aad ogaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoob\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xasuustaa booska kaamerada iyo habka, iyo wixii qarsan: halka aad ka eegayso, muuqaalka laba-barood ama toosan, habka wejiga, geesaha, dejinta qorraxda, kooxaha qarsan, tags-ka la damiyey iyo qorshaha goynta. Goobaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-goob\"\u003EKu dar goob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDejiso muuqaalka: hareeyso, weynee, dooro habka, dejiso qorraxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E ee gacanta midig, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar muuqaal\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobtu waxay ka muuqataa liiska, magaceedu waa &quot;Goob 1&quot;, &quot;Goob 2&quot; iyo sidaas oo kale, waxayna sidoo kale noqotaa tab dhaqaaleysa kor ee muuqaalka 3D. Xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Goob 1 waa la kaydiyay: kaamerada, habka iyo wixii qarsan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aad-goob\"\u003EAad goob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji tab-kiisa kor ku yaal muuqaalka 3D, ama magaciisa liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAma riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goobta xigta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E goobta hore. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKan xiga\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKan hore\u003C/span\u003E hoosta liiska ayaa isla sameeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaamerada waxay u dhaqaaqdaa goobta ilbiriqsi ka badan nus. Haddii kombiyuutarkaaga loo dejiyey yareynta dhaqdhaqaaqa, isla markiiba ayuu u gudbaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-magacee-ama-tirtir-goob\"\u003EBeddel, magacee ama tirtir goob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoob kasta oo liiska ku jirta waxay leedahay saddex badhan oo yaryar magaciisa ka dambeeya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECusboonaysii\u003C/strong\u003E (wareegga fallaadhaha): wuxuu kaydiyaa kaamerada hadda, habka iyo wixii qarsan goobtaas. &quot;Goob 2 waa la cusboonaysiiyay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagacee\u003C/strong\u003E (qalinka): wuxuu furaa dialog &quot;Rename scene&quot;. Qor magaca cusub oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E (qaraabada qashinka): wuxuu tirtiraa goobta. &quot;Goob 2 waa la tirtiray. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celin karta.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dar, cusboonaysii, magacee iyo tirtirida goobaha waa tallaabooyin ka noqo, sida beddelka moodeelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"quful-kaamerada-goob\"\u003EQuful kaamerada goob\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkii aad isla muuqaalka mar kale iyo mar kale soo bandhigayso naqshaddu ay isbedelayso, qufulow kaamerada goobtaas si muuqaalku aan waligiis u dhaqaaqin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E, guji badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003Equfulka\u003C/strong\u003E (qufulka furan) magaca goobta ka dambeeya. Wuu xirmaa, tab-ka goobta ee muuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujinayaa qufulka yar. Xariiqa xaaladda: &quot;Goob 2: kaamerada waa la qufuliyay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoob kasta oo aad rabto inaad soo rendarto u gudub: kaamerada waxay noqonaysaa muuqaalkii la kaydiyay oo kacsan, sawirrada laga sameeyo waxay isku dhigmaan kuwii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaamerada la qufuliyay, \u003Cstrong\u003ECusboonaysii\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu weli kaydiyaa habka iyo wixii qarsan goobta, laakiin kaamerada waxay sii jirtaa meeshay ku taalay, xitaa haddii aad wareegtay. Dib u fur qufulka adigoo mar kale gujinaya qufulka; cusboonaysiinta kadib waxay kaydinaysaa muuqaalka hadda. Qufulinta iyo furitaanka waa tallaabooyin ka noqo, qufulka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-bandhig\"\u003ESoo bandhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar laba goobood ama ka badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECiyaar\u003C/span\u003E hoosta liiska. ModelCraft wuxuu u gudbaa goobta xigta ilbiriqsiyo kasta, wuxuuna ku laabtaa midda ugu horreysay markii uu dhammeeyo midda ugu dambeysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (isla badhanka) ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaraasad qorraxda ah: ku dar hal goob saacad kasta oo keliya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaqti\u003C/span\u003E la beddelay, kadibna ciyaar. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#a-sun-study\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"a-sun-study\"\u003EHabka iyo hooska qorraxda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u soo bandhigto iyada oo aan xariiqyada, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E laba jeer: shaashad buuxda, kadibna shaashad buuxda oo xariiqyadu qarsan yihiin. Tabs-ka goobta ayaa muuqaalka kor ku sii jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-goobtu-muujisa\"\u003EWaxa goobtu muujisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobtu waxay xasuusataa waxa la qariyey markii aad kaydisay: kooxaha iyo component-yada aad \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/hide-isolate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/hide-isolate\"\u003Eqariyey\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/tags\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/tags\"\u003Etags\u003C/a\u003E aad damisay, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sections\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sections\"\u003Ediyaaradaha goynta\u003C/a\u003E ee goyn. Marka aad aado goobta, way qariyaan oo mar kale muujiyaan. Sidaas darteed hal goob waxay muujin kartaa guriga oo dhan, kan xiga guriga oo tag-ka saqafka la damiyey, kan saddexaad goyn ka mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha iyo wejiyada xor ah ee qarsan ma ka mid aha goobaha. Aadista goob ma abuurto tallaabo ka noqo. Goobaha ay kaydiyeen nooca hore ee ModelCraft waxay hayaan waxa la qariyey sida ay tahay; guji Cusboonaysii si aad ugu kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-dhaqdhaqaaq\"\u003EDhoofi dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E, hoosta liiska, wuxuu ciyaaraa goobaha laga bilaabo kii ugu horreeyay ilaa kii ugu dambeeyay, isagoo kaamerada si nacnac ah u wareejinaya intooda, wuxuuna filimka ku kaydiyaa fiidiyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWebM\u003C/strong\u003E ah (laba ilbiriqsi dhaqdhaqaaq iyo joojin yar goob kasta). Wuxuu duubaa muuqaalka sida aad u aragto, cabbirka shaashadda, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003Emuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/a\u003E (ma jiraan dhidibbo, hage ama xulasho). Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama mar kale guji badhanka si aad u joojiso iyada oo aan la kaydin. WebM waxay ciyaartaa browser-ka iyo VLC; tafatirayaashu way u beddelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocod la rendaray (cirka, qorraxda, hooska, agabka) cabbir aad doorato, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar fiidiyo…\u003C/span\u003E halkii: haddii aan furayaal dhaqdhaqaaq lahayn, wuxuu qaadaa goobaha, siday u kala horreeyaan, sida jidka kaamerada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003EDhaqaaji kaamerada iyo walxaha\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabo-aad-ogaato\"\u003EWaxyaabo aad ogaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddelka habka ama kaamerada kadib markii aad gashay goob, goobta ma beddelayso ilaa aad gujiso Cusboonaysii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobaha lama dhoofiyo Collada, OBJ, glTF, STL ama IFC.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Goob wuxuu xasuustaa booska kaamerada iyo habka, iyo wixii qarsan: halka aad ka eegayso, muuqaalka laba-barood ama toosan, habka wejiga, geesaha, dejinta qorraxda, kooxaha qarsan, tags-ka la damiyey iyo qorshaha goynta. Goobaha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Ku dar goob Dejiso muuqaalka: hareeyso, weynee, dooro habka, dejiso qorraxda. Liiska Muuqaallada ee gacanta midig, guji Ku dar muuqaal. Goobtu waxay ka muuqataa liiska, magaceedu waa \"Goob 1\", \"Goob 2\" iyo sidaas oo kale, waxayna sidoo kale noqotaa tab dhaqaaleysa kor ee muuqaalka 3D. Xariiqa xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Goob 1 waa la kaydiyay: kaamerada, habka iyo wixii qarsan.\" Aad goob Guji tab-kiisa kor ku yaal muuqaalka 3D, ama magaciisa liiska Muuqaallada. Ama riix Page Down goobta xigta iyo Page Up goobta hore. Kan xiga iyo Kan hore hoosta liiska ayaa isla sameeya. Kaamerada waxay u dhaqaaqdaa goobta ilbiriqsi ka badan nus. Haddii kombiyuutarkaaga loo dejiyey yareynta dhaqdhaqaaqa, isla markiiba ayuu u gudbaa. Beddel, magacee ama tirtir goob Goob kasta oo liiska ku jirta waxay leedahay saddex badhan oo yaryar magaciisa ka dambeeya: Cusboonaysii (wareegga fallaadhaha): wuxuu kaydiyaa kaamerada hadda, habka iyo wixii qarsan goobtaas. \"Goob 2 waa la cusboonaysiiyay.\" Magacee (qalinka): wuxuu furaa dialog \"Rename scene\". Qor magaca cusub oo guji Kaydi. Tirtir (qaraabada qashinka): wuxuu tirtiraa goobta. \"Goob 2 waa la tirtiray. Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celin karta.\" Ku dar, cusboonaysii, magacee iyo tirtirida goobaha waa tallaabooyin ka noqo, sida beddelka moodeelka. Quful kaamerada goob Markii aad isla muuqaalka mar kale iyo mar kale soo bandhigayso naqshaddu ay isbedelayso, qufulow kaamerada goobtaas si muuqaalku aan waligiis u dhaqaaqin. Liiska Muuqaallada, guji badhanka qufulka (qufulka furan) magaca goobta ka dambeeya. Wuu xirmaa, tab-ka goobta ee muuqaalka 3D wuxuu muujinayaa qufulka yar. Xariiqa xaaladda: \"Goob 2: kaamerada waa la qufuliyay.\" Goob kasta oo aad rabto inaad soo rendarto u gudub: kaamerada waxay noqonaysaa muuqaalkii la kaydiyay oo kacsan, sawirrada laga sameeyo waxay isku dhigmaan kuwii hore. Kaamerada la qufuliyay, Cusboonaysii wuxuu weli kaydiyaa habka iyo wixii qarsan goobta, laakiin kaamerada waxay sii jirtaa meeshay ku taalay, xitaa haddii aad wareegtay. Dib u fur qufulka adigoo mar kale gujinaya qufulka; cusboonaysiinta kadib waxay kaydinaysaa muuqaalka hadda. Qufulinta iyo furitaanka waa tallaabooyin ka noqo, qufulka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .modelcraft. Soo bandhig Ku dar laba goobood ama ka badan. Guji Ciyaar hoosta liiska. ModelCraft wuxuu u gudbaa goobta xigta ilbiriqsiyo kasta, wuxuuna ku laabtaa midda ugu horreysay markii uu dhammeeyo midda ugu dambeysay. Guji Jooji (isla badhanka) ama riix Esc si aad u joojiso. Daraasad qorraxda ah: ku dar hal goob saacad kasta oo keliya Waqti la beddelay, kadibna ciyaar. Eeg Habka iyo hooska qorraxda. Si aad u soo bandhigto iyada oo aan xariiqyada, riix Ctrl+Shift+F laba jeer: shaashad buuxda, kadibna shaashad buuxda oo xariiqyadu qarsan yihiin. Tabs-ka goobta ayaa muuqaalka kor ku sii jira. Waxa goobtu muujisa Goobtu waxay xasuusataa waxa la qariyey markii aad kaydisay: kooxaha iyo component-yada aad qariyey, tags aad damisay, iyo diyaaradaha goynta ee goyn. Marka aad aado goobta, way qariyaan oo mar kale muujiyaan. Sidaas darteed hal goob waxay muujin kartaa guriga oo dhan, kan xiga guriga oo tag-ka saqafka la damiyey, kan saddexaad goyn ka mid ah. Geesaha iyo wejiyada xor ah ee qarsan ma ka mid aha goobaha. Aadista goob ma abuurto tallaabo ka noqo. Goobaha ay kaydiyeen nooca hore ee ModelCraft waxay hayaan waxa la qariyey sida ay tahay; guji Cusboonaysii si aad ugu kaydiso. Dhoofi dhaqdhaqaaq Soo saar dhaqdhaqaaq, hoosta liiska, wuxuu ciyaaraa goobaha laga bilaabo kii ugu horreeyay ilaa kii ugu dambeeyay, isagoo kaamerada si nacnac ah u wareejinaya intooda, wuxuuna filimka ku kaydiyaa fiidiyo WebM ah (laba ilbiriqsi dhaqdhaqaaq iyo joojin yar goob kasta). Wuxuu duubaa muuqaalka sida aad u aragto, cabbirka shaashadda, muuqaalka soo bandhigga (ma jiraan dhidibbo, hage ama xulasho). Riix Esc ama mar kale guji badhanka si aad u joojiso iyada oo aan la kaydin. WebM waxay ciyaartaa browser-ka iyo VLC; tafatirayaashu way u beddelaan. Socod la rendaray (cirka, qorraxda, hooska, agabka) cabbir aad doorato, isticmaal Soo saar fiidiyo… halkii: haddii aan furayaal dhaqdhaqaaq lahayn, wuxuu qaadaa goobaha, siday u kala horreeyaan, sida jidka kaamerada. Eeg Dhaqaaji kaamerada iyo walxaha. Waxyaabo aad ogaato Beddelka habka ama kaamerada kadib markii aad gashay goob, goobta ma beddelayso ilaa aad gujiso Cusboonaysii. Goobaha lama dhoofiyo Collada, OBJ, glTF, STL ama IFC.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Isticmaal ModelCraft kaaliye AI ah","summary":"U ogolow kaaliyahaaga AI ama qoraalkaaga inuu eego moodeelka oo dhiso jidh fudud: ogolaansho, xiriir iyada oo loo marayo CadCraft Studio, iyo diiwaanka waxqabadka.","section":"tasks","order":125,"keywords":["ai","kaaliye","wakiil","mcp","model context protocol","qoraal","moodelayn","boks","silindar","rendar","safka rendarka","ogolaansho","ka jooji","waxqabad"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidh-kaaliyahaaga","text":"Ku xidh kaaliyahaaga","level":2},{"id":"adigu-waad-xakamaynaysaa","text":"Adigu waad xakamaynaysaa","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kaaliyuhu-weydiisan-karo","text":"Waxa kaaliyuhu weydiisan karo","level":2},{"id":"haddii-wax-shaqeynin","text":"Haddii wax shaqeynin","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida kaaliye AI ah (ama qoraal aad qortay) loogu ogolaado inuu ModelCraft la shaqeeyo, iyo sida loo go&#039;aamiyo waxa uu taaban karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Ema leh AI gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E mana diro wax meel kasta. Kaaliyahaaga adiga ayaa keenaya: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). ModelCraft waxay siinaysaa qalab keliya, adna ayaad dooran doontaa kuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (giraanta ku taal bar-ka app-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo u gudub tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow kaaliyayaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan ModelCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la demiyay ilaa aad shidayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa ay sameyn karto: \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E waa la calaamadiyay bilowga; calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar\u003C/strong\u003E kaliya marka aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka aan ku jirin ogolaanshaha aad calaamadisay looma soo bandhigo kaaliyaha, haddii uu si kastaba u weydiiyo, ModelCraft way diidi doontaa oo waxay ku qori doontaa diiwaanka waxqabadka. Deminta badhanka waxay joojinaysaa dhammaan xiriirrada hal mar. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta ModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sidoo kale demisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidh-kaaliyahaaga\"\u003EKu xidh kaaliyahaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaaliyayaasha waxay ku xiriiraan \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu socodsiiyaa server yar oo kaliya kombiyuutarkan gaari karo, oo lagu ilaaliyo calaamad (token) uu sameeyo mar kasta oo bilaabo. Studio-ga, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh kaaliye\u003C/span\u003E oo ku koobi cinwaanka iyo calaamadda kaaliyahaaga (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa dejinta saxda ah ee la dhejiyo). Calaamadda ha wadaagin marna.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka browser-ka ma furi karo xiriir kaaliye: appsyada browser-ka badhanka ma saameeyo ilaa aad isticmaasho CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adigu-waad-xakamaynaysaa\"\u003EAdigu waad xakamaynaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo\u003C/strong\u003E, oo lagu calaamadiyay magaca kaaliyaha uu u isticmaalo (tusaale &quot;Kaaliye: boks&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay ee kaaliyaha oo dhammaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaad ogaanaysaa marka mid la xidhay.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka bar-ka app-ka ayaa magaca kaaliyaha muujinaya intuu xiriir yahay; riix si aad u aragto waxa uu ogolaan karo, ama si aad u \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jooji\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxqabadka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxqabadka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liis ku sameeyaa wac kasta: goorta, qalabka, iyo in la dhammeeyay ama la diiday. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi diiwaanka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu keydiyaa nuqul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kaaliyuhu-weydiisan-karo\"\u003EWaxa kaaliyuhu weydiisan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOgolaansho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodel_describe\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECutubka moodeelka, cabbirkiisa, iyo koox kasta iyo komponent kasta meesha ay ku yaalliin, haba yihiin jidh xidhan iyo mugga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eview_screenshot\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir ka mid ah aragta 3D sida ay muuqato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebox_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecylinder_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoks ama silindar oo koox cusub ah, meel iyo cabbir adiga ama isagu siiyo (&quot;3m&quot;, &quot;10&#039;&quot; ama tiro ku jira cutubka moodeelka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Einstance_move\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einstances_erase\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu guuraa ama tirtiraa kooxaha iyo komponentada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efaces_list\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ematerials_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyada kooxda ama joomatriga furan (jihada kasta, balaadhka iyo dhexdhexaadka); agabka iyo midabada uu ku rinjiyayn karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epush_pull\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu riixaa ama jiidaa dhinac, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E sameysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epaint\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu rinjiyaa dhinacyada ama kooxda oo dhan midab ama agab\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Egroup_make\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa koox ama komponent ka dhigan dhinacyo kala go&#039; iyo kooxo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escene_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Escene_show\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu aragta u kaydiyaa muuqaal; wuxuu u gudbaa muuqaal la kaydiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emesh_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShay mesh ah oo lagu bilaabo (kuub, kubbad, silindar …), sida goobta shaqada Mesh ku daraysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodifiers_list\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_add\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_set\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emodifier_remove\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri / Wax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXirmada beddelayaasha mesh-ka: mirror, array, subdivision, bevel iyo kuwa kale; waxba si joogto ah looma dabaqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelka sida OpenUSD (.usda, .usdc ama .usdz), sida loo kaydiyo moodeelka USD ahaan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E); foolder aad Studio-ga ku ogolaatay, haddii kale soo dejin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erender_still\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir la rendariyay oo ah aragta ama muuqaal la kaydiyay, sida badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E ee wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E sameeyo, iyo dejintaada rendarka haddii aysan weydiinin kuwo kale (preset muuqaal: dibadda, gudaha, goyn, habeen ama auto; degdeg ama tayo sare, cabbir, tusaale, samada); PNG uu eegi karo, ama PNG, EXR ama fayl rendar foolder aad Studio-ga ku ogolaatay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erender_queue\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku daraa sawirro tayo sare ah wada-hadalka rendarka (aragta, ama muuqaalada la kaydiyay) oo socodsiiyaa safka; sawirrada dhammaystiran waxay u gaaraan foolder aad ogolaatay, ama waxay ku sii jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESafka rendarka\u003C/span\u003E wada-hadalka rendarka. Wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_push\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu cusboonaysiiyaa moodeel laga xidhay barnaamij kale (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EIlaali moodeel .3dm oo toos ah\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_status\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu sheegaa haddii moodeelka xidhan uu weli jiro iyo goorta uu ugu dambeyntii cusboonaysiiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eundo\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabooyinkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidhadka kaaliyuhu sameeyo waxay yimaadaan kooxo, sidaas darteed marna ma isku darmaan waxa aad naqshadeysay. Ma jiro qalab kaydiya moodeelka: kaydinta waa adiga, dhoofinta ama rendarka waxay u baahan yihiin \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar\u003C/strong\u003E la calaamadiyay. Rendar ma beddelo moodeelka; rendarka muuqaal la kaydiyay wuxuu u gudbaa aragta sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E sameyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-wax-shaqeynin\"\u003EHaddii wax shaqeynin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaaliyuhu ma arko qalabka ModelCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E hubi in badhanka uu daaqaddan ku shidan yahay, iyo in daaqaddu furan tahay Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Waxay u baahan tahay ogolaanshaha wax ka beddelka&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna weydii mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKhaladaadka &quot;401&quot; ama &quot;token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamaddu way isbeddeshay (Studio ayaa dib u bilaabay, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalaamad cusub\u003C/span\u003E). Ku koobi calaamadda cusub dejinta kaaliyaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ETusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E: tusaalooyin dhab ah, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida kaaliye AI ah (ama qoraal aad qortay) loogu ogolaado inuu ModelCraft la shaqeeyo, iyo sida loo go'aamiyo waxa uu taaban karo. ModelCraft ma leh AI gaar ah mana diro wax meel kasta. Kaaliyahaaga adiga ayaa keenaya: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). ModelCraft waxay siinaysaa qalab keliya, adna ayaad dooran doontaa kuwa. Shid Fur Dejinta (giraanta ku taal bar-ka app-ka, ama Ctrl+,) oo u gudub tab-ka ModelCraft. Hoosta Kaaliyayaasha, calaamadi Ogolow kaaliyayaasha AI iyo qoraallada inay isticmaalaan ModelCraft. Waa la demiyay ilaa aad shidayso. Dooro waxa ay sameyn karto: Akhri waa la calaamadiyay bilowga; calaamadi Wax ka beddel, Kaydi ama Soo saar kaliya marka aad u baahan tahay. Qalabka aan ku jirin ogolaanshaha aad calaamadisay looma soo bandhigo kaaliyaha, haddii uu si kastaba u weydiiyo, ModelCraft way diidi doontaa oo waxay ku qori doontaa diiwaanka waxqabadka. Deminta badhanka waxay joojinaysaa dhammaan xiriirrada hal mar. Dib u deji dejinta ModelCraft ayaa sidoo kale demisa. Ku xidh kaaliyahaaga Kaaliyayaasha waxay ku xiriiraan CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu socodsiiyaa server yar oo kaliya kombiyuutarkan gaari karo, oo lagu ilaaliyo calaamad (token) uu sameeyo mar kasta oo bilaabo. Studio-ga, dooro Ku xidh kaaliye oo ku koobi cinwaanka iyo calaamadda kaaliyahaaga (Studio wuxuu muujinayaa dejinta saxda ah ee la dhejiyo). Calaamadda ha wadaagin marna. Tab-ka browser-ka ma furi karo xiriir kaaliye: appsyada browser-ka badhanka ma saameeyo ilaa aad isticmaasho CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga. Adigu waad xakamaynaysaa Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqo, oo lagu calaamadiyay magaca kaaliyaha uu u isticmaalo (tusaale \"Kaaliye: boks\"). Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay ee kaaliyaha oo dhammaan. Waad ogaanaysaa marka mid la xidhay. Badhanka bar-ka app-ka ayaa magaca kaaliyaha muujinaya intuu xiriir yahay; riix si aad u aragto waxa uu ogolaan karo, ama si aad u Ka jooji. Waxqabadka. Dejinta › ModelCraft › Kaaliyayaasha › Waxqabadka wuxuu liis ku sameeyaa wac kasta: goorta, qalabka, iyo in la dhammeeyay ama la diiday. Kaydi diiwaanka wuxuu keydiyaa nuqul. Waxa kaaliyuhu weydiisan karo Qalab Ogolaansho Waxa uu sameeyo app_info, model_describe Akhri Cutubka moodeelka, cabbirkiisa, iyo koox kasta iyo komponent kasta meesha ay ku yaalliin, haba yihiin jidh xidhan iyo mugga view_screenshot Akhri Sawir ka mid ah aragta 3D sida ay muuqato box_add, cylinder_add Wax ka beddel Boks ama silindar oo koox cusub ah, meel iyo cabbir adiga ama isagu siiyo (\"3m\", \"10'\" ama tiro ku jira cutubka moodeelka) instance_move, instances_erase Wax ka beddel Wuxuu guuraa ama tirtiraa kooxaha iyo komponentada faces_list, materials_list Akhri Dhinacyada kooxda ama joomatriga furan (jihada kasta, balaadhka iyo dhexdhexaadka); agabka iyo midabada uu ku rinjiyayn karo push_pull Wax ka beddel Wuxuu riixaa ama jiidaa dhinac, sida Riix/jiid sameysa paint Wax ka beddel Wuxuu rinjiyaa dhinacyada ama kooxda oo dhan midab ama agab group_make Wax ka beddel Wuxuu sameeyaa koox ama komponent ka dhigan dhinacyo kala go' iyo kooxo scene_add, scene_show Wax ka beddel Wuxuu aragta u kaydiyaa muuqaal; wuxuu u gudbaa muuqaal la kaydiyay mesh_add Wax ka beddel Shay mesh ah oo lagu bilaabo (kuub, kubbad, silindar …), sida goobta shaqada Mesh ku daraysa modifiers_list, modifier_add, modifier_set, modifier_remove Akhri / Wax ka beddel Xirmada beddelayaasha mesh-ka: mirror, array, subdivision, bevel iyo kuwa kale; waxba si joogto ah looma dabaqo usd_export Soo saar Moodeelka sida OpenUSD (.usda, .usdc ama .usdz), sida loo kaydiyo moodeelka USD ahaan (USD); foolder aad Studio-ga ku ogolaatay, haddii kale soo dejin render_still Soo saar Sawir la rendariyay oo ah aragta ama muuqaal la kaydiyay, sida badhanka Soo saar ee wada-hadalka Soo saar sameeyo, iyo dejintaada rendarka haddii aysan weydiinin kuwo kale (preset muuqaal: dibadda, gudaha, goyn, habeen ama auto; degdeg ama tayo sare, cabbir, tusaale, samada); PNG uu eegi karo, ama PNG, EXR ama fayl rendar foolder aad Studio-ga ku ogolaatay (Rendar sawir) render_queue Soo saar Wuxuu ku daraa sawirro tayo sare ah wada-hadalka rendarka (aragta, ama muuqaalada la kaydiyay) oo socodsiiyaa safka; sawirrada dhammaystiran waxay u gaaraan foolder aad ogolaatay, ama waxay ku sii jiraan Safka rendarka wada-hadalka rendarka. Wuxuu u baahan yahay WebGPU link_push Wax ka beddel Wuxuu cusboonaysiiyaa moodeel laga xidhay barnaamij kale (eeg Ilaali moodeel .3dm oo toos ah) link_status Akhri Wuxuu sheegaa haddii moodeelka xidhan uu weli jiro iyo goorta uu ugu dambeyntii cusboonaysiiyay undo Wax ka beddel Wuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabooyinkiisa Jidhadka kaaliyuhu sameeyo waxay yimaadaan kooxo, sidaas darteed marna ma isku darmaan waxa aad naqshadeysay. Ma jiro qalab kaydiya moodeelka: kaydinta waa adiga, dhoofinta ama rendarka waxay u baahan yihiin Soo saar la calaamadiyay. Rendar ma beddelo moodeelka; rendarka muuqaal la kaydiyay wuxuu u gudbaa aragta sida Muuqaallada sameyso. Haddii wax shaqeynin Kaaliyuhu ma arko qalabka ModelCraft: hubi in badhanka uu daaqaddan ku shidan yahay, iyo in daaqaddu furan tahay Studio. \"Waxay u baahan tahay ogolaanshaha wax ka beddelka\": calaamadi Wax ka beddel hoosta Kaaliyayaasha, ka dibna weydii mar kale. Khaladaadka \"401\" ama \"token\": calaamaddu way isbeddeshay (Studio ayaa dib u bilaabay, ama Calaamad cusub). Ku koobi calaamadda cusub dejinta kaaliyaha. Eeg sidoo kale Tusaalooyinka kaaliyayaasha AI: tusaalooyin dhab ah, mid kasta oo leh qalabka uu isticmaalo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"export-model","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Soo saar moodel barnaamijyo kale","summary":"Dooro soo-saarista saxda ah ee rendarka, webka, daabacaadda 3D, BIM iyo BimCraft, oo hubi waxa kasta oo ay ilaalinayso.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["daabac","3mf","pdf","warqad","sawir","rendar","kaydi muuqaalka","soo saar","la wadaag","gltf","glb","collada","dae","obj","stl","daabacaadda 3d","ifc","bim","bimcraft","dir","barnaamijyo kale","screenshot"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-saar","text":"Soo saar","level":2},{"id":"qaab-ayaa-la-doonayo","text":"Qaab ayaa la doonayo","level":2},{"id":"ka-hor-intaadan-soo-saarin","text":"Ka hor intaadan soo saarin","level":2},{"id":"moodel-u-dir-bimcraft","text":"Moodel u dir BimCraft","level":2},{"id":"sawirka-muuqaalka-ahaan","text":"Sawirka muuqaalka ahaan","level":2},{"id":"daabac-muuqaalka-ama-kaydi-pdf","text":"Daabac muuqaalka, ama kaydi PDF","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESoo saar wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul moodelka qaab kale ah. Faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E sidoo kale ilaali: waa faylka kaliya ee wax walba ilaaliya, iyo kaliya ModelCraft si toos ah u furta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saar\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka hore kaydi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), si faylkaaga shaqada uu ammaan ugu noqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka. Browser-ku wuu soo dejiyaa, magaca moodelka u eg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka oo dhan ayaa la soo saaraa. Si aad mid qayb ah u soo saarto, kaydi, tirtir inta kale, soo saar, kadibna ka noqo ama mar kale fur.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaab-ayaa-la-doonayo\"\u003EQaab ayaa la doonayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad rabtaa inaad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDooro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur modeler 3D kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ilaalinayaa kooxaha, kooxaha ku jira kooxda kale, qaybaha (la wadaago, lagama nuqlo), magacyada iyo midabka. Z sare, mitir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERendar u samee, ama isticmaal barnaamij muuqaal-sawirid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOBJ (.obj)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ ayaa ugu badan la akhriyaa; wuxuu qoraa meel kasta oo kooxda ah shay gaar ah, laakiin midab ma lahan iyo qaybo la wadaago ma lahan. glTF wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaybaha iyo midabka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhig webka, mishiinka ciyaarta ama AR\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EglTF binary (.glb)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal fayl oo wax walba ku jira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaabac 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu hubiyaa in moodelku xidhan yahay oo wajiyadu saxda ku jiraan, kadibna wuxuu qoraa STL ama 3MF millimitir. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL oo loo daabacayo (.stl, millimitir)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa moodel oo dhan hubin la&#039;aan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur BimCraft ama barnaamij BIM kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoox kasta ama qayb kasta oo sare waxay noqotaa hal qayb dhismeed.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar xaaladda mid kasta oo soo saarid wuu xaqiijiyaa, tusaale ahaan &quot;Waa la soo saaray House.stl (millimitir).&quot; ama &quot;Waa la soo saaray House.dae (Collada 1.4.1, Z sare, mitir; qaybaha way la wadaagaan).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-intaadan-soo-saarin\"\u003EKa hor intaadan soo saarin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxi shayadaada.\u003C/strong\u003E Collada, glTF iyo IFC waxay ilaaliyaan kooxaha iyo qaybaha shay gooni ah. Joomatari furan waxay u baxdaa mid ah hal dhigan; IFC-na waxay noqotaa hal qayb oo la yiraahdo &quot;Loose geometry&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagaci u bixi.\u003C/strong\u003E Magacyada kooxda iyo qaybaha waxay galaan Collada iyo IFC, sidaas darteed darbi loo yaqaan &quot;North wall&quot; wuxuu imanayaa sidaas oo kale &quot;North wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubi jihada wajiga.\u003C/strong\u003E Wajiyada muujinaya buluug-cirro dibadda waxay u jeedi doonaan gudaha soo saarista. Ku saxo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERogi wajiga\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/erase#a-face-facing-the-wrong-way\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/erase\" data-hash=\"a-face-facing-the-wrong-way\"\u003ETirtir iyo nadiifi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaabacaadda,\u003C/strong\u003E samee qaybaha jireed xidhan: dooro koox kasta oo hubi in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E leeyahay &quot;Jireed: Haa&quot;. Kadibna cabbir moodelka cabbirka la daabacayo, ama ku cabbir software-ka daabacaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodel-u-dir-bimcraft\"\u003EMoodel u dir BimCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb kasta oo dhismeed u samee koox ama qayb, oo magac u bixi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E ee la soo dejiyay BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka qaabeynta fikradda, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMassing u dir BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E: koox kasta waxay u baxdaa ikhtiyaar qaabeyn oo leh dabaqyo, bedka dabaqyada iyo mugga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/massing-to-bimcraft\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/massing-to-bimcraft\"\u003EU dir qaabeynta BimCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo saarista IFC ee caadiga ah ma leh xidhiidh toos ah labada barnaamij dhexdooda. IFC-ku wuxuu leeyahay hal dabaq, geesi kasta waa wakiil guud oo qayb dhismeed ah oo aan nooc ama hanti lahayn: wuxuu qaadaa qaabka iyo magaca oo keliya. Kooxaha xidhan waxay noqdaan qaabab jir ah; kuwa furan waxay noqdaan dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-muuqaalka-ahaan\"\u003ESawirka muuqaalka ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka muuqaalka (.png)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa waxa uu muujinayo muuqaalka 3D si sax ah, cabbirka shaashadda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawirka laba jeer cabbirka (.png)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa laba jeer ballac iyo laba jeer dherer (daabacaad ama slaayd cad), cabbirrada iyo calaamadaha cabbirkaas ayaa dib loo sawiraa halkii la fidin lahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir u eg iftiinka maalinta (samada, qorraxda, hooska jilicsan, muraayadda), isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E halkaas: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\"\u003ERendar sawir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir nadiif ah, marka hore kor u qor \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003Emuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/a\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift P\"\u003E⇧P\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+P\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): dhidibbada, hagayaasha, khadadka qaybta iyo doorashada ayaa la ka saaraa. Kamarada, qaabka iyo hooska u dejiso sidaad rabto, ama tag \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Emuuqaal\u003C/a\u003E; si aad filim dhaqdhaqaaq ah u kaydiso muuqaalladaada, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E gudaha gunta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaallada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daabac-muuqaalka-ama-kaydi-pdf\"\u003EDaabac muuqaalka, ama kaydi PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF muuqaalka (.pdf)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa PDF hal bog ah: muuqaalka laba jeer cabbirka shaashadda, cabbirradiisa, bog A4 ah (Letter markii moodelku yahay fit iyo inji), jiifka, iyo xariiq hoose oo sheegaysa magaca faylka, taariikhda iyo unitiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaabac muuqaalka…\u003C/span\u003E isla bogaas wuxuu geeyaa hortaagga daabacaadda browser-kaaga. Dooro daabaca, ama &quot;Kaydi sida PDF&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBogu wuxuu muujinayaa muuqaalka sida uu yahay: muuqaalka perspektiifka ma leh miisaan. Sawir miisaan leh, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiif\u003C/span\u003E demi oo ka eeg \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, kuna dar \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Ecabbirro\u003C/a\u003E cabbirrada muhiimka ah. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/styles-shadows#presentation-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/styles-shadows\" data-hash=\"presentation-view\"\u003EMuuqaalka soo bandhigga\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa dhidibbada, hagayaasha iyo doorashada; cabbirradu way sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Soo saar wuxuu sameeyaa nuqul moodelka qaab kale ah. Faylka .modelcraft sidoo kale ilaali: waa faylka kaliya ee wax walba ilaaliya, iyo kaliya ModelCraft si toos ah u furta. Soo saar Marka hore kaydi (Ctrl+S), si faylkaaga shaqada uu ammaan ugu noqdo. Riix Soo saar kooxda Fayl. Dooro qaabka. Browser-ku wuu soo dejiyaa, magaca moodelka u eg. Moodelka oo dhan ayaa la soo saaraa. Si aad mid qayb ah u soo saarto, kaydi, tirtir inta kale, soo saar, kadibna ka noqo ama mar kale fur. Qaab ayaa la doonayo Waxaad rabtaa inaad Dooro Qoraalo Ku fur modeler 3D kale Collada (.dae) Wuxuu ilaalinayaa kooxaha, kooxaha ku jira kooxda kale, qaybaha (la wadaago, lagama nuqlo), magacyada iyo midabka. Z sare, mitir. Rendar u samee, ama isticmaal barnaamij muuqaal-sawirid OBJ (.obj) ama glTF binary (.glb) OBJ ayaa ugu badan la akhriyaa; wuxuu qoraa meel kasta oo kooxda ah shay gaar ah, laakiin midab ma lahan iyo qaybo la wadaago ma lahan. glTF wuxuu ilaalinayaa qaybaha iyo midabka. Ku dhig webka, mishiinka ciyaarta ama AR glTF binary (.glb) Hal fayl oo wax walba ku jira. Daabac 3D Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)… Wuxuu hubiyaa in moodelku xidhan yahay oo wajiyadu saxda ku jiraan, kadibna wuxuu qoraa STL ama 3MF millimitir. Eeg Diyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D. STL oo loo daabacayo (.stl, millimitir) wuxuu qoraa moodel oo dhan hubin la'aan. Ku fur BimCraft ama barnaamij BIM kale IFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc) Koox kasta ama qayb kasta oo sare waxay noqotaa hal qayb dhismeed. Bar xaaladda mid kasta oo soo saarid wuu xaqiijiyaa, tusaale ahaan \"Waa la soo saaray House.stl (millimitir).\" ama \"Waa la soo saaray House.dae (Collada 1.4.1, Z sare, mitir; qaybaha way la wadaagaan).\" Ka hor intaadan soo saarin Kooxi shayadaada. Collada, glTF iyo IFC waxay ilaaliyaan kooxaha iyo qaybaha shay gooni ah. Joomatari furan waxay u baxdaa mid ah hal dhigan; IFC-na waxay noqotaa hal qayb oo la yiraahdo \"Loose geometry\". Magaci u bixi. Magacyada kooxda iyo qaybaha waxay galaan Collada iyo IFC, sidaas darteed darbi loo yaqaan \"North wall\" wuxuu imanayaa sidaas oo kale \"North wall\". Hubi jihada wajiga. Wajiyada muujinaya buluug-cirro dibadda waxay u jeedi doonaan gudaha soo saarista. Ku saxo Rogi wajiga (eeg Tirtir iyo nadiifi). Daabacaadda, samee qaybaha jireed xidhan: dooro koox kasta oo hubi in Macluumaadka leeyahay \"Jireed: Haa\". Kadibna cabbir moodelka cabbirka la daabacayo, ama ku cabbir software-ka daabacaha. Moodel u dir BimCraft Qayb kasta oo dhismeed u samee koox ama qayb, oo magac u bixi. Dooro Soo saar, kadibna IFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc). Fur faylka .ifc ee la soo dejiyay BimCraft. Qaabka qaabeynta fikradda, isticmaal Soo saar › Massing u dir BimCraft…: koox kasta waxay u baxdaa ikhtiyaar qaabeyn oo leh dabaqyo, bedka dabaqyada iyo mugga. Eeg U dir qaabeynta BimCraft. Soo saarista IFC ee caadiga ah ma leh xidhiidh toos ah labada barnaamij dhexdooda. IFC-ku wuxuu leeyahay hal dabaq, geesi kasta waa wakiil guud oo qayb dhismeed ah oo aan nooc ama hanti lahayn: wuxuu qaadaa qaabka iyo magaca oo keliya. Kooxaha xidhan waxay noqdaan qaabab jir ah; kuwa furan waxay noqdaan dusha. Sawirka muuqaalka ahaan Soo saar › Sawirka muuqaalka (.png) wuxuu kaydiyaa waxa uu muujinayo muuqaalka 3D si sax ah, cabbirka shaashadda. Sawirka laba jeer cabbirka (.png) wuxuu kaydiyaa laba jeer ballac iyo laba jeer dherer (daabacaad ama slaayd cad), cabbirrada iyo calaamadaha cabbirkaas ayaa dib loo sawiraa halkii la fidin lahaa. Sawir u eg iftiinka maalinta (samada, qorraxda, hooska jilicsan, muraayadda), isticmaal Soo saar › Rendar sawir… halkaas: eeg Rendar sawir. Sawir nadiif ah, marka hore kor u qor muuqaalka soo bandhigga (Shift+P): dhidibbada, hagayaasha, khadadka qaybta iyo doorashada ayaa la ka saaraa. Kamarada, qaabka iyo hooska u dejiso sidaad rabto, ama tag muuqaal; si aad filim dhaqdhaqaaq ah u kaydiso muuqaalladaada, isticmaal Soo saar dhaqdhaqaaq gudaha gunta Muuqaallada. Daabac muuqaalka, ama kaydi PDF Soo saar › PDF muuqaalka (.pdf) wuxuu kaydiyaa PDF hal bog ah: muuqaalka laba jeer cabbirka shaashadda, cabbirradiisa, bog A4 ah (Letter markii moodelku yahay fit iyo inji), jiifka, iyo xariiq hoose oo sheegaysa magaca faylka, taariikhda iyo unitiga. Soo saar › Daabac muuqaalka… isla bogaas wuxuu geeyaa hortaagga daabacaadda browser-kaaga. Dooro daabaca, ama \"Kaydi sida PDF\". Bogu wuxuu muujinayaa muuqaalka sida uu yahay: muuqaalka perspektiifka ma leh miisaan. Sawir miisaan leh, Perspektiif demi oo ka eeg Sare ama Hore, kuna dar cabbirro cabbirrada muhiimka ah. Muuqaalka soo bandhigga wuxuu ka saaraa dhidibbada, hagayaasha iyo doorashada; cabbirradu way sii jiraan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"massing-to-bimcraft","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Massing u dir BimCraft","summary":"U dir massing-ka push/pull BimCraft sida ikhtiyaarro massing, adigoo leh dabaqyo, dhul saldhig, sagxadda guud ee dabaqyada iyo mugga la xisaabiyay solid kasta.","section":"tasks","order":131,"keywords":["massing","mass","fikrad","ikhtiyaarro","bimcraft","ifc","bim","riix-jiid","dabaqyo","davaaqyo","dhul saldhig","sagxadda guud","mugga","u dir","u gudbi","qaabka dhismaha","marxalad 2"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"ka-hor-inta-aadan-bilaabin","text":"Ka hor inta aadan bilaabin","level":2},{"id":"u-dir","text":"U dir","level":2},{"id":"sida-solid-ku-u-noqdo-mass","text":"Sida solid-ku u noqdo mass","level":2},{"id":"qaabab-fudud","text":"Qaabab fudud","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU beddel bloogyada aad ku moodeeshay riix-jiid ikhtiyaarro massing oo BimCraft fahmi karto, si fikraddu u sii socoto sida moodeel dhismeed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-hor-inta-aadan-bilaabin\"\u003EKa hor inta aadan bilaabin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta oo mass ah ka dhig \u003Cstrong\u003Ekooxda\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ekomponentka\u003C/strong\u003E oo magac sii. Mid kasta wuxuu noqonayaa hal ikhtiyaar. Joometri xoog la&#039;aan lama diro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir\"\u003EU dir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro kooxaha la diro. Haddii aan wax la dooran, kooxda iyo komponentka sare oo dhan ayaa la diraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMassing u dir BimCraft…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagaca kooxda ikhtiyaarka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoogga dabaqa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi liiska: dabaqyada, dhul saldhigga, sagxadda guud iyo mugga ikhtiyaar kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EU dir BimCraft\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u furto tab BimCraft cusub oo ikhtiyaaradu ku jiraan, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU kaydi sida IFC\u003C/span\u003E si aad faylka u soo dejiso oo halkaas adigu ku furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBimCraft gudihiisa ikhtiyaaradu waxay ku taxan yihiin &quot;Ikhtiyaarada massing ee moodeelka&quot;, halkaas oo mid laga dhigi karo ikhtiyaarka hadda jira, loona kobciyo darbiyo iyo sagxado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-solid-ku-u-noqdo-mass\"\u003ESida solid-ku u noqdo mass\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyadu\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhererka solid-ka oo loo qaybiyey joogga dabaqa, la wareegay, waana ugu yaraan hal. Dabaqyadu markaa dhererka solid-ka ayay si siman wadaagaan; sidaas darteed bloog 10 m ah oo dabaqyo 3 m ah leh wuxuu leeyahay 3 dabaq oo 3.33 m kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhulka dabaq kasta\u003C/strong\u003E waa ballaca qaybta solid-ka ee dhulkan heerkiisa. Bloog dib u dhacda wuxuu leeyahay dabaqyada sare oo yar, sagxadda guudna waa wadarta dhammaantood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhul saldhigga\u003C/strong\u003E waa kontuurka qaybta ka sarraysa saldhigga solid-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMugga\u003C/strong\u003E waa kan solid-ka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka IFC ikhtiyaar kasta waa building element proxy (dhul saldhigga oo lagu kor qaaday dherer solid-ka) oo leh hal space dabaq kasta, oo sagxadda guud ee dabaqaas ku jirta. Ikhtiyaaradu dhammaantood waxay wadaagaan hal dhis, oo leh dabaqyo sida ikhtiyaarka ugu sarreeya oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabab-fudud\"\u003EQaabab fudud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBloog toos ah oo sare taagan wuxuu u gudbaa sida la moodeeshay. Wax kale oo la diraa, liiskuna wuxuu sharaxayaa sababta qaabkiisa loo fudaydiyay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyadiisa oo dhammaantood ma aha sida saldhigiisa oo kale\u003C/strong\u003E (wuu dib u dhacaa ama wuu jiifsanayaa): massing-ka BimCraft waa kontuurka saldhigga oo lagu kor qaaday dherer buuxa, laakiin sagxadaha dabaqyada iyo mugga waa kuwa solid-ka laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolid-ku ma xirna\u003C/strong\u003E: dabaqyada aan qaybtooda la xidhi karin lama cabbiro, wayna eber ahaan u tirsanaadaan. Xir solid-ka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Jirid: Haa&quot;) si tirooyinka buuxa loo helo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaldhigiisu wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan hal kontuur\u003C/strong\u003E: kan ugu weyn ayaa loo isticmaalaa dhul saldhig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E waa export kale: wuxuu diraa qaabab iyo magacyo kaliya, dabaq ama sagxad la&#039;aan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxba lama soo rarayo. Faylka waxaa loo gudbiyaa tab BimCraft ee kombiyuutarkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid U beddel bloogyada aad ku moodeeshay riix-jiid ikhtiyaarro massing oo BimCraft fahmi karto, si fikraddu u sii socoto sida moodeel dhismeed. Ka hor inta aadan bilaabin Mid kasta oo mass ah ka dhig kooxda ama komponentka oo magac sii. Mid kasta wuxuu noqonayaa hal ikhtiyaar. Joometri xoog la'aan lama diro. U dir Dooro kooxaha la diro. Haddii aan wax la dooran, kooxda iyo komponentka sare oo dhan ayaa la diraa. Dooro Soo saar, kadibna Massing u dir BimCraft…. Qor Magaca kooxda ikhtiyaarka iyo Joogga dabaqa. Hubi liiska: dabaqyada, dhul saldhigga, sagxadda guud iyo mugga ikhtiyaar kasta. Dooro U dir BimCraft si aad u furto tab BimCraft cusub oo ikhtiyaaradu ku jiraan, ama U kaydi sida IFC si aad faylka u soo dejiso oo halkaas adigu ku furto. BimCraft gudihiisa ikhtiyaaradu waxay ku taxan yihiin \"Ikhtiyaarada massing ee moodeelka\", halkaas oo mid laga dhigi karo ikhtiyaarka hadda jira, loona kobciyo darbiyo iyo sagxado. Sida solid-ku u noqdo mass Dabaqyadu waa dhererka solid-ka oo loo qaybiyey joogga dabaqa, la wareegay, waana ugu yaraan hal. Dabaqyadu markaa dhererka solid-ka ayay si siman wadaagaan; sidaas darteed bloog 10 m ah oo dabaqyo 3 m ah leh wuxuu leeyahay 3 dabaq oo 3.33 m kasta. Dhulka dabaq kasta waa ballaca qaybta solid-ka ee dhulkan heerkiisa. Bloog dib u dhacda wuxuu leeyahay dabaqyada sare oo yar, sagxadda guudna waa wadarta dhammaantood. Dhul saldhigga waa kontuurka qaybta ka sarraysa saldhigga solid-ka. Mugga waa kan solid-ka laftiisa. Faylka IFC ikhtiyaar kasta waa building element proxy (dhul saldhigga oo lagu kor qaaday dherer solid-ka) oo leh hal space dabaq kasta, oo sagxadda guud ee dabaqaas ku jirta. Ikhtiyaaradu dhammaantood waxay wadaagaan hal dhis, oo leh dabaqyo sida ikhtiyaarka ugu sarreeya oo kale. Qaabab fudud Bloog toos ah oo sare taagan wuxuu u gudbaa sida la moodeeshay. Wax kale oo la diraa, liiskuna wuxuu sharaxayaa sababta qaabkiisa loo fudaydiyay: Dabaqyadiisa oo dhammaantood ma aha sida saldhigiisa oo kale (wuu dib u dhacaa ama wuu jiifsanayaa): massing-ka BimCraft waa kontuurka saldhigga oo lagu kor qaaday dherer buuxa, laakiin sagxadaha dabaqyada iyo mugga waa kuwa solid-ka laftiisa. Solid-ku ma xirna: dabaqyada aan qaybtooda la xidhi karin lama cabbiro, wayna eber ahaan u tirsanaadaan. Xir solid-ka (Macluumaadka wuxuu leeyahay \"Jirid: Haa\") si tirooyinka buuxa loo helo. Saldhigiisu wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan hal kontuur: kan ugu weyn ayaa loo isticmaalaa dhul saldhig. Waxa wanaagsan in la ogaado IFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc) waa export kale: wuxuu diraa qaabab iyo magacyo kaliya, dabaq ama sagxad la'aan. Waxba lama soo rarayo. Faylka waxaa loo gudbiyaa tab BimCraft ee kombiyuutarkan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Kaydi, fur iyo soo saar USD","summary":"Kaydi moodeelka oo dhan sida USD (.usda, .usdc ama .usdz) iyadoo aan wax lumin, dib u fur, oo soo dhoofi muuqaalada USD ee barnaamijyada 3D ee kale.","section":"tasks","order":135,"keywords":["usd","usda","usdc","usdz","openusd","universal scene description","kaydi sida","soo saar","soo dhoofi","isku-dhisidda muuqaalka","archviz","openpbr","materialx","xidhmo"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-sida-usd","text":"Kaydi sida USD","level":2},{"id":"waxba-ma-lumo","text":"Waxba ma lumo","level":2},{"id":"fur-ama-soo-dhoofi-usd-qof-kale","text":"Fur ama soo dhoofi USD qof kale","level":2},{"id":"weli-ma-jiro","text":"Weli ma jiro","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUSD waa qaab muuqaal oo barnaamijyo badan oo 3D, sawirid iyo archviz wadaagaan. ModelCraft wuu qoraa oo wuu akhriyaa. \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu weli yahay qaabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E qorto; USD waa doorasho ku jirta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-sida-usd\"\u003EKaydi sida USD\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoraal (.usda)\u003C/span\u003E (la akhriyi karo, wanaagsan xakamaynta noocyada), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBinary (.usdc)\u003C/span\u003E (ugu yar oo ugu dhakhsaha badan) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmo (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E (hal fayl oo tekstuurada gudaha ku jira).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuu soo dejiyaa (barnaamijka desktop-ka waxaad dooraysaa meesha uu tago).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla doorashooyinkaas waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxba-ma-lumo\"\u003EWaxba ma lumo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur fayl USD ah oo ModelCraft kaydiyay, waxaad heleysaa moodeelka sidiisii oo kale: dusha iyo godadkooda, geesaha jilicsan iyo qarsan, qalinnada, kooxaha iyo qaybaha, calaamadaha, muuqaallada, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha goynta, laydhadhka, tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay iyo muuqaalka. Barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan isla moodeelkaas sida meshes, kooxo, prototypes ee qaybaha, alaabta (materials), laydhadhka iyo kamaradaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii barnaamij kale beddelo joometriga kooxda ama qaybta, ModelCraft qaybtaas wuxuu u furaa sida mesh oo isbeddelka la ilaaliyo, wuxuuna sheegaa inta qaybood oo sidaas akhriyay. Goobta qayb la dhigay oo barnaamij kale ka guurtay ama ka tirtirtay wuxuu sii ahaanayaa wuxuu guurtay ama tirtirtay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-ama-soo-dhoofi-usd-qof-kale\"\u003EFur ama soo dhoofi USD qof kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.usd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E si aad moodeel uga bilowdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E mid si aad ugu darto moodeelka furan. Ku soo rid faylalka uu tixraacayo (lakabyada kale, tekstuurada) faylka ay la socdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeshes waxay soo galaan normals, UV koorsiyada iyo midabkooda, joometriga la wadaago wuxuu soo galaa qaybo ahaan, alaabta midabka rinjiga ahaan, laydhadhka laydh ahaan, kamaradaha muuqaal ahaan, meter ku jira, Z sare, iyadoo aan loo eegin unitka faylka iyo dhidibka sare.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-ma-jiro\"\u003EWeli ma jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAnimation, skeletons iyo MaterialX node graphs weli lama akhriyo lamana qori USD ahaan. Animation-ka iyo alaabta nodeyda ee ModelCraft waxay ku sii jiraan fayl USD oo uu kaydiyay, si ModelCraft mar kale u furo, laakiin barnaamijyada kale ma arkaan. Lakabyada faylku tixraacayo oo ModelCraft aan akhrin karin (tusaale ahaan dukumeentiga MaterialX) waa laga reebayaa, oo fiiro ayaa la siiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"USD waa qaab muuqaal oo barnaamijyo badan oo 3D, sawirid iyo archviz wadaagaan. ModelCraft wuu qoraa oo wuu akhriyaa. .modelcraft wuxuu weli yahay qaabka Kaydi qorto; USD waa doorasho ku jirta Kaydi sida. Kaydi sida USD Dooro Kaydi sida kooxda Fayl (ama riix Ctrl+Shift+S). Dooro qaabka: Qoraal (.usda) (la akhriyi karo, wanaagsan xakamaynta noocyada), Binary (.usdc) (ugu yar oo ugu dhakhsaha badan) ama Xidhmo (.usdz) (hal fayl oo tekstuurada gudaha ku jira). Faylku wuu soo dejiyaa (barnaamijka desktop-ka waxaad dooraysaa meesha uu tago). Isla doorashooyinkaas waxay ku jiraan Soo saar › USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…. Waxba ma lumo Fur fayl USD ah oo ModelCraft kaydiyay, waxaad heleysaa moodeelka sidiisii oo kale: dusha iyo godadkooda, geesaha jilicsan iyo qarsan, qalinnada, kooxaha iyo qaybaha, calaamadaha, muuqaallada, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha goynta, laydhadhka, tekstuurada la soo dhoofiyay iyo muuqaalka. Barnaamijyada kale waxay arkaan isla moodeelkaas sida meshes, kooxo, prototypes ee qaybaha, alaabta (materials), laydhadhka iyo kamaradaha. Haddii barnaamij kale beddelo joometriga kooxda ama qaybta, ModelCraft qaybtaas wuxuu u furaa sida mesh oo isbeddelka la ilaaliyo, wuxuuna sheegaa inta qaybood oo sidaas akhriyay. Goobta qayb la dhigay oo barnaamij kale ka guurtay ama ka tirtirtay wuxuu sii ahaanayaa wuxuu guurtay ama tirtirtay. Fur ama soo dhoofi USD qof kale Fur fayl .usd, .usda, .usdc ama .usdz si aad moodeel uga bilowdo. Soo dhoofi mid si aad ugu darto moodeelka furan. Ku soo rid faylalka uu tixraacayo (lakabyada kale, tekstuurada) faylka ay la socdaan. Meshes waxay soo galaan normals, UV koorsiyada iyo midabkooda, joometriga la wadaago wuxuu soo galaa qaybo ahaan, alaabta midabka rinjiga ahaan, laydhadhka laydh ahaan, kamaradaha muuqaal ahaan, meter ku jira, Z sare, iyadoo aan loo eegin unitka faylka iyo dhidibka sare. Weli ma jiro Animation, skeletons iyo MaterialX node graphs weli lama akhriyo lamana qori USD ahaan. Animation-ka iyo alaabta nodeyda ee ModelCraft waxay ku sii jiraan fayl USD oo uu kaydiyay, si ModelCraft mar kale u furo, laakiin barnaamijyada kale ma arkaan. Lakabyada faylku tixraacayo oo ModelCraft aan akhrin karin (tusaale ahaan dukumeentiga MaterialX) waa laga reebayaa, oo fiiro ayaa la siiyaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Moodeel si wadajir ah oo Live TeamWork","summary":"Waxa ka beddelaya ModelCraft markaad ku jirto kalfadhi Live TeamWork oo CadCraft Studio ah: kooxaha iyo komponentada oo dhan moodeel keliya, cidda dib u qaabayn karta wax isla mar, undo-kaaga, iyo ku biirida browser-ka isku shabakad.","section":"tasks","order":135,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","wadajir","wadaag live","kalfadhi","wadaag","ku biir","koox","komponent","push pull","cursor","pointer","midkiis kale","magacyada","midabka","doorashada","undo","martigeliye"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"ku-shaqee-kooxdaada","text":"Ku shaqee kooxdaada","level":2},{"id":"iska-arag","text":"Iska arag","level":2},{"id":"undo-wuxuu-soo-celinayaa-shaqadaada","text":"Undo wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqadaada","level":2},{"id":"ku-biir-browser-ka","text":"Ku biir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"kalfadhigu-markuu-dhammaado","text":"Kalfadhigu markuu dhammaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ka dhaca moodeelka marka dhowr qof ay isku mar ku shaqeynayaan. CadCraft Studio ayaa bilaabaa oo ku biiraa kalfadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag, Ku biir); bogagaan waa moodeelka laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-shaqee-kooxdaada\"\u003EKu shaqee kooxdaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof kasta wuxuu tafatiraa isla moodeelka, isbeddelladaadu waxay muuqdaan isla markiiba. Sida isbeddelladu isku darto waxaa ku xiran waxa aad beddeshay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqaajinta, magacdhigidda, midabaynta ama qarinta kooxaha iyo komponentada la dhigay\u003C/strong\u003E isku darta: laba qof oo laba koox dhaqaajiya labadooda way hayaan dhaqaajintooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoomatriga gudaha koox keliya\u003C/strong\u003E (geesihiisa iyo dhinacyadiisa: sawirid, push/pull, tirtirid) waa hal qayb. Marka laba qof isku mar dib u qaabeeyaan isla koox, isbeddelka labaad waa la celiyaa, status bar-ku wuu sheegaa. Kooxo kala duwan ma isku faraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJoomatri aan kooxda ku jirin\u003C/strong\u003E waa kooxda moodeelka laftiisa: qof keliya ayaa dib u qaabayn kara isagoo mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidaas darteed isku raacsanaada cidda ku shaqeysa kooxdee, ama samee koox qof kasta qaybtiisa ka hor intaadan bilaabin. Hagayaasha, cabbirrada iyo goyanka waxay isku darmaan mid mid; muuqaalada, tags, dabaqyada iyo tooska naqshadda waxay u gudbaan qofkii ugu dambeeyay beddelay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iska-arag\"\u003EIska arag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof kasta oo kalfadhiga ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab gaar ah. Waxaad aragtaa pointer-ka qof kasta sida fallaar midabkiisa ah, magaciisa ku dhinac, qoto dheer ee aragta aad eegayso, iyo sanduuq jajab midabkiisa ah oo ku wareegsan wixii uu doortay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPointers, magacyada iyo doorashooyinka waa kuwa kalfadhiga keliya: weligood lama kaydiyo faylka, weligood ma galaan undo qof kasta. Way u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way u nacaysaan xitaa xidhiidh gaabanaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-wuxuu-soo-celinayaa-shaqadaada\"\u003EUndo wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqadaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabadaada ugu dambeysay oo keliya, wuxuuna dhaafaa tallaabooyinka kale. Marka qof wax isla shay ka beddelay ka dib, waxba lama soo celinayo, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegaa cidda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biir-browser-ka\"\u003EKu biir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaaxiibka aan Studio lahayn wuxuu iska sawiri karaa sawirka hoostiisa koodka martigeliyaha telefon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isku shabakad ah. ModelCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu buuxiyaa moodeelka martigeliyaha marka martigeliyuhu kuu ogolaado. Xiriirka casuumada wuxuu ku ogolaanayaa qof ka shabakad kale: martigeliyuhu waa inuu lahaadaa kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qof kasta kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, xiriirka wuxuu shaqeeyaa ilaa kalfadhiga martigeliyaha uu furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kalfadhigu-markuu-dhammaado\"\u003EKalfadhigu markuu dhammaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMartigeliyaha keliya ayaa kaydiya moodeelka. Qof kasta kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: keydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Waxa ka dhaca moodeelka marka dhowr qof ay isku mar ku shaqeynayaan. CadCraft Studio ayaa bilaabaa oo ku biiraa kalfadhiga Live TeamWork (Wadaag, Ku biir); bogagaan waa moodeelka laftiisa. Ku shaqee kooxdaada Qof kasta wuxuu tafatiraa isla moodeelka, isbeddelladaadu waxay muuqdaan isla markiiba. Sida isbeddelladu isku darto waxaa ku xiran waxa aad beddeshay: Dhaqaajinta, magacdhigidda, midabaynta ama qarinta kooxaha iyo komponentada la dhigay isku darta: laba qof oo laba koox dhaqaajiya labadooda way hayaan dhaqaajintooda. Joomatriga gudaha koox keliya (geesihiisa iyo dhinacyadiisa: sawirid, push/pull, tirtirid) waa hal qayb. Marka laba qof isku mar dib u qaabeeyaan isla koox, isbeddelka labaad waa la celiyaa, status bar-ku wuu sheegaa. Kooxo kala duwan ma isku faraan. Joomatri aan kooxda ku jirin waa kooxda moodeelka laftiisa: qof keliya ayaa dib u qaabayn kara isagoo mar. Sidaas darteed isku raacsanaada cidda ku shaqeysa kooxdee, ama samee koox qof kasta qaybtiisa ka hor intaadan bilaabin. Hagayaasha, cabbirrada iyo goyanka waxay isku darmaan mid mid; muuqaalada, tags, dabaqyada iyo tooska naqshadda waxay u gudbaan qofkii ugu dambeeyay beddelay. Iska arag Qof kasta oo kalfadhiga ku jira wuxuu leeyahay midab gaar ah. Waxaad aragtaa pointer-ka qof kasta sida fallaar midabkiisa ah, magaciisa ku dhinac, qoto dheer ee aragta aad eegayso, iyo sanduuq jajab midabkiisa ah oo ku wareegsan wixii uu doortay. Pointers, magacyada iyo doorashooyinka waa kuwa kalfadhiga keliya: weligood lama kaydiyo faylka, weligood ma galaan undo qof kasta. Way u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way u nacaysaan xitaa xidhiidh gaabanaan. Undo wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqadaada Ctrl+Z wuxuu soo celinayaa tallaabadaada ugu dambeysay oo keliya, wuxuuna dhaafaa tallaabooyinka kale. Marka qof wax isla shay ka beddelay ka dib, waxba lama soo celinayo, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegaa cidda. Ku biir browser-ka Saaxiibka aan Studio lahayn wuxuu iska sawiri karaa sawirka hoostiisa koodka martigeliyaha telefon, tablet ama kombiyuutar isku shabakad ah. ModelCraft wuxuu furmaa browser-ka oo wuxuu buuxiyaa moodeelka martigeliyaha marka martigeliyuhu kuu ogolaado. Xiriirka casuumada wuxuu ku ogolaanayaa qof ka shabakad kale: martigeliyuhu waa inuu lahaadaa kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qof kasta kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, xiriirka wuxuu shaqeeyaa ilaa kalfadhiga martigeliyaha uu furan yahay. Kalfadhigu markuu dhammaado Martigeliyaha keliya ayaa kaydiya moodeelka. Qof kasta kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: keydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ka imaanaya qaabeeyayaasha kale","summary":"Sida habitaadka push/pull ee qaabeeyayaasha kale ula mid yihiin ModelCraft, fur fur, iyo farqiyada dadka badanaa ku qaldama.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["u beddelid","u guur","caadi","farqiyo","qaabeeyaha push pull","skp","gaagaaban","habitaadyo","isbarbardhig","sanduuqa cabbirrada","outliner","entity info"],"headings":[{"id":"habitaadyo-wada-socda","text":"Habitaadyo wada socda","level":2},{"id":"farqiyo-ku-qaldiya-dadka","text":"Farqiyo ku qaldiya dadka","level":2},{"id":"kaydintu-waa-soo-dejin","text":"Kaydintu waa soo dejin","level":3},{"id":"wuu-soo-dhoofiyaa-faylalka-skp-laakiin-ma-kaydiyo","text":"Wuu soo dhoofiyaa faylalka .skp, laakiin ma kaydiyo","level":3},{"id":"ma-jiro-menu-ka-midig-riix","text":"Ma jiro menu-ka midig-riix","level":3},{"id":"cutubyada-waxay-ku-jiraan-status-bar-ka","text":"Cutubyada waxay ku jiraan status bar-ka","level":3},{"id":"rinjiga-wuxuu-leeyahay-alaabtiisa","text":"Rinjiga wuxuu leeyahay alaabtiisa","level":3},{"id":"miisaanku-waa-siman-yahay-ma-leh-qabasho","text":"Miisaanku waa siman yahay, ma leh qabasho","level":3},{"id":"wareeg-wuxuu-doortaa-diyaaradiisa-meesha-aad-guuto","text":"Wareeg wuxuu doortaa diyaaradiisa meesha aad guuto","level":3},{"id":"ku-saabsanaanta-barta-aad-marisay","text":"Ku-saabsanaanta barta aad marisay","level":3},{"id":"parallel-wuxuu-isticmaalaa-geesta-aad-marisay-ka-hor-bilowga","text":"Parallel wuxuu isticmaalaa geesta aad marisay ka hor bilowga","level":3},{"id":"nuqullada-kooxda-waa-isku-xidhan-yihiin","text":"Nuqullada kooxda waa isku xidhan yihiin","level":3},{"id":"space-ma-pan-garayso","text":"Space ma pan-garayso","level":3},{"id":"scroll-labo-farood-wuu-zoom-garayaa","text":"Scroll labo-farood wuu zoom-garayaa","level":3},{"id":"jidhadka-isku-riixan-ma-gooyaan","text":"Jidhadka isku riixan ma gooyaan","level":3},{"id":"waxa-maqan","text":"Waxa maqan","level":3},{"id":"gaagaabyada-browser-ku-haysto","text":"Gaagaabyada browser-ku haysto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad ku qaabeysay SketchUp, ModelCraft wuu ku noqon doonaa mid aad ku barataa: isla fikradda wejiyada iyo push/pull, isla xarfaha qalabka, sanduuq qiime ah oo aad ku qorto adigoo aan riixin, cabbir la yaqaan xagal oo casaan, cagaar iyo buluug ah, kooxaha, qaybaha, Outliner, Entity Info iyo goobaha. Bogganu wuxuu liistaa waxa si toos ah u wada socda, iyo waxa ka sii muhiimsan oo aan wada socon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habitaadyo-wada-socda\"\u003EHabitaadyo wada socda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad caadi u tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix Space si aad u doorato, L Xarriiq, R Afargeesle, C Goobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix P Push/Pull, M Guuri, Q Wareeji, S Miisaan, E Tirtiraha, T Tape Measure\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix O Orbit, H Pan, Z Zoom, Shift+Z Zoom Extents\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix G si aad u samayso qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu samaynayaa kooxda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor sanduuqa cabbirka adigoo aan riixin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid, sanduuqa qiimaha ee hoose. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E afar-geesle, \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E kadib Guuri koobiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid; \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E sidoo kale waa shaqeysaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E barta ama kala-sooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor lambar fudud moodeel inch-ka ah oo hel inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex-jiid si aad u orbit-garayso, Shift+dhex-jiid si aad u pan-garayso, wheel si aad zoom-ka u sameyso meesha cursor-ku joogo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo-guji Push/Pull si aad u ku celiso masaafada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFallaadhaha si aad u xidho red, green, blue, iyo parallel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E red, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E green, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E blue, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E parallel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift hay si aad u xidho inference-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl (Option Mac-ka) si aad u koobiyeeyso markii aad guurinayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kombuyuutar kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift si aad u beddesho, Ctrl si aad u darto, Shift+Ctrl si aad uga saarto xulashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku furayaasha; Mac-ka isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E meesha uu Ctrl yiri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad bidix-midig, gudub midig-bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka Dimension si aad u calaamadayso dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, iyo wax ka badan: qor dherer cusub cabbirka moodeelka oo moodeelku wuu u cabbirmaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003ECabbir oo dib u cabbir\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo-guji wejiga si aad u hesho wejiga iyo geesaha; saddex-guji si aad u hesho dhammaan kuwa isku xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo-guji kooxda si aad u tafatirto; Esc si aad u xirto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhad ku jiid wejiga si aad u kala qaybiso; geesta u dhaxaysa wejiyada isku diyaar ah tirtir si aad u isku xidho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid afar-geeska daaqadda ee darbiga dhex mari si aad u jarto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada dib-buluug-xagaasha; Reverse Faces\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku midabka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse face\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaha sidii tabsyo aragga dul ah, Page Up iyo Page Down\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScenes\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHiyaaradda taariikhda, waqtiga, latitude iyo longitude, woqooyiga cagaar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid, panel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStyle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"farqiyo-ku-qaldiya-dadka\"\u003EFarqiyo ku qaldiya dadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kaydintu-waa-soo-dejin\"\u003EKaydintu waa soo dejin\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro Save oo dib u qoraysa faylka aad furtay, ma jiro Save As oo leh magac, ma jiro autosave, ma jiro fayl backup ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu mar kasta soo dejiyaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E cusub, badanaa folder-ka downloads-kaaga. Badanaa kaydi, oo magacee ama u rarr faylalka adigu. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\"\u003EFur, kaydi, soo dhoofi iyo soo saar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wuu-soo-dhoofiyaa-faylalka-skp-laakiin-ma-kaydiyo\"\u003EWuu soo dhoofiyaa faylalka .skp, laakiin ma kaydiyo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa faylalka SketchUp adigoo isticmaalaya akhriyaha ModelCraft ee bogga: kooxaha, qaybaha, midabka, texture-yada wejiyada, tags iyo geesaha jilicsan ayaa soo gala. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#skp-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"skp-files\"\u003EQaababka faylka si faahfaahsan\u003C/a\u003E. ModelCraft ma kaydin karo \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E: si aad dib ugu noqoto, ModelCraft ka soo saar Collada oo ku soo dhoofi SketchUp.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ma-jiro-menu-ka-midig-riix\"\u003EMa jiro menu-ka midig-riix\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMidig-jiid wuxuu pan-gareeyaa; midig-guji ma sameeyo wax. Amarrada aad ku raadin lahayd menu-ka guji-midig waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse face\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExplode\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake unique\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake component\u003C/span\u003E) iyo kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrganize\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cutubyada-waxay-ku-jiraan-status-bar-ka\"\u003ECutubyada waxay ku jiraan status bar-ka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro Model Info ama doorashada template. Unit picker-ku wuxuu ku yaal hoose midig. Moodeel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa feet iyo inches Mareykanka, mm meelaha kale, iyadoo laga bilaabayo luuqadda browser-kaaga. Tobanaan jibbaaran had iyo jeer waxay leedahay dhibic, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m\u003C/code\u003E, halkii \u003Ccode\u003E2,5m\u003C/code\u003E, sababtoo ah koomaku had iyo jeer kala saaraa qiimayaasha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"rinjiga-wuxuu-leeyahay-alaabtiisa\"\u003ERinjiga wuxuu leeyahay alaabtiisa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu rinjiyaa midabyo adag iyo alaabta qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterials\u003C/span\u003E: dhagax-dhiig, siding, saqaf, alwaax, dhagax iyo wax ka badan, oo ModelCraft ayaa sawira. Weli ma soo rari kartid sawir aad leedahay sida alaab; tixraacyada ku imanaya faylalka la soo dhoofiyay way ilaalinayaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003ERinji midabbo iyo alaabta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"miisaanku-waa-siman-yahay-ma-leh-qabasho\"\u003EMiisaanku waa siman yahay, ma leh qabasho\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaanku ma muujiyo sanduuq leh qabasho. Guji barta ku sii taagan, oo ah barta tixraaca, kadibna cabbirka cusub ama factor aad qortay. Had iyo jeer wuu si siman u miisaaniyaa dhinacyada oo dhan. Si aad hal dhinac u fidiso, push/pull ama guuri wejiga, ama dib u qor ballaca, qotada ama joogta kooxda gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEntity info\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003Edib u cabbir cabbir\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wareeg-wuxuu-doortaa-diyaaradiisa-meesha-aad-guuto\"\u003EWareeg wuxuu doortaa diyaaradiisa meesha aad guuto\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro protractor ku dhegta wejiyada markaad fallaadhaha ku socodsiiso si aad diyaarad u doorato. Guji dhexda wejiga si aad u wareegto diyaaradda wejigaas, ama dhulka si aad u wareegto toosan. Fallaadhaha aragga ayaa wareegaya ka hor guji-ga koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ku-saabsanaanta-barta-aad-marisay\"\u003EKu-saabsanaanta barta aad marisay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu ku dhegaa jihooyinka tiirka laga bilaabo \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo barta, geesaha iyo wejiyada ku hoos mouse-ka. Ma raadiyo jihada barta aad kaliya ku dul marisay (khadka dhibcaha ah ee &quot;from point&quot;). Si aad u toosiso geesha fog, ku xidh tiirka fallaadhaha, oo ku dul geeskaas: barta xidhan ayaa u dhaqaaqda si ay u toosanto. Ama dhig \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/guides-measure\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/guides-measure\"\u003Ehage\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"parallel-wuxuu-isticmaalaa-geesta-aad-marisay-ka-hor-bilowga\"\u003EParallel wuxuu isticmaalaa geesta aad marisay ka hor bilowga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EParallel iyo perpendicular waxay isticmaalaan geesta ugu dambeysay ee mouse-ku gudbay \u003Cstrong\u003Eka hor guji-ga koowaad\u003C/strong\u003E, ma aha geesaha aad ku dul marayso intaad sawirayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference#parallel-and-perpendicular\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\" data-hash=\"parallel-and-perpendicular\"\u003EKu-saabsanaanta iyo dhegaysiga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nuqullada-kooxda-waa-isku-xidhan-yihiin\"\u003ENuqullada kooxda waa isku xidhan yihiin\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobiyeynta kooxda adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E waxay samaysaa meel kale oo isla kooxda, sidaas darteed tafatirka mid wuxuu beddelaa labadaba, sida qaybaha. SketchUp kooxaha wuu madax-bannaan yahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EXallinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"space-ma-pan-garayso\"\u003ESpace ma pan-garayso\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu doortaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, sida SketchUp. Web apps kale qaar Space la hayo way pan-garayaan; halkan ma sameeyo. Midig-jiid ayaa beddelkeeda pan-garaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"scroll-labo-farood-wuu-zoom-garayaa\"\u003EScroll labo-farood wuu zoom-garayaa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETrackpad-ka, deji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Scrolling oo ah Trackpad: labo farood wuu orbit-garaya, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo labo farood wuu pan-garayaa, pinch wuu zoom-garayaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#on-a-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"on-a-trackpad\"\u003EOrbit, pan iyo zoom\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii gacmahaagu furayaasha Blender-ka yaqaanaan halkii SketchUp, dooro habka menu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModeler\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay ku shaqeeyaan doorashada hal mar, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu soo saaraa (push/pull), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu nuqulaa, oo menu-ka sare (File, Edit, View, Select, Add, Object, Mesh) wuu bedelaa toolbar-ka. Haddii aad ka timid SketchUp, habka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush-pull\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa menu-bar la mid ah isla xarfaha qalabka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys iyo mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"jidhadka-isku-riixan-ma-gooyaan\"\u003EJidhadka isku riixan ma gooyaan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPush/pull wuxuu ku gooyaa wejiga ka dambeeya isla shay gudahiisa, laakiin laba jidh oo kala duwan oo isku riixan ma isku gudbaan. Ma jiro Intersect Faces ama Solid Tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-maqan\"\u003EWaxa maqan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFreehand, Trim, Split iyo Outer Shell, alaabta sawirka aad leedahay, extensions, iyo qalab layout-ka xaashiyaha ma jiraan dhismahan. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaagaabyada-browser-ku-haysto\"\u003EGaagaabyada browser-ku haysto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, sidaas darteed gaagaabyo yar oo browser-ka ah ayaa leh, ma aha app-ka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad browser ah (isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu xiraa tab-ka. Haddii aad isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jirto, browser-ku wuu weydiinayaa ka hor xidhitaanka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#shortcuts-the-browser-keeps\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"shortcuts-the-browser-keeps\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-ka iyo trackpad-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Haddii aad ku qaabeysay SketchUp, ModelCraft wuu ku noqon doonaa mid aad ku barataa: isla fikradda wejiyada iyo push/pull, isla xarfaha qalabka, sanduuq qiime ah oo aad ku qorto adigoo aan riixin, cabbir la yaqaan xagal oo casaan, cagaar iyo buluug ah, kooxaha, qaybaha, Outliner, Entity Info iyo goobaha. Bogganu wuxuu liistaa waxa si toos ah u wada socda, iyo waxa ka sii muhiimsan oo aan wada socon. Habitaadyo wada socda Waxaad caadi u tahay ModelCraft Riix Space si aad u doorato, L Xarriiq, R Afargeesle, C Goobo Isku mid: Space, L, R, C Riix P Push/Pull, M Guuri, Q Wareeji, S Miisaan, E Tirtiraha, T Tape Measure Isku mid: P, M, Q, S, E, T Riix O Orbit, H Pan, Z Zoom, Shift+Z Zoom Extents Isku mid: O, H, Z, Shift+Z Riix G si aad u samayso qayb Isku mid: G. Shift+G wuxuu samaynayaa kooxda Qor sanduuqa cabbirka adigoo aan riixin Isku mid, sanduuqa qiimaha ee hoose. Riix Enter Qor 4m,3m afar-geesle, 12s geesaha Isku mid Qor 3x ama /3 kadib Guuri koobiyo Isku mid; *3 sidoo kale waa shaqeysaa Qor [x,y,z] ama \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E barta ama kala-sooca Isku mid Qor lambar fudud moodeel inch-ka ah oo hel inches Isku mid Dhex-jiid si aad u orbit-garayso, Shift+dhex-jiid si aad u pan-garayso, wheel si aad zoom-ka u sameyso meesha cursor-ku joogo Isku mid Labo-guji Push/Pull si aad u ku celiso masaafada Isku mid Fallaadhaha si aad u xidho red, green, blue, iyo parallel Isku mid: → red, ← green, ↑ blue, ↓ parallel Shift hay si aad u xidho inference-ka Isku mid Ctrl (Option Mac-ka) si aad u koobiyeeyso markii aad guurinayso Ctrl, Ctrl ama Alt, kombuyuutar kasta Shift si aad u beddesho, Ctrl si aad u darto, Shift+Ctrl si aad uga saarto xulashada Isku furayaasha; Mac-ka isticmaal Ctrl meesha uu Ctrl yiri Daaqad bidix-midig, gudub midig-bidix Isku mid Qalabka Dimension si aad u calaamadayso dherer D, iyo wax ka badan: qor dherer cusub cabbirka moodeelka oo moodeelku wuu u cabbirmaa. Eeg Cabbir oo dib u cabbir Labo-guji wejiga si aad u hesho wejiga iyo geesaha; saddex-guji si aad u hesho dhammaan kuwa isku xidhan Isku mid Labo-guji kooxda si aad u tafatirto; Esc si aad u xirto Isku mid Khad ku jiid wejiga si aad u kala qaybiso; geesta u dhaxaysa wejiyada isku diyaar ah tirtir si aad u isku xidho Isku mid Jiid afar-geeska daaqadda ee darbiga dhex mari si aad u jarto Isku mid Wejiyada dib-buluug-xagaasha; Reverse Faces Isku midabka; Reverse face gudaha Entity info Goobaha sidii tabsyo aragga dul ah, Page Up iyo Page Down Isku mid, iyo Play panel-ka Scenes Hiyaaradda taariikhda, waqtiga, latitude iyo longitude, woqooyiga cagaar Isku mid, panel-ka Style Farqiyo ku qaldiya dadka Kaydintu waa soo dejin Ma jiro Save oo dib u qoraysa faylka aad furtay, ma jiro Save As oo leh magac, ma jiro autosave, ma jiro fayl backup ah. Save (Ctrl+S) wuxuu mar kasta soo dejiyaa fayl .modelcraft cusub, badanaa folder-ka downloads-kaaga. Badanaa kaydi, oo magacee ama u rarr faylalka adigu. Eeg Fur, kaydi, soo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Wuu soo dhoofiyaa faylalka .skp, laakiin ma kaydiyo Import wuxuu akhrinayaa faylalka SketchUp adigoo isticmaalaya akhriyaha ModelCraft ee bogga: kooxaha, qaybaha, midabka, texture-yada wejiyada, tags iyo geesaha jilicsan ayaa soo gala. Eeg Qaababka faylka si faahfaahsan. ModelCraft ma kaydin karo .skp: si aad dib ugu noqoto, ModelCraft ka soo saar Collada oo ku soo dhoofi SketchUp. Ma jiro menu-ka midig-riix Midig-jiid wuxuu pan-gareeyaa; midig-guji ma sameeyo wax. Amarrada aad ku raadin lahayd menu-ka guji-midig waxay ku jiraan Entity info (Reverse face, Edit, Explode, Make unique, Make component) iyo kooxda Organize ee toolbar-ka. Cutubyada waxay ku jiraan status bar-ka Ma jiro Model Info ama doorashada template. Unit picker-ku wuxuu ku yaal hoose midig. Moodeel cusub wuxuu ku bilaabmaa feet iyo inches Mareykanka, mm meelaha kale, iyadoo laga bilaabayo luuqadda browser-kaaga. Tobanaan jibbaaran had iyo jeer waxay leedahay dhibic, 2.5m, halkii 2,5m, sababtoo ah koomaku had iyo jeer kala saaraa qiimayaasha. Rinjiga wuxuu leeyahay alaabtiisa Paint (B) wuxuu rinjiyaa midabyo adag iyo alaabta qaybta Materials: dhagax-dhiig, siding, saqaf, alwaax, dhagax iyo wax ka badan, oo ModelCraft ayaa sawira. Weli ma soo rari kartid sawir aad leedahay sida alaab; tixraacyada ku imanaya faylalka la soo dhoofiyay way ilaalinayaan. Eeg Rinji midabbo iyo alaabta. Miisaanku waa siman yahay, ma leh qabasho Miisaanku ma muujiyo sanduuq leh qabasho. Guji barta ku sii taagan, oo ah barta tixraaca, kadibna cabbirka cusub ama factor aad qortay. Had iyo jeer wuu si siman u miisaaniyaa dhinacyada oo dhan. Si aad hal dhinac u fidiso, push/pull ama guuri wejiga, ama dib u qor ballaca, qotada ama joogta kooxda gudaha Entity info, ama dib u cabbir cabbir. Wareeg wuxuu doortaa diyaaradiisa meesha aad guuto Ma jiro protractor ku dhegta wejiyada markaad fallaadhaha ku socodsiiso si aad diyaarad u doorato. Guji dhexda wejiga si aad u wareegto diyaaradda wejigaas, ama dhulka si aad u wareegto toosan. Fallaadhaha aragga ayaa wareegaya ka hor guji-ga koowaad. Ku-saabsanaanta barta aad marisay ModelCraft wuxuu ku dhegaa jihooyinka tiirka laga bilaabo barta bilowga, iyo barta, geesaha iyo wejiyada ku hoos mouse-ka. Ma raadiyo jihada barta aad kaliya ku dul marisay (khadka dhibcaha ah ee \"from point\"). Si aad u toosiso geesha fog, ku xidh tiirka fallaadhaha, oo ku dul geeskaas: barta xidhan ayaa u dhaqaaqda si ay u toosanto. Ama dhig hage. Parallel wuxuu isticmaalaa geesta aad marisay ka hor bilowga Parallel iyo perpendicular waxay isticmaalaan geesta ugu dambeysay ee mouse-ku gudbay ka hor guji-ga koowaad, ma aha geesaha aad ku dul marayso intaad sawirayso. Eeg Ku-saabsanaanta iyo dhegaysiga. Nuqullada kooxda waa isku xidhan yihiin Koobiyeynta kooxda adigoo isticmaalaya Move waxay samaysaa meel kale oo isla kooxda, sidaas darteed tafatirka mid wuxuu beddelaa labadaba, sida qaybaha. SketchUp kooxaha wuu madax-bannaan yahay. Eeg Xallinta dhibaatada. Space ma pan-garayso Space wuxuu doortaa Select, sida SketchUp. Web apps kale qaar Space la hayo way pan-garayaan; halkan ma sameeyo. Midig-jiid ayaa beddelkeeda pan-garaya. Scroll labo-farood wuu zoom-garayaa Trackpad-ka, deji Settings › ModelCraft › Scrolling oo ah Trackpad: labo farood wuu orbit-garaya, Shift iyo labo farood wuu pan-garayaa, pinch wuu zoom-garayaa. Eeg Orbit, pan iyo zoom. Haddii gacmahaagu furayaasha Blender-ka yaqaanaan halkii SketchUp, dooro habka menu-ka Modeler: G, R iyo S waxay ku shaqeeyaan doorashada hal mar, E wuu soo saaraa (push/pull), Shift+D wuu nuqulaa, oo menu-ka sare (File, Edit, View, Select, Add, Object, Mesh) wuu bedelaa toolbar-ka. Haddii aad ka timid SketchUp, habka Push-pull wuxuu siinayaa menu-bar la mid ah isla xarfaha qalabka. Eeg Menus, keys iyo mouse. Jidhadka isku riixan ma gooyaan Push/pull wuxuu ku gooyaa wejiga ka dambeeya isla shay gudahiisa, laakiin laba jidh oo kala duwan oo isku riixan ma isku gudbaan. Ma jiro Intersect Faces ama Solid Tools. Waxa maqan Freehand, Trim, Split iyo Outer Shell, alaabta sawirka aad leedahay, extensions, iyo qalab layout-ka xaashiyaha ma jiraan dhismahan. Weli lama dhisin wuxuu liistaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda. Gaagaabyada browser-ku haysto ModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, sidaas darteed gaagaabyo yar oo browser-ka ah ayaa leh, ma aha app-ka. Ctrl+N wuxuu furaa daaqad browser ah (isticmaal New), Ctrl+W wuxuu xiraa tab-ka. Haddii aad isbeddel aan la kaydin ku jirto, browser-ku wuu weydiinayaa ka hor xidhitaanka. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-ka iyo trackpad-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Dejinta ModelCraft","summary":"Dooro qaabka furayaasha aad taqanno, samee trackpad-ku uu wareego oo uu muuqaal u guuro iyada oo aan badhamada kamarada la isticmaalin, oo shid ama demi ku xidhidhka iyo isku dhaca jirdilka.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["dejin","doorashooyin","xakamaynta","qaabka furayaasha","khariidadda furayaasha","gaabinta","blender","trackpad","touchpad","scroll","orbit","pinch","ku xidh","snapping","collide","isku dhac","overlap","intersect","dhex mari"],"headings":[{"id":"xakamaynta-furayaasha-iyo-batoonada","text":"Xakamaynta: furayaasha iyo batoonada","level":2},{"id":"jiidista-tirada-mouse-ka-ama-trackpad-ka","text":"Jiidista: tirada mouse-ka ama trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"ku-xidhidhka","text":"Ku xidhidhka","level":2},{"id":"jirdilku-wuu-istaagaa-meesha-uu-taabto","text":"Jirdilku wuu istaagaa meesha uu taabto","level":2},{"id":"saxanka-daabacaha-3d","text":"Saxanka daabacaha 3D","level":2},{"id":"orbit-iyo-pan","text":"Orbit iyo pan","level":2},{"id":"calaamadda-geeska","text":"Calaamadda geeska","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E adigoo riixaya giirka ku yaal bar-ka barnaamijka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tab-ka ugu horreeya, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu haystaa dejinta barnaamijkan leeyahay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu haystaa kuwa dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft wadaagaan (mawduuca, qalabka, daaqadaha). Dejinta ModelCraft waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xusaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xakamaynta-furayaasha-iyo-batoonada\"\u003EXakamaynta: furayaasha iyo batoonada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba qaab oo furayaasha ah. Halkan ka beddel, ama adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha: Riix-jiid\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha: Moodelka\u003C/span\u003E hoose midig ee muuqaalka, ama dhamaadka menu-ga qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka Riix-jiid\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga; xarfaha moodeelada riix-jiid sida SketchUp): xaraf ayaa doorta qalab: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xariiq, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E afar-geesle, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E riix/jiid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E guuri, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wareeji, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E miisaan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E samee qayb. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo falalka mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka Moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E (furayaasha moodeelada mesh sida Blender): marka hore dooro, kadibna isla markiiba ku falee wax la doortay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu guuraa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu wareejiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu miisaamaa meesha mouse-ku joogo — ma jiro riix koowaad. Intii uu guuraayo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qufulaa dhidibka casaan, cagaar ama buluug, lambar la qoro wuxuu dejiyaa masaafada (ama darajooyinka, ama xaddiga), riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dhigaa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama midig-riix wuxuu soo celiyaa. Kadib waxaad dib ugu noqotaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka furayaasha waa isla doorashada qaabka menu-ga: qaabka Moodeelka waa qaabka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E, iyo midka aad doorato ayaa doorta kan kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E. Liiska buuxa ee Moodeelka wuxuu ku jiraa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard#modeler-keys\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"modeler-keys\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo falalka mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E. Tooltips-ka qalabka iyo kaarka bilowga waxay raacaan qaabka aad doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiidista-tirada-mouse-ka-ama-trackpad-ka\"\u003EJiidista: tirada mouse-ka ama trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOgow (bilowga)\u003C/strong\u003E: ModelCraft wuu eegaa jiidista. Jiidis jaanibka ama mid yar-yar, sida uu trackpad-ku diro, wuu wareegaa; tirooyinka tirada oo dhan ayaa weynaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirada mouse-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: jiidista had iyo jeer wuxuu u weynaysiinayaa mouse-ka dhinaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E: ku sawir labo farood si aad u wareegto, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo sawir si aad u guurto, ku qabo pinch si aad u weynaysiso. Weligaa uma baahnid badhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPinch wuxuu weynaysiiyaa doorasho kasta. Haddii &quot;Ogow&quot; uu khaldo mouse-kaaga ama trackpad-kaaga, dooro midka aad haysato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka Moodeelka waxaad sidoo kale ku wareegi kartaa adigoo hayaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiidaya, iyo guuri adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option Shift\"\u003E⌥⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+Shift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo jiid — waa faa&#039;iido laptop aan badhanka dhexe lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xidhidhka\"\u003EKu xidhidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xidh barta, geesaha iyo jihooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E (oo furan bilowga) wuxuu jiidaa mouse-ka dhamaadyada, dhexdhexaadka, geesaha, hagayaasha iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug — eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/inference\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/inference\"\u003EInference\u003C/a\u003E. Demi markaad rabto inaad wax si xor ah ugu dhigto u dhow geometry kale oo aan u boodin. Dhinacyada, dhulka iyo qufulka jihooyinka waxay weli shaqeeyaan iyada oo ku xidhidhka la damiyey.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu xidh\u003C/span\u003E ee midig-hoose ee muuqaalka wuxuu sameeyaa isla waxa shaqadan; waa la kaydiyaa. Qaabka Moodeelka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddelaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jirdilku-wuu-istaagaa-meesha-uu-taabto\"\u003EJirdilku wuu istaagaa meesha uu taabto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJirdilka istaag meesha ay taabtaan\u003C/strong\u003E (oo furan bilowga) wuxuu ilaaliyaa derbi in la jiido oo lagu galo derbi kale. Markii aad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E (iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, iyo koobiyee-kadib-guuri \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) doorashada waxay u dhaqaaqaa jirdilka kale ilaa ay taabato oo ay istaato; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E dhinacu wuxuu istaagaa markuu la kulmo jirdil kale. Korka ku nasashada wax iyo kor ugu jiidista waa ku fiican yihiin — gudaha oo keliya ayaa la joojiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad waxyaabo ugu riixdo si ula kac ah, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dhac\u003C/span\u003E midig-hoose (ama ka saar dejinta), samee guuritaanka, kadibna mar kale guji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku dhacyada waxaa loo hubiyaa guuritaanka iyo riix/jiid oo keliya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E weli ma hubiyaan, geometry aan kooxda ku jirin oo taabta weli wuu isku xidhaa sida mar walba: ku hay qaybaha kala duwan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/groups-components\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/groups-components\"\u003Ekooxaha\u003C/a\u003E si ay kala go&#039;an yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saxanka-daabacaha-3d\"\u003ESaxanka daabacaha 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabirka saxanka daabacahaaga: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama dejin\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga), 180 × 180 × 180, 220 × 220 × 250, 256 × 256 × 256 ama 300 × 300 × 400 mm. Dooro cabirka u dhow mugga dhismaha daabacahaaga. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E ayaa markaas sheegaysa marka moodeelku ka weyn yahay saxanka; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama dejin\u003C/span\u003E ahaan, cabirka lama hubinayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"orbit-iyo-pan\"\u003EOrbit iyo pan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOrbit ku wareeji wax ka hooseeya cursor-ka\u003C/strong\u003E (oo furan bilowga): orbit wuxuu ku wareegaa qaybta moodeelka ee ku hoos jirta mouse-ka, pan wuxuu hayaa barta hoos mouse-ka; meel banaan labaduba waxay isticmaalaan dhexda muuqaalka. Demi si aad had iyo jeer ugu wareegto dhexda muuqaalka. \u003Cstrong\u003EXawaaraha orbit\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXawaaraha pan\u003C/strong\u003E waxay u dhaxeeyaan 0.25× ilaa 3× (1× waa bilowga) waxayna raacaan mouse-ka, trackpad-ka, taabashada iyo furayaasha fallaadhaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EOrbit, pan iyo zoom\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadda-geeska\"\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku muuqda geeska muuqaalka 3D: \u003Cstrong\u003EKaabka muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga; midig-sare — guji dhinac, geeso ama geeso si aad uga eegto meeshaas, jiid si aad u orbit-garto, jiid giraanta compass-ka si aad moodeelka u wareejiso), \u003Cstrong\u003EAstaanta dhidibka\u003C/strong\u003E (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah hoose bidix oo u wareegta muuqaalka: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMidna\u003C/strong\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/view-cube\"\u003EKaabka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur Dejinta adigoo riixaya giirka ku yaal bar-ka barnaamijka ama Ctrl+,. Tab-ka ugu horreeya, ModelCraft, wuxuu haystaa dejinta barnaamijkan leeyahay; Guud wuxuu haystaa kuwa dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft wadaagaan (mawduuca, qalabka, daaqadaha). Dejinta ModelCraft waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xusaa. Xakamaynta: furayaasha iyo batoonada Laba qaab oo furayaasha ah. Halkan ka beddel, ama adigoo isticmaalaya Furayaasha: Riix-jiid / Furayaasha: Moodelka hoose midig ee muuqaalka, ama dhamaadka menu-ga qalabka Dheeraad: Qaabka Riix-jiid (bilowga; xarfaha moodeelada riix-jiid sida SketchUp): xaraf ayaa doorta qalab: L xariiq, R afar-geesle, P riix/jiid, M guuri, Q wareeji, S miisaan, G samee qayb. Eeg Furayaasha iyo falalka mouse-ka. Qaabka Moodeelka (furayaasha moodeelada mesh sida Blender): marka hore dooro, kadibna isla markiiba ku falee wax la doortay. G wuu guuraa, R wuu wareejiyaa, S wuu miisaamaa meesha mouse-ku joogo — ma jiro riix koowaad. Intii uu guuraayo, X, Y ama Z wuxuu qufulaa dhidibka casaan, cagaar ama buluug, lambar la qoro wuxuu dejiyaa masaafada (ama darajooyinka, ama xaddiga), riix ama Enter wuxuu dhigaa; Esc ama midig-riix wuxuu soo celiyaa. Kadib waxaad dib ugu noqotaa Dooro. Qaabka furayaasha waa isla doorashada qaabka menu-ga: qaabka Moodeelka waa qaabka menu-ga Moodeelar, iyo midka aad doorato ayaa doorta kan kale. Eeg Menus, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Liiska buuxa ee Moodeelka wuxuu ku jiraa Furayaasha iyo falalka mouse-ka. Tooltips-ka qalabka iyo kaarka bilowga waxay raacaan qaabka aad doorato. Jiidista: tirada mouse-ka ama trackpad-ka Ogow (bilowga): ModelCraft wuu eegaa jiidista. Jiidis jaanibka ama mid yar-yar, sida uu trackpad-ku diro, wuu wareegaa; tirooyinka tirada oo dhan ayaa weynaysa. Tirada mouse-ka: jiidista had iyo jeer wuxuu u weynaysiinayaa mouse-ka dhinaca. Trackpad: ku sawir labo farood si aad u wareegto, hay Shift oo sawir si aad u guurto, ku qabo pinch si aad u weynaysiso. Weligaa uma baahnid badhamada Wareeg, Muuqaalka guuri ama Weynee. Pinch wuxuu weynaysiiyaa doorasho kasta. Haddii \"Ogow\" uu khaldo mouse-kaaga ama trackpad-kaaga, dooro midka aad haysato. Qaabka Moodeelka waxaad sidoo kale ku wareegi kartaa adigoo hayaa Alt oo jiidaya, iyo guuri adigoo isticmaalaya Alt+Shift iyo jiid — waa faa'iido laptop aan badhanka dhexe lahayn. Ku xidhidhka Ku xidh barta, geesaha iyo jihooyinka (oo furan bilowga) wuxuu jiidaa mouse-ka dhamaadyada, dhexdhexaadka, geesaha, hagayaasha iyo jihooyinka casaan, cagaar iyo buluug — eeg Inference. Demi markaad rabto inaad wax si xor ah ugu dhigto u dhow geometry kale oo aan u boodin. Dhinacyada, dhulka iyo qufulka jihooyinka waxay weli shaqeeyaan iyada oo ku xidhidhka la damiyey. Badhanka Ku xidh ee midig-hoose ee muuqaalka wuxuu sameeyaa isla waxa shaqadan; waa la kaydiyaa. Qaabka Moodeelka, Shift+Tab ayaa beddelaa. Jirdilku wuu istaagaa meesha uu taabto Jirdilka istaag meesha ay taabtaan (oo furan bilowga) wuxuu ilaaliyaa derbi in la jiido oo lagu galo derbi kale. Markii aad Guuri (iyo G, iyo koobiyee-kadib-guuri Ctrl+D) doorashada waxay u dhaqaaqaa jirdilka kale ilaa ay taabato oo ay istaato; Riix/jiid dhinacu wuxuu istaagaa markuu la kulmo jirdil kale. Korka ku nasashada wax iyo kor ugu jiidista waa ku fiican yihiin — gudaha oo keliya ayaa la joojiyaa. Si aad waxyaabo ugu riixdo si ula kac ah, guji Isku dhac midig-hoose (ama ka saar dejinta), samee guuritaanka, kadibna mar kale guji. Isku dhacyada waxaa loo hubiyaa guuritaanka iyo riix/jiid oo keliya. Wareeji iyo Miisaan weli ma hubiyaan, geometry aan kooxda ku jirin oo taabta weli wuu isku xidhaa sida mar walba: ku hay qaybaha kala duwan kooxaha si ay kala go'an yihiin. Saxanka daabacaha 3D Cabirka saxanka daabacahaaga: Lama dejin (bilowga), 180 × 180 × 180, 220 × 220 × 250, 256 × 256 × 256 ama 300 × 300 × 400 mm. Dooro cabirka u dhow mugga dhismaha daabacahaaga. Hubi daabacaadda 3D ayaa markaas sheegaysa marka moodeelku ka weyn yahay saxanka; Lama dejin ahaan, cabirka lama hubinayo. Orbit iyo pan Orbit ku wareeji wax ka hooseeya cursor-ka (oo furan bilowga): orbit wuxuu ku wareegaa qaybta moodeelka ee ku hoos jirta mouse-ka, pan wuxuu hayaa barta hoos mouse-ka; meel banaan labaduba waxay isticmaalaan dhexda muuqaalka. Demi si aad had iyo jeer ugu wareegto dhexda muuqaalka. Xawaaraha orbit iyo Xawaaraha pan waxay u dhaxeeyaan 0.25× ilaa 3× (1× waa bilowga) waxayna raacaan mouse-ka, trackpad-ka, taabashada iyo furayaasha fallaadhaha. Eeg Orbit, pan iyo zoom. Calaamadda geeska Waxa ku muuqda geeska muuqaalka 3D: Kaabka muuqaalka (bilowga; midig-sare — guji dhinac, geeso ama geeso si aad uga eegto meeshaas, jiid si aad u orbit-garto, jiid giraanta compass-ka si aad moodeelka u wareejiso), Astaanta dhidibka (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah hoose bidix oo u wareegta muuqaalka: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama Midna. Eeg Kaabka muuqaalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dooro qaab menu ah oo la mid ah moodeelka aad hore u taqaanno, ku sii fur kasta amar furaha aad rabto, u rar amarada menyuyaasha kale, oo dejinta wheel-ka iyo badhamada mouse-ka dhexe iyo midig.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["qaabka menu-ka","menyuyaasha","bar-ka menu-ka","toolbar","gaabinta furayaasha","hotkeys","furayaasha","qaabka furaha","keymap","habayn","dib u fur","mouse","wheel","rogid","jihada zoom-ka","badhanka dhexe","badhanka midig","orbit","pan","export","import","beddelid","la yaqaan","riix-jiid","moodeelar"],"headings":[{"id":"qaababka","text":"Qaababka","level":2},{"id":"u-samee-sidaad-rabto","text":"U samee sidaad rabto","level":2},{"id":"mouse","text":"Mouse","level":2},{"id":"qaado-wax-kasta","text":"Qaado wax kasta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabyada ModelCraft waa isku mid siduu u helo sida aad ugu gaadho. \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka menu-ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa meesha ay ku taagan yihiin shaashadda, sida ay ugu magacdaranyihiin halkaas, iyo furayaasha ay shaqeeyaan. Dooro gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E; isbeddelku isla markiiba ayuu dhacaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka\"\u003EQaababka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka ModelCraft-ka (Fayl, Sawir, Wax ka beddel, Habee, Tafatir, Kamarad) iyo furayaasha hal xaraf ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xarriiq, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E afar-geesle, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E riix-jiid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E guuri, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wareeji, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E miisaan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tirtiraha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wareeg. Bilowga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix-jiid\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar menu (Fayl, Tafatir, Muuqaal, Kamarad, Sawir, Qalab, Daaqad) oo ku dul taal safka qalabyada ugu waaweyn, oo leh furayaasha hal xaraf ah ee isku mid ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar menu oo madax ah (Fayl, Tafatir, Muuqaal, Dooro, Ku dar, Walax, Mesh) iyo furayaasha moodeelayaasha mesh-ka: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dooro, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qabo, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wareeji iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E miisaan dooran oo isku mar ah (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa qufulaya hal dhinac intuu socdo), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E riix-jiid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E afar-geesle, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tirtir, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dooro dhammaan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E midna, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E koobiyee, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command G\"\u003E⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E koox, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qari. Badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa u pan-kaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe zoom-kaa; badhanka midig wuxuu joojiyaa wixii qalabku sameynayo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilowga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERibbon oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee\u003C/span\u003E tab-kiisu yahay badhamo weyn oo yar: qaabab la dhigo, god-yo, guuri, wareeji iyo cabbir, isu-hagaaji, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E (godyada lagu jaro qaababta) iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D; qalab kasta oo kale oo ku jira tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalab dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E. Badhanka midig wuu wareegaa, badhanka dhexe wuu pan-kaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/beginner\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/beginner\"\u003EQaabka Bilowga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha qaabka aad ka yaqaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha\u003C/span\u003E geeska hoose ee midig ee muuqaalka iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETafatir\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDheeraad\u003C/span\u003E waa isla doorasho: marka aad dooratid furayaasha moodeelka, waxay dooranaysaa qaabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E; dooridda furayaasha riix-jiid waxay ka tagaysaa qaabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii nooca hore aad dooratay furayaasha moodeelka, ModelCraft wuxuu mar keliya ku furmi doonaa qaabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E, isagoo keligiis ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFure kasta oo ka tirsan furayaasha riix-jiid laakiin qaabkaagu amar kale siiyay, wax ma sameyso, sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa halka amarkeedu u gudbay (&quot;Moodeelar gudaha, Riix-jiid waa E&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo falaarahu had iyo jeer waxa ay ahaayeen waxa ay yihiin, lambarada had iyo jeer waxay tagaan sanduuqa qiimaha, qalabna markuu wax dhaqaajinayo furayaashiisa ayaa ku guuleysta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-samee-sidaad-rabto\"\u003EU samee sidaad rabto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabayn…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo menyuyaasha\u003C/span\u003E, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar fur\u003C/span\u003E oo riix furaha. Guji fur si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBar menu-ga, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeesha ay ku taal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu amarka u raraa menu kale, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFurayaasha oo keliya\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, deji wheel-ka iyo waxa badhamadu ku sameeyaan muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu bixi magac oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta qaab dhismay wuxuu sameeyaa koobiga gaarka ah (&quot;Moodeelkayga&quot;); qaabka dhismay ah ma beddelmo. Koobigaaga wuxuu akhrinayaa furayaasha sida qaabka uu ka bilaabay: mid laga sameeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa furayaasha qabo, wareeji iyo miisaan oo isku mar shaqeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse\"\u003EMouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWheel-ka mouse-ka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sida ay u degdegto. Pinch-ka trackpad-ka had iyo jeer wuxuu zoom-kaa sida farahaagu u dhaqaaqayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid muuqaalka 3D gudihiisa\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal kasta oo gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa badhamada ModelCraft (badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa, badhanka midig ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa pan-kaa). Ama dheji badhanka dhexe iyo midig inay wareegaan, pan-kaan, zoom-kaan ama waxba ha samaynin; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaa wareegga iyo pan-ka. Badhanka bidix wuxuu had iyo jeer u tirsanaadaa qalabka la isticmaalayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad-yada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJiidista\u003C/span\u003E weli wuxuu go&#039;aamiyaa in laba farood ay wareegaan (trackpad) ama zoom-gaan (mouse). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EWareeg, pan iyo zoom\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaado-wax-kasta\"\u003EQaado wax kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi…\u003C/span\u003E wuu ku daraa mid, oo laga keenay kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo dhoofiyay wuxuu tilmaami karaa amarada ModelCraft-ka oo kaliya: wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebayaa, wayna ku tiirsan yihiin sadarka xaaladda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir qaabkan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal qaabkan app kasta\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal kaararka qaabka ayaa ka dhigaya app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabkiisa la mid ah: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix-jiid\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu la socdaa qaababka bar-menu-ka ee app-yada kale. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoodeelar\u003C/span\u003E ma leh nidaam la mid ah app-yada kale, sidaas darteed wuxuu ahaan doonaa doorasho ModelCraft oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELa xidhiidha: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo falka mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa imow moodeeleyaasha kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qalabyada ModelCraft waa isku mid siduu u helo sida aad ugu gaadho. Qaabka menu-ka wuxuu go'aamiyaa meesha ay ku taagan yihiin shaashadda, sida ay ugu magacdaranyihiin halkaas, iyo furayaasha ay shaqeeyaan. Dooro gudaha Dejinta (Ctrl+,) › ModelCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka; isbeddelku isla markiiba ayuu dhacaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. Qaababka Qaabka Waxa aad hesho ModelCraft Qalabka ModelCraft-ka (Fayl, Sawir, Wax ka beddel, Habee, Tafatir, Kamarad) iyo furayaasha hal xaraf ah: L xarriiq, R afar-geesle, P riix-jiid, M guuri, Q wareeji, S miisaan, E tirtiraha, O wareeg. Bilowga. Riix-jiid Bar menu (Fayl, Tafatir, Muuqaal, Kamarad, Sawir, Qalab, Daaqad) oo ku dul taal safka qalabyada ugu waaweyn, oo leh furayaasha hal xaraf ah ee isku mid ah. Moodeelar Bar menu oo madax ah (Fayl, Tafatir, Muuqaal, Dooro, Ku dar, Walax, Mesh) iyo furayaasha moodeelayaasha mesh-ka: W dooro, G qabo, R wareeji iyo S miisaan dooran oo isku mar ah (X, Y ama Z ayaa qufulaya hal dhinac intuu socdo), E riix-jiid, B afar-geesle, X tirtir, A dooro dhammaan, Alt+A midna, Shift+D koobiyee, Ctrl+G koox, H qari. Badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa; Shift iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa u pan-kaa, Ctrl iyo badhanka dhexe zoom-kaa; badhanka midig wuxuu joojiyaa wixii qalabku sameynayo. Bilowga Ribbon oo Samee tab-kiisu yahay badhamo weyn oo yar: qaabab la dhigo, god-yo, guuri, wareeji iyo cabbir, isu-hagaaji, Koox (godyada lagu jaro qaababta) iyo hubinta daabacaadda 3D; qalab kasta oo kale oo ku jira tab-ka Qalab dheeraad ah. Badhanka midig wuu wareegaa, badhanka dhexe wuu pan-kaa. Eeg Qaabka Bilowga. Furayaasha qaabka aad ka yaqaan Furayaasha geeska hoose ee midig ee muuqaalka iyo Tafatir › Dheeraad waa isla doorasho: marka aad dooratid furayaasha moodeelka, waxay dooranaysaa qaabka Moodeelar; dooridda furayaasha riix-jiid waxay ka tagaysaa qaabka ModelCraft. Haddii nooca hore aad dooratay furayaasha moodeelka, ModelCraft wuxuu mar keliya ku furmi doonaa qaabka Moodeelar, isagoo keligiis ah. Fure kasta oo ka tirsan furayaasha riix-jiid laakiin qaabkaagu amar kale siiyay, wax ma sameyso, sadarka xaaladdu wuxuu sheegayaa halka amarkeedu u gudbay (\"Moodeelar gudaha, Riix-jiid waa E\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space iyo falaarahu had iyo jeer waxa ay ahaayeen waxa ay yihiin, lambarada had iyo jeer waxay tagaan sanduuqa qiimaha, qalabna markuu wax dhaqaajinayo furayaashiisa ayaa ku guuleysta. U samee sidaad rabto Dooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji Habayn…. Gudaha Furayaasha iyo menyuyaasha, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). Ku dar fur oo riix furaha. Guji fur si aad uga saarto. Bar menu-ga, Meesha ay ku taal wuxuu amarka u raraa menu kale, ama Furayaasha oo keliya. Gudaha Mouse, deji wheel-ka iyo waxa badhamadu ku sameeyaan muuqaalka 3D. Ku bixi magac oo guji Kaydi. Kaydinta qaab dhismay wuxuu sameeyaa koobiga gaarka ah (\"Moodeelkayga\"); qaabka dhismay ah ma beddelmo. Koobigaaga wuxuu akhrinayaa furayaasha sida qaabka uu ka bilaabay: mid laga sameeyay Moodeelar wuxuu hayaa furayaasha qabo, wareeji iyo miisaan oo isku mar shaqeeya. Mouse Wheel-ka mouse-ka: Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu weynayaa (bilowga) ama Shubis kor u sii weynee wuxuu yareeyaa, iyo sida ay u degdegto. Pinch-ka trackpad-ka had iyo jeer wuxuu zoom-kaa sida farahaagu u dhaqaaqayo. Jiid muuqaalka 3D gudihiisa: Muuqaal kasta oo gaar ah wuxuu hayaa badhamada ModelCraft (badhanka dhexe wuu wareegaa, badhanka midig ama Shift iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa pan-kaa). Ama dheji badhanka dhexe iyo midig inay wareegaan, pan-kaan, zoom-kaan ama waxba ha samaynin; Shift oo leh badhanka ayaa beddelaa wareegga iyo pan-ka. Badhanka bidix wuxuu had iyo jeer u tirsanaadaa qalabka la isticmaalayo. Trackpad-yada: Dejinta › ModelCraft › Jiidista weli wuxuu go'aamiyaa in laba farood ay wareegaan (trackpad) ama zoom-gaan (mouse). Eeg Wareeg, pan iyo zoom. Qaado wax kasta Soo saar wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo .ccinput.json ah; Soo dhoofi… wuu ku daraa mid, oo laga keenay kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo dhoofiyay wuxuu tilmaami karaa amarada ModelCraft-ka oo kaliya: wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebayaa, wayna ku tiirsan yihiin sadarka xaaladda. Tirtir qaabkan wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay. Dejintan waxay ku sii jiraan browser-kan. Isticmaal qaabkan app kasta oo ku yaal kaararka qaabka ayaa ka dhigaya app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabkiisa la mid ah: Riix-jiid wuxuu la socdaa qaababka bar-menu-ka ee app-yada kale. Moodeelar ma leh nidaam la mid ah app-yada kale, sidaas darteed wuxuu ahaan doonaa doorasho ModelCraft oo keliya. La xidhiidha: Furayaasha iyo falka mouse-ka · Dejinta ModelCraft · Ka imow moodeeleyaasha kale","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Furayaasha iyo ficillada jiirka","summary":"Furayaasha gaaban ee ModelCraft oo dhan, ficillada jiirka, gesture-yada trackpad-ka iyo taabashada, oo loo kala saaray waxa ay sameeyaan.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["kiboodhka","gaabinta","furayaasha","furayaasha degdega","jiirka","trackpad","taabasho","gestures","xaashida gaaban","ctrl","command","furayaasha fallaadha"],"headings":[{"id":"qalabyada","text":"Qalabyada","level":2},{"id":"moodelka-iyo-faylka","text":"Moodelka iyo faylka","level":2},{"id":"esc","text":"Esc","level":2},{"id":"inta-qalabku-shaqeynayo","text":"Inta qalabku shaqeynayo","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-fallaadha-waqtiyada-kale","text":"Furayaasha fallaadha waqtiyada kale","level":2},{"id":"jiirka","text":"Jiirka","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-modeler","text":"Furayaasha Modeler","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-taabasho","text":"Shaashad taabasho","level":2},{"id":"meesha-ay-move-ku-jirto","text":"Meesha ay Move ku jirto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa furayaasha riix-jiid, kuwa ModelCraft ku bilaabo. Nooca kale, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/keyboard#modeler-keys\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/keyboard\" data-hash=\"modeler-keys\"\u003EFurayaasha Modeler\u003C/a\u003E hoose iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaabintu waxay shaqeysaa marka muuqaalka 3D ama badhanka qalabka uu xoogga ku leeyahay. Haddii aad hadda ku qortay goob panel ama aad beddelday liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStyle\u003C/span\u003E, guji muuqaalka 3D marka hore, si furayaasha uusan u tagin goobtaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, jiirarka iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E si aad u aragto sida furayaasha loo qoro kombiyuutar kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabyada\"\u003EQalabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaint\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E qiyaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha qalabku waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya bila furayaasha kale: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo xaraf la socda ma sameynayo wax, marka laga reebo labada hoose.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodelka-iyo-faylka\"\u003EMoodelka iyo faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee qayb doorashada ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee koox doorashada ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee dhammaan (moodelka oo dhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi (wuxuu soo dejiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur moodel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wax kasta (kooxda furan, haddii mid furan yahay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJar doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji: nuqulka wuu raacaa mawshaarka, guji meesha uu tago\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji isla meesha (meeshii laga koobiyeeyay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul: nuqul ayaa mawshaarka la socda, guji si aad u dhigto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAragtida xigta / ta hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ama xir caawimaadan (sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E app bar-ka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E gudaha caawimaadda ayaa xirta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka shaashadda: shaashad buuxa, kadibna qalabka qarsoon, kadibna caadi (Control sidoo kale Mac-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka baxaa hal heer mar kasta oo aad riixdo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJoojinta wixii qalabku ku jiro (xariiq la rinjiyeynayo, riix/jiid, guuri). Wax kasta waa dib loo celiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu u beddelaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu xirayaa kooxda aad tafatirayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu sidoo kale joojiyaa aragtiyada la ciyaarayo. Sanduuqa qiimaha gudihiisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa wixii aad qortay, kadibna wuxuu kuu celinayaa aragtida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"inta-qalabku-shaqeynayo\"\u003EInta qalabku shaqeynayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro, ama mid ka mid ah \u003Ccode\u003E. , - &#039; &quot; [ &lt; * /\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu bilaabaa qorista sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dabaqaa wixii aad qortay sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha casaan (mar kale riix si aad u furto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha cagaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xidhaa la mid geesha ugu dambaysay ee aad hoos u marisay guji koowaad ka hor\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu hayaa jihada aad ku dhejisan tahay, inta aad haysato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Move)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu u beddelaa dhaqdhaqaaq iyo nuqul\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha fallaadha ee xidhashada waxay shaqeeyaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E (marka qiyaas laga bilaabo barta), guji koowaad ka dib. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E mar walba wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa jihada wajiga, mana laha xidhasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotate\u003C/span\u003E furayaasha fallaadhu waxay muujiyaan fariin &quot;Locked&quot; guji koowaad ka dib, laakiin ma beddelaan wareejinta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-fallaadha-waqtiyada-kale\"\u003EFurayaasha fallaadha waqtiyada kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka qalab aan waxba ku jirin, furayaasha fallaadhu waxay dhaqdhaqaaqaan kamarada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo fallaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiirka\"\u003EJiirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFicil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix, jiid, sii dayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid sida labo guji (qalabyada rinjiyeynta); jiid doorasho (for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E); tirtir inta lagu jiro (for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer gucsi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: wajiga iyo geesihiisa, geeska iyo wajiyadiisa, kooxda furta; meel bannaan ayaa kooxda xirta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E: ku celi masaafadii ugu dambaysay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex jeer gucsi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: wax kasta oo isku xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: u dhex geli ama ka bax doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: ku dar doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E: ka saar doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg, qalab kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + jiid badhanka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri, qalab kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri, qalab kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWheel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mawshaarka ku dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro menu-ga badhanka midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa laba farood oo jiidan sameeyaa waxay ku xidhan tahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Dhaqdhaqaaqa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGesture\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETrackpad (ama la xisaabiyay)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mawshaarka ku dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + laba farood oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mawshaarka ku dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee mawshaarka ku dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood oo riix oo jiid (badhanka labaad la hayo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#on-a-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"on-a-trackpad\"\u003EWareeg, muuqaalka guuri iyo weynee\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/settings#scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"scrolling-mouse-wheel-or-trackpad\"\u003EDejinta ModelCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-modeler\"\u003EFurayaasha Modeler\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModelCraft\u003C/span\u003E › Xakamaynta la dejiyo nooca Modeler:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E (soo saar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E qiyaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri doorashada isla markiiba, mawshaarka ka bilaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji doorashada dhexdeeda (dhuumaha buluug)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaan doorashada dhexdeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Y\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EY\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E inta lagu jiro guurid ama wareejin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidh dhuumaha casaan / cagaaran / buluug (mar kale si aad u furto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama riix badhanka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u celi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift D\"\u003E⇧D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul samee oo guuri nuqulka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option A\"\u003E⌥A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhammaan / ha doorato midkood\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur kooxda ama qaybta la doortay; mar kale si aad u xirto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command G\"\u003E⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command G\"\u003E⇧⌘G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee koox / samee qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENumpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"1\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"7\"\u003E7\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E7\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHore / midig / sare (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa dambe / bidix / hoose)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENumpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"5\"\u003E5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerspective wuu shaqeeyaa ama wuu joogsadaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENumpad \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\".\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift C\"\u003E⇧C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee dhammaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhejinta furan ama xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka dhexe / oo leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / oo leh \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg / muuqaalka guuri / weynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + jiid / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option Shift\"\u003E⌥⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+Shift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg / muuqaalka guuri (ma loo baahna badhanka dhexe)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji, ka noqo, kaydi iyo fur waxay haystaan furayaasha kor ku qoran. Qiimaha la qoray, sanduuqa qiimaha iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush/pull\u003C/span\u003E isku mid ayay u shaqeeyaan labada nooc.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-taabasho\"\u003EShaashad taabasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGesture\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji oo qalabka hadda jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer taabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer gucsi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix, jiid, sii dayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku mid sida riix, jiid, sii dayn ee jiirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood: fur-xidh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba farood: wada dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri (Settings › ModelCraft › Touch screen ayaa ka dhigi karta Wareeg)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex farood: wada dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg (Muuqaalka guuri marka laba farood wareegayaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal farood oo aan dhaqdhaqaaqin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dhammeeyaa qalabka, sida Enter; marka waxba socon, kadibna jiid si aad u wareegto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFarood labaad inta lagu jiro ficil hal farood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFicilkaas wuu joojiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna jiid hal farood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qiimo u qorto shaashad taabasho, taabo sanduuqa qiimaha ee hoose, qor, kadibna riix Enter (ama Go) ee kiboodhka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-move-ku-jirto\"\u003EMeesha ay Move ku jirto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMove waxay ku jirtaa qalabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, furayaha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: dooro waxa la guurinayo, guji barta saldhigga, kadibna barta labaad ama qor masaafada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\"\u003EGuuri, koobiyee iyo samee array-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kuwani waa furayaasha riix-jiid, kuwa ModelCraft ku bilaabo. Nooca kale, eeg Furayaasha Modeler hoose iyo Dejinta ModelCraft. Gaabintu waxay shaqeysaa marka muuqaalka 3D ama badhanka qalabka uu xoogga ku leeyahay. Haddii aad hadda ku qortay goob panel ama aad beddelday liiska Style, guji muuqaalka 3D marka hore, si furayaasha uusan u tagin goobtaas. Eeg Furayaasha, jiirarka iyo trackpad-yada si aad u aragto sida furayaasha loo qoro kombiyuutar kasta. Qalabyada Furay Qalab Space Select L Line R Rectangle C Circle N Polygon A Arc F Offset B Paint P Push/pull M Move Q Rotate S Scale E Eraser T Tape qiyaas D Dimension O Orbit H Pan Z Zoom Xarfaha qalabku waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya bila furayaasha kale: Shift oo xaraf la socda ma sameynayo wax, marka laga reebo labada hoose. Moodelka iyo faylka Furay Wuxuu sameeyaa G Samee qayb doorashada ka Shift+G Samee koox doorashada ka Shift+Z Weynee dhammaan (moodelka oo dhan) Ctrl+Z Ka noqo Ctrl+Y ama Ctrl+Shift+Z Samee mar kale Ctrl+S Kaydi (wuxuu soo dejiyaa faylka .modelcraft) Ctrl+O Fur moodel Ctrl+A Dooro wax kasta (kooxda furan, haddii mid furan yahay) Ctrl+C Koobiyee doorashada Ctrl+X Jar doorashada Ctrl+V Dhaji: nuqulka wuu raacaa mawshaarka, guji meesha uu tago Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji isla meesha (meeshii laga koobiyeeyay) Ctrl+D Nuqul: nuqul ayaa mawshaarka la socda, guji si aad u dhigto Delete ama Backspace Tirtir doorashada Page Down / Page Up Aragtida xigta / ta hore F1 Fur ama xir caawimaadan (sidoo kale Help app bar-ka; Esc gudaha caawimaadda ayaa xirta) Ctrl+Shift+F Qaabka shaashadda: shaashad buuxa, kadibna qalabka qarsoon, kadibna caadi (Control sidoo kale Mac-ka) Esc Esc wuxuu ka baxaa hal heer mar kasta oo aad riixdo: Joojinta wixii qalabku ku jiro (xariiq la rinjiyeynayo, riix/jiid, guuri). Wax kasta waa dib loo celiyaa. Wuxuu u beddelaa Select. Wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada. Wuxuu xirayaa kooxda aad tafatirayso. Wuxuu sidoo kale joojiyaa aragtiyada la ciyaarayo. Sanduuqa qiimaha gudihiisa, Esc wuxuu nadiifiyaa wixii aad qortay, kadibna wuxuu kuu celinayaa aragtida. Inta qalabku shaqeynayo Furay Wuxuu sameeyaa Tiro, ama mid ka mid ah . , - ' \" [ \u003C * / Wuxuu bilaabaa qorista sanduuqa qiimaha Enter Wuxuu dabaqaa wixii aad qortay sanduuqa qiimaha → Wuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha casaan (mar kale riix si aad u furto) ← Wuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha cagaaran ↑ Wuxuu xidhaa dhuumaha buluug ↓ Wuxuu xidhaa la mid geesha ugu dambaysay ee aad hoos u marisay guji koowaad ka hor Hay Shift Wuxuu hayaa jihada aad ku dhejisan tahay, inta aad haysato Ctrl, Ctrl ama Alt (Move) Wuxuu u beddelaa dhaqdhaqaaq iyo nuqul Furayaasha fallaadha ee xidhashada waxay shaqeeyaan Line, Rectangle, Circle, Polygon, Move, Scale iyo Tape (marka qiyaas laga bilaabo barta), guji koowaad ka dib. Push/pull mar walba wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa jihada wajiga, mana laha xidhasho. Rotate furayaasha fallaadhu waxay muujiyaan fariin \"Locked\" guji koowaad ka dib, laakiin ma beddelaan wareejinta. Furayaasha fallaadha waqtiyada kale Marka qalab aan waxba ku jirin, furayaasha fallaadhu waxay dhaqdhaqaaqaan kamarada: Furay Wuxuu sameeyaa ← → ↑ ↓ Wareeg Shift oo fallaad Muuqaalka guuri Jiirka Ficil Wuxuu sameeyaa Guji Wuxuu isticmaalaa qalabka hadda jira Riix, jiid, sii dayn Isku mid sida labo guji (qalabyada rinjiyeynta); jiid doorasho (for Select); tirtir inta lagu jiro (for Eraser) Laba jeer gucsi Select: wajiga iyo geesihiisa, geeska iyo wajiyadiisa, kooxda furta; meel bannaan ayaa kooxda xirta. Push/pull: ku celi masaafadii ugu dambaysay Saddex jeer gucsi Select: wax kasta oo isku xidhan Shift + guji Select: u dhex geli ama ka bax doorashada Ctrl + guji Select: ku dar doorashada Shift + Ctrl + guji Select: ka saar doorashada Jiid badhanka dhexe Wareeg, qalab kasta Shift + jiid badhanka dhexe Muuqaalka guuri, qalab kasta Jiid badhanka midig Muuqaalka guuri, qalab kasta Wheel Weynee mawshaarka ku dhow Ma jiro menu-ga badhanka midig. Trackpad Waxa laba farood oo jiidan sameeyaa waxay ku xidhan tahay Settings › ModelCraft › Dhaqdhaqaaqa: Gesture Trackpad (ama la xisaabiyay) Mouse wheel Laba farood oo jiid Wareeg Weynee mawshaarka ku dhow Shift + laba farood oo jiid Muuqaalka guuri Weynee Pinch Weynee mawshaarka ku dhow Weynee mawshaarka ku dhow Laba farood oo riix oo jiid (badhanka labaad la hayo) Muuqaalka guuri Muuqaalka guuri Eeg Wareeg, muuqaalka guuri iyo weynee iyo Dejinta ModelCraft. Furayaasha Modeler Marka Settings › ModelCraft › Xakamaynta la dejiyo nooca Modeler: Furay Wuxuu sameeyaa W ama Space Select L / B / C / N Line / Rectangle / Circle / Polygon E Push/pull (soo saar) T Tape qiyaas D Dimension G Guuri doorashada isla markiiba, mawshaarka ka bilaabo R Wareeji doorashada dhexdeeda (dhuumaha buluug) S Miisaan doorashada dhexdeeda X / Y / Z inta lagu jiro guurid ama wareejin Xidh dhuumaha casaan / cagaaran / buluug (mar kale si aad u furto) Guji ama Enter Dhig Esc ama riix badhanka midig Dib u celi Shift+D Nuqul samee oo guuri nuqulka X ama Delete Tirtir doorashada A / Alt+A Dooro dhammaan / ha doorato midkood Tab Fur kooxda ama qaybta la doortay; mar kale si aad u xirto Ctrl+G / Ctrl+Shift+G Samee koox / samee qayb Numpad 1 / 3 / 7 Hore / midig / sare (Ctrl waa dambe / bidix / hoose) Numpad 5 Perspective wuu shaqeeyaa ama wuu joogsadaa Numpad . Weynee doorashada Home ama Shift+C Weynee dhammaan Shift+Tab Dhejinta furan ama xidhan Jiid badhanka dhexe / oo leh Shift / oo leh Ctrl Wareeg / muuqaalka guuri / weynee Alt + jiid / Alt+Shift + jiid Wareeg / muuqaalka guuri (ma loo baahna badhanka dhexe) Koobiyee, dhaji, ka noqo, kaydi iyo fur waxay haystaan furayaasha kor ku qoran. Qiimaha la qoray, sanduuqa qiimaha iyo Push/pull isku mid ayay u shaqeeyaan labada nooc. Shaashad taabasho Gesture Wuxuu sameeyaa Taabo Guji oo qalabka hadda jira Laba jeer taabo Laba jeer gucsi Riix, jiid, sii dayn Isku mid sida riix, jiid, sii dayn ee jiirka Laba farood: fur-xidh Weynee Laba farood: wada dhaqdhaqaaq Muuqaalka guuri (Settings › ModelCraft › Touch screen ayaa ka dhigi karta Wareeg) Saddex farood: wada dhaqdhaqaaq Wareeg (Muuqaalka guuri marka laba farood wareegayaan) Hal farood oo aan dhaqdhaqaaqin Wuxuu dhammeeyaa qalabka, sida Enter; marka waxba socon, kadibna jiid si aad u wareegto Farood labaad inta lagu jiro ficil hal farood Ficilkaas wuu joojiyaa Qalabka Orbit, kadibna jiid hal farood Wareeg Si aad qiimo u qorto shaashad taabasho, taabo sanduuqa qiimaha ee hoose, qor, kadibna riix Enter (ama Go) ee kiboodhka. Meesha ay Move ku jirto Move waxay ku jirtaa qalabka Move, furayaha M: dooro waxa la guurinayo, guji barta saldhigga, kadibna barta labaad ama qor masaafada. Eeg Guuri, koobiyee iyo samee array-yada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tools","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Liiska qalabyada","summary":"Qalab kasta oo ModelCraft ah oo furihiisa, waxa riix kasta sameeyo, iyo waxa aad ku qori karto sanduuqa qiimaha intuu shaqeynayo.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["qalabyada","toolbar","amarrada","liiska","xariiq","afar-geesle","goobo","poligon","ka fogaan","qaanso","qalin","spline","raac aniga","sweep","qaanso 2 dhibic","qaanso dhexda","dooro","riix jiid","guuri","wareeji","cabbir","tirtiraha","teef","wareeg","muuqaal","guuri muuqaalka","weynee","dhig qayb"],"headings":[{"id":"qalabyada-sawirka","text":"Qalabyada sawirka","level":2},{"id":"qalabyada-tafatirka","text":"Qalabyada tafatirka","level":2},{"id":"qalabyada-kamarada","text":"Qalabyada kamarada","level":2},{"id":"habaynta","text":"Habaynta","level":2},{"id":"dhig-qayb","text":"Dhig qayb","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETalada xaashida xaaladda had iyo jeer waxay sheegaysaa waxa qalabka hadda uu rabo marka xigta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa wixii qalabku ku jiro dhexdooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabyada-sawirka\"\u003EQalabyada sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERiix\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor sanduuqa qiimaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXariiq\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow, kadibna dhibic kasta oo xiga. Wuu joogsadaa marka dusha la xidho, ama markii \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la riixo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer oo u jeeda tusaha; \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E dhibic; \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ka fogaan (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeeska koowaad (dhulka ama dusha), geeska ka soo horjeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallac iyo qoto: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda (dhulka ama dusha), dhibic ku taal geeska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa hor riixitaankii koowaad: dhinacyada, \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/span\u003E). Ka dib: radiuska (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda, geesta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida Goobo; wuxuu ku bilaabmaa 6 dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow, dhamaad, kadibna boos\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererka xarriiqda labada dhibic ka dib bilowga (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E); boosta ka dib dhamaadka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor-u-kac\u003C/span\u003E); \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E qaybaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProtraktor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda, dhibcaha 0°, kadibna xagalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagalka digrii (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIga raac\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro jid, kadibna riix dusha (ama riix dusha, kadibna geesta jidka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERinji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha, kooxda ama qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E— (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isku xidhan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E midabka oo dhan, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qaado midab)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha (ama horey u dooro dusha ama geesaha), kadibna dhinaca iyo masaafada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E); gelida dusha waa gudaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha uu qalinku maro; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama laba jeer dhufo ayaa dhammaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer oo socda tusaha, \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E dhibicda xigta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaansada dhexdeeda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda, bilowga, kadibna dhamaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadiuska ka dib dhexda; xagalka digrii ka dib bilowga; \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E qaybaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabyada-tafatirka\"\u003EQalabyada tafatirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERiix\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix, laba jeer dhufo, saddex jeer dhufo, jiid sanduuq. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/select\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/select\"\u003EDooro waxyaabaha\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hal cabbir ama geesi la doortay: dherer cusub, taasoo beddeshaa moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha, kadibna masaafada. Dusha laba jeer dhufo si aad masaafadii ugu dambaysay u celiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafo; taban waa jihada kale (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeel ka, meel u. Ku hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u koobiyayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafo oo u jeeda tusaha, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E). Koobiyee ka dib: \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda (dusha si aad u leexiso diyaarkeeda), jihada bilowga, jihada dhamaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagalka digrii (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta sii jirta, barta tixraaca, cabbirka cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsugeyn: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix ama jiid geesaha, kooxaha, hagayaasha iyo cabbirrada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeef\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta: xariiq hage oo isbarbar ah. Dhibic: cabbir oo dhibic hage ka dhig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa fogaanta (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E) ama masaafada (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba geesood (ama geesta keliya), kadibna meesha xariiqda cabbirku ku dhacayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003ECabbir iyo beddel cabbir\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa fogaanta (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E). Isla markiiba ka dib: dherer cusub, taasoo beddeshaa moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku shaqeeyaan xulashada. Haddii waxba la dooran, waxa aad marka hore dhufato ayay qaadaan (dusha ayaa geeskeeda keenta).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabyada-kamarada\"\u003EQalabyada kamarada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJiid si aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu wareeg qaybta moodeelka ee tusaha hoosteeda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu u guuraa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka u jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWeynee\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee: sare waa gudaha, hoose waa dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Z\"\u003E⇧Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(badhan, ma aha qalab) Moodeelka oo dhan ku buuxi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInta badan uma baahnid kuwan iyada oo mouse la isticmaalayo: jiid dhexe wuu wareegaa, jiid midig wuu guurayaa, gurigu qalab kasta weynee. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EWareeg, guuri iyo weynee\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habaynta\"\u003EHabaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa sameeya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayb\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXulashada ka dhig qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoox\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXulashada ka dhig koox\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha la doortay mar kale waxay noqdaan joometri xor ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-qayb\"\u003EDhig qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa aha toolbar-ka dushiisa: riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig\u003C/span\u003E oo ku xigta qayb ku jirta guddiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybaha\u003C/span\u003E. Hal mar dhufo meesha ay asalka qaybtu tagayso; qalabku markaasuu ku laabanayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Talada xaashida xaaladda had iyo jeer waxay sheegaysaa waxa qalabka hadda uu rabo marka xigta. Esc wuxuu joojiyaa wixii qalabku ku jiro dhexdooda. Qalabyada sawirka Qalab Furaha Riix Qor sanduuqa qiimaha Xariiq L Bilow, kadibna dhibic kasta oo xiga. Wuu joogsadaa marka dusha la xidho, ama markii Esc la riixo Dherer oo u jeeda tusaha; [x,y,z] dhibic; \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ka fogaan (Dherer) Afar-geesle R Geeska koowaad (dhulka ama dusha), geeska ka soo horjeeda Ballac iyo qoto: 4m,3m (Cabbirrada) Goobo C Dhexda (dhulka ama dusha), dhibic ku taal geeska Ka hor riixitaankii koowaad: dhinacyada, 24s ama 24 (Dhinacyada). Ka dib: radiuska (Radius) Poligon N Dhexda, geesta Sida Goobo; wuxuu ku bilaabmaa 6 dhinac Qaanso A Bilow, dhamaad, kadibna boos Dhererka xarriiqda labada dhibic ka dib bilowga (Dherer); boosta ka dib dhamaadka (Kor-u-kac); 12s qaybaha Protraktor — Dhexda, dhibcaha 0°, kadibna xagalka Xagalka digrii (Xagal) Iga raac — Dooro jid, kadibna riix dusha (ama riix dusha, kadibna geesta jidka) — Rinji B Dusha, kooxda ama qaybta — (Ctrl isku xidhan, Shift midabka oo dhan, Alt qaado midab) Ka fogaan F Dusha (ama horey u dooro dusha ama geesaha), kadibna dhinaca iyo masaafada Masaafada (Masaafo); gelida dusha waa gudaha Qalin — Dhibcaha uu qalinku maro; Enter ama laba jeer dhufo ayaa dhammaysa Dherer oo socda tusaha, [x,y,z] ama \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E dhibicda xigta Qaansada dhexdeeda — Dhexda, bilowga, kadibna dhamaadka Radiuska ka dib dhexda; xagalka digrii ka dib bilowga; 12s qaybaha Qalabyada tafatirka Qalab Furaha Riix Qor Dooro Space Riix, laba jeer dhufo, saddex jeer dhufo, jiid sanduuq. Eeg Dooro waxyaabaha Marka hal cabbir ama geesi la doortay: dherer cusub, taasoo beddeshaa moodeelka Riix/jiid P Dusha, kadibna masaafada. Dusha laba jeer dhufo si aad masaafadii ugu dambaysay u celiso Masaafo; taban waa jihada kale (Masaafo) Guuri M Meel ka, meel u. Ku hay Ctrl ama Alt si aad u koobiyayso Masaafo oo u jeeda tusaha, \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E ama [x,y,z] (Masaafo). Koobiyee ka dib: 3x ama /3 Wareeji Q Dhexda (dusha si aad u leexiso diyaarkeeda), jihada bilowga, jihada dhamaadka Xagalka digrii (Xagal) Miisaan S Barta sii jirta, barta tixraaca, cabbirka cusub Isugeyn: 2, 0.5 (Miisaan) Tirtiraha E Riix ama jiid geesaha, kooxaha, hagayaasha iyo cabbirrada Waxba Teef T Geesta: xariiq hage oo isbarbar ah. Dhibic: cabbir oo dhibic hage ka dhig Ka fogaanta (Ka fogaan) ama masaafada (Dherer) Cabbir D Laba geesood (ama geesta keliya), kadibna meesha xariiqda cabbirku ku dhacayso. Eeg Cabbir iyo beddel cabbir Ka fogaanta (Ka fogaan). Isla markiiba ka dib: dherer cusub, taasoo beddeshaa moodeelka Guuri, Wareeji iyo Miisaan waxay ku shaqeeyaan xulashada. Haddii waxba la dooran, waxa aad marka hore dhufato ayay qaadaan (dusha ayaa geeskeeda keenta). Qalabyada kamarada Qalab Furaha Jiid si aad u Wareeg O Ku wareeg qaybta moodeelka ee tusaha hoosteeda (Shift wuxuu u guuraa) Muuqaalka guuri H Muuqaalka u jiid Weynee Z Weynee: sare waa gudaha, hoose waa dibadda Xuduudaha Shift+Z (badhan, ma aha qalab) Moodeelka oo dhan ku buuxi Inta badan uma baahnid kuwan iyada oo mouse la isticmaalayo: jiid dhexe wuu wareegaa, jiid midig wuu guurayaa, gurigu qalab kasta weynee. Eeg Wareeg, guuri iyo weynee. Habaynta Badhanka Furaha Waxa sameeya Qayb G Xulashada ka dhig qayb Koox Shift+G Xulashada ka dhig koox Kala bax midna Kooxaha iyo qaybaha la doortay mar kale waxay noqdaan joometri xor ah Dhig qayb Ma aha toolbar-ka dushiisa: riix Dhig oo ku xigta qayb ku jirta guddiga Qaybaha. Hal mar dhufo meesha ay asalka qaybtu tagayso; qalabku markaasuu ku laabanayaa Dooro.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"inference","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Jihada iyo dhejinta","summary":"Waa maxay calaamadaha midabka leh, dhejinta ayaa guuleysta, iyo sida loo xidho jihada furayaasha fallaadha ama Shift.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["jihada","dhejin","dhejinta","geesle","dhexe","dhexe wajiga","dhuumo","dhuumaha casaan","dhuumaha cagaaran","dhuumaha buluug","la mid","ka toosan","xidh","shift","osnap"],"headings":[{"id":"calaamadaha-iyo-qoraalada","text":"Calaamadaha iyo qoraalada","level":2},{"id":"dhejinta-mid-ayaa-guuleysta","text":"Dhejinta mid ayaa guuleysta","level":2},{"id":"rinjiyee-wajiga-barta-ka-bilaabo","text":"Rinjiyee wajiga barta ka bilaabo","level":2},{"id":"la-mid-iyo-ka-toosan","text":"La mid iyo ka toosan","level":2},{"id":"xidh-jihada","text":"Xidh jihada","level":2},{"id":"gudaha-kooxda","text":"Gudaha kooxda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIntaad qalab rinjiyeynta ama tafatirka ka shaqeynayso, ModelCraft wuxuu eegaa waxa mawshaarka ku yaal, wuxuuna ku dhejiyaa waxa ugu faa&#039;iidada badan ee u dhow. Calaamad ayaa muujinaysa waxa uu helay, qoraalka geeska hoose ee bidix ayaa magacaabaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"calaamadaha-iyo-qoraalada\"\u003ECalaamadaha iyo qoraalada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu ku dhejiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesle dhammaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo cagaar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaadka geesle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo cyan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda geesle\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda wajiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta hagaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECirro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta uu tagay qalabka teefka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAsal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDahabi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha ay dhuumaha casaan, cagaar iyo buluug ku kulmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuumaha casaan / Dhuumaha cagaaran / Dhuumaha buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq midabkaas leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq ka bilaabmaya barta bilowga oo u jeeda jihadaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa mid geesha / Ka toosan geesha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq magenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq ka bilaabmaya barta bilowga, la mid ama ka toosan geesha la xusay (eeg hoose)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq magenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJihada aad ku xidhay furayaasha fallaadha ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesle dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAfar-geesle casaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeel kasta oo geesle dhexdeeda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHage dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECirro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeel kasta oo xariiqda hagaha dhexdeeda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWajiga dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiamond buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeel kasta oo wajiga dushiisa ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaarada dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaaradda aad ka bilaabatay, marka mawshaarku uu meel banaan ku jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhulka (diyaaradda casaan-cagaaran), marka waxba kale aan jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka xariiqda dhuumaha ka soo bilaabanta barta bilowga uu gudbo geesle ama hage, ModelCraft wuxuu ku dhejiyaa isgoyska, tipka wuxuu magacaabaa labadaba, sida &quot;On red axis, on edge&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhejinta-mid-ayaa-guuleysta\"\u003EDhejinta mid ayaa guuleysta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibcaha\u003C/strong\u003E ku dhow ilaa 12 pixel: marka hore geesaha dhammaadka, kadibna barooyinka hagaha, dhexda, dhexda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal iyo asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJihooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E barta bilowga: dhuumaha casaan, cagaar iyo buluug, iyo la mid ama ka toosan geesaha la xusay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesle\u003C/strong\u003E ama xariiq hage.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWajiga.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaaradda rinjiyeynta\u003C/strong\u003E, ama dhulka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ka dambeeya wajiga ayaa marna lagu dhejin. Ka wareeg si aad u aragto barta aad rabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rinjiyee-wajiga-barta-ka-bilaabo\"\u003ERinjiyee wajiga barta ka bilaabo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E oo laga bilaabo geeska, dhexda geesle, geesle ama dhexda wajiga, waxa lagu rinjiyeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ediyaaradda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuuna jeexaa wajigaas. Geesle waxaa leh labo wajiyo, sidaas darteed dhinaca geeska uu mawshaarku ku yaal ayaa go&#039;aamiya: si aad u rinjiso dhammaadka sanduuq dheer, ka bilow dhexda geesle mid ah, mawshaarkuna dhinaca gudaha wajiga dhammaadka ku jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-mid-iyo-ka-toosan\"\u003ELa mid iyo ka toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu xusaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egeeska ugu dambeeya ee mawshaarku dul maray ka hor riiggaaga koowaad\u003C/strong\u003E. Bilowga geeska ama geesle wuxuu u tirsan yahay in la dul maray geeskaas. Marka qalabku shaqeeyo, geesaha kale ee aad dul martid ma beddelaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad xariiq la mid geesle uga rinjiyeysid:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo mawshaarka geeska aad rabto ku hoos mari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU gudub barta bilowga, iyadoo aan geesaha kale gudbin haddii aad karo, oo guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU guuri jihada la mid geeskaas. Xariiqdu wuxuu u noqdaa magenta, tipka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Parallel to edge&quot;. Ka toosan ayaa sidaas oo kale u shaqeysa, diyaaradda aad ku rinjiyeynayso dhexdeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii geeska qaldan la xusay, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ku hoos mari geeska saxda ah, kadibna bilow mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidh-jihada\"\u003EXidh jihada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadib guji koowaad oo qalab ah, waxaad xidhi kartaa barta xigta si ay xariiq kaliya ugu jirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuray\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu xidhaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuumaha casaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuumaha cagaaran\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuumaha buluug (toos u kor)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa mid geesha ugu dambaysay (eeg kor)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla fallaadha mar kale riix si aad u furto. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Locked to the red axis. Press the same arrow to unlock.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXidhan ahaan, barta waxay u dhaqaaqdaa xariiqda, waxayna weli la safaysaa barooyinka aad ku dul marto: ku dul mar geeska sanduuq kale si aad u rinjiyeyso xariiq dhuumaha casaan ilaa geeskaas oo kaliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xidhaa jihada aad hadda ku dhejisan tahay (dhuun ama la mid), inta aad ku hayso. Ka dayso si aad u furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXidhashadu waxay shaqeysaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERectangle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolygon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETape\u003C/span\u003E. Guji koowaad ka hor, furayaasha fallaadhu waxay ku wareegaan muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gudaha-kooxda\"\u003EGudaha kooxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad ku tafatirayso kooxda ama qaybta, dhuumuhu waa dhuumaha kooxda laftiisa (way dhaqdhaqaaqaan, way wareegaan haddii la wareejiyay). Dhejintu weli waxay heshaa barooyin iyo geesaha ka baxsan kooxda, sidaas darteed waad ku toosin kartaa waxyaabaha moodelka kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Intaad qalab rinjiyeynta ama tafatirka ka shaqeynayso, ModelCraft wuxuu eegaa waxa mawshaarka ku yaal, wuxuuna ku dhejiyaa waxa ugu faa'iidada badan ee u dhow. Calaamad ayaa muujinaysa waxa uu helay, qoraalka geeska hoose ee bidix ayaa magacaabaa. Calaamadaha iyo qoraalada Qoraal Calaamad Wuxuu ku dhejiyaa Geesle dhammaadka Goobo cagaar Dhammaadka geesle Dhexda Goobo cyan Dhexda geesle Dhexda wajiga Goobo buluug Dhexda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal Barta hagaha Cirro Barta uu tagay qalabka teefka Asal Dahabi Meesha ay dhuumaha casaan, cagaar iyo buluug ku kulmaan Dhuumaha casaan / Dhuumaha cagaaran / Dhuumaha buluug Xariiq midabkaas leh Xariiq ka bilaabmaya barta bilowga oo u jeeda jihadaas La mid geesha / Ka toosan geesha Xariiq magenta Xariiq ka bilaabmaya barta bilowga, la mid ama ka toosan geesha la xusay (eeg hoose) Xidhan Xariiq magenta Jihada aad ku xidhay furayaasha fallaadha ama Shift Geesle dushiisa Afar-geesle casaan Meel kasta oo geesle dhexdeeda ah Hage dushiisa Cirro Meel kasta oo xariiqda hagaha dhexdeeda ah Wajiga dushiisa Diamond buluug Meel kasta oo wajiga dushiisa ah Diyaarada dushiisa midna Diyaaradda aad ka bilaabatay, marka mawshaarku uu meel banaan ku jiro Dhulka dushiisa midna Dhulka (diyaaradda casaan-cagaaran), marka waxba kale aan jirin Marka xariiqda dhuumaha ka soo bilaabanta barta bilowga uu gudbo geesle ama hage, ModelCraft wuxuu ku dhejiyaa isgoyska, tipka wuxuu magacaabaa labadaba, sida \"On red axis, on edge\". Dhejinta mid ayaa guuleysta Dhibcaha ku dhow ilaa 12 pixel: marka hore geesaha dhammaadka, kadibna barooyinka hagaha, dhexda, dhexda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal iyo asalka. Jihooyinka barta bilowga: dhuumaha casaan, cagaar iyo buluug, iyo la mid ama ka toosan geesaha la xusay. Geesle ama xariiq hage. Wajiga. Diyaaradda rinjiyeynta, ama dhulka. Waxa ka dambeeya wajiga ayaa marna lagu dhejin. Ka wareeg si aad u aragto barta aad rabto. Rinjiyee wajiga barta ka bilaabo Rectangle, Circle ama Polygon oo laga bilaabo geeska, dhexda geesle, geesle ama dhexda wajiga, waxa lagu rinjiyeeyaa diyaaradda wajiga ee mawshaarka ku yaal, wuxuuna jeexaa wajigaas. Geesle waxaa leh labo wajiyo, sidaas darteed dhinaca geeska uu mawshaarku ku yaal ayaa go'aamiya: si aad u rinjiso dhammaadka sanduuq dheer, ka bilow dhexda geesle mid ah, mawshaarkuna dhinaca gudaha wajiga dhammaadka ku jiro. La mid iyo ka toosan ModelCraft wuxuu xusaa geeska ugu dambeeya ee mawshaarku dul maray ka hor riiggaaga koowaad. Bilowga geeska ama geesle wuxuu u tirsan yahay in la dul maray geeskaas. Marka qalabku shaqeeyo, geesaha kale ee aad dul martid ma beddelaan. Si aad xariiq la mid geesle uga rinjiyeysid: Riix L oo mawshaarka geeska aad rabto ku hoos mari. U gudub barta bilowga, iyadoo aan geesaha kale gudbin haddii aad karo, oo guji. U guuri jihada la mid geeskaas. Xariiqdu wuxuu u noqdaa magenta, tipka wuxuu leeyahay \"Parallel to edge\". Ka toosan ayaa sidaas oo kale u shaqeysa, diyaaradda aad ku rinjiyeynayso dhexdeeda. Haddii geeska qaldan la xusay, riix Esc, ku hoos mari geeska saxda ah, kadibna bilow mar kale. Xidh jihada Kadib guji koowaad oo qalab ah, waxaad xidhi kartaa barta xigta si ay xariiq kaliya ugu jirto: Furay Wuxuu xidhaa → Dhuumaha casaan ← Dhuumaha cagaaran ↑ Dhuumaha buluug (toos u kor) ↓ La mid geesha ugu dambaysay (eeg kor) Isla fallaadha mar kale riix si aad u furto. Joogta xaaladda wuxuu leeyahay \"Locked to the red axis. Press the same arrow to unlock.\" Xidhan ahaan, barta waxay u dhaqaaqdaa xariiqda, waxayna weli la safaysaa barooyinka aad ku dul marto: ku dul mar geeska sanduuq kale si aad u rinjiyeyso xariiq dhuumaha casaan ilaa geeskaas oo kaliya. Shift wuxuu xidhaa jihada aad hadda ku dhejisan tahay (dhuun ama la mid), inta aad ku hayso. Ka dayso si aad u furto. Xidhashadu waxay shaqeysaa Line, Rectangle, Circle, Polygon, Move, Scale iyo Tape. Guji koowaad ka hor, furayaasha fallaadhu waxay ku wareegaan muuqaalka. Gudaha kooxda Intaad ku tafatirayso kooxda ama qaybta, dhuumuhu waa dhuumaha kooxda laftiisa (way dhaqdhaqaaqaan, way wareegaan haddii la wareejiyay). Dhejintu weli waxay heshaa barooyin iyo geesaha ka baxsan kooxda, sidaas darteed waad ku toosin kartaa waxyaabaha moodelka kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"value-box","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qor cabbirka saxda ah sanduuqa qiimaha","summary":"Dhammaan siyaabaha loo qoro dherer, cabbir, dhibic, kala-fogaan, xagal, dhinac iyo nuqul, iyo sida cutubyada iyo tirooyinka calaamad la'aanta ah loo akhriyo.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["sanduuqa qiimaha","value box","qor","saxda","cabbir","dherer","cutubyo","feet","inches","metric","millimeters","isku-xidhka","kala-fogaan","array","dhinacyo","xagal","tobanaal comma"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-loo-qoro","text":"Sida loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"dherero","text":"Dherero","level":2},{"id":"xisaabinta","text":"Xisaabinta","level":2},{"id":"qalab-kasta","text":"Qalab kasta","level":2},{"id":"barta-iyo-kala-fogaanka","text":"Barta iyo kala-fogaanka","level":2},{"id":"nuqullo-ka-dib-guuritaanka","text":"Nuqullo ka dib guuritaanka","level":2},{"id":"dherero-qoran-waxay-u-baahan-yihiin-jihada","text":"Dherero qoran waxay u baahan yihiin jihada","level":2},{"id":"unitka-moodeelka","text":"Unitka moodeelka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu ku yaal bar-ka xaaladda ee hoose, oo calaamadiisu wuu isbeddelaa qalabka. Intaad shaqaynayso wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka toosa; waqti kasta waad qori kartaa mid saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBilow falka gujin (geeska koowaad, dhinaca, dhibcaha laga bilaabo guuritaanka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor. Ma loo baahna inaad gujiso sanduuqa qiimaha: lambar ama mid ka mid ah \u003Ccode\u003E. , - &#039; &quot; [ &lt; * /\u003C/code\u003E ayaa u diraya qorashadaada halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuqa qiimaha si aad u nadiifiso oo aad ku laabato aragta. Shaashadda taabashada, taabo sanduuqa qiimaha si kiiboodhku u soo baxo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii ModelCraft aanu akhrin karin waxaad qortay, status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Qor dherer sida 3m, 10&#039;6&quot; ama 4m,3m.&quot; Haddii qalabku isticmaali karin, wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Taasi ma shaqeynin: …&quot; iyo sababta ku jirta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dherero\"\u003EDherero\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3m\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E320cm\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E3200mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMitir, santimitir, millimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10ft\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10 feet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6in\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6 inches\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInji\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E10&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet iyo inji, leh qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInji leh qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1.5ft\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.5m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETobanaal oo leh unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro calaamad la&#039;aan ah, oo ah unitka moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiro calaamad la&#039;aan ah wuxuu isticmaalaa unitka moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E, sida lagu muujiyay doorashada ku taal midig hoose: inji moodeel feet iyo inji ah (sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E waa 10 feet), millimitir moodeel millimitir ah, iwm. Qoraal unit wuxuu had iyo jeer ku guuleystaa, cutubka moodeelka ha ahaadee. Calaamadaha qalloocan iyo calaamadaha prime (’ ” ′ ″) waxaa sidoo kale loo akhriyaa sida feet iyo inji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHad iyo jeer isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003Edhibic\u003C/strong\u003E tobanaalka: \u003Ccode\u003E2.5m\u003C/code\u003E. Calaamadda comma (,) waxay kala soocaa laba qiime, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E2,5\u003C/code\u003E waa 2 iyo 5 (laba qiime), iyadoo aan loo eegin dejinta luuqadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xisaabinta\"\u003EXisaabinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer kasta waxay noqon kartaa xisaab: ku dar \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, ka jar \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, dhufo \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, qaybi \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E, oo isticmaal qaw. Ma loo baahna xisaabiye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex meelood meel ee 2.5 (unitka moodeelka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;+3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039; 6 3/4&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E900 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 7/16&quot; moodeel feet iyo inji ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3m-25cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.75 m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro calaamad la&#039;aan ah waa unitka moodeelka marka ay tahay dherer (\u003Ccode\u003E2.5/3\u003C/code\u003E moodeel mitir ah waa 0.833 m), iyo qayb-dhufasho (factor) marka ay dhufanayso ama qaybinayso dherer (\u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E). Xagal iyo factor-yadu waxay qaadan karaan xisaabo: \u003Ccode\u003E90/2\u003C/code\u003E waa 45°. Laba dherer oo la dhufto waxay samaysaan balac, ma aha dherer, sidaas darteed \u003Ccode\u003E2m*3m\u003C/code\u003E waa la diidaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii ModelCraft aanu xisaabin karin, status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa khaldan iyo meesha, tusaale &quot;Qaybin eber ah (xaraf 4).&quot; Qaw ayaa sidoo kale furaya sanduuqa qiimaha, sidaas darteed waxaad ku bilaabi kartaa \u003Ccode\u003E(\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwan waxay hayaan macnahoodii: \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E ka dib nuqul, \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E dhinacyada, iyo \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E marka geesta la doortay (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003Eqaybiya geesta\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalab-kasta\"\u003EQalab kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer (u socda dhanka taabashada), ama barta ama kala-fogaan (hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba dherer: \u003Ccode\u003E4m,3m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;,10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E. Calaamadda semicolon (;) ayaa sidoo kale shaqeysa: \u003Ccode\u003E4m;3m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhinacyada\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore taabashada koowaad, tirada dhinacyada: \u003Ccode\u003E12s\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E12\u003C/code\u003E (3 ilaa 999). Ka dib, radius-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer. Mid diidan wuxuu u socdaa dhanka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer (u socda dhanka taabashada), ama barta ama kala-fogaan. Nuqul ka dib: \u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarajooyin: \u003Ccode\u003E90\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-45\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFactor ka weyn 0: \u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.25\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETeef\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala qaybi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa qayb oo isle&#039;eg: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E5s\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E/5\u003C/code\u003E (2 ilaa 1000). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/divide\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/divide\"\u003EKala qaybi geesta ama curve qaybo isle&#039;eg\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa fogaan\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDherer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha uu khadka cabbirku gelayo; marka dhigidda ka dib, dherer cusub ayaa cabbiraysa moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQiimaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hal cabbir ama geeso la doortay, dherer cusub ayaa cabbiraysa moodeelka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/dimensions\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/dimensions\"\u003ECabbir iyo cabbiraysa\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barta-iyo-kala-fogaanka\"\u003EBarta iyo kala-fogaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, ka dib taabashada koowaad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[x,y,z]\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu u gudbaa barta saxda ah ee moodeelka (dhuruuda kooxda marka aad tafatirayso gudaha kooxda). Tusaale: \u003Ccode\u003E[0,0,3m]\u003C/code\u003E waa 3 m sare ee meesha asalka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;dx,dy,dz&gt;\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu u gudbaa masaafadaas ka bilowga taabashada koowaad, dhinaca casaan, cagaar iyo buluug. Tusaale: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;0,0,10&#039;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E waa 10 feet toosan sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimaha saddexdaba mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay unitkiisa: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;12&#039;,0,6&quot;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqullo-ka-dib-guuritaanka\"\u003ENuqullo ka dib guuritaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla markaa ka dib nuqul \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamaynaya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3x\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E*3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 nuqul oo isku xiga, isku masaafo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3 nuqul oo si siman loo kala faafiyay asalka ilaa nuqulka koowaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlaa 500 nuqul. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/move-copy#a-row-of-copies\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/move-copy\" data-hash=\"a-row-of-copies\"\u003EGuuri, nuqul iyo samee array-yo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dherero-qoran-waxay-u-baahan-yihiin-jihada\"\u003EDherero qoran waxay u baahan yihiin jihada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDherer keligiis oo la qoro wuxuu u socdaa dhanka uu taabashadu ku tilmaamayo taabashada koowaad. Haddii aad qorto isla markaa ka dib gujinta, adoon weli wax dhaqaajin, jihadu weli ma jirto, wax ma dhicin. Dhaqaajiso taabashada xoogaa dhanka aad rabto inaad tagto, kadibna qor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unitka-moodeelka\"\u003EUnitka moodeelka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel unitka doorashada midig hoose: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eft iyo in\u003C/span\u003E, in, ft, yd, mi, mil, µm, mm, cm, m ama km, illaa intii ay ku shidan yihiin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E (unitka moodeelka laftiisa had iyo jeer waa jira). Dherer lagu qoro calaamadda unit kasta waxaa loo akhriyaa unitkaas. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EUnitada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitada\u003C/a\u003E. Wuxuu beddelaa sida cabbirada loo muujiyo iyo sida tirooyinka calaamad la&#039;aanta ah loo akhriyo; moodeelka ayaa isku cabbir ah. Unitka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida cabbirada loo muujiyo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnit\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDherero\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBalacyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMugyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eft iyo in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E (ilaa 1/16&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ein\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E126 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esq in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecu in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E320 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ecm³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3200 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em² ka 0.01 m² ka hoose, haddii kale mm²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em³ ka 0.01 m³ ka hoose, haddii kale mm³\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeel cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa feet iyo inji marka luuqada browser-ka ay tahay gobol Mareykanka (iyo Liberia iyo Myanmar), iyo millimitir meel kasta. Unit la xiddigeeyay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E ayaa la isticmaalaa halkii, marka ModelCraft ay haysato. Ama beddel doorashada ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qiimaha wuxuu ku yaal bar-ka xaaladda ee hoose, oo calaamadiisu wuu isbeddelaa qalabka. Intaad shaqaynayso wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka toosa; waqti kasta waad qori kartaa mid saxda ah. Sida loo qoro Bilow falka gujin (geeska koowaad, dhinaca, dhibcaha laga bilaabo guuritaanka). Qor. Ma loo baahna inaad gujiso sanduuqa qiimaha: lambar ama mid ka mid ah . , - ' \" [ \u003C * / ayaa u diraya qorashadaada halkaas. Riix Enter. Riix Esc sanduuqa qiimaha si aad u nadiifiso oo aad ku laabato aragta. Shaashadda taabashada, taabo sanduuqa qiimaha si kiiboodhku u soo baxo. Haddii ModelCraft aanu akhrin karin waxaad qortay, status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Qor dherer sida 3m, 10'6\" ama 4m,3m.\" Haddii qalabku isticmaali karin, wuxuu leeyahay \"Taasi ma shaqeynin: …\" iyo sababta ku jirta. Dherero Qoraal Macnaha 3m 320cm 3200mm Mitir, santimitir, millimitir 10' 10ft 10 feet Feet 6\" 6in 6 inches Inji 10'6\" 10' 6\" 10'-6 1/2\" Feet iyo inji, leh qayb 6 1/2\" 6-1/2\" 3/4\" Inji leh qayb 1.5ft .5m Tobanaal oo leh unit 120 Tiro calaamad la'aan ah, oo ah unitka moodeelka Tiro calaamad la'aan ah wuxuu isticmaalaa unitka moodeelka, sida lagu muujiyay doorashada ku taal midig hoose: inji moodeel feet iyo inji ah (sidaas darteed 120 waa 10 feet), millimitir moodeel millimitir ah, iwm. Qoraal unit wuxuu had iyo jeer ku guuleystaa, cutubka moodeelka ha ahaadee. Calaamadaha qalloocan iyo calaamadaha prime (’ ” ′ ″) waxaa sidoo kale loo akhriyaa sida feet iyo inji. Had iyo jeer isticmaal dhibic tobanaalka: 2.5m. Calaamadda comma (,) waxay kala soocaa laba qiime, sidaas darteed 2,5 waa 2 iyo 5 (laba qiime), iyadoo aan loo eegin dejinta luuqadda. Xisaabinta Dherer kasta waxay noqon kartaa xisaab: ku dar +, ka jar -, dhufo *, qaybi /, oo isticmaal qaw. Ma loo baahna xisaabiye. Qoraal Macnaha 2.5/3 Saddex meelood meel ee 2.5 (unitka moodeelka) 12'6\"+3/4\" 12' 6 3/4\" (24'-0\")/3 8' 2*450mm 900 mm 4+7/16 4 7/16\" moodeel feet iyo inji ah 3m-25cm 2.75 m Tiro calaamad la'aan ah waa unitka moodeelka marka ay tahay dherer (2.5/3 moodeel mitir ah waa 0.833 m), iyo qayb-dhufasho (factor) marka ay dhufanayso ama qaybinayso dherer (2*450mm). Xagal iyo factor-yadu waxay qaadan karaan xisaabo: 90/2 waa 45°. Laba dherer oo la dhufto waxay samaysaan balac, ma aha dherer, sidaas darteed 2m*3m waa la diidaa. Haddii ModelCraft aanu xisaabin karin, status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa khaldan iyo meesha, tusaale \"Qaybin eber ah (xaraf 4).\" Qaw ayaa sidoo kale furaya sanduuqa qiimaha, sidaas darteed waxaad ku bilaabi kartaa (. Kuwan waxay hayaan macnahoodii: /3, 3x iyo *3 ka dib nuqul, 24s dhinacyada, iyo /3 marka geesta la doortay (qaybiya geesta). Qalab kasta Qalab Calaamad Qoraal Xarriiq Dherer Dherer (u socda dhanka taabashada), ama barta ama kala-fogaan (hoos) Afar-geesle Cabbirrada Laba dherer: 4m,3m, 12',10'. Calaamadda semicolon (;) ayaa sidoo kale shaqeysa: 4m;3m Goobo, Poligon Dhinacyada, ka dibna Radius Marka hore taabashada koowaad, tirada dhinacyada: 12s ama 12 (3 ilaa 999). Ka dib, radius-ka Riix/jiid Masaafo Dherer. Mid diidan wuxuu u socdaa dhanka kale Guuri Masaafo Dherer (u socda dhanka taabashada), ama barta ama kala-fogaan. Nuqul ka dib: 3x, *3, /3 Wareeji Xagal Darajooyin: 90, -45, 22.5 Miisaan Miisaan Factor ka weyn 0: 2, 0.5, 1.25 Teef Ka fogaan ama Dherer Dherer Kala qaybi Qaybo Immisa qayb oo isle'eg: 5, 5s ama /5 (2 ilaa 1000). Eeg Kala qaybi geesta ama curve qaybo isle'eg Cabbir Ka fogaan, ka dibna Dherer Meesha uu khadka cabbirku gelayo; marka dhigidda ka dib, dherer cusub ayaa cabbiraysa moodeelka Dooro Qiimaha Marka hal cabbir ama geeso la doortay, dherer cusub ayaa cabbiraysa moodeelka. Eeg Cabbir iyo cabbiraysa Barta iyo kala-fogaanka Marka Xarriiq iyo Guuri, ka dib taabashada koowaad: [x,y,z] wuxuu u gudbaa barta saxda ah ee moodeelka (dhuruuda kooxda marka aad tafatirayso gudaha kooxda). Tusaale: [0,0,3m] waa 3 m sare ee meesha asalka ah. \u003Cdx,dy,dz\u003E wuxuu u gudbaa masaafadaas ka bilowga taabashada koowaad, dhinaca casaan, cagaar iyo buluug. Tusaale: \u003C0,0,10'\u003E waa 10 feet toosan sare. Qiimaha saddexdaba mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay unitkiisa: \u003C12',0,6\"\u003E. Nuqullo ka dib guuritaanka Isla markaa ka dib nuqul Guuri: Qoraal Samaynaya 3x ama *3 3 nuqul oo isku xiga, isku masaafo /3 3 nuqul oo si siman loo kala faafiyay asalka ilaa nuqulka koowaad Ilaa 500 nuqul. Eeg Guuri, nuqul iyo samee array-yo. Dherero qoran waxay u baahan yihiin jihada Dherer keligiis oo la qoro wuxuu u socdaa dhanka uu taabashadu ku tilmaamayo taabashada koowaad. Haddii aad qorto isla markaa ka dib gujinta, adoon weli wax dhaqaajin, jihadu weli ma jirto, wax ma dhicin. Dhaqaajiso taabashada xoogaa dhanka aad rabto inaad tagto, kadibna qor. Unitka moodeelka Beddel unitka doorashada midig hoose: ft iyo in, in, ft, yd, mi, mil, µm, mm, cm, m ama km, illaa intii ay ku shidan yihiin Dejinta › Guud › Cutubyada (unitka moodeelka laftiisa had iyo jeer waa jira). Dherer lagu qoro calaamadda unit kasta waxaa loo akhriyaa unitkaas. Eeg Unitada, qiimaha qoran iyo liisaska unitada. Wuxuu beddelaa sida cabbirada loo muujiyo iyo sida tirooyinka calaamad la'aanta ah loo akhriyo; moodeelka ayaa isku cabbir ah. Unitka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Sida cabbirada loo muujiyo: Unit Dherero Balacyo Mugyo ft iyo in 10' 6 1/2\" (ilaa 1/16\") sq ft cu ft in 126 1/2\" sq in cu in m 3.2 m m² m³ cm 320 cm cm² cm³ mm 3200 mm m² ka 0.01 m² ka hoose, haddii kale mm² m³ ka 0.01 m³ ka hoose, haddii kale mm³ Moodeel cusub wuxuu bilaabmaa feet iyo inji marka luuqada browser-ka ay tahay gobol Mareykanka (iyo Liberia iyo Myanmar), iyo millimitir meel kasta. Unit la xiddigeeyay Dejinta › Guud › Cutubyada ayaa la isticmaalaa halkii, marka ModelCraft ay haysato. Ama beddel doorashada ka dib Cusub.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"formats","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Qaababka faylka si faahfaahsan","summary":"Waxa saxda ah ee qaab kasta oo ModelCraft furto, soo dhoofiyo iyo soo saaro ilaaliyo, beddelo, ama ka reebo.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["qaababka","noocyada faylka","modelcraft","json","3dm","nurbs","skp","collada","dae","obj","mtl","gltf","glb","stl","step","stp","ap214","ap242","ply","alembic","abc","cache","fbx","3mf","ifc","dwg","dxf","unitiyada","dhidibbada","y sare","z sare","millimitir","xadka"],"headings":[{"id":"modelcraft-modelcraft","text":"ModelCraft (.modelcraft)","level":2},{"id":"usd-usd-usda-usdc-usdz","text":"USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz)","level":2},{"id":"collada-dae","text":"Collada (.dae)","level":2},{"id":"obj-obj-mtl","text":"OBJ (.obj, .mtl)","level":2},{"id":"gltf-glb-gltf","text":"glTF (.glb, .gltf)","level":2},{"id":"stl-stl","text":"STL (.stl)","level":2},{"id":"step-step-stp","text":"STEP (.step, .stp)","level":2},{"id":"3dm","text":".3dm","level":2},{"id":"ply-ply","text":"PLY (.ply)","level":2},{"id":"fbx-fbx","text":"FBX (.fbx)","level":2},{"id":"alembic-abc","text":"Alembic (.abc)","level":2},{"id":"3mf-3mf","text":"3MF (.3mf)","level":2},{"id":"soo-saarista-dwg-iyo-dxf-dwg-dxf","text":"Soo saarista DWG iyo DXF (.dwg, .dxf)","level":2},{"id":"ifc-ifc","text":"IFC (.ifc)","level":2},{"id":"dwg-dwg-iyo-dxf-dxf","text":"DWG (.dwg) iyo DXF (.dxf)","level":2},{"id":"faylasha-skp","text":"Faylasha SKP","level":2},{"id":"lama-taageero","text":"Lama taageero","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka ModelCraft wuxuu ku jiraa mitir, Z (buluug) ayaa sare. Qaab kasta oo hoos ku qoran waa la beddelaa ama laga beddelaa taas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"modelcraft-modelcraft\"\u003EModelCraft (.modelcraft)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ama ku deji muuqaalka. Faylasha dhamaadkoodu yahay \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ayaa sidoo kale la aqbalaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), sida soo dejinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaalinaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax walba: joomatariga, wajiyada iyo midabkooda, agabka iyo teexturada la soo dhoofiyay, nalalka, geesaha nuugan, kooxaha, qaybaha, magacyada, hagayaasha, muuqaallada, unitiyada, iyo kamarada iyo qaabka ugu dambeeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa reebta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda ka noqoshada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E200 MB\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka ay kaydiyeen ModelCraft cusub oo ka cusub kan adiga leedahay waa la diidaa: &quot;Moodelkan waxaa kaydiyay ModelCraft cusub (nooca faylka …). Cusboonaysii ModelCraft si aad u furto.&quot; Faylka aan ahayn moodel ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Faylkan maaha moodel ModelCraft (ma aha JSON).&quot; ama &quot;Kani maaha fayl ModelCraft aan furi karno: …&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usd-usd-usda-usdc-usdz\"\u003EUSD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur, soo dhoofi, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…\u003C/span\u003E. Fayl USD ah oo ModelCraft kaydiyay mar kale wax lumin ma furmaa; faylasha USD ee barnaamijyada kale waxay u furmaan sida meshes, kooxo, qaybo, nal iyo kamaro. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EKaydi, fur iyo soo saar USD\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"collada-dae\"\u003ECollada (.dae)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Qaabka ugu fiican ee moodel la is-beddelo modeler 3D kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar:\u003C/strong\u003E Collada 1.4.1, Z sare, mitir. Hal joomatari oo koox kasta ama qayb kasta; qaybaha mar bay la qoraa oo tixraac ayaa lagu dhigaa, sidaas darteed way la wadaagaan. Wajiyada godad ama xuduud gudaha ku leh waxaa loo kala jaraa saddex-geesood. Midabyadu waxay noqdaan agab. Geesaha furan waxaa loo qoraa xariiqyo. Magacyada aan qaabkan ku habboonayn waa la hagaajiyaa, magaca saxda ahna waxaa lagu sii haya dhinaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E saddex-geesood, poligonno (godad leh), dabaaldeg-saddex-geesood iyo xarriijin ayaa noqda wajiyo; xariiqyadu waxay noqdaan geesaha. Beddelka nodes-ka, dhidibka sare ee faylka iyo unitigiisa ayaa la dabaqaa. Node la dhigay meelo dhowr ah, ama joomatari ay isticmaalaan nodes dhowr, waxay imaan doontaa qayb; nodes kale waxay imaan doonaan kooxo. Midabyada agabka (diffuse) waxay noqdaan midabyada wajiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama soo dhoofin:\u003C/strong\u003E teexturada, maqaarka iyo morphs, kamaroyada, nalalka, qaabab beddel gaar ah (look-at iyo skew), iyo tixraacyada faylal kale. Bar xaaladdu ayaa tiriya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa lumaa marka la soo saarayo:\u003C/strong\u003E geesaha nuugan oo ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EMarka la soo dhoofiyo,\u003C/strong\u003E dusha saddex-geesood ah waxay ku sii jiraan saddex-geesood, diagonalkooduna waa la nuugaa si meelaha siman ay u akhriyan hal dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"obj-obj-mtl\"\u003EOBJ (.obj, .mtl)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi iyo soo saar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E ku deji \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E oo ay weheliyaan \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyo sawirrada teexturada (ama soo dhoofi \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E keliya: wuxuu imanayaa aan agab lahayn, bar xaaladduna wuxuu magacaabaa \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E uu doonayay). Waxaa la akhriyaa mitir iyo Y sare. Shay kasta (\u003Ccode\u003Eo\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003Eg\u003C/code\u003E haddii kale) waxay noqotaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E, wajiyadeeda sidooda ayay u ilaaliyaan (afar-geesle waxay ahaanayaan afar-geesle). Isku-xidhka teexturada, normals (jihooyinka wajiga) iyo midabyada barta kasta ayaa la ilaalinayaa. Sawirka midabka agabka (\u003Ccode\u003Emap_Kd\u003C/code\u003E, PNG, JPEG ama WebP) wuxuu imanayaa sida teexture, oo leh ikhtiyaarrada miisaanka iyo kala-guuritaanka; haddii kale midabkiisa (\u003Ccode\u003EKd\u003C/code\u003E). Geesaha halka jihooyinka faylka kala go&#039;an yihiin waa adag; haddii jihooyin aan jirin, kooxaha nuugista faylka ayaa go&#039;aan qaadanaya. Khariidado kale (bump, normal), barar, xariiqyo iyo qalino waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay. OBJ ma leh unit, sidaas darteed moodel loo sameeyay millimitir ama inji wuxuu yimaadaa cabbir qaldan: miisaan ka dhig soo dhoofinta ka dib (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003EWareeji iyo miisaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar:\u003C/strong\u003E mitir, Y sare, isku-xidhka adduunka. Shay kasta oo kooxda ah hal shay; qaybaha si buuxda ayaa loo qoraa meel kasta oo lagu dhigo. Meshes waxay ilaaliyaan wajiyadooda, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo normals; wajiyada ay isku xidheen \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003Egeesaha nuugan\u003C/a\u003E waxay helaan normal geesood kasta. Marka moodelku midab leeyahay, \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E ayaa la soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E ag dhinac. Marka ay teexturo la soo dhoofiyay leedahay, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyo sawirrada waxaa hal \u003Ccode\u003E.zip\u003C/code\u003E ah wada la soo dejiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka:\u003C/strong\u003E 2 milyan oo bar ama wajig; 64 MB qoraal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gltf-glb-gltf\"\u003EglTF (.glb, .gltf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi iyo soo saar, glTF 2.0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E oo ay weheliyaan \u003Ccode\u003E.bin\u003C/code\u003E iyo faylasha teexturada: ku deji muuqaalka hal mar (ama dooro \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E keliya la siiyo wuxuu magacaabaa faylka uu u baahan yahay: &quot;Faylkan \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay &quot;…&quot;: fur nuqulka \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E, ama ku deji \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E oo ay weheliyaan faylasha.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeshes\u003C/strong\u003E waxay imanayaan sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emeshes\u003C/a\u003E, mid kasta oo mesh ah faylka ku jira, iyada oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta la ilaalinayo. Geesaha halka normals-ka faylka kala go&#039;an yihiin waa adag; kuwa kale waa nuugan. Mesh la isticmaalo meelo dhowr ah wuu wadaagaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENodes\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan kooxo, oo magacooda la siiyaa sida faylka ku jira. Meshes-ka nuqul ahaan loo isticmaalay (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) waxay imanayaan hal mesh oo meelo badan lagu dhigay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka:\u003C/strong\u003E teexture midabka aasaasiga ah (PNG, JPEG ama WebP) wuxuu imanayaa sida teexture, oo lagu dhigayaa isku-xidhka teexturada faylka (iyo beddelka teexturada haddii uu jiro), waana la ilaalinayaa markaad kaydinayso; haddii kale midabka aasaasiga. Metal, roughness, khariidadaha normal, muraayadda, clear coat, sheen iyo kordhinta agabka kale waa la akhriyaa laakiin weli ma ilaalinayno: bar xaaladdu way sheegtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENalalka\u003C/strong\u003E (KHR_lights_punctual): nalalka barta iyo nalalka iftiinka gaarka ah waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Enal\u003C/a\u003E. Nalalka jihada ah waa la tiriyaa: qorraxdu moodelka ayay iftiinaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKamaroyada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Emuuqaallo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJilayaasha maqaarka ku xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E waxay imanayaan iyagoo istaagan sida faylku ku hayo; lafahooda, dhaqdhaqaaqooda iyo morph targets waa la tiriyaa oo weli ma ilaalinayno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha la kala-kaxeeyay\u003C/strong\u003E (Draco, meshopt) iyo xogta quantized waa la akhriyaa. Fakoodarrada waxay soo gelayaan kaliya faylka u baahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarar iyo xariiqyo waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay (mesh wuxuu haystaa wajiyo). Teexturada KTX2 waa la ka reebay; wajiyadu midabkooda way hayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E): glTF 2.0 binary, mitir, Y sare. Hal mesh qeexid kasta, sidaas darteed qaybaha way la wadaagaan. Meshes waxay ilaaliyaan normals-kooda, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta; wajiyada ay isku xidheen \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003Egeesaha nuugan\u003C/a\u003E waxay sidaan jihooyin siman. Midabyada iyo agabyadu waxay noqdaan agab (agab waa midabkiisa); teexturada la soo dhoofiyay waxay noqdaan teexture. Nalalka shidan waxay noqdaan nalal barta iyo kuwa jihada leh (nalalka aagga ma leh isbeddel glTF, waa la ka reebay); muuqaallada waxay noqdaan kamaroyo. Geesaha furan waa la ka reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka:\u003C/strong\u003E faylal ilaa 300 MB; qiyaas ahaan 130 milyan oo tiro joomatari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stl-stl\"\u003ESTL (.stl)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi iyo soo saar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E binary ama ASCII. STL ma leh unit: waxaa loo akhriyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitir\u003C/strong\u003E, sida daabacayaasha iyo soo saarista ModelCraft qiimaha u qoraan. Geesaha isku meel ku yaal waa la isku xidhaa, sidaas darteed qayb xidhan waxay imanaysaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E xidhan. Midabyada faylka (heshiisyada VisCAM / SolidView iyo Materialise) wajiyada ayay rinjiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar,\u003C/strong\u003E daabacaadda 3D ahaan: binary STL, \u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitir\u003C/strong\u003E, Z sare. Saddex-geesood keliya: kooxaha iyo geesaha furan waa la ka reebay. Wajiyada rinjiyeysan midabkooda waxay ku qornaa heshiiska VisCAM / SolidView, kaas oo barnaamijyada kale ka indho-tirtiraan haddii aanay akhrin. Soo saar jir xidhan si daabacaaddu u nadiif noqoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-step-stp\"\u003ESTEP (.step, .stp)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi kaliya. STEP waa waxa modeler-yada qaybaha iyo bixiyayaasha u diraan: faylasha AP203, AP214 iyo AP242.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft faylka isagu akhriyaa, bogga gudihiisa, oo jir kasta wuxuu u beddelaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E xidhan oo saddex-geesood ah: wajiyada siman ayay siman yihiin, wajiyada cudurran (silinda, koone, sfeer, torus, dusha B-spline) waxay noqdaan kuwo yar oo siman, geesaha gudaha hal wajig cudurran ah waa nuugan, geesaha u dhexeeya laba wajig waa adag. Faylasha STEP waxay sheegaan unitigooda; moodelku wuxuu imanayaa cabbirkiisa runta ah. Isku-dhisme wuxuu imanayaa qayb kasta meeshii faylku ku dhigay, qayb kasta mesh gaar ah oo koox ku magac ah faylka. Midabyada, magacyada qaybaha ee qaab-dhismeedka iyo dulqaadka (PMI) lama akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFariimo:\u003C/strong\u003E waxa la dhaafay ama la sawiray si ka cidhiidhi yar waxaa lagu daraa xariga xaaladda (&quot;Notes: …&quot;); fayl aan jir lahayn, fayl qaldan ama mid xadka ka dambeeya wuxuu sheegaa sababta wax kuma daro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka:\u003C/strong\u003E faylal ilaa 300 MB; 400 000 wajood iyo 8 milyan saddex-geesood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3dm\"\u003E.3dm\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi kaliya. Faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxay haystaan moodelada NURBS: polysurfaces, dusha, meshes, qalino iyo bloogyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft faylka isagu akhriyaa, bogga gudihiisa. Meshes waxay imanayaan sidaas oo kale; wajig kasta oo polysurface ama extrusion ah wuxuu ka imanayaa meshka sawirka ee lagu kaydiyay faylka, haddii kale ModelCraft wuu saddex-geesood ka dhigaa (diyaaradaha, dusha NURBS, dusha wareegga, qalino la jiidey, extrusion; geesahooda ayaa lagu jarayaa, polysurface xidhan waa mesh xidhan). Qalinadu waxay noqdaan geesaha, bloogyadu waxay noqdaan qaybo (bloog gudaha bloog waa la ilaalinayaa), layers-ku waxay noqdaan tags (waa qarsan yihiin marka ay damaan), midabka shayga (kiisa, layer-kiisa ama agabkiisa) wajiyadiisa ayuu rinjiyeeyaa. Faylku wuxuu sheegaa unitigiisa; moodelku wuxuu imanayaa cabbirkiisa runta ah. Tallaabo tallaabo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\"\u003ESoo geli moodel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFariimo:\u003C/strong\u003E xariga xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa wajiyo intee ah ka yimid meshes-ka la kaydiyay iyo intee ah saddex-geesood loo beddelay, wuxuuna magacaabaa waxa laga reebay: barar, daruurta barar, qoraal, cabbirro, hatches, nalal, shayada SubD, wajiyada noocyada dusha aan weli la akhriyin, bloogyada lagu xidhay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka:\u003C/strong\u003E faylal ilaa 300 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ply-ply\"\u003EPLY (.ply)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi iyo soo saar, meshes midab leh (iska-baadhista, daabacaadda 3D midab leh, modelerada kale).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dhoofi:\u003C/strong\u003E ASCII iyo binary. Wajiyadu waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta la ilaalinayo; wajig kasta waxaa rinjiyeeya midabka ugu dhow ee 4,096 midab, si aad midabyada hadda u aragto. PLY ma leh unit iyo heshiis dhidib: isku-xidhyadu sidooda ayay imanayaan (mitir, Z sare). PLY oo barar keliya leh waa daruur barar: ku fur BimCraft ama CivilCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo saar:\u003C/strong\u003E binary PLY oo leh booska, normals iyo midabyada (iyo isku-xidhka teexturada marka moodelku leeyahay), mitir, Z sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fbx-fbx\"\u003EFBX (.fbx)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi kaliya. Faylasha FBX 7 (laga bilaabo 2011), binary ama ASCII, oo akhriyaha ModelCraft u akhriyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeshes waxay imanayaan sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emeshes\u003C/a\u003E oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada (UV set kasta) iyo midabyada barta leh; mesh ay shayo dhowr isticmaalaan way wadaagtaa. Shayada waxay noqdaan kooxo beddelkooda (pivots, offsets iyo pre-rotations ku jira).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgabka: teexturada diffuse — ee faylka ku jirta, ama sawir lagu dhigay \u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E ka dhinac — waxay imanaysaa sida teexture (sawirrada TGA waxaa lagu ilaaliyaa PNG); haddii kale midabka diffuse. Dejinta kale ee agabka waxay sugayaan model agab cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhidibka sare ee faylka iyo unitigiisa ayaa la dabaqaa: wax walba Z sare ayuu imanayaa, mitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENalalka barta iyo nalalka iftiinka gaarka ah waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/lights\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/lights\"\u003Enal\u003C/a\u003E (xoogga FBX ee 100 waa nalka caadiga ah ee ModelCraft, 800 lumens: xoogga FBX ma leh unit). Kamaroyada waxay noqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/scenes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/scenes\"\u003Emuuqaallo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJilayaasha maqaarka ku xidhan waxay imanayaan iyagoo nasasho ku jira; lafaha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa waa la tiriyaa, weli ma ilaalinayno. Nalalka jihada iyo aagga, iyo joomatari aan ahayn meshes (NURBS, qalino), waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha FBX 6 iyo kuwa ka hore waa la diidaa: mar kale ku kaydi FBX 2011 ama mid ka cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alembic-abc\"\u003EAlembic (.abc)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi kaliya: kaydinta joomatariga barnaamijyada dhaqdhaqaaqa iyo saameynta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeshes (polygon iyo subdivision) waxay imanayaan sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emeshes\u003C/a\u003E, oo isku-xidhka teexturada iyo normals; beddelada waxay noqdaan kooxo. Alembic waa Y sare oo waa la rogaa Z sare; mitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydin leh tusaale badan (dhaqdhaqaaq) waxay imanaysaa tusaalaha koowaad; bar xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa inta ay leedahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarar, qalino, dusha NURBS, kamaroyo iyo nalal waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay. Faylasha qaabka HDF5 ee hore waa la diidaa: mar kale ku kaydi faylka Ogawa Alembic.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu marka hore hubiyaa qaabka, kadibna wuxuu qoraa xulashada, ama wax kasta oo la muujinayo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3mf-3mf\"\u003E3MF (.3mf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo saar kaliya, laga bilaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E. 3MF core: hal mesh \u003Cstrong\u003Emillimitir\u003C/strong\u003E, Z sare, midabyadiisa agab ahaan. Inta badan barnaamijyada jeexista way akhriyaan, oo STL ka duwan wuxuu sheegaa unitigiisa. Waxyaabaha qarsan waa la ka reebay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saarista-dwg-iyo-dxf-dwg-dxf\"\u003ESoo saarista DWG iyo DXF (.dwg, .dxf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijyada CAD. Moodelka unitigiisa ayaa lagu qoraa: inji moodelada fit iyo inji, haddii kale millimitir, santimitir ama mitir (bar xaaladdu magacaabaa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWajiyada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan wajiyo 3D (saddex-geesood). Xariiqyada gudaha wajiga, iyo geesaha nuugan, waa lagu qoraa kuwo aan muuqan, sidaas darteed wajiyadu waxay u egyihiin kuwa ModelCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha furan\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan xariiqyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKooxaha iyo qaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E waxay noqdaan bloogyo: qayb mar bay la qoraa oo waxay u dhigan tahay inta la isticmaalo, nuqullada la rogay iyo kuwa lagu muraayadeeyay ku jira. Koox la fidiyay ka dib markii la rogay (sidaas darteed way foorarsan tahay) meeshiisii ayaa lagu qoraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidabyada:\u003C/strong\u003E DWG wuxuu ilaalinayaa midabka wajig kasta si sax ah; DXF wuxuu isticmaalaa midabka ugu dhow ee 255 midab oo CAD-ka caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENoocyada:\u003C/strong\u003E DWG waxaa lagu qoraa AutoCAD 2004 (AC1018), kaas oo barnaamijyada CAD ee 2004 ka dambeeya furtaan. DXF waa R12 (AC1009), nooca ay akhriyaan barnaamij kasta oo CAD; R12 ma leh goob unit, sidaas darteed u sheeg barnaamijka CAD unitiga uu isticmaali doono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama qorin:\u003C/strong\u003E hagayaasha, cabbirrada, muuqaallada iyo kamarada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ifc-ifc\"\u003EIFC (.ifc)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo saar kaliya, BimCraft iyo barnaamijyada BIM kale. IFC4 oo leh mashruuc, goob, dhismo iyo dabaqyadiisa. Koox ama qayb kasta oo sare waxay noqotaa hal wakiil qayb dhismeed oo magacyadiisa leh; kuwa xidhan waxaa loo qoraa qaabab jir ah (faceted breps), kuwa furan waxaa loo qoraa moodelo dusha ah; godadka wajiyada waa la ilaalinayaa. Joomatari furan oo sare wuxuu noqdaa hal qayb oo la yiraahdo &quot;Loose geometry&quot;. Noocyo, hanti ama agab ma jiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabaqyada:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDabaqyada IFC…\u003C/span\u003E ayaa liistaa, mid kasta magac iyo sare-u-kaca (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar dabaq\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saadaal moodelka\u003C/span\u003E, kaas oo dabaq u sameeya dherer kasta oo kooxaha sare ay taagan yihiin). Soo saarista, koox kasta ama qayb kasta dabaqa hoose ama isku mid ah ee ku dhow dhibcaha ugu hooseeya ayay saaraa, meeshiisana way ilaalisaa. Dabaq la&#039;aan, wax walba waxay ku jiraan hal dabaq, &quot;Level 1&quot;, ee 0. Dabaqyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dwg-dwg-iyo-dxf-dxf\"\u003EDWG (.dwg) iyo DXF (.dxf)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo dhoofi sida xariiqyo dhulka (hatches iyo 3D faces sida wajiyo); soo saar sida kor lagu qoray. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/site-plan\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/site-plan\"\u003EMoodel qorshe goob ah ku dhig\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri:\u003C/strong\u003E xariiqyo, polylines (qaansooyin ku jira), 3D polylines, goobo, qaansooyin, iyo tixraacyo bloog oo ay ku jiraan array-yada, meesha moodelka. Shayada aan muuqan (sida gobolada qarsan ee bloogga firfircoon) waa la ka reebay. Qalinada waxay noqdaan 48 qayb toos ah wareeg kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri tan iyo 0.4:\u003C/strong\u003E splines iyo ellipses (sida geesaha), qoraal, qoraal dhowr-sadar iyo qiimaha sifooyinka (sida geesaha qoraal hal-jid ah), hatches (wajiyo godad leh), 3D faces iyo buuxinta jirka (wajiyo), iyo cabbirro (laga sawiray bloogyada cabbirka ee sawirka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri tan iyo 0.7:\u003C/strong\u003E jirarka 3D, gobolada iyo jidadka (xogta ACIS, DWG iyo DXF nooc kasta), mid kasta koox gaar ah, kuwa xidhan waxay noqdaan jir. Wajiyada dusha aan diyaarad, silinda, koone, sfeer, torus iyo dusha spline fudud ahayn waa la ka reebay oo waa la liistaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama akhriyo:\u003C/strong\u003E barar, miisaska, multileaders, sawirrada, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira paper space.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada:\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa laga qaadaa sawirka markuu sheego. Haddii kale, ModelCraft ayaa weydiiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDXF\u003C/strong\u003E waa inuu noqdaa ASCII. DXF binary waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha DWG\u003C/strong\u003E ee AutoCAD R13 ilaa qaabka hadda (AutoCAD 2018 iyo ka dambeeya; AC1012 ilaa AC1032) waxaa akhrinaya akhriyaha DWG ee ModelCraft, bogga gudihiisa; waa qayb ka mid ah ModelCraft, sidaas darteed wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka kasta oo ModelCraft uu offline shaqeeyo. Noocyada hore (R12 iyo ka hor) iyo faylal aad u qaldan ma akhriyi karaan; ku kaydi DXF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka:\u003C/strong\u003E kala-koobka ka fog bilowga 10,000 km, ama in ka badan 2 milyan oo qayb xariiq, waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha-skp\"\u003EFaylasha SKP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E (ama ku deji muuqaalka faylka) wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha SketchUp akhriyaha ModelCraft ee gaarka ah, bogga gudihiisa: waxba lama soo raro, oo wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka kasta oo ModelCraft uu offline shaqeeyo. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay faylasha SketchUp 3, 6, 7, 2014, 2017, 2018, 2020, 2025 iyo 2026; noocyada kale way furmi karaan, laakiin wali lama isku dayin. Moodelku wuxuu imanayaa hal koox oo magaceeda faylka ku salaysan. Hal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa mar kale ka saaraa. Tallaabo tallaabo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ESoo geli moodel SKP\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlaalinaya:\u003C/strong\u003E wajiyada godadkooda, kooxaha (sida kooxo) iyo qaybaha (sida qaybo, la wadaago), magacyadooda iyo meelaha ay ku dhigan yihiin, midabyada, tags-ka kooxaha iyo qaybaha, geesaha aan qayb ka ahayn wajig, iyo geesaha nuugan iyo siman, si dusha wareegsan ay siman ku sii jirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMidabyada:\u003C/strong\u003E agabka wajig kasta ayaa siinaya midabkiisa. Agab lagu rinjiyeeyay koox ama qayb ayaa noqda rinjiga meeshaas, sidaas darteed wajiyada gudihiisa midab aan lahayn ayaa qaadanaya, sida SketchUp; qayb lagu rinjiyeeyay laba midab ayaa ku sii jirta hal qayb.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETags\u003C/strong\u003E ee kooxaha iyo qaybaha waxay noqdaan tags ModelCraft, la muujiyay ama qarsan sida ay ahaayeen. Tags ee wajiyada furan iyo geesaha lama ilaalinayo (ModelCraft wuxuu tag ku dhejiyaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha keliya); bar xaaladdu wuu tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxyaabaha qarsan waxay imanayaan qarsan\u003C/strong\u003E (wajiyo, geesaha, kooxo, qaybo, iyo wajiyo iyo geesaha tag qarsan ku jira), si aad u aragto waxa SketchUp muujiyay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa muujiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETeexturada:\u003C/strong\u003E wajig lagu rinjiyeeyay agab teexturo leh wuxuu ilaalinayaa teexturadiisa, meeshii faylku ku dhigay, faylka ModelCraft wuxuu ilaalinayaa sawirka. Teexturada koox ama qayb oo dhan, teexturada ka maqan faylka, ama sawir aan browser-ku muujin karin (sida faylka Photoshop) waxay ilaalinaysaa midabka agabkiisa kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa la ka reebay, waxaana bar xaaladda lagu tiraa:\u003C/strong\u003E sawirrada lagu dhigay moodelka. Qoraalka, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha qaybta, muuqaallada iyo qaababka lama akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada:\u003C/strong\u003E faylasha SketchUp dhexdooda inji ayay ku jiraan; ModelCraft wuu beddelaa, sidaas darteed cabbirku waa sax unit kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E lama dhisin. Si aad moodel ugu celiso SketchUp, soo saar Collada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lama-taageero\"\u003ELama taageero\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ma furi karo faylasha 3DS ama IFC, mana kaydin karo faylasha 3DS, FBX, STEP, \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ama SketchUp (\u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Moodelka ModelCraft wuxuu ku jiraa mitir, Z (buluug) ayaa sare. Qaab kasta oo hoos ku qoran waa la beddelaa ama laga beddelaa taas. ModelCraft (.modelcraft) Waxa Faahfaahin Fur Fur (Ctrl+O) ama ku deji muuqaalka. Faylasha dhamaadkoodu yahay .json ayaa sidoo kale la aqbalaa Kaydi Kaydi (Ctrl+S), sida soo dejinta Ilaalinaya Wax walba: joomatariga, wajiyada iyo midabkooda, agabka iyo teexturada la soo dhoofiyay, nalalka, geesaha nuugan, kooxaha, qaybaha, magacyada, hagayaasha, muuqaallada, unitiyada, iyo kamarada iyo qaabka ugu dambeeya Ka reebta Taariikhda ka noqoshada Xadka 200 MB Faylka ay kaydiyeen ModelCraft cusub oo ka cusub kan adiga leedahay waa la diidaa: \"Moodelkan waxaa kaydiyay ModelCraft cusub (nooca faylka …). Cusboonaysii ModelCraft si aad u furto.\" Faylka aan ahayn moodel ModelCraft wuxuu leeyahay \"Faylkan maaha moodel ModelCraft (ma aha JSON).\" ama \"Kani maaha fayl ModelCraft aan furi karno: …\". USD (.usd, .usda, .usdc, .usdz) Fur, soo dhoofi, iyo Kaydi sida ama Soo saar › USD (.usda, .usdc, .usdz)…. Fayl USD ah oo ModelCraft kaydiyay mar kale wax lumin ma furmaa; faylasha USD ee barnaamijyada kale waxay u furmaan sida meshes, kooxo, qaybo, nal iyo kamaro. Eeg Kaydi, fur iyo soo saar USD. Collada (.dae) Soo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Qaabka ugu fiican ee moodel la is-beddelo modeler 3D kale. Soo saar: Collada 1.4.1, Z sare, mitir. Hal joomatari oo koox kasta ama qayb kasta; qaybaha mar bay la qoraa oo tixraac ayaa lagu dhigaa, sidaas darteed way la wadaagaan. Wajiyada godad ama xuduud gudaha ku leh waxaa loo kala jaraa saddex-geesood. Midabyadu waxay noqdaan agab. Geesaha furan waxaa loo qoraa xariiqyo. Magacyada aan qaabkan ku habboonayn waa la hagaajiyaa, magaca saxda ahna waxaa lagu sii haya dhinaciisa. Soo dhoofi: saddex-geesood, poligonno (godad leh), dabaaldeg-saddex-geesood iyo xarriijin ayaa noqda wajiyo; xariiqyadu waxay noqdaan geesaha. Beddelka nodes-ka, dhidibka sare ee faylka iyo unitigiisa ayaa la dabaqaa. Node la dhigay meelo dhowr ah, ama joomatari ay isticmaalaan nodes dhowr, waxay imaan doontaa qayb; nodes kale waxay imaan doonaan kooxo. Midabyada agabka (diffuse) waxay noqdaan midabyada wajiga. Lama soo dhoofin: teexturada, maqaarka iyo morphs, kamaroyada, nalalka, qaabab beddel gaar ah (look-at iyo skew), iyo tixraacyada faylal kale. Bar xaaladdu ayaa tiriya. Waa lumaa marka la soo saarayo: geesaha nuugan oo ah. Marka la soo dhoofiyo, dusha saddex-geesood ah waxay ku sii jiraan saddex-geesood, diagonalkooduna waa la nuugaa si meelaha siman ay u akhriyan hal dusha. OBJ (.obj, .mtl) Soo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Soo dhoofi: ku deji .obj oo ay weheliyaan .mtl iyo sawirrada teexturada (ama soo dhoofi .obj keliya: wuxuu imanayaa aan agab lahayn, bar xaaladduna wuxuu magacaabaa .mtl uu doonayay). Waxaa la akhriyaa mitir iyo Y sare. Shay kasta (o, ama g haddii kale) waxay noqotaa mesh, wajiyadeeda sidooda ayay u ilaaliyaan (afar-geesle waxay ahaanayaan afar-geesle). Isku-xidhka teexturada, normals (jihooyinka wajiga) iyo midabyada barta kasta ayaa la ilaalinayaa. Sawirka midabka agabka (map_Kd, PNG, JPEG ama WebP) wuxuu imanayaa sida teexture, oo leh ikhtiyaarrada miisaanka iyo kala-guuritaanka; haddii kale midabkiisa (Kd). Geesaha halka jihooyinka faylka kala go'an yihiin waa adag; haddii jihooyin aan jirin, kooxaha nuugista faylka ayaa go'aan qaadanaya. Khariidado kale (bump, normal), barar, xariiqyo iyo qalino waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay. OBJ ma leh unit, sidaas darteed moodel loo sameeyay millimitir ama inji wuxuu yimaadaa cabbir qaldan: miisaan ka dhig soo dhoofinta ka dib (eeg Wareeji iyo miisaan). Soo saar: mitir, Y sare, isku-xidhka adduunka. Shay kasta oo kooxda ah hal shay; qaybaha si buuxda ayaa loo qoraa meel kasta oo lagu dhigo. Meshes waxay ilaaliyaan wajiyadooda, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo normals; wajiyada ay isku xidheen geesaha nuugan waxay helaan normal geesood kasta. Marka moodelku midab leeyahay, .mtl ayaa la soo dejiyaa .obj ag dhinac. Marka ay teexturo la soo dhoofiyay leedahay, .obj, .mtl iyo sawirrada waxaa hal .zip ah wada la soo dejiyaa. Xadka: 2 milyan oo bar ama wajig; 64 MB qoraal. glTF (.glb, .gltf) Soo dhoofi iyo soo saar, glTF 2.0. Soo dhoofi: .glb, ama .gltf oo ay weheliyaan .bin iyo faylasha teexturada: ku deji muuqaalka hal mar (ama dooro .glb). .gltf keliya la siiyo wuxuu magacaabaa faylka uu u baahan yahay: \"Faylkan .gltf wuxuu u baahan yahay \"…\": fur nuqulka .glb, ama ku deji .gltf oo ay weheliyaan faylasha.\" Meshes waxay imanayaan sida meshes, mid kasta oo mesh ah faylka ku jira, iyada oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta la ilaalinayo. Geesaha halka normals-ka faylka kala go'an yihiin waa adag; kuwa kale waa nuugan. Mesh la isticmaalo meelo dhowr ah wuu wadaagaa. Nodes waxay noqdaan kooxo, oo magacooda la siiyaa sida faylka ku jira. Meshes-ka nuqul ahaan loo isticmaalay (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) waxay imanayaan hal mesh oo meelo badan lagu dhigay. Agabka: teexture midabka aasaasiga ah (PNG, JPEG ama WebP) wuxuu imanayaa sida teexture, oo lagu dhigayaa isku-xidhka teexturada faylka (iyo beddelka teexturada haddii uu jiro), waana la ilaalinayaa markaad kaydinayso; haddii kale midabka aasaasiga. Metal, roughness, khariidadaha normal, muraayadda, clear coat, sheen iyo kordhinta agabka kale waa la akhriyaa laakiin weli ma ilaalinayno: bar xaaladdu way sheegtaa. Nalalka (KHR_lights_punctual): nalalka barta iyo nalalka iftiinka gaarka ah waxay noqdaan nal. Nalalka jihada ah waa la tiriyaa: qorraxdu moodelka ayay iftiinaysaa. Kamaroyada waxay noqdaan muuqaallo. Jilayaasha maqaarka ku xidhan waxay imanayaan iyagoo istaagan sida faylku ku hayo; lafahooda, dhaqdhaqaaqooda iyo morph targets waa la tiriyaa oo weli ma ilaalinayno. Faylasha la kala-kaxeeyay (Draco, meshopt) iyo xogta quantized waa la akhriyaa. Fakoodarrada waxay soo gelayaan kaliya faylka u baahan. Barar iyo xariiqyo waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay (mesh wuxuu haystaa wajiyo). Teexturada KTX2 waa la ka reebay; wajiyadu midabkooda way hayn. Soo saar (.glb): glTF 2.0 binary, mitir, Y sare. Hal mesh qeexid kasta, sidaas darteed qaybaha way la wadaagaan. Meshes waxay ilaaliyaan normals-kooda, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta; wajiyada ay isku xidheen geesaha nuugan waxay sidaan jihooyin siman. Midabyada iyo agabyadu waxay noqdaan agab (agab waa midabkiisa); teexturada la soo dhoofiyay waxay noqdaan teexture. Nalalka shidan waxay noqdaan nalal barta iyo kuwa jihada leh (nalalka aagga ma leh isbeddel glTF, waa la ka reebay); muuqaallada waxay noqdaan kamaroyo. Geesaha furan waa la ka reebay. Xadka: faylal ilaa 300 MB; qiyaas ahaan 130 milyan oo tiro joomatari. STL (.stl) Soo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Soo dhoofi: binary ama ASCII. STL ma leh unit: waxaa loo akhriyaa millimitir, sida daabacayaasha iyo soo saarista ModelCraft qiimaha u qoraan. Geesaha isku meel ku yaal waa la isku xidhaa, sidaas darteed qayb xidhan waxay imanaysaa mesh xidhan. Midabyada faylka (heshiisyada VisCAM / SolidView iyo Materialise) wajiyada ayay rinjiyaan. Soo saar, daabacaadda 3D ahaan: binary STL, millimitir, Z sare. Saddex-geesood keliya: kooxaha iyo geesaha furan waa la ka reebay. Wajiyada rinjiyeysan midabkooda waxay ku qornaa heshiiska VisCAM / SolidView, kaas oo barnaamijyada kale ka indho-tirtiraan haddii aanay akhrin. Soo saar jir xidhan si daabacaaddu u nadiif noqoto. STEP (.step, .stp) Soo dhoofi kaliya. STEP waa waxa modeler-yada qaybaha iyo bixiyayaasha u diraan: faylasha AP203, AP214 iyo AP242. Soo dhoofi: ModelCraft faylka isagu akhriyaa, bogga gudihiisa, oo jir kasta wuxuu u beddelaa mesh xidhan oo saddex-geesood ah: wajiyada siman ayay siman yihiin, wajiyada cudurran (silinda, koone, sfeer, torus, dusha B-spline) waxay noqdaan kuwo yar oo siman, geesaha gudaha hal wajig cudurran ah waa nuugan, geesaha u dhexeeya laba wajig waa adag. Faylasha STEP waxay sheegaan unitigooda; moodelku wuxuu imanayaa cabbirkiisa runta ah. Isku-dhisme wuxuu imanayaa qayb kasta meeshii faylku ku dhigay, qayb kasta mesh gaar ah oo koox ku magac ah faylka. Midabyada, magacyada qaybaha ee qaab-dhismeedka iyo dulqaadka (PMI) lama akhriyo. Fariimo: waxa la dhaafay ama la sawiray si ka cidhiidhi yar waxaa lagu daraa xariga xaaladda (\"Notes: …\"); fayl aan jir lahayn, fayl qaldan ama mid xadka ka dambeeya wuxuu sheegaa sababta wax kuma daro. Xadka: faylal ilaa 300 MB; 400 000 wajood iyo 8 milyan saddex-geesood. .3dm Soo dhoofi kaliya. Faylasha .3dm waxay haystaan moodelada NURBS: polysurfaces, dusha, meshes, qalino iyo bloogyo. Soo dhoofi: ModelCraft faylka isagu akhriyaa, bogga gudihiisa. Meshes waxay imanayaan sidaas oo kale; wajig kasta oo polysurface ama extrusion ah wuxuu ka imanayaa meshka sawirka ee lagu kaydiyay faylka, haddii kale ModelCraft wuu saddex-geesood ka dhigaa (diyaaradaha, dusha NURBS, dusha wareegga, qalino la jiidey, extrusion; geesahooda ayaa lagu jarayaa, polysurface xidhan waa mesh xidhan). Qalinadu waxay noqdaan geesaha, bloogyadu waxay noqdaan qaybo (bloog gudaha bloog waa la ilaalinayaa), layers-ku waxay noqdaan tags (waa qarsan yihiin marka ay damaan), midabka shayga (kiisa, layer-kiisa ama agabkiisa) wajiyadiisa ayuu rinjiyeeyaa. Faylku wuxuu sheegaa unitigiisa; moodelku wuxuu imanayaa cabbirkiisa runta ah. Tallaabo tallaabo: Soo geli moodel .3dm. Fariimo: xariga xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa wajiyo intee ah ka yimid meshes-ka la kaydiyay iyo intee ah saddex-geesood loo beddelay, wuxuuna magacaabaa waxa laga reebay: barar, daruurta barar, qoraal, cabbirro, hatches, nalal, shayada SubD, wajiyada noocyada dusha aan weli la akhriyin, bloogyada lagu xidhay. Xadka: faylal ilaa 300 MB. PLY (.ply) Soo dhoofi iyo soo saar, meshes midab leh (iska-baadhista, daabacaadda 3D midab leh, modelerada kale). Soo dhoofi: ASCII iyo binary. Wajiyadu waxay noqdaan mesh oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada iyo midabyada barta la ilaalinayo; wajig kasta waxaa rinjiyeeya midabka ugu dhow ee 4,096 midab, si aad midabyada hadda u aragto. PLY ma leh unit iyo heshiis dhidib: isku-xidhyadu sidooda ayay imanayaan (mitir, Z sare). PLY oo barar keliya leh waa daruur barar: ku fur BimCraft ama CivilCraft. Soo saar: binary PLY oo leh booska, normals iyo midabyada (iyo isku-xidhka teexturada marka moodelku leeyahay), mitir, Z sare. FBX (.fbx) Soo dhoofi kaliya. Faylasha FBX 7 (laga bilaabo 2011), binary ama ASCII, oo akhriyaha ModelCraft u akhriyo. Meshes waxay imanayaan sida meshes oo normals, isku-xidhka teexturada (UV set kasta) iyo midabyada barta leh; mesh ay shayo dhowr isticmaalaan way wadaagtaa. Shayada waxay noqdaan kooxo beddelkooda (pivots, offsets iyo pre-rotations ku jira). Agabka: teexturada diffuse — ee faylka ku jirta, ama sawir lagu dhigay .fbx ka dhinac — waxay imanaysaa sida teexture (sawirrada TGA waxaa lagu ilaaliyaa PNG); haddii kale midabka diffuse. Dejinta kale ee agabka waxay sugayaan model agab cusub. Dhidibka sare ee faylka iyo unitigiisa ayaa la dabaqaa: wax walba Z sare ayuu imanayaa, mitir. Nalalka barta iyo nalalka iftiinka gaarka ah waxay noqdaan nal (xoogga FBX ee 100 waa nalka caadiga ah ee ModelCraft, 800 lumens: xoogga FBX ma leh unit). Kamaroyada waxay noqdaan muuqaallo. Jilayaasha maqaarka ku xidhan waxay imanayaan iyagoo nasasho ku jira; lafaha iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa waa la tiriyaa, weli ma ilaalinayno. Nalalka jihada iyo aagga, iyo joomatari aan ahayn meshes (NURBS, qalino), waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay. Faylasha FBX 6 iyo kuwa ka hore waa la diidaa: mar kale ku kaydi FBX 2011 ama mid ka cusub. Alembic (.abc) Soo dhoofi kaliya: kaydinta joomatariga barnaamijyada dhaqdhaqaaqa iyo saameynta. Meshes (polygon iyo subdivision) waxay imanayaan sida meshes, oo isku-xidhka teexturada iyo normals; beddelada waxay noqdaan kooxo. Alembic waa Y sare oo waa la rogaa Z sare; mitir. Kaydin leh tusaale badan (dhaqdhaqaaq) waxay imanaysaa tusaalaha koowaad; bar xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa inta ay leedahay. Barar, qalino, dusha NURBS, kamaroyo iyo nalal waa la tiriyaa oo waa la ka reebay. Faylasha qaabka HDF5 ee hore waa la diidaa: mar kale ku kaydi faylka Ogawa Alembic. Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)… wuxuu marka hore hubiyaa qaabka, kadibna wuxuu qoraa xulashada, ama wax kasta oo la muujinayo. Eeg Diyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D. 3MF (.3mf) Soo saar kaliya, laga bilaabo Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…. 3MF core: hal mesh millimitir, Z sare, midabyadiisa agab ahaan. Inta badan barnaamijyada jeexista way akhriyaan, oo STL ka duwan wuxuu sheegaa unitigiisa. Waxyaabaha qarsan waa la ka reebay. Eeg Diyaari moodelka daabacaadda 3D. Soo saarista DWG iyo DXF (.dwg, .dxf) Barnaamijyada CAD. Moodelka unitigiisa ayaa lagu qoraa: inji moodelada fit iyo inji, haddii kale millimitir, santimitir ama mitir (bar xaaladdu magacaabaa). Wajiyada waxay noqdaan wajiyo 3D (saddex-geesood). Xariiqyada gudaha wajiga, iyo geesaha nuugan, waa lagu qoraa kuwo aan muuqan, sidaas darteed wajiyadu waxay u egyihiin kuwa ModelCraft. Geesaha furan waxay noqdaan xariiqyo. Kooxaha iyo qaybaha waxay noqdaan bloogyo: qayb mar bay la qoraa oo waxay u dhigan tahay inta la isticmaalo, nuqullada la rogay iyo kuwa lagu muraayadeeyay ku jira. Koox la fidiyay ka dib markii la rogay (sidaas darteed way foorarsan tahay) meeshiisii ayaa lagu qoraa. Midabyada: DWG wuxuu ilaalinayaa midabka wajig kasta si sax ah; DXF wuxuu isticmaalaa midabka ugu dhow ee 255 midab oo CAD-ka caadiga ah. Noocyada: DWG waxaa lagu qoraa AutoCAD 2004 (AC1018), kaas oo barnaamijyada CAD ee 2004 ka dambeeya furtaan. DXF waa R12 (AC1009), nooca ay akhriyaan barnaamij kasta oo CAD; R12 ma leh goob unit, sidaas darteed u sheeg barnaamijka CAD unitiga uu isticmaali doono. Lama qorin: hagayaasha, cabbirrada, muuqaallada iyo kamarada. IFC (.ifc) Soo saar kaliya, BimCraft iyo barnaamijyada BIM kale. IFC4 oo leh mashruuc, goob, dhismo iyo dabaqyadiisa. Koox ama qayb kasta oo sare waxay noqotaa hal wakiil qayb dhismeed oo magacyadiisa leh; kuwa xidhan waxaa loo qoraa qaabab jir ah (faceted breps), kuwa furan waxaa loo qoraa moodelo dusha ah; godadka wajiyada waa la ilaalinayaa. Joomatari furan oo sare wuxuu noqdaa hal qayb oo la yiraahdo \"Loose geometry\". Noocyo, hanti ama agab ma jiro. Dabaqyada: Soo saar › Dabaqyada IFC… ayaa liistaa, mid kasta magac iyo sare-u-kaca (Ku dar dabaq, ama Ka saadaal moodelka, kaas oo dabaq u sameeya dherer kasta oo kooxaha sare ay taagan yihiin). Soo saarista, koox kasta ama qayb kasta dabaqa hoose ama isku mid ah ee ku dhow dhibcaha ugu hooseeya ayay saaraa, meeshiisana way ilaalisaa. Dabaq la'aan, wax walba waxay ku jiraan hal dabaq, \"Level 1\", ee 0. Dabaqyada waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka ModelCraft. DWG (.dwg) iyo DXF (.dxf) Soo dhoofi sida xariiqyo dhulka (hatches iyo 3D faces sida wajiyo); soo saar sida kor lagu qoray. Eeg Moodel qorshe goob ah ku dhig. Akhri: xariiqyo, polylines (qaansooyin ku jira), 3D polylines, goobo, qaansooyin, iyo tixraacyo bloog oo ay ku jiraan array-yada, meesha moodelka. Shayada aan muuqan (sida gobolada qarsan ee bloogga firfircoon) waa la ka reebay. Qalinada waxay noqdaan 48 qayb toos ah wareeg kasta. Akhri tan iyo 0.4: splines iyo ellipses (sida geesaha), qoraal, qoraal dhowr-sadar iyo qiimaha sifooyinka (sida geesaha qoraal hal-jid ah), hatches (wajiyo godad leh), 3D faces iyo buuxinta jirka (wajiyo), iyo cabbirro (laga sawiray bloogyada cabbirka ee sawirka). Akhri tan iyo 0.7: jirarka 3D, gobolada iyo jidadka (xogta ACIS, DWG iyo DXF nooc kasta), mid kasta koox gaar ah, kuwa xidhan waxay noqdaan jir. Wajiyada dusha aan diyaarad, silinda, koone, sfeer, torus iyo dusha spline fudud ahayn waa la ka reebay oo waa la liistaa. Lama akhriyo: barar, miisaska, multileaders, sawirrada, iyo wax kasta oo ku jira paper space. Unitiyada: waxaa laga qaadaa sawirka markuu sheego. Haddii kale, ModelCraft ayaa weydiiya. DXF waa inuu noqdaa ASCII. DXF binary waa la diidaa. Faylasha DWG ee AutoCAD R13 ilaa qaabka hadda (AutoCAD 2018 iyo ka dambeeya; AC1012 ilaa AC1032) waxaa akhrinaya akhriyaha DWG ee ModelCraft, bogga gudihiisa; waa qayb ka mid ah ModelCraft, sidaas darteed wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka kasta oo ModelCraft uu offline shaqeeyo. Noocyada hore (R12 iyo ka hor) iyo faylal aad u qaldan ma akhriyi karaan; ku kaydi DXF. Xadka: kala-koobka ka fog bilowga 10,000 km, ama in ka badan 2 milyan oo qayb xariiq, waa la diidaa. Faylasha SKP Soo dhoofi (ama ku deji muuqaalka faylka) wuxuu akhriyaa faylasha SketchUp akhriyaha ModelCraft ee gaarka ah, bogga gudihiisa: waxba lama soo raro, oo wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka kasta oo ModelCraft uu offline shaqeeyo. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay faylasha SketchUp 3, 6, 7, 2014, 2017, 2018, 2020, 2025 iyo 2026; noocyada kale way furmi karaan, laakiin wali lama isku dayin. Moodelku wuxuu imanayaa hal koox oo magaceeda faylka ku salaysan. Hal Ctrl+Z ayaa mar kale ka saaraa. Tallaabo tallaabo: Soo geli moodel SKP. Ilaalinaya: wajiyada godadkooda, kooxaha (sida kooxo) iyo qaybaha (sida qaybo, la wadaago), magacyadooda iyo meelaha ay ku dhigan yihiin, midabyada, tags-ka kooxaha iyo qaybaha, geesaha aan qayb ka ahayn wajig, iyo geesaha nuugan iyo siman, si dusha wareegsan ay siman ku sii jirto. Midabyada: agabka wajig kasta ayaa siinaya midabkiisa. Agab lagu rinjiyeeyay koox ama qayb ayaa noqda rinjiga meeshaas, sidaas darteed wajiyada gudihiisa midab aan lahayn ayaa qaadanaya, sida SketchUp; qayb lagu rinjiyeeyay laba midab ayaa ku sii jirta hal qayb. Tags ee kooxaha iyo qaybaha waxay noqdaan tags ModelCraft, la muujiyay ama qarsan sida ay ahaayeen. Tags ee wajiyada furan iyo geesaha lama ilaalinayo (ModelCraft wuxuu tag ku dhejiyaa kooxaha iyo qaybaha keliya); bar xaaladdu wuu tiriyaa. Waxyaabaha qarsan waxay imanayaan qarsan (wajiyo, geesaha, kooxo, qaybo, iyo wajiyo iyo geesaha tag qarsan ku jira), si aad u aragto waxa SketchUp muujiyay; Muuji dhammaan ayaa muujiya. Teexturada: wajig lagu rinjiyeeyay agab teexturo leh wuxuu ilaalinayaa teexturadiisa, meeshii faylku ku dhigay, faylka ModelCraft wuxuu ilaalinayaa sawirka. Teexturada koox ama qayb oo dhan, teexturada ka maqan faylka, ama sawir aan browser-ku muujin karin (sida faylka Photoshop) waxay ilaalinaysaa midabka agabkiisa kaliya. Waa la ka reebay, waxaana bar xaaladda lagu tiraa: sawirrada lagu dhigay moodelka. Qoraalka, cabbirrada, hagayaasha, diyaaradaha qaybta, muuqaallada iyo qaababka lama akhriyo. Unitiyada: faylasha SketchUp dhexdooda inji ayay ku jiraan; ModelCraft wuu beddelaa, sidaas darteed cabbirku waa sax unit kasta. Kaydinta .skp lama dhisin. Si aad moodel ugu celiso SketchUp, soo saar Collada (.dae). Lama taageero ModelCraft ma furi karo faylasha 3DS ama IFC, mana kaydin karo faylasha 3DS, FBX, STEP, .3dm ama SketchUp (.skp).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"your-machine","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Waxa uu kumbiyuutarkaagu rendar ku sameeyo","summary":"Dejinta › Rendar wuxuu muujinayaa garaafyada, core-yada processor-ka iyo xusuusta ay browserkan u ogolaanayso app-ka inuu isticmaalo, iyo heerka oo go'aaminaya meesha rendarku ka bilaabmo.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["kumbiyuutarkaaga","kaarka garaafyada","gpu","webgpu","webgl","processor","cpu","cores","threads","xusuusta","ram","xusuus la wadaago","go'doon","darajo","heerka","xawaaraha","gaabis","xawaaraha rendarka","laptop"],"headings":[{"id":"heerka","text":"Heerka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ku sii jir tab-ka app-kan, oo hoos u jiid ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendering\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour machine\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo bandhigayaa waxa browserkan u ogolaanayo app-ka inuu rendarka isticmaalo. Waxba ka mid ah ma bannaanaado kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESafka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaheeda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaarka garaafyada ee browserku sheego. &quot;WebGPU&quot; waxa uu macnaheedu yahay inuu qaban karo shaqada rendarka oo dhan; &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; waxa uu macnaheedu yahay muuqaalka toosan iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERender a picture…\u003C/span\u003E ayaa isticmaala (tayo sare oo leh WebGL path tracer), laakiin rendarka muuqaalka iyo safka rendarka, oo u baahan WebGPU, lama bixiyo; software stand-in waxa uu macnaheedu yahay wax walba processor-ka ayaa socda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInta core ee processor-ka browserku sheego\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMemory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaas ahaan inta xusuus ee kombiyuutarku leeyahay, marka browserku sheego. Browserrada qaarkood ma sheegaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShared memory\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaddii bogga la ogolyahay inuu xusuus la wadaago workers-keeda. Marka ON, core kasta wuxuu ka shaqayn karaa hal nuqul oo ka mid ah scene-ka; marka OFF, mid kasta nuqul gaar ah ayuu u baahan yahay, sidaas darteed scene weyn wuxuu ku habboon yahay core yar oo isla waqtiga ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFast processor code\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaddii browserku socodsiiyo code-ka degdega ah ee WebAssembly. Haddii aanu jirin, waxa la isticmaalaa fallback gaabis ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELevel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, basic\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProcessor only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sababta hoosteeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"heerka\"\u003EHeerka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeerku wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Elive view\u003C/a\u003E ka bilaabanto (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFor this computer\u003C/span\u003E), inta shay kala firdhsan ee ay muujiso, iyo inta wejiga ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/modifiers#subdivision-surface\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/modifiers\" data-hash=\"subdivision-surface\"\u003Esubdivision surface\u003C/a\u003E ay ku muujin karto muuqaalka, si kombiyuutar leh chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira ama aan kaarka garaafyo lahayn uu u jawaabo degdeg. Chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira ama telefoon, ama xusuus 4 GB ama ka yar, waligood ma helo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGraphics card, high\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowserrada way kala duwan yihiin. Isla kombiyuutarka wuxuu muuqan karaa WebGPU browser hal ah, iyo &quot;WebGL 2 only&quot; browser kale. Linux inta badan browserrada weli ma leh WebGPU.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Fur Settings (Ctrl+,), ku sii jir tab-ka app-kan, oo hoos u jiid ilaa Rendering. Your machine wuxuu soo bandhigayaa waxa browserkan u ogolaanayo app-ka inuu rendarka isticmaalo. Waxba ka mid ah ma bannaanaado kombiyuutarkaaga. Safka Macnaheeda Graphics Kaarka garaafyada ee browserku sheego. \"WebGPU\" waxa uu macnaheedu yahay inuu qaban karo shaqada rendarka oo dhan; \"WebGL 2 only\" waxa uu macnaheedu yahay muuqaalka toosan iyo Render a picture… ayaa isticmaala (tayo sare oo leh WebGL path tracer), laakiin rendarka muuqaalka iyo safka rendarka, oo u baahan WebGPU, lama bixiyo; software stand-in waxa uu macnaheedu yahay wax walba processor-ka ayaa socda Processor Inta core ee processor-ka browserku sheego Memory Qiyaas ahaan inta xusuus ee kombiyuutarku leeyahay, marka browserku sheego. Browserrada qaarkood ma sheegaan Shared memory Haddii bogga la ogolyahay inuu xusuus la wadaago workers-keeda. Marka ON, core kasta wuxuu ka shaqayn karaa hal nuqul oo ka mid ah scene-ka; marka OFF, mid kasta nuqul gaar ah ayuu u baahan yahay, sidaas darteed scene weyn wuxuu ku habboon yahay core yar oo isla waqtiga ah Fast processor code Haddii browserku socodsiiyo code-ka degdega ah ee WebAssembly. Haddii aanu jirin, waxa la isticmaalaa fallback gaabis ah Level Graphics card, high, Graphics card, basic ama Processor only, iyo sababta hoosteeda Heerka Heerku wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha live view ka bilaabanto (For this computer), inta shay kala firdhsan ee ay muujiso, iyo inta wejiga ee subdivision surface ay ku muujin karto muuqaalka, si kombiyuutar leh chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira ama aan kaarka garaafyo lahayn uu u jawaabo degdeg. Chip garaafyo oo dhex ku jira ama telefoon, ama xusuus 4 GB ama ka yar, waligood ma helo Graphics card, high. Browserrada way kala duwan yihiin. Isla kombiyuutarka wuxuu muuqan karaa WebGPU browser hal ah, iyo \"WebGL 2 only\" browser kale. Linux inta badan browserrada weli ma leh WebGPU.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"render-engine-addons","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Ku dar matoor rendar kordhin ahaan","summary":"Waxa kordhin uu ku dari karo liiska Matoorka ee sanduuqa Rendar, ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay si uu barnaamij u socodsiiyo, iyo waxa Studio hubiyo oo weydiiyo.","section":"reference","order":117,"keywords":["kordhin","addon","matoor","matoorka rendarka","horumariye","engine.run","ogolaansho","barnaamij","script","saxiixan","studio","api"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKordhin (Dejinta › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu ku dari karaa matoor liiska Matoorka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E. Qoraalka oo dhan ee horumariyeyaasha kordhinta waa qaybta 16 ee qorshaha kordhinta; si kooban:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKordhinta wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa matoor leh aqoonsi uu ku bilaabmo magiciisa, magac, dejinno ikhtiyaari ah, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emidkood\u003C/strong\u003E barnaamij la socodsiiyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eama\u003C/strong\u003E function JavaScript ah oo sawirka sameeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMatoorka barnaamij socodsiiya wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaanshaha \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eengine.run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E, oo la muujiyaa ka hor rakibidda iyo Dejinta. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio oo keliya; browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa sida fayl loo keydiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKordhinta wuxuu magacaabaa barnaamijka (magac fayl oo fudud oo keliya: marna shell), script ah oo \u003Cstrong\u003Eku jirta kordhinta la saxiixay\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo arguments oo ka kooban placeholders iyo eray fudud. Studio wuxuu helaa barnaamijka ama wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa inaad hal mar u tilmaamto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, \u003Cstrong\u003EStudio wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa sanduuqiisa\u003C/strong\u003E: kordhinta noocee, barnaamijka noocee, iyo in script-ku wax kasta samayn karo oo barnaamijku samayn karo. Kaliya u oggolow kordhin aad aaminsan tahay. Jawaabtaadu waxa loo xasuusanayaa kordhinta iyo barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPakajka (muuqaalka sida USD iyo fayl dejin, iyo fayl glTF marka kordhinta weydiiso) iyo script-ka kordhinta waxay galaan folder cusub oo ku meel gaar ah; barnaamijku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa folderkaas, sawirkuna wuu soo noqdaa isagoo calaamadeysan magaca matoorka kordhinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKordhinno kaliya ayaa ku dari kara matoorrada rendarka API 1.4 iyo wixii ka dambeeya. Tusaale shaqeynaya oo rendar command-line ah oo open-source ah wuxuu ku jiraa kaydkiisa u gaar ah; weli lama socodsiin rendar-kaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kordhin (Dejinta › Kordhinno) wuxuu ku dari karaa matoor liiska Matoorka ee Rendar sawir…. Qoraalka oo dhan ee horumariyeyaasha kordhinta waa qaybta 16 ee qorshaha kordhinta; si kooban: Kordhinta wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa matoor leh aqoonsi uu ku bilaabmo magiciisa, magac, dejinno ikhtiyaari ah, iyo midkood barnaamij la socodsiiyo ama function JavaScript ah oo sawirka sameeya. Matoorka barnaamij socodsiiya wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaanshaha engine.run, oo la muujiyaa ka hor rakibidda iyo Dejinta. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Studio oo keliya; browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa sida fayl loo keydiyo. Kordhinta wuxuu magacaabaa barnaamijka (magac fayl oo fudud oo keliya: marna shell), script ah oo ku jirta kordhinta la saxiixay, iyo arguments oo ka kooban placeholders iyo eray fudud. Studio wuxuu helaa barnaamijka ama wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa inaad hal mar u tilmaamto. Markii ugu horreysay ee kordhin barnaamij socodsiiyo, Studio wuxuu kuu weydiinayaa sanduuqiisa: kordhinta noocee, barnaamijka noocee, iyo in script-ku wax kasta samayn karo oo barnaamijku samayn karo. Kaliya u oggolow kordhin aad aaminsan tahay. Jawaabtaadu waxa loo xasuusanayaa kordhinta iyo barnaamijka. Pakajka (muuqaalka sida USD iyo fayl dejin, iyo fayl glTF marka kordhinta weydiiso) iyo script-ka kordhinta waxay galaan folder cusub oo ku meel gaar ah; barnaamijku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa folderkaas, sawirkuna wuu soo noqdaa isagoo calaamadeysan magaca matoorka kordhinta. Kordhinno kaliya ayaa ku dari kara matoorrada rendarka API 1.4 iyo wixii ka dambeeya. Tusaale shaqeynaya oo rendar command-line ah oo open-source ah wuxuu ku jiraa kaydkiisa u gaar ah; weli lama socodsiin rendar-kaas.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Xallinta dhibaatooyinka","summary":"Calaamadaha, sababaha iyo xalalka, laga bilaabo aragga 3D ee madhan ilaa soo dhoofinta oo cabbirkeedu khaldan yahay, oo leh farriimaha ModelCraft tusa.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["dhibaato","khalad","ma shaqeynayo","madhan","webgl","awood","gaabis","fariin","soo dhoofinta fashilmay","cabbir khaldan","ma dooran karo","taabasho","furayaasha ma shaqeynayaan","shaqo lumay"],"headings":[{"id":"aragga-3d-waa-madhan","text":"Aragga 3D waa madhan","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-waxba-ma-sameynayaan-ama-sanduuq-ayay-ku-qorayaan","text":"Furayaasha waxba ma sameynayaan, ama sanduuq ayay ku qorayaan","level":2},{"id":"qorista-lambar-waxba-ma-sameyso","text":"Qorista lambar waxba ma sameyso","level":2},{"id":"qaabka-wax-ka-bilaabma-meel-khalad-ah-shaashad-taabasho","text":"Qaabka wax ka bilaabma meel khalad ah shaashad taabasho","level":2},{"id":"kooxda-hal-mid-wax-ka-beddelay-mid-kale-ayaa-wax-ka-beddelay","text":"Kooxda hal mid wax ka beddelay mid kale ayaa wax ka beddelay","level":2},{"id":"riix-jiid-ma-samaynayo-waxa-aan-filayay","text":"Riix/jiid ma samaynayo waxa aan filayay","level":2},{"id":"xariiq-ama-qaab-dusha-ma-samayn","text":"Xariiq ama qaab dusha ma samayn","level":2},{"id":"ma-dooran-karo-ama-ma-tirtiri-karo-dusha","text":"Ma dooran karo ama ma tirtiri karo dusha","level":2},{"id":"dooro-wax-marka-hore-si-aad-u-guurto-ama-riix","text":"\"Dooro wax marka hore si aad u guurto, ama riix.\"","level":2},{"id":"marka-hore-joometri-dooro-jiid-daaqad-ama-saddex-jeer-dhufo-si-aad-wax-kasta-oo-isku-xidhan-u-doorato","text":"\"Marka hore joometri dooro (jiid daaqad, ama saddex jeer dhufo si aad wax kasta oo isku xidhan u doorato).\"","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-fallaadhaha-wareegaan-halkii-ay-ku-xidhi-lahaayeen","text":"Furayaasha fallaadhaha wareegaan halkii ay ku xidhi lahaayeen","level":2},{"id":"esc-shaashadda-buuxda","text":"Esc shaashadda buuxda","level":2},{"id":"badhanka-dhexe-ma-jiro","text":"Badhanka dhexe ma jiro","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofinta","text":"Soo dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"soo-dhoofintu-cabbir-khalad-ah-ayay-leedahay-ama-dhinac-ayay-jiifaa","text":"Soo dhoofintu cabbir khalad ah ayay leedahay ama dhinac ayay jiifaa","level":3},{"id":"furidda-faylalka","text":"Furidda faylalka","level":2},{"id":"shaqo-ayaan-lumiyay","text":"Shaqo ayaan lumiyay","level":2},{"id":"galka-soo-dejinta-waxa-ku-buuxsamaya-nuqullo","text":"Galka soo dejinta waxa ku buuxsamaya nuqullo","level":2},{"id":"way-gaabisaa","text":"Way gaabisaa","level":2},{"id":"hooska-ma-jiro","text":"Hooska ma jiro","level":2},{"id":"browserkan-shaashadda-buuxda-uma-oggolaan","text":"\"Browserkan shaashadda buuxda uma oggolaan.\"","level":2},{"id":"modelcraft-ma-furmayo-xidhiidh-la-aanta","text":"ModelCraft ma furmayo xidhiidh la'aanta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"aragga-3d-waa-madhan\"\u003EAragga 3D waa madhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad:\u003C/strong\u003E dhexda shaashadu way madhan tahay, ama waxay muujinaysaa midabka duruufta oo keliya, riixitaanka qalabyada wax ma sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft wuxuu sawiraa WebGL 2, farsamada sawirka 3D ee browserka. Waa ka maqan tahay marka browserku duug yahay, marka xawaaraynta hardware-ka la damiyay, ama marka darawalka sawirka la xannibay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur dejinta browserka oo raadi &quot;graphics acceleration&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShid &quot;Use graphics acceleration when available&quot; oo dib u bilow browserka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii ay horay u shaqeynayso, qor \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://gpu\u003C/code\u003E bar-ka ciwaanka (\u003Ccode\u003Eedge://gpu\u003C/code\u003E Edge-ka) oo raadi &quot;WebGL2&quot; liiska. Haddii ay tahay &quot;disabled&quot;, cusbooneysii darawalka sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral\u003C/strong\u003E, oo hoos u jiid ilaa &quot;Performance&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa saar &quot;Use recommended performance settings&quot;, kadibna calaamadi &quot;Use hardware acceleration when available&quot;. Dib u bilow Firefox.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii weli fashilanto, qor \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:support\u003C/code\u003E bar-ka ciwaanka oo eeg qaybta &quot;Graphics&quot; ee WebGL 2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECusbooneysii macOS iyo Safari. Nooca cusub ee Safari had iyo jeer WebGL 2 ayuu shid. Haddii aad beddeshay astaamaha tijaabada ee hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ESafari\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EAdvanced\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EFeature Flags\u003C/strong\u003E), dib u deji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKombiyuutarka shaqada, desktop-ka fog ama mashiinka virtual-ka, sawirka 3D siyaasad ayaa laga xannibi karaa. Isku day kombiyuutar kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers iyo kombiyuutarada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-waxba-ma-sameynayaan-ama-sanduuq-ayay-ku-qorayaan\"\u003EFurayaasha waxba ma sameynayaan, ama sanduuq ayay ku qorayaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E xulashada keyboard-ka waxay ku jirtaa goob guddi ah: liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHabka\u003C/span\u003E, dejinta qorraxda, goobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagac\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E, ama doorashada cutubyada. Xarfaha iyo furayaasha fallaadhaha markaas goobtaas ayay gaadhaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix dhex muuqaalka 3D, kadibna mar kale riix furaha. Furayaashu waxba ma sameynayaan inta uu sanduuq wada-hadal furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-lambar-waxba-ma-sameyso\"\u003EQorista lambar waxba ma sameyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeli jihada ma jirto.\u003C/strong\u003E Dherer la qoray wuxuu raacaa jihada tusaha ka bilaabmay riixitaankii koowaad. Tusaha si yar ugu dhaqaaq jihada aad rabto, kadibna qor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaqtiga khaldan.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabyada badankood qiime la qoray kaliya ka dib riixitaankii koowaad: marka hore dhufo geeska koowaad, dusha ama dhibcaha ka guuri. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E waxay qaataan tirada dhinacyada ka hor riixitaankii koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Qor dherer sida 3m, 10&#039;6&quot; ama 4m,3m.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft ma akhrin karin. Hubi calaamadda tobanka ee koomada (\u003Ccode\u003E2,5\u003C/code\u003E): isticmaal dhibic.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabka-wax-ka-bilaabma-meel-khalad-ah-shaashad-taabasho\"\u003EQaabka wax ka bilaabma meel khalad ah shaashad taabasho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad:\u003C/strong\u003E farta ku jirta, afar-geeslaha koowaad waa fiican yahay, laakiin kan xiga, goobada ama xariiqdu waxay ka bilaabataa meeshii taabashadii hore ku dhammaatay, halkii ay ka bilaabi lahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E cilad ku jirta dhismahan: shaashad taabasho, qalabku wuxuu xasuustaa dhibicda ugu dambeysay ee isku dhejinta ee isku daygii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E taabo badhanka qalabka toolbar-ka mar kale ka hor qaab kasta oo cusub. Taasi qalabka mar kale ayuu bilaabaa, dhibicda koowaadna waxay ku dhacaysaa meeshii aad taabatay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooxda-hal-mid-wax-ka-beddelay-mid-kale-ayaa-wax-ka-beddelay\"\u003EKooxda hal mid wax ka beddelay mid kale ayaa wax ka beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamad:\u003C/strong\u003E waxaad nuqul ka sameysay kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, mid ka mid ah nuqullada ayaad furtay oo wax ka beddeshay, kii kalena wuu isbeddelay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska\u003C/span\u003E labadaba isku magac ayuu muujinayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabkan, nuqulka kooxdu waa goob labaad oo isku mid ah, sida qayb. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E waxaa loo soo bandhigaa qaybaha oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro nuqulka aad rabto inaad wax ka beddesho, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee qayb\u003C/span\u003E gudaha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaadka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E. Nuqulkaas hadda waxyaabihiisa gaar ayuu u leeyahay. Ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala bax\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riix-jiid-ma-samaynayo-waxa-aan-filayay\"\u003ERiix/jiid ma samaynayo waxa aan filayay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Riix/jiid wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa dusha. Dhufo dusha.&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E Waxaad dhufatay geesta ama meel banaan. Tusaha ku dhaaf ilaa dusha iftiimo, kadibna dhufo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha kooxda gudaheeda ayuu ku jiraa.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka hore ku dhufo laba jeer kooxda si aad u furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaaqadda darbiga ma jeexin.\u003C/strong\u003E Afar-geeslaha waa in lagu sawiraa dusha darbiga, ma aha hortiisa, darbiguna waa inuu lahaadaa dusha dambe. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/openings#if-it-did-not-cut-through\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/openings\" data-hash=\"if-it-did-not-cut-through\"\u003EKu jeex furitaan darbi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba sanduuq isku dhejinmaya ma isku daraan.\u003C/strong\u003E Jirmaallada lagu riixay isku mid ma jeexaan, ma isku xidhaan dhismahan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariiq-ama-qaab-dusha-ma-samayn\"\u003EXariiq ama qaab dusha ma samayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha wuxuu buuxmaa kaliya marka geesuhu xidhaan wareeg siman. Hubi in dhibicda ugu dambaysa lagu dhejiyay bilowga (&quot;Endpoint&quot;), iyo in geesuhu dhammaantood ku jiraan hal diyaar. Wareeg jaban diyaarka ka baxsan wuxuu ku sii jiraa xariiqyo. Mid ka mid ah geeskiisa mar kale sawir, idinkoo geeska ku dhejinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ma-dooran-karo-ama-ma-tirtiri-karo-dusha\"\u003EMa dooran karo ama ma tirtiri karo dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro ahaan, riix oo u dhow geesta waxay qaadaa geeska. Riix dhexda dusha oo u dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtiraha\u003C/span\u003E ma qaado dusha. Dusha dooro, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah geeskeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii ay qayb ama kooxda ku jirto, riixitaanku wuxuu doortaa qaybta oo dhan. Ku dhufo laba jeer si aad u furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-wax-marka-hore-si-aad-u-guurto-ama-riix\"\u003E&quot;Dooro wax marka hore si aad u guurto, ama riix.&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E waxay u baahan yihiin wax ay ka shaqeeyaan: dooro marka hore, ama bilow qalabka adigoo riixaya shayga laftiisa (ma aha meel banaan ama hage).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-hore-joometri-dooro-jiid-daaqad-ama-saddex-jeer-dhufo-si-aad-wax-kasta-oo-isku-xidhan-u-doorato\"\u003E&quot;Marka hore joometri dooro (jiid daaqad, ama saddex jeer dhufo si aad wax kasta oo isku xidhan u doorato).&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift G\"\u003E⇧G\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+G\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u baahan yihiin xulasho. Hagayaashu ma kooxeyn karaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-fallaadhaha-wareegaan-halkii-ay-ku-xidhi-lahaayeen\"\u003EFurayaasha fallaadhaha wareegaan halkii ay ku xidhi lahaayeen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQufulada waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya ka dib riixitaankii koowaad ee qalabka sawirka ama tafatirka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERiix/jiid\u003C/span\u003E ma lahan qufulo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E qufulada ma beddelaan leexinta. Waqtiyada kale furayaasha fallaadhaha muuqaalka ayay wareegaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"esc-shaashadda-buuxda\"\u003EEsc shaashadda buuxda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaashadda buuxda, browserku wuxuu isticmaali karaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E koowaad si uu uga baxo shaashadda buuxda. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale si aad qalabka u joojiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhanka-dhexe-ma-jiro\"\u003EBadhanka dhexe ma jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E u hesho oo jiid, ama isticmaal furayaasha fallaadhaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom#without-a-middle-button\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-hash=\"without-a-middle-button\"\u003EWareeg, guuri iyo weynee\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-dhoofinta\"\u003ESoo dhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;ModelCraft wuxuu soo dhoofiyaa SketchUp (.skp), Collada (.dae), OBJ, glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic (.abc), DWG iyo DXF. … midkoodna ma aha.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar moodeelka barnaamijka kale mid ka mid ah qaababkan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 300 MB.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYaree ama kala qaybi moodeelka barnaamijka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;…aad ayuu u weyn yahay in lagu moodeelo halkan (ka badan 2 milyan dhibic).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla sidaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka .gltf wuxuu u baahan yahay &quot;…&quot;…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig \u003Ccode\u003E.gltf\u003C/code\u003E oo wata faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.bin\u003C/code\u003E iyo tekstuurada, ama fur nooca \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka glTF wuxuu u baahan yahay kordhinta …, oo ModelCraft weli ma akhrin.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u soo saar barnaamijka kale adigoo ka saaraya kordhintaas (tekstuurada KTX2 tusaale ahaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ wuxuu soo galaa isaga oo aan midabkiisa ama tekstuuradiisa lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E oo wata \u003Ccode\u003E.mtl\u003C/code\u003E iyo sawirradiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylkan Alembic wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabka hore ee HDF5…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u kaydi barnaamijka kale sida faylka Ogawa Alembic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFBX wuxuu soo galaa isaga oo aan tekstuuradiisa lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig \u003Ccode\u003E.fbx\u003C/code\u003E oo wata sawirrada tekstuurka, ama ku dar warbaahinta markaad soo saarayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka FBX nooca … yahay, taas oo ModelCraft aan akhrin.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u soo saar FBX 2011 ama mid cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL ama PLY wuxuu soo galaa 1,000 jeer oo ka weyn ama ka yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL waxa loo akhriyaa millimitir, PLY meter: cabbirka ka beddel (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003EWareeji iyo cabbir\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tani ma aha fayl Collada (.dae)…&quot; ama &quot;…XML aan qaab sax ahayn…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa khasaare ama ma aha Collada. Dib u soo saar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka Collada-n ma leh joometri ModelCraft soo dhoofin karto.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay kaliya haysaa kamaradaha, iftiimiyeyaasha ama tixraacyo faylal kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tani waa DXF binary ah. Ku kaydi ASCII DXF oo mar kale isku day.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u kaydi ASCII barnaamijka CAD, kadibna isku day mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tani ma aha naqshad DWG…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku ma aha DWG, ama waa khasaare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Naqshadda lama akhrin karin (…). Waxay khasaare tahay, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay nooc DWG ah oo akhriyuhu aanu maamulin…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQawsiyada waxay sheegayaan sababta. Ku kaydi DXF, ama DWG AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 barnaamijka CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Naqshadda waxay gaadhaa in ka badan 10,000 km asalkeeda…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig naqshadda agagaarka 0,0 barnaamijka CAD\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"soo-dhoofintu-cabbir-khalad-ah-ayay-leedahay-ama-dhinac-ayay-jiifaa\"\u003ESoo dhoofintu cabbir khalad ah ayay leedahay ama dhinac ayay jiifaa\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ:\u003C/strong\u003E OBJ ma leh unit; ModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa meter. Moodeel millimitir ah wuxuu soo gali doonaa 1000 jeer oo ka weyn: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/rotate-scale#fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/rotate-scale\" data-hash=\"fix-an-import-that-came-in-the-wrong-size\"\u003Ecabbir ka beddel\u003C/a\u003E adigoo \u003Ccode\u003E0.001\u003C/code\u003E ku dhufanaya; moodeel inji ah \u003Ccode\u003E0.0254\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOBJ dhinac jiifa:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft wuxuu filayaa faylalka OBJ ee Y sare. Fayl loo qoray Z sare wuxuu soo galaa jiifaya. Ku leexi 90° dhidibka casaanka: riix badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E dhexda dusha ee jihada casaanka wajahan, ama fur faylka barnaamijkiisa oo soo saar Y sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG ama DXF:\u003C/strong\u003E unitka khaldan ayaad doorateen sanduuqa &quot;Drawing units&quot;. Dib u noqo oo mar kale soo dhoofi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furidda-faylalka\"\u003EFuridda faylalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylkan ma aha moodeel ModelCraft ah (ma aha JSON).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/span\u003E qaababka kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Tani ma aha fayl ModelCraft ah oo aan furi karno: …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa khasaare ama gacanta lagu beddelay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Moodeelkan waxaa kaydiyay ModelCraft cusub…&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur nooca cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 200 MB.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelka aad ayuu u weyn yahay in halkan la furo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqo-ayaan-lumiyay\"\u003EShaqo ayaan lumiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft ma kaydiyo faylal isaga keligiis. Marka aad xirto ama dib u soo rogto tab leh isbeddello aan la kaydin, browserku wuxuu marka hore weydiiyaa (&quot;Ka bax goobta?&quot; ama &quot;Dib u soo rog goobta?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto oo kaydiso. New iyo Open ayaa sidoo kale weydiiya (&quot;Isbeddello aan la kaydin&quot;). Haddii browserka ama kombiyuutarku burburo, mar kale fur ModelCraft isla browserka: wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqada aan la kaydin (&quot;Soo celi shaqadaada?&quot;; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ESoo celi shaqadaada\u003C/a\u003E). Had iyo jeer kaydi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"galka-soo-dejinta-waxa-ku-buuxsamaya-nuqullo\"\u003EGalka soo dejinta waxa ku buuxsamaya nuqullo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydin kasta waa soo dejin cusub, oo magacooda yahay \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (1).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EUntitled (2).modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E iyo sidaas oo kale. Tirtir kuwii hore, ama dhig browserka inuu weydiiyo meesha uu kaydinayo fayl kasta, oo faylkii hore adigu si gacan ah u beddel. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/files#save-a-model\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/files\" data-hash=\"save-a-model\"\u003EFur, kaydi, soo dhoofi iyo soo saar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"way-gaabisaa\"\u003EWay gaabisaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabo kasta oo ka noqod wuxuu hayaa nuqul moodeelka (a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu hayaa kaliya wixii isbeddelay), sidaas darteed soo dhoofinta weyn ee joometriga riixitaanka, tafatir kasta wakhti dheer buu qaadanayaa. Kala bax ama tirtir waxa aadan u baahnayn, kaydi, kadibna dib u fur: dib u furidu taariikhda ka noqoshada way tirtirtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHooska qorraxdu waa wax ugu badan kharashka. Ka saar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooska qorraxda\u003C/span\u003E intaad moodelaynayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hooska-ma-jiro\"\u003EHooska ma jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHooska qorraxda\u003C/span\u003E waa demsan tahay, qorraxdu waa hoos waqtiga aad dooratay (&quot;Qorraxdu waa hoos wakhtigan.&quot;), ama habka waa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESilig\u003C/span\u003E, kaasoo aan hooska sawirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserkan-shaashadda-buuxda-uma-oggolaan\"\u003E&quot;Browserkan shaashadda buuxda uma oggolaan.&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowsers qaarkood iyo muuqaallada ku-dhex-jira qaarkood way diidaan shaashadda buuxda. Isticmaal shaashadda buuxda ee browserka laftiisa, (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"modelcraft-ma-furmayo-xidhiidh-la-aanta\"\u003EModelCraft ma furmayo xidhiidh la&#039;aanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft wuxuu u furmaa khadka ka baxsan kaliya ka dib markii loo kaydiyay khadka ka baxsan browserkaas: badhanka app bar-ka waa inuu akhriyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan diyaar\u003C/span\u003E. Furo markaad khadka ku jirto oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii badhanku akhriyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/span\u003E, mar kale riix xidhiidh wanaagsan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka ka baxsan lama heli karo\u003C/span\u003E waxay tahay in daaqaddan (daaqad gaar ah, ama kombiyuutar la maamulo) aanay koobi u kaydin karin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aragga 3D waa madhan Calaamad: dhexda shaashadu way madhan tahay, ama waxay muujinaysaa midabka duruufta oo keliya, riixitaanka qalabyada wax ma sameeyo. Sababta: ModelCraft wuxuu sawiraa WebGL 2, farsamada sawirka 3D ee browserka. Waa ka maqan tahay marka browserku duug yahay, marka xawaaraynta hardware-ka la damiyay, ama marka darawalka sawirka la xannibay. Xalka: Fur dejinta browserka oo raadi \"graphics acceleration\". Shid \"Use graphics acceleration when available\" oo dib u bilow browserka. Haddii ay horay u shaqeynayso, qor chrome://gpu bar-ka ciwaanka (edge://gpu Edge-ka) oo raadi \"WebGL2\" liiska. Haddii ay tahay \"disabled\", cusbooneysii darawalka sawirka. Fur Settings, kadibna General, oo hoos u jiid ilaa \"Performance\". Ka saar \"Use recommended performance settings\", kadibna calaamadi \"Use hardware acceleration when available\". Dib u bilow Firefox. Haddii weli fashilanto, qor about:support bar-ka ciwaanka oo eeg qaybta \"Graphics\" ee WebGL 2. Cusbooneysii macOS iyo Safari. Nooca cusub ee Safari had iyo jeer WebGL 2 ayuu shid. Haddii aad beddeshay astaamaha tijaabada ee hoos Safari, kadibna Settings, kadibna Advanced (ama Feature Flags), dib u deji. Kombiyuutarka shaqada, desktop-ka fog ama mashiinka virtual-ka, sawirka 3D siyaasad ayaa laga xannibi karaa. Isku day kombiyuutar kale. Eeg Browsers iyo kombiyuutarada. Furayaasha waxba ma sameynayaan, ama sanduuq ayay ku qorayaan Sababta: xulashada keyboard-ka waxay ku jirtaa goob guddi ah: liiska Dusha ee Habka, dejinta qorraxda, goobta Magac ee Macluumaadka, ama doorashada cutubyada. Xarfaha iyo furayaasha fallaadhaha markaas goobtaas ayay gaadhaan. Xalka: riix dhex muuqaalka 3D, kadibna mar kale riix furaha. Furayaashu waxba ma sameynayaan inta uu sanduuq wada-hadal furan yahay. Qorista lambar waxba ma sameyso Weli jihada ma jirto. Dherer la qoray wuxuu raacaa jihada tusaha ka bilaabmay riixitaankii koowaad. Tusaha si yar ugu dhaqaaq jihada aad rabto, kadibna qor. Waqtiga khaldan. Qalabyada badankood qiime la qoray kaliya ka dib riixitaankii koowaad: marka hore dhufo geeska koowaad, dusha ama dhibcaha ka guuri. Goobo iyo Poligon waxay qaataan tirada dhinacyada ka hor riixitaankii koowaad. \"Qor dherer sida 3m, 10'6\" ama 4m,3m.\" ModelCraft ma akhrin karin. Hubi calaamadda tobanka ee koomada (2,5): isticmaal dhibic. Qaabka wax ka bilaabma meel khalad ah shaashad taabasho Calaamad: farta ku jirta, afar-geeslaha koowaad waa fiican yahay, laakiin kan xiga, goobada ama xariiqdu waxay ka bilaabataa meeshii taabashadii hore ku dhammaatay, halkii ay ka bilaabi lahaayeen. Sababta: cilad ku jirta dhismahan: shaashad taabasho, qalabku wuxuu xasuustaa dhibicda ugu dambeysay ee isku dhejinta ee isku daygii hore. Xalka: taabo badhanka qalabka toolbar-ka mar kale ka hor qaab kasta oo cusub. Taasi qalabka mar kale ayuu bilaabaa, dhibicda koowaadna waxay ku dhacaysaa meeshii aad taabatay. Kooxda hal mid wax ka beddelay mid kale ayaa wax ka beddelay Calaamad: waxaad nuqul ka sameysay kooxda Guuri iyo Ctrl, mid ka mid ah nuqullada ayaad furtay oo wax ka beddeshay, kii kalena wuu isbeddelay. Liiska labadaba isku magac ayuu muujinayaa. Sababta: qalabkan, nuqulka kooxdu waa goob labaad oo isku mid ah, sida qayb. Badhanka Ka dhig gaar ah waxaa loo soo bandhigaa qaybaha oo keliya. Xalka: dooro nuqulka aad rabto inaad wax ka beddesho, riix Samee qayb gudaha Macluumaadka, kadibna Ka dhig gaar ah. Nuqulkaas hadda waxyaabihiisa gaar ayuu u leeyahay. Ama Kala bax. Riix/jiid ma samaynayo waxa aan filayay \"Riix/jiid wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa dusha. Dhufo dusha.\" Waxaad dhufatay geesta ama meel banaan. Tusaha ku dhaaf ilaa dusha iftiimo, kadibna dhufo. Dusha kooxda gudaheeda ayuu ku jiraa. Marka hore ku dhufo laba jeer kooxda si aad u furto. Daaqadda darbiga ma jeexin. Afar-geeslaha waa in lagu sawiraa dusha darbiga, ma aha hortiisa, darbiguna waa inuu lahaadaa dusha dambe. Eeg Ku jeex furitaan darbi. Laba sanduuq isku dhejinmaya ma isku daraan. Jirmaallada lagu riixay isku mid ma jeexaan, ma isku xidhaan dhismahan. Xariiq ama qaab dusha ma samayn Dusha wuxuu buuxmaa kaliya marka geesuhu xidhaan wareeg siman. Hubi in dhibicda ugu dambaysa lagu dhejiyay bilowga (\"Endpoint\"), iyo in geesuhu dhammaantood ku jiraan hal diyaar. Wareeg jaban diyaarka ka baxsan wuxuu ku sii jiraa xariiqyo. Mid ka mid ah geeskiisa mar kale sawir, idinkoo geeska ku dhejinaya. Ma dooran karo ama ma tirtiri karo dusha Dooro ahaan, riix oo u dhow geesta waxay qaadaa geeska. Riix dhexda dusha oo u dhow. Tirtiraha ma qaado dusha. Dusha dooro, kadibna riix Delete, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah geeskeeda. Haddii ay qayb ama kooxda ku jirto, riixitaanku wuxuu doortaa qaybta oo dhan. Ku dhufo laba jeer si aad u furto. \"Dooro wax marka hore si aad u guurto, ama riix.\" Guuri, Wareeji iyo Miisaan waxay u baahan yihiin wax ay ka shaqeeyaan: dooro marka hore, ama bilow qalabka adigoo riixaya shayga laftiisa (ma aha meel banaan ama hage). \"Marka hore joometri dooro (jiid daaqad, ama saddex jeer dhufo si aad wax kasta oo isku xidhan u doorato).\" G iyo Shift+G waxay u baahan yihiin xulasho. Hagayaashu ma kooxeyn karaan. Furayaasha fallaadhaha wareegaan halkii ay ku xidhi lahaayeen Qufulada waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya ka dib riixitaankii koowaad ee qalabka sawirka ama tafatirka. Riix/jiid ma lahan qufulo, Wareeji qufulada ma beddelaan leexinta. Waqtiyada kale furayaasha fallaadhaha muuqaalka ayay wareegaan. Esc shaashadda buuxda Shaashadda buuxda, browserku wuxuu isticmaali karaa Esc koowaad si uu uga baxo shaashadda buuxda. Riix Esc mar kale si aad qalabka u joojiso. Badhanka dhexe ma jiro Riix O si aad Wareeg u hesho oo jiid, ama isticmaal furayaasha fallaadhaha. Eeg Wareeg, guuri iyo weynee. Soo dhoofinta Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo \"ModelCraft wuxuu soo dhoofiyaa SketchUp (.skp), Collada (.dae), OBJ, glTF (.glb/.gltf), FBX, PLY, STL, Alembic (.abc), DWG iyo DXF. … midkoodna ma aha.\" Soo saar moodeelka barnaamijka kale mid ka mid ah qaababkan \"Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 300 MB.\" Yaree ama kala qaybi moodeelka barnaamijka kale \"…aad ayuu u weyn yahay in lagu moodeelo halkan (ka badan 2 milyan dhibic).\" Isla sidaas \"Faylka .gltf wuxuu u baahan yahay \"…\"…\" Dhig .gltf oo wata faylalka .bin iyo tekstuurada, ama fur nooca .glb \"Faylka glTF wuxuu u baahan yahay kordhinta …, oo ModelCraft weli ma akhrin.\" Dib u soo saar barnaamijka kale adigoo ka saaraya kordhintaas (tekstuurada KTX2 tusaale ahaan) OBJ wuxuu soo galaa isaga oo aan midabkiisa ama tekstuuradiisa lahayn Dhig .obj oo wata .mtl iyo sawirradiisa \"Faylkan Alembic wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabka hore ee HDF5…\" Dib u kaydi barnaamijka kale sida faylka Ogawa Alembic FBX wuxuu soo galaa isaga oo aan tekstuuradiisa lahayn Dhig .fbx oo wata sawirrada tekstuurka, ama ku dar warbaahinta markaad soo saarayso \"Faylka FBX nooca … yahay, taas oo ModelCraft aan akhrin.\" Dib u soo saar FBX 2011 ama mid cusub STL ama PLY wuxuu soo galaa 1,000 jeer oo ka weyn ama ka yar STL waxa loo akhriyaa millimitir, PLY meter: cabbirka ka beddel (eeg Wareeji iyo cabbir) \"Tani ma aha fayl Collada (.dae)…\" ama \"…XML aan qaab sax ahayn…\" Faylku waa khasaare ama ma aha Collada. Dib u soo saar \"Faylka Collada-n ma leh joometri ModelCraft soo dhoofin karto.\" Waxay kaliya haysaa kamaradaha, iftiimiyeyaasha ama tixraacyo faylal kale \"Tani waa DXF binary ah. Ku kaydi ASCII DXF oo mar kale isku day.\" Dib u kaydi ASCII barnaamijka CAD, kadibna isku day mar kale \"Tani ma aha naqshad DWG…\" Faylku ma aha DWG, ama waa khasaare \"Naqshadda lama akhrin karin (…). Waxay khasaare tahay, ama waxaa lagu kaydiyay nooc DWG ah oo akhriyuhu aanu maamulin…\" Qawsiyada waxay sheegayaan sababta. Ku kaydi DXF, ama DWG AutoCAD 2000 ilaa 2018 barnaamijka CAD \"Naqshadda waxay gaadhaa in ka badan 10,000 km asalkeeda…\" Dhig naqshadda agagaarka 0,0 barnaamijka CAD Soo dhoofintu cabbir khalad ah ayay leedahay ama dhinac ayay jiifaa OBJ: OBJ ma leh unit; ModelCraft wuxuu akhriyaa meter. Moodeel millimitir ah wuxuu soo gali doonaa 1000 jeer oo ka weyn: cabbir ka beddel adigoo 0.001 ku dhufanaya; moodeel inji ah 0.0254. OBJ dhinac jiifa: ModelCraft wuxuu filayaa faylalka OBJ ee Y sare. Fayl loo qoray Z sare wuxuu soo galaa jiifaya. Ku leexi 90° dhidibka casaanka: riix badhanka Wareeji dhexda dusha ee jihada casaanka wajahan, ama fur faylka barnaamijkiisa oo soo saar Y sare. DWG ama DXF: unitka khaldan ayaad doorateen sanduuqa \"Drawing units\". Dib u noqo oo mar kale soo dhoofi. Furidda faylalka Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo \"Faylkan ma aha moodeel ModelCraft ah (ma aha JSON).\" Isticmaal Soo dhoofi qaababka kale \"Tani ma aha fayl ModelCraft ah oo aan furi karno: …\" Faylku waa khasaare ama gacanta lagu beddelay \"Moodeelkan waxaa kaydiyay ModelCraft cusub…\" Ku fur nooca cusub \"Faylkan wuxuu ka weyn yahay 200 MB.\" Moodeelka aad ayuu u weyn yahay in halkan la furo Shaqo ayaan lumiyay ModelCraft ma kaydiyo faylal isaga keligiis. Marka aad xirto ama dib u soo rogto tab leh isbeddello aan la kaydin, browserku wuxuu marka hore weydiiyaa (\"Ka bax goobta?\" ama \"Dib u soo rog goobta?\"); dooro inaad joogto oo kaydiso. New iyo Open ayaa sidoo kale weydiiya (\"Isbeddello aan la kaydin\"). Haddii browserka ama kombiyuutarku burburo, mar kale fur ModelCraft isla browserka: wuxuu soo celinayaa shaqada aan la kaydin (\"Soo celi shaqadaada?\"; eeg Soo celi shaqadaada). Had iyo jeer kaydi Ctrl+S. Galka soo dejinta waxa ku buuxsamaya nuqullo Kaydin kasta waa soo dejin cusub, oo magacooda yahay Untitled (1).modelcraft, Untitled (2).modelcraft iyo sidaas oo kale. Tirtir kuwii hore, ama dhig browserka inuu weydiiyo meesha uu kaydinayo fayl kasta, oo faylkii hore adigu si gacan ah u beddel. Eeg Fur, kaydi, soo dhoofi iyo soo saar. Way gaabisaa Tallaabo kasta oo ka noqod wuxuu hayaa nuqul moodeelka (a mesh wuxuu hayaa kaliya wixii isbeddelay), sidaas darteed soo dhoofinta weyn ee joometriga riixitaanka, tafatir kasta wakhti dheer buu qaadanayaa. Kala bax ama tirtir waxa aadan u baahnayn, kaydi, kadibna dib u fur: dib u furidu taariikhda ka noqoshada way tirtirtaa. Hooska qorraxdu waa wax ugu badan kharashka. Ka saar Hooska qorraxda intaad moodelaynayso. Hooska ma jiro Hooska qorraxda waa demsan tahay, qorraxdu waa hoos waqtiga aad dooratay (\"Qorraxdu waa hoos wakhtigan.\"), ama habka waa Silig, kaasoo aan hooska sawirin. \"Browserkan shaashadda buuxda uma oggolaan.\" Browsers qaarkood iyo muuqaallada ku-dhex-jira qaarkood way diidaan shaashadda buuxda. Isticmaal shaashadda buuxda ee browserka laftiisa, (Control-Command-F / F11). ModelCraft ma furmayo xidhiidh la'aanta ModelCraft wuxuu u furmaa khadka ka baxsan kaliya ka dib markii loo kaydiyay khadka ka baxsan browserkaas: badhanka app bar-ka waa inuu akhriyo Khadka ka baxsan diyaar. Furo markaad khadka ku jirto oo riix Kaydi khadka ka baxsan. Haddii badhanku akhriyo Lama kaydin karin, mar kale riix xidhiidh wanaagsan; Khadka ka baxsan lama heli karo waxay tahay in daaqaddan (daaqad gaar ah, ama kombiyuutar la maamulo) aanay koobi u kaydin karin. Eeg Shaqada khadka ka baxsan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"modelcraft","title":"Wali lama dhisin","summary":"Waxa dhismaha ModelCraft ee hadda aan wali samayn, iyo waxa aad maanta ku samayn karto halkii.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["maqan","weli ma jiro","xaddidaad","waddo","maaddooyin","teexturo","qoraal","lakabyo","jar","kala qaybi","daruur","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"qalabka-sawirka","text":"Qalabka sawirka","level":2},{"id":"animation","text":"Animation","level":2},{"id":"moodeelo","text":"Moodeelo","level":2},{"id":"abaabul-iyo-muuqaal","text":"Abaabul iyo muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"bixinta","text":"Bixinta","level":2},{"id":"agabka-iyo-midabyada","text":"Agabka iyo midabyada","level":2},{"id":"faylalka","text":"Faylalka","level":2},{"id":"daabacaadda-3d","text":"Daabacaadda 3D","level":2},{"id":"waxqabadka","text":"Waxqabadka","level":2},{"id":"apps-iyo-madal-yadaha","text":"Apps iyo madal-yadaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EModelCraft waa dhismo hore. Bogan wuxuu liistaa waxa aan wali samayn, si aanad u raadin, iyo sida ugu dhow ee shaqada loo qabanayo maanta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-sawirka\"\u003EQalabka sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir gacanta lagu sameeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix barta adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalin\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada qeybaha qaws ama goobo ka bedelka ka dib markii la sameeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir oo dib u sawir adigoo qorraya \u003Ccode\u003E24s\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro far-nooc \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/text3d\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/text3d\"\u003Eqoraal 3D\u003C/a\u003E, ama wax ka beddel erayada ka dib markii la dhigay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir oo qoraalka dib ku dar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal ka beddelka adigoo ku qorayo cabbirka xaglada, ama cabbirka silinda adigoo ka qaadanayo cabbirka goobadeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri geesaha adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E; cabbir silinda adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirro ku jira faylalka moodeelka la dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirrada waxay ku muuqdaan sawirrada, daabacaadaha iyo PDF-yada muuqaalka; faylalka moodeelka waxay sidaas ku qaadaan joomitari oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJarid, kala qaybin iyo Qolof dibada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/solids\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/solids\"\u003EIsku geyn, Ka jar iyo Isgoys\u003C/a\u003E kooxo xidhan, ama \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003Eisgoyso wajiyada\u003C/a\u003E oo tirtir wixii aadan u baahnayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhidibka wareegga furayaasha jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix barta \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E dhexdiisa wajiga u jeeda jihada dhidibka aad rabto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQufulo badan oo hal mar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuful hal jihada oo furaha jihada, kadibna ku qabso dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac ku-xidhan ama dhamaad cabbir oo aan geesaha ka ahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig cabbirka geesaha laba geesood, khadka ama jihooyinka casaan, cagaar ama buluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"animation\"\u003EAnimation\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWajiyada, geesaha, waqtiga qorraxda, qaabka ama wixii la qariyay oo la animeeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb dhaqaaqda ka dhig koox ama qayb; sawir fiidiyow gaar ah oo waqti kale ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKamarad raacaya waddo la sawiray, ama eegaysa shay dhaqaaqaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig furayaal kamarad badan dhinaca (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhawaaqa fiidiyowyada, iyo fiidiyowyada tayada sare (path-traced) iyada oo aan WebGPU jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar dhawaaqa tafatiraha fiidiyowga; WebGPU la&#039;aanteed, fiidiyowga ku sawir qalabka degdega ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation#render-the-video\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\" data-hash=\"render-the-video\"\u003ERender the video\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaambadaha la animeeyay (iftiinka, faafitaanka, midabka) fiidiyow la sawiray, bal-ballaarka kamaradda oo aan furayaal kamarad lahayn fiidiyow, animeynta agabka ama dejinta sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaambadaha waxay ku animeeyaan muuqaalka; fiidiyow ahaan, furaha kamaradda bal ku dhig weyneynta; fiidiyow gaar ah u sawir dejinta laambad kasta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003EAnimate any property\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiro ama lafo ka soo qaadista dhinac ilaa dhinac, lafo aad arki karto, miisaanka oo dhibic dhibic loo muujiyo (waxay muujiyaan wajiga ka wajiga), miisaanka oo dhibicda la arko markii la rinjiyeeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabada dhinac rinji, ama samee hal dhinac oo isticmaal Miro modifier ka hor inta aan armature la darin; u beddel Rinji miisaanka iyo Jihee si aad u hubiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELafaha laga akhriyo faylalka glTF, FBX ama USD sida armature, iyo armature-yada lagu qoro faylalkaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan fadhi ahaan miisaanka faylka; ku dar lafaha dalabka lafaha faylka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaal miisaanka faylka\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animate\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animate\"\u003EAnimate\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartanka IK ama dhinaca oo laga soo jiido muuqaalka, kala dhexaadka caqabadda (maxalli ama aduunka), dhererka IK-ga, IK khad dhexdeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor barta bartanka, ama u jeedi shay kalena guuri; ku hay silsiladaha dhererkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhar, dareere, jidhka jilicsan, isku xidhka iyo kulliyadaha dhexdooda jidh adag, isku dhac qaabka saxda ah ee shay (kaliya sanduuqyo iyo kubbado oo ku wareegsan), simulation toos ah markaad ciyaarayso, xawaare bilow ama wareeg (jidhadka waxay ku bilaabmaan fadhi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhadka adag rinji oo ciyaar furayaasha; kulliyad samee furayaal; qaabka qallafsan ku kala qaybi sanduuqyo (kooxo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta animeynta glTF ama faylal kale oo moodeel ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiidiyow sawir; faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.modelcraft\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003Efaylka USD\u003C/a\u003E ModelCraft uu kaydiyay, u hay ModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorista faallada ama cinwaanka arrinta VR-ka, codka-qoraalka, dhaqdhaqaaqa qayb-jeexa gacanta VR-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig arrinta VR-ka, kadibna ku dar erayadeeda barnaamij BCF; deji qayb-jeex muuqaalka ka hor inta aadan galin: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/vr-review\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/vr-review\"\u003EDib-u-eeg moodeelka madadaalada VR\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIn dadka miiska ku jira VR-ka lagu arko (kaliya dadka VR-ka ku jira ayaa muuqda), duulimaadka VR la duubo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeydii inay ku biiraan VR, ama samee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Eanimation\u003C/a\u003E socodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moodeelo\"\u003EMoodeelo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirka heerarka (multiresolution), iyo Faahfaahin kala-qaybisa saddex-geesood yaryar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/a\u003E mesh la kala qaybiyay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E si mar kale u siman\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERemesh loo beddelo wajiyo afar-geesood ah oo raacaya qaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemesh\u003C/span\u003E (saddex-geesood siman), kadibna dib u dhis adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#retopology\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"retopology\"\u003ERetopology\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaanka dhibcaha lagu rinjiyeeyay modifiers-ka (Displace, Smooth iyo Shrinkwrap waxay ka shaqeeyaan mesh oo dhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECodso modifier-ka, kadibna sculpt ama wax ka beddel qaybaha u baahan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee iyo dhaji dhibcaha, geesaha ama wajiyada, jarka seeftu gudaha wajiga ku dhammaanayo, geesaha silig oo aan wajiyo lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh-ka ku sar Moodeel; seef geesaha ka geesaha ah; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/mesh-edit#change-the-shape\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/mesh-edit\" data-hash=\"change-the-shape\"\u003EExtrude\u003C/a\u003E geesaha furan u beddel wajiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"abaabul-iyo-muuqaal\"\u003EAbaabul iyo muuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELakabyada DWG iyo DXF ee qorshaha goobta ah sida calaamado\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshaha goobta wuxuu yimaadaa hal koox: kala bax oo koox qaybaha aad calaamaynayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhowr jeex qaybeed isku mar, sanduuq qaybeed, ama khadka qaybeed oo la dhoofiyo sida naqshad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sections\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sections\"\u003Eqaybeed-dhexaad\u003C/a\u003E mar ayuu jaraa; dhoofi muuqaalka sida sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadadka dhaqsiga leh oo jajaban, ama jilicsan intaad jiido Haraaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/soften\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/soften\"\u003EJilicsan xagal\u003C/a\u003E Macluumaadka shayga, kadibna ka noqo si aad xagal kale u isku daydo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaktabad online ah oo moodeelo ah oo la baarto, ama qaybo leh ikhtiyaarro la doorto (midab, qaab)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/starter\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/starter\"\u003EMaktabadda bilowga\u003C/a\u003E; soo dhoofi moodeelo Collada, OBJ ama glTF; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/stretch\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/stretch\"\u003Efidi\u003C/a\u003E koobi cabbirkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhigida geedaha maktabadda dhirta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view#scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\" data-hash=\"scatter-plants-rocks-and-people\"\u003EScatter\u003C/a\u003E dhirta muuqaalka tooska ah, ama dhig geed maktabadda bilowga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyo madax-bannaan oo kooxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dhig qayb, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig gaar ah\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/troubleshooting#editing-one-group-changed-another\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"editing-one-group-changed-another\"\u003EXalinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bixinta\"\u003EBixinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBixinta muuqaalka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E shaqada), safka bixinta, iyo kamarada, sawirka sama, ikhtiyaarrada iftiinka iyada oo aan WebGPU jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETayada sare\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa habka WebGL ee halkaas, iyada oo aan ikhtiyaaradaas jirin (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render#high-quality\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render\" data-hash=\"high-quality\"\u003ERender a picture\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarnaamij kale oo sawirka Soo saar ku sawira iyada oo aan add-on-ka injineriyada bixinta lahayn (CadCraft ma socodsiiso barnaamij kale oo ku hoos yaal GNU GPL); kamaradaha panorama ama stereo iyo sawirka sama barnaamij kale oo ku dhex jira; plug-in-ka Unreal Engine (faylalka waa la qoraa, plug-in-ka furaya ma soo bixin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInjineriyadeena Fast iyo Path tracer; injineriyada add-on-ka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/render-other-program\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/render-other-program\"\u003Esawirka barnaamij kale\u003C/a\u003E); faylka USD, glTF ama Unreal ee liiska Engine-ka si aad ugu qaaddo barnaamij kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhirta iyo dhagaxyada kala firidhsan ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERendar sawir…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku muuqdaan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/live-view\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/live-view\"\u003Emuuqaalka tooska ah\u003C/a\u003E, panoramaskiisa, muujiyahaa iyo fiidiyowga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agabka-iyo-midabyada\"\u003EAgabka iyo midabyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGaliyada aan ahayn midabka saldhigga, adkaynta, birta, qumman, caadiga iyo iftiinka oo ku beddelan dusha sawirrada tayada sare (waxay isticmaalaan celceliska)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003ESamee agab nuqadaha\u003C/a\u003E: ku xidh si kastaba ha ahaato, muuqaalku wuu muujinayaa inay beddelan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka wajiyada riix/jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel shayga mesh si aad muuqaalka u hesho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabkaaga oo la wadaago Maktabadda app-ka, iyo khariidaadka la xirtay (ARM/ORM) ama EXR ee teexturka la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu hay faylka; soo dhoofi khariidaadka kala gaarka ah sida PNG ama JPEG\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabka faylka ee Live TeamWork (waxay ku sii jiraan kombuterka ay sameeyeen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi faylka oo la wadaag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaq-dhaqaaqa teexturka ee wajiyada qalloocan, ama teexturka dhowr wajiyood isku mar oo ay tahay xaddi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig decal-yo yaryar qayb kasta; rinji dhinac kasta oo xadiga ah si gaar ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex-dhigida wajiyada riix/jiid, dhex-dhigida dhowr shay isku sawirka, qaab gacanta lagu sameeyo, ama iftiinka la dhex dhigay ee laambadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa beddel mesh oo ka fur; dhex dhig shay kasta; kor u qaad masaafada raadinta; sawir sawir si aad u hesho iftiinka laambadaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERinjiga roughness, metalness ama height, rinjiga sawirrada (stamps) iyo rinjiga teexturka ka weyn 512 × 512\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalkan rinji midabka saldhigga; samee khariidaad kale tafatiraha sawirka oo soo dhoofi sida teexturka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETeexturada dhoofinta Collada, STL, PLY, 3MF, IFC, DWG iyo DXF, iyo jaantuska nuqadaha agabka faylka ee moodeelada la dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaababkaas waxay helaan midabka agab kasta; glTF iyo OBJ waxay qabtaan teexturada la soo dhoofiyay; dhoofi agab keligiis sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading#materialx\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\" data-hash=\"materialx\"\u003EMaterialX\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/usd\"\u003EUSD\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu hayaa moodeelka oo dhan ModelCraft ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETeexturada faylalka Collada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la tiriyaa oo la reebaa soo dhoofinta; teexturada faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.skp\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E ayaa yimaada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalka\"\u003EFaylalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta faylalka SketchUp, iyo qoraalka iyo cabbirrada ka yimid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-sketchup-files\"\u003ESoo dhoofi\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu hayaa wejiyada, midabka iyo teexturka; dhoofi Collada (\u003Ccode\u003E.dae\u003C/code\u003E) si aad ugu noqoto SketchUp\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirrada iyo hagaha dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar barnaamijka CAD ka dib markii la dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha, miisaska iyo multileaders ka yimid DWG iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la tiriyaa oo la reebaa; qoraalku wuxuu yimaadaa sida xarfo xariiq keli ah, ma aha far-nooca sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha, mesh, miisaska iyo multileaders ka yimid DWG iyo DXF; wajiyada jidhka 3D ee dusha la rogay, la aalaaqay ama dusha kale ee bilaa qaab\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la tiriyaa oo waa la reebaa (jidhadka 3D waa yimaadaan). Qaybahaas ka dhoofi barnaamijka CAD sida OBJ ama Collada oo soo dhoofi taas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENoocyada IFC, hantida ama agabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta IFC wuxuu leeyahay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/formats#ifc-ifc\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/formats\" data-hash=\"ifc-ifc\"\u003Edabaq\u003C/a\u003E iyo waxyaabo guud; ku dar kuwa kale barnaamij BIM\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelka oo toos loo diro BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc)\u003C/span\u003E oo ku fur BimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha furan ee glTF iyo STL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal OBJ ama Collada khadadka sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAgabka glTF iyo FBX ka dhaafsan midabka saldhigga (birta, roughness, khariidaadka caadiga, muraayadda, clear coat, sheen…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la akhriyaa oo waa la liisanayaa; ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa midabka saldhigga ama teexturka. Dib u dhis muuqaalka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/shading\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/shading\"\u003EShading workspace\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELafaha glTF, animeynta iyo morph targets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan taagan sida ay nasan yihiin; animee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Ejadwalka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidabyada iyo magacyada qaybaha isu-dhigga ee faylalka STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha waxay yimaadaan sida meshes cabbirkooda runta ah; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/paint\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/paint\"\u003Erinji\u003C/a\u003E oo magacaabo soo dhoofinta ka dib\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShayaadka SubD, qoraalka, cabbirrada iyo laambadaha faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/import-3dm-files#what-is-left-out-and-said\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/import-3dm-files\" data-hash=\"what-is-left-out-and-said\"\u003Ewaxa laga reebay\u003C/a\u003E; beddel SubD mesh barnaamijka faylka sameeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETeexturada KTX2 iyo noocyada agabka glTF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi teexturada PNG ama JPEG; noocii caadiga ahaa ayaa la isticmaalaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorista glTF instancing (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha waa la qoraa hal mar, waana la dhigaa mar badan, taas oo kasta oo muuqaal akhriyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAnimeynta Alembic (muunad kasta oo kaydka), dhibcaha iyo khadadka Alembic, qorista Alembic\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuunadda koowaad ayaa yimaada; animee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/animation\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/animation\"\u003Ejadwalka\u003C/a\u003E; qor glTF, USD ama OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhariidaadka bump iyo normal ee agabka OBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya sawirka midabka (\u003Ccode\u003Emap_Kd\u003C/code\u003E) ayaa yimaada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELafaha FBX iyo animeynta, dhoofinta FBX, faylalka FBX 6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan fadhi ahaan; dhoofi glTF; kaydi faylalka duugga ah sida FBX 2011 ama ka dambeeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkin-ka Collada, morphs, kamaradaha, iftiinka, look-at iyo beddelka skew, tixraacyada dibadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa laga reebay soo dhoofinta oo waa la tiriyaa fariinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalka daabacaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command S\"\u003E⇧⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu kaydiyaa nuqul kale. Kadib qaraxa, ModelCraft wuxuu kugu soo celiyaa shaqadaada aan la kaydin (&quot;Ma soo celin shaqadaada?&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta daruurta iyo isku-xidhka kombuterro kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli lama heli karo. Faylalka kombuterkaaga ku kaydi, kadibna ku koobiyee meelaha aad u baahan tahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daabacaadda-3d\"\u003EDaabacaadda 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma jiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaageerooyinka slicer-ka dhabta ah (interfaces, raft, qaabka saxda ah ee taageerada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#supports-preview\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"supports-preview\"\u003EHormarinta taageerooyinka\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa meesha iyo qiyaasta; hormarinta slicer-kaaga ayaa muujinaysa kuwa dhabta ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb isku-dhex-jirta ama geesaha ay ku kulmaan saddex wajiyo ama ka badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#repair\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"repair\"\u003EHagaaji\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liistaa meesha ay yaalliin; isticmaal \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/intersect\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/intersect\"\u003EIsgoys wajiyada\u003C/a\u003E oo tirtir wixii dhex jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka qalabka ee daabacaadda iyo qaab ee dhex-dhexaad ah ee dhex-madhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#hollow\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"hollow\"\u003EDhex-madhan\u003C/a\u003E wuu faaruqiyaa; slicer-kaaga ayuu ku darayaa dhex-buuxin qayb adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaahfaahin aad u yar nozzle-kaagu aanu ku sawirin karin (ka dhaafsan darbiyada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/print-tools#wall-thickness\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/print-tools\" data-hash=\"wall-thickness\"\u003EBallaca darbiga\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu helaa darbiyada khafiifka ah; hormarinta lakabka slicer-kaaga ayaa muujisa kuwa kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxqabadka\"\u003EWaxqabadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa noqo wuxuu haya nuqul moodeelka tallaabo kasta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/meshes\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/meshes\"\u003Emesh\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu haya oo keliya wixii isbedelay), sidaas darteed soo dhoofin aad u weyn ee joomitariga riix/jiid waxay ka dhigaysaa wax kasta oo lagu tafatiro mid gaabiyaa. Soo dhoofinta ku hay mid fudud, oo kaydi oo dib u fur si aad taariikhda u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"apps-iyo-madal-yadaha\"\u003EApps iyo madal-yadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDesktop:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka Mac, Windows iyo Linux, iyo CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka oo leh sideed app oo hal rakibid ah. Android-ka, CadCraft Studio waxaa lagu rakibaa APK-ka ka yimid getcadcraft.com/download. iPad ama iPhone dhismo weli ma jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaabashada:\u003C/strong\u003E eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/orbit-pan-zoom\"\u003EWareeg, muuqaalka guuri iyo weynee\u003C/a\u003E si aad u aragto dhaqdhaqaaqyada farta. Cadaadiska qalinka ayaa dhex dhigaya burushka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/sculpt\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/sculpt\"\u003ESculpt\u003C/a\u003E; meelaha kale cadaadiska iyo jilibka qalinka lama isticmaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E ModelCraft \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/modelcraft/export-model#print-the-view-or-save-it-as-a-pdf\" data-topic=\"modelcraft/export-model\" data-hash=\"print-the-view-or-save-it-as-a-pdf\"\u003Ewuxuu daabacaa hal muuqaal bog kasta\u003C/a\u003E; ma jiraan dhar-xaashiyo leh dhowr muuqaal ama bar-cinwaan. Ku dhoofi DWG/DXF oo CadCraft ku habboon sawirada cabbirka ku siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"ModelCraft waa dhismo hore. Bogan wuxuu liistaa waxa aan wali samayn, si aanad u raadin, iyo sida ugu dhow ee shaqada loo qabanayo maanta. Qalabka sawirka Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Sawir gacanta lagu sameeyo Riix barta adigoo isticmaalaya Qalin Tirada qeybaha qaws ama goobo ka bedelka ka dib markii la sameeyay Tirtir oo dib u sawir adigoo qorraya 24s Dooro far-nooc qoraal 3D, ama wax ka beddel erayada ka dib markii la dhigay Tirtir oo qoraalka dib ku dar Xagal ka beddelka adigoo ku qorayo cabbirka xaglada, ama cabbirka silinda adigoo ka qaadanayo cabbirka goobadeeda Guuri geesaha adigoo isticmaalaya Wareeji; cabbir silinda adigoo isticmaalaya Miisaan Cabbirro ku jira faylalka moodeelka la dhoofiyay Cabbirrada waxay ku muuqdaan sawirrada, daabacaadaha iyo PDF-yada muuqaalka; faylalka moodeelka waxay sidaas ku qaadaan joomitari oo keliya Jarid, kala qaybin iyo Qolof dibada Isku geyn, Ka jar iyo Isgoys kooxo xidhan, ama isgoyso wajiyada oo tirtir wixii aadan u baahnayn Dooro dhidibka wareegga furayaasha jihada Riix barta Wareeji dhexdiisa wajiga u jeeda jihada dhidibka aad rabto Qufulo badan oo hal mar ah Quful hal jihada oo furaha jihada, kadibna ku qabso dhibic Dhinac ku-xidhan ama dhamaad cabbir oo aan geesaha ka ahayn Dhig cabbirka geesaha laba geesood, khadka ama jihooyinka casaan, cagaar ama buluug Animation Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Wajiyada, geesaha, waqtiga qorraxda, qaabka ama wixii la qariyay oo la animeeyo Qayb dhaqaaqda ka dhig koox ama qayb; sawir fiidiyow gaar ah oo waqti kale ah Kamarad raacaya waddo la sawiray, ama eegaysa shay dhaqaaqaya Dhig furayaal kamarad badan dhinaca (Animate) Dhawaaqa fiidiyowyada, iyo fiidiyowyada tayada sare (path-traced) iyada oo aan WebGPU jirin Ku dar dhawaaqa tafatiraha fiidiyowga; WebGPU la'aanteed, fiidiyowga ku sawir qalabka degdega ah (Render the video) Laambadaha la animeeyay (iftiinka, faafitaanka, midabka) fiidiyow la sawiray, bal-ballaarka kamaradda oo aan furayaal kamarad lahayn fiidiyow, animeynta agabka ama dejinta sawirka Laambadaha waxay ku animeeyaan muuqaalka; fiidiyow ahaan, furaha kamaradda bal ku dhig weyneynta; fiidiyow gaar ah u sawir dejinta laambad kasta (Animate any property) Miro ama lafo ka soo qaadista dhinac ilaa dhinac, lafo aad arki karto, miisaanka oo dhibic dhibic loo muujiyo (waxay muujiyaan wajiga ka wajiga), miisaanka oo dhibicda la arko markii la rinjiyeeyo Labada dhinac rinji, ama samee hal dhinac oo isticmaal Miro modifier ka hor inta aan armature la darin; u beddel Rinji miisaanka iyo Jihee si aad u hubiso Lafaha laga akhriyo faylalka glTF, FBX ama USD sida armature, iyo armature-yada lagu qoro faylalkaas Moodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan fadhi ahaan miisaanka faylka; ku dar lafaha dalabka lafaha faylka, kadibna Isticmaal miisaanka faylka (Animate) Bartanka IK ama dhinaca oo laga soo jiido muuqaalka, kala dhexaadka caqabadda (maxalli ama aduunka), dhererka IK-ga, IK khad dhexdeeda Qor barta bartanka, ama u jeedi shay kalena guuri; ku hay silsiladaha dhererkooda Dhar, dareere, jidhka jilicsan, isku xidhka iyo kulliyadaha dhexdooda jidh adag, isku dhac qaabka saxda ah ee shay (kaliya sanduuqyo iyo kubbado oo ku wareegsan), simulation toos ah markaad ciyaarayso, xawaare bilow ama wareeg (jidhadka waxay ku bilaabmaan fadhi) Jidhadka adag rinji oo ciyaar furayaasha; kulliyad samee furayaal; qaabka qallafsan ku kala qaybi sanduuqyo (kooxo) Dhoofinta animeynta glTF ama faylal kale oo moodeel ah Fiidiyow sawir; faylka .modelcraft, iyo faylka USD ModelCraft uu kaydiyay, u hay ModelCraft Qorista faallada ama cinwaanka arrinta VR-ka, codka-qoraalka, dhaqdhaqaaqa qayb-jeexa gacanta VR-ka Dhig arrinta VR-ka, kadibna ku dar erayadeeda barnaamij BCF; deji qayb-jeex muuqaalka ka hor inta aadan galin: eeg Dib-u-eeg moodeelka madadaalada VR In dadka miiska ku jira VR-ka lagu arko (kaliya dadka VR-ka ku jira ayaa muuqda), duulimaadka VR la duubo Weydii inay ku biiraan VR, ama samee animation socodka Moodeelo Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Sawirka heerarka (multiresolution), iyo Faahfaahin kala-qaybisa saddex-geesood yaryar Sculpt mesh la kala qaybiyay; Remesh si mar kale u siman Remesh loo beddelo wajiyo afar-geesood ah oo raacaya qaabka Remesh (saddex-geesood siman), kadibna dib u dhis adigoo isticmaalaya Retopology Miisaanka dhibcaha lagu rinjiyeeyay modifiers-ka (Displace, Smooth iyo Shrinkwrap waxay ka shaqeeyaan mesh oo dhan) Codso modifier-ka, kadibna sculpt ama wax ka beddel qaybaha u baahan Koobiyee iyo dhaji dhibcaha, geesaha ama wajiyada, jarka seeftu gudaha wajiga ku dhammaanayo, geesaha silig oo aan wajiyo lahayn Mesh-ka ku sar Moodeel; seef geesaha ka geesaha ah; Extrude geesaha furan u beddel wajiyo Abaabul iyo muuqaal Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Lakabyada DWG iyo DXF ee qorshaha goobta ah sida calaamado Qorshaha goobta wuxuu yimaadaa hal koox: kala bax oo koox qaybaha aad calaamaynayso Dhowr jeex qaybeed isku mar, sanduuq qaybeed, ama khadka qaybeed oo la dhoofiyo sida naqshad Hal qaybeed-dhexaad mar ayuu jaraa; dhoofi muuqaalka sida sawir Khadadka dhaqsiga leh oo jajaban, ama jilicsan intaad jiido Haraaga Jilicsan xagal Macluumaadka shayga, kadibna ka noqo si aad xagal kale u isku daydo Maktabad online ah oo moodeelo ah oo la baarto, ama qaybo leh ikhtiyaarro la doorto (midab, qaab) Maktabadda bilowga; soo dhoofi moodeelo Collada, OBJ ama glTF; fidi koobi cabbirkiisa Dhigida geedaha maktabadda dhirta Scatter dhirta muuqaalka tooska ah, ama dhig geed maktabadda bilowga Koobiyo madax-bannaan oo kooxda ah Ka dhig qayb, kadibna Ka dhig gaar ah (eeg Xalinta dhibaatada) Bixinta Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Bixinta muuqaalka (Soo saar shaqada), safka bixinta, iyo kamarada, sawirka sama, ikhtiyaarrada iftiinka iyada oo aan WebGPU jirin Rendar sawir… oo ku jira Tayada sare wuxuu isticmaalaa habka WebGL ee halkaas, iyada oo aan ikhtiyaaradaas jirin (Render a picture) Barnaamij kale oo sawirka Soo saar ku sawira iyada oo aan add-on-ka injineriyada bixinta lahayn (CadCraft ma socodsiiso barnaamij kale oo ku hoos yaal GNU GPL); kamaradaha panorama ama stereo iyo sawirka sama barnaamij kale oo ku dhex jira; plug-in-ka Unreal Engine (faylalka waa la qoraa, plug-in-ka furaya ma soo bixin) Injineriyadeena Fast iyo Path tracer; injineriyada add-on-ka (sawirka barnaamij kale); faylka USD, glTF ama Unreal ee liiska Engine-ka si aad ugu qaaddo barnaamij kasta Dhirta iyo dhagaxyada kala firidhsan ee Rendar sawir… Waxay ku muuqdaan muuqaalka tooska ah, panoramaskiisa, muujiyahaa iyo fiidiyowga Agabka iyo midabyada Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Galiyada aan ahayn midabka saldhigga, adkaynta, birta, qumman, caadiga iyo iftiinka oo ku beddelan dusha sawirrada tayada sare (waxay isticmaalaan celceliska) Samee agab nuqadaha: ku xidh si kastaba ha ahaato, muuqaalku wuu muujinayaa inay beddelan Muuqaalka wajiyada riix/jiid Beddel shayga mesh si aad muuqaalka u hesho Agabkaaga oo la wadaago Maktabadda app-ka, iyo khariidaadka la xirtay (ARM/ORM) ama EXR ee teexturka la soo dhoofiyay Ku hay faylka; soo dhoofi khariidaadka kala gaarka ah sida PNG ama JPEG Agabka faylka ee Live TeamWork (waxay ku sii jiraan kombuterka ay sameeyeen) Kaydi faylka oo la wadaag Dhaq-dhaqaaqa teexturka ee wajiyada qalloocan, ama teexturka dhowr wajiyood isku mar oo ay tahay xaddi Dhig decal-yo yaryar qayb kasta; rinji dhinac kasta oo xadiga ah si gaar ah Dhex-dhigida wajiyada riix/jiid, dhex-dhigida dhowr shay isku sawirka, qaab gacanta lagu sameeyo, ama iftiinka la dhex dhigay ee laambadaha Ka beddel mesh oo ka fur; dhex dhig shay kasta; kor u qaad masaafada raadinta; sawir sawir si aad u hesho iftiinka laambadaha Rinjiga roughness, metalness ama height, rinjiga sawirrada (stamps) iyo rinjiga teexturka ka weyn 512 × 512 Halkan rinji midabka saldhigga; samee khariidaad kale tafatiraha sawirka oo soo dhoofi sida teexturka Teexturada dhoofinta Collada, STL, PLY, 3MF, IFC, DWG iyo DXF, iyo jaantuska nuqadaha agabka faylka ee moodeelada la dhoofiyay Qaababkaas waxay helaan midabka agab kasta; glTF iyo OBJ waxay qabtaan teexturada la soo dhoofiyay; dhoofi agab keligiis sida MaterialX; USD wuxuu hayaa moodeelka oo dhan ModelCraft ahaan Teexturada faylalka Collada Waa la tiriyaa oo la reebaa soo dhoofinta; teexturada faylalka .skp iyo .glb ayaa yimaada Faylalka Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Kaydinta faylalka SketchUp, iyo qoraalka iyo cabbirrada ka yimid Soo dhoofi wuxuu hayaa wejiyada, midabka iyo teexturka; dhoofi Collada (.dae) si aad ugu noqoto SketchUp Cabbirrada iyo hagaha dhoofinta DWG iyo DXF Ku dar barnaamijka CAD ka dib markii la dhoofiyay Dhibcaha, miisaska iyo multileaders ka yimid DWG iyo DXF Waa la tiriyaa oo la reebaa; qoraalku wuxuu yimaadaa sida xarfo xariiq keli ah, ma aha far-nooca sawirka Dusha, mesh, miisaska iyo multileaders ka yimid DWG iyo DXF; wajiyada jidhka 3D ee dusha la rogay, la aalaaqay ama dusha kale ee bilaa qaab Waa la tiriyaa oo waa la reebaa (jidhadka 3D waa yimaadaan). Qaybahaas ka dhoofi barnaamijka CAD sida OBJ ama Collada oo soo dhoofi taas Noocyada IFC, hantida ama agabka Dhoofinta IFC wuxuu leeyahay dabaq iyo waxyaabo guud; ku dar kuwa kale barnaamij BIM Moodeelka oo toos loo diro BimCraft Dhoofi IFC oo loogu talagalay BimCraft (.ifc) oo ku fur BimCraft Geesaha furan ee glTF iyo STL Isticmaal OBJ ama Collada khadadka sawirka Agabka glTF iyo FBX ka dhaafsan midabka saldhigga (birta, roughness, khariidaadka caadiga, muraayadda, clear coat, sheen…) Waa la akhriyaa oo waa la liisanayaa; ModelCraft wuxuu hayaa midabka saldhigga ama teexturka. Dib u dhis muuqaalka Shading workspace Lafaha glTF, animeynta iyo morph targets Moodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan taagan sida ay nasan yihiin; animee jadwalka Midabyada iyo magacyada qaybaha isu-dhigga ee faylalka STEP Qaybaha waxay yimaadaan sida meshes cabbirkooda runta ah; rinji oo magacaabo soo dhoofinta ka dib Shayaadka SubD, qoraalka, cabbirrada iyo laambadaha faylalka .3dm Eeg waxa laga reebay; beddel SubD mesh barnaamijka faylka sameeyay Teexturada KTX2 iyo noocyada agabka glTF Dhoofi teexturada PNG ama JPEG; noocii caadiga ahaa ayaa la isticmaalaa Qorista glTF instancing (EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing) Qaybaha waa la qoraa hal mar, waana la dhigaa mar badan, taas oo kasta oo muuqaal akhriyaa Animeynta Alembic (muunad kasta oo kaydka), dhibcaha iyo khadadka Alembic, qorista Alembic Muunadda koowaad ayaa yimaada; animee jadwalka; qor glTF, USD ama OBJ Khariidaadka bump iyo normal ee agabka OBJ Kaliya sawirka midabka (map_Kd) ayaa yimaada Lafaha FBX iyo animeynta, dhoofinta FBX, faylalka FBX 6 Moodeelada laftirka leh waxay yimaadaan fadhi ahaan; dhoofi glTF; kaydi faylalka duugga ah sida FBX 2011 ama ka dambeeya Skin-ka Collada, morphs, kamaradaha, iftiinka, look-at iyo beddelka skew, tixraacyada dibadda Waa laga reebay soo dhoofinta oo waa la tiriyaa fariinta Faylalka daabacaadda Kaydi sida (Ctrl+Shift+S) wuxuu kaydiyaa nuqul kale. Kadib qaraxa, ModelCraft wuxuu kugu soo celiyaa shaqadaada aan la kaydin (\"Ma soo celin shaqadaada?\") Kaydinta daruurta iyo isku-xidhka kombuterro kala duwan Weli lama heli karo. Faylalka kombuterkaaga ku kaydi, kadibna ku koobiyee meelaha aad u baahan tahay Daabacaadda 3D Wali ma jiro Halkii, maanta Taageerooyinka slicer-ka dhabta ah (interfaces, raft, qaabka saxda ah ee taageerada) Hormarinta taageerooyinka wuxuu muujiyaa meesha iyo qiyaasta; hormarinta slicer-kaaga ayaa muujinaysa kuwa dhabta ah Qayb isku-dhex-jirta ama geesaha ay ku kulmaan saddex wajiyo ama ka badan Hagaaji wuxuu liistaa meesha ay yaalliin; isticmaal Isgoys wajiyada oo tirtir wixii dhex jira Qaabka qalabka ee daabacaadda iyo qaab ee dhex-dhexaad ah ee dhex-madhan Dhex-madhan wuu faaruqiyaa; slicer-kaaga ayuu ku darayaa dhex-buuxin qayb adag Faahfaahin aad u yar nozzle-kaagu aanu ku sawirin karin (ka dhaafsan darbiyada) Ballaca darbiga wuxuu helaa darbiyada khafiifka ah; hormarinta lakabka slicer-kaaga ayaa muujisa kuwa kale Waxqabadka Ka noqo wuxuu haya nuqul moodeelka tallaabo kasta (mesh wuxuu haya oo keliya wixii isbedelay), sidaas darteed soo dhoofin aad u weyn ee joomitariga riix/jiid waxay ka dhigaysaa wax kasta oo lagu tafatiro mid gaabiyaa. Soo dhoofinta ku hay mid fudud, oo kaydi oo dib u fur si aad taariikhda u tirtirto. Apps iyo madal-yadaha Desktop: ModelCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka Mac, Windows iyo Linux, iyo CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka oo leh sideed app oo hal rakibid ah. Android-ka, CadCraft Studio waxaa lagu rakibaa APK-ka ka yimid getcadcraft.com/download. iPad ama iPhone dhismo weli ma jiro. Taabashada: eeg Wareeg, muuqaalka guuri iyo weynee si aad u aragto dhaqdhaqaaqyada farta. Cadaadiska qalinka ayaa dhex dhigaya burushka Sculpt; meelaha kale cadaadiska iyo jilibka qalinka lama isticmaalo. Xaashiyaha: ModelCraft wuxuu daabacaa hal muuqaal bog kasta; ma jiraan dhar-xaashiyo leh dhowr muuqaal ama bar-cinwaan. Ku dhoofi DWG/DXF oo CadCraft ku habboon sawirada cabbirka ku siman.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Isticmaalka caawintan","summary":"Fur caawinta, baadh, oo arag tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["caawin","f1","baadh","casharro","buug"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-caawinta","text":"Fur caawinta","level":2},{"id":"raadi-mawduuc","text":"Raadi mawduuc","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka","text":"Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la&#039;aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-caawinta\"\u003EFur caawinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ee app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la socda furaha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EFurayaasha Mac-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-mawduuc\"\u003ERaadi mawduuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003ETillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go&#039;aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan &quot;Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka\"\u003ECaawintaas oo kale websaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebsaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la'aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa. Fur caawinta Riix F1, ama dooro Caawin barka sare ee app-ka. Riix Esc ama dooro Xir si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix F1 oo la socda furaha fn (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka Caawin. Eeg Furayaasha Mac-ka. Raadi mawduuc Ku qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa. Mawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka. Xiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. Dib u noqo wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid. Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga Qaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go'aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan \"Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online\". Dooro Beddel sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale. Dooro Muuji dhammaan si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Gaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: Ctrl+S wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S. Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka Websaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, Ku fur website-ka oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarada","summary":"Browserrada app-yadu ku shaqeeyaan, waxa ka duwan dhexdooda, iyo waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","browser","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","shuruudaha","xusuusta"],"headings":[{"id":"browserka","text":"Browserka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan","text":"Waxa browserada ku kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan","text":"Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay","text":"Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka\"\u003EBrowserka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan\"\u003EWaxa browserada ku kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ama Edge, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji &quot;File download location&quot; &quot;Ask for each download&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003ETaabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan\"\u003EBrowserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee \u003Cem\u003Ebilaabmo\u003C/em\u003E, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan). Browserka Isticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan: Browser Engine Faahfaahin Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha. Firefox Gecko Way shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah. Safari WebKit Way shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad. Dhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga. Waxa browserada ku kala duwan Furidda folder-ka. Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba. Kaydinta. Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin. Chrome ama Edge, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Firefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Safari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji \"File download location\" \"Ask for each download\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Apps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada Qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro. Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan Waxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo. Nooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo. Tanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee bilaabmo, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo. Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay Kuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray: 8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn). Chip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan. Faylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada","summary":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro, furayaasha function ee Mac-ka, riix midig iyo panning la'aan mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kiiboodh","gaadh","shortcut","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","furayaasha function","trackpad","riix midig","badhanka dhexe","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka","text":"Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka","level":2},{"id":"gaadhka-browserku-hayo","text":"Gaadhka browserku hayo","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka","text":"Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal","text":"Qorista sanduuq qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoran\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows iyo Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. &quot;Kadib&quot; waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha function ee Mac-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehay \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efur \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhka-browserku-hayo\"\u003EGaadhka browserku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-ka iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashadda buuxda ee browserka (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka\"\u003EBadhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal\"\u003EQorista sanduuq qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista &quot;L&quot; waxay qortaa L. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro Caawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo. Qoran Mac-ka Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) iyo S Ctrl iyo S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F Ctrl, Shift iyo F Alt+← Option (⌥) iyo ← Alt iyo ← Backspace furaha Delete Backspace Delete fn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore) Delete Enter Return Enter Calaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. \"Kadib\" waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo. Gaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (Ctrl+Shift+F), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso. Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto: hay fn (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama fur System Settings, kadibna Keyboard, kadibna Keyboard Shortcuts, kadibna Function Keys, oo shid \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Qaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii. Gaadhka browserku hayo Bog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T iyo Ctrl+W had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas. Ctrl+Q Mac-ka iyo Alt+F4 Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Shaashadda buuxda ee browserka (Control-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda / F11) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo Ctrl+Shift+F ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara. Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn: Riix midig: guji labo farood. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings gudaha, kadibna Trackpad, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. Ctrl la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero. Riix midig: guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Qorista sanduuq qoraal Intaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista \"L\" waxay qortaa L. Riix Esc ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Hel qalab ama dejin","summary":"Riix Ctrl+K oo qor xarfo yar si aad u wada fuliso qalab kasta, u beddesho dejin ama furto mawduuc caawin.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["raadi","baadh","palet amarka","furid degdeg","fuli amar","qalab","dejin","gaadh","ctrl k","cmd k"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-oo-fuli","text":"Raadi oo fuli","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-oo-fuli\"\u003ERaadi oo fuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa sanduuqa xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"App kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka. Raadi oo fuli Riix Ctrl+K, ama dooro Raadi barka sare ku jirta. Qor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid. Riix Enter si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. Esc ayaa sanduuqa xidha. Qalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa Dejinta oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa. Waxa aad ogaataa Waxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay. Qalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay. Qalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad","summary":"Ku xidh panelada dhinaca bidix, midig ama hoosta, isku rari, u kooxee sida tab-yo, ku hay ama qari, ku dhaaf naqshadda, ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow, dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo, ama u wareeji daaqad gaar ah shaashad kale.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panelada","ku xidh","ku dhaaf","wareeji panel","jiid","qaabeynta","tab-yada","kooxda tab-ka","isku rari","ku hay","auto-hide","qari panel","xir panel","kooban","cabbirka qaabeynta","dhow","safafka qalabka","lafmeyso","1 safka","2 safka","khadka qalabka","shaashad labaad","laba shaashad","shaashado badan","daaqad","daaqad kor u soo booda","dib u deji qaabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda","text":"Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo","text":"U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo","level":2},{"id":"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi","text":"Pin, qari oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow","text":"Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow","level":2},{"id":"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo","text":"Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-kiiboodhka","text":"Isticmaal kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad","text":"Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad","level":2},{"id":"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan","text":"Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan","level":2},{"id":"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah","text":"Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal","text":"Dhaqaaji wada-hadal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada","text":"Dib u dhig panelada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda\"\u003EDhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo\"\u003EU kooxee panelada sida tab-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove out of the tab group\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EPin, qari oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto-hide\u003C/strong\u003E: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnpin\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u xidho si joogto ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka xidhka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow\"\u003EKa dhig qaabeynta mid dhow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay laba doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComfortable\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo\"\u003EDooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-kiiboodhka\"\u003EIsticmaal kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the left\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock at the bottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloat over the drawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin to the edge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E panel kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha menu-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove all panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su&#039;aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan\"\u003EHal daaqad oo panelo ka badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to panels window 2\u003C/span\u003E (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the next one\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah\"\u003EIsku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E qaybtaas oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal\"\u003EDhaqaaji wada-hadal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot to PDF\u003C/span\u003E ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in its own window\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen it\u003C/span\u003E si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep them here\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan. Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu ⋯, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu ⋯ oo keliya. Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda Jiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare. Intaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa. Ku dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca. Panelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso. Panel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa. Ku jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu ⋯. U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo Laba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa beddela tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Si aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro Move out of the tab group menu ⋯-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro Tab with iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin. Pin, qari oo soo celi Pin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa auto-hide: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix Esc) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro Unpin, si aad u xidho si joogto ah. Badhanka xidhka, ama Hide this panel menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix Enter. Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow Settings › General › Layout density waxay leedahay laba doorasho. Comfortable waa caadiga. Compact wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. Reset layout ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay. Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo Settings › General › Toolbar rows waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. Wrap waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. 2 rows wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, 1 row hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama Tab ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos 2 rows, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta Settings › CadCraft. Isticmaal kiiboodhka Badhanka ⋯ ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: Dock on the left, Dock on the right, Dock at the bottom, Float over the drawing, Pin to the edge, Hide this panel, Tab with panel kale, Move to a new window iyo Put it back. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix Enter, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix Enter. Esc ayaa xidha menu-ga. Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad Dooro ⋯ panel, kadibna Move all panels to a new window. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Move panels to a new window Settings gudahiisa. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto. Sii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad. Furayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su'aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad. Chrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro Put it on my other screen daaqadda panelada (ama Put the panels on my other screen menu ⋯ panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa. Daaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa. Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta. Menu ⋯ ee panel, Move to a new window wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, Move to panels window 2 (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa \"panels 2\". Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa. Daaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada. Markaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro Open the next one mar kasta daaqad kasta. Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah Qaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu ⋯ qaybtaas oo dooro Move to a new window; Put it back (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah. Dhaqaaji wada-hadal Wada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso. Kiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix Alt+Shift+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar Ctrl si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa. Taleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin. Ku dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka Plot to PDF ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, Open in its own window. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha. Dib u dhig panelada Dooro Put the panels back daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Xidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro Open it si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama Keep them here. Settings › General › Reset layout wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen. Haddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale. Qaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka ribbon tab-yo ah oo naqshadda dushiisa ku jira, oo leh Properties iyo baadhe mashruuc dhinaca bidix iyo tab kasta muuqaal furan, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","ribbon","tab-yada ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","baadhe","palet-yada","palet properties","tab-yada muuqaalka","safka xaaladda","degdeg fur","xidh ribbon","qaabka caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn","beddel","dhigan"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka","text":"Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii","text":"Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka magaca:\u003C/strong\u003E magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat each tool does here\u003C/span\u003E (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka xulashada:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka bidix:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore fur fayl&quot;, ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka\"\u003EKa isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii\"\u003ERibbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the ribbon back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Ribbon and project browser. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Safka magaca: magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, What each tool does here (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, Help iyo Settings. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka. Ribbon: qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. File bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa. Safka xulashada: hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay. Panelka bidix: Properties sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto. Tab-yada muuqaalka: hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay. Safka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda: hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale \"Marka hore fur fayl\", ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka Markaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii Laba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka Move the ribbon ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay Collapse the ribbon iyo Keep the ribbon open sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta. Move the ribbon › Move to a new window ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the ribbon back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka tiir qalab ah oo dhinaca bidix ku jira, oo leh meel aad ku kaydiso qalabkaaga, sanduuq macluumaad oo naqshadda sare ku socda oo raacaya qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, socodsiiye dhinaca midig, tab muuqaal kasta, degdeg dooro iyo palet wax-beddel, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","sanduuqa qalabka","tiirka qalabka","sanduuqa macluumaadka","macluumaad","socodsiiye","khariidadda mashruuca","safka degdega ah","degdeg dooro","palet wax-beddel","palet pet","my tools","qalabkayga","tab-yada muuqaalka","daaqadda sanduuqa qalabka","qaabeynta caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa macluumaadka:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Nothing selected&quot;. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMy tools:\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocodsiiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka degdega ah:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalet-ka wax-beddelka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu&#039;aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii\"\u003ESanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the toolbox\u003C/span\u003E ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the toolbox back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Toolbox and info box. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Qalabka: qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa. Sanduuqa macluumaadka: hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay \"Nothing selected\". Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan. Sanduuqa qalabka: tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa. My tools: kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro Add to My tools; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan. Socodsiiyaha: panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, Properties iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig. Tab-yada muuqaalka: tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa. Safka degdega ah: hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada. Palet-ka wax-beddelka: riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu'aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo Properties. Esc, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii Badhanka Move the toolbox ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay Move to a new window: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the toolbox back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Habee qaabeyntaada oo kaydi habayntaada","summary":"Dooro panelka ku muujinaya baadhaha mashruuca, Properties ama waxa panelka u gaar ah, meesha sanduuqa qalabka ku jiro iyo waxa safafka ku jiro, kaydi sida qaabeyntaada, oo kaydi habayn oo dhan magac hoose oo aad ku beddesho.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","habee","u habee","qaabeyntayda","qaabeyntayda gaarka ah","panelada","tafatirayaasha","baadhaha mashruuca","properties","sanduuqa qalabka","safka degdega","sanduuqa macluumaadka","deegaanka shaqada","habayn","profile","kaydi habayn","beddel habayn","dhoofi habayn","soo deji habayn","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-qaabeyntaada","text":"Habee qaabeyntaada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo","text":"Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-qaabeyntaada\"\u003EHabee qaabeyntaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, kadibna dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dushiisa:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhinaceeda:\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeel naqshaddu:\u003C/strong\u003E tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this layout\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo\"\u003EKaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork environments\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave my setup\u003C/span\u003E. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwitch to it\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaag:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport a setup…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejin, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto. Habee qaabeyntaada Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,), dooro Global, kadibna Layout. Dooro Arrange your own layout…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho. Ku sii magac, kadibna dooro: Naqshadda dushiisa: qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo. Naqshadda dhinaceeda: sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo My tools oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda. Meel naqshaddu: tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda. Muuqaalka: cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka. Dooro Use this layout. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya. Waxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa From add-ons and files; Export this layout wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran Habee panelada. Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo Deegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo My tools. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan. Kaydi: qor magac hoosta Work environments oo dooro Save my setup. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas. Beddel: dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro Switch to it. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta. Wadaag: Export wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl .ccenv.json; Import a setup… wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna. Ka saar: dooro dejin, kadibna dooro Remove. Waxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin. Si aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka, qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca iyo qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","summary":"Kaydi app si aad ugu shaqeyso khadka ka baxsan, waxa ku shaqeeya xidhiidh la'aan, iyo waxa u baahan xidhiidh.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","internet la'aan","diyaarad","booqasho goob","cache","service worker","rakib","soo deji","xidhiidh"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan","text":"Waxa xidhiidh u baahan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur app-ka intaad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug &quot;Offline ready&quot;. Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuridda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan\"\u003EWaxa xidhiidh u baahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHelidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada websaydhka, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi&#039;ax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Apps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la'aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo. Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan Fur app-ka intaad online tahay. Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barka sare. Sug \"Offline ready\". Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa. Tan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la'aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa. Hadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya Furidda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga. Caawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda. Waxa xidhiidh u baahan Markii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan. Helidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Xiriirrada websaydhka, sida Ku fur website-ka iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale. Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn. Waxa aad ogaataa Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi'ax. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin. Safari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar. CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan","summary":"Faylalku kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan, sida kaydintu u shaqeyso, iyo waxa browserku xasuusto.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["asturnaan","upload","cloud","kaydi","soo dejin","kaydin","maxalli","amni","sirta"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan","level":2},{"id":"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserku-xasuusto","text":"Waxa browserku xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-cloud-ka","text":"Kaydinta cloud-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan\"\u003EFaylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida kaydintu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejinaya\u003C/strong\u003E fayl cusub:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida &quot;(edited)&quot; ama &quot;(marked up)&quot;, si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserku-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa browserku xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-cloud-ka\"\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan Markaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. Faylka lama soo dirin. Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la'aan. Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso Bog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo soo dejinaya fayl cusub: Soo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada). Apps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida \"(edited)\" ama \"(marked up)\", si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"). Waxa browserku xasuusto Qaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso. Kaydinta cloud-ka Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"so","chain":["so","en"]};
